s⠀expression⠀remains⠀open⠀to⠀interpretation.⠀Characters⠀may⠀be⠀lively⠀or⠀direct;⠀the⠀narrator's⠀selectivity⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀whole⠀cast⠀delicate⠀and⠀reserved.\n\nThe⠀thriller⠀supplies⠀a⠀concrete⠀decision⠀about⠀help,⠀departure,⠀trust,⠀or⠀warning⠀in⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀relevant⠀facts⠀be⠀available⠀even⠀when⠀description⠀is⠀restrained.⠀A⠀successful⠀response⠀can⠀buy⠀a⠀held⠀quiet⠀interval.⠀Do⠀not⠀create⠀menus,⠀romance,⠀or⠀a⠀tragic⠀route⠀by⠀default.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀actual⠀situation⠀and⠀any⠀pending⠀response⠀clear⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀whether⠀altered⠀or⠀unchanged;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀result⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀shift⠀for⠀a⠀striking⠀image.⠀The⠀emotional⠀remainder⠀can⠀stay⠀subtle⠀precisely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀the⠀practical⠀event⠀around⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPapbabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Thriller⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nLet⠀selected⠀impressions⠀change⠀through⠀recurrence⠀across⠀installments.⠀Kawabata's⠀catalogue⠀profile⠀supplies⠀attention⠀to⠀passing⠀moments;⠀web-serial⠀form⠀preserves⠀the⠀history⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀small⠀difference⠀recognizable.⠀A⠀familiar⠀object,⠀place,⠀or⠀gesture⠀should⠀return⠀because⠀life⠀or⠀the⠀current⠀situation⠀brings⠀it⠀back,⠀not⠀because⠀every⠀detail⠀requires⠀a⠀payoff.\n\nReenter⠀through⠀the⠀task⠀underway⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀actually⠀changed.⠀A⠀brief⠀inward⠀association⠀can⠀connect⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀an⠀earlier⠀interval⠀without⠀replaying⠀it.⠀Keep⠀dialogue⠀varied⠀and⠀direct⠀where⠀the⠀speakers⠀would⠀be.⠀Some⠀feelings⠀may⠀remain⠀unarticulated,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀omit⠀the⠀information⠀necessary⠀to⠀understand⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀the⠀consequence⠀of⠀a⠀completed⠀act.\n\nThe⠀thriller's⠀longer⠀pressure⠀follows⠀concrete⠀intentions,⠀resources,⠀and⠀timing.⠀A⠀quiet⠀precaution⠀or⠀accurate⠀observation⠀can⠀create⠀lasting⠀progress.⠀Avoid⠀resetting⠀unease⠀after⠀each⠀success⠀or⠀making⠀every⠀installment⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀poignant⠀uncertainty.⠀Local⠀danger⠀can⠀be⠀resolved⠀while⠀an⠀emotional⠀association⠀develops⠀more⠀slowly.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀passage⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀situation⠀now⠀available,⠀preserving⠀both⠀the⠀practical⠀gains⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀changes⠀in⠀how⠀people⠀inhabit⠀their⠀lives⠀afterward.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
