            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-tragedy-04",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Tragedy · 04/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == tragedy}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Tragedy. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 4 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-tragedy; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPaqamai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀Romantic⠀and⠀uncanny⠀route.⠀Use⠀calm,⠀syntactically⠀complete⠀sentences⠀at⠀the⠀selected⠀narrative⠀distance⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀person.⠀They⠀may⠀lengthen⠀around⠀something⠀the⠀permitted⠀focal⠀experience⠀cannot⠀yet⠀name,⠀without⠀imitating⠀translated⠀German⠀word⠀order⠀or⠀replacing⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀ordinary⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀habitual⠀act⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀shared⠀daily⠀life:⠀a⠀clock⠀wound⠀each⠀evening,⠀a⠀particular⠀window,⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀keys,⠀a⠀song⠀played⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀hour,⠀a⠀walk⠀along⠀the⠀same⠀path.⠀Present⠀it⠀first⠀inside⠀a⠀routine⠀the⠀character⠀loves⠀or⠀at⠀least⠀relies⠀on—warm,⠀amusingly⠀familiar,⠀or⠀simply⠀relied⠀upon.⠀Do⠀not⠀foreshadow⠀its⠀later⠀role⠀with⠀manufactured⠀dread.\n\nLet⠀the⠀estrangement⠀enter⠀gradually⠀and⠀perceptually.⠀The⠀interval⠀changes;⠀the⠀sound⠀arrives⠀at⠀an⠀unexpected⠀moment;⠀the⠀face⠀in⠀a⠀photograph⠀seems⠀slightly⠀shifted;⠀the⠀worn⠀step⠀catches⠀differently.⠀Write⠀these⠀as⠀things⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀not⠀as⠀confirmed⠀supernatural⠀events:⠀the⠀world⠀should⠀feel⠀unreliable⠀while⠀remaining⠀entirely⠀natural,⠀and⠀no⠀ghost,⠀monster,⠀or⠀hidden⠀mechanism⠀may⠀be⠀produced⠀afterward⠀to⠀explain⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀unease⠀follow⠀the⠀established⠀world⠀and⠀events.⠀A⠀mistaken⠀belief,⠀promise,⠀or⠀silence⠀can⠀matter⠀when⠀present,⠀but⠀the⠀profile⠀does⠀not⠀assign⠀fault⠀or⠀supply⠀an⠀explanation.\n\nWhere⠀the⠀character⠀tries⠀to⠀restore⠀a⠀valued⠀routine,⠀let⠀the⠀result⠀follow⠀the⠀commitments⠀and⠀changes⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀actually⠀established.⠀A⠀restoration⠀may⠀succeed⠀in⠀part⠀or⠀in⠀full;⠀if⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀has⠀become⠀impossible,⠀make⠀the⠀specific⠀reason⠀and⠀loss⠀legible.⠀Mark⠀the⠀break⠀with⠀one⠀callback⠀to⠀the⠀opening:⠀the⠀object⠀that⠀was⠀shared⠀comfort⠀now⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀reminder⠀of⠀what⠀went⠀unsaid⠀or⠀undone.⠀Render⠀dawning⠀awareness⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access,⠀with⠀any⠀authorized⠀change⠀of⠀focal⠀mind⠀clearly⠀distinguished.\n\nRecognition⠀arrives⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀sees⠀that⠀the⠀ordinary⠀habit⠀itself⠀was⠀the⠀vessel⠀of⠀the⠀loss,⠀not⠀a⠀refuge⠀from⠀it.⠀Afterward⠀the⠀uncanny⠀subsides;⠀the⠀fact⠀remains⠀irreversible,⠀but⠀the⠀object⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀being⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀whose⠀weight⠀has⠀changed.⠀Close⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀performing⠀or⠀abandoning⠀the⠀routine⠀once⠀more,⠀without⠀sudden⠀consolation,⠀in⠀a⠀final⠀sentence⠀that⠀registers⠀the⠀quieter⠀isolation⠀this⠀understanding⠀has⠀installed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nSet⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀a⠀present-day⠀city⠀where⠀one⠀old⠀authority⠀still⠀operates⠀through⠀practical⠀permissions⠀rather⠀than⠀supernatural⠀power:⠀a⠀family,⠀a⠀board,⠀a⠀landlord,⠀a⠀church,⠀a⠀firm,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀council,⠀or⠀a⠀similar⠀inherited⠀network.⠀Show⠀its⠀reach⠀through⠀concrete⠀urban⠀material⠀detail—who⠀holds⠀which⠀key,⠀which⠀staircase⠀is⠀watched,⠀whose⠀name⠀opens⠀a⠀door,⠀which⠀messages⠀arrive⠀unread,⠀whose⠀photograph⠀stays⠀in⠀a⠀locked⠀office.\n\nGive⠀the⠀protagonist⠀one⠀shared,⠀repeated⠀habit⠀with⠀someone⠀they⠀love:⠀a⠀morning⠀call,⠀a⠀regular⠀meeting⠀place,⠀a⠀food⠀one⠀buys⠀for⠀the⠀other,⠀a⠀routine⠀errand,⠀a⠀password⠀phrased⠀as⠀an⠀old⠀joke.⠀Let⠀it⠀be⠀genuinely⠀warm⠀and⠀practical,⠀with⠀room⠀for⠀tenderness⠀or⠀running⠀humor;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀it⠀sinister⠀from⠀the⠀start.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀turning⠀point⠀as⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀the⠀habit⠀and⠀the⠀authority's⠀demand:⠀information,⠀time,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀silence⠀that⠀cannot⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀loved⠀one's⠀trust.⠀Have⠀the⠀protagonist⠀first⠀try⠀to⠀protect⠀both⠀by⠀adjusting⠀the⠀habit⠀slightly—delaying⠀the⠀call,⠀meeting⠀elsewhere,⠀sending⠀a⠀different⠀message,⠀hiding⠀fatigue—and⠀write⠀this⠀adaptation⠀as⠀intelligent⠀care,⠀not⠀as⠀obvious⠀corruption.\n\nUse⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀private⠀life⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.⠀The⠀familiar⠀meeting⠀place⠀begins⠀to⠀feel⠀staged;⠀the⠀loved⠀one⠀notices⠀the⠀changed⠀rhythm;⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀once⠀felt⠀safe⠀shows⠀its⠀surveillance⠀potential;⠀ordinary⠀words⠀start⠀reading⠀as⠀warnings.⠀Keep⠀the⠀horror⠀personal⠀and⠀social.⠀The⠀masks⠀are⠀the⠀composed⠀faces⠀the⠀protagonist⠀and⠀the⠀authority⠀require⠀in⠀particular⠀rooms,⠀and⠀they⠀can⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company⠀at⠀a⠀cost.⠀No⠀hidden⠀bloodline,⠀power,⠀faction,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀entity⠀may⠀resolve⠀anything.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀occur⠀when⠀the⠀protagonist⠀must⠀choose⠀whom⠀to⠀fail.⠀Keep⠀the⠀choice⠀morally⠀untidy:⠀the⠀authority's⠀demand⠀may⠀also⠀protect⠀someone⠀else,⠀and⠀the⠀loved⠀one's⠀need⠀may⠀be⠀partly⠀unreasonable⠀or⠀unknowable.⠀Put⠀the⠀decision⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀city's⠀detail⠀pressures⠀it—a⠀train⠀leaving,⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀a⠀phone⠀ringing,⠀a⠀message⠀arriving.\n\nAfterward,⠀bring⠀the⠀shared⠀habit⠀back⠀exactly⠀once:⠀as⠀a⠀gesture⠀the⠀loved⠀one⠀still⠀performs⠀without⠀knowing,⠀or⠀as⠀a⠀routine⠀the⠀protagonist⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀maintain.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means—the⠀protagonist⠀sees⠀that⠀the⠀authority⠀was⠀not⠀an⠀external⠀monster⠀but⠀a⠀claim⠀already⠀allowed⠀to⠀live⠀inside⠀the⠀daily⠀affection.⠀Close⠀with⠀the⠀protagonist⠀alone⠀in⠀an⠀urban⠀space⠀carrying⠀that⠀recognition,⠀with⠀no⠀promise⠀of⠀revenge,⠀rescue,⠀or⠀redemptive⠀exposure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀route.⠀Let⠀a⠀definite⠀narrator⠀take⠀part⠀in⠀a⠀community's⠀retelling⠀of⠀an⠀already⠀completed⠀loss,⠀inside⠀whichever⠀communal⠀occasion⠀the⠀story⠀supplies:⠀a⠀family⠀gathering,⠀a⠀court,⠀a⠀village⠀meeting,⠀a⠀wake,⠀the⠀aftermath⠀of⠀a⠀ritual,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀or⠀a⠀journey⠀on⠀which⠀an⠀older⠀speaker⠀finally⠀recounts⠀what⠀happened.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀concrete⠀as⠀supplied,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀religious⠀observance,⠀code-switching,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀family⠀structure⠀on⠀characters⠀who⠀would⠀not⠀recognize⠀them.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀repeated⠀household⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀routine⠀the⠀community⠀associates⠀with⠀the⠀lost⠀person:⠀a⠀dish⠀prepared⠀for⠀the⠀same⠀festival,⠀a⠀song⠀sung⠀while⠀working,⠀a⠀bench⠀where⠀someone⠀sat,⠀a⠀blessing⠀spoken⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀keys⠀passed⠀from⠀hand⠀to⠀hand.⠀Introduce⠀it⠀first⠀in⠀ordinary⠀use,⠀with⠀warmth⠀or⠀mild⠀friction,⠀so⠀listeners⠀meet⠀it⠀as⠀familiar⠀rather⠀than⠀symbolic.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀begins,⠀let⠀the⠀teller—or⠀a⠀chorus⠀of⠀speakers—interrupt⠀with⠀remembered⠀variations:⠀who⠀taught⠀the⠀phrase,⠀how⠀the⠀object⠀was⠀mended,⠀when⠀the⠀routine⠀first⠀broke.⠀Make⠀these⠀interruptions⠀load-bearing.⠀Each⠀one⠀should⠀add⠀or⠀dispute⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀the⠀causal⠀chain:⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀believed,⠀what⠀alternative⠀existed,⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀went⠀unchosen.⠀Let⠀different⠀speakers⠀attach⠀different⠀significance⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀repeated⠀detail,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀settle⠀the⠀meaning⠀early.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀when⠀the⠀remembered⠀variations⠀suddenly⠀cohere⠀for⠀the⠀listeners.⠀The⠀phrase⠀that⠀once⠀meant⠀welcome⠀is⠀revealed⠀as⠀the⠀moment⠀someone⠀chose⠀silence;⠀the⠀object⠀passed⠀between⠀friends⠀is⠀seen⠀as⠀the⠀last⠀link⠀in⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀could⠀not⠀be⠀refused.⠀Keep⠀the⠀recognition⠀local⠀and⠀specific—attached⠀to⠀these⠀people,⠀this⠀household,⠀this⠀obligation—never⠀a⠀lesson⠀about⠀fate⠀or⠀national⠀character.\n\nThe⠀telling⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀linear⠀confession:⠀the⠀frame⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀listeners⠀can⠀interrupt,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀version,⠀so⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀causal⠀chain⠀stays⠀legible⠀throughout.\n\nAfterward,⠀let⠀the⠀repeated⠀detail⠀remain⠀in⠀living⠀use⠀rather⠀than⠀become⠀a⠀memorial.⠀A⠀younger⠀character⠀prepares⠀the⠀dish⠀imperfectly;⠀a⠀child⠀asks⠀why⠀the⠀song⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀sung;⠀an⠀elder⠀resumes⠀the⠀old⠀bench.⠀The⠀loss⠀stays⠀irreversible,⠀but⠀continued⠀use⠀now⠀carries⠀the⠀completed⠀knowledge⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀Close⠀on⠀that⠀double⠀use—ordinary⠀and⠀charged⠀at⠀once—without⠀a⠀moral⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀of⠀renewal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀first-person⠀narrator's⠀private⠀entries⠀or⠀dated⠀reflections,⠀using⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route,⠀assembled⠀after⠀a⠀loss.⠀The⠀narrator⠀addresses⠀no⠀audience⠀and⠀performs⠀no⠀public⠀confession.⠀The⠀entries⠀can⠀be⠀short,⠀uneven,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀repetitive,⠀but⠀each⠀must⠀render⠀lived⠀experience⠀as⠀it⠀was⠀felt—attention,⠀sensation,⠀half-formed⠀reasoning—not⠀summarize⠀what⠀happened.⠀Let⠀the⠀language⠀follow⠀this⠀particular⠀teller:⠀plain⠀or⠀emotional,⠀hesitant⠀or⠀dry,⠀according⠀to⠀temperament.\n\nChoose⠀a⠀repeated⠀seasonal⠀routine⠀or⠀daily⠀habit⠀shared⠀with⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀will⠀be⠀lost:⠀watering⠀a⠀plant⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀hour,⠀eating⠀a⠀particular⠀fruit⠀when⠀the⠀season⠀turns,⠀an⠀umbrella⠀kept⠀by⠀the⠀same⠀door,⠀a⠀walk⠀to⠀a⠀certain⠀bench,⠀tea⠀made⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀time,⠀a⠀train⠀schedule⠀checked⠀out⠀of⠀habit.⠀In⠀the⠀early⠀entries,⠀record⠀it⠀with⠀ordinary⠀care,⠀humor,⠀or⠀mild⠀complaint.⠀Do⠀not⠀call⠀it⠀precious.\n\nMark⠀passing⠀time⠀with⠀concrete⠀seasonal⠀or⠀calendar⠀details⠀drawn⠀from⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀place—never⠀a⠀decorative⠀scenery⠀inventory—and⠀at⠀some⠀point⠀entangle⠀the⠀marker⠀with⠀the⠀habit:⠀the⠀first⠀cold⠀morning⠀changes⠀the⠀task,⠀the⠀rainy⠀season⠀makes⠀the⠀usual⠀path⠀difficult,⠀year-end⠀cleaning⠀disturbs⠀the⠀shared⠀object,⠀the⠀new⠀year⠀begins⠀without⠀the⠀expected⠀call.\n\nHandle⠀retrospective⠀knowledge⠀honestly.⠀The⠀entries⠀may⠀already⠀imply⠀that⠀something⠀ended;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀suspense⠀by⠀hiding⠀the⠀outcome.⠀Include⠀one⠀early⠀entry⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀rereads⠀differently—a⠀phrase⠀the⠀lost⠀person⠀repeated,⠀an⠀odd⠀reluctance,⠀a⠀task⠀left⠀undone—that⠀was⠀taken⠀as⠀ordinary⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Keep⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knew⠀then⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀now;⠀the⠀later⠀understanding⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀retrofitted⠀as⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀inside⠀the⠀diary's⠀own⠀movement:⠀the⠀narrator⠀rereads⠀an⠀entry,⠀recalls⠀the⠀exact⠀words,⠀or⠀performs⠀the⠀habit⠀once⠀and⠀finds⠀it⠀means⠀something⠀else.⠀The⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀opening⠀returns⠀here⠀carrying⠀the⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀and⠀the⠀loss⠀it⠀marks⠀is⠀concrete⠀and⠀irreversible,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀melancholy.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀sequence⠀in⠀an⠀aftermath⠀that⠀preserves⠀the⠀ritual⠀in⠀some⠀form:⠀continued⠀alone,⠀allowed⠀to⠀lapse,⠀or⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀smaller⠀private⠀version.⠀No⠀resolution⠀or⠀moral⠀lesson⠀is⠀required.⠀Close⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀observation⠀showing⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀living⠀inside⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀thing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWork⠀in⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀route.⠀Tell⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀first⠀person⠀or⠀limited⠀third⠀person⠀from⠀a⠀single⠀protagonist's⠀consciousness,⠀with⠀the⠀narration⠀holding⠀close⠀to⠀that⠀character's⠀attention⠀and⠀granting⠀access⠀to⠀no⠀other⠀mind.⠀Anchor⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀story's⠀actual⠀city,⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀household,⠀rendered⠀with⠀the⠀texture⠀this⠀tradition⠀brings⠀to⠀urban⠀intimacy—local⠀speech⠀rhythms,⠀distances,⠀sounds,⠀hours—kept⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀place,⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀rather⠀than⠀turned⠀into⠀regional⠀symbols.⠀Where⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀is⠀Latin⠀American,⠀keep⠀those⠀particulars⠀exact;⠀where⠀it⠀is⠀not,⠀carry⠀over⠀the⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀relocation.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀concrete⠀domestic⠀attachment⠀that⠀recurs⠀in⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀ordinary⠀life:⠀a⠀locked⠀drawer,⠀coffee⠀prepared⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀hour,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀bus,⠀a⠀plant⠀on⠀a⠀balcony,⠀a⠀child's⠀backpack,⠀a⠀table⠀set⠀the⠀same⠀way.⠀Let⠀it⠀first⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀comfort⠀or⠀as⠀a⠀manageable⠀irritation.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀it;⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀live⠀inside⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀affection⠀for⠀the⠀routine.\n\nComplicate⠀the⠀attachment⠀through⠀relationships,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀social⠀panorama.⠀Someone⠀else⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀same⠀routine,⠀resents⠀it,⠀or⠀has⠀a⠀claim⠀to⠀the⠀object.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀begins⠀to⠀notice⠀discrepancies:⠀the⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀now⠀seems⠀rehearsed,⠀a⠀message⠀arrives⠀earlier⠀than⠀usual,⠀the⠀loved⠀one⠀avoids⠀the⠀cupboard,⠀the⠀object⠀has⠀moved.⠀Keep⠀every⠀sign⠀psychologically⠀legible—observed⠀by⠀this⠀particular⠀character,⠀not⠀authorized⠀by⠀an⠀omniscient⠀teller—and⠀never⠀resolve⠀them⠀with⠀a⠀magical⠀event,⠀an⠀external⠀rescue,⠀or⠀any⠀supernatural⠀fact⠀the⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀already⠀permit.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀turn⠀occur⠀when⠀the⠀protagonist⠀recognizes⠀that⠀the⠀attachment⠀itself⠀was⠀the⠀mechanism⠀of⠀the⠀betrayal⠀or⠀self-betrayal:⠀the⠀loved⠀one⠀used⠀the⠀daily⠀habit⠀to⠀hide⠀something;⠀or⠀the⠀protagonist⠀used⠀it⠀to⠀avoid⠀asking⠀a⠀necessary⠀question;⠀or⠀the⠀routine⠀was⠀the⠀only⠀safe⠀form⠀of⠀a⠀love⠀that⠀demanded⠀more.⠀Deliver⠀the⠀recognition⠀through⠀a⠀callback—the⠀protagonist⠀encounters⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀gesture⠀again⠀and⠀understands⠀what⠀it⠀was⠀really⠀marking.⠀Make⠀the⠀irreversible⠀consequence⠀a⠀specific⠀loss:⠀a⠀person⠀gone,⠀a⠀trust⠀broken,⠀a⠀promise⠀missed,⠀not⠀a⠀mood⠀of⠀regret.\n\nClose⠀in⠀aftermath.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀performs⠀the⠀routine⠀once⠀more⠀or⠀deliberately⠀leaves⠀it⠀undone,⠀while⠀the⠀city's⠀ordinary⠀texture⠀continues⠀around⠀them,⠀and⠀the⠀final⠀paragraph⠀shows⠀their⠀changed⠀way⠀of⠀inhabiting⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaman::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly:⠀name⠀the⠀place⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀details,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀repeated⠀daily⠀habit⠀or⠀object⠀carry⠀the⠀opening.⠀First⠀or⠀third⠀person⠀both⠀work;⠀whatever⠀the⠀choice,⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀stays⠀locked⠀to⠀one⠀character's⠀perception.\n\nStage⠀every⠀spatial⠀change⠀visually⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀it—doors,⠀rooms,⠀stairs,⠀vehicles,⠀and⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀the⠀recurring⠀object.⠀Break⠀paragraphs⠀readably⠀around⠀dialogue,⠀action,⠀and⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀private⠀response,⠀and⠀give⠀any⠀unfamiliar⠀name⠀or⠀mechanic⠀a⠀clear,⠀brief⠀presentation⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀it⠀matters.\n\nRun⠀one⠀callback⠀detail⠀through⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀three⠀passes:⠀a⠀bento⠀wrapper,⠀a⠀ringtone,⠀a⠀bandage,⠀a⠀train⠀platform,⠀an⠀umbrella⠀left⠀behind,⠀a⠀particular⠀message,⠀a⠀keychain.⠀First⠀show⠀it⠀in⠀ordinary⠀use.⠀Then⠀show⠀a⠀small⠀disruption⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices⠀but⠀cannot⠀yet⠀name.⠀After⠀the⠀loss,⠀show⠀its⠀return.⠀The⠀object⠀must⠀collect⠀meaning⠀across⠀the⠀passes,⠀not⠀merely⠀recur.\n\nMake⠀the⠀tragic⠀turn⠀physically⠀legible.⠀The⠀character⠀sees⠀or⠀touches⠀the⠀object⠀after⠀the⠀event,⠀and⠀a⠀single⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beat⠀carries⠀the⠀recognition—one⠀or⠀two⠀private⠀thoughts,⠀no⠀flood⠀of⠀rhetorical⠀questions⠀or⠀generic⠀grief.⠀Reactions⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀quietly⠀funny,⠀but⠀each⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀owner;⠀the⠀cast⠀is⠀neither⠀uniformly⠀quippy⠀nor⠀uniformly⠀restrained.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀loss⠀irreversible.⠀No⠀miraculous⠀repair,⠀no⠀melodramatic⠀collapse.⠀If⠀humor⠀appears,⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀the⠀kind⠀that⠀remembers⠀the⠀shared⠀routine⠀with⠀painful⠀specificity⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀defense⠀that⠀erases⠀what⠀happened.\n\nStop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀boundary⠀falls—mid-task,⠀on⠀leaving,⠀or⠀sitting⠀with⠀the⠀object—without⠀requiring⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀confession,⠀or⠀external⠀rescue.⠀Let⠀the⠀final⠀beat⠀be⠀the⠀character's⠀changed⠀handling⠀of⠀the⠀routine:⠀setting⠀the⠀keychain⠀down,⠀covering⠀the⠀bento,⠀deleting⠀the⠀message,⠀or⠀deliberately⠀choosing⠀not⠀to,⠀so⠀the⠀callback⠀closes⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀tragedy's⠀private⠀weight.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀shared⠀objects,⠀phrases,⠀or⠀routines⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀lyric⠀attention.⠀First⠀render⠀the⠀object⠀in⠀its⠀ordinary,⠀warm⠀context⠀through⠀rhythmic⠀syntax,⠀recurring⠀consonant⠀or⠀vowel⠀sounds,⠀and⠀images⠀traced⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀senses.⠀Move⠀between⠀a⠀tight⠀concrete⠀image⠀and⠀a⠀wider⠀associative⠀image—the⠀way⠀afternoon⠀light⠀crosses⠀a⠀table,⠀then⠀becomes⠀the⠀light⠀that⠀will⠀outlast⠀a⠀particular⠀habit.⠀Interrupt⠀the⠀patterned⠀sentences⠀with⠀plain⠀statements⠀when⠀a⠀fact⠀or⠀decision⠀needs⠀weight,⠀so⠀the⠀lyricism⠀does⠀not⠀soften⠀the⠀causal⠀consequence.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀irreversible⠀event,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀with⠀altered⠀syntax.⠀The⠀earlier⠀cadence⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀cut⠀short,⠀or⠀a⠀comparison⠀that⠀once⠀seemed⠀soothing⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀harsher⠀implication.⠀This⠀return⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀object⠀means⠀without⠀explaining⠀that⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀summarizing⠀sentence.⠀Recognition⠀can⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀attention:⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀narrator⠀noticed⠀without⠀understanding⠀becomes⠀the⠀image⠀through⠀which⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀felt.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀lyricism⠀from⠀overruling⠀the⠀tragedy's⠀causal⠀landscape.⠀Choices⠀remain⠀intelligible;⠀alternatives⠀remain⠀visible;⠀characters⠀may⠀act⠀well⠀and⠀still⠀suffer.⠀The⠀repeated⠀images⠀and⠀sounds⠀make⠀the⠀fall⠀more⠀particular,⠀not⠀prettier.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀use⠀figurative⠀language,⠀but⠀other⠀characters⠀speak⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀registers,⠀and⠀their⠀dialogue⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀continuation⠀of⠀the⠀narrator's⠀lyric⠀voice.⠀End⠀a⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀has⠀just⠀changed⠀in⠀significance,⠀leaving⠀the⠀aftermath⠀present⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀completed⠀grief.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀a⠀present⠀moment⠀contain⠀an⠀ordinary⠀shared⠀routine,⠀then⠀allow⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀to⠀intrude⠀through⠀a⠀detail:⠀a⠀particular⠀way⠀a⠀kettle⠀sounds,⠀the⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀used⠀to⠀say⠀at⠀this⠀hour.⠀Keep⠀the⠀memory⠀concrete⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀object⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀the⠀whole⠀history.⠀Move⠀the⠀reflection⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀and⠀what⠀is,⠀showing⠀a⠀small⠀irreversible⠀change—the⠀routine⠀continues,⠀but⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀shared⠀it⠀is⠀absent,⠀or⠀the⠀familiar⠀action⠀now⠀serves⠀a⠀different⠀need.\n\nUse⠀repetition⠀to⠀build⠀attachment⠀across⠀reflections.⠀When⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀returns,⠀let⠀the⠀later⠀context⠀alter⠀its⠀meaning.⠀The⠀first⠀remembrance⠀may⠀recall⠀comfort⠀or⠀humor;⠀after⠀the⠀tragic⠀event,⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀may⠀stand⠀for⠀what⠀was⠀lost⠀or⠀for⠀the⠀mistake⠀that⠀preceded⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀active⠀during⠀each⠀reflective⠀return:⠀the⠀narrator⠀performs⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task,⠀speaks⠀to⠀someone,⠀or⠀notices⠀something⠀new⠀while⠀remembering.⠀The⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀must⠀coexist,⠀not⠀replace⠀each⠀other.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀reflection⠀erase⠀causal⠀consequence.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀soften⠀a⠀memory,⠀but⠀the⠀narrative⠀still⠀shows⠀the⠀choice,⠀its⠀alternatives,⠀and⠀its⠀irreversible⠀result.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀reflect⠀directly⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀quiet⠀moment⠀into⠀an⠀announcement⠀of⠀impermanence.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remain⠀pleasurable⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene;⠀tenderness⠀and⠀humor⠀that⠀belonged⠀to⠀the⠀lost⠀person⠀can⠀remain⠀vivid⠀without⠀irony.⠀Use⠀the⠀backward⠀glance⠀to⠀make⠀recognition⠀gradual:⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers⠀a⠀warning⠀or⠀an⠀alternative⠀without⠀seeing⠀it⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀and⠀only⠀the⠀later⠀perspective⠀reveals⠀how⠀that⠀option⠀was⠀already⠀lost.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling:⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀recounting⠀or⠀retelling⠀a⠀sequence⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀or⠀listeners.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀particular⠀national⠀pantheon,⠀religious⠀lesson,⠀or⠀generic⠀honor⠀code.⠀If⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀names⠀a⠀language⠀or⠀place,⠀keep⠀its⠀traditions⠀distinct;⠀an⠀Arabic⠀frame⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀a⠀Persian⠀one,⠀and⠀Hebrew⠀or⠀Kurdish⠀traditions⠀must⠀not⠀collapse⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀regional⠀flavor.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀be⠀brief⠀but⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling,⠀so⠀the⠀audience's⠀presence⠀shapes⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀delayed.\n\nWithin⠀the⠀frame,⠀narrate⠀the⠀shared⠀life⠀in⠀strongly⠀remembered⠀scenes.⠀Each⠀scene⠀can⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀formulaic⠀signpost—\"He⠀would⠀tell⠀of,\"⠀\"It⠀happened⠀that,\"—then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀concrete⠀particulars⠀of⠀a⠀routine,⠀object,⠀or⠀phrase⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀repeats⠀deliberately.⠀Use⠀these⠀recurrences⠀as⠀marks⠀of⠀daily⠀attachment⠀before⠀the⠀tragic⠀event.⠀Let⠀an⠀interjection⠀from⠀the⠀listener,⠀a⠀repeated⠀address⠀to⠀the⠀audience,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀interrupt⠀the⠀tale⠀at⠀deliberate⠀points,⠀reminding⠀the⠀reader⠀that⠀this⠀is⠀a⠀retelling⠀and⠀that⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀already⠀past.\n\nNarrate⠀the⠀innermost⠀crisis—the⠀tragic⠀choice⠀and⠀its⠀irreversible⠀consequence—with⠀causal⠀clarity:⠀alternatives⠀visible,⠀actions⠀intelligible,⠀and⠀recognition⠀earned.⠀The⠀frame⠀can⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀audience⠀after⠀the⠀loss.⠀Their⠀response⠀need⠀not⠀announce⠀a⠀moral;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀silence,⠀a⠀practical⠀observation,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀fully⠀answer.⠀This⠀double⠀time—tale⠀and⠀frame—allows⠀Maeda's⠀repetition⠀to⠀acquire⠀grief:⠀an⠀object⠀ordinary⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀becomes⠀weighted⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀lingers⠀on⠀it⠀after⠀the⠀catastrophe.⠀Keep⠀any⠀nested⠀tale⠀subordinate⠀to⠀the⠀central⠀tragedy;⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀story-within-a-story⠀to⠀replace⠀the⠀main⠀loss.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀teller⠀pausing⠀or⠀the⠀listener⠀asking⠀for⠀the⠀rest,⠀leaving⠀the⠀aftermath⠀legible⠀without⠀forcing⠀closure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀through⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀details:⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object,⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀time⠀of⠀day.⠀State⠀them⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses⠀without⠀editorializing.⠀The⠀repetition⠀itself⠀establishes⠀the⠀shared⠀life:⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀place,⠀a⠀chair⠀pulled⠀back⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀angle,⠀a⠀name⠀said⠀the⠀same⠀way⠀before⠀a⠀small⠀task.⠀Do⠀not⠀embellish⠀these⠀details⠀with⠀adjectives⠀unless⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀gains⠀something⠀concrete⠀from⠀them.\n\nUse⠀callbacks⠀as⠀the⠀primary⠀emotional⠀lever.⠀After⠀the⠀tragic⠀event,⠀return⠀to⠀one⠀of⠀the⠀exact⠀details⠀once.⠀Let⠀the⠀change⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀selection⠀and⠀placement,⠀not⠀through⠀explanation.⠀For⠀example,⠀the⠀cup⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀set⠀down,⠀but⠀the⠀second⠀hand⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀steady⠀it⠀is⠀absent;⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀is⠀repeated,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator⠀stops⠀before⠀the⠀end.⠀Keep⠀one⠀tight⠀inward⠀sentence⠀when⠀needed⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀causal⠀connection⠀or⠀the⠀recognition⠀clear,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀accumulate⠀several⠀interpretations⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀moment.⠀The⠀reader⠀must⠀infer⠀the⠀weight⠀from⠀the⠀detail's⠀prior⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀story.\n\nDo⠀not⠀cut⠀the⠀causal⠀chain⠀to⠀achieve⠀brevity.⠀Show⠀the⠀choice,⠀the⠀visible⠀alternative,⠀and⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀action⠀mattered.⠀If⠀a⠀warning⠀was⠀given,⠀it⠀must⠀appear⠀once⠀and⠀remain⠀intelligible.⠀Allow⠀people⠀to⠀act⠀sensibly⠀and⠀still⠀suffer.⠀In⠀the⠀aftermath,⠀preserve⠀the⠀felt⠀absence⠀of⠀the⠀lost⠀person⠀or⠀thing⠀without⠀announcing⠀grief.⠀A⠀plain⠀observation—what⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀now,⠀what⠀the⠀room⠀sounds⠀like⠀alone—can⠀end⠀the⠀response;⠀the⠀conclusion⠀remains⠀inferable⠀from⠀the⠀selected⠀detail.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nMove⠀through⠀sustained⠀scenes⠀with⠀natural⠀shifts⠀among⠀what⠀characters⠀do,⠀say,⠀perceive,⠀remember,⠀and⠀privately⠀think.⠀Establish⠀attachment⠀through⠀ordinary⠀routines⠀and⠀familiar⠀details⠀embedded⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀described⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀set-piece.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀shared⠀breakfast⠀can⠀include⠀a⠀practical⠀conversation,⠀a⠀small⠀joke,⠀and⠀an⠀unnoticed⠀detail⠀that⠀will⠀return⠀later.⠀Use⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀to⠀orient⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀time⠀or⠀place⠀without⠀announcing⠀\"later\"⠀or⠀\"the⠀next⠀day,\"⠀unless⠀the⠀transition⠀needs⠀clarity.\n\nKeep⠀callbacks⠀subtle⠀but⠀decisive.⠀A⠀repeated⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀gesture⠀first⠀appears⠀as⠀an⠀unremarkable⠀part⠀of⠀daily⠀life.⠀After⠀the⠀tragedy,⠀it⠀can⠀resurface⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀scene,⠀and⠀its⠀meaning⠀changes⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀happened.⠀The⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀change⠀directly;⠀allow⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀to⠀notice⠀the⠀object⠀without⠀immediately⠀summarizing⠀its⠀significance.⠀If⠀a⠀reflection⠀is⠀needed,⠀keep⠀it⠀brief⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀moment.⠀This⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀loss⠀becomes⠀intertwined⠀with⠀ongoing⠀life.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀causal⠀fall⠀through⠀character⠀actions⠀and⠀social⠀constraints,⠀not⠀through⠀sudden⠀melodrama.⠀Make⠀alternatives⠀visible⠀through⠀conversation,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀another⠀character's⠀advice,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀protagonist⠀decline⠀them⠀for⠀intelligible⠀reasons.⠀Inward⠀experience⠀is⠀authorized⠀for⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract;⠀other⠀characters'⠀thoughts⠀remain⠀unavailable⠀unless⠀granted.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀may⠀shift⠀between⠀close⠀perception⠀and⠀a⠀more⠀composed⠀sentence,⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀uniformly⠀wry⠀or⠀distant.⠀After⠀the⠀irreversible⠀event,⠀continue⠀with⠀daily⠀movement:⠀a⠀routine⠀can⠀resume,⠀a⠀room⠀can⠀be⠀cleaned,⠀a⠀conversation⠀can⠀remain⠀unfinished.⠀End⠀a⠀response⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene⠀naturally⠀pauses,⠀allowing⠀aftermath⠀to⠀persist⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀thematic⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀central⠀relationship⠀premise⠀concrete⠀through⠀repeated⠀private⠀details:⠀a⠀nickname⠀used⠀only⠀in⠀certain⠀moments,⠀an⠀inside⠀joke,⠀a⠀place⠀the⠀couple⠀returns⠀to,⠀a⠀habit⠀one⠀character⠀performs⠀for⠀the⠀other.⠀Let⠀these⠀elements⠀appear⠀early⠀in⠀ordinary⠀affectionate⠀scenes⠀and⠀be⠀repeated⠀without⠀urgency.⠀Use⠀them⠀to⠀build⠀a⠀shared⠀world⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀recognize⠀as⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀relationship,⠀not⠀a⠀collection⠀of⠀generic⠀couple⠀tropes.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀grow⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀premise's⠀tensions.⠀If⠀the⠀pairing⠀is⠀a⠀rivalry,⠀the⠀fall⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀choice⠀that⠀turns⠀their⠀competition⠀fatal⠀or⠀irreparable;⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀comfort⠀relationship,⠀the⠀loss⠀can⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀duty⠀outside⠀the⠀bond.⠀Show⠀the⠀characters'⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀need⠀as⠀real,⠀not⠀as⠀mechanical⠀markers.⠀A⠀scene⠀of⠀comfort⠀before⠀the⠀collapse⠀can⠀remain⠀genuinely⠀warm;⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀jealousy⠀can⠀be⠀serious⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀bond.⠀After⠀the⠀irreversible⠀event,⠀return⠀to⠀one⠀or⠀more⠀of⠀the⠀established⠀private⠀details.⠀Their⠀changed⠀meaning⠀is⠀the⠀story's⠀emotional⠀payoff:⠀the⠀same⠀nickname⠀now⠀said⠀by⠀only⠀one⠀person,⠀the⠀shared⠀place⠀become⠀a⠀site⠀of⠀remembrance.\n\nUse⠀scene⠀selection⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship⠀arc.⠀Each⠀scene⠀should⠀either⠀deepen⠀the⠀attachment,⠀make⠀a⠀warning⠀visible,⠀or⠀show⠀the⠀aftermath.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀inner⠀experience⠀where⠀authorized;⠀other⠀characters⠀remain⠀unavailable.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀miscommunication⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀a⠀real⠀incompatible⠀commitment.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀consequence,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀final⠀line⠀that⠀explains⠀\"this⠀is⠀why⠀they⠀lost⠀each⠀other.\"⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀or⠀phrase,⠀leaving⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀feel⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀earlier⠀warmth⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀absence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀fanfiction⠀register⠀legible⠀through⠀emotional⠀directness⠀and⠀intimate⠀pacing,⠀but⠀the⠀tragedy⠀remains⠀a⠀real⠀arc,⠀not⠀a⠀permanent⠀withdrawal⠀of⠀all⠀affection.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nUse⠀an⠀oral-chronicle⠀voice⠀that⠀speaks⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀already⠀known,⠀often⠀from⠀a⠀point⠀after⠀the⠀loss.⠀Open⠀scenes⠀or⠀descriptions⠀with⠀compact⠀declarations:⠀\"He⠀was⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀mended⠀the⠀gate⠀each⠀spring,\"⠀or⠀\"She⠀kept⠀the⠀old⠀cup⠀by⠀the⠀stove.\"⠀These⠀declarations⠀establish⠀the⠀everyday⠀attachments⠀that⠀will⠀later⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀people⠀remember.⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀exchange⠀so⠀the⠀declaration⠀is⠀grounded⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀repeated⠀moment,⠀not⠀a⠀heraldic⠀title.\n\nBuild⠀recurrence⠀through⠀phrasing.⠀A⠀repeated⠀formula—\"This⠀was⠀before⠀the⠀long⠀frost,\"⠀\"The⠀day⠀being⠀short,\"—can⠀mark⠀sections,⠀but⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀each⠀time⠀it⠀returns.⠀Within⠀scenes,⠀let⠀shared⠀objects⠀and⠀routines⠀reappear⠀in⠀the⠀chronicler's⠀account:⠀a⠀basket,⠀a⠀walking⠀route,⠀a⠀familiar⠀question.⠀These⠀repetitions⠀carry⠀Maeda's⠀daily⠀life⠀into⠀an⠀oral⠀form.⠀The⠀public⠀voice⠀may⠀note⠀a⠀kindness,⠀an⠀inconvenience,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀debt⠀owed⠀between⠀people,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀household⠀action⠀into⠀a⠀martial⠀contest.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀emerge⠀from⠀a⠀choice⠀whose⠀alternatives⠀the⠀telling⠀can⠀make⠀explicit:⠀the⠀chronicler⠀may⠀say⠀that⠀a⠀different⠀decision⠀had⠀been⠀advised,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀weather⠀and⠀the⠀need⠀of⠀the⠀household⠀pressed⠀at⠀once.⠀Keep⠀characters⠀intelligent⠀and⠀worthy⠀of⠀regard⠀even⠀when⠀they⠀choose⠀badly;⠀humility⠀or⠀duty⠀may⠀drive⠀the⠀fall.⠀After⠀the⠀irreversible⠀deed,⠀let⠀the⠀chronicle⠀resume⠀with⠀practical⠀continuation—others⠀still⠀collect⠀wood,⠀manage⠀the⠀livestock,⠀set⠀the⠀table—while⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀from⠀before⠀now⠀names⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost.⠀Recognition⠀can⠀be⠀public⠀as⠀a⠀community's⠀understanding:⠀the⠀people⠀begin⠀to⠀speak⠀of⠀the⠀event⠀in⠀a⠀certain⠀way,⠀or⠀a⠀previously⠀small⠀habit⠀is⠀remembered⠀only⠀because⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀gone.⠀End⠀a⠀response⠀on⠀a⠀new⠀practical⠀moment⠀that⠀keeps⠀the⠀loss⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀communal⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀sealing⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀social-realist⠀domestic⠀route,⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀national⠀and⠀institutional⠀texture⠀settled⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀Nordic⠀mood.⠀Let⠀the⠀fall⠀grow⠀from⠀ordinary⠀obligations⠀that⠀are⠀publicly⠀legible:⠀a⠀work⠀schedule,⠀a⠀housing⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀family⠀responsibility,⠀a⠀municipal⠀or⠀workplace⠀expectation,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀to⠀a⠀neighbor.⠀Show⠀the⠀practical⠀conditions⠀that⠀make⠀two⠀commitments⠀incompatible,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀name⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀losing⠀and⠀still⠀cannot⠀keep⠀everything.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀participant's⠀inward⠀reasoning⠀about⠀a⠀specific⠀necessity.⠀The⠀focal⠀mind⠀weighs⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀acting⠀or⠀not⠀acting,⠀notices⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀expects,⠀and⠀registers⠀the⠀small⠀daily⠀evidence⠀of⠀strain.⠀Other⠀characters⠀remain⠀intelligent⠀and⠀occupied⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀obligations;⠀they⠀may⠀offer⠀a⠀warning⠀or⠀an⠀alternative⠀that⠀is⠀genuinely⠀reasonable⠀and⠀still⠀insufficient,⠀because⠀the⠀difficulty⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀structure⠀of⠀the⠀commitments,⠀not⠀in⠀anyone's⠀failure⠀to⠀understand.\n\nSelect⠀one⠀recurring⠀element⠀from⠀the⠀shared⠀daily⠀life—a⠀route,⠀a⠀chore,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀room,⠀an⠀object⠀passed⠀between⠀people—and⠀present⠀it⠀first⠀as⠀practical⠀and⠀unremarkable.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀its⠀future⠀significance.⠀After⠀the⠀loss,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀element⠀in⠀a⠀scene⠀where⠀its⠀ordinary⠀use⠀has⠀become⠀difficult⠀or⠀impossible.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀recognizes⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀attention⠀and⠀behavior:⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀the⠀usual⠀action,⠀an⠀avoidance,⠀an⠀attempt⠀to⠀continue⠀that⠀stops.⠀Do⠀not⠀have⠀anyone⠀announce⠀that⠀the⠀object⠀now⠀symbolizes⠀grief.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Maeda⠀movement⠀from⠀specific⠀shared⠀attachment⠀to⠀changed⠀understanding.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀humor⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀relationships⠀where⠀they⠀belong,⠀but⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀cancel⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀works,⠀a⠀relationship⠀altered⠀by⠀the⠀choice,⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀remains⠀but⠀no⠀longer⠀holds⠀the⠀same⠀daily⠀meaning.⠀Stay⠀within⠀the⠀actual⠀world;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀folktale⠀or⠀supernatural⠀explanation⠀unless⠀the⠀setting⠀already⠀includes⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀screenable⠀scenes,⠀with⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action⠀carry⠀the⠀consequential⠀fall.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cast's⠀choices⠀visible:⠀someone⠀can⠀hear⠀a⠀warning,⠀weigh⠀an⠀alternative,⠀and⠀still⠀pick⠀the⠀action⠀that⠀later⠀cannot⠀be⠀undone.⠀Give⠀each⠀scene⠀one⠀clear⠀practical⠀occupation—serving⠀a⠀meal,⠀repairing⠀something,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀call—so⠀the⠀tragedy⠀occurs⠀inside⠀ordinary⠀life⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀symbolic⠀register.\n\nChoose⠀a⠀recurring⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀that⠀appears⠀in⠀early⠀scenes⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Show⠀it⠀in⠀quotidian⠀use:⠀opened,⠀passed,⠀cleaned,⠀repeated.⠀Do⠀not⠀lecture⠀about⠀it.⠀Later,⠀when⠀the⠀event⠀has⠀occurred,⠀let⠀the⠀object⠀appear⠀again⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀emotional⠀register.⠀Stage⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀does⠀with⠀it:⠀a⠀longer⠀hold,⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀touch⠀it,⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀to⠀continue⠀the⠀usual⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀the⠀familiar⠀phrase.⠀The⠀repetition⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀changed⠀understanding.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀and⠀blocking⠀to⠀show⠀tenderness⠀or⠀humor⠀where⠀it⠀fits,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀soften⠀the⠀irreversibility.⠀Required⠀private⠀thought⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀set⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀voice-over⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀can⠀hear.⠀The⠀note⠀may⠀render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀recognition,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀changed⠀feeling⠀about⠀the⠀recurring⠀object,⠀while⠀the⠀visible⠀scene⠀shows⠀only⠀what⠀an⠀observer⠀could⠀see.\n\nEnd⠀a⠀scene⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀new⠀decision,⠀or⠀plainly⠀shown⠀aftermath.⠀No⠀character⠀needs⠀a⠀monologue⠀of⠀self-knowledge;⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀can⠀appear⠀through⠀one⠀ordinary⠀action⠀performed⠀differently.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀tragedy⠀where⠀the⠀stage⠀action⠀exposes⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice.⠀Use⠀clear⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀purposeful⠀objects⠀so⠀that⠀an⠀audience⠀can⠀follow⠀what⠀each⠀character⠀knows⠀and⠀when.⠀Let⠀a⠀warning⠀be⠀given⠀in⠀dialogue⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀insufficient⠀because⠀two⠀obligations⠀cannot⠀both⠀be⠀met.⠀The⠀fall⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀incompatible⠀commitments,⠀not⠀from⠀anyone⠀simply⠀missing⠀an⠀obvious⠀solution.\n\nSelect⠀one⠀prop⠀or⠀repeated⠀physical⠀routine—a⠀dish,⠀a⠀key,⠀a⠀shoe,⠀an⠀order⠀of⠀tasks—and⠀stage⠀its⠀repetition⠀in⠀the⠀early⠀scenes.⠀Keep⠀it⠀quotidian,⠀not⠀symbolic.⠀Later,⠀have⠀a⠀character⠀handle⠀the⠀same⠀prop⠀differently.⠀Stage⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀observable⠀behavior:⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀touch⠀it,⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀the⠀usual⠀action,⠀an⠀attempt⠀to⠀continue⠀that⠀stops,⠀or⠀an⠀effort⠀to⠀give⠀it⠀away.⠀Let⠀the⠀pause⠀and⠀physical⠀change⠀carry⠀the⠀new⠀meaning⠀without⠀a⠀speech⠀explaining⠀it.\n\nUse⠀monologues⠀or⠀asides⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀serve⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀by⠀changing⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀relationship.⠀For⠀required⠀private⠀thought,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀set⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀dialogue⠀and⠀stage⠀directions,⠀not⠀as⠀lines⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀hear⠀and⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀performed⠀aside.⠀A⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀announce⠀that⠀everything⠀has⠀changed;⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture.⠀Let⠀warmth⠀and⠀humor⠀exist⠀where⠀they⠀belong,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀them⠀to⠀reverse⠀the⠀loss.\n\nStructure⠀the⠀scene⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀consequences⠀are⠀visible⠀without⠀narration.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀can⠀end⠀in⠀an⠀altered⠀routine,⠀a⠀refused⠀offer,⠀or⠀a⠀silent⠀exit.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀redemption⠀speech⠀or⠀a⠀neat⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀one⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind⠀moving⠀back⠀and⠀forth⠀between⠀immediate⠀perception⠀and⠀charged⠀memory.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀follow⠀that⠀association:⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀fragment⠀of⠀speech⠀can⠀call⠀up⠀the⠀day⠀the⠀choice⠀was⠀made.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀so⠀readers⠀know⠀which⠀material⠀is⠀present⠀experience,⠀which⠀is⠀recollection,⠀and⠀which⠀is⠀imagined.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀mind⠀become⠀omniscient⠀or⠀invade⠀other⠀characters'⠀private⠀thoughts.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀objects⠀and⠀small⠀routines⠀as⠀mental⠀touchstones.⠀In⠀early⠀passages,⠀they⠀appear⠀as⠀daily⠀background:⠀a⠀mug⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀route⠀followed,⠀a⠀phrase⠀said⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀time.⠀After⠀the⠀tragic⠀event,⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀one⠀of⠀those⠀details⠀with⠀changed⠀emotional⠀weight.⠀The⠀object⠀has⠀not⠀changed;⠀the⠀mind's⠀relation⠀to⠀it⠀has.⠀Show⠀that⠀shift⠀through⠀the⠀quality⠀of⠀attention—longer⠀pause,⠀break⠀in⠀syntax,⠀sudden⠀refusal⠀to⠀finish⠀the⠀thought—not⠀through⠀an⠀explicit⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀loss.\n\nLet⠀tenderness,⠀humor,⠀and⠀irritation⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀stream⠀where⠀they⠀fit,⠀because⠀Maeda's⠀profile⠀includes⠀them.⠀The⠀tragic⠀point⠀is⠀not⠀achieved⠀by⠀making⠀every⠀thought⠀bleak.⠀Instead,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀may⠀become⠀painful⠀because⠀it⠀was⠀once⠀light.⠀Aftermath⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀mind⠀trying⠀and⠀failing⠀to⠀restore⠀an⠀old⠀routine,⠀and⠀recognizing⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀meaning⠀cannot⠀be⠀reinstalled.\n\nThe⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀wherever⠀the⠀association⠀naturally⠀halts:⠀a⠀present⠀action⠀interrupted⠀by⠀memory,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀recalled⠀in⠀private⠀with⠀new⠀weight,⠀or⠀a⠀sensation⠀that⠀closes⠀the⠀loop.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀concluding⠀epiphany⠀or⠀require⠀the⠀stream⠀to⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀realization.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀a⠀readable⠀transcript⠀where⠀each⠀sender⠀has⠀a⠀recognizable⠀digital⠀habit—punctuation,⠀timing,⠀use⠀of⠀read⠀receipts,⠀delay⠀before⠀replying,⠀attachment⠀behavior.⠀Let⠀the⠀irreversible⠀event⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀exchange,⠀not⠀just⠀referred⠀to⠀in⠀summary.⠀The⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀can⠀be⠀stated⠀across⠀messages:⠀someone⠀asks⠀for⠀help,⠀another⠀explains⠀a⠀duty,⠀a⠀third⠀tries⠀to⠀mediate.⠀All⠀can⠀be⠀intelligent⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀to⠀keep⠀every⠀promise.\n\nEstablish⠀a⠀recurring⠀message⠀element⠀early:⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀sign-off,⠀a⠀request⠀sent⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀time,⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀discussed⠀daily.⠀Show⠀it⠀as⠀ordinary⠀communication.⠀After⠀the⠀loss,⠀bring⠀back⠀the⠀same⠀element⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀weight.⠀The⠀change⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀sender's⠀established⠀habit:⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀now⠀arrives⠀late,⠀goes⠀unsent,⠀loses⠀its⠀usual⠀punctuation,⠀or⠀is⠀answered⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀no⠀longer⠀responds⠀in⠀the⠀old⠀way.⠀The⠀changed⠀digital⠀behavior,⠀not⠀a⠀dramatic⠀confession,⠀carries⠀Maeda's⠀reframing.\n\nDistinguish⠀clearly⠀between⠀sent⠀messages,⠀unsent⠀drafts,⠀and⠀private⠀thought.⠀Show⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀as⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀not⠀as⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀If⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀needed,⠀separate⠀it⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Other⠀characters⠀respond⠀only⠀to⠀what⠀would⠀actually⠀appear⠀on⠀their⠀screens.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀fake⠀system⠀events⠀or⠀receipts⠀merely⠀to⠀imply⠀subtext,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀place⠀private⠀thought⠀inside⠀a⠀message⠀bubble⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀were⠀sent.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀lands,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀a⠀long⠀gap,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀that⠀now⠀reads⠀differently⠀to⠀the⠀recipient.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀the⠀ordinary⠀channel⠀has⠀itself⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqamba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nStructure⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀legible⠀visual⠀novel⠀scenes:⠀each⠀scene-setting⠀passage⠀establishes⠀place,⠀then⠀dialogue⠀and⠀focal⠀reaction⠀move⠀the⠀event.⠀Let⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀be⠀reached⠀in⠀a⠀scene⠀with⠀visible⠀practical⠀business,⠀so⠀the⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀ordinary⠀constraints⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀the⠀decision.⠀Keep⠀speech⠀attribution⠀concise,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀background⠀cue⠀into⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.\n\nPick⠀a⠀recurring⠀visual⠀element:⠀an⠀after-school⠀room,⠀a⠀kitchen⠀shelf,⠀a⠀bus⠀window,⠀a⠀repeated⠀item⠀someone⠀always⠀sets⠀down.⠀Introduce⠀it⠀without⠀symbolic⠀commentary.⠀Later,⠀after⠀the⠀loss,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀element⠀or⠀object.⠀The⠀focal⠀narration⠀may⠀register⠀it⠀differently—through⠀a⠀longer⠀pause,⠀a⠀noticed⠀detail⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀ignored,⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀to⠀continue⠀the⠀old⠀routine,⠀or⠀a⠀feeling⠀that⠀the⠀familiar⠀thing⠀now⠀belongs⠀to⠀an⠀unreachable⠀time.⠀Do⠀not⠀have⠀a⠀character⠀announce⠀that⠀the⠀object⠀symbolizes⠀grief;⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀attention⠀does⠀the⠀work.\n\nUse⠀focal⠀narration⠀and⠀inner⠀response⠀as⠀ordinary⠀private⠀prose;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀known⠀by⠀other⠀characters.⠀Let⠀warmth⠀and⠀humor⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀scenes⠀where⠀they⠀fit,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀them⠀to⠀repair⠀the⠀tragedy.⠀The⠀recognition⠀may⠀occur⠀without⠀a⠀branching⠀menu⠀or⠀player⠀choice.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀character⠀sees⠀the⠀familiar⠀thing,⠀says⠀the⠀old⠀phrase,⠀and⠀then⠀fails⠀to⠀continue⠀the⠀routine.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀with⠀a⠀simple⠀tag⠀like⠀a⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀shift.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands,⠀background⠀description⠀fields,⠀or⠀image⠀generation⠀instructions.⠀The⠀style⠀here⠀is⠀narrative⠀and⠀illustrative,⠀not⠀a⠀game⠀engine.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqambb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀a⠀serialized⠀prose⠀narrative:⠀each⠀installment⠀moves⠀a⠀local⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀consequential⠀fall⠀while⠀keeping⠀the⠀overall⠀through-line⠀legible.⠀Begin⠀an⠀installment⠀by⠀recovering⠀only⠀the⠀necessary⠀context—the⠀current⠀obligation,⠀the⠀person's⠀relationship,⠀the⠀previously⠀established⠀habit—not⠀a⠀full⠀recap.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀advance⠀through⠀ordinary⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀focal⠀thought.\n\nUse⠀a⠀recurring⠀routine⠀or⠀object⠀across⠀installments⠀as⠀a⠀Maeda-style⠀anchor.⠀In⠀early⠀entries,⠀show⠀it⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀daily⠀life⠀without⠀comment.⠀In⠀a⠀later⠀entry,⠀bring⠀the⠀same⠀element⠀into⠀view⠀after⠀the⠀irreversible⠀event.⠀Weave⠀the⠀brief⠀recovered⠀sentence⠀into⠀the⠀current⠀scene's⠀observation⠀or⠀action,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀recognizes⠀the⠀earlier⠀usage⠀without⠀the⠀story⠀stopping⠀for⠀a⠀flashback.⠀The⠀current⠀scene⠀then⠀shows⠀the⠀character's⠀changed⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀element⠀through⠀attention,⠀hesitation,⠀avoidance,⠀or⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀to⠀continue⠀the⠀routine.⠀Do⠀not⠀have⠀a⠀character⠀announce⠀that⠀this⠀is⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀from⠀before.\n\nUse⠀hooks⠀that⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀serial⠀flow:⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀task⠀begun,⠀someone⠀arriving.⠀These⠀are⠀not⠀cliffhanger⠀threats;⠀the⠀installment⠀may⠀simply⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning⠀or⠀on⠀a⠀character⠀noticing⠀that⠀a⠀usual⠀step⠀was⠀skipped.⠀Avoid⠀forcing⠀a⠀full⠀resolution⠀or⠀crisis⠀in⠀every⠀entry.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀focused⠀character's⠀ordinary⠀prose.⠀Other⠀characters⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀they⠀observe.⠀The⠀serial⠀should⠀allow⠀the⠀same⠀daily⠀element⠀to⠀reappear⠀several⠀entries⠀later,⠀each⠀time⠀with⠀a⠀slightly⠀heavier⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀tragedy.⠀That⠀cumulative⠀shift⠀is⠀the⠀main⠀structural⠀technique.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nTreat⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀as⠀an⠀action⠀with⠀a⠀legible⠀mechanism⠀and⠀an⠀immediate⠀practical⠀consequence;⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀merely⠀describe⠀hurt⠀but⠀shows⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀with⠀an⠀admission,⠀a⠀need,⠀a⠀withheld⠀answer,⠀an⠀apology,⠀or⠀a⠀return.⠀Before⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀risks⠀exposure,⠀give⠀the⠀character⠀a⠀concrete⠀small⠀calculation—what⠀could⠀be⠀saved⠀or⠀lost,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀said⠀first,⠀what⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀guarded—then⠀let⠀the⠀risk⠀be⠀taken⠀or⠀refused⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀moment.\n\nFollow⠀each⠀move⠀to⠀its⠀receiving⠀effect:⠀a⠀direct⠀request⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀look⠀at⠀visible⠀work⠀instead⠀of⠀answering,⠀an⠀apology⠀may⠀lower⠀the⠀speaker's⠀practical⠀position,⠀a⠀need⠀that⠀is⠀admitted⠀may⠀be⠀met⠀with⠀a⠀useful⠀but⠀careful⠀kindness.⠀Show⠀the⠀interaction⠀through⠀ordinary⠀resources⠀and⠀pressures—space,⠀time,⠀money,⠀information,⠀obligation—so⠀that⠀emotional⠀strain⠀and⠀practical⠀trouble⠀act⠀as⠀one⠀joined⠀situation.⠀Permit⠀tenderness⠀that⠀remains⠀imperfect:⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀kneel⠀beside⠀another⠀but⠀check⠀the⠀untouched⠀medical⠀kit⠀afterward,⠀or⠀offer⠀food⠀while⠀already⠀reaching⠀for⠀a⠀tool⠀needed⠀elsewhere.\n\nDo⠀not⠀settle⠀every⠀wound.⠀Recognition⠀can⠀arrive⠀after⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀already⠀irreparable,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀preserve⠀the⠀exact⠀choice⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀undone⠀without⠀recovering⠀the⠀damaged⠀relationship.⠀Keep⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀inside⠀the⠀character⠀who⠀is⠀acting,⠀not⠀inside⠀the⠀person⠀being⠀addressed;⠀the⠀other's⠀response⠀is⠀inferred⠀from⠀visible⠀timing,⠀tone,⠀and⠀movement.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀acknowledged⠀cost⠀are⠀both⠀legible,⠀however⠀much⠀remains⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀short,⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀where⠀every⠀spoken⠀line⠀is⠀unmistakably⠀attributed⠀and⠀every⠀practical⠀adjustment—a⠀chair⠀moved,⠀a⠀door⠀checked,⠀a⠀package⠀set⠀down—is⠀shown⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀matters.⠀Advance⠀the⠀shared⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀operation⠀the⠀active⠀character⠀can⠀attempt,⠀using⠀the⠀visible⠀conditions⠀that⠀are⠀already⠀in⠀play:⠀which⠀resource⠀is⠀scarce,⠀which⠀person⠀is⠀waiting,⠀which⠀step⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀repeated.⠀Move⠀from⠀decision⠀to⠀result⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀passage⠀so⠀the⠀interaction⠀feels⠀present⠀and⠀rapid⠀rather⠀than⠀pre-explained.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀user's⠀submitted⠀action⠀and⠀speech⠀as⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀continuing⠀system,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀prompt⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀answered⠀with⠀a⠀full⠀reversal.⠀An⠀NPC⠀may⠀comply,⠀cooperate,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀return⠀later⠀depending⠀on⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀but⠀each⠀response⠀should⠀draw⠀on⠀a⠀visible⠀motive⠀and⠀immediate⠀practical⠀stake—loyalty,⠀fatigue,⠀debt,⠀fear,⠀trust—so⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀continuation⠀follows⠀naturally.⠀Where⠀the⠀tragedy⠀requires⠀a⠀loss,⠀make⠀it⠀the⠀live⠀consequence⠀of⠀a⠀choice⠀already⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀help⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀risks⠀something⠀irreplaceable,⠀or⠀refuse⠀exactly⠀the⠀aid⠀that⠀would⠀have⠀preserved⠀an⠀incompatible⠀commitment.\n\nLeave⠀the⠀exchange⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀visibly⠀continuing:⠀someone⠀has⠀just⠀finished⠀speaking,⠀moved⠀toward⠀a⠀door,⠀set⠀down⠀a⠀tool,⠀or⠀begun⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀prompt.⠀No⠀question⠀mark,⠀menu,⠀or⠀forced⠀decision⠀is⠀necessary;⠀the⠀NPC's⠀ongoing⠀behavior⠀and⠀the⠀newly⠀visible⠀cost⠀are⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀turn.⠀Keep⠀character⠀thought⠀inside⠀the⠀responding⠀viewpoint⠀and⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀minds⠀of⠀others.⠀Tragedy⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀as⠀a⠀slow⠀narrowing⠀of⠀options,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀hidden⠀requirement⠀to⠀punish⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀method:⠀a⠀spare,⠀linked⠀account⠀of⠀real⠀material⠀moves⠀where⠀one⠀episode⠀shows⠀the⠀exact⠀pressure⠀behind⠀a⠀choice⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀shows⠀its⠀price.⠀Do⠀not⠀adopt⠀a⠀classical⠀register⠀or⠀insert⠀historical⠀scenery;⠀keep⠀the⠀tone⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀socially⠀situated⠀language⠀already⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀story.⠀Each⠀brief⠀episode⠀should⠀include⠀enough⠀concrete⠀domestic⠀or⠀practical⠀detail—a⠀door,⠀a⠀loan,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀tool—to⠀make⠀the⠀consequences⠀touchable,⠀without⠀converting⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀stock⠀figures⠀of⠀family⠀or⠀duty.\n\nFor⠀Kamachi's⠀mechanical⠀order,⠀give⠀every⠀step⠀a⠀legible⠀cause⠀before⠀its⠀visible⠀result.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀act⠀against⠀a⠀commitment,⠀show⠀the⠀small⠀calculation⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀choice⠀possible:⠀what⠀obligation⠀the⠀room⠀will⠀call⠀due,⠀what⠀private⠀need⠀the⠀faster⠀step⠀protects,⠀what⠀cost⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀counted.⠀The⠀recipient⠀of⠀the⠀act⠀should⠀respond⠀in⠀a⠀subsequent⠀episode,⠀so⠀a⠀request⠀and⠀its⠀rejection⠀or⠀awkward⠀partial⠀answer⠀are⠀heard⠀in⠀different⠀scenes,⠀each⠀one⠀revealing⠀the⠀changed⠀relation.⠀Recurrence⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀tragedy,⠀with⠀a⠀repeated⠀errand,⠀name,⠀or⠀gesture⠀light⠀in⠀one⠀episode⠀and⠀heavy⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀after⠀new⠀facts⠀are⠀known.\n\nUse⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀episodes⠀as⠀an⠀expressive⠀resource:⠀omission⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀not⠀yet⠀name,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀episode⠀may⠀recognize⠀the⠀lost⠀chance⠀without⠀restoring⠀it.⠀Keep⠀all⠀narration⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀person⠀and⠀viewpoint.⠀The⠀ending⠀of⠀an⠀episode⠀may⠀pause⠀at⠀the⠀completed⠀act⠀and⠀its⠀acknowledged⠀consequence,⠀never⠀at⠀a⠀moral⠀stated⠀for⠀the⠀reader.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nKeep⠀the⠀passage⠀tight,⠀with⠀hard⠀nouns⠀and⠀visible⠀wear—scuffed⠀tile,⠀bent⠀metal,⠀a⠀torn⠀cuff,⠀a⠀heavier⠀crate—so⠀that⠀physical⠀state⠀carries⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀tragedy.⠀Move⠀by⠀compressed⠀transitions:⠀beginning,⠀change,⠀result,⠀without⠀transition⠀words⠀that⠀explain⠀the⠀reader⠀forward.⠀Where⠀Kamachi⠀requires⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀write⠀the⠀key⠀calculation⠀as⠀one⠀to⠀three⠀concrete⠀sentences:⠀what⠀condition⠀makes⠀the⠀move⠀work,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀sees,⠀what⠀will⠀happen⠀if⠀the⠀move⠀succeeds⠀or⠀fails.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀result⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀beat;⠀no⠀summary.\n\nLet⠀each⠀paragraph⠀earn⠀its⠀length.⠀A⠀longer⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀kept⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀working⠀through⠀a⠀conflict⠀between⠀two⠀live⠀obligations,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀still⠀touch⠀objects,⠀time,⠀or⠀cost:⠀count⠀the⠀minutes,⠀name⠀the⠀person⠀waiting,⠀itemize⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀replaced.⠀Change⠀the⠀rhythm⠀by⠀cutting⠀a⠀result⠀into⠀a⠀short⠀standalone⠀sentence—The⠀door⠀held.⠀She'd⠀already⠀paid.—or⠀by⠀slowing⠀into⠀an⠀exact⠀physical⠀image⠀without⠀sentiment.⠀Ground⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker:⠀show⠀the⠀strained⠀voice,⠀the⠀hand⠀that⠀stays⠀busy,⠀the⠀dropped⠀courtesy,⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀everyone⠀hard⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀canned⠀way.\n\nDo⠀not⠀pre-announce⠀suffering.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀the⠀impossible⠀choice⠀and⠀the⠀recorded⠀consequence,⠀with⠀recognition⠀arriving⠀as⠀an⠀unglossed⠀detail:⠀a⠀lighter⠀object⠀remaining⠀where⠀a⠀heavier⠀one⠀used⠀to⠀stand,⠀a⠀fixed⠀lamplight⠀reaching⠀an⠀empty⠀chair,⠀a⠀figure⠀still⠀moving⠀down⠀the⠀street⠀after⠀the⠀decision.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀completed⠀action⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath.⠀No⠀closing⠀reflection⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents⠀that⠀are⠀practical⠀moves,⠀not⠀neutral⠀summaries.⠀Each⠀letter,⠀report,⠀note,⠀or⠀record⠀names⠀its⠀writer,⠀recipient⠀or⠀intended⠀use,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition,⠀and⠀it⠀must⠀change⠀a⠀specific⠀practical⠀relation—payment,⠀access,⠀permission,⠀blame,⠀care,⠀or⠀silence.⠀Write⠀from⠀the⠀document's⠀own⠀purpose:⠀an⠀official⠀report⠀may⠀record⠀times⠀and⠀conditions⠀while⠀omitting⠀the⠀writer's⠀motive;⠀a⠀private⠀letter⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀moral⠀choice⠀to⠀someone⠀the⠀writer⠀needs⠀or⠀fears;⠀a⠀request⠀may⠀reveal⠀exactly⠀the⠀mechanism⠀Kamachi⠀would⠀make⠀legible⠀by⠀listing⠀what⠀resource⠀must⠀arrive⠀before⠀what⠀step⠀can⠀occur.\n\nLet⠀the⠀document's⠀knowledge⠀or⠀concealment⠀follow⠀its⠀author.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀suspicion⠀without⠀naming⠀it,⠀give⠀a⠀reason⠀that⠀is⠀true⠀but⠀incomplete,⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀an⠀earlier⠀message⠀because⠀one⠀key⠀condition⠀was⠀never⠀stated.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀corrector⠀after⠀the⠀document;⠀the⠀reader⠀compares⠀the⠀paper's⠀claims,⠀times,⠀omissions,⠀and⠀material⠀traces.⠀Revisions⠀and⠀crossed-out⠀sections⠀are⠀evidence,⠀not⠀decorative⠀texture:⠀a⠀writer⠀may⠀change⠀a⠀number,⠀soften⠀a⠀reproach,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀name⠀out⠀because⠀the⠀later⠀cost⠀is⠀already⠀known.\n\nMake⠀the⠀tragic⠀mechanism⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀sequence.⠀One⠀document⠀supplies⠀the⠀condition⠀another⠀document⠀depends⠀on;⠀the⠀final⠀record⠀may⠀show⠀both⠀the⠀choice⠀and⠀the⠀now⠀irretrievable⠀alternative.⠀Allow⠀a⠀document⠀to⠀arrive⠀too⠀late,⠀to⠀remain⠀unopened,⠀or⠀to⠀be⠀read⠀by⠀the⠀wrong⠀person.⠀Use⠀whichever⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀requires⠀rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀through⠀journal,⠀report,⠀and⠀correspondence.⠀Interiority⠀is⠀present⠀only⠀where⠀a⠀document⠀can⠀legitimately⠀record⠀the⠀writer's⠀thought;⠀do⠀not⠀hide⠀the⠀writer's⠀private⠀mind⠀inside⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀would⠀not⠀contain⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nOrganize⠀each⠀interval⠀of⠀comfort⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀legible⠀operation:⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀a⠀concrete⠀need⠀or⠀known⠀preference,⠀selects⠀the⠀available⠀means,⠀and⠀performs⠀a⠀tender⠀act⠀whose⠀result⠀is⠀shown—warm⠀tea⠀left⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀cup,⠀a⠀coat⠀placed⠀within⠀reach,⠀a⠀chair⠀turned⠀so⠀a⠀tired⠀person⠀can⠀sit⠀without⠀asking.⠀Write⠀the⠀kindness⠀through⠀timing,⠀temperature,⠀placement,⠀and⠀familiar⠀objects⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀declarations.⠀Let⠀the⠀recipient⠀receive⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀keeps⠀individual⠀personality:⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀say⠀nothing⠀but⠀finish⠀the⠀drink,⠀another⠀may⠀set⠀the⠀cup⠀aside⠀and⠀still⠀accept⠀a⠀blanket,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀mention⠀the⠀wrong⠀thing⠀and⠀then⠀quietly⠀remain.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀comfort⠀cosmetic.⠀The⠀tragedy's⠀cost⠀stays⠀active⠀in⠀the⠀exact⠀material⠀detail⠀the⠀kindness⠀cannot⠀restore:⠀the⠀empty⠀seat,⠀the⠀frozen⠀account,⠀the⠀scheduled⠀call,⠀the⠀passport,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀still⠀must⠀be⠀opened.⠀Warmth⠀does⠀not⠀reverse⠀the⠀loss⠀or⠀melt⠀the⠀difficulty;⠀it⠀makes⠀one⠀moment⠀bearable.⠀A⠀sincere⠀kindness⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀acknowledgment⠀that⠀it⠀is⠀insufficient,⠀and⠀that⠀insufficiency⠀may⠀be⠀unsaid⠀but⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀silence⠀after⠀the⠀act.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀selected⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀anchored⠀in⠀the⠀acting⠀character,⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀comforted⠀person's⠀mind.⠀Other⠀figures⠀may⠀refuse⠀help,⠀accept⠀it⠀awkwardly,⠀or⠀offer⠀their⠀own⠀small⠀contribution,⠀and⠀they⠀remain⠀fully⠀in⠀the⠀world⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀priorities.⠀The⠀ending⠀need⠀not⠀close⠀the⠀hurt;⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀conclude⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀act⠀is⠀complete⠀and⠀its⠀visible⠀effect—or⠀absence⠀of⠀effect—is⠀legible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀composed⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀to⠀hold⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀social⠀frame⠀before⠀the⠀tactical⠀move⠀appears.⠀A⠀decision⠀may⠀be⠀introduced⠀through⠀its⠀surrounding⠀conditions:⠀the⠀room's⠀occupants,⠀the⠀known⠀history⠀between⠀them,⠀the⠀obligation⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀affected,⠀the⠀object⠀on⠀which⠀the⠀choice⠀now⠀depends.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀distinguish⠀its⠀own⠀reflective,⠀socially⠀situated⠀sentence⠀patterns⠀from⠀spoken⠀dialogue;⠀characters⠀in⠀conversation⠀may⠀be⠀abrupt⠀while⠀the⠀narrative⠀remains⠀measured.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀Kamachi⠀mechanism⠀enters,⠀keep⠀it⠀legible⠀without⠀abandoning⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture.⠀Give⠀the⠀necessary⠀conditions⠀in⠀a⠀subordinate⠀clause⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀apposite⠀statement—what⠀permission,⠀timing,⠀resource,⠀or⠀past⠀arrangement⠀makes⠀the⠀action⠀possible—then⠀let⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀immediate⠀result⠀occupy⠀their⠀own⠀shorter⠀sentence.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀decision⠀into⠀a⠀full⠀deliberative⠀essay;⠀the⠀faster⠀consequence⠀can⠀cut⠀against⠀the⠀longer⠀paragraph⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀loss⠀feel⠀proximate.⠀Public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀when⠀the⠀selected⠀narrator⠀permits:⠀a⠀formal⠀occasion⠀can⠀make⠀one⠀private⠀admission⠀more⠀vulnerable,⠀or⠀a⠀letter⠀read⠀in⠀company⠀can⠀give⠀a⠀private⠀bond⠀public⠀consequence.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀occur⠀through⠀selection⠀and⠀order⠀rather⠀than⠀emotional⠀declaration.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀mention⠀the⠀unavailable⠀alternative⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀chosen⠀route⠀has⠀become⠀irreversible,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀prose⠀attends⠀to:⠀a⠀chair⠀moved⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀will⠀not⠀arrive,⠀a⠀schedule⠀kept⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀was⠀the⠀reason⠀for⠀leaving,⠀an⠀object⠀restored⠀too⠀neatly.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀event⠀and⠀its⠀acknowledged⠀social⠀meaning⠀are⠀both⠀clear,⠀without⠀collapsing⠀the⠀tragedy⠀into⠀a⠀final⠀aphorism.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀listener⠀already⠀bound⠀to⠀the⠀teller⠀by⠀love,⠀debt,⠀old⠀resentment,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀promise,⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀purpose⠀the⠀teller⠀needs:⠀an⠀alliance,⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀warning,⠀permission,⠀or⠀a⠀last⠀chance⠀to⠀be⠀understood.⠀Give⠀the⠀occasion⠀practical⠀weight—a⠀vigil,⠀a⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀night⠀before⠀departure—so⠀the⠀audience's⠀attention⠀is⠀itself⠀at⠀stake⠀while⠀the⠀tale⠀runs.\n\nInside⠀the⠀embedded⠀account,⠀run⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀a⠀legible⠀chain⠀of⠀constrained⠀choices.⠀At⠀each⠀step⠀show⠀the⠀resource⠀actually⠀available,⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀obligation⠀that⠀restricts⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀act⠀that⠀locks⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀in⠀place,⠀so⠀that⠀when⠀a⠀listener⠀asks⠀\"why⠀didn't⠀they⠀just—\",⠀the⠀answer⠀is⠀already⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀tale's⠀own⠀world:⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀oath,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀depended⠀on⠀them,⠀the⠀sealed⠀door.⠀Treat⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀as⠀an⠀active⠀intervention,⠀not⠀a⠀flashback.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀compare,⠀object,⠀or⠀fall⠀dangerously⠀silent,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀tale's⠀speed,⠀emphasis,⠀or⠀omissions⠀in⠀response.\n\nBind⠀the⠀levels⠀with⠀recurrence.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀question⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀can⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀room⠀with⠀its⠀meaning⠀altered⠀by⠀everything⠀told⠀in⠀between.⠀Trace⠀the⠀fatal⠀event⠀as⠀intelligible⠀decisions⠀rather⠀than⠀punishment:⠀the⠀choice⠀that⠀seemed⠀right,⠀the⠀incompatibility⠀discovered⠀too⠀late,⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀one⠀more⠀speech⠀or⠀one⠀more⠀silence⠀was⠀still⠀possible,⠀then⠀the⠀act⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀taken⠀back.⠀Let⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀at⠀different⠀levels—the⠀character⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀may⠀see⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀it,⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀understand⠀now⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀understand⠀then,⠀and⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀recognize⠀something⠀before⠀either⠀of⠀them⠀says⠀it.\n\nWhen⠀one⠀telling⠀ends,⠀do⠀not⠀restart⠀the⠀same⠀narrative.⠀Let⠀a⠀new⠀tale⠀answer⠀a⠀standing⠀question,⠀reopen⠀a⠀sealed⠀possibility,⠀or⠀surface⠀the⠀cost⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀been⠀carrying.⠀Bring⠀each⠀telling⠀to⠀a⠀close⠀where⠀the⠀listener's⠀next⠀act—staying,⠀interrupting,⠀refusing,⠀promising—has⠀become⠀a⠀live⠀question;⠀that⠀choice⠀may⠀remain⠀open,⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀already⠀be⠀under⠀way⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀breaks.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀last⠀reversal⠀alone;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀accumulated⠀shape⠀of⠀tales⠀that⠀could⠀have⠀ended⠀otherwise,⠀told⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀outcome⠀is⠀narrowing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realism⠀route.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀focal⠀character⠀whose⠀choices⠀are⠀formed⠀by⠀a⠀particular⠀family,⠀workplace,⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀institution,⠀and⠀take⠀the⠀specifics—streets,⠀kinds⠀of⠀work,⠀rental⠀agreements,⠀shifts,⠀inheritances,⠀union⠀positions,⠀school⠀records,⠀the⠀exact⠀obligations⠀people⠀owe⠀one⠀another—from⠀whatever⠀place,⠀language,⠀and⠀institutions⠀the⠀story⠀itself⠀supplies.⠀Social⠀conditions⠀are⠀not⠀backdrop;⠀they⠀create⠀the⠀choices⠀and⠀limits⠀the⠀character⠀will⠀later⠀honor,⠀violate,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀see.\n\nWork⠀each⠀turning⠀point⠀as⠀a⠀legible⠀mechanism.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀acts,⠀make⠀the⠀operative⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀observable⠀first:⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀a⠀parent,⠀a⠀contract,⠀a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀residence⠀permit,⠀a⠀medical⠀appointment,⠀a⠀custody⠀arrangement,⠀stated⠀in⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀two⠀and⠀then⠀tested⠀by⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀Show⠀the⠀reasoning⠀from⠀available⠀options—not⠀always⠀correct,⠀not⠀always⠀honest,⠀but⠀plausible⠀under⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀moment.⠀When⠀a⠀path⠀closes,⠀let⠀it⠀close⠀on⠀the⠀page:⠀a⠀message⠀not⠀sent,⠀a⠀signature⠀not⠀obtained,⠀a⠀lock⠀turned,⠀a⠀form⠀rejected,⠀a⠀witness⠀who⠀chooses⠀silence.\n\nKeep⠀speech⠀and⠀description⠀measured⠀and⠀concrete.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀character's⠀perception⠀and⠀a⠀slightly⠀wider⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀world,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀fate⠀or⠀moral⠀commentary;⠀let⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀interactions⠀build⠀a⠀structure⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀character's⠀virtues—loyalty,⠀diligence,⠀honesty,⠀hope—become⠀entangled⠀with⠀the⠀very⠀conditions⠀that⠀destroy⠀them.⠀Recognition⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀fall:⠀the⠀character⠀grasps⠀the⠀incompatibility⠀of⠀two⠀commitments⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀grasp⠀can⠀still⠀change⠀what⠀happens⠀next,⠀or⠀arrives⠀too⠀late⠀to⠀alter⠀the⠀cost,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀makes⠀clear⠀which⠀of⠀the⠀two⠀it⠀is.\n\nIn⠀the⠀aftermath,⠀do⠀not⠀restore⠀what⠀was⠀lost⠀or⠀recast⠀the⠀disaster⠀as⠀inevitable⠀from⠀the⠀start.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀concrete⠀remains—the⠀unread⠀letter,⠀the⠀emptied⠀apartment,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀still⠀answers⠀the⠀phone,⠀the⠀promise⠀that⠀now⠀means⠀something⠀different—and⠀let⠀the⠀final⠀passages⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀understanding⠀the⠀mechanism⠀of⠀what⠀happened,⠀with⠀that⠀understanding⠀plainly⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀undo⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀on⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀inherited⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life.⠀Make⠀the⠀authority⠀concrete—an⠀old⠀family,⠀a⠀controlling⠀institution,⠀a⠀building⠀with⠀rules⠀of⠀its⠀own,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀passes⠀across⠀generations,⠀a⠀restricted⠀archive,⠀an⠀obligation⠀whose⠀ritual⠀form⠀still⠀carries⠀material⠀consequences—and⠀make⠀the⠀present⠀equally⠀concrete:⠀a⠀job,⠀a⠀lease,⠀a⠀night⠀shift,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀a⠀small⠀apartment,⠀a⠀phone⠀that⠀rings⠀with⠀both⠀love⠀and⠀demand.⠀Let⠀the⠀old⠀order⠀be⠀exactly⠀as⠀supernatural⠀or⠀as⠀mundane⠀as⠀the⠀story's⠀world⠀already⠀permits,⠀and⠀no⠀further.⠀The⠀fall⠀comes⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀tries⠀to⠀honor⠀a⠀private⠀desire⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀commitment⠀without⠀escaping⠀the⠀old⠀structure's⠀reach.\n\nUse⠀a⠀legible⠀mechanism⠀for⠀every⠀collision.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀works⠀the⠀system—a⠀formal⠀request,⠀an⠀inherited⠀right,⠀a⠀claimed⠀exemption—state⠀the⠀relevant⠀rule⠀and⠀the⠀resource⠀in⠀hand,⠀then⠀show⠀why⠀the⠀action⠀fails,⠀half-succeeds,⠀or⠀costs⠀more⠀than⠀expected.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀always⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀reconstruct⠀the⠀sequence:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knew,⠀what⠀was⠀misunderstood,⠀which⠀practical⠀obstacle⠀made⠀the⠀difference.⠀Keep⠀physical⠀clarity⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts:⠀a⠀phone⠀call⠀leads⠀to⠀a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀meeting⠀to⠀a⠀signature,⠀a⠀signature⠀to⠀a⠀lock⠀closing.⠀Move⠀fast⠀when⠀actions⠀follow⠀one⠀another;⠀slow⠀down⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀weighs⠀loyalty⠀against⠀freedom.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀come⠀from⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀and⠀intimate⠀space—a⠀hallway's⠀fluorescent⠀buzz,⠀a⠀barred⠀window,⠀old⠀incense⠀in⠀a⠀modern⠀room,⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀key,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀from⠀the⠀street—used⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀old⠀and⠀new⠀orders⠀press⠀on⠀the⠀same⠀person,⠀never⠀as⠀free⠀decoration.⠀In⠀trusted⠀company⠀a⠀mask⠀can⠀fall:⠀someone⠀admits⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀fear,⠀and⠀that⠀admission⠀should⠀carry⠀weight⠀later⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀softening⠀a⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tragedy⠀a⠀chosen⠀one.⠀Let⠀the⠀fall⠀grow⠀from⠀a⠀decision⠀the⠀character⠀makes⠀with⠀open⠀eyes—for⠀example,⠀protecting⠀one⠀person⠀at⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀another,⠀claiming⠀a⠀legacy⠀known⠀to⠀be⠀poisoned,⠀or⠀refusing⠀an⠀escape⠀that⠀was⠀genuinely⠀available—whichever⠀choice⠀this⠀particular⠀person⠀would⠀actually⠀make.⠀Let⠀recognition,⠀whenever⠀it⠀lands,⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀in⠀the⠀prose.⠀In⠀the⠀aftermath⠀the⠀modern⠀world⠀continues⠀past⠀the⠀disaster—trains⠀run,⠀messages⠀arrive—while⠀the⠀character⠀lives⠀inside⠀the⠀specific⠀absence⠀the⠀choice⠀has⠀created.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀route.⠀Set⠀the⠀narration⠀inside⠀one⠀particular⠀community—its⠀language,⠀town⠀or⠀city,⠀family⠀arrangement,⠀and⠀period⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them—and⠀work⠀through⠀the⠀systems⠀that⠀bind⠀people⠀together:⠀who⠀cooks⠀on⠀which⠀days,⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀house⠀keys,⠀who⠀answers⠀the⠀phone⠀for⠀an⠀older⠀relative,⠀how⠀money⠀moves⠀between⠀siblings,⠀what⠀a⠀wedding⠀gift⠀commits⠀a⠀family⠀to,⠀which⠀school⠀or⠀employer⠀carries⠀a⠀known⠀reputation.⠀These⠀are⠀not⠀decorations;⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀machinery⠀through⠀which⠀love⠀and⠀obligation⠀are⠀enforced.⠀Do⠀not⠀weld⠀on⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀or⠀obligatory⠀code-switching;⠀this⠀household⠀is⠀particular,⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀history.\n\nGive⠀every⠀decision⠀a⠀legible⠀rule⠀and⠀resource.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀weighs⠀a⠀move,⠀show⠀the⠀operative⠀constraint—a⠀promise⠀to⠀an⠀aunt,⠀a⠀loan,⠀a⠀marriage⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀property⠀document,⠀a⠀call⠀expected⠀from⠀a⠀relative⠀abroad—alongside⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀has⠀to⠀answer⠀it⠀with,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀why⠀the⠀choice⠀seems⠀protected,⠀necessary,⠀or⠀forced.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀move⠀itself:⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀signature,⠀a⠀withheld⠀message,⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀lie.⠀Reversals⠀can⠀come⠀fast,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀concrete—the⠀key⠀turns,⠀the⠀bus⠀leaves,⠀the⠀envelope⠀is⠀opened,⠀the⠀upstairs⠀door⠀closes.\n\nCarry⠀private⠀feeling⠀through⠀specific⠀domestic⠀observation⠀rather⠀than⠀abstract⠀emotion:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀steel⠀plate,⠀a⠀name⠀worn⠀nearly⠀off⠀a⠀household⠀document,⠀the⠀exact⠀moment⠀a⠀relative⠀stops⠀speaking,⠀cooking-oil⠀smell⠀in⠀a⠀stairwell⠀while⠀a⠀hard⠀conversation⠀waits.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀values⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀pressure⠀costs.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀on⠀a⠀choice⠀that⠀is⠀both⠀rational⠀and⠀ruinous—honoring⠀an⠀old⠀promise⠀against⠀a⠀present⠀love,⠀shielding⠀a⠀brother⠀from⠀a⠀family⠀debt,⠀refusing⠀a⠀marriage⠀or⠀an⠀emigration⠀that⠀would⠀solve⠀one⠀problem⠀and⠀sever⠀another—and⠀let⠀it⠀grow⠀from⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀everyday⠀decisions⠀with⠀cumulative⠀consequence,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀single⠀melodramatic⠀betrayal.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀come⠀early⠀with⠀no⠀clean⠀path⠀out,⠀or⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀loss.⠀In⠀the⠀aftermath,⠀neither⠀restore⠀the⠀family⠀nor⠀exile⠀the⠀character:⠀let⠀the⠀household⠀continue⠀its⠀ordinary⠀rounds⠀with⠀the⠀absence⠀now⠀fixed,⠀and⠀preserve⠀on⠀the⠀page⠀the⠀exact⠀thing⠀that⠀was⠀lost.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism⠀route.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀character⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀time⠀and⠀place,⠀with⠀the⠀external⠀world⠀recognizable⠀through⠀work,⠀household,⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀school—while⠀the⠀central⠀movement⠀stays⠀inward:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀values,⠀fears,⠀refuses⠀to⠀say,⠀and⠀the⠀repeated⠀reasoning⠀that⠀keeps⠀them⠀inside⠀a⠀decision⠀they⠀cannot⠀fully⠀justify⠀to⠀anyone⠀else.\n\nHandle⠀the⠀practical⠀world⠀with⠀legible⠀cause⠀and⠀effect.⠀When⠀a⠀key⠀event⠀occurs—a⠀phone⠀call,⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀contract,⠀a⠀diagnosis,⠀a⠀missed⠀train,⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀a⠀job⠀or⠀a⠀parent—state⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀that⠀bears⠀on⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀explain⠀the⠀choice⠀to⠀themselves⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀terms:⠀this⠀is⠀my⠀duty,⠀that⠀person⠀depends⠀on⠀me,⠀I⠀owe⠀this,⠀acting⠀now⠀costs⠀me⠀the⠀other⠀thing.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀action.⠀Move⠀quickly⠀through⠀exchanges⠀and⠀consequences,⠀but⠀stay⠀physically⠀concrete⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀where⠀people⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀in⠀the⠀room.\n\nMake⠀private⠀response⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀causal⠀sequence⠀rather⠀than⠀decoration.⠀The⠀character⠀hesitates,⠀re-checks,⠀avoids⠀a⠀question,⠀looks⠀at⠀the⠀object⠀that⠀carries⠀a⠀memory;⠀understanding⠀shifts,⠀sometimes⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀fact.⠀Recognition⠀is⠀the⠀center⠀of⠀this⠀tragedy—the⠀moment⠀the⠀character⠀sees⠀the⠀incompatibility⠀between⠀two⠀commitments⠀or⠀the⠀true⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀choice.⠀It⠀can⠀come⠀early⠀and⠀deepen,⠀or⠀arrive⠀late⠀and⠀change⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means;⠀either⠀way,⠀make⠀it⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀announced.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language⠀plain⠀and⠀precise,⠀with⠀no⠀ornament⠀that⠀hides⠀the⠀event.⠀Use⠀seasonal⠀or⠀sensory⠀detail⠀sparingly,⠀and⠀only⠀where⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀attention:⠀a⠀train⠀announcement,⠀a⠀cold⠀window,⠀rain⠀on⠀a⠀bicycle⠀seat,⠀a⠀letter⠀left⠀unopened⠀on⠀a⠀table⠀should⠀locate⠀the⠀person⠀and⠀carry⠀weight⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀moment⠀into⠀a⠀symbol.⠀Resist⠀a⠀large⠀redemptive⠀gesture⠀at⠀the⠀end;⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀return⠀to⠀ordinary⠀tasks⠀now⠀changed.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀not⠀that⠀they⠀were⠀weak—it⠀is⠀that⠀they⠀understood⠀enough⠀to⠀have⠀made⠀another⠀choice,⠀and⠀still⠀made⠀the⠀one⠀that⠀destroyed⠀what⠀mattered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀and⠀testimony⠀route:⠀a⠀composed⠀account⠀by⠀a⠀participant⠀who⠀can⠀report⠀their⠀own⠀actions⠀and⠀observations,⠀in⠀whatever⠀person⠀and⠀ownership⠀the⠀story's⠀narration⠀uses.⠀The⠀speaker⠀knows⠀the⠀neighborhood,⠀the⠀workplace,⠀the⠀family,⠀the⠀political⠀and⠀economic⠀pressures,⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀history⠀that⠀shaped⠀the⠀present.⠀Open⠀on⠀an⠀event⠀or⠀decision⠀that⠀already⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀community,⠀so⠀the⠀shared⠀conditions⠀are⠀felt⠀from⠀the⠀first⠀paragraph.\n\nGive⠀every⠀important⠀turn⠀a⠀legible⠀mechanism.⠀The⠀narrator⠀is⠀not⠀carried⠀by⠀fate;⠀they⠀act⠀on⠀rules⠀and⠀resources—who⠀controls⠀the⠀papers,⠀which⠀route⠀is⠀affordable⠀or⠀safe,⠀what⠀the⠀landlord⠀will⠀accept,⠀what⠀the⠀union⠀or⠀the⠀party⠀expects,⠀what⠀a⠀relative⠀has⠀promised,⠀what⠀the⠀police⠀will⠀and⠀will⠀not⠀do.⠀State⠀the⠀constraint⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀specific⠀action—a⠀signature,⠀a⠀bus⠀ride,⠀a⠀phone⠀call,⠀a⠀meeting⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀happen—so⠀the⠀sequence⠀stays⠀physically⠀clear⠀even⠀as⠀events⠀accelerate.⠀When⠀a⠀choice⠀closes⠀a⠀path,⠀let⠀both⠀narrator⠀and⠀reader⠀watch⠀it⠀close.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀community's⠀specific⠀language,⠀place,⠀and⠀history.⠀Local⠀belief⠀or⠀custom⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀as⠀social⠀texture,⠀but⠀nothing⠀supernatural⠀enters⠀unless⠀the⠀story's⠀world⠀already⠀contains⠀it.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀arises⠀from⠀real⠀conditions—a⠀debt,⠀a⠀strike,⠀a⠀land⠀dispute,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀leave,⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀a⠀neighbor—and⠀the⠀central⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀intelligent,⠀loyal,⠀and⠀clear-eyed⠀and⠀still⠀choose⠀wrongly⠀because⠀every⠀available⠀choice⠀is⠀costly.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀speaker's⠀later⠀knowledge⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀sudden⠀revelation⠀forced⠀into⠀the⠀action:⠀\"At⠀the⠀time⠀I⠀believed...\"⠀and⠀\"We⠀understood⠀only⠀later⠀that...\"⠀are⠀the⠀natural⠀registers⠀of⠀this⠀voice,⠀and⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀break⠀the⠀participant⠀stance.⠀Make⠀the⠀fall⠀irreversible—a⠀home,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀a⠀position,⠀a⠀child's⠀trust,⠀something⠀no⠀final⠀gesture⠀can⠀repair.⠀In⠀the⠀aftermath,⠀do⠀not⠀shrink⠀the⠀ending⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀grief:⠀the⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀shared⠀place,⠀carries⠀the⠀changed⠀role,⠀and⠀names⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀did⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀remained.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀already⠀contains⠀a⠀practical⠀commitment—a⠀promise,⠀a⠀job,⠀a⠀warning,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀request⠀the⠀main⠀character⠀accepts⠀because⠀the⠀alternatives⠀look⠀worse—and⠀stage⠀the⠀immediate⠀space⠀concretely:⠀where⠀people⠀are⠀standing,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀see,⠀what⠀is⠀within⠀reach.⠀Use⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀to⠀mark⠀changes⠀in⠀action,⠀speaker,⠀or⠀focus,⠀and⠀keep⠀spatial⠀movement⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀a⠀name,⠀rule,⠀or⠀mechanic⠀is⠀unfamiliar,⠀introduce⠀it⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀a⠀brief⠀explanation⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀it⠀matters,⠀then⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀tested.\n\nDrive⠀the⠀fall⠀with⠀legible⠀cause⠀and⠀effect.⠀At⠀each⠀choice,⠀show⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀behind⠀it—\"the⠀deadline⠀was⠀noon,\"⠀\"he⠀had⠀one⠀key,\"⠀\"the⠀contract⠀barred⠀her⠀from⠀leaving⠀without⠀notice\"—then⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀consequence.⠀Rapid⠀shifts⠀are⠀welcome,⠀but⠀every⠀reversal⠀must⠀be⠀physically⠀intelligible:⠀the⠀door⠀slams,⠀the⠀message⠀sends,⠀the⠀bus⠀pulls⠀away.⠀Never⠀let⠀speed⠀erase⠀the⠀mechanism.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tragedy⠀personal⠀and⠀cumulative.⠀Ordinary⠀goals—help⠀a⠀friend,⠀protect⠀someone,⠀get⠀through⠀the⠀day,⠀keep⠀a⠀promise—are⠀enough;⠀each⠀decision⠀narrows⠀the⠀options⠀that⠀remain.⠀Let⠀the⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀surface⠀early⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀collision⠀coming⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀cannot.⠀Make⠀recognition⠀a⠀visible⠀event—a⠀sentence⠀spoken,⠀a⠀look,⠀a⠀document,⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀reorders⠀everything—worn⠀on⠀the⠀character's⠀face⠀and⠀body;⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀without⠀undoing⠀it.\n\nGive⠀reaction⠀beats⠀to⠀their⠀owners.⠀A⠀serious⠀moment⠀can⠀stay⠀serious;⠀a⠀frightened⠀character⠀can⠀stammer,⠀freeze,⠀or⠀ask⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀twice;⠀no⠀exchange⠀needs⠀a⠀joke,⠀and⠀no⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Fast⠀pacing⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀skirting⠀grief.⠀Let⠀the⠀story⠀continue⠀briefly⠀past⠀the⠀loss⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀ordinary⠀scene—a⠀room⠀now⠀empty,⠀a⠀phone⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀ring,⠀a⠀task⠀finished⠀mechanically—so⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀is⠀felt,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀last-minute⠀escape⠀or⠀twist⠀to⠀soften⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀emotional⠀movement⠀of⠀lyric⠀prose⠀carry⠀the⠀causal⠀mechanics⠀that⠀Kamachi's⠀profile⠀makes⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀rule,⠀resource,⠀or⠀physical⠀sequence⠀matters,⠀explain⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀comparison⠀or⠀a⠀recurring⠀image⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀the⠀mechanism⠀into⠀ornamental⠀description;⠀the⠀image⠀should⠀clarify⠀a⠀consequence⠀or⠀reveal⠀a⠀personal⠀stake.⠀Plain⠀declarative⠀sentences⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀rhythm⠀to⠀state⠀the⠀rule,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀will⠀later⠀turn⠀against⠀the⠀protagonist.\n\nBuild⠀a⠀tragic⠀fall⠀from⠀a⠀character's⠀relation⠀to⠀a⠀system⠀they⠀can⠀understand⠀but⠀not⠀escape.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternatives⠀clearly,⠀let⠀loyalty,⠀pride,⠀or⠀love⠀reason⠀the⠀character⠀past⠀each⠀one,⠀and⠀preserve⠀their⠀intelligence:⠀the⠀mistake⠀is⠀not⠀ignorance⠀but⠀the⠀emotional⠀priority⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀destructive⠀choice⠀feel⠀inevitable.⠀When⠀recognition⠀comes,⠀make⠀it⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀familiar⠀image⠀or⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀applies—the⠀same⠀equipment,⠀count,⠀or⠀permission⠀now⠀means⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀real.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figuration⠀sourceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀memories⠀rather⠀than⠀imposing⠀a⠀uniform⠀solemn⠀tone.\n\nMaintain⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀as⠀shifts⠀in⠀emotional⠀attention⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀physical⠀action.⠀A⠀reversal⠀can⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀moves⠀from⠀technical⠀observation⠀to⠀feeling,⠀but⠀the⠀physical⠀causality⠀must⠀stay⠀continuous;⠀if⠀the⠀chain⠀breaks⠀for⠀the⠀sake⠀of⠀rhythm,⠀rewrite⠀the⠀transition⠀in⠀plainer⠀terms.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀recognition,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀reversal⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀fall.⠀The⠀loss⠀that⠀comes⠀should⠀matter⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀both⠀see⠀how⠀it⠀was⠀made,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀demands⠀one⠀final⠀metaphor.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀reflective⠀attention⠀work⠀upon⠀the⠀specific⠀rules⠀and⠀practical⠀problems⠀that⠀Kamachi's⠀profile⠀supplies.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀is⠀recalled,⠀explain⠀enough⠀of⠀its⠀operation⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀tragic⠀consequence⠀intelligible,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight:⠀who⠀set⠀the⠀condition,⠀what⠀could⠀have⠀been⠀repeated,⠀or⠀why⠀no⠀repetition⠀was⠀possible.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀recoverable⠀even⠀when⠀memory⠀circles⠀back,⠀because⠀the⠀loss⠀must⠀be⠀seen⠀to⠀follow⠀from⠀a⠀legible⠀event.\n\nUse⠀recognition⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀temporal⠀perspective⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀sudden⠀emotional⠀flood.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀have⠀understood⠀the⠀rule⠀even⠀then⠀and⠀still⠀chose⠀as⠀they⠀did;⠀what⠀changes⠀is⠀knowing⠀which⠀small⠀decision⠀became⠀irreversible.⠀Let⠀alternatives⠀appear⠀through⠀concrete⠀recollections—the⠀unspent⠀resource,⠀the⠀warning⠀given⠀once,⠀the⠀habit⠀that⠀could⠀have⠀been⠀different—not⠀through⠀abstract⠀lament.⠀Allow⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀to⠀remain⠀real⠀in⠀memory,⠀so⠀the⠀current⠀loss⠀does⠀not⠀rewrite⠀the⠀good⠀as⠀always⠀already⠀ruined.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence.⠀Rapid⠀shifts⠀can⠀occur⠀between⠀present⠀action⠀and⠀a⠀past⠀moment⠀that⠀explains⠀the⠀speaker's⠀feeling,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀causal⠀link⠀explicit:⠀the⠀remembered⠀mechanism⠀should⠀illuminate⠀why⠀the⠀present⠀is⠀unchanged⠀or⠀finally⠀changed.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀single⠀attentive⠀recollection,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀quiet⠀sentence.⠀Loss⠀may⠀be⠀long⠀understood⠀or⠀newly⠀arriving,⠀but⠀the⠀tragedy⠀should⠀make⠀its⠀mechanism⠀clear.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀framed,⠀reflective⠀oral⠀mode⠀as⠀your⠀definite⠀route⠀from⠀the⠀regional⠀selection.⠀The⠀account⠀is⠀told⠀by⠀a⠀narrator⠀whose⠀memory⠀owns⠀the⠀event⠀and⠀whose⠀listener⠀can⠀ask⠀the⠀practical⠀questions⠀Kamachi's⠀profile⠀demands:⠀how⠀the⠀rule⠀worked,⠀what⠀resource⠀ran⠀out,⠀why⠀the⠀sequence⠀could⠀not⠀be⠀reversed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀told.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀explains⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀let⠀it⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀listener's⠀need⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀an⠀authorial⠀aside,⠀and⠀ensure⠀the⠀explanation⠀remains⠀brief⠀enough⠀not⠀to⠀become⠀a⠀lecture.\n\nShape⠀the⠀tragic⠀fall⠀as⠀a⠀retrospectively⠀understood⠀sequence.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀outcome⠀and⠀yet⠀withhold⠀some⠀temporal⠀clarity⠀until⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀seen⠀the⠀alternatives:⠀the⠀exact⠀point⠀where⠀love⠀or⠀duty⠀chose⠀the⠀shorter⠀term,⠀or⠀the⠀unspent⠀resource⠀that⠀would⠀not⠀have⠀been⠀enough⠀anyway.⠀Recognition⠀becomes⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀listener⠀both⠀see⠀the⠀rule's⠀true⠀consequence.⠀After⠀that⠀recognition,⠀the⠀telling⠀can⠀continue⠀into⠀small⠀aftermath⠀details—who⠀kept⠀the⠀object,⠀who⠀repeated⠀the⠀phrase—rather⠀than⠀closing⠀with⠀an⠀abstract⠀maxim.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀regional⠀particularities⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀actual⠀setting,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀'Middle⠀Eastern'⠀atmosphere.⠀No⠀mysticism,⠀honor⠀code,⠀or⠀antiquity⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀framed⠀telling⠀may⠀interrupt⠀itself⠀with⠀present-day⠀remarks⠀or⠀questions,⠀but⠀these⠀interruptions⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀physical⠀causality⠀of⠀the⠀story.⠀Do⠀not⠀pile⠀nested⠀tales⠀inside⠀one⠀reply.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀the⠀telling,⠀leaving⠀the⠀listener's⠀next⠀question⠀implied⠀but⠀not⠀answered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀only⠀the⠀details⠀that⠀must⠀do⠀double⠀work.⠀Every⠀image,⠀object,⠀or⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀should⠀simultaneously⠀advance⠀the⠀mechanical⠀situation⠀and⠀reveal⠀the⠀emotional⠀stakes.⠀When⠀Kamachi's⠀profile⠀calls⠀for⠀a⠀rule⠀to⠀be⠀understood,⠀state⠀it⠀in⠀one⠀exact⠀direct⠀clause;⠀if⠀it⠀cannot⠀be⠀stated⠀briefly,⠀break⠀its⠀operation⠀across⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀simple⠀clauses⠀rather⠀than⠀narrating⠀all⠀possibilities.⠀Let⠀the⠀character's⠀misunderstanding⠀appear⠀in⠀action,⠀as⠀a⠀miscalculated⠀number,⠀a⠀skipped⠀check,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀chosen⠀too⠀late.\n\nUse⠀the⠀character's⠀limited⠀inward⠀attention⠀as⠀the⠀window⠀for⠀tragedy.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀often⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀dwell⠀on:⠀a⠀warning⠀repeated⠀once,⠀a⠀better⠀plan⠀visible⠀to⠀the⠀reader,⠀a⠀habit⠀that⠀would⠀have⠀saved⠀them.⠀Give⠀enough⠀inference⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀alternative⠀real,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀why⠀they⠀missed⠀it.⠀The⠀loss⠀lands⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀concrete⠀detail⠀returns⠀changed—the⠀key⠀left⠀once,⠀now⠀the⠀locked⠀door;⠀the⠀battery⠀set⠀aside,⠀now⠀the⠀dark⠀room.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀continuous⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀by⠀making⠀each⠀new⠀sentence⠀the⠀direct⠀result⠀of⠀the⠀last.⠀Shortness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota.⠀A⠀single⠀longer⠀sentence⠀is⠀allowed⠀when⠀it⠀carries⠀irreplaceable⠀causal⠀information;⠀do⠀not⠀pad⠀with⠀fragments⠀that⠀only⠀signal⠀style.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀immediately⠀after⠀a⠀reversal.⠀Recognition⠀in⠀minimalist⠀tragedy⠀is⠀often⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀act—a⠀hand⠀stopping,⠀a⠀repeated⠀word—that⠀shows⠀the⠀failure⠀is⠀irrevocable⠀without⠀a⠀declarative⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀steady⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Let⠀the⠀interaction⠀of⠀rules⠀and⠀resources⠀emerge⠀through⠀what⠀characters⠀do,⠀say,⠀or⠀remember⠀during⠀a⠀practical⠀situation.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀weave⠀the⠀explanation⠀into⠀the⠀character's⠀perception:⠀a⠀count⠀they⠀check,⠀a⠀condition⠀someone⠀restates,⠀a⠀resource⠀they⠀can⠀see⠀decreasing.⠀Explanation⠀should⠀not⠀halt⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀technical⠀aside,⠀but⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀explicit⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀later⠀reconstruct⠀why⠀an⠀action⠀failed⠀or⠀succeeded.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀within⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀move⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀inner⠀experience,⠀but⠀knowledge⠀stays⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀consciousness.⠀Show⠀alternatives⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀warnings⠀but⠀as⠀moments⠀of⠀hesitation,⠀another⠀person's⠀advice,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀set⠀aside.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀choose⠀according⠀to⠀love,⠀duty,⠀pride,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀need⠀without⠀losing⠀intelligence.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀change⠀how⠀they⠀see⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene;⠀it⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀small⠀sensory⠀detail⠀that⠀now⠀proves⠀the⠀loss.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀catastrophic⠀turn⠀in⠀every⠀reply.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀an⠀action,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀memory,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task.⠀Rapid⠀shifts⠀remain⠀possible⠀through⠀changes⠀of⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀genre⠀machinery;⠀if⠀a⠀dramatic⠀reversal⠀occurs,⠀keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀understandable.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀trust⠀ordinary⠀details⠀to⠀bear⠀tragic⠀weight⠀when⠀recognition⠀arrives.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀authoring⠀contract's⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀and⠀continue⠀the⠀scene⠀from⠀there.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nTreat⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀as⠀a⠀rule⠀system.⠀The⠀habits,⠀private⠀phrases,⠀known⠀resentments,⠀and⠀repeated⠀comforts⠀between⠀the⠀characters⠀function⠀like⠀resources⠀and⠀constraints:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀them,⠀misread⠀them,⠀or⠀run⠀them⠀out.⠀When⠀a⠀relationship⠀rule⠀matters,⠀make⠀it⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀scene—a⠀phrase⠀that⠀one⠀person⠀always⠀says⠀before⠀hiding⠀bad⠀news,⠀a⠀gesture⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀mean⠀forgiveness⠀but⠀now⠀only⠀marks⠀distance.⠀Explain⠀the⠀rule⠀through⠀its⠀effect⠀on⠀the⠀pair's⠀current⠀moment,⠀not⠀through⠀narrative⠀meta-commentary.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragic⠀fall⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀relationship⠀promise,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀betrayal.⠀Give⠀the⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀rivalry⠀enough⠀space⠀to⠀exist⠀as⠀real⠀warmth⠀before⠀it⠀becomes⠀costly.⠀Warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀should⠀be⠀emotionally⠀intelligible:⠀another⠀character⠀names⠀the⠀risk,⠀a⠀repeated⠀moment⠀could⠀have⠀been⠀repaired,⠀a⠀known⠀boundary⠀is⠀crossed⠀because⠀a⠀competing⠀loyalty⠀demands⠀it.⠀The⠀characters⠀remain⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention;⠀their⠀intelligence⠀does⠀not⠀prevent⠀their⠀choices⠀from⠀destroying⠀what⠀they⠀most⠀relied⠀on.\n\nUse⠀callbacks⠀as⠀Kamachi-style⠀reversals.⠀When⠀a⠀short⠀phrase⠀or⠀detail⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀intimate⠀moment⠀returns,⠀its⠀operational⠀meaning⠀should⠀have⠀changed:⠀the⠀same⠀promise⠀now⠀constitutes⠀a⠀refusal,⠀the⠀same⠀comfort⠀now⠀withdraws⠀support.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀and⠀conversational⠀sequence⠀continuous;⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀of⠀feeling⠀can⠀be⠀caused⠀by⠀a⠀recognized⠀rule⠀suddenly⠀applying⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀way.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀within⠀an⠀unresolved⠀emotional⠀beat,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀relationship⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀events⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀of⠀deeds⠀whose⠀consequences⠀are⠀already⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀teller.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀states⠀the⠀crucial⠀practical⠀rule⠀or⠀resource:⠀an⠀oath⠀that⠀bound⠀a⠀choice,⠀a⠀condition⠀that⠀could⠀not⠀be⠀repeated,⠀a⠀count⠀that⠀had⠀to⠀hold.⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀actions⠀that⠀show⠀the⠀rule⠀in⠀operation.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀misunderstands⠀or⠀exploits⠀the⠀mechanism,⠀make⠀that⠀episode⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀record,⠀using⠀direct⠀clauses⠀that⠀preserve⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀recognition.⠀The⠀same⠀phrase,⠀name,⠀or⠀gesture⠀returns⠀after⠀the⠀decisive⠀act⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning;⠀the⠀teller⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀difference⠀explicit⠀through⠀a⠀short⠀clause⠀rather⠀than⠀relying⠀on⠀mere⠀repetition.⠀Alternatives⠀appear⠀as⠀other⠀oaths⠀offered,⠀other⠀ways⠀the⠀resource⠀could⠀have⠀been⠀spent,⠀or⠀a⠀warning⠀spoken⠀once.⠀The⠀characters⠀remain⠀distinguishable⠀and⠀intelligent;⠀the⠀saga's⠀elevated⠀register⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀them⠀to⠀be⠀foolish⠀or⠀to⠀speak⠀in⠀ceremonial⠀formulas⠀without⠀practical⠀content.\n\nThe⠀account⠀may⠀include⠀dialogue⠀that⠀interrupts⠀or⠀contests⠀the⠀chronicle,⠀but⠀the⠀interruption⠀should⠀still⠀clarify⠀mechanism⠀or⠀motive.⠀Let⠀humor⠀be⠀possible⠀without⠀converting⠀grief⠀into⠀parody.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀the⠀final⠀aftermath,⠀with⠀a⠀deed⠀remembered⠀but⠀its⠀full⠀cost⠀still⠀unfolding.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀gods⠀or⠀heroic⠀doom⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀contains⠀them.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀narrative⠀access⠀and⠀personality⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀selected⠀saga⠀tradition.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nOpen⠀the⠀tragedy⠀inside⠀a⠀contemporary⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀social⠀setting⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀first⠀scene⠀state⠀the⠀governing⠀mechanism⠀through⠀use⠀rather⠀than⠀exposition.⠀A⠀character⠀files⠀a⠀housing⠀application,⠀clocks⠀a⠀care⠀shift,⠀signs⠀a⠀loan⠀document,⠀or⠀submits⠀a⠀workplace⠀form.⠀The⠀narration⠀explains⠀the⠀rule⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀acts⠀on⠀it:⠀what⠀the⠀form⠀requires,⠀what⠀the⠀deadline⠀assumes,⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀will⠀verify.⠀Keep⠀the⠀explanation⠀concrete⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀physical⠀task—the⠀paper⠀in⠀hand,⠀the⠀portal⠀on⠀screen,⠀the⠀phone⠀call⠀in⠀progress—so⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀the⠀rule⠀as⠀a⠀working⠀condition,⠀not⠀a⠀symbol.\n\nLet⠀the⠀character⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀calculation⠀about⠀that⠀mechanism⠀that⠀a⠀capable⠀person⠀could⠀make⠀under⠀real⠀constraints.⠀Show⠀the⠀available⠀correct⠀interpretation⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀another⠀character⠀states⠀the⠀safer⠀reading,⠀a⠀posted⠀notice⠀contradicts⠀the⠀assumption,⠀or⠀the⠀form's⠀own⠀wording⠀warns⠀against⠀the⠀shortcut.⠀Then⠀show⠀why⠀this⠀person⠀misses⠀or⠀discounts⠀it—pressure⠀from⠀a⠀second⠀obligation,⠀trust⠀in⠀a⠀colleague,⠀fatigue,⠀a⠀prior⠀success⠀with⠀a⠀similar⠀rule—without⠀making⠀them⠀foolish.⠀The⠀resulting⠀action⠀must⠀follow⠀in⠀a⠀legible⠀physical⠀and⠀social⠀sequence:⠀the⠀form⠀is⠀submitted,⠀the⠀shift⠀is⠀swapped,⠀the⠀payment⠀is⠀deferred,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀consequence⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀mundane⠀surroundings.\n\nDrive⠀the⠀fall⠀through⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀that⠀share⠀one⠀practical⠀resource.⠀A⠀duty⠀to⠀family⠀collides⠀with⠀a⠀duty⠀to⠀work;⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀a⠀colleague⠀collides⠀with⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀a⠀spouse;⠀the⠀need⠀for⠀housing⠀collides⠀with⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀tell⠀the⠀truth.⠀Render⠀each⠀collision⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀problem⠀the⠀character⠀tries⠀to⠀solve⠀with⠀the⠀rules⠀they⠀believe⠀govern⠀the⠀situation.⠀Their⠀attempts⠀can⠀be⠀resourceful⠀and⠀even⠀temporarily⠀successful—a⠀swapped⠀shift⠀covers⠀the⠀care⠀visit,⠀a⠀deferred⠀payment⠀quiets⠀the⠀landlord—but⠀each⠀partial⠀solution⠀narrows⠀the⠀later⠀options.⠀When⠀a⠀moral⠀instinct⠀constrains⠀a⠀choice,⠀state⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀felt⠀limit:⠀what⠀exactly⠀the⠀character⠀refuses⠀to⠀lose,⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀refusal⠀makes⠀impossible⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀step.\n\nLet⠀the⠀domestic⠀surface⠀carry⠀the⠀story.⠀Concrete⠀rooms,⠀meals,⠀commutes,⠀forms,⠀phone⠀calls,⠀and⠀institutional⠀waiting⠀areas⠀do⠀the⠀narrative⠀work.⠀Weather,⠀season,⠀and⠀landscape⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀practical⠀environment—ice⠀on⠀the⠀platform,⠀a⠀dark⠀afternoon⠀commute,⠀a⠀snow-cleared⠀entrance—not⠀to⠀symbolic⠀commentary.⠀Ordinary⠀warmth⠀may⠀appear:⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀help,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀humor⠀at⠀the⠀kitchen⠀table.⠀Keep⠀that⠀warmth⠀inside⠀a⠀world⠀where⠀the⠀governing⠀rules⠀still⠀bind,⠀so⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀soften⠀the⠀mechanism⠀or⠀promise⠀rescue.\n\nWhen⠀recognition⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀rather⠀than⠀undo⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀sees⠀the⠀correct⠀interpretation⠀of⠀the⠀mechanism⠀they⠀misunderstood,⠀or⠀understands⠀who⠀else⠀was⠀harmed,⠀and⠀that⠀knowledge⠀revalues⠀an⠀earlier⠀choice⠀without⠀enabling⠀repair.⠀Render⠀the⠀recognition⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀mundane⠀surroundings⠀where⠀the⠀mistake⠀occurred—the⠀kitchen,⠀the⠀office,⠀the⠀station⠀platform—and⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀sit⠀with⠀the⠀revised⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀become⠀suddenly⠀eloquent⠀about⠀the⠀error.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀a⠀household⠀continues⠀without⠀the⠀chair⠀at⠀the⠀table,⠀an⠀institution⠀keeps⠀operating,⠀a⠀relationship⠀remains⠀altered.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀recognition⠀has⠀landed⠀and⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀unchanged⠀practical⠀condition⠀remains⠀in⠀view.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀governing⠀mechanism⠀into⠀the⠀character's⠀handling⠀of⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀space.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀interacts⠀with⠀a⠀rule—a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀sign-in⠀sheet,⠀a⠀payment⠀schedule,⠀a⠀safety⠀protocol—the⠀action⠀line⠀shows⠀the⠀rule⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀interpretation⠀of⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀visible⠀moment.⠀The⠀character⠀turns⠀the⠀handle⠀without⠀checking⠀the⠀posted⠀hours,⠀slides⠀the⠀form⠀into⠀the⠀wrong⠀tray⠀while⠀watching⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀signs⠀the⠀line⠀without⠀reading⠀the⠀condition⠀above⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀have⠀them⠀announce⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀visible⠀result⠀supply⠀the⠀correction:⠀the⠀door⠀holds,⠀the⠀tray⠀is⠀retrieved,⠀the⠀supervisor⠀points⠀to⠀the⠀unsigned⠀clause.\n\nKeep⠀action⠀blocks⠀concise⠀and⠀causally⠀sequential.⠀Each⠀block⠀advances⠀the⠀mechanism:⠀a⠀phone⠀is⠀checked,⠀a⠀tray⠀is⠀moved,⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀found⠀or⠀not⠀found.⠀Scene⠀headings⠀mark⠀location⠀and⠀time⠀changes;⠀use⠀cuts⠀to⠀move⠀from⠀an⠀action⠀to⠀its⠀consequence.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀rule⠀operating⠀in⠀another⠀room—the⠀same⠀form⠀on⠀a⠀different⠀desk,⠀the⠀same⠀deadline⠀on⠀a⠀different⠀screen—but⠀each⠀location⠀adds⠀a⠀concrete⠀fact,⠀not⠀a⠀repeated⠀sentiment.⠀Write⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀seen⠀and⠀heard;⠀do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nStage⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀as⠀simultaneous⠀physical⠀business.⠀Two⠀characters⠀try⠀to⠀speak⠀past⠀each⠀other⠀while⠀each⠀continues⠀a⠀practical⠀task:⠀one⠀is⠀counting⠀stock,⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀signing⠀a⠀form;⠀one⠀is⠀packing⠀a⠀bag,⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀holding⠀out⠀a⠀phone.⠀Let⠀their⠀speeches⠀be⠀partial,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀addressed⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀to⠀each⠀other.⠀The⠀conflict⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀physically⠀trying⠀to⠀accomplish,⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀say.⠀Use⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀selectively:⠀a⠀knock,⠀a⠀drawer⠀closing⠀in⠀another⠀room,⠀a⠀phone⠀buzzing⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀scene⠀just⠀as⠀the⠀dialogue⠀reaches⠀a⠀decision.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀irreversible⠀turn⠀occurs,⠀show⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀before⠀the⠀recognition.⠀The⠀character⠀completes⠀the⠀wrong⠀step—the⠀form⠀goes⠀into⠀the⠀wrong⠀tray,⠀the⠀door⠀closes⠀behind⠀them,⠀the⠀call⠀ends—and⠀the⠀scene⠀holds⠀on⠀the⠀visible⠀result⠀long⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀audience⠀to⠀understand,⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀spoken⠀or⠀reacted.⠀Then⠀cut⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀scene,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀recognition⠀come⠀later⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀beat.⠀The⠀final⠀screen⠀moment⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀moving⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task,⠀now⠀carrying⠀the⠀changed⠀situation,⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀monologue.⠀The⠀loss⠀remains⠀visible⠀in⠀a⠀prop,⠀a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀appear.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragic⠀mechanism⠀as⠀a⠀prop⠀or⠀blocking⠀choice⠀an⠀actor⠀can⠀perform.⠀The⠀rule,⠀resource,⠀or⠀institutional⠀fact⠀lives⠀in⠀a⠀lock,⠀a⠀ledger,⠀a⠀phone⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀ajar,⠀a⠀chair⠀that⠀must⠀remain⠀empty.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀make⠀clear⠀who⠀can⠀see,⠀reach,⠀hear,⠀or⠀move⠀between⠀two⠀places.⠀A⠀character's⠀miscalculation⠀appears⠀in⠀their⠀handling⠀of⠀the⠀prop⠀or⠀their⠀movement⠀across⠀the⠀stage⠀before⠀their⠀speech⠀reveals⠀it:⠀they⠀set⠀the⠀ledger⠀on⠀the⠀wrong⠀desk,⠀they⠀leave⠀the⠀door⠀ajar⠀while⠀turning⠀away,⠀they⠀pocket⠀the⠀key⠀instead⠀of⠀returning⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀hook.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀everyday⠀practical⠀stakes,⠀not⠀the⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀mechanism.⠀Speakers⠀refer⠀to⠀the⠀object⠀they⠀are⠀using,⠀the⠀time⠀they⠀have,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀they⠀are⠀waiting⠀for.⠀When⠀one⠀character⠀tries⠀to⠀explain⠀a⠀rule⠀to⠀another,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀kind⠀of⠀terse⠀instruction⠀or⠀complaint⠀that⠀would⠀occur⠀in⠀the⠀moment:⠀\"The⠀form⠀goes⠀in⠀the⠀blue⠀tray,\"⠀\"They⠀lock⠀this⠀door⠀at⠀five,\"⠀\"I⠀put⠀the⠀key⠀under⠀the⠀mat.\"⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀not⠀follow⠀the⠀instruction,⠀and⠀the⠀staged⠀consequence⠀shows⠀why⠀that⠀matters.\n\nStage⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀as⠀competing⠀physical⠀actions⠀rather⠀than⠀debate.⠀One⠀character⠀is⠀repeatedly⠀summoned⠀toward⠀an⠀exit⠀while⠀another⠀asks⠀them⠀to⠀hold⠀a⠀prop.⠀A⠀pause⠀indicates⠀a⠀decision⠀without⠀needing⠀a⠀monologue.⠀When⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀is⠀used,⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose:⠀the⠀character⠀addresses⠀the⠀audience⠀to⠀articulate⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀a⠀consequence,⠀not⠀merely⠀to⠀fill⠀in⠀hidden⠀backstory.⠀Otherwise⠀keep⠀private⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀provided⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀wrapper;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀something⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.\n\nStage⠀the⠀irreversible⠀turn⠀as⠀a⠀completed⠀action⠀whose⠀consequence⠀becomes⠀visible⠀before⠀the⠀character's⠀recognition.⠀The⠀wrong⠀object⠀is⠀carried⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀person;⠀the⠀door⠀is⠀locked⠀before⠀they⠀return;⠀the⠀call⠀ends⠀and⠀the⠀phone⠀is⠀set⠀face⠀down.⠀Let⠀the⠀stage⠀hold⠀for⠀a⠀beat⠀on⠀the⠀physical⠀fact.⠀Then⠀allow⠀the⠀recognition⠀to⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene,⠀possibly⠀with⠀a⠀simple⠀line⠀that⠀revalues⠀the⠀earlier⠀action.⠀The⠀final⠀image⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀occupying⠀the⠀same⠀space,⠀now⠀surrounded⠀by⠀the⠀arrangements⠀their⠀earlier⠀choices⠀have⠀made⠀permanent.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀mechanism⠀as⠀a⠀recurring⠀private⠀phrase⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀mind.⠀The⠀rule—a⠀hospital⠀visiting⠀policy,⠀a⠀loan⠀repayment⠀schedule,⠀a⠀caretaker⠀rota,⠀a⠀work⠀deadline—returns⠀as⠀a⠀formulation⠀the⠀narrator⠀repeats⠀with⠀variations:⠀\"the⠀form⠀must⠀be⠀in⠀by⠀Friday,\"⠀\"the⠀door⠀is⠀always⠀locked⠀from⠀the⠀inside,\"⠀\"they⠀only⠀call⠀once.\"⠀Each⠀recall⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀narrator⠀reasoning⠀abstractly⠀but⠀being⠀visited⠀by⠀the⠀phrase⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀else.⠀The⠀variations⠀reveal⠀both⠀precision⠀and⠀a⠀growing⠀self-interest:⠀the⠀phrase⠀acquires⠀an⠀exception,⠀a⠀justification,⠀a⠀softened⠀verb.\n\nBraid⠀each⠀recall⠀with⠀sensory⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀and⠀bodily⠀awareness.⠀A⠀sentence⠀moves⠀from⠀the⠀exact⠀mechanism⠀to⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀pen,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀corridor,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat,⠀then⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀first⠀explained⠀the⠀rule.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀distinguish⠀event⠀from⠀recollection:⠀use⠀tense⠀shifts⠀or⠀concrete⠀markers⠀to⠀signal⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀remembering⠀an⠀actual⠀past⠀event⠀rather⠀than⠀imagining⠀a⠀future⠀one.⠀Interruption⠀comes⠀from⠀an⠀external⠀noise,⠀a⠀phone⠀buzz,⠀or⠀the⠀body⠀itself,⠀and⠀the⠀association⠀may⠀leap⠀before⠀the⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀original⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀surface⠀as⠀quarrels⠀within⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀words.⠀One⠀impulse⠀makes⠀the⠀narrator⠀formulate⠀the⠀rule⠀honestly;⠀another⠀immediately⠀supplies⠀the⠀exception⠀that⠀would⠀let⠀them⠀act⠀as⠀they⠀wish.⠀The⠀syntax⠀accelerates⠀or⠀fragments⠀under⠀the⠀pressure,⠀but⠀the⠀conflict⠀remains⠀an⠀actual⠀practical⠀problem—childcare⠀hours,⠀rent,⠀medication,⠀a⠀promise⠀made—being⠀turned⠀over⠀and⠀adjusted⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀head,⠀not⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀rhetorical⠀self-questions.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀irreversible⠀result⠀happens,⠀let⠀it⠀enter⠀the⠀stream⠀as⠀an⠀external⠀fact⠀that⠀briefly⠀halts⠀the⠀associative⠀movement:⠀a⠀dropped⠀object,⠀a⠀phone⠀going⠀dark,⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀a⠀name⠀called.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀recognition⠀develop⠀over⠀the⠀remainder⠀of⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀the⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀earlier⠀formulations⠀and⠀sees⠀them⠀differently.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀lands⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀dramatic⠀insight⠀but⠀in⠀the⠀changed⠀tone⠀of⠀the⠀repeated⠀phrases⠀now⠀that⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀unalterable.⠀End⠀inside⠀the⠀same⠀associative⠀movement,⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀perception⠀following⠀the⠀recognition,⠀so⠀the⠀aftermath⠀retains⠀the⠀style's⠀present-tense⠀immediacy.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀mechanism⠀as⠀a⠀rule⠀of⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀rule⠀the⠀participants⠀refer⠀to:⠀a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀password,⠀a⠀channel⠀membership,⠀a⠀payment⠀deadline,⠀a⠀contact⠀saved⠀or⠀blocked.⠀The⠀transcript⠀states⠀the⠀rule⠀through⠀use—a⠀participant⠀quotes⠀the⠀deadline,⠀a⠀moderator⠀posts⠀the⠀channel⠀rule,⠀a⠀sender⠀references⠀the⠀saved⠀contact—rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀separate⠀explanation.⠀Show⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀through⠀their⠀message⠀style:⠀one⠀sends⠀short⠀fragments,⠀another⠀edits⠀repeatedly,⠀another⠀waits⠀to⠀reply.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀type⠀the⠀same⠀way.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀carry⠀a⠀consequence,⠀not⠀decorative⠀interface⠀noise.\n\nDistinguish⠀transmitted⠀text⠀from⠀private⠀thought⠀through⠀the⠀draft-to-sent⠀gap.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀transcript⠀only⠀as⠀a⠀draft⠀block⠀if⠀you⠀are⠀showing⠀it;⠀otherwise⠀keep⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀in⠀the⠀provided⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀wrapper⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀exchange.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀types⠀and⠀deletes⠀a⠀message,⠀show⠀the⠀visible⠀signs⠀of⠀that⠀action—the⠀long⠀delay,⠀the⠀edited⠀message,⠀the⠀abrupt⠀change⠀of⠀subject—rather⠀than⠀narrating⠀their⠀whole⠀internal⠀debate.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀is⠀a⠀final,⠀committed⠀act;⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀a⠀draft⠀and⠀the⠀sent⠀message⠀is⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀occurs.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀use⠀of⠀the⠀channel.⠀Two⠀threads⠀pull⠀a⠀character⠀in⠀opposite⠀directions:⠀a⠀group⠀chat⠀asks⠀for⠀confirmation⠀while⠀a⠀private⠀chat⠀demands⠀silence;⠀a⠀work⠀channel⠀sends⠀reminders⠀while⠀a⠀family⠀chat⠀asks⠀for⠀care.⠀The⠀character⠀tries⠀to⠀manage⠀both⠀by⠀exploiting⠀the⠀interface—turning⠀off⠀notifications,⠀pretending⠀to⠀be⠀offline,⠀replying⠀with⠀a⠀vague⠀emoji,⠀muting⠀one⠀thread—and⠀that⠀tactical⠀choice⠀creates⠀a⠀misread.⠀The⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀rule⠀each⠀participant⠀believes⠀they⠀are⠀following,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀messages⠀do⠀not⠀state⠀it⠀directly.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀irreversible⠀turn⠀happens,⠀let⠀it⠀occur⠀in⠀the⠀transcript⠀as⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀a⠀withdrawal,⠀or⠀the⠀arrival⠀of⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀unsent.⠀Do⠀not⠀immediately⠀follow⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀long⠀explanatory⠀paragraph.⠀Then⠀allow⠀recognition⠀to⠀develop⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀message⠀or⠀a⠀separated⠀authoring⠀block.⠀The⠀final⠀message⠀may⠀be⠀ordinary—a⠀routine⠀check-in,⠀a⠀one-word⠀reply,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀on⠀read—while⠀the⠀private⠀wrapper⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀interface⠀state⠀preserves⠀the⠀aftermath.⠀The⠀style⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀pending⠀thread⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀relationship.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀mechanism⠀in⠀a⠀repeated⠀visual⠀detail⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀revisit⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀A⠀first⠀visit⠀shows⠀a⠀box⠀left⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀place,⠀a⠀schedule⠀on⠀the⠀wall,⠀a⠀coat⠀missing⠀from⠀a⠀hook;⠀the⠀narration⠀explains⠀the⠀character's⠀current⠀understanding⠀in⠀a⠀short⠀reaction⠀tied⠀to⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen.⠀A⠀later⠀visit⠀shows⠀the⠀same⠀detail,⠀now⠀understood⠀correctly,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀response⠀changes⠀without⠀needing⠀a⠀new⠀external⠀event.⠀The⠀repetition⠀deepens⠀the⠀consequences⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀misread⠀rather⠀than⠀introducing⠀a⠀new⠀mystery.\n\nKeep⠀character⠀reaction⠀beats⠀brief.⠀One⠀or⠀two⠀lines⠀of⠀inner⠀response⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀thinks⠀about⠀the⠀current⠀exchange,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀expand⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀stream⠀of⠀consciousness.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀most⠀of⠀the⠀practical⠀conflict.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀must⠀be⠀explained—a⠀rule,⠀a⠀deadline,⠀a⠀commitment—have⠀a⠀character⠀state⠀it⠀in⠀readable⠀speech⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀summarize⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀focused⠀sentence⠀tied⠀to⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Avoid⠀essay-like⠀exposition⠀blocks.\n\nShow⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀through⠀scene⠀changes⠀and⠀focal⠀reactions.⠀Between⠀spaces,⠀cut⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀location⠀where⠀a⠀different⠀obligation⠀is⠀present.⠀The⠀same⠀character⠀expresses⠀warmth⠀in⠀one⠀scene⠀and⠀cold⠀practicality⠀in⠀another;⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀notes⠀the⠀tension⠀without⠀moralizing.⠀Each⠀side's⠀practical⠀demand⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀visible⠀task—a⠀call⠀to⠀be⠀made,⠀a⠀form⠀to⠀be⠀signed,⠀a⠀household⠀chore—rather⠀than⠀letting⠀dialogue⠀wander⠀into⠀general⠀debate.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀irreversible⠀result⠀occurs,⠀write⠀the⠀scene⠀so⠀the⠀visual⠀detail⠀at⠀the⠀center⠀of⠀the⠀mistake⠀remains⠀stable⠀while⠀the⠀recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀The⠀focal⠀narration⠀says⠀explicitly⠀that⠀this⠀is⠀the⠀same⠀tray,⠀the⠀same⠀locked⠀door,⠀the⠀same⠀empty⠀chair.⠀The⠀loss⠀then⠀lands⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀the⠀earlier⠀miscalculation.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀quiet⠀image⠀and⠀a⠀brief⠀inner⠀response⠀that⠀preserves⠀the⠀aftermath.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀choices,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀image⠀commands;⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀scene-oriented⠀presentation,⠀not⠀an⠀executable⠀visual⠀novel⠀engine.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqanbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nIntroduce⠀the⠀central⠀mechanism⠀in⠀broad⠀terms⠀in⠀an⠀early⠀installment,⠀then⠀add⠀the⠀exact⠀clause⠀that⠀will⠀eventually⠀matter⠀in⠀later⠀installments:⠀a⠀grace⠀period,⠀an⠀exception,⠀a⠀hidden⠀deadline,⠀a⠀household⠀arrangement.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀problem,⠀recover⠀the⠀needed⠀particular⠀briefly—\"the⠀form⠀was⠀due⠀Friday,⠀but⠀the⠀online⠀portal⠀showed⠀Monday\"—rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀history.⠀The⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀same⠀rule⠀being⠀used⠀correctly⠀and⠀incorrectly⠀across⠀installments.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀installment⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀with⠀a⠀local⠀development⠀that⠀narrows⠀the⠀future.⠀Each⠀reply⠀advances⠀an⠀immediate⠀practical⠀task:⠀the⠀character⠀gets⠀the⠀wrong⠀confirmation,⠀sends⠀the⠀message,⠀misses⠀the⠀call,⠀or⠀chooses⠀the⠀cheaper⠀option.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀arc;⠀the⠀camera⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀task⠀unfinished⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀next⠀installment.⠀A⠀hook⠀can⠀be⠀an⠀ordinary⠀pending⠀question,⠀not⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge:⠀the⠀character⠀learns⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀rule⠀that⠀changes⠀whether⠀an⠀earlier⠀step⠀was⠀safe.\n\nLet⠀the⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀accumulate⠀as⠀competing⠀resources⠀and⠀obligations.⠀One⠀installment⠀focuses⠀on⠀the⠀work⠀deadline,⠀the⠀next⠀on⠀the⠀family⠀need,⠀the⠀next⠀on⠀the⠀housing⠀cost.⠀Each⠀new⠀obligation⠀connects⠀to⠀the⠀mechanism⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀piling⠀on:⠀the⠀same⠀money,⠀the⠀same⠀caregiver,⠀the⠀same⠀schedule,⠀the⠀same⠀public⠀record.⠀The⠀character⠀tries⠀to⠀solve⠀one⠀problem⠀with⠀a⠀method⠀that⠀quietly⠀worsens⠀another,⠀always⠀through⠀concrete⠀action.\n\nLet⠀the⠀irreversible⠀outcome⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀after⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀seen⠀the⠀character⠀come⠀close⠀to⠀fixing⠀the⠀earlier⠀mistakes.⠀The⠀recognition⠀is⠀deferred⠀across⠀text⠀passages,⠀not⠀delivered⠀immediately⠀after⠀the⠀fatal⠀choice.⠀When⠀it⠀arrives,⠀it⠀revalues⠀earlier⠀local⠀successes.⠀Close⠀the⠀installment⠀on⠀the⠀aftermath:⠀an⠀ordinary⠀continuation,⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀unread,⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀is⠀too⠀quiet,⠀a⠀changed⠀routine.⠀The⠀serial⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀pending⠀obligation⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀total⠀resolution.⠀Recover⠀context⠀only⠀briefly⠀when⠀needed,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀fiction⠀moving.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nLocate⠀each⠀turn⠀of⠀the⠀fall⠀in⠀the⠀small⠀opportunities⠀for⠀admission,⠀demand,⠀apology,⠀or⠀withdrawal⠀between⠀people⠀who⠀already⠀matter⠀to⠀one⠀another.⠀Let⠀a⠀beautiful⠀or⠀memorable⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀that⠀closeness—a⠀room's⠀particular⠀light,⠀the⠀scent⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀routine,⠀an⠀object⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀touch⠀without⠀remembering.⠀The⠀beauty⠀is⠀not⠀relief⠀from⠀the⠀trouble;⠀it⠀is⠀proof⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀trouble⠀is⠀costing⠀them.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀to⠀make⠀emotional⠀strain⠀physically⠀legible⠀without⠀turning⠀characters⠀into⠀displays⠀of⠀symptoms.⠀A⠀throat⠀tightening⠀before⠀a⠀lie,⠀a⠀hand⠀hesitating⠀over⠀a⠀familiar⠀place,⠀a⠀pause⠀while⠀someone⠀counts⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀honesty:⠀these⠀reveal⠀the⠀relationship's⠀state⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀experience,⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀Let⠀the⠀strain⠀reach⠀behavior—a⠀sentence⠀abandoned,⠀a⠀demand⠀made⠀too⠀precisely,⠀a⠀kindness⠀received⠀like⠀a⠀debt—and⠀let⠀it⠀shape⠀what⠀happens⠀next,⠀not⠀only⠀how⠀it⠀feels.\n\nPrivate⠀thought⠀may⠀contradict⠀speech,⠀run⠀partly⠀against⠀it,⠀or⠀move⠀alongside⠀it;⠀the⠀reason⠀for⠀the⠀gap⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀relationship⠀and⠀its⠀present⠀danger.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀betrayal⠀or⠀collapse⠀in⠀every⠀exchange.⠀Tenderness⠀may⠀remain⠀real⠀and⠀even⠀useful,⠀but⠀comfort⠀arrives⠀at⠀a⠀price:⠀it⠀can⠀reopen⠀an⠀old⠀wound,⠀require⠀a⠀concession,⠀or⠀come⠀with⠀the⠀knowledge⠀that⠀this⠀ease⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept.⠀When⠀a⠀choice⠀turns⠀destructive,⠀keep⠀the⠀character's⠀commitment⠀and⠀the⠀visible⠀alternatives⠀intelligible,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀spent⠀and⠀why⠀someone⠀keeps⠀spending⠀it.⠀The⠀loss⠀itself⠀need⠀not⠀land⠀in⠀this⠀reply;⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀legible⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀attachment⠀already⠀costs⠀these⠀people,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀admission,⠀apology,⠀or⠀return⠀arrives⠀already⠀priced.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs,⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀speaker⠀attribution⠀so⠀players⠀always⠀know⠀who⠀is⠀talking⠀and⠀acting.⠀Ground⠀the⠀stakes⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀controlled⠀sensual⠀details⠀per⠀exchange:⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down⠀without⠀sound,⠀rain⠀arriving⠀through⠀an⠀open⠀door,⠀a⠀name⠀pronounced⠀too⠀carefully.⠀Let⠀one⠀character⠀notice⠀such⠀a⠀detail⠀before⠀anyone⠀else⠀reacts⠀to⠀it;⠀the⠀noticing⠀itself⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀charge.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀non-player⠀cast⠀active⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀purposes.⠀Their⠀offers,⠀refusals,⠀and⠀changes⠀of⠀subject⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀relationships⠀and⠀world⠀already⠀in⠀play,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀need⠀to⠀generate⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀forced⠀decision.⠀A⠀tender⠀gesture⠀can⠀stay⠀tender⠀while⠀complicating⠀the⠀bond;⠀a⠀coldness⠀can⠀reveal⠀divided⠀attachment⠀rather⠀than⠀random⠀cruelty.⠀In⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀mode⠀a⠀fatal⠀attachment⠀often⠀announces⠀itself⠀as⠀attention⠀that⠀feels⠀luxurious⠀and⠀wrong⠀at⠀once—render⠀it⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀watches,⠀handles,⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀look⠀at,⠀never⠀through⠀an⠀announced⠀doom.\n\nLet⠀practical⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀conversation:⠀obligations⠀proceed,⠀other⠀people⠀come⠀and⠀go,⠀the⠀day⠀does⠀not⠀pause⠀for⠀the⠀scene.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀interaction,⠀which⠀may⠀fall⠀mid-speech,⠀mid-action,⠀or⠀inside⠀a⠀thought;⠀leave⠀the⠀exchange⠀open⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀contribution⠀instead⠀of⠀resolving⠀the⠀tragedy⠀or⠀forcing⠀a⠀choice⠀before⠀the⠀turn⠀closes.⠀Keep⠀each⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀players'⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access,⠀and⠀let⠀narrative⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player⠀control⠀follow⠀their⠀separately⠀selected⠀settings.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀route⠀for⠀this⠀telling.⠀Divide⠀it⠀into⠀short⠀chapter-like⠀episodes,⠀each⠀organized⠀around⠀a⠀memory,⠀an⠀encounter,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀disclosure⠀that⠀returns⠀the⠀central⠀attachment⠀to⠀a⠀socially⠀legible⠀point⠀of⠀strain.⠀By⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀an⠀episode,⠀the⠀consequences⠀of⠀a⠀visit,⠀letter,⠀rumor,⠀or⠀interrupted⠀meeting⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀whole⠀fall.\n\nGive⠀each⠀episode⠀a⠀hinge:⠀an⠀object,⠀dish,⠀street⠀name,⠀ritual,⠀or⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀that⠀recurs.⠀Describe⠀it⠀with⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀use,⠀serve,⠀or⠀inherit⠀it⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀atmosphere⠀alone.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀returns,⠀its⠀meaning⠀has⠀changed⠀because⠀the⠀attachment⠀has⠀changed—not⠀because⠀a⠀sign⠀has⠀appeared.⠀Write⠀in⠀the⠀vernacular⠀of⠀the⠀story's⠀actual⠀speech⠀communities,⠀keeping⠀register⠀distinct⠀between⠀formal⠀occasions⠀and⠀private⠀talk.\n\nTreat⠀recognition⠀as⠀a⠀stepwise⠀public⠀event.⠀Family⠀members,⠀neighbors,⠀or⠀servants⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀same⠀small⠀scene⠀differently;⠀convey⠀that⠀layered⠀awareness⠀through⠀reported⠀gossip,⠀indirect⠀speech,⠀and⠀visible⠀reaction⠀rather⠀than⠀entering⠀minds⠀the⠀narration⠀has⠀no⠀access⠀to.⠀Emotional⠀truth⠀stays⠀chiefly⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀or⠀characters⠀whose⠀interiority⠀is⠀permitted.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀an⠀imperial,⠀rural,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀setting⠀because⠀the⠀tradition⠀is⠀Chinese.⠀Use⠀the⠀world,⠀period,⠀and⠀cast⠀already⠀supplied;⠀if⠀that⠀cast⠀is⠀contemporary⠀or⠀non-Chinese,⠀keep⠀the⠀episodic⠀account⠀of⠀attraction,⠀regret,⠀and⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀without⠀altering⠀anyone's⠀identity⠀or⠀language.⠀Return,⠀episode⠀by⠀episode,⠀in⠀formally⠀marked⠀steps⠀to⠀the⠀bond⠀whose⠀cost⠀is⠀still⠀accumulating.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀quick,⠀concrete⠀strokes:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀sticks⠀in⠀its⠀frame,⠀the⠀chipped⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀painted⠀table,⠀a⠀mark⠀on⠀the⠀wrist⠀where⠀a⠀bracelet⠀used⠀to⠀sit.⠀Let⠀material⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀condition⠀without⠀explaining⠀the⠀symbol.⠀When⠀the⠀action⠀turns,⠀cut⠀hard⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀necessary⠀event,⠀objection,⠀or⠀refusal.⠀A⠀flash⠀of⠀remembered⠀beauty—a⠀gown's⠀exact⠀color,⠀a⠀mouth's⠀taste,⠀a⠀street⠀wet⠀with⠀rain—may⠀land⠀once,⠀then⠀be⠀replaced⠀by⠀what⠀it⠀now⠀costs⠀to⠀recall.\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀diction,⠀but⠀keep⠀each⠀voice⠀inside⠀its⠀situation:⠀a⠀cautious⠀lover,⠀a⠀jealous⠀relative,⠀and⠀a⠀reluctant⠀returnee⠀should⠀not⠀share⠀one⠀hard⠀manner⠀of⠀speaking.⠀The⠀prose⠀compresses;⠀the⠀feelings⠀stay⠀varied⠀and⠀particular.⠀Allow⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀working⠀out⠀something⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀rendered⠀in⠀a⠀phrase—a⠀decision,⠀a⠀suspicion,⠀a⠀count⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀already⠀gone—and⠀end⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀thinking⠀ends.\n\nLet⠀the⠀fall⠀proceed⠀through⠀practical⠀consequence:⠀who⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀stay,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀sold⠀or⠀hidden,⠀which⠀promise⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀kept⠀in⠀its⠀original⠀form.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀fact—an⠀unpaid⠀bill,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀ajar,⠀a⠀map⠀returned⠀with⠀one⠀folded⠀corner—rather⠀than⠀as⠀an⠀announcement.⠀Beauty⠀appears⠀because⠀this⠀way⠀of⠀seeing⠀still⠀finds⠀it;⠀wear⠀appears⠀because⠀the⠀world⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀exacting.⠀Keep⠀both⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀so⠀that⠀neither⠀cancels⠀the⠀other.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀brutal⠀or⠀every⠀room⠀squalid.⠀A⠀clean⠀room⠀can⠀hold⠀a⠀dangerous⠀memory;⠀a⠀kind⠀act⠀can⠀sharpen⠀the⠀eventual⠀loss.⠀The⠀pressure⠀here⠀is⠀rhythmic⠀and⠀material,⠀not⠀a⠀mandate⠀of⠀despair.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀the⠀fall⠀completes,⠀provided⠀the⠀compressed⠀detail⠀already⠀shows⠀the⠀incompatibility⠀that⠀gives⠀the⠀coming⠀loss⠀its⠀weight.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀writer,⠀recipient⠀or⠀intended⠀use,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀A⠀letter⠀arrives⠀late;⠀a⠀diary⠀entry⠀records⠀what⠀its⠀writer⠀could⠀bear⠀to⠀know⠀that⠀night;⠀a⠀receipt,⠀lease⠀amendment,⠀or⠀medical⠀note⠀later⠀corrects⠀an⠀impression⠀the⠀personal⠀papers⠀created.⠀Do⠀not⠀append⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀each⠀document—selection⠀and⠀order⠀do⠀the⠀interpretive⠀work.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀memory⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀documents⠀as⠀material⠀quality:⠀the⠀stationery's⠀edge,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀drawer,⠀a⠀stain⠀from⠀the⠀meal⠀remembered⠀while⠀writing.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀room⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀so⠀precisely⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀why⠀the⠀writer⠀cannot⠀let⠀it⠀go,⠀and⠀still⠀hesitate⠀over⠀the⠀consequence⠀the⠀writer⠀will⠀not⠀name.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀document⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀admits⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀tragedy,⠀not⠀an⠀error⠀to⠀be⠀repaired.⠀Remember⠀that⠀each⠀document⠀is⠀composed⠀for⠀its⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀writer's⠀whole⠀live⠀mind,⠀so⠀where⠀private⠀interiority⠀is⠀permitted,⠀keep⠀the⠀thought⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀gets⠀committed⠀to⠀paper.\n\nUse⠀revisions⠀and⠀material⠀traces⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀changed⠀feeling⠀and⠀commitment:⠀torn⠀pages,⠀crossed-out⠀names,⠀repeated⠀drafts⠀of⠀one⠀sentence,⠀an⠀envelope⠀opened⠀and⠀resealed.⠀A⠀promise⠀or⠀refusal⠀was⠀rarely⠀made⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀clean⠀moment.⠀Conflicting⠀accounts⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀a⠀lie;⠀two⠀people⠀may⠀have⠀lived⠀the⠀same⠀evening⠀through⠀different⠀loves⠀and⠀fears.⠀Preserve⠀each⠀writer's⠀limited⠀knowledge—later⠀documents⠀may⠀discover⠀the⠀cost,⠀but⠀they⠀cannot⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀writer⠀knew.\n\nHandle⠀documents⠀as⠀objects⠀with⠀consequences:⠀misdelivered,⠀destroyed,⠀kept⠀too⠀long,⠀read⠀aloud⠀by⠀the⠀wrong⠀person,⠀entered⠀into⠀an⠀argument⠀or⠀an⠀inheritance.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀any⠀single⠀entry;⠀it⠀emerges⠀across⠀the⠀archive⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀recognizes⠀that⠀the⠀most⠀beautiful⠀sentence⠀was⠀also⠀where⠀the⠀bond⠀became⠀impossible.⠀Let⠀the⠀sequence⠀rest⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀not⠀when⠀every⠀question⠀has⠀been⠀answered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀real⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness:⠀someone⠀remembers⠀a⠀favorite⠀tea,⠀folds⠀a⠀warm⠀jacket⠀over⠀a⠀chair,⠀saves⠀the⠀last⠀piece⠀of⠀fruit,⠀sits⠀through⠀a⠀dull⠀program⠀because⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀values⠀it.⠀Render⠀these⠀acts⠀with⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensory⠀exactness—the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀cup,⠀the⠀particular⠀sweetness⠀held⠀back⠀for⠀someone—so⠀the⠀warmth⠀is⠀lived⠀rather⠀than⠀generic.⠀The⠀comfort⠀is⠀not⠀bait⠀for⠀a⠀punishment⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀paragraph;⠀it⠀genuinely⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀involved.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀stay⠀partial⠀and⠀personal.⠀One⠀character⠀accepts⠀care⠀easily;⠀another⠀hoards⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀it;⠀a⠀third⠀offers⠀help⠀that⠀misses⠀the⠀actual⠀need.⠀Comfort⠀requires⠀no⠀confession⠀and⠀no⠀repair,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀arrive⠀inside⠀an⠀unresolved⠀loyalty,⠀a⠀pending⠀departure,⠀or⠀the⠀knowledge⠀that⠀this⠀ease⠀cannot⠀last.⠀There⠀it⠀gives⠀the⠀tragedy⠀its⠀force:⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀exactly⠀what⠀someone⠀stands⠀to⠀lose.\n\nDo⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀tragedy's⠀commitments⠀to⠀manufacture⠀ease.⠀A⠀warm⠀breakfast⠀can⠀share⠀a⠀morning⠀with⠀a⠀promise⠀being⠀reconsidered;⠀a⠀familiar⠀joke⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀last⠀language⠀two⠀people⠀still⠀have⠀in⠀common⠀before⠀a⠀separation;⠀a⠀returned⠀possession⠀can⠀be⠀both⠀a⠀kindness⠀and⠀an⠀acknowledgment⠀that⠀its⠀owner⠀is⠀not⠀coming⠀back.⠀The⠀loss⠀need⠀not⠀occur⠀within⠀the⠀scene,⠀but⠀register⠀which⠀small⠀pleasure⠀has⠀quietly⠀become⠀irreplaceable,⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀moment⠀into⠀a⠀premonition.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cast⠀distinct.⠀Kindness⠀may⠀be⠀awkward,⠀habitual,⠀self-protective,⠀or⠀deliberate;⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀tender⠀without⠀being⠀spoken.⠀A⠀kitchen⠀or⠀bedroom⠀may⠀take⠀sensuous⠀detail⠀while⠀remaining⠀entirely⠀ordinary,⠀and⠀disagreement,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀the⠀world's⠀established⠀problems⠀stay⠀intact.⠀This⠀warmth⠀is⠀the⠀human⠀ground⠀from⠀which⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimate⠀strangeness⠀becomes⠀legible.⠀Stop⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀moment⠀of⠀closeness⠀or⠀care;⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀no⠀break,⠀lesson,⠀or⠀resolution⠀to⠀justify⠀ending⠀there.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀deliberate⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀move⠀between⠀social⠀context⠀and⠀private⠀experience.⠀Open⠀a⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀household's⠀arrangements,⠀a⠀public⠀occasion,⠀a⠀letter⠀of⠀invitation,⠀or⠀a⠀place⠀as⠀it⠀is⠀spoken⠀of⠀in⠀a⠀certain⠀circle;⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀paragraph⠀draw⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀person's⠀attention—the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀curtain,⠀a⠀name⠀pronounced⠀in⠀the⠀formal⠀register,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀promise⠀understood⠀as⠀debt.⠀Keep⠀narration⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language⠀in⠀diction⠀and⠀rhythm,⠀while⠀dialogue⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀voices⠀of⠀its⠀speakers.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀attachment⠀vivid⠀without⠀dissolving⠀into⠀atmosphere.⠀A⠀red⠀lantern,⠀an⠀embroidered⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀half-empty⠀dish,⠀the⠀scent⠀of⠀a⠀closed⠀room⠀may⠀recur,⠀but⠀each⠀return⠀changes⠀meaning⠀as⠀social⠀possibility⠀narrows.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀set⠀private⠀reluctance⠀beside⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀expects,⠀provided⠀the⠀active⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀permits⠀that⠀distance;⠀when⠀a⠀framing⠀or⠀omniscient⠀voice⠀spans⠀rooms,⠀keep⠀clear⠀whose⠀knowledge⠀is⠀being⠀rendered⠀at⠀each⠀step.\n\nLet⠀the⠀fall⠀appear⠀as⠀gradual⠀adjustment⠀in⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said,⠀worn,⠀exchanged,⠀or⠀refused⠀in⠀public.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀arrive⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀understands⠀that⠀an⠀apparently⠀free⠀choice⠀was⠀already⠀enclosed⠀by⠀family,⠀property,⠀reputation,⠀or⠀debt—but⠀do⠀not⠀stage⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀lecture.⠀Let⠀it⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀comparison⠀the⠀narration⠀has⠀been⠀building⠀all⠀along⠀between⠀the⠀intimate⠀detail⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀condition⠀surrounding⠀it.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀before⠀the⠀catastrophe:⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀public⠀business,⠀an⠀invitation⠀declined,⠀a⠀door⠀shut⠀on⠀a⠀private⠀understanding,⠀while⠀the⠀broader⠀fall⠀remains⠀in⠀motion.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀world⠀contract;⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀may⠀organize⠀passages⠀where⠀relevant,⠀and⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture⠀gives⠀the⠀tragedy⠀its⠀social⠀legibility⠀without⠀requiring⠀aristocratic⠀settings⠀or⠀archaic⠀vocabulary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀fall⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀given⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀can⠀still⠀alter⠀the⠀teller's⠀remaining⠀choices.⠀Establish⠀the⠀occasion⠀and⠀purpose⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀immediately:⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀buying⠀time,⠀seeking⠀sympathy,⠀delaying⠀an⠀answer,⠀explaining⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀trying⠀to⠀make⠀someone⠀understand⠀before⠀a⠀decision⠀closes.⠀Give⠀the⠀listener⠀a⠀competing⠀stake,⠀so⠀the⠀frame⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀stage⠀but⠀a⠀live⠀negotiation⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀needs⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀wants⠀to⠀hear⠀or⠀prevent.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀carry⠀the⠀embedded⠀story.⠀Render⠀remembered⠀rooms,⠀food,⠀fabric,⠀heat,⠀scent,⠀and⠀touch⠀with⠀exact⠀sensory⠀precision,⠀and⠀attach⠀each⠀beautiful⠀image⠀to⠀an⠀obligation,⠀bargain,⠀or⠀loss.⠀A⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀must⠀cross⠀the⠀levels⠀and⠀accrue⠀meaning:⠀a⠀comb,⠀a⠀tune,⠀a⠀promise⠀couched⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀words,⠀a⠀room⠀returned⠀to⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀When⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupts,⠀make⠀the⠀interruption⠀reveal⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀account.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀ask⠀about⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀teller⠀smoothed⠀over,⠀challenge⠀a⠀sequence,⠀or⠀demand⠀the⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀that⠀explains⠀a⠀present⠀consequence.⠀The⠀teller's⠀response⠀then⠀exposes⠀the⠀omission,⠀defense,⠀or⠀choice⠀that⠀the⠀tale⠀was⠀arranged⠀to⠀manage.\n\nSeparate⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀now⠀shows.⠀The⠀fall⠀must⠀be⠀intelligible⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀still⠀defends⠀it.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀arrive⠀inside⠀the⠀told⠀story,⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀telling,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀listener's⠀response;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀it⠀to⠀be⠀neat⠀or⠀redemptive.⠀Aftermath⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀loss⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀frame,⠀not⠀undo⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀levels⠀clear⠀by⠀giving⠀each⠀shift⠀a⠀distinct⠀sensory⠀marker,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀or⠀an⠀audience⠀gesture.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀courtly⠀setting,⠀djinn,⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀cliffhanger;⠀the⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀reference⠀supplies⠀narrative⠀pressure,⠀not⠀imported⠀props.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social-developmental⠀realism⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀fall⠀as⠀an⠀unfolding⠀history⠀in⠀which⠀work,⠀family,⠀property,⠀rank,⠀migration,⠀or⠀institutional⠀expectation⠀exerts⠀steady⠀pressure⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀desire.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀in⠀a⠀realist⠀register⠀and⠀attach⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀knowledge:⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀transactions,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀alternatives⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀see,⠀not⠀a⠀sociological⠀overview.\n\nGround⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀lushness⠀in⠀tangible⠀conditions.⠀Describe⠀a⠀beautiful⠀object⠀by⠀showing⠀how⠀it⠀is⠀priced,⠀rented,⠀inherited,⠀pawned,⠀mended,⠀or⠀envied.⠀Remembered⠀places⠀carry⠀their⠀social⠀history:⠀a⠀room⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀lovely⠀but⠀also⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀lease,⠀a⠀legacy,⠀a⠀lost⠀position,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀claim.⠀Jealous⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀appears⠀through⠀practical⠀conflicts,⠀such⠀as⠀an⠀invitation⠀accepted⠀at⠀a⠀cost,⠀a⠀family⠀debt,⠀a⠀career⠀decision⠀made⠀to⠀please,⠀or⠀a⠀room⠀one⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀afford.⠀Let⠀the⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀expose⠀the⠀unstable⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀conceal⠀it;⠀render⠀the⠀surface⠀with⠀sensual⠀precision⠀and⠀then⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀demands.\n\nMake⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀intelligible⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀character⠀foolish.⠀A⠀parent,⠀employer,⠀friend,⠀or⠀former⠀self⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀practical⠀risk⠀plainly,⠀and⠀the⠀protagonist⠀may⠀genuinely⠀understand⠀the⠀risk⠀and⠀still⠀choose⠀against⠀it.⠀Build⠀the⠀choice⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀incompatible⠀commitments,⠀not⠀from⠀ignorance⠀or⠀fate.⠀Recognition⠀becomes⠀a⠀later⠀reckoning⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀in⠀social⠀and⠀personal⠀terms;⠀aftermath⠀does⠀not⠀reverse⠀the⠀history⠀or⠀grant⠀comfort.⠀Keep⠀the⠀perspective's⠀access⠀limited⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀German⠀national⠀scenery,⠀reflexive⠀bureaucracies,⠀or⠀translated⠀word⠀order.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nLocate⠀the⠀fall⠀where⠀an⠀inherited⠀demand,⠀title,⠀debt,⠀ritual⠀obligation,⠀or⠀old⠀family⠀arrangement⠀meets⠀ordinary⠀present⠀life.⠀Use⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀collision⠀to⠀make⠀that⠀meeting⠀physically⠀and⠀emotionally⠀specific:⠀a⠀modern⠀flat⠀inside⠀an⠀old⠀house,⠀a⠀family⠀rule⠀enforced⠀by⠀a⠀current⠀employer,⠀a⠀cherished⠀object⠀whose⠀upkeep⠀now⠀costs⠀someone⠀a⠀choice.⠀Let⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀sharpen⠀the⠀encounter⠀by⠀showing⠀how⠀the⠀old⠀demand⠀changes⠀the⠀feel⠀and⠀stakes⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀room,⠀task,⠀or⠀relationship,⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀a⠀cause⠀with⠀mood.\n\nRender⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀beauty⠀with⠀a⠀cost⠀through⠀urban⠀material⠀detail.⠀Describe⠀fabric,⠀lighting,⠀jewelry,⠀food,⠀or⠀architecture⠀in⠀exact⠀sensory⠀terms,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀maintenance,⠀threat,⠀or⠀bargain⠀attached⠀to⠀it.⠀Private⠀desire⠀can⠀be⠀intense,⠀jealous,⠀or⠀divided,⠀and⠀socially⠀expected⠀masks⠀may⠀fall⠀in⠀trusted⠀company.⠀When⠀a⠀mask⠀falls,⠀let⠀the⠀unmasking⠀itself⠀be⠀dangerous⠀or⠀comforting⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀relationship;⠀the⠀intimacy⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀cost⠀or⠀pressure⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀been⠀carrying,⠀not⠀serve⠀as⠀a⠀guaranteed⠀trap.\n\nMake⠀each⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀legible⠀through⠀authority⠀and⠀intimacy⠀together.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀obey⠀an⠀old⠀loyalty,⠀refuse⠀a⠀modern⠀compromise,⠀or⠀protect⠀one⠀person⠀at⠀another's⠀expense.⠀Show⠀the⠀reasoning⠀and⠀the⠀alternative,⠀so⠀the⠀fall⠀is⠀a⠀consequence⠀of⠀an⠀in-character⠀incompatible⠀commitment.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀loss⠀for⠀the⠀survivors⠀without⠀restoring⠀what⠀was⠀destroyed.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀blood⠀rules,⠀powers,⠀or⠀factions;⠀Gothic⠀atmosphere⠀works⠀here⠀through⠀social⠀pressure,⠀material⠀decay,⠀and⠀personal⠀horror.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀response⠀boundary⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social-domestic⠀realism⠀route.⠀Build⠀the⠀tragedy⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀community⠀by⠀showing⠀the⠀obligations⠀and⠀consequences⠀that⠀structure⠀daily⠀life:⠀who⠀must⠀be⠀visited,⠀fed,⠀repaid,⠀married,⠀cared⠀for,⠀or⠀answered.⠀Keep⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀immediate⠀knowledge⠀and⠀social⠀position.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀register⠀meals,⠀rooms,⠀arrivals,⠀departures,⠀debts,⠀and⠀obligations⠀as⠀consequential⠀events,⠀not⠀decorative⠀background.\n\nPlace⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensuousness⠀inside⠀remembered⠀domestic⠀rituals.⠀Describe⠀precise⠀fabrics,⠀dishes,⠀scents,⠀weather,⠀and⠀family⠀objects,⠀and⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀cost⠀or⠀preserve.⠀A⠀divided⠀attachment⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀household⠀duty⠀and⠀private⠀desire,⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀relative⠀expects⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀remembers,⠀or⠀between⠀two⠀loyalties⠀that⠀cannot⠀both⠀be⠀honored.⠀Let⠀jealousy⠀or⠀longing⠀emerge⠀through⠀small⠀repeated⠀actions:⠀a⠀letter⠀kept,⠀a⠀meal⠀left⠀unsent,⠀a⠀visit⠀rehearsed⠀but⠀not⠀made.⠀Each⠀repeated⠀action⠀should⠀move⠀the⠀character⠀closer⠀to⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀reveal⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀avoiding⠀one.\n\nLet⠀external⠀warnings⠀be⠀practical⠀and⠀intelligible.⠀A⠀parent,⠀friend,⠀or⠀colleague⠀can⠀name⠀the⠀risk,⠀and⠀the⠀protagonist⠀can⠀still⠀choose⠀against⠀that⠀advice⠀for⠀reasons⠀the⠀narrative⠀makes⠀clear.⠀The⠀fall⠀results⠀from⠀an⠀incompatible⠀commitment,⠀not⠀stupidity⠀or⠀fate.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀arrive⠀through⠀an⠀encounter⠀with⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀place,⠀object,⠀or⠀relationship,⠀and⠀the⠀aftermath⠀should⠀keep⠀the⠀loss⠀present⠀without⠀pretending⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀repaired.⠀Keep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social-psychological⠀realism⠀route.⠀Write⠀in⠀a⠀composed⠀register⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀perception,⠀with⠀syntax⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀following⠀that⠀teller.⠀Observe⠀the⠀ordinary⠀pressures⠀of⠀work,⠀family,⠀marriage,⠀reputation,⠀or⠀place⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀encounters:⠀a⠀conversation⠀at⠀work,⠀a⠀family⠀expectation⠀repeated,⠀a⠀reputation⠀at⠀stake,⠀a⠀room⠀or⠀street⠀that⠀has⠀changed.⠀Let⠀the⠀fall⠀grow⠀from⠀a⠀decision⠀the⠀character⠀makes,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀surrounding⠀social⠀world⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀choices⠀and⠀responses⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀involved.\n\nAllow⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀lushness⠀to⠀appear⠀in⠀precise⠀sensory⠀attention:⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀water,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀garment,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀or⠀cooking,⠀the⠀grain⠀of⠀a⠀wooden⠀surface.⠀Tie⠀each⠀detail⠀to⠀memory⠀and⠀cost.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀memory⠀may⠀be⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀clings⠀to,⠀what⠀they⠀fear⠀losing,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀enter.⠀Render⠀jealous⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀watched,⠀avoided,⠀remembered,⠀or⠀left⠀unsaid.⠀Show⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀lingering⠀on⠀one⠀person⠀or⠀object,⠀turning⠀away⠀from⠀another,⠀or⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀scene⠀that⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀entered.\n\nLet⠀seasonal⠀or⠀spatial⠀attention⠀cue⠀narrated⠀time⠀and⠀recognition,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀checklist.⠀Recognition⠀can⠀arrive⠀quietly⠀through⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀an⠀empty⠀seat,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀now⠀done⠀alone.⠀Aftermath⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀loss⠀and⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀continues⠀in⠀its⠀presence,⠀not⠀explain⠀it⠀away.⠀Keep⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀within⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀silence,⠀seclusion,⠀or⠀a⠀conventional⠀Japanese⠀setting;⠀whatever⠀is⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story⠀world⠀determines⠀the⠀actual⠀places⠀and⠀persons.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological-urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Set⠀the⠀fall⠀in⠀a⠀city⠀whose⠀streets,⠀rooms,⠀cafés,⠀buses,⠀and⠀apartments⠀are⠀rendered⠀exactly⠀enough⠀to⠀hold⠀remembered⠀desire.⠀Move⠀between⠀the⠀present⠀aftermath⠀and⠀earlier⠀moments⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀attachment⠀through⠀deliberate,⠀clearly⠀cued⠀time⠀shifts.⠀Signal⠀each⠀shift⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀or⠀spatial⠀marker,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀particular⠀light,⠀a⠀route,⠀or⠀an⠀object,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀follows⠀the⠀movement⠀without⠀chronological⠀disorder⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀lushness⠀as⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀memory.⠀Describe⠀a⠀dress,⠀a⠀perfume,⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀meal,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀light⠀with⠀tactile⠀precision,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀after⠀the⠀loss.⠀Each⠀return⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀image⠀carrying⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning:⠀what⠀was⠀once⠀desired⠀is⠀now⠀evidence⠀of⠀absence,⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀undone.⠀Jealous,⠀divided⠀longing⠀can⠀occupy⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀the⠀past;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀resolve⠀it.⠀The⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀is⠀always⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀cost:⠀an⠀unpaid⠀rent,⠀a⠀lover's⠀absence,⠀a⠀family⠀debt,⠀a⠀photograph⠀no⠀longer⠀accurate.\n\nThe⠀fall⠀must⠀remain⠀intelligible.⠀Show⠀the⠀choice⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀or⠀emotional⠀situation⠀that⠀made⠀it,⠀not⠀merely⠀the⠀misery⠀that⠀followed.⠀Alternatives⠀can⠀be⠀named⠀by⠀a⠀friend⠀or⠀by⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀later⠀self,⠀but⠀the⠀earlier⠀decision⠀must⠀have⠀its⠀own⠀felt⠀logic⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Recognition⠀occurs⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀remembered⠀scene⠀is⠀revisited⠀with⠀later⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀its⠀meaning⠀changes⠀irreversibly.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀the⠀loss⠀in⠀the⠀city's⠀continuing⠀life.⠀Keep⠀the⠀perspective⠀within⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀magic,⠀ghosts,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀causality⠀unless⠀the⠀provided⠀world⠀canon⠀already⠀contains⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀tragic⠀situation⠀without⠀preface.⠀Open⠀on⠀a⠀place,⠀gesture,⠀object,⠀or⠀exchange⠀that⠀already⠀carries⠀pressure.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀crisp:⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀for⠀movement,⠀clear⠀speakers⠀in⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀a⠀dedicated⠀beat⠀for⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀reaction.⠀The⠀pacing⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀each⠀step⠀toward⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀without⠀rushing⠀the⠀recognition.\n\nCompress⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀lushness⠀into⠀high-contrast⠀sensory⠀details.⠀Select⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀specific⠀images⠀per⠀scene—a⠀glove,⠀a⠀mirror,⠀a⠀plate,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain—and⠀return⠀to⠀them⠀later⠀under⠀changed⠀circumstances.⠀Beauty⠀costs⠀something⠀visible:⠀an⠀unaffordable⠀garment,⠀a⠀favor⠀accepted,⠀a⠀parting⠀gift.⠀Use⠀the⠀reaction⠀beats⠀to⠀render⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀emotional⠀state,⠀whether⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀quietly⠀overwhelmed,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀exclamation.⠀Let⠀each⠀beat⠀register⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀image⠀or⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀competing⠀commitment.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀fall⠀legible.⠀Before⠀the⠀choice,⠀make⠀the⠀competing⠀commitment⠀concrete⠀through⠀dialogue⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀private⠀thought,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀character's⠀reaction⠀show⠀what⠀that⠀commitment⠀costs.⠀Warnings⠀can⠀be⠀spoken⠀plainly⠀and⠀the⠀protagonist⠀may⠀still⠀proceed.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀focused⠀moment:⠀an⠀image⠀from⠀earlier⠀now⠀means⠀something⠀else,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀or⠀the⠀narration⠀notes⠀the⠀change⠀without⠀explaining⠀it⠀into⠀softness.⠀Aftermath⠀remains⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀closing⠀lines;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀comedy,⠀or⠀first-person⠀narration⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀story⠀contract⠀already⠀calls⠀for⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀each⠀scene⠀around⠀one⠀sensuous⠀image⠀taken⠀from⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀places⠀and⠀attachments—a⠀mirror,⠀a⠀length⠀of⠀fabric,⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀dish⠀two⠀people⠀shared—and⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀as⠀the⠀arc⠀turns.⠀Early⠀on,⠀the⠀image⠀belongs⠀to⠀appetite⠀or⠀habit;⠀after⠀an⠀irreversible⠀choice,⠀bring⠀it⠀back⠀with⠀its⠀association⠀shifted⠀so⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀felt⠀through⠀the⠀senses⠀before⠀anyone⠀names⠀it.⠀The⠀image⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀tragedy;⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀cost⠀physically⠀present,⠀and⠀it⠀stays⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀associations.\n\nShape⠀rhythm⠀so⠀it⠀carries⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀anticipation⠀and⠀aftermath.⠀Before⠀the⠀fall,⠀let⠀sentences⠀wind⠀through⠀associative⠀memory—what⠀a⠀fabric⠀recalls,⠀whom⠀a⠀scent⠀belongs⠀to—and⠀let⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfold⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀an⠀absent⠀person⠀present.⠀Land⠀decisive⠀facts⠀in⠀short,⠀plain⠀clauses:⠀what⠀was⠀chosen,⠀who⠀left,⠀what⠀was⠀signed.⠀Keep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀voice⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀register;⠀the⠀cast⠀need⠀not⠀speak⠀poetically,⠀and⠀a⠀flat⠀spoken⠀line⠀can⠀cut⠀through⠀the⠀figurative⠀surface⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀happening.\n\nKeep⠀attachment⠀specific⠀and⠀intelligence⠀intact.⠀Jealousy,⠀divided⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀doomed⠀attraction⠀arrives⠀through⠀remembered⠀sensation⠀and⠀private⠀encounters—a⠀hand⠀remembered⠀too⠀well,⠀another⠀person's⠀scent⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀room—rather⠀than⠀generalized⠀sorrow,⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀unspoken⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀as⠀actual⠀felt⠀attention⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀Let⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀be⠀intelligible⠀in⠀their⠀plain⠀sense⠀even⠀inside⠀the⠀beauty.⠀After⠀recognition,⠀allow⠀the⠀ornament⠀to⠀thin⠀where⠀attention⠀itself⠀has⠀changed.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀may⠀hold⠀one⠀image⠀now⠀unshareable,⠀preserving⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀without⠀claiming⠀the⠀pain⠀has⠀been⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀telling⠀move⠀between⠀a⠀present⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasions⠀that⠀have⠀become⠀unreachable.⠀Choose⠀one⠀familiar⠀place⠀or⠀object⠀and⠀visit⠀it⠀twice:⠀once⠀while⠀it⠀still⠀belongs⠀to⠀ordinary⠀life,⠀and⠀again⠀after⠀a⠀choice⠀has⠀made⠀it⠀inaccessible.⠀The⠀second⠀visit⠀carries⠀the⠀recognition;⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀change⠀at⠀length,⠀because⠀the⠀detail—a⠀hand⠀resting⠀on⠀a⠀rail,⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀door⠀sounded,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀tea⠀before⠀the⠀departure—already⠀holds⠀it.⠀Mark⠀each⠀passage⠀between⠀present⠀and⠀past⠀with⠀a⠀sensory⠀cue⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀recap.\n\nGround⠀reflection⠀in⠀this⠀person⠀and⠀this⠀loss.⠀A⠀divided⠀attachment⠀can⠀be⠀felt⠀as⠀two⠀remembered⠀occasions⠀that⠀now⠀touch:⠀the⠀afternoon⠀that⠀meant⠀devotion⠀and⠀the⠀errand⠀that⠀meant⠀betrayal,⠀coinciding⠀in⠀one⠀remembered⠀texture.⠀Let⠀later⠀thought⠀re-read⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀so⠀that⠀recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means,⠀keeping⠀the⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀habits⠀of⠀mind⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀general⠀statements⠀about⠀time⠀and⠀impermanence.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀private⠀longing⠀stays⠀available⠀as⠀felt⠀experience,⠀not⠀only⠀as⠀described⠀scenery.\n\nOrdinary⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀pleasurable⠀inside⠀grief—a⠀meal⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀good,⠀a⠀guest⠀still⠀welcome—because⠀the⠀tragedy⠀is⠀the⠀removal⠀of⠀possibility,⠀not⠀the⠀erasure⠀of⠀warmth.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀present,⠀mid-attention,⠀with⠀the⠀familiar⠀thing⠀changed,⠀and⠀no⠀scene⠀is⠀obliged⠀to⠀close⠀by⠀announcing⠀that⠀nothing⠀lasts.⠀What⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀stays⠀unrestored,⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀it⠀can⠀remain⠀tender⠀without⠀being⠀softened.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀this⠀tragedy⠀inside⠀a⠀frame:⠀a⠀specific⠀person⠀tells⠀a⠀specific⠀tale⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀gathering,⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀hour,⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀rendered⠀concretely—the⠀light,⠀the⠀tea⠀being⠀poured,⠀who⠀grows⠀restless,⠀who⠀already⠀knows⠀the⠀end.⠀Fix⠀the⠀teller's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀events—participant,⠀witness,⠀or⠀inheritor⠀of⠀the⠀account—and⠀keep⠀knowledge⠀within⠀it:⠀the⠀teller⠀knows⠀what⠀was⠀seen,⠀what⠀was⠀told⠀afterward,⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀since⠀been⠀understood,⠀no⠀more.⠀The⠀tale⠀is⠀received,⠀not⠀merely⠀reported;⠀the⠀listeners'⠀attention⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀form.\n\nInside⠀the⠀tale,⠀keep⠀sensual⠀precision⠀attached⠀to⠀remembered⠀places:⠀a⠀courtyard,⠀a⠀shop,⠀a⠀route⠀through⠀the⠀market,⠀a⠀bathhouse,⠀given⠀through⠀the⠀textures,⠀scents,⠀and⠀gestures⠀the⠀teller⠀lingers⠀on⠀because⠀they⠀still⠀carry⠀the⠀attachment.⠀Let⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀glamorous⠀person⠀or⠀a⠀jealous⠀arrangement⠀surface⠀gradually,⠀nameable⠀only⠀as⠀the⠀telling⠀proceeds.⠀Keep⠀warnings⠀intelligible⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀so⠀the⠀fall⠀remains⠀chosen⠀rather⠀than⠀dressed⠀as⠀fate.\n\nBreak⠀the⠀telling⠀with⠀the⠀present:⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀refill,⠀a⠀door⠀opening,⠀someone⠀defending⠀the⠀person⠀being⠀described.⠀These⠀interruptions⠀let⠀recognition⠀happen⠀inside⠀the⠀frame—the⠀listener⠀understanding⠀the⠀loss⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀named,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀discovering,⠀mid-sentence,⠀that⠀a⠀past⠀choice⠀cannot⠀be⠀taken⠀back.⠀The⠀social⠀warmth⠀of⠀the⠀frame⠀persists⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀tale⠀turns⠀toward⠀loss.⠀Close⠀with⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀still⠀unrestored,⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀account⠀tidy⠀or⠀the⠀audience's⠀understanding⠀complete,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀idiom⠀of⠀teller⠀and⠀listeners⠀within⠀the⠀community⠀and⠀language⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀antiquity⠀or⠀mysticism.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀set⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀for⠀each⠀scene—two⠀or⠀three⠀will⠀usually⠀be⠀enough—and⠀let⠀each⠀one⠀carry⠀attachment⠀or⠀memory:⠀a⠀mark⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀wall,⠀a⠀particular⠀cloth,⠀a⠀sound⠀that⠀repeats⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀hour.⠀Place⠀the⠀detail⠀beside⠀the⠀action⠀without⠀explaining⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀no⠀longer⠀says.⠀Where⠀an⠀inward⠀connection⠀is⠀essential⠀to⠀causality,⠀state⠀it⠀directly⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀run⠀exactly⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀it⠀needs⠀to⠀make⠀sense;⠀one⠀precise⠀sentence⠀serves⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments,⠀and⠀economy⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota.\n\nMark⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀and⠀recognition⠀in⠀plain⠀clauses.⠀Let⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀appear⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀the⠀loss;⠀its⠀new⠀occasion⠀changes⠀it,⠀and⠀nothing⠀needs⠀to⠀announce⠀the⠀change.⠀Show⠀what⠀beauty⠀cost⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀action—a⠀hand⠀turned⠀over,⠀a⠀box⠀closed,⠀a⠀name⠀said⠀once—rather⠀than⠀through⠀adjectives.⠀Keep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀voice⠀individual⠀even⠀in⠀brief⠀lines.\n\nDo⠀not⠀cut⠀away⠀the⠀alternatives⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀fall⠀tragic:⠀a⠀single⠀line⠀can⠀establish⠀that⠀another⠀path⠀was⠀open,⠀that⠀someone⠀said⠀so,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀understood⠀it⠀only⠀later.⠀Repetition⠀should⠀be⠀deliberate,⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀chosen⠀detail⠀exactly⠀when⠀its⠀meaning⠀has⠀changed.⠀What⠀is⠀omitted⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀but⠀never⠀confusing,⠀and⠀a⠀final⠀direct⠀sentence⠀can⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀one⠀continuous⠀scene.⠀Open⠀inside⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀conversation⠀already⠀underway,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀move⠀naturally⠀among⠀what⠀is⠀happening,⠀what⠀is⠀said,⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀perceives⠀or⠀recalls,⠀and⠀whatever⠀inner⠀experience⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀is⠀authorized⠀to⠀carry.⠀A⠀sensuous⠀detail—the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀fabric,⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀dish,⠀light⠀falling⠀the⠀way⠀it⠀fell⠀in⠀a⠀remembered⠀room—carries⠀the⠀intimacy⠀of⠀this⠀profile,⠀but⠀let⠀it⠀serve⠀the⠀moment⠀and⠀release⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀stop⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀ornament⠀it.\n\nBuild⠀tragic⠀consequence⠀from⠀choices⠀made⠀inside⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀summary⠀or⠀foreshadowing.⠀Put⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀into⠀dialogue⠀or⠀into⠀specific⠀thought—one⠀person⠀states⠀the⠀risk⠀plainly,⠀or⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀sees⠀the⠀other⠀road⠀and⠀understands⠀its⠀price—and⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀person⠀still⠀choose,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀choose,⠀for⠀reasons⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀made⠀real.⠀Divided⠀or⠀jealous⠀attachment⠀lives⠀in⠀concrete⠀intimacies:⠀a⠀private⠀name,⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture,⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀two⠀people⠀once⠀met,⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀arrangements⠀that⠀maintain⠀them—what⠀someone⠀pays,⠀risks,⠀or⠀gives⠀up⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀intact.\n\nRecognition⠀can⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀later⠀recollection⠀that⠀re-reads⠀an⠀earlier⠀glance⠀or⠀remark.⠀Use⠀paragraphs⠀to⠀guide⠀attention⠀without⠀signposting,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀voice⠀stay⠀fluid⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀contemporary.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀decisive⠀act,⠀a⠀postponed⠀answer,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀simply⠀knowing⠀what⠀has⠀changed;⠀supply⠀an⠀epiphany⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀moment⠀has⠀earned⠀one,⠀and⠀no⠀reply⠀owes⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀the⠀ground⠀the⠀tragedy⠀stands⠀on.⠀Select⠀scenes⠀that⠀keep⠀it⠀legible:⠀the⠀private⠀language⠀these⠀two⠀actually⠀use,⠀a⠀repeated⠀moment⠀that⠀means⠀more⠀to⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀than⠀the⠀other⠀knows,⠀a⠀small⠀ritual⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀begun⠀to⠀change.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀rivalry⠀real⠀space⠀as⠀specific⠀actions,⠀spoken⠀lines,⠀and⠀words⠀withheld⠀for⠀character-specific⠀reasons;⠀whatever⠀is⠀withheld⠀should⠀also⠀exist⠀as⠀private⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀not⠀only⠀as⠀implication.\n\nLet⠀fatal⠀glamour⠀live⠀in⠀intimate⠀particulars—a⠀preferred⠀seat,⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀touching,⠀a⠀remembered⠀sweetness⠀with⠀an⠀edge—and⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀concrete:⠀the⠀relationship⠀itself,⠀a⠀loyalty⠀it⠀displaced,⠀a⠀belief⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀that⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀survive.⠀Show⠀that⠀cost⠀through⠀consequence⠀inside⠀the⠀scenes⠀rather⠀than⠀melodrama,⠀and⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀premise⠀actually⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀bolt⠀on⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀a⠀collapsed⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀rescue.\n\nEarn⠀the⠀payoff⠀through⠀callbacks.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀shared⠀object⠀from⠀an⠀early⠀scene⠀returns⠀later⠀with⠀its⠀meaning⠀changed⠀because⠀one⠀character⠀now⠀knows⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀was⠀feeling⠀or⠀hiding;⠀recognition⠀should⠀re-read⠀that⠀earlier⠀private⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀import⠀a⠀new⠀external⠀fact.⠀Afterward,⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored—the⠀residue⠀of⠀the⠀attachment,⠀the⠀name⠀still⠀known—without⠀pretending⠀it⠀vanished.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀hard⠀truth⠀spoken,⠀or⠀with⠀someone⠀quietly⠀noticing⠀that⠀the⠀shared⠀name⠀has⠀stopped⠀being⠀used;⠀it⠀can⠀equally⠀end⠀before⠀anything⠀is⠀said.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀being⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀fixes⠀a⠀deed⠀or⠀a⠀bond⠀in⠀memory—for⠀example,⠀\"It⠀was⠀in⠀the⠀year⠀of⠀the⠀flood⠀that⠀she⠀left⠀the⠀house⠀by⠀the⠀river\"—then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀complicate⠀what⠀the⠀declaration⠀claims.⠀Let⠀names⠀and⠀a⠀few⠀recurring⠀phrases⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀gives⠀them⠀new⠀application;⠀do⠀not⠀hang⠀an⠀epithet⠀on⠀every⠀entrance.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀intimacy⠀of⠀remembered⠀places⠀inside⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀economy.⠀Two⠀people⠀bound⠀by⠀a⠀shared⠀room,⠀a⠀repeated⠀errand,⠀or⠀a⠀gift⠀whose⠀meaning⠀changed⠀can⠀hold⠀a⠀divided⠀attachment⠀without⠀breaking⠀the⠀telling's⠀scale,⠀and⠀sensory⠀particulars—a⠀threshold,⠀a⠀scent,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀object⠀passed⠀between⠀hands—can⠀mark⠀what⠀desire⠀paid.⠀Record⠀the⠀cost⠀beside⠀the⠀deed,⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered:⠀the⠀price⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀aside⠀but⠀half⠀the⠀account.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀tragic⠀alternatives⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀voice—the⠀chronicler⠀notes⠀that⠀another⠀path⠀was⠀once⠀open,⠀that⠀a⠀warning⠀was⠀spoken⠀and⠀disregarded—so⠀the⠀fall⠀remains⠀chosen.\n\nRecognition⠀enters⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀revises⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀act⠀means,⠀not⠀only⠀as⠀private⠀grief⠀but⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀account's⠀community⠀will⠀remember.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority:⠀a⠀participant⠀corrects⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀passage⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀Keep⠀the⠀tradition⠀coherent⠀with⠀the⠀world⠀actually⠀supplied—no⠀imported⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀speech⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake—and⠀let⠀the⠀telling⠀leave⠀its⠀consequence⠀in⠀memory⠀rather⠀than⠀settling⠀every⠀meaning⠀on⠀the⠀listener's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀a⠀Norwegian⠀social-realist⠀fall⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀conditions⠀that⠀damage⠀a⠀life⠀are⠀also⠀the⠀surfaces⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀precision⠀can⠀render.⠀Make⠀the⠀domestic⠀and⠀institutional⠀texture⠀specific:⠀a⠀farm's⠀mortgage⠀reviewed⠀at⠀a⠀kitchen⠀table,⠀a⠀municipal⠀committee's⠀ruling⠀on⠀a⠀wharf⠀lease,⠀a⠀parish⠀list⠀where⠀a⠀name⠀appears⠀or⠀disappears,⠀a⠀workplace⠀hierarchy⠀enforced⠀through⠀who⠀pours⠀coffee⠀and⠀who⠀signs⠀the⠀ledger.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀carry⠀its⠀cost⠀inside⠀these⠀settings—the⠀good⠀silver⠀laid⠀out⠀for⠀the⠀bank⠀officer,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀wet⠀wool⠀and⠀paraffin⠀in⠀the⠀vestibule⠀where⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀refused,⠀the⠀grain⠀of⠀a⠀table⠀worn⠀by⠀a⠀parent⠀whose⠀promise⠀still⠀binds⠀the⠀household.\n\nLet⠀divided⠀attachment⠀take⠀a⠀social⠀shape⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀purely⠀private⠀one.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀caught⠀between⠀a⠀lover's⠀claim⠀and⠀a⠀duty⠀to⠀kin,⠀between⠀a⠀marriage⠀that⠀would⠀save⠀the⠀property⠀and⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀in⠀another⠀town,⠀between⠀loyalty⠀to⠀an⠀employer⠀and⠀loyalty⠀to⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀has⠀been⠀wronged.⠀Keep⠀the⠀competing⠀commitments⠀intelligible⠀through⠀the⠀institutions⠀that⠀enforce⠀them:⠀an⠀inheritance⠀clause,⠀a⠀lease⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀renewed,⠀a⠀reputation⠀that⠀affects⠀credit,⠀a⠀union⠀or⠀parish⠀decision⠀that⠀closes⠀one⠀route⠀and⠀opens⠀another.⠀Other⠀people⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀danger,⠀offer⠀a⠀real⠀alternative,⠀or⠀refuse⠀help⠀for⠀reasons⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow.\n\nUse⠀one⠀recurring⠀remembered⠀place⠀as⠀an⠀intimate⠀anchor,⠀and⠀tie⠀each⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀social⠀mechanism⠀of⠀the⠀fall.⠀A⠀boathouse⠀first⠀associated⠀with⠀courtship⠀may⠀later⠀be⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀a⠀contract⠀is⠀signed,⠀then⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀spoken,⠀then⠀the⠀place⠀sold⠀at⠀auction.⠀Let⠀the⠀sensory⠀details⠀gather⠀consequence—the⠀same⠀wet⠀rope,⠀the⠀same⠀painted⠀door—so⠀that⠀beauty⠀and⠀damage⠀share⠀the⠀image⠀rather⠀than⠀restate⠀nostalgia.\n\nWhen⠀recognition⠀arrives,⠀attach⠀it⠀to⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀a⠀house⠀lost⠀to⠀auction,⠀a⠀route⠀no⠀longer⠀traveled,⠀a⠀name⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀letter⠀delivered⠀too⠀late.⠀Write⠀the⠀recognition⠀as⠀knowledge⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀earlier⠀acts,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀sudden⠀moral⠀conversion.⠀Aftermath⠀may⠀include⠀endurance,⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀belated⠀reparation,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀keep⠀the⠀loss⠀real⠀rather⠀than⠀wiping⠀it⠀away.\n\nUse⠀ordinary⠀private⠀prose⠀for⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀presentation,⠀and⠀keep⠀another⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀conclusions.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀transform⠀the⠀narration⠀into⠀a⠀folktale⠀or⠀a⠀crime⠀investigation⠀unless⠀those⠀features⠀are⠀separately⠀authorized⠀by⠀the⠀world⠀contract.⠀The⠀response⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀during⠀continuing⠀attention,⠀waiting,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀completed⠀fall,⠀a⠀revelation,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀decision⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀itself⠀reaches⠀one.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀action⠀in⠀concise,⠀readable⠀screen⠀blocks.⠀Start⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes;⠀keep⠀the⠀heading⠀plain⠀and⠀functional.⠀Give⠀each⠀block⠀a⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀event⠀a⠀production⠀could⠀stage,⠀and⠀let⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀appear⠀in⠀selected⠀physical⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀situation:⠀a⠀silk⠀sleeve⠀catching⠀on⠀a⠀door⠀latch⠀as⠀a⠀character⠀leaves,⠀a⠀tray⠀of⠀fruit⠀set⠀down⠀too⠀hard⠀when⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀mentioned,⠀rain⠀on⠀glass⠀behind⠀a⠀conversation⠀about⠀a⠀marriage⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀happen.⠀Do⠀not⠀pile⠀description⠀into⠀the⠀action⠀lines;⠀let⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀precise⠀details⠀do⠀the⠀work.\n\nUse⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀dialogue⠀blocks.⠀Let⠀conversation⠀carry⠀the⠀incompatible⠀commitments—duty⠀to⠀a⠀parent,⠀a⠀lover's⠀claim,⠀a⠀business⠀promise,⠀a⠀debt⠀of⠀hospitality—and⠀let⠀each⠀character⠀speak⠀from⠀a⠀distinct⠀interest.⠀A⠀warning⠀or⠀an⠀alternative⠀should⠀be⠀intelligible⠀in⠀the⠀lines⠀themselves,⠀not⠀delivered⠀as⠀exposition.⠀When⠀a⠀pause⠀matters,⠀mark⠀it;⠀otherwise⠀leave⠀performance⠀choices⠀to⠀the⠀script's⠀economy.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀prose⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note,⠀separate⠀from⠀dialogue⠀and⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀inward⠀experience⠀contributes⠀recognition⠀or⠀motive,⠀write⠀it⠀in⠀that⠀note;⠀do⠀not⠀convert⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀voice-over⠀unless⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀specifically⠀needs⠀voice-over⠀and⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀No⠀other⠀character⠀should⠀react⠀to⠀that⠀hidden⠀content.\n\nMake⠀irreversible⠀choices⠀visible⠀through⠀movement⠀and⠀consequence.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀close⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀reopen,⠀leave⠀a⠀ring⠀on⠀a⠀counter,⠀tear⠀up⠀a⠀ticket,⠀or⠀tell⠀a⠀truth⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀unsaid.⠀Let⠀the⠀sensual⠀detail⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀choice:⠀the⠀same⠀silk⠀sleeve⠀is⠀smoothed⠀before⠀a⠀final⠀refusal,⠀the⠀same⠀tray⠀is⠀cleared⠀after⠀a⠀departure.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀has⠀seen⠀and⠀heard—a⠀repeated⠀object⠀handled⠀differently,⠀a⠀line⠀spoken⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context,⠀a⠀character's⠀movement⠀toward⠀or⠀away⠀from⠀a⠀familiar⠀place—not⠀from⠀a⠀caption⠀or⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.\n\nAvoid⠀camera⠀commands.⠀Use⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀advance⠀the⠀sequence,⠀not⠀as⠀decoration.⠀The⠀ending⠀may⠀occur⠀after⠀a⠀decisive⠀action,⠀during⠀continuing⠀movement⠀or⠀speech,⠀or⠀at⠀an⠀unfinished⠀moment;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀music⠀cue,⠀a⠀final⠀close-up,⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀denouement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances,⠀and⠀exits.⠀Every⠀character⠀who⠀enters⠀or⠀leaves⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀reason⠀and⠀a⠀physical⠀task:⠀bringing⠀tea,⠀checking⠀a⠀ledger,⠀closing⠀a⠀window,⠀putting⠀away⠀a⠀coat.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene,⠀and⠀let⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀live⠀in⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Describe⠀costume⠀or⠀prop⠀only⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀executed,⠀but⠀choose⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀cost:⠀a⠀faded⠀silk⠀collar⠀on⠀a⠀coat⠀kept⠀from⠀a⠀better⠀year,⠀a⠀chipped⠀cup⠀used⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀particular⠀guest⠀visits,⠀a⠀photograph⠀kept⠀inside⠀a⠀drawer⠀that⠀a⠀character⠀touches⠀before⠀making⠀a⠀promise.\n\nLet⠀an⠀object⠀recur⠀so⠀its⠀later⠀handling⠀changes⠀meaning⠀without⠀requiring⠀explanation.⠀A⠀jade⠀clasp,⠀a⠀key,⠀a⠀tray⠀of⠀oranges,⠀or⠀a⠀deed⠀may⠀be⠀handled⠀with⠀tenderness⠀in⠀one⠀scene,⠀set⠀down⠀with⠀finality⠀in⠀another,⠀and⠀left⠀behind⠀in⠀a⠀third.⠀The⠀audience⠀should⠀read⠀the⠀change⠀from⠀the⠀actor's⠀business⠀and⠀the⠀surrounding⠀lines,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator's⠀gloss.\n\nGive⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose.⠀A⠀monologue⠀may⠀articulate⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀plea,⠀a⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀recognition⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀safely⠀spoken⠀to⠀another⠀character.⠀Use⠀it⠀sparingly⠀and⠀as⠀public⠀performance,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀every⠀private⠀thought.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.\n\nShape⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀stage-able⠀choices.⠀Have⠀a⠀character⠀perform⠀an⠀irreversible⠀action⠀with⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀through⠀an⠀exit:⠀locking⠀a⠀door,⠀handing⠀over⠀a⠀deed,⠀turning⠀away⠀during⠀a⠀plea,⠀placing⠀the⠀recurring⠀object⠀where⠀another⠀character⠀will⠀find⠀it⠀too⠀late.⠀Keep⠀the⠀other⠀characters'⠀ignorance⠀visible—they⠀respond⠀only⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀see⠀and⠀hear⠀on⠀stage.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀silent⠀look,⠀a⠀pause,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀whose⠀earlier⠀meaning⠀the⠀audience⠀now⠀hears⠀differently,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀acted,⠀not⠀described.⠀Let⠀the⠀recognition⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀without⠀erasing⠀it.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.⠀Let⠀the⠀script's⠀exits,⠀objects,⠀and⠀speeches⠀do⠀the⠀work.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀immediately⠀after⠀a⠀decision,⠀during⠀an⠀unfinished⠀gesture,⠀or⠀as⠀a⠀character⠀remains⠀on⠀stage⠀with⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀a⠀single⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀and⠀private⠀words⠀braid⠀together,⠀but⠀keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀happens⠀now,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀feared⠀or⠀desired.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀inside⠀that⠀braid:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀jasmine⠀hair⠀oil,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀red⠀envelope,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀mahjong⠀tile,⠀the⠀cold⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀jade⠀bracelet.⠀Let⠀each⠀sensory⠀detail⠀carry⠀an⠀attachment⠀or⠀a⠀cost—the⠀jasmine⠀oil⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀is⠀leaving,⠀the⠀red⠀envelope⠀holds⠀money⠀that⠀was⠀borrowed,⠀the⠀jade⠀bracelet⠀is⠀the⠀one⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀sold.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀remembered⠀places⠀as⠀recurring⠀anchors,⠀and⠀tie⠀each⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀commitments⠀that⠀are⠀coming⠀apart.⠀A⠀corridor⠀first⠀remembered⠀with⠀a⠀lover⠀may⠀later⠀return⠀with⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀debt⠀being⠀refused,⠀later⠀still⠀with⠀a⠀name⠀no⠀longer⠀spoken.⠀Let⠀the⠀mind⠀return⠀under⠀pressure⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀scene—a⠀smell,⠀a⠀voice,⠀a⠀task—not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator's⠀thematic⠀summary.⠀The⠀place⠀should⠀gather⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀simply⠀repeat.\n\nShape⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀associative⠀junctures.⠀Incompatible⠀commitments⠀may⠀surface⠀as⠀recalled⠀arguments,⠀unfinished⠀sentences,⠀or⠀physical⠀discomfort⠀when⠀a⠀duty⠀is⠀mentioned:⠀a⠀tightening⠀in⠀the⠀chest⠀at⠀the⠀word⠀\"lease,\"⠀a⠀remembered⠀hand⠀pulling⠀away,⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀tea⠀at⠀a⠀meeting⠀where⠀a⠀promise⠀was⠀broken.⠀An⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀can⠀be⠀marked⠀by⠀a⠀sudden⠀halt⠀in⠀association,⠀a⠀reversal⠀of⠀attention,⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀mind⠀refuses⠀to⠀complete—the⠀moment⠀the⠀bracelet⠀left⠀the⠀wrist,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀opened,⠀the⠀sentence⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀finished.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀memory⠀understood⠀differently—why⠀a⠀person⠀looked⠀away,⠀what⠀an⠀unsent⠀message⠀said,⠀what⠀the⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀question⠀really⠀meant—rather⠀than⠀as⠀an⠀announced⠀insight.\n\nDo⠀not⠀give⠀every⠀character⠀the⠀same⠀associative⠀style.⠀Other⠀people⠀remain⠀outside⠀this⠀mind;⠀their⠀speech⠀and⠀actions⠀are⠀perceived⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀but⠀their⠀private⠀thoughts⠀are⠀not⠀dissolved⠀into⠀the⠀narration.⠀Keep⠀actual⠀events⠀legible:⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀what⠀happened⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀mind⠀loops⠀or⠀digresses.⠀Allow⠀interruptions—a⠀telephone,⠀a⠀customer,⠀a⠀cough—to⠀cut⠀across⠀recollection⠀and⠀press⠀the⠀present⠀forward.\n\nRegular⠀reasoning⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀enough:⠀create⠀movement⠀through⠀perception⠀and⠀recurrence,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀linear⠀argument.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀association,⠀an⠀incomplete⠀thought,⠀or⠀a⠀sensory⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀room.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nPresent⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable,⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀affect⠀the⠀meaning:⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀on⠀read⠀after⠀a⠀family⠀dinner,⠀a⠀late⠀reply⠀that⠀crosses⠀a⠀deadline,⠀a⠀photo⠀attachment⠀that⠀recalls⠀a⠀shared⠀market⠀stall.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀be⠀distinct—one⠀writes⠀long⠀paragraphs,⠀one⠀sends⠀single⠀words,⠀one⠀edits⠀repeatedly,⠀one⠀ignores⠀group⠀chat—and⠀let⠀those⠀habits⠀carry⠀their⠀commitments⠀and⠀evasions.\n\nKeep⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀inside⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀actually⠀transmit,⠀and⠀tie⠀each⠀detail⠀to⠀the⠀cost⠀or⠀attachment⠀at⠀stake.⠀A⠀message⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀dress⠀fitting⠀for⠀a⠀wedding⠀that⠀is⠀being⠀arranged⠀against⠀the⠀sender's⠀wish,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀incense⠀at⠀a⠀temple⠀where⠀a⠀promise⠀was⠀made,⠀the⠀exact⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀bruise⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀hidden,⠀or⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀letter⠀discovered⠀in⠀a⠀drawer.⠀The⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀shared⠀photographs⠀or⠀remembered⠀details,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀message⠀and⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀the⠀message⠀is⠀negotiating,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀invisible⠀narrator's⠀lyric⠀aside.\n\nDistinguish⠀sent⠀messages⠀from⠀unsent⠀drafts⠀and⠀private⠀thought.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀types⠀then⠀deletes,⠀show⠀the⠀draft⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀non-transmitted⠀item⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀presentation⠀permits⠀it.⠀Required⠀private⠀interiority⠀remains⠀a⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript;⠀another⠀character⠀cannot⠀know⠀it.⠀A⠀delayed⠀reply⠀or⠀an⠀edit⠀receipt⠀may⠀hint⠀at⠀hesitation,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀transcript⠀claim⠀knowledge⠀of⠀an⠀unsent⠀mind.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀transmitted⠀acts.⠀An⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀message⠀sent⠀after⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀forwarded⠀screenshot,⠀a⠀block,⠀or⠀the⠀exact⠀words⠀that⠀end⠀a⠀negotiation.⠀Let⠀the⠀choice⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀message⠀record⠀itself:⠀the⠀timestamp⠀that⠀shows⠀a⠀reply⠀came⠀too⠀late,⠀the⠀attachment⠀that⠀was⠀opened⠀but⠀never⠀answered,⠀the⠀contact⠀removed⠀after⠀a⠀final⠀exchange.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀come⠀when⠀an⠀earlier⠀message⠀is⠀re-read⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context,⠀when⠀a⠀timestamp⠀reveals⠀a⠀lie,⠀or⠀when⠀two⠀people⠀react⠀differently⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀attachment.⠀Let⠀the⠀loss⠀be⠀real⠀and⠀preserved⠀in⠀the⠀record:⠀a⠀final⠀message,⠀a⠀removed⠀contact,⠀a⠀thread⠀that⠀stops⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀resumed.\n\nContext⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀needed,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀message⠀is⠀sent⠀or⠀while⠀a⠀reply⠀is⠀being⠀typed,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaoba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀concise⠀setting⠀block:⠀time,⠀place,⠀and⠀a⠀few⠀visual⠀or⠀sensory⠀details⠀that⠀a⠀reader⠀could⠀picture.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀there,⠀but⠀tie⠀each⠀detail⠀to⠀the⠀cost⠀or⠀attachment⠀at⠀stake—red⠀paper⠀cutouts⠀in⠀a⠀doorway⠀where⠀a⠀marriage⠀is⠀being⠀arranged,⠀the⠀shine⠀of⠀pomade⠀on⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀is⠀leaving,⠀the⠀sour-sweet⠀smell⠀of⠀vinegar⠀at⠀a⠀food⠀stall⠀where⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀discussed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀description⠀brief;⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀move⠀forward⠀through⠀dialogue⠀and⠀focal⠀reaction.\n\nAttribute⠀dialogue⠀clearly.⠀Let⠀conversation⠀carry⠀the⠀incompatible⠀commitments:⠀a⠀family⠀debt,⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀an⠀employer,⠀a⠀lover's⠀demand,⠀a⠀duty⠀to⠀remain⠀in⠀a⠀certain⠀city.⠀Characters⠀should⠀speak⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀concerns,⠀allowing⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀to⠀be⠀intelligible⠀without⠀becoming⠀lectures.⠀Repetition⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀or⠀address⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀tonal⠀marker,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀it⠀into⠀every⠀exchange;⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀the⠀loss⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀weight.\n\nWrite⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀where⠀it⠀actually⠀matters.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀recognizes⠀a⠀consequence,⠀remembers⠀a⠀place,⠀or⠀notices⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀beauty,⠀provide⠀that⠀as⠀private⠀prose.⠀Keep⠀that⠀interiority⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀orient⠀the⠀moment—a⠀corridor's⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀character's⠀turned⠀face—but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator;⠀the⠀actual⠀evidence⠀remains⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀done.\n\nShape⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀scene⠀decisions.⠀An⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀may⠀be⠀shown⠀as⠀a⠀character⠀paying⠀a⠀debt,⠀destroying⠀a⠀photograph,⠀refusing⠀a⠀train⠀ticket,⠀or⠀accepting⠀a⠀marriage⠀arrangement.⠀Let⠀the⠀choice⠀be⠀prepared⠀by⠀the⠀scene's⠀sensory⠀details:⠀the⠀red⠀paper⠀cutouts⠀are⠀taken⠀down⠀after⠀the⠀refusal,⠀the⠀pomade⠀is⠀washed⠀off⠀after⠀the⠀departure,⠀the⠀vinegar⠀smell⠀lingers⠀in⠀the⠀empty⠀stall.⠀Recognition⠀can⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀when⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀or⠀repeated⠀line⠀is⠀heard⠀differently—the⠀same⠀doorway⠀now⠀undecorated,⠀the⠀same⠀address⠀spoken⠀by⠀a⠀stranger.⠀Keep⠀the⠀loss⠀meaningful:⠀the⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀reset⠀after⠀the⠀choice,⠀and⠀the⠀aftermath⠀may⠀include⠀silence,⠀avoidance,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀household.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀engine⠀commands.⠀This⠀is⠀a⠀single⠀narrative⠀sequence.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀spoken⠀line,⠀during⠀continuing⠀action,⠀or⠀at⠀an⠀unfinished⠀moment;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀decision⠀screen⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaobb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀installments⠀as⠀continuous⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀what-is-underway.⠀Open⠀a⠀reply⠀by⠀briefly⠀recovering⠀only⠀the⠀particular⠀that⠀matters⠀for⠀re-entry:⠀the⠀unfinished⠀errand,⠀the⠀person⠀waiting⠀in⠀the⠀other⠀room,⠀the⠀letter⠀whose⠀sender⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀named.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀previous⠀installment.⠀Then⠀advance⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀through⠀concrete⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue,⠀letting⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀appear⠀in⠀specific⠀objects⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀situation—wet⠀jasmine⠀on⠀a⠀windowsill⠀where⠀a⠀farewell⠀was⠀said,⠀a⠀torn⠀seam⠀on⠀a⠀qipao⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀mended⠀for⠀a⠀wedding⠀the⠀wearer⠀does⠀not⠀want,⠀the⠀oily⠀gleam⠀of⠀roast⠀meat⠀under⠀a⠀stall⠀lamp⠀where⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀being⠀negotiated.\n\nLet⠀remembered⠀places⠀recur⠀across⠀installments,⠀and⠀tie⠀each⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀commitments⠀that⠀are⠀coming⠀apart.⠀A⠀teahouse,⠀a⠀ferry⠀landing,⠀a⠀family⠀shop,⠀or⠀a⠀hotel⠀corridor⠀first⠀seen⠀with⠀a⠀lover⠀can⠀return⠀later⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning:⠀the⠀same⠀teahouse⠀where⠀a⠀promise⠀was⠀made⠀becomes⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀promise⠀is⠀broken,⠀the⠀same⠀ferry⠀landing⠀where⠀a⠀departure⠀was⠀delayed⠀becomes⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀no⠀one⠀arrives.⠀Use⠀sensory⠀particulars⠀to⠀anchor⠀the⠀return,⠀but⠀add⠀new⠀information⠀or⠀consequence⠀each⠀time;⠀do⠀not⠀simply⠀describe⠀the⠀same⠀place⠀again.\n\nCarry⠀divided⠀attachment⠀through⠀the⠀serial⠀arc.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remain⠀caught⠀between⠀love⠀and⠀duty,⠀jealousy⠀and⠀generosity,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀in⠀one⠀city⠀and⠀a⠀life⠀possible⠀in⠀another.⠀Let⠀the⠀competing⠀commitments⠀be⠀intelligible⠀in⠀each⠀installment,⠀and⠀let⠀other⠀people⠀offer⠀real⠀alternatives.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀should⠀emerge⠀over⠀time⠀from⠀choices⠀and⠀social⠀conditions,⠀not⠀from⠀every⠀reply⠀containing⠀a⠀fresh⠀catastrophe.⠀Let⠀the⠀sensual⠀details⠀accumulate⠀the⠀cost:⠀the⠀jasmine⠀wilts,⠀the⠀seam⠀is⠀mended⠀and⠀then⠀torn⠀again,⠀the⠀stall⠀lamp⠀goes⠀dark.\n\nWrite⠀recognition⠀when⠀the⠀arc⠀reaches⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀choice⠀only⠀after⠀seeing⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀hearing⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀or⠀failing⠀to⠀reach⠀someone⠀in⠀time.⠀Let⠀that⠀recognition⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀the⠀earlier⠀sensory⠀anchors—the⠀jasmine⠀was⠀already⠀wilting,⠀the⠀seam⠀was⠀already⠀strained,⠀the⠀lamp⠀was⠀already⠀flickering.⠀The⠀following⠀installments⠀should⠀keep⠀the⠀aftermath⠀active—absence,⠀debt,⠀silence,⠀a⠀changed⠀daily⠀route—without⠀erasing⠀the⠀loss⠀through⠀a⠀quick⠀reversal.\n\nDo⠀not⠀end⠀every⠀reply⠀with⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter.⠀A⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀pauses,⠀an⠀errand⠀that⠀remains⠀half-done,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀sent,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀left⠀alone⠀with⠀a⠀decision.⠀Use⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀when⠀earned,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀serial⠀form⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀demand⠀a⠀twist⠀each⠀time.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nBuild⠀each⠀turbulent⠀beat⠀from⠀an⠀observable⠀social⠀act⠀the⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀narrator⠀would⠀accept⠀as⠀normal:⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀meal⠀served⠀too⠀punctually,⠀an⠀apology⠀spoken⠀in⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀withheld⠀glance⠀across⠀a⠀shared⠀desk.⠀Select⠀the⠀detail⠀before⠀judging⠀it.⠀The⠀feeling⠀enters⠀through⠀the⠀act's⠀cost—who⠀must⠀keep⠀speaking,⠀who⠀must⠀wait,⠀who⠀is⠀answered⠀only⠀in⠀practical⠀terms.\n\nLet⠀speech⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀diverge⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀stop⠀mid