ee⠀alternatives—someone⠀could⠀refuse⠀to⠀bow,⠀another⠀could⠀speak⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment—but⠀they⠀are⠀intelligibly⠀costly,⠀and⠀the⠀characters⠀may⠀remain⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention⠀even⠀when⠀they⠀choose⠀the⠀destructive⠀path.\n\nKeep⠀speech⠀plain,⠀sometimes⠀evasive.⠀Families⠀and⠀neighbors⠀talk⠀around⠀the⠀real⠀problem⠀using⠀honor⠀words⠀and⠀practical⠀excuses.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀recognition⠀can⠀show⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀routine⠀or⠀a⠀sentence⠀someone⠀fails⠀to⠀finish;⠀it⠀may⠀also⠀surface⠀in⠀a⠀public⠀act⠀whose⠀cost⠀the⠀narrator⠀records⠀without⠀comment.⠀Preserve⠀ordinary⠀warmth⠀inside⠀the⠀household—a⠀bowl⠀of⠀hot⠀water,⠀a⠀coat⠀mended—so⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀symbolic.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nCut⠀transit⠀between⠀actions.⠀Move⠀from⠀one⠀concrete⠀shot⠀to⠀the⠀next:⠀the⠀broken⠀lock,⠀the⠀cracked⠀heel,⠀the⠀smear⠀of⠀ash⠀on⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀coin⠀held⠀out⠀and⠀withdrawn.⠀Use⠀short⠀sentences⠀when⠀the⠀physical⠀fact⠀is⠀the⠀feeling.⠀A⠀stone⠀is⠀cold;⠀a⠀roof⠀leaks;⠀a⠀thumb⠀rubs⠀the⠀same⠀rough⠀patch⠀until⠀the⠀skin⠀hurts.⠀Ground⠀every⠀turn⠀in⠀the⠀body's⠀labor:⠀lifting,⠀dividing,⠀sweeping,⠀wheeling,⠀waiting⠀at⠀a⠀gate.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀meaning;⠀let⠀the⠀worn⠀object⠀carry⠀it.\n\nMake⠀institutions⠀visible⠀through⠀gear⠀and⠀routine.⠀Show⠀a⠀school⠀register⠀with⠀corners⠀chewed⠀by⠀damp,⠀a⠀clinic⠀cabinet⠀locked⠀with⠀wire,⠀a⠀cadre's⠀pen⠀that⠀skips,⠀a⠀hundred-year-old⠀scale⠀no⠀one⠀trusts⠀but⠀everyone⠀uses.⠀The⠀tragic⠀pressure⠀arises⠀when⠀someone⠀must⠀rely⠀on⠀exactly⠀this⠀untrustworthy⠀mechanism⠀for⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀survival⠀or⠀honor.⠀Keep⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀specific⠀and⠀real;⠀hardness⠀is⠀the⠀style,⠀not⠀a⠀demand⠀for⠀constant⠀cruelty.\n\nAllow⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀calculating⠀or⠀remembering⠀why⠀a⠀demand⠀must⠀be⠀met.⠀Otherwise⠀keep⠀the⠀mind⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀task.⠀Change⠀rhythm⠀deliberately:⠀a⠀slow⠀paragraph⠀for⠀the⠀waiting⠀and⠀a⠀rapid⠀sequence⠀when⠀a⠀load⠀slips⠀or⠀a⠀road⠀is⠀crossed.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀be⠀physical—a⠀hand⠀that⠀knows⠀the⠀answer⠀before⠀the⠀mouth,⠀or⠀a⠀man⠀setting⠀down⠀something⠀he⠀will⠀not⠀pick⠀up⠀again—but⠀it⠀may⠀also⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀task.⠀Let⠀the⠀fall⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀accumulated⠀reliance⠀on⠀worn⠀things,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀forced⠀final⠀gesture.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCompose⠀the⠀sequence⠀as⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀purpose,⠀and⠀date.⠀Use⠀plain,⠀purposeful⠀language⠀suited⠀to⠀each⠀form:⠀a⠀family⠀letter⠀that⠀asks⠀for⠀a⠀small⠀loan⠀and⠀apologizes⠀for⠀the⠀tone,⠀a⠀village⠀notice⠀that⠀lists⠀a⠀name⠀among⠀arrears,⠀an⠀account⠀slip⠀with⠀sums⠀erased⠀and⠀rewritten,⠀a⠀doctor's⠀note⠀that⠀records⠀symptoms⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀conversation⠀before⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀all-knowing⠀summary⠀after⠀a⠀document.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀work⠀across⠀gaps.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀what⠀each⠀writer⠀omits⠀or⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀formal⠀report⠀may⠀praise⠀a⠀school's⠀progress⠀while⠀a⠀margin⠀note⠀records⠀the⠀teacher's⠀transfer;⠀a⠀letter⠀home⠀may⠀avoid⠀mentioning⠀a⠀wound⠀to⠀protect⠀the⠀reader.⠀Show⠀social⠀damage⠀in⠀formality:⠀honorifics⠀that⠀appear⠀or⠀disappear,⠀a⠀receipt⠀signed⠀by⠀an⠀illiterate⠀neighbor⠀with⠀a⠀cross,⠀a⠀printed⠀form⠀that⠀has⠀no⠀space⠀for⠀the⠀actual⠀reason.\n\nPermit⠀documents⠀to⠀be⠀revised⠀or⠀to⠀conflict.⠀A⠀later⠀letter⠀can⠀contradict⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀without⠀explaining⠀the⠀change.⠀Material⠀condition⠀matters—a⠀torn⠀corner,⠀a⠀different⠀ink,⠀a⠀line⠀scratched⠀out—but⠀use⠀it⠀sparingly.⠀Build⠀tragedy⠀through⠀the⠀unreturned⠀request,⠀the⠀notice⠀that⠀arrives⠀too⠀late,⠀the⠀account⠀that⠀finally⠀balances⠀at⠀a⠀cost⠀no⠀writer⠀names.⠀Recognition⠀can⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀whose⠀brevity⠀or⠀formality⠀carries⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning:⠀a⠀reply⠀with⠀one⠀sentence,⠀an⠀entry⠀in⠀a⠀registry,⠀a⠀note⠀kept⠀in⠀a⠀sleeve.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀dramatic⠀confession⠀in⠀every⠀piece.⠀Let⠀the⠀documents⠀remain⠀what⠀their⠀authors⠀would⠀actually⠀have⠀written.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nPlace⠀comfort⠀in⠀the⠀ordinary⠀made⠀tender⠀and⠀concrete:⠀a⠀child's⠀coat⠀turned⠀so⠀the⠀warm⠀side⠀faces⠀inward,⠀a⠀bowl⠀of⠀congee⠀salted⠀exactly⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀preference,⠀a⠀seat⠀cleared⠀without⠀being⠀asked.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀eye⠀on⠀the⠀physical⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀affection.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀observation⠀gives⠀the⠀warmth⠀its⠀dignity;⠀no⠀character⠀must⠀announce⠀how⠀much⠀it⠀matters.\n\nLet⠀preferences⠀and⠀small⠀rituals⠀belong⠀to⠀specific⠀people.⠀One⠀likes⠀the⠀window⠀cracked,⠀another⠀folds⠀sleeves⠀twice,⠀a⠀third⠀refuses⠀help⠀until⠀the⠀work⠀is⠀nearly⠀finished.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀accept⠀comfort⠀with⠀annoyance,⠀or⠀provide⠀it⠀while⠀still⠀angry.⠀The⠀disagreement⠀remains⠀real,⠀even⠀when⠀a⠀blanket⠀is⠀shared⠀or⠀a⠀cup⠀is⠀refilled.\n\nUse⠀comfort⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc.⠀The⠀precise⠀care⠀can⠀make⠀visible⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀lose⠀or⠀already⠀cannot⠀restore.⠀In⠀the⠀aftermath,⠀the⠀same⠀familiar⠀object—a⠀repaired⠀shoe,⠀a⠀preserved⠀fruit,⠀a⠀child's⠀schoolbook—can⠀become⠀evidence⠀of⠀a⠀bond⠀that⠀remains⠀in⠀daily⠀life⠀without⠀repairing⠀the⠀larger⠀damage.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀emotional⠀confession⠀or⠀complete⠀repair.⠀Sincere⠀care⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀unspoken⠀grief.⠀The⠀story⠀should⠀retain⠀the⠀loss;⠀the⠀comfort⠀makes⠀the⠀loss⠀particular⠀and⠀the⠀surviving⠀warmth⠀credible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀in⠀deliberate⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀room⠀to⠀a⠀courtyard,⠀from⠀a⠀private⠀exchange⠀to⠀a⠀public⠀notice,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀alters⠀shape⠀under⠀the⠀larger⠀view.⠀Use⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀hold⠀the⠀personal⠀fact⠀inside⠀its⠀social⠀frame:⠀a⠀letter⠀read⠀once⠀at⠀home⠀and⠀again⠀in⠀a⠀magistrate's⠀office;⠀a⠀child's⠀illness⠀discussed⠀over⠀a⠀meal⠀and⠀then⠀recorded⠀as⠀a⠀number⠀in⠀a⠀ledger.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀meaning;⠀let⠀the⠀framing⠀produce⠀it.\n\nChoose⠀a⠀selecting⠀intelligence⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀all-explaining⠀voice.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀know⠀family⠀history,⠀the⠀value⠀of⠀a⠀field,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀village⠀said⠀last⠀year,⠀without⠀knowing⠀what⠀the⠀central⠀character⠀is⠀thinking.⠀This⠀allows⠀private⠀grief⠀to⠀emerge⠀through⠀its⠀visible⠀effects.⠀When⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast,⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀repeated⠀objects⠀or⠀routines:⠀the⠀chair⠀that⠀is⠀moved⠀for⠀a⠀guest,⠀the⠀sleeve⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀forgiven⠀by⠀washing.\n\nLet⠀ceremony⠀and⠀official⠀occasion⠀work⠀as⠀plot⠀turns,⠀not⠀decoration.⠀A⠀funeral,⠀contract-signing,⠀harvest⠀inspection,⠀or⠀the⠀receipt⠀of⠀a⠀school⠀certificate⠀can⠀crystallize⠀a⠀commitment⠀that⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀avoided.⠀Keep⠀speech⠀more⠀formal⠀in⠀the⠀public⠀setting⠀and⠀closer⠀in⠀the⠀family,⠀but⠀remain⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀place.⠀A⠀final⠀recognition⠀may⠀occupy⠀a⠀long⠀paragraph⠀of⠀waiting⠀or⠀quiet⠀movement;⠀it⠀may⠀also⠀surface⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀framed⠀detail⠀whose⠀social⠀meaning⠀the⠀narrator⠀records⠀without⠀comment.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀changed⠀order⠀of⠀things.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀outer⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀occasion⠀of⠀telling:⠀a⠀worker,⠀student,⠀neighbor,⠀or⠀former⠀official⠀speaks⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀room⠀or⠀street,⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀whose⠀attention⠀has⠀practical⠀reasons.⠀The⠀teller⠀uses⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀to⠀justify⠀a⠀choice,⠀request⠀mercy,⠀preserve⠀a⠀reputation,⠀or⠀postpone⠀an⠀unavoidable⠀admission.⠀The⠀listener's⠀decision⠀to⠀remain,⠀interrupt,⠀or⠀walk⠀away⠀is⠀itself⠀an⠀act⠀that⠀grants⠀or⠀refuses⠀what⠀the⠀tale⠀requests.\n\nCompose⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀with⠀clean,⠀unsentimental⠀observation.⠀Show⠀the⠀damage⠀through⠀ordinary⠀events:⠀a⠀delayed⠀train,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀coat,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀ledger,⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀that⠀once⠀meant⠀safety.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀injury;⠀let⠀the⠀teller's⠀emphasis⠀and⠀omissions⠀reveal⠀which⠀institution⠀or⠀habit⠀made⠀the⠀loss⠀ordinary.⠀Keep⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀anchored⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene—its⠀wording⠀answers⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀listener⠀asked,⠀repeats⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀listener⠀saw,⠀or⠀stops⠀where⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀continue.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀across⠀the⠀levels⠀as⠀a⠀recognition⠀device.⠀Establish⠀one⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀gesture⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀before⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀begins.⠀Let⠀it⠀return⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀function,⠀then⠀appear⠀again⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀after⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀is⠀the⠀teller's⠀prior⠀knowledge:⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀already⠀understood⠀during⠀the⠀embedded⠀events⠀but⠀withheld⠀from⠀the⠀account.⠀When⠀that⠀knowledge⠀surfaces,⠀the⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀changes⠀meaning⠀for⠀the⠀listener,⠀and⠀the⠀loss⠀becomes⠀legible⠀as⠀irreversible—a⠀choice⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀taken⠀back,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀outer⠀response⠀as⠀the⠀tragedy's⠀aftermath.⠀The⠀listener⠀refuses⠀aid,⠀repeats⠀the⠀teller's⠀phrase⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning,⠀or⠀silently⠀records⠀the⠀tale⠀for⠀an⠀institution.⠀If⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀changes⠀the⠀teller's⠀position—a⠀confession⠀now⠀heard,⠀a⠀request⠀now⠀denied—that⠀shift⠀is⠀the⠀final⠀recognition.⠀End⠀with⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀moral⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀universal⠀statement.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀distance⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own:⠀first⠀person⠀is⠀permitted⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator⠀is⠀a⠀participant⠀in⠀the⠀occasion;⠀otherwise⠀keep⠀the⠀observer's⠀restraint.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social-realist⠀route.⠀Treat⠀a⠀room,⠀workplace,⠀street,⠀or⠀household⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀social⠀system:⠀notice⠀its⠀procedures,⠀its⠀ordinary⠀permissions,⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀people⠀adjust⠀their⠀behavior⠀to⠀survive⠀it.⠀Use⠀clean,⠀unsentimental⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀observation⠀to⠀let⠀an⠀institution⠀become⠀visible⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀an⠀unpaid⠀sum,⠀a⠀rule⠀no⠀one⠀questions,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀without⠀belief.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀a⠀developmental⠀fall.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀choosing⠀among⠀intelligible⠀alternatives⠀and⠀moving⠀toward⠀the⠀harmful⠀one⠀through⠀duty,⠀pride,⠀a⠀mistaken⠀judgment⠀of⠀another⠀person,⠀or⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀conditions⠀that⠀are⠀real⠀but⠀not⠀inevitable.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀character⠀foolish.⠀Keep⠀their⠀choices⠀legible,⠀and⠀let⠀readers⠀see⠀what⠀the⠀chosen⠀course⠀will⠀cost⠀before⠀the⠀character⠀admits⠀it.⠀Warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀may⠀appear,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀remain⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀abstract⠀moral⠀commentary.\n\nUse⠀the⠀German-language⠀realist⠀tradition⠀for⠀social⠀notation⠀and⠀causal⠀clarity,⠀not⠀for⠀heaviness⠀or⠀bureaucratic⠀depth.⠀When⠀syntax⠀carries⠀social⠀distance,⠀let⠀it⠀follow⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀position:⠀an⠀observer⠀may⠀use⠀subordinate⠀clauses⠀to⠀hold⠀a⠀judgment⠀at⠀arm's⠀length;⠀a⠀participant⠀may⠀use⠀parataxis⠀and⠀concrete⠀action.⠀Keep⠀sentences⠀economical;⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀restraint⠀should⠀discipline⠀German⠀realism's⠀periodic⠀sentence,⠀not⠀disappear⠀under⠀it.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀occur⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀or⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀already⠀present⠀earlier⠀in⠀the⠀story—a⠀ledger⠀entry,⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀at⠀the⠀start,⠀a⠀chair⠀left⠀empty⠀at⠀a⠀table—and⠀sees⠀what⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀has⠀already⠀done.⠀This⠀return⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀loss⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀confirming⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀conclude⠀with⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture⠀about⠀the⠀institution.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀irreversible⠀consequence:⠀the⠀changed⠀relation,⠀the⠀lost⠀trust,⠀the⠀unrecovered⠀sum,⠀the⠀room⠀now⠀empty.⠀Preserve⠀a⠀narrator⠀whose⠀normality⠀reveals⠀the⠀damage,⠀not⠀one⠀who⠀announces⠀its⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nPlace⠀the⠀tragedy⠀where⠀inherited⠀authority⠀touches⠀present⠀life:⠀a⠀family⠀name⠀still⠀governs⠀a⠀building,⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀debt⠀still⠀delays⠀a⠀marriage,⠀an⠀old⠀right⠀still⠀determines⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀a⠀room.⠀Use⠀Gothic-Punk's⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀to⠀make⠀that⠀authority⠀tangible—the⠀worn⠀enamel⠀sign,⠀the⠀locked⠀roof⠀door,⠀the⠀peeling⠀paint⠀that⠀marks⠀the⠀privileged⠀corridor.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀itself⠀a⠀claim;⠀state⠀the⠀material⠀fact⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀social⠀weight⠀come⠀through⠀clean⠀observation.\n\nWrite⠀one⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimate⠀relation⠀as⠀the⠀axis⠀of⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀authority⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀parent,⠀patron,⠀former⠀friend,⠀or⠀employer⠀whose⠀old⠀power⠀now⠀operates⠀through⠀a⠀modern⠀instrument:⠀a⠀lease,⠀a⠀hospital⠀visitation⠀rule,⠀a⠀personal⠀loan,⠀a⠀reputation.⠀Show⠀the⠀private⠀desire,⠀gratitude,⠀shame,⠀or⠀distrust⠀that⠀binds⠀the⠀central⠀figure⠀to⠀this⠀authority.⠀Let⠀social⠀masks⠀fall⠀only⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀and⠀show⠀what⠀that⠀unmasking⠀costs.⠀The⠀institution⠀should⠀become⠀visible⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act—a⠀key⠀handed⠀over,⠀a⠀name⠀written⠀in⠀the⠀ledger,⠀a⠀dismissal⠀offered⠀as⠀politeness.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tragic⠀fall⠀causal⠀and⠀legible.⠀Alternate⠀the⠀character's⠀inner⠀reasoning⠀with⠀visible⠀consequences,⠀using⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀economy.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀chooses,⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀believe⠀they⠀are⠀preserving⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀actually⠀giving⠀up.⠀Recognition⠀occurs⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀material⠀detail⠀that⠀appeared⠀earlier⠀in⠀the⠀story—the⠀old⠀man's⠀initials⠀in⠀the⠀hallway,⠀the⠀photograph⠀behind⠀the⠀counter,⠀the⠀unpaid⠀bill⠀from⠀the⠀previous⠀spring—and⠀connects⠀it⠀to⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost.⠀Let⠀that⠀connection⠀alter⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀loss⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀intensify⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀as⠀an⠀instrument⠀of⠀attention:⠀a⠀room⠀can⠀smell⠀of⠀damp⠀paper,⠀a⠀boot⠀can⠀scrape⠀on⠀worn⠀stone,⠀a⠀neon⠀sign⠀can⠀flicker⠀over⠀a⠀family⠀emblem.⠀These⠀sensory⠀details⠀should⠀always⠀serve⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter,⠀never⠀replace⠀motive⠀or⠀consequence.⠀End⠀with⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored—a⠀relationship,⠀a⠀home,⠀a⠀self-respect⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀has⠀quietly⠀taken.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀supernatural⠀powers,⠀factions,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules;⠀the⠀horror⠀is⠀social⠀and⠀personal,⠀not⠀occult.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route.⠀Center⠀the⠀story⠀on⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀wedding,⠀a⠀property⠀division,⠀or⠀an⠀exchange⠀of⠀care⠀between⠀relatives.⠀Observe⠀the⠀household's⠀procedures⠀closely:⠀who⠀is⠀consulted,⠀whose⠀income⠀is⠀counted,⠀whose⠀silence⠀is⠀expected,⠀what⠀is⠀written⠀down⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀to⠀memory.⠀Let⠀the⠀institution⠀become⠀visible⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act—a⠀brother's⠀signature,⠀a⠀daughter's⠀unpaid⠀travel⠀fare,⠀a⠀ledger⠀kept⠀in⠀a⠀sari⠀border,⠀a⠀feast⠀prepared⠀but⠀not⠀shared.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀or⠀an⠀English-language⠀setting.⠀Use⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀observation⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀small⠀humiliation⠀beneath⠀the⠀polite⠀arrangement:⠀a⠀bride's⠀name⠀spelled⠀differently⠀in⠀two⠀documents,⠀a⠀son⠀who⠀is⠀not⠀told⠀the⠀full⠀debt,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀asks⠀the⠀wrong⠀question⠀with⠀perfect⠀courtesy.\n\nThe⠀loss⠀should⠀be⠀irreversible⠀and⠀particular.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀lost⠀house,⠀a⠀broken⠀engagement,⠀an⠀abandoned⠀education,⠀a⠀disowned⠀son,⠀or⠀a⠀sister⠀sent⠀away⠀before⠀her⠀wedding⠀gifts⠀were⠀counted.⠀Build⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀a⠀choice⠀among⠀intelligible⠀alternatives:⠀a⠀father⠀decides⠀between⠀his⠀sister's⠀hospital⠀bill⠀and⠀his⠀daughter's⠀education;⠀a⠀daughter⠀decides⠀whether⠀to⠀expose⠀a⠀brother's⠀theft⠀before⠀the⠀family⠀property⠀is⠀divided;⠀a⠀mother⠀decides⠀whether⠀her⠀grandson⠀may⠀eat⠀first⠀while⠀the⠀employer's⠀ledger⠀remains⠀open⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀choice⠀melodramatic⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀foolish.⠀Let⠀the⠀alternatives⠀be⠀specific⠀and⠀hard.\n\nShow⠀recognition⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀or⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀already⠀present⠀earlier⠀in⠀the⠀story—a⠀ledger⠀entry,⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀at⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀room⠀arranged⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀will⠀not⠀return—and⠀sees⠀its⠀changed⠀function⠀within⠀the⠀household's⠀procedures.⠀The⠀same⠀ledger⠀that⠀once⠀recorded⠀a⠀loan⠀may⠀now⠀record⠀a⠀child's⠀wedding⠀gift;⠀the⠀phrase⠀\"you⠀have⠀eaten⠀at⠀our⠀table\"⠀may⠀become⠀an⠀accusation.⠀Use⠀one⠀such⠀concrete⠀recurrence⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀turn.⠀End⠀with⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀undone:⠀a⠀room⠀still⠀arranged⠀for⠀a⠀son⠀who⠀will⠀not⠀return,⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀has⠀transferred⠀a⠀field,⠀a⠀word⠀spoken⠀at⠀a⠀wedding⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀recalled.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture⠀about⠀caste,⠀religion,⠀or⠀honor⠀unless⠀those⠀facts⠀are⠀already⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story⠀setting;⠀let⠀the⠀damage⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀observed⠀social⠀texture.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/psychological⠀realism⠀route,⠀with⠀the⠀reflective⠀miscellany's⠀attention⠀to⠀particular⠀objects,⠀seasons,⠀and⠀personal⠀habits.⠀Write⠀the⠀tragedy⠀in⠀a⠀concrete,⠀socially⠀legible⠀setting—a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀rented⠀room,⠀a⠀family⠀gathering,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀errand—and⠀observe⠀it⠀with⠀clean⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀restraint.⠀Let⠀an⠀institution⠀appear⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀ordinary⠀act:⠀a⠀name⠀left⠀off⠀a⠀distribution⠀list,⠀a⠀tea⠀poured⠀before⠀the⠀guest⠀who⠀can⠀help,⠀a⠀ration⠀book⠀turned⠀the⠀wrong⠀way,⠀a⠀photograph⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀shelf.\n\nPay⠀careful⠀attention⠀to⠀ordinary⠀surroundings⠀without⠀making⠀them⠀decorative.⠀A⠀cold⠀corridor,⠀a⠀view⠀of⠀a⠀bare⠀tree,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀gate,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀drying⠀leaves⠀can⠀indicate⠀the⠀season⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀situation,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀always⠀attach⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀perception.⠀Do⠀not⠀present⠀a⠀mandatory⠀seasonal⠀inventory.⠀Show⠀the⠀character's⠀inner⠀life⠀through⠀their⠀attention,⠀omissions,⠀and⠀small⠀routines,⠀using⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀as⠀fits⠀the⠀authoring⠀contract.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀a⠀psychological⠀development,⠀not⠀a⠀sudden⠀catastrophe.\n\nLet⠀the⠀loss⠀accumulate⠀in⠀observed⠀details.⠀A⠀co-worker's⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀bus⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀stops⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀corner,⠀a⠀job⠀advertisement⠀read⠀without⠀hope.⠀The⠀character's⠀fall⠀should⠀be⠀causally⠀legible:⠀a⠀choice⠀made⠀for⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀pride⠀that⠀prevents⠀admitting⠀error,⠀a⠀mistaken⠀belief⠀about⠀another⠀person's⠀loyalty.⠀Allow⠀alternatives⠀to⠀be⠀visible:⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀have⠀asked,⠀could⠀have⠀refused,⠀could⠀have⠀stayed⠀home⠀that⠀evening.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀them⠀stupid.\n\nRecognition⠀arrives⠀as⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀ordinary⠀sequence⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀detail⠀already⠀present⠀earlier⠀in⠀the⠀story—a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀wrapper,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀habitual⠀bow—and⠀connects⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀pause⠀changes⠀the⠀detail's⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀confirming⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀an⠀epiphanic⠀paragraph⠀or⠀a⠀philosophical⠀conclusion.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀irreversible⠀consequence⠀observed⠀plainly:⠀an⠀empty⠀chair,⠀a⠀locked⠀drawer,⠀a⠀train⠀ticket⠀used⠀only⠀one⠀way.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀particularity⠀of⠀the⠀loss.⠀A⠀diary⠀or⠀reflective⠀segment⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀within⠀the⠀fiction,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀live⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀intimate⠀psychological/urban⠀fiction.⠀Use⠀the⠀supplied⠀community's⠀concrete⠀streets,⠀transport,⠀shops,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀transactions.⠀A⠀contemporary⠀Latin⠀American⠀city⠀is⠀one⠀possible⠀setting⠀when⠀established;⠀this⠀route⠀supplies⠀intimate⠀urban⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀compulsory⠀location.⠀Keep⠀community⠀and⠀history⠀specific⠀when⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀magical⠀atmosphere⠀or⠀a⠀generalized⠀\"Latin⠀American\"⠀setting.⠀Let⠀the⠀city's⠀social⠀texture⠀enter⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀practical⠀lives:⠀a⠀bus⠀route,⠀a⠀market⠀bargaining,⠀a⠀rented⠀room,⠀a⠀family⠀remittance,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀festival⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀feels⠀the⠀same.\n\nFollow⠀one⠀central⠀character's⠀inner⠀experience⠀closely⠀while⠀retaining⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀restraint.⠀Show⠀choices⠀emerging⠀from⠀intelligible⠀reasons—a⠀son⠀returning⠀to⠀support⠀a⠀mother,⠀a⠀sister⠀protecting⠀a⠀brother's⠀immigration⠀status,⠀a⠀wage⠀worker⠀accepting⠀overtime⠀that⠀eliminates⠀sleep,⠀a⠀student⠀quitting⠀school⠀to⠀care⠀for⠀a⠀grandmother.⠀Make⠀the⠀loss⠀accumulate⠀through⠀small,⠀externally⠀visible⠀details:⠀a⠀pair⠀of⠀shoes⠀left⠀in⠀a⠀hallway,⠀a⠀telephone⠀call⠀that⠀ends⠀too⠀quickly,⠀a⠀receipt⠀for⠀a⠀ticket⠀never⠀used,⠀an⠀apartment's⠀electricity⠀cut⠀off.\n\nLet⠀the⠀institution⠀appear⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act:⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀stamp,⠀a⠀queue⠀that⠀moves⠀only⠀for⠀those⠀with⠀connections,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀knock,⠀a⠀school⠀form⠀requesting⠀a⠀parent's⠀signature⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀in⠀the⠀family⠀can⠀read.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀these⠀into⠀a⠀political⠀essay;⠀let⠀them⠀remain⠀concrete⠀interruptions⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀day.⠀Show⠀the⠀private⠀damage⠀they⠀cause:⠀shame,⠀exhaustion,⠀distance⠀from⠀a⠀loved⠀one,⠀an⠀unpayable⠀debt.\n\nRecognition⠀occurs⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀concrete⠀detail⠀or⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀and⠀hears⠀or⠀sees⠀it⠀in⠀its⠀changed⠀function.⠀A⠀phrase⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀repeated⠀to⠀reassure⠀family—\"I⠀will⠀be⠀home⠀next⠀month\"—is⠀heard⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀way⠀when⠀the⠀impossibility⠀becomes⠀clear.⠀Use⠀such⠀recurrence⠀without⠀melodrama.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀irreversible⠀consequence:⠀a⠀room⠀emptied,⠀a⠀bus⠀station⠀at⠀dawn,⠀a⠀voice⠀on⠀a⠀recorded⠀message⠀no⠀longer⠀answerable.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀that⠀absence,⠀not⠀a⠀large⠀historical⠀event.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀naturalistic⠀presentation;⠀the⠀marvelous⠀or⠀fantastic⠀is⠀not⠀used⠀in⠀this⠀route⠀and⠀cannot⠀be⠀added⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀short,⠀visually⠀concrete⠀scenes.⠀Enter⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀that⠀establishes⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation,⠀and⠀keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀explicit:⠀the⠀corridor⠀narrows⠀past⠀the⠀lockers,⠀the⠀bus⠀door⠀folds⠀shut,⠀the⠀shop⠀counter⠀reflects⠀the⠀green⠀sign.⠀Use⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀read⠀is⠀fast⠀and⠀the⠀beat⠀structure⠀is⠀clear.\n\nKeep⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀observational⠀method⠀within⠀that⠀scene-based⠀presentation.⠀Let⠀an⠀institution⠀appear⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀ordinary⠀event:⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀clipboard,⠀a⠀train⠀announcement⠀that⠀cancels⠀a⠀stop,⠀a⠀form⠀returned⠀for⠀a⠀missing⠀stamp,⠀a⠀family⠀member's⠀apology⠀eaten⠀before⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀delivered.⠀Show⠀the⠀humiliation⠀without⠀theatrics—the⠀character⠀notices⠀the⠀exact⠀detail⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀moment⠀hurt⠀and⠀says⠀nothing.⠀Use⠀private⠀reaction⠀beats⠀to⠀render⠀the⠀interior⠀cost;⠀these⠀may⠀be⠀brief⠀but⠀must⠀be⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀thought,⠀perception,⠀or⠀reasoning,⠀not⠀just⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀feeling.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀small,⠀causally⠀connected⠀losses.⠀In⠀scene⠀one,⠀the⠀character⠀chooses⠀the⠀safer⠀path⠀because⠀a⠀duty⠀seems⠀clear.⠀In⠀a⠀later⠀scene,⠀that⠀choice⠀costs⠀a⠀relationship,⠀a⠀job,⠀or⠀a⠀sum⠀of⠀money.⠀In⠀another,⠀the⠀character⠀repeats⠀the⠀same⠀justification⠀and⠀recognizes⠀that⠀it⠀no⠀longer⠀works.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀character⠀inexplicably⠀foolish;⠀alternatives⠀should⠀be⠀visible,⠀even⠀if⠀they⠀look⠀dangerous⠀or⠀disloyal.⠀The⠀fall⠀should⠀feel⠀fast⠀in⠀reading⠀but⠀built⠀from⠀concrete⠀steps.\n\nUse⠀recognition⠀as⠀a⠀scene-level⠀reversal⠀of⠀meaning,⠀not⠀a⠀sudden⠀philosophical⠀statement.⠀Stage⠀it⠀at⠀a⠀concrete⠀location⠀where⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀that⠀appeared⠀earlier⠀in⠀the⠀story⠀and⠀connects⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀loss:⠀the⠀train⠀pass⠀once⠀used⠀for⠀a⠀family⠀visit⠀now⠀used⠀for⠀an⠀errand⠀that⠀severs⠀the⠀family;⠀the⠀receipt⠀once⠀kept⠀to⠀prove⠀a⠀payment⠀now⠀proves⠀a⠀debt.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀irreversible⠀consequence⠀as⠀a⠀quiet⠀visual:⠀a⠀door⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀corridor,⠀a⠀phone⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀lunch⠀box⠀unopened.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀compulsory⠀cliffhanger⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀naturally⠀stops⠀at⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action;⠀preserve⠀the⠀tragic⠀aftermath⠀instead.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀fall⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀sustained⠀attention⠀to⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀recurring⠀images.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀things⠀the⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀because⠀they⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀place,⠀the⠀work,⠀or⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀gate,⠀a⠀bowl,⠀a⠀row⠀of⠀lamps,⠀a⠀particular⠀sound.⠀Let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀carry⠀the⠀tragedy.⠀An⠀image⠀may⠀first⠀appear⠀as⠀ordinary,⠀then⠀return⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions,⠀and⠀later⠀arrive⠀after⠀an⠀irreversible⠀choice;⠀but⠀the⠀number⠀of⠀returns⠀and⠀their⠀order⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀story⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀three-stage⠀pattern.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀thing⠀itself⠀has⠀not⠀changed⠀while⠀everything⠀around⠀it⠀has,⠀or⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀thing⠀itself⠀altered.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀this⠀progression.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀do⠀the⠀recognition.\n\nShape⠀sentences⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀plain⠀observation⠀gains⠀weight⠀by⠀position.⠀A⠀short⠀declarative⠀sentence⠀can⠀state⠀a⠀fact⠀without⠀commentary,⠀and⠀the⠀following⠀longer⠀sentence⠀can⠀unfold⠀its⠀consequence.⠀Use⠀rhythm⠀to⠀control⠀how⠀much⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀before⠀understanding.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀moved,⠀keep⠀the⠀language⠀clean.⠀Avoid⠀adjective⠀accumulation.⠀The⠀irony⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀as⠀damage,⠀not⠀from⠀sarcastic⠀commentary.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀position⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀attend⠀to⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀out.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀a⠀participant,⠀their⠀attention⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀habitual,⠀or⠀self-justifying.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀observes⠀others,⠀their⠀lyric⠀focus⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀only⠀tenderness⠀available.⠀Private⠀thought⠀remains⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own;⠀other⠀characters'⠀minds⠀are⠀not⠀opened⠀by⠀the⠀style.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀the⠀ending⠀to⠀preserve⠀aftermath⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀announce⠀the⠀loss;⠀whether⠀the⠀final⠀sentence⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀recurring⠀image,⠀a⠀plain⠀fact,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀ordinary⠀action⠀depends⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀actually⠀made⠀available.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀surface⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀memory⠀of⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes.⠀A⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀should⠀be⠀concrete:⠀a⠀particular⠀meal,⠀a⠀walk,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀together,⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀used⠀to⠀say.⠀The⠀narrator⠀recalls⠀it⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀was⠀dramatic⠀but⠀because⠀it⠀later⠀became⠀evidence⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀lost.⠀Show⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀alongside⠀the⠀memory⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀two⠀coexist.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀doing⠀something⠀ordinary⠀now⠀while⠀remembering⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀past,⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀performances⠀carries⠀the⠀loss.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀reflection⠀unsentimental.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀feel⠀longing,⠀but⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀not⠀insist⠀on⠀it.⠀Let⠀a⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀association:⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀now⠀used⠀differently,⠀a⠀seat⠀left⠀empty,⠀a⠀habit⠀continued⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀irony⠀appears⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀accepts⠀a⠀damaging⠀condition⠀as⠀normal⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀recognizes⠀the⠀damage⠀through⠀the⠀reflective⠀distance.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀social⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀unquestioned⠀acceptance⠀be⠀the⠀exposure.\n\nAllow⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀to⠀remain⠀pleasurable.⠀A⠀remembered⠀moment⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀genuinely⠀warm,⠀and⠀its⠀warmth⠀makes⠀the⠀later⠀loss⠀meaningful⠀rather⠀than⠀inevitable.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀directly⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀detail⠀do⠀the⠀work,⠀but⠀the⠀reflection⠀must⠀be⠀authorized⠀by⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀Other⠀characters'⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀inaccessible.⠀Use⠀the⠀ending⠀to⠀preserve⠀aftermath⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀announce⠀impermanence⠀as⠀a⠀lesson;⠀whether⠀the⠀final⠀passage⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀moment,⠀stays⠀with⠀the⠀memory,⠀or⠀moves⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action⠀depends⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀actually⠀made⠀available.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀route.⠀Establish⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀and⠀an⠀audience:⠀a⠀guest⠀recounting⠀an⠀incident,⠀an⠀elder⠀answering⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀traveler⠀explaining⠀why⠀a⠀place⠀changed.⠀The⠀teller's⠀position⠀matters.⠀They⠀may⠀have⠀witnessed⠀the⠀events,⠀heard⠀them⠀from⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀participated⠀without⠀understanding⠀their⠀full⠀consequence⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent.⠀What⠀they⠀relate⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀know,⠀what⠀they⠀consider⠀worth⠀telling,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀frame's⠀delay.⠀The⠀teller⠀relates⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀first:⠀a⠀marriage⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀dispute⠀over⠀water⠀or⠀work,⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀repeated⠀until⠀it⠀becomes⠀policy.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀ask⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀supply⠀a⠀detail,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀answer⠀can⠀revise⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀account⠀meant.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀social⠀damage.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀unquestioned⠀acceptance⠀of⠀an⠀institution⠀be⠀the⠀exposure,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀audience's⠀reaction⠀show⠀where⠀the⠀damage⠀lands.⠀The⠀teller's⠀acceptance⠀and⠀the⠀audience's⠀recognition⠀may⠀remain⠀distinct;⠀the⠀teller⠀need⠀not⠀arrive⠀at⠀the⠀audience's⠀understanding.\n\nUse⠀the⠀frame⠀to⠀preserve⠀aftermath.⠀After⠀the⠀main⠀account⠀ends,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀audience.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀continue⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action,⠀answer⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀fall⠀silent,⠀but⠀the⠀particular⠀gesture⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀closing⠀ritual.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀ask⠀what⠀happened⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person,⠀and⠀the⠀answer⠀may⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀plain.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced.⠀Let⠀the⠀frame⠀close⠀in⠀whatever⠀way⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀supports,⠀preserving⠀the⠀account's⠀aftermath⠀without⠀resolving⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀tragedy.⠀Choose⠀details⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀through⠀which⠀the⠀damage⠀appears:⠀a⠀ledger⠀entry,⠀a⠀chair⠀moved,⠀a⠀bowl⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀gate⠀closed.⠀Each⠀detail⠀should⠀appear⠀once⠀or⠀twice,⠀not⠀be⠀inventoried.⠀The⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀becomes⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀it.⠀Omit⠀the⠀explanation.⠀The⠀reader⠀infers⠀the⠀loss⠀from⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀observations.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀State⠀an⠀action,⠀then⠀its⠀consequence.⠀A⠀plain⠀sentence⠀can⠀expose⠀an⠀institution⠀without⠀commentary:⠀a⠀posted⠀fee,⠀a⠀payment⠀made,⠀a⠀room⠀afterward⠀empty.⠀The⠀particular⠀details⠀and⠀their⠀order⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀sequence.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀irony⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀accept⠀as⠀normal⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀as⠀damage.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀position⠀is⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀select⠀as⠀worth⠀mentioning.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀a⠀participant,⠀their⠀omissions⠀may⠀be⠀habitual⠀or⠀self-justifying.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀observes⠀others,⠀their⠀restraint⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀only⠀available⠀tenderness.\n\nKeep⠀causality⠀inferable.⠀Omission⠀should⠀not⠀remove⠀the⠀connection⠀between⠀a⠀choice⠀and⠀its⠀consequence.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀refuses⠀an⠀offer,⠀show⠀the⠀refusal⠀and⠀later⠀show⠀the⠀empty⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀offer⠀had⠀been.⠀The⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀the⠀connection.⠀An⠀essential⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀pad⠀it.⠀Use⠀the⠀ending⠀to⠀preserve⠀aftermath⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀announce⠀the⠀loss;⠀whether⠀the⠀final⠀sentence⠀is⠀a⠀single⠀exact⠀detail,⠀a⠀plain⠀fact,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action⠀depends⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀actually⠀made⠀available.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀in⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Open⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀moment:⠀a⠀transaction,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀task.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting;⠀the⠀style⠀governs⠀presentation,⠀not⠀world⠀physics.\n\nLet⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀particulars.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀a⠀condition,⠀refuse⠀an⠀alternative,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀belief⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀made⠀intelligible.⠀Show⠀the⠀social⠀damage⠀through⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀and⠀small⠀humiliations⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀lecture.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀irony⠀appears⠀when⠀a⠀speaker⠀reveals⠀their⠀position⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀something⠀damaging⠀in⠀a⠀calm,⠀practical⠀tone,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀let⠀the⠀statement⠀stand⠀without⠀commentary.⠀The⠀scene's⠀ordinary⠀particulars—the⠀fee,⠀the⠀queue,⠀the⠀form,⠀the⠀chair—should⠀carry⠀the⠀institution's⠀pressure⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀its⠀injustice.\n\nUse⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀shifts,⠀the⠀shift⠀should⠀be⠀motivated⠀by⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention.⠀Inner⠀experience⠀remains⠀authorized⠀by⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀Other⠀characters'⠀private⠀thoughts⠀are⠀not⠀opened.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀place,⠀and⠀recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀lesson.⠀Use⠀the⠀ending⠀to⠀preserve⠀aftermath⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀announce⠀the⠀loss;⠀whether⠀the⠀response⠀ends⠀with⠀business⠀concluded,⠀resumed,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀actual⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀scene⠀selection.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀that⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀promise⠀of⠀the⠀pairing:⠀the⠀private⠀language⠀they⠀use,⠀the⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀or⠀phrase⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀them,⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀share⠀a⠀task⠀or⠀a⠀silence.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs,⠀but⠀let⠀it⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀situation.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀relationship's⠀incompatible⠀commitments.⠀The⠀loss⠀should⠀be⠀meaningful⠀because⠀the⠀attachment⠀was⠀particular.⠀Show⠀the⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀that⠀sustained⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀meal⠀prepared,⠀a⠀note⠀left,⠀a⠀door⠀held,⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀more⠀than⠀once.⠀When⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀comes,⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀intelligible⠀through⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀values⠀and⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀irony⠀appears⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀accepts⠀a⠀damaging⠀social⠀condition⠀as⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀the⠀relationship,⠀or⠀when⠀the⠀relationship⠀itself⠀becomes⠀the⠀institution⠀that⠀hurts⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀social⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀the⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀carry⠀it.\n\nUse⠀callbacks⠀and⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀with⠀restraint.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀after⠀the⠀loss⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀A⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀may⠀be⠀performed⠀by⠀one⠀person⠀alone.⠀The⠀payoff⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀premise's⠀promise,⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀reconciliation.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.⠀Use⠀the⠀ending⠀to⠀preserve⠀aftermath⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀resolve⠀it⠀into⠀comfort⠀or⠀punishment;⠀whether⠀the⠀relationship's⠀consequence⠀is⠀settled,⠀unsettled,⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀actual⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀an⠀oral⠀chronicle⠀of⠀deeds⠀by⠀which⠀these⠀people⠀are⠀remembered.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀that⠀establishes⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀an⠀act:⠀who⠀did⠀the⠀thing,⠀what⠀it⠀cost,⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀is⠀still⠀told.⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀The⠀account⠀should⠀feel⠀retold,⠀not⠀invented⠀on⠀the⠀spot.⠀Use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀and⠀recurring⠀phrasing,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀source⠀tradition⠀coherent.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀into⠀every⠀speaker.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀emerge⠀through⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀that⠀become⠀public⠀deeds.⠀A⠀debt⠀paid,⠀a⠀refusal⠀given,⠀a⠀door⠀closed,⠀a⠀name⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀list.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀relates⠀the⠀act⠀and⠀its⠀consequence,⠀and⠀the⠀recurrence⠀shows⠀how⠀the⠀damage⠀spread.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀irony⠀appears⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀accepts⠀a⠀damaging⠀institution⠀as⠀the⠀normal⠀order⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀loss.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀social⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀of⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀carry⠀it.⠀Warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀should⠀be⠀intelligible:⠀the⠀chronicle⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀someone⠀advised⠀otherwise,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀different⠀choice⠀was⠀available,⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀outcome⠀seem⠀foolish⠀or⠀inevitable.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀aftermath⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀chronicle⠀chooses⠀to⠀remember.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀after⠀the⠀loss.⠀A⠀name⠀may⠀be⠀spoken⠀once⠀and⠀then⠀not⠀again.⠀Use⠀the⠀ending⠀to⠀preserve⠀aftermath⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀declare⠀the⠀account⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf;⠀whether⠀the⠀final⠀passage⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀depends⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀chronicle⠀has⠀actually⠀established.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀a⠀clean,⠀observant⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism.⠀Choose⠀one⠀ordinary⠀institutional⠀or⠀family⠀arrangement—a⠀workplace⠀duty,⠀a⠀household⠀obligation,⠀a⠀small⠀public⠀procedure—and⠀make⠀it⠀the⠀site⠀of⠀the⠀fall.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀plain⠀and⠀specific:⠀what⠀people⠀call⠀normal,⠀how⠀they⠀sit⠀at⠀a⠀table,⠀what⠀they⠀hand⠀over⠀without⠀comment.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀report⠀these⠀details⠀without⠀explaining⠀their⠀meaning,⠀so⠀the⠀social⠀damage⠀accumulates⠀in⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀authorial⠀judgment.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀irony⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀arrangement⠀actually⠀costs.⠀When⠀someone⠀judges⠀another⠀person's⠀small⠀failure,⠀let⠀the⠀judgment⠀reveal⠀the⠀judge's⠀position⠀and⠀the⠀system⠀both⠀of⠀them⠀inhabit.⠀Do⠀not⠀have⠀the⠀narrator⠀denounce⠀the⠀institution;⠀instead,⠀let⠀the⠀accepted⠀routine⠀expose⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀recognizes⠀what⠀has⠀become⠀unavoidable⠀or⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀lost,⠀render⠀that⠀recognition⠀as⠀a⠀quiet⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀same⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀is⠀perceived—a⠀familiar⠀room,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀task⠀now⠀understood⠀differently.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀route⠀definite⠀by⠀selecting⠀one⠀social-realist⠀method:⠀domestic⠀realism,⠀institutional⠀observation,⠀or⠀a⠀psychological⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀life.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀snow,⠀reserve,⠀or⠀isolation⠀as⠀automatic⠀atmosphere.⠀Let⠀the⠀tragedy⠀be⠀located⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀ordinary⠀world⠀of⠀the⠀story,⠀present⠀in⠀its⠀plainest⠀rooms⠀and⠀procedures,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserve⠀the⠀loss⠀without⠀restoring⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nBuild⠀the⠀fall⠀through⠀visible⠀social⠀scenes.⠀In⠀each⠀scene,⠀choose⠀one⠀ordinary⠀transaction⠀that⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀accept⠀as⠀normal:⠀someone⠀being⠀signed⠀in,⠀a⠀tray⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀document⠀initialed.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concise⠀and⠀grounded⠀in⠀observable⠀behavior.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀small⠀pressure⠀points—the⠀polite⠀refusal,⠀the⠀routine⠀question⠀that⠀costs⠀a⠀character⠀something—without⠀explanatory⠀speeches.⠀The⠀audience⠀should⠀see⠀the⠀institution⠀working⠀through⠀these⠀transactions,⠀not⠀hear⠀a⠀character⠀describe⠀it.\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀and⠀cuts⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀actually⠀changes.⠀Offscreen⠀sound⠀or⠀voice-over⠀must⠀serve⠀the⠀sequence;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀camera⠀directions⠀or⠀emotional⠀overlays.⠀If⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀required,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀inside⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀but⠀never⠀as⠀dialogue⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀can⠀hear.⠀Let⠀the⠀institutional⠀damage⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀ordinary⠀materials:⠀a⠀coat⠀left⠀behind,⠀an⠀unchanged⠀form,⠀a⠀corridor⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀walked⠀too⠀often.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀loss,⠀show⠀the⠀aftermath⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀plain⠀observable⠀world.⠀People⠀continue⠀the⠀routine,⠀avoid⠀a⠀doorway,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀simple⠀question⠀with⠀fresh⠀weight.⠀Recognition⠀can⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀glance,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀action,⠀but⠀make⠀that⠀change⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀visible⠀scene⠀itself⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀by⠀a⠀narrator.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nArrange⠀the⠀stage⠀so⠀the⠀tragedy⠀happens⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀In⠀each⠀scene,⠀choose⠀one⠀ordinary⠀object⠀or⠀transaction—a⠀ledger,⠀a⠀tea⠀cup,⠀a⠀coat⠀on⠀a⠀chair—and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀pressure.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀accepts⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀let⠀the⠀blocking⠀make⠀that⠀acceptance⠀visible⠀without⠀comment:⠀one⠀person⠀steps⠀back⠀while⠀another⠀signs.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀be⠀clear⠀and⠀pressure-focused;⠀no⠀character⠀needs⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀whole⠀institution⠀aloud.\n\nThe⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carries⠀the⠀social⠀work.⠀A⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀chair⠀turned⠀away,⠀an⠀object⠀passed⠀too⠀slowly—all⠀can⠀reveal⠀position.⠀Monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀must⠀have⠀a⠀true⠀dramatic⠀function,⠀not⠀replace⠀every⠀private⠀thought.⠀If⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀present,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀clearly⠀distinguished⠀from⠀lines⠀another⠀character⠀could⠀hear.⠀The⠀play⠀does⠀not⠀cut⠀away;⠀let⠀the⠀audience⠀see⠀the⠀small⠀consequential⠀moment⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀space.\n\nThe⠀fall⠀should⠀be⠀staged⠀as⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀ordinary⠀transactions⠀that⠀gradually⠀close⠀a⠀door.⠀After⠀the⠀loss,⠀continue⠀the⠀business:⠀the⠀same⠀tray,⠀the⠀same⠀form,⠀the⠀same⠀doorway⠀now⠀handled⠀with⠀knowledge.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀a⠀climactic⠀collapse.⠀Let⠀the⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀gesture⠀carry⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀so⠀the⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀aftermath⠀in⠀the⠀physical⠀scene⠀itself.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀one⠀focal⠀mind⠀carry⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀its⠀associations.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀flow⠀in⠀one⠀ordinary⠀institutional⠀detail—a⠀form,⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀name⠀being⠀read—and⠀let⠀the⠀mind⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀through⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern.⠀When⠀the⠀institution⠀reappears,⠀let⠀the⠀mind⠀circle⠀it⠀in⠀plain⠀phrases,⠀not⠀explanatory⠀summaries.⠀Syntax⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀movement:⠀a⠀paragraph⠀may⠀turn⠀from⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀tea⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀doorway⠀to⠀the⠀voice⠀of⠀a⠀superior,⠀so⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀still⠀distinguish⠀event⠀from⠀recollection.\n\nThe⠀social⠀exposure⠀works⠀by⠀what⠀this⠀mind⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal.⠀The⠀character⠀notices⠀the⠀humiliation⠀without⠀naming⠀it⠀grandly,⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀small⠀detail,⠀and⠀reveals⠀the⠀system⠀through⠀the⠀unremarked⠀pattern.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀mind⠀universally⠀witty,⠀panicked,⠀or⠀perfectly⠀self-aware;⠀let⠀its⠀particular⠀habits⠀shape⠀the⠀flow.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀phrase⠀returning⠀with⠀new⠀weight⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀understanding⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀silence.⠀After⠀the⠀loss,⠀the⠀same⠀objects⠀and⠀memories⠀continue,⠀now⠀freighted⠀with⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀Let⠀the⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀or⠀image⠀carry⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀so⠀the⠀aftermath⠀is⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀mind's⠀own⠀movement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀messages⠀themselves.⠀Choose⠀one⠀ordinary⠀message⠀transaction—a⠀request⠀acknowledged,⠀a⠀refusal⠀given⠀by⠀emoji,⠀a⠀formal⠀notification⠀sent⠀again⠀because⠀the⠀first⠀was⠀ignored—and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀pressure.⠀Each⠀sender⠀has⠀an⠀actual⠀digital⠀habit:⠀someone⠀answers⠀immediately,⠀someone⠀leaves⠀a⠀draft,⠀someone⠀uses⠀a⠀formal⠀phrase⠀to⠀an⠀institution.⠀Through⠀these⠀ordinary⠀message⠀choices,⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀No⠀one⠀needs⠀to⠀type⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture;⠀the⠀routine⠀phrasing⠀can⠀expose⠀the⠀system.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀story.⠀Distinguish⠀clearly⠀between⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀and⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀between⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀If⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀required,⠀set⠀it⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀it⠀in.⠀A⠀timestamp⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀delay⠀can⠀matter⠀when⠀it⠀shows⠀hesitation,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀edits⠀or⠀receipts⠀just⠀for⠀subtext.\n\nRecognition⠀can⠀happen⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀someone⠀sent⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀typed⠀but⠀never⠀sent,⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀response⠀that⠀arrives⠀too⠀late.⠀After⠀the⠀loss,⠀the⠀same⠀channel⠀carries⠀the⠀aftermath:⠀a⠀group⠀chat⠀continues⠀without⠀one⠀person,⠀someone⠀reads⠀an⠀old⠀message⠀again,⠀or⠀a⠀routine⠀notification⠀now⠀sounds⠀different.⠀Let⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀unsent⠀draft⠀carry⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀so⠀the⠀transcript⠀shows⠀the⠀damage⠀through⠀its⠀ordinary⠀digital⠀life.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nCarry⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀legible⠀scene⠀moments.⠀Set⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀observable⠀detail—the⠀office⠀desk,⠀the⠀waiting⠀room,⠀the⠀stairwell—and⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀select⠀the⠀significant⠀ordinary⠀thing.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀orient⠀the⠀scene,⠀but⠀the⠀story's⠀social⠀exposure⠀comes⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀dialogue⠀refuses⠀to⠀announce.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀clear,⠀without⠀adding⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀choices,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images.\n\nDialogue⠀should⠀be⠀attributed⠀cleanly⠀and⠀reflect⠀the⠀institution's⠀small⠀rituals:⠀a⠀required⠀apology,⠀a⠀repeated⠀request,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀casual⠀comment.⠀The⠀focal⠀response⠀can⠀stay⠀plain,⠀even⠀ironic,⠀but⠀not⠀explanatory.⠀Focal⠀interiority⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀hear⠀it.⠀Irony⠀surfaces⠀when⠀the⠀narration⠀notices⠀something⠀the⠀speaker⠀does⠀not⠀say.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀arrive⠀in⠀the⠀narration⠀between⠀one⠀line⠀and⠀the⠀next,⠀or⠀when⠀an⠀earlier⠀visual⠀detail⠀reappears⠀with⠀new⠀meaning.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀loss,⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀rhythm.⠀The⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀or⠀sees⠀a⠀familiar⠀expression,⠀and⠀the⠀plain⠀description⠀now⠀carries⠀the⠀aftermath.⠀Let⠀a⠀repeated⠀visual⠀cue—a⠀desk,⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀face—carry⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀so⠀the⠀tragedy⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀accumulation⠀of⠀ordinary⠀illustrated⠀moments⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀melodramatic⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqapbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀continuation⠀of⠀a⠀social⠀fall⠀already⠀in⠀motion.⠀Choose⠀one⠀ordinary⠀transaction⠀per⠀installment—a⠀small⠀institutional⠀task,⠀a⠀household⠀exchange,⠀a⠀routine⠀errand—and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀the⠀tragedy⠀forward.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀plain⠀and⠀observational.⠀Briefly⠀remind⠀the⠀reader⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀current⠀duty⠀or⠀unresolved⠀obligation⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀aids⠀re-entry.⠀Let⠀each⠀person⠀reveal⠀position⠀through⠀ordinary⠀acceptance⠀without⠀explanatory⠀narrative.⠀The⠀through-line⠀is⠀the⠀accumulating⠀cost:⠀a⠀kindness⠀refused,⠀a⠀form⠀accepted,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀becomes⠀a⠀loss.\n\nUse⠀earned⠀developments⠀rather⠀than⠀forced⠀cliffhangers.⠀A⠀conversation⠀may⠀change⠀a⠀relationship,⠀a⠀delayed⠀decision⠀may⠀close⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀may⠀gain⠀weight.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀turn⠀inside⠀the⠀ongoing⠀story,⠀not⠀a⠀sudden⠀twist.⠀Keep⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀irony⠀in⠀the⠀plain⠀contrast⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀speaker⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀does.⠀After⠀a⠀major⠀loss,⠀the⠀next⠀installment⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀aftermath⠀through⠀continued⠀daily⠀life:⠀the⠀same⠀workplace,⠀the⠀same⠀family⠀table,⠀the⠀same⠀errand⠀now⠀handled⠀without⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀the⠀hope⠀that⠀was⠀lost.⠀Let⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀carry⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀across⠀installments⠀so⠀the⠀serial⠀form⠀shows⠀the⠀damage⠀through⠀its⠀ordinary⠀continuity.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nBuild⠀the⠀fall⠀through⠀a⠀relationship⠀that⠀matters,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀disastrous⠀mistake.⠀Use⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging⠀to⠀make⠀each⠀encounter⠀physically⠀and⠀emotionally⠀legible:⠀where⠀people⠀stand,⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀with⠀their⠀hands,⠀when⠀they⠀look⠀away,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀refuse⠀to⠀say.⠀Let⠀a⠀memory⠀surface⠀during⠀a⠀present⠀exchange⠀and⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀risk⠀in⠀that⠀moment.⠀The⠀memory⠀should⠀not⠀explain⠀everything;⠀it⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀current⠀choice⠀harder.\n\nLet⠀strain⠀change⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀and⠀the⠀behavior⠀that⠀follows⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀needs⠀comfort⠀may⠀push⠀it⠀away,⠀apologize⠀for⠀asking,⠀or⠀accept⠀it⠀badly.⠀Carry⠀that⠀strain⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀beat:⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀refused⠀comfort⠀may⠀later⠀stand⠀closer⠀without⠀speaking,⠀reach⠀for⠀a⠀task⠀they⠀can⠀still⠀do,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀with⠀unusual⠀care.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀said⠀the⠀wrong⠀thing⠀may⠀overcorrect⠀by⠀going⠀silent,⠀then⠀force⠀a⠀lighter⠀tone⠀that⠀neither⠀of⠀them⠀believes.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀every⠀exchange⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀clean⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀clean⠀break.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀survive⠀inside⠀the⠀damage,⠀and⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀genuine⠀care⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀later⠀loss⠀worse⠀rather⠀than⠀better.\n\nMake⠀the⠀tragic⠀turn⠀a⠀choice⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀at⠀least⠀partly.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternative⠀they⠀considered⠀and⠀why⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀take⠀it.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀look,⠀a⠀remembered⠀promise,⠀a⠀word⠀that⠀finally⠀lands.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀Let⠀the⠀surviving⠀character⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀choice⠀without⠀turning⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀fixed⠀portrait⠀of⠀suffering.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀inside⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀let⠀other⠀people⠀remain⠀intelligent⠀even⠀when⠀they⠀cannot⠀stop⠀what⠀is⠀coming.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nPresent⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Keep⠀paragraphs⠀scannable:⠀a⠀short⠀narrative⠀beat⠀establishes⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀then⠀dialogue⠀carries⠀the⠀exchange,⠀then⠀a⠀reaction⠀beat⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀cost.⠀Use⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀physical⠀choices⠀that⠀accompany⠀the⠀emotional⠀ones.\n\nLet⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict⠀shape⠀each⠀reply.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀something⠀during⠀the⠀exchange⠀and⠀act⠀on⠀it,⠀but⠀the⠀memory⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀practical⠀basis⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀After⠀a⠀difficult⠀admission,⠀a⠀refused⠀comfort,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀made,⠀make⠀the⠀reaction⠀beat⠀register⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail:⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀stays⠀open,⠀a⠀chair⠀pushed⠀back,⠀a⠀task⠀resumed⠀too⠀quickly,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀room.⠀Let⠀that⠀cost⠀remain⠀active⠀at⠀the⠀pause⠀point⠀so⠀the⠀continuation⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀just⠀said⠀and⠀done⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀new⠀prompt.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tragic⠀stakes⠀legible⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀disaster.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternative⠀a⠀character⠀considered⠀and⠀why⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀take⠀it.⠀Let⠀NPCs⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀lives⠀and⠀make⠀their⠀own⠀choices⠀within⠀the⠀interval:⠀one⠀may⠀finish⠀a⠀chore,⠀leave⠀a⠀door⠀open,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀did⠀not⠀ask.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀warmth⠀can⠀survive⠀inside⠀the⠀damage,⠀and⠀a⠀caring⠀act⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀later⠀loss⠀heavier.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀for⠀narrative⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player⠀control.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀executable⠀commands,⠀or⠀forced⠀choices.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀classical⠀or⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route.⠀Structure⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀encounters,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀setting,⠀a⠀relationship⠀at⠀stake,⠀and⠀a⠀choice⠀that⠀narrows⠀what⠀remains⠀possible.⠀Let⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging⠀make⠀each⠀episode⠀physically⠀legible:⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀meet,⠀what⠀they⠀carry,⠀what⠀they⠀remember,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀when⠀words⠀fail.\n\nOpen⠀each⠀episode⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀current⠀condition,⠀not⠀a⠀fresh⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀whole⠀fall.⠀A⠀remembered⠀wound⠀can⠀surface⠀in⠀a⠀present⠀encounter⠀and⠀change⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀say⠀or⠀do.⠀A⠀bond⠀that⠀once⠀held⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀later⠀loss⠀unbearable.⠀Let⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀be⠀intelligible⠀within⠀the⠀episode:⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀considered⠀and⠀why⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀take⠀it.⠀Close⠀the⠀episode⠀on⠀the⠀narrowed⠀condition⠀the⠀next⠀one⠀must⠀inherit:⠀a⠀promise⠀now⠀conditional,⠀a⠀meeting⠀now⠀avoided,⠀a⠀duty⠀now⠀heavier,⠀a⠀silence⠀now⠀deliberate.\n\nMake⠀recognition⠀an⠀episode's⠀turning⠀point,⠀not⠀a⠀sudden⠀moral⠀appended⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀person's⠀absence,⠀or⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀remains.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀and⠀period⠀of⠀the⠀actual⠀setting⠀distinct.⠀Do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀cast⠀or⠀impose⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀temperament.⠀The⠀episodic⠀form⠀carries⠀the⠀tragedy;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀tournament,⠀a⠀journey,⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀number⠀of⠀encounters.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀fall⠀feel⠀immediate.⠀Cut⠀the⠀connective⠀tissue⠀between⠀decisions⠀and⠀their⠀consequences.⠀A⠀character⠀reaches⠀for⠀something,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀sentence⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀reach⠀cost.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀concrete,⠀but⠀attach⠀each⠀physical⠀detail⠀to⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀relationship⠀cost:⠀worn⠀gear⠀that⠀fails⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀a⠀cracked⠀surface⠀someone⠀keeps⠀touching,⠀a⠀bruise⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀a⠀person⠀moves,⠀a⠀broken⠀clasp⠀that⠀marks⠀a⠀promise⠀already⠀strained.\n\nGround⠀Kishimoto's⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀in⠀material⠀stakes.⠀A⠀fight⠀is⠀not⠀just⠀a⠀contest;⠀it⠀damages⠀equipment,⠀exhausts⠀bodies,⠀and⠀leaves⠀marks⠀that⠀persist⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀scene.⠀A⠀relationship⠀conflict⠀is⠀not⠀just⠀words;⠀it⠀changes⠀where⠀people⠀stand,⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀with⠀their⠀hands,⠀and⠀whether⠀they⠀can⠀still⠀look⠀at⠀each⠀other.⠀Let⠀a⠀memory⠀surface⠀through⠀a⠀physical⠀object⠀or⠀a⠀scar,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀the⠀present⠀encounter.\n\nVary⠀rhythm⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀reasoning.⠀Compress⠀the⠀movement⠀from⠀decision⠀to⠀consequence⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀acts⠀on⠀habit,⠀pride,⠀or⠀fear.⠀Lengthen⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀weighing⠀an⠀alternative,⠀because⠀the⠀tragedy⠀requires⠀that⠀alternative⠀to⠀be⠀intelligible.⠀Make⠀the⠀tragic⠀turn⠀a⠀choice⠀with⠀practical⠀consequences.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀land⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail:⠀a⠀broken⠀promise,⠀a⠀name⠀carved⠀somewhere,⠀a⠀thing⠀that⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀repaired.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀This⠀is⠀pressure-oriented⠀treatment,⠀not⠀survival⠀horror.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Each⠀document⠀should⠀carry⠀Kishimoto's⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict:⠀a⠀letter⠀written⠀to⠀someone⠀the⠀author⠀cannot⠀face,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry⠀about⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound,⠀a⠀report⠀that⠀records⠀an⠀event⠀without⠀understanding⠀what⠀it⠀meant.⠀Let⠀what⠀each⠀document⠀knows⠀or⠀conceals⠀follow⠀from⠀its⠀situation.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀omit⠀what⠀the⠀author⠀is⠀ashamed⠀to⠀admit.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀record⠀facts⠀while⠀missing⠀the⠀relationship⠀that⠀gave⠀them⠀weight.\n\nSequence⠀the⠀documents⠀so⠀each⠀one⠀responds⠀to⠀a⠀prior⠀relationship⠀event⠀or⠀records⠀a⠀new⠀one.⠀A⠀later⠀document⠀can⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀or⠀reveal⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀author⠀misunderstood⠀what⠀they⠀saw.⠀A⠀material⠀trace—a⠀torn⠀page,⠀a⠀letter⠀never⠀sent,⠀a⠀name⠀crossed⠀out—can⠀show⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀heart⠀without⠀explaining⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀gaps⠀between⠀documents⠀carry⠀the⠀fall's⠀progression:⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀written,⠀what⠀is⠀written⠀too⠀late,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀revised⠀under⠀pressure⠀should⠀matter⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀the⠀documents⠀themselves.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀without⠀adding⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.\n\nMake⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀documents⠀themselves.⠀A⠀character⠀reads⠀what⠀they⠀wrote⠀before⠀the⠀fall⠀and⠀understands⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀see⠀then.⠀A⠀recipient⠀reads⠀a⠀letter⠀too⠀late.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀the⠀unsent⠀letter,⠀the⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀the⠀record⠀of⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀was⠀broken.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀document⠀form⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀documents⠀carry⠀the⠀tragedy⠀rather⠀than⠀summarize⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness,⠀familiar⠀preferences,⠀practical⠀care,⠀ease,⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters⠀enjoy⠀each⠀other:⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀remembered⠀joke,⠀a⠀small⠀favor⠀done⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀a⠀comfortable⠀silence.⠀Use⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging⠀to⠀make⠀these⠀moments⠀physically⠀legible—who⠀sits⠀where,⠀who⠀reaches⠀for⠀what,⠀who⠀notices⠀a⠀preference⠀and⠀acts⠀on⠀it.⠀Choose⠀kindnesses⠀that⠀reveal⠀a⠀preference⠀or⠀need⠀the⠀fall⠀will⠀later⠀sever:⠀the⠀way⠀someone⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀the⠀task⠀they⠀always⠀do⠀for⠀the⠀other,⠀the⠀joke⠀only⠀they⠀share,⠀the⠀silence⠀they⠀can⠀keep⠀without⠀strain.⠀Let⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀active⠀through⠀the⠀warmth⠀rather⠀than⠀despite⠀it.⠀The⠀comfort⠀should⠀raise⠀the⠀stakes⠀of⠀the⠀fall.⠀A⠀bond⠀that⠀feels⠀real⠀and⠀good⠀makes⠀the⠀later⠀loss⠀heavier.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀care⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀thing⠀a⠀character⠀remembers⠀when⠀everything⠀else⠀is⠀gone.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀comfort⠀remove⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.⠀Disagreement,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀personality⠀remain⠀intact.⠀The⠀warmth⠀coexists⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀coming,⠀not⠀instead⠀of⠀it.\n\nMake⠀the⠀consequential⠀fall⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀relationships⠀that⠀provided⠀the⠀comfort.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀choose⠀duty⠀over⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀cared⠀for⠀them,⠀or⠀pride⠀over⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀needed⠀them.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternative⠀they⠀considered⠀and⠀why⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀take⠀it.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀warmth:⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture,⠀a⠀shared⠀preference,⠀a⠀kindness⠀that⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀returned.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored,⠀and⠀the⠀comfort⠀makes⠀that⠀loss⠀meaningful⠀rather⠀than⠀softening⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀to⠀build⠀the⠀fall.⠀Let⠀each⠀scene⠀open⠀with⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀situate⠀it:⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀choice⠀possible,⠀the⠀history⠀that⠀weighs⠀on⠀a⠀relationship,⠀the⠀judgment⠀that⠀will⠀follow.⠀Distinguish⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀frame⠀the⠀moment,⠀not⠀merely⠀report⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀Kishimoto's⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict⠀at⠀the⠀center,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀wider⠀context⠀give⠀it⠀consequence.⠀A⠀personal⠀choice⠀about⠀love,⠀duty,⠀or⠀pride⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀choice⠀as⠀well.⠀A⠀memory⠀that⠀changes⠀a⠀present⠀encounter⠀should⠀also⠀reveal⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀world⠀the⠀characters⠀inhabit.⠀When⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀organizes⠀a⠀passage,⠀move⠀deliberately⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀registers:⠀show⠀the⠀public⠀demand⠀or⠀ceremony⠀that⠀requires⠀one⠀thing,⠀then⠀the⠀private⠀conversation⠀or⠀withheld⠀gesture⠀that⠀reveals⠀another.⠀Let⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀them⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀fall⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀decorative⠀interruption.\n\nMake⠀the⠀tragic⠀turn⠀a⠀choice⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀within⠀their⠀social⠀position.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternative⠀they⠀considered⠀and⠀why⠀their⠀duty,⠀pride,⠀or⠀love⠀made⠀it⠀impossible.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀through⠀the⠀wider⠀frame:⠀a⠀character⠀sees⠀what⠀their⠀choice⠀meant⠀not⠀only⠀for⠀themselves⠀but⠀for⠀others.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored,⠀and⠀the⠀formal⠀narration⠀should⠀let⠀that⠀loss⠀settle⠀into⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀rather⠀than⠀remain⠀a⠀private⠀wound.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀or⠀archaic⠀vocabulary;⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture⠀is⠀the⠀style,⠀not⠀the⠀scenery.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nTell⠀the⠀loss⠀as⠀a⠀spoken⠀account⠀with⠀a⠀live⠀occasion⠀and⠀a⠀live⠀stake.⠀Someone⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀needs⠀this⠀telling⠀now⠀—⠀to⠀decide⠀something,⠀to⠀forgive⠀someone,⠀to⠀stay⠀watchful⠀through⠀a⠀night⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀does⠀work⠀in⠀the⠀room:⠀it⠀persuades,⠀warns,⠀delays,⠀or⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀listeners⠀read⠀the⠀teller.⠀Keep⠀the⠀two⠀levels⠀easy⠀to⠀tell⠀apart⠀through⠀framing⠀beats:⠀who⠀speaks,⠀who⠀interrupts,⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀skips⠀or⠀repeats.\n\nLet⠀one⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀object⠀appear⠀both⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀and⠀inside⠀the⠀tale,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀return⠀add⠀to⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀The⠀pressure⠀builds⠀when⠀the⠀listeners⠀can⠀compare⠀the⠀told⠀version⠀against⠀outer⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀two⠀do⠀not⠀quite⠀agree⠀—⠀not⠀a⠀riddle⠀to⠀be⠀solved,⠀but⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀still⠀cannot⠀say⠀plainly.⠀An⠀interruption⠀can⠀force⠀the⠀teller⠀onto⠀ground⠀they⠀were⠀skirting;⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀name⠀or⠀a⠀sequence⠀can⠀reopen⠀a⠀moment⠀they⠀had⠀closed.⠀Wherever⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀reaches⠀private⠀experience,⠀use⠀it⠀for⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀polished⠀tale⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀actually⠀lived⠀—⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name,⠀the⠀sentence⠀begun⠀and⠀replaced.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀embedded⠀tragedy⠀around⠀two⠀commitments⠀that⠀could⠀not⠀both⠀be⠀kept⠀—⠀a⠀person,⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀home⠀—⠀and⠀stage⠀the⠀choice⠀that⠀made⠀them⠀incompatible⠀as⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀with⠀clear⠀spatial⠀staging:⠀where⠀people⠀stood,⠀what⠀hands⠀did,⠀what⠀was⠀seen⠀too⠀late.⠀Use⠀the⠀Kishimoto⠀profile's⠀memory-return⠀so⠀an⠀old⠀wound⠀surfaces⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀and⠀again⠀at⠀the⠀outer⠀level,⠀changing⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀for⠀a⠀concrete⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀reason.⠀Let⠀listeners⠀respond⠀as⠀practical⠀people⠀—⠀concern,⠀anger,⠀love⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀an⠀audience⠀held⠀in⠀wonder.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀land⠀at⠀the⠀outer⠀level:⠀a⠀listener⠀names⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀would⠀not,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀sees⠀their⠀own⠀omission⠀in⠀someone⠀else's⠀face.⠀It⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀without⠀repairing⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀shifts⠀under⠀that⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀finish⠀or⠀pause⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀falls;⠀no⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀owed,⠀and⠀the⠀frame⠀needs⠀no⠀court,⠀bargain,⠀or⠀desert⠀—⠀only⠀the⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀now⠀meaning⠀something⠀the⠀listeners⠀cannot⠀unhear.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realism⠀route.⠀Hold⠀a⠀medium⠀narrative⠀distance⠀that⠀opens⠀to⠀summarize⠀work,⠀housing,⠀family⠀obligation,⠀and⠀institutions,⠀then⠀closes⠀in⠀on⠀remembered⠀wounds,⠀an⠀old⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀physical⠀effort.⠀Let⠀sentence⠀construction⠀carry⠀consequence⠀—⠀subordinate⠀clauses⠀that⠀show⠀what⠀follows⠀from⠀what,⠀plain⠀verbs⠀for⠀labor,⠀exact⠀nouns⠀for⠀rooms,⠀contracts,⠀tools,⠀and⠀offices⠀—⠀following⠀the⠀established⠀narrator⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀invented⠀translated⠀word⠀order⠀or⠀dialect.\n\nLet⠀the⠀central⠀bond⠀begin⠀as⠀practical⠀alliance:⠀the⠀same⠀shift,⠀the⠀same⠀debt,⠀the⠀same⠀supervision.⠀Trust⠀grows⠀through⠀small⠀repeated⠀reliable⠀actions,⠀the⠀way⠀Kishimoto⠀turns⠀friction⠀and⠀rivalry⠀into⠀loyalty⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀keep⠀doing⠀for⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀his⠀clear⠀visual⠀staging⠀becomes⠀concrete⠀realist⠀scene-setting⠀—⠀who⠀occupies⠀which⠀room,⠀what⠀the⠀work⠀looks⠀like,⠀what⠀a⠀gesture⠀costs⠀in⠀that⠀setting.\n\nIntroduce⠀the⠀tragic⠀constraint⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀fact⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀supports⠀—⠀a⠀contract,⠀a⠀move,⠀an⠀inherited⠀duty,⠀a⠀public⠀accusation⠀—⠀and⠀show⠀it⠀making⠀the⠀old⠀cooperation⠀impossible⠀without⠀making⠀anyone⠀foolish⠀or⠀willful.⠀Let⠀the⠀fall⠀accumulate⠀through⠀decisions⠀each⠀reasonable⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀it⠀was⠀taken:⠀covering⠀for⠀someone,⠀sending⠀money,⠀keeping⠀a⠀message⠀quiet,⠀honoring⠀a⠀demand.⠀Keep⠀the⠀pressure⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀system⠀—⠀an⠀employer,⠀a⠀housing⠀rule,⠀a⠀family's⠀expectation⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀single⠀villain,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀remembered⠀moment⠀of⠀shared⠀work⠀or⠀shared⠀danger⠀return⠀when⠀one⠀character⠀sees⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀now⠀doing,⠀changing⠀the⠀encounter⠀for⠀reasons⠀the⠀memory⠀actually⠀supports.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀as⠀exact⠀practical⠀understanding:⠀one⠀finally⠀sees⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀their⠀roads⠀diverged⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀other⠀could⠀not⠀follow.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀explained⠀aloud.⠀Render⠀aftermath⠀in⠀ordinary⠀continuation⠀—⠀a⠀room⠀kept⠀as⠀it⠀was,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀more⠀slowly,⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀unanswered⠀—⠀with⠀the⠀loss⠀measured⠀in⠀daily⠀concrete⠀terms⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀climactic⠀argument.⠀Warmth⠀may⠀survive⠀inside⠀scenes;⠀the⠀arc⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀punishing⠀anyone.⠀Wherever⠀the⠀narration⠀permits⠀interiority,⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀reckoning⠀with⠀the⠀choice,⠀not⠀only⠀its⠀visible⠀results.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀contains⠀—⠀inherited⠀standing,⠀an⠀institution,⠀a⠀family,⠀a⠀network⠀that⠀still⠀allocates⠀work,⠀shelter,⠀or⠀safety⠀—⠀as⠀a⠀material⠀fact⠀of⠀present⠀urban⠀life.⠀Render⠀it⠀through⠀exact⠀decaying⠀detail:⠀a⠀broken⠀fixture⠀no⠀one⠀repairs,⠀a⠀ledger,⠀keys⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀fit,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀stairwell.⠀Let⠀atmosphere⠀work⠀on⠀the⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it:⠀shifts⠀in⠀light,⠀noise,⠀and⠀crowding⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀scene⠀feels⠀from⠀inside,⠀and⠀the⠀characters⠀notice.\n\nCenter⠀a⠀bond⠀that⠀began⠀as⠀mutual⠀protection⠀within⠀this⠀world⠀and⠀is⠀shown⠀through⠀practical⠀care.⠀Use⠀the⠀Kishimoto⠀profile's⠀memory-return⠀—⠀one⠀clear⠀flashback⠀to⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀rescued⠀or⠀believed⠀the⠀other,⠀staged⠀visually⠀enough⠀to⠀read⠀as⠀prose⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀to⠀sharpen⠀why⠀the⠀current⠀fracture⠀hurts.⠀Let⠀the⠀intimacy⠀be⠀morally⠀complicated⠀and⠀genuinely⠀wanted⠀on⠀both⠀sides,⠀never⠀a⠀trap⠀laid⠀from⠀the⠀beginning;⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀fear⠀get⠀their⠀real⠀interior⠀weight⠀wherever⠀the⠀narration⠀reaches⠀them,⠀since⠀the⠀public⠀mask⠀is⠀what⠀others⠀see,⠀not⠀all⠀the⠀character⠀is.\n\nLet⠀the⠀inherited⠀structure⠀interpret⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀privilege⠀attached⠀to⠀blood⠀or⠀name,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀role,⠀a⠀lineage⠀can⠀force⠀a⠀choice⠀between⠀the⠀bond⠀and⠀practical⠀survival,⠀so⠀that⠀two⠀people⠀who⠀want⠀the⠀same⠀thing⠀cannot⠀keep⠀it⠀on⠀these⠀terms.⠀Social⠀masks⠀organize⠀the⠀telling⠀—⠀performed⠀selves⠀for⠀the⠀authority,⠀and⠀the⠀trusted-company⠀moments⠀where⠀the⠀masks⠀come⠀off,⠀which⠀is⠀exactly⠀what⠀any⠀exposure⠀costs.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀mask⠀falls,⠀make⠀recognition⠀sudden⠀but⠀earned⠀—⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀differently,⠀a⠀gesture⠀recognized⠀from⠀before,⠀a⠀document⠀left⠀open⠀—⠀traceable⠀to⠀facts⠀established⠀earlier.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀or⠀redeem⠀the⠀institution⠀inside⠀the⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀aftermath⠀intimate⠀and⠀urban:⠀the⠀familiar⠀space⠀colder,⠀louder,⠀or⠀emptier⠀than⠀before,⠀the⠀city⠀continuing⠀without⠀that⠀particular⠀shared⠀room.⠀Import⠀nothing⠀of⠀vampire⠀physiology,⠀humanity⠀scores,⠀factions,⠀or⠀blood⠀bonds;⠀the⠀horror⠀here⠀is⠀personal⠀and⠀social.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀the⠀irreversible⠀separation⠀registers⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀tone⠀of⠀a⠀trusted⠀place,⠀without⠀staging⠀a⠀departure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀route.⠀Keep⠀attention⠀close⠀on⠀one⠀particular⠀household,⠀shop,⠀ward,⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀within⠀the⠀established⠀narration,⠀and⠀name⠀rooms,⠀utensils,⠀travel⠀routes,⠀and⠀work⠀shifts⠀with⠀the⠀precision⠀actual⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting.⠀Where⠀a⠀specific⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀or⠀period⠀is⠀given,⠀let⠀its⠀words⠀sit⠀naturally⠀in⠀context;⠀where⠀none⠀is⠀given,⠀add⠀no⠀invented⠀markers,⠀and⠀force⠀no⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀theme,⠀or⠀standard⠀family⠀shape⠀onto⠀the⠀cast.\n\nStage⠀the⠀central⠀relationship⠀through⠀practical⠀reliability⠀repeated⠀over⠀time⠀—⠀covering⠀an⠀absence,⠀keeping⠀the⠀accounts⠀straight,⠀walking⠀someone⠀home⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀loyalty⠀is⠀proven⠀in⠀what⠀people⠀do,⠀the⠀Kishimoto⠀method⠀of⠀friction⠀becoming⠀trust.⠀Give⠀the⠀remembered⠀wound⠀a⠀concrete⠀shape⠀the⠀story⠀supports:⠀a⠀failure,⠀an⠀accident,⠀a⠀death,⠀a⠀public⠀disgrace.⠀When⠀a⠀present⠀crisis⠀revives⠀it,⠀return⠀it⠀as⠀one⠀clear⠀image⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀encounter⠀for⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀reason.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀pressure⠀come⠀from⠀obligations⠀that⠀are⠀not⠀evil⠀—⠀emigration⠀for⠀work,⠀a⠀fixed⠀marriage,⠀a⠀duty⠀of⠀care,⠀a⠀debt⠀to⠀be⠀honored⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀love⠀and⠀duty⠀cannot⠀both⠀be⠀kept⠀and⠀every⠀choice⠀remains⠀understandable⠀to⠀the⠀reader.⠀Write⠀family⠀members⠀and⠀elders⠀as⠀particular⠀people:⠀some⠀generous,⠀some⠀rigid,⠀none⠀uniformly⠀oppressive;⠀friends⠀not⠀uniformly⠀wise.⠀Dialogue⠀carries⠀requests,⠀refusals,⠀and⠀reassurance⠀in⠀these⠀characters'⠀actual⠀idiom,⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀exchange⠀needs⠀to⠀become⠀confrontation.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀practical⠀perception⠀—⠀a⠀packed⠀bag,⠀a⠀ticket⠀confirmation,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀by⠀the⠀stove,⠀a⠀task⠀quietly⠀finished⠀—⠀and⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀without⠀undoing⠀it.⠀Render⠀aftermath⠀inside⠀the⠀continuing⠀routine:⠀a⠀meal⠀eaten⠀alone,⠀a⠀call⠀not⠀made,⠀a⠀task⠀performed⠀mechanically,⠀the⠀household⠀going⠀on⠀around⠀an⠀absence.⠀Wherever⠀the⠀narration⠀permits,⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀reckoning⠀its⠀full⠀interior⠀weight;⠀restraint⠀in⠀speech⠀is⠀not⠀absence⠀of⠀experience.⠀Domestic⠀details⠀can⠀carry⠀that⠀absence⠀at⠀whatever⠀point⠀the⠀scene⠀stops.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism⠀route.⠀Keep⠀vocabulary⠀plain⠀and⠀exact,⠀descriptions⠀short,⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀fitted⠀to⠀the⠀established⠀teller.⠀Understatement⠀governs⠀expression⠀—⠀what⠀characters⠀say⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀allow⠀to⠀show⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀still⠀makes⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀attention,⠀sensation,⠀and⠀feeling⠀available;⠀omission⠀is⠀a⠀surface⠀technique,⠀not⠀a⠀prohibition⠀on⠀interior⠀life.⠀Seasonal⠀and⠀time⠀markers⠀can⠀serve⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀emotional⠀clock⠀when⠀they⠀arise⠀naturally⠀—⠀rain⠀at⠀a⠀window,⠀the⠀turn⠀of⠀a⠀school⠀term,⠀a⠀train⠀schedule⠀—⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀scenery⠀inventory.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀bond⠀as⠀rivalry⠀or⠀friction⠀that⠀became⠀loyal⠀friendship⠀through⠀remembered⠀exchanges⠀of⠀help:⠀teaching,⠀covering,⠀enduring⠀something⠀together.⠀Keep⠀flashbacks⠀brief⠀and⠀visually⠀clear⠀—⠀one⠀strong⠀image⠀returning⠀when⠀a⠀present⠀echo⠀triggers⠀it⠀—⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀memory⠀a⠀concrete⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀for⠀what⠀it⠀changes⠀in⠀the⠀encounter,⠀in⠀the⠀Kishimoto⠀manner.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀conflict⠀arise⠀from⠀roles⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀refused⠀in⠀this⠀world⠀—⠀a⠀marriage,⠀a⠀transfer,⠀a⠀register,⠀an⠀elder's⠀expectation⠀—⠀with⠀both⠀characters⠀intelligent⠀enough⠀to⠀see⠀the⠀constraint⠀whole.⠀Stage⠀the⠀decisive⠀movement⠀in⠀practical⠀moments⠀rather⠀than⠀grand⠀argument:⠀a⠀proposal⠀answered⠀by⠀silence,⠀a⠀ticket⠀bought,⠀a⠀promise⠀released⠀with⠀a⠀polite⠀phrase.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀felt⠀drives⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀wound⠀sharpens⠀it⠀when⠀one⠀recognizes⠀in⠀the⠀other⠀an⠀old⠀recklessness⠀now⠀patiently⠀trained⠀away.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀at⠀small⠀scale⠀—⠀an⠀unsteady⠀pour,⠀the⠀truth⠀inside⠀a⠀hesitating⠀phrase⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀without⠀forcing⠀confession⠀or⠀repair.⠀Afterward⠀the⠀loss⠀stays⠀inside⠀ordinary⠀settings:⠀a⠀corridor,⠀a⠀platform,⠀a⠀kitchen⠀where⠀a⠀habitual⠀action⠀is⠀now⠀performed⠀with⠀different⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀plain,⠀specific⠀image⠀is⠀available⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀reaches⠀one;⠀nothing⠀requires⠀a⠀completed⠀ritual,⠀a⠀spoken⠀farewell,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀symbol,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Narrate⠀in⠀the⠀established⠀person⠀and⠀distance,⠀with⠀close⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀neighborhood's⠀lived⠀geography⠀—⠀the⠀bus⠀route,⠀the⠀stall,⠀the⠀rented⠀room,⠀the⠀night⠀shift⠀—⠀treating⠀the⠀city⠀as⠀a⠀pressure⠀system⠀of⠀distance,⠀fares,⠀schedules,⠀and⠀employers⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀picture⠀postcard.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀take⠀some⠀rhythm⠀from⠀how⠀these⠀characters⠀actually⠀speak⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀language⠀supports⠀it,⠀without⠀decorative⠀localism.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀supplied⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history,⠀and⠀add⠀no⠀supernatural⠀fact⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀it.\n\nForm⠀the⠀central⠀bond⠀under⠀practical⠀need⠀—⠀shared⠀work,⠀shared⠀watchfulness,⠀mutual⠀shelter⠀—⠀with⠀loyalty⠀proven⠀in⠀small⠀repeated⠀acts,⠀following⠀the⠀Kishimoto⠀profile's⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict.⠀Give⠀the⠀remembered⠀wound⠀a⠀concrete⠀history⠀the⠀story⠀supports,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀sensory⠀memory⠀that⠀both⠀explains⠀the⠀trust⠀and⠀names⠀what⠀these⠀characters⠀fear⠀losing.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀incompatibility⠀emerge⠀from⠀diverging⠀exits:⠀one⠀path⠀requires⠀leaving,⠀hiding⠀a⠀shared⠀history,⠀or⠀breaking⠀a⠀commitment;⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀held⠀in⠀place⠀by⠀family,⠀debt,⠀or⠀legal⠀status.⠀Each⠀understands⠀the⠀other's⠀choice⠀even⠀as⠀it⠀costs⠀them,⠀and⠀no⠀villain⠀need⠀arrange⠀the⠀harm.⠀Give⠀every⠀step⠀its⠀practical⠀basis⠀—⠀money,⠀papers,⠀hours,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀vehicle⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀fall⠀is⠀economically⠀legible⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀emotional,⠀and⠀any⠀advance⠀in⠀position⠀has⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀ground⠀rather⠀than⠀arriving⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀wants⠀it.\n\nBring⠀recognition⠀in⠀close⠀sensory⠀terms⠀grounded⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀established:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀cheap⠀gasoline⠀on⠀work⠀clothes,⠀a⠀bus⠀pulling⠀away,⠀rain⠀on⠀a⠀plastic⠀tarp.⠀Afterward,⠀stay⠀with⠀ordinary⠀continuation⠀—⠀shifts⠀missed,⠀rent⠀unpaid,⠀a⠀number⠀changed⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀city⠀runs⠀loud⠀and⠀indifferent⠀around⠀a⠀private⠀loss,⠀and⠀carry⠀in⠀interiority⠀whatever⠀the⠀surface⠀hides,⠀wherever⠀the⠀narration⠀reaches⠀it.⠀The⠀remaining⠀character⠀may⠀come⠀to⠀read⠀these⠀streets⠀as⠀shared⠀history;⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀at⠀its⠀own⠀boundary⠀without⠀a⠀staged⠀final⠀image.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly⠀—⠀inside⠀conversation⠀or⠀motion⠀already⠀running⠀—⠀and⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀with⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀crisp⠀spatial⠀cues⠀so⠀every⠀movement⠀stays⠀followable.⠀Keep⠀paragraphs⠀short,⠀with⠀readable⠀breaks⠀separating⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀When⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀name⠀or⠀mechanic⠀matters,⠀give⠀it⠀one⠀clear⠀presentation⠀line⠀and⠀move⠀on.\n\nFollow⠀key⠀lines⠀and⠀turns⠀with⠀a⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beat:⠀a⠀tightened⠀fist,⠀a⠀skipped⠀breath,⠀a⠀short⠀run⠀of⠀unspoken⠀thought⠀where⠀the⠀narration⠀allows⠀it.⠀Write⠀the⠀beat⠀in⠀its⠀owner's⠀actual⠀register⠀—⠀serious,⠀numb,⠀angry,⠀or⠀dryly⠀funny⠀as⠀that⠀particular⠀person⠀is⠀—⠀without⠀explaining⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀past⠀bond⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀brief,⠀vivid⠀image,⠀for⠀instance⠀a⠀shared⠀job,⠀a⠀fight⠀once⠀won⠀together,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀somewhere⠀ordinary;⠀stage⠀it⠀visually,⠀trigger⠀it⠀from⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀present,⠀and⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀concrete⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀reason⠀to⠀change⠀the⠀encounter,⠀in⠀the⠀manner⠀of⠀the⠀Kishimoto⠀profile's⠀remembered⠀wounds.⠀No⠀monologue⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀carry⠀it.\n\nMake⠀the⠀tragic⠀core⠀a⠀single⠀decision⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀walked⠀back⠀—⠀leaving,⠀refusing⠀help,⠀accepting⠀a⠀duty,⠀telling⠀the⠀truth⠀—⠀taken⠀by⠀an⠀intelligent⠀person⠀for⠀intelligible⠀reasons,⠀with⠀the⠀cost⠀visible⠀on⠀both⠀sides.⠀Where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀dialogue⠀spare⠀and⠀natural,⠀each⠀line⠀changing⠀something,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀staging⠀clear⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀who⠀stands⠀where.⠀After⠀the⠀decision,⠀let⠀its⠀consequence⠀register⠀physically⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀street:⠀an⠀empty⠀chair,⠀an⠀unread⠀message,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀hallway⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀become⠀impossible.\n\nThe⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀wherever⠀its⠀scene⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀mid-motion,⠀on⠀a⠀reaction,⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀still⠀unanswered⠀—⠀owing⠀neither⠀a⠀resolution⠀nor⠀a⠀cliffhanger;⠀the⠀paragraph⠀rhythm⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀loss⠀legible⠀at⠀whatever⠀point⠀the⠀telling⠀pauses.⠀In⠀whatever⠀lines⠀do⠀close⠀the⠀response,⠀keep⠀the⠀grounding⠀concrete⠀and⠀visual⠀so⠀the⠀weight⠀lands⠀without⠀a⠀staged⠀curtain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging⠀and⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action,⠀but⠀let⠀lyrical⠀patterning⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀showing⠀what⠀a⠀bond⠀means⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀it⠀breaks.⠀A⠀present⠀action⠀or⠀exchange⠀can⠀bear⠀a⠀comparison⠀that⠀the⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀later,⠀so⠀that⠀recognition⠀changes⠀the⠀image⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀explaining⠀the⠀loss.⠀Keep⠀the⠀comparison⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀scene:⠀what⠀was⠀touched,⠀remembered,⠀or⠀said⠀becomes⠀the⠀material⠀of⠀the⠀repeated⠀figure.⠀When⠀a⠀particular⠀sound⠀or⠀cadence⠀returns,⠀have⠀it⠀return⠀because⠀the⠀relationship's⠀stake⠀has⠀shifted,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀prose⠀requires⠀ornament.\n\nLet⠀the⠀fall⠀remain⠀intelligible⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀reasons⠀and⠀possibilities.⠀Set⠀out⠀the⠀meaningful⠀alternative⠀in⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀the⠀sentence,⠀not⠀in⠀an⠀editorial⠀aside;⠀show⠀that⠀a⠀refusal⠀or⠀return⠀was⠀possible⠀by⠀giving⠀the⠀other⠀path⠀a⠀concrete⠀shape.⠀Stage⠀the⠀consequence⠀in⠀a⠀physically⠀clear⠀moment—an⠀action⠀interrupted,⠀a⠀task⠀finished⠀badly,⠀a⠀promise⠀remembered⠀too⠀exactly—and⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀lyrical⠀passage⠀dwell⠀on⠀that⠀consequence.⠀The⠀inward⠀recognition⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀image,⠀now⠀changed:⠀the⠀first⠀occurrence⠀may⠀have⠀promised⠀continuity,⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀occurrence⠀may⠀mark⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀Let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserve⠀a⠀specific⠀detail,⠀word,⠀or⠀gesture⠀rather⠀than⠀converting⠀all⠀warmth⠀into⠀mourning.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀characters⠀to⠀speak⠀figuratively⠀everywhere.⠀A⠀plain⠀statement⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀rhythmic⠀passage⠀and⠀carry⠀the⠀decisive⠀information.⠀The⠀style⠀selects⠀and⠀repeats,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀fate⠀where⠀every⠀attachment⠀is⠀already⠀ruin⠀or⠀every⠀insight⠀is⠀melancholy.⠀Warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀must⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀actual⠀story,⠀and⠀people⠀may⠀act⠀capably⠀even⠀in⠀defeat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nUse⠀a⠀clear⠀present⠀encounter⠀as⠀the⠀anchor⠀for⠀reflection.⠀Kishimoto's⠀staging⠀should⠀keep⠀the⠀immediate⠀conflict⠀legible:⠀one⠀person⠀arrives⠀with⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀memory,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀responds.⠀Let⠀reflection⠀move⠀between⠀that⠀present⠀difficulty⠀and⠀a⠀precise⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀so⠀that⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available⠀becomes⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀stake.⠀A⠀remembered⠀detail—a⠀way⠀of⠀waiting,⠀a⠀shared⠀route,⠀a⠀phrase⠀whose⠀use⠀has⠀changed—carries⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀small⠀irreversible⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀reflection⠀erase⠀the⠀action;⠀after⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀the⠀practical⠀consequence⠀should⠀feel⠀heavier,⠀not⠀postponed.\n\nShow⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀through⠀accumulated⠀recognitions.⠀A⠀present⠀decision⠀can⠀be⠀traced⠀to⠀earlier⠀refusals⠀or⠀loyalties,⠀but⠀each⠀step⠀must⠀remain⠀a⠀choice⠀for⠀the⠀person⠀making⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀alternative⠀intelligible:⠀the⠀reflective⠀passage⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀another⠀course⠀was⠀open,⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀present⠀action⠀should⠀show⠀why⠀it⠀is⠀now⠀lost.⠀Use⠀remembered⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀as⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀meaning,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀placeholder⠀for⠀sadness.⠀The⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable⠀even⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀recognizes⠀what⠀has⠀gone.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀land⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀sentence⠀or⠀gesture.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀prepare⠀it⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀but⠀the⠀tragic⠀turn⠀should⠀happen⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀summary.⠀Afterward,⠀preserve⠀the⠀loss⠀rather⠀than⠀resolving⠀it⠀with⠀comfort.⠀The⠀final⠀movement⠀can⠀leave⠀the⠀real⠀task⠀unfinished⠀or⠀the⠀relationship⠀changed,⠀without⠀requiring⠀every⠀reflection⠀to⠀announce⠀impermanence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀structure:⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀addresses⠀an⠀audience⠀that⠀has⠀asked⠀for⠀or⠀needs⠀to⠀hear⠀a⠀particular⠀account.⠀The⠀teller's⠀present⠀circumstances⠀may⠀briefly⠀frame⠀the⠀tale,⠀but⠀the⠀frame⠀should⠀not⠀overshadow⠀the⠀story.⠀Within⠀the⠀account,⠀keep⠀Kishimoto's⠀staging⠀legible—each⠀exchange⠀is⠀placed⠀clearly,⠀and⠀an⠀action's⠀practical⠀consequence⠀is⠀shown.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀pause⠀to⠀reflect⠀on⠀a⠀relationship⠀or⠀to⠀mark⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀already⠀know;⠀these⠀pauses⠀deepen⠀the⠀audience's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀loss⠀rather⠀than⠀providing⠀editorial⠀commentary.\n\nChoose⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀route⠀with⠀reflective⠀prose,⠀not⠀a⠀fantastic⠀or⠀mystical⠀apparatus.⠀The⠀tragic⠀material⠀arises⠀from⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀working⠀partnership,⠀a⠀journey⠀among⠀neighbors,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀undertaking,⠀and⠀from⠀the⠀ways⠀people⠀are⠀bound⠀by⠀obligation⠀and⠀affection.⠀Tell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀incidents⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀selects⠀because⠀they⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Use⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀or⠀gesture⠀as⠀the⠀teller's⠀way⠀of⠀organizing⠀repeated⠀moments:⠀first⠀as⠀a⠀promise⠀or⠀sign⠀of⠀trust,⠀then⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀a⠀changed⠀relation,⠀finally⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀recognition⠀means.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀particular⠀folkloric⠀inventory;⠀let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀grow⠀from⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀concrete⠀actions.\n\nThe⠀teller⠀may⠀possess⠀later⠀knowledge,⠀but⠀must⠀distinguish⠀it⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀understanding⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀comments⠀that⠀a⠀choice⠀would⠀prove⠀costly,⠀do⠀so⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀characters⠀foolish.⠀Keep⠀the⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀told⠀scenes⠀themselves.⠀End⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀finish⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀object,⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀the⠀audience's⠀silence,⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀moral⠀lesson.⠀The⠀frame's⠀closing⠀may⠀be⠀brief,⠀but⠀the⠀tragedy⠀should⠀remain⠀a⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀characters'⠀choices,⠀not⠀a⠀preordained⠀lesson⠀told⠀at⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nStage⠀each⠀significant⠀action⠀clearly⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀details.⠀A⠀relationship⠀is⠀shown⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀handle,⠀where⠀they⠀stand,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀say,⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀a⠀long⠀analysis.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀for⠀the⠀choice⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀consequence.⠀When⠀a⠀memory⠀changes⠀a⠀present⠀encounter,⠀bring⠀in⠀only⠀the⠀single⠀memory⠀detail⠀that⠀alters⠀the⠀present⠀response;⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀the⠀shared⠀history⠀from⠀its⠀effect.\n\nMake⠀the⠀tragic⠀fall⠀legible⠀through⠀repeated⠀small⠀actions.⠀A⠀recurring⠀gesture⠀or⠀object⠀can⠀return⠀once⠀with⠀meaning,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀comparison.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀refuses⠀an⠀alternative,⠀show⠀the⠀alternative⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀possibility⠀in⠀the⠀scene—an⠀offered⠀route,⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀question—and⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀refusal⠀without⠀summarizing⠀its⠀morality.⠀Keep⠀the⠀characters⠀intelligent:⠀their⠀reasons⠀may⠀be⠀implied⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀notice⠀and⠀by⠀the⠀specific⠀terms⠀of⠀their⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀simple⠀observation⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀direct⠀sentence,⠀not⠀a⠀reflective⠀paragraph.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀to⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀The⠀final⠀beat⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀character⠀looking⠀at⠀an⠀object,⠀speaking⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀completing⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task,⠀and⠀the⠀withheld⠀explanation⠀is⠀the⠀aftermath.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀causality:⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀infer⠀why⠀the⠀loss⠀matters⠀from⠀the⠀established⠀details.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀be⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀short⠀fragments⠀when⠀the⠀thought⠀requires⠀it.⠀The⠀style's⠀economy⠀is⠀a⠀selection⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀ban⠀on⠀all⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀practical⠀situation⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀move⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀as⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀requires.⠀Use⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging:⠀no⠀matter⠀how⠀much⠀the⠀prose⠀moves⠀inward,⠀keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀and⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀relationship⠀carries⠀the⠀conflict,⠀show⠀the⠀bond⠀through⠀concrete⠀interaction—a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀pointed⠀question,⠀a⠀remembered⠀obligation⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀current⠀response—rather⠀than⠀telling⠀the⠀reader⠀how⠀close⠀they⠀are.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀reasoning⠀as⠀it⠀is⠀rendered⠀in⠀the⠀prose.⠀Present⠀alternatives⠀not⠀as⠀authorial⠀warnings⠀but⠀as⠀live⠀possibilities:⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀offers⠀a⠀different⠀choice,⠀a⠀suggestion⠀someone⠀tries⠀to⠀make,⠀a⠀practical⠀plan⠀that⠀would⠀have⠀worked.⠀The⠀narrative⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀awareness⠀that⠀the⠀alternative⠀exists,⠀and⠀then⠀show⠀why⠀it⠀is⠀refused⠀or⠀lost.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀fall⠀depend⠀on⠀sudden⠀stupidity.⠀Recognition⠀can⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀or⠀says,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀slow⠀enough⠀at⠀that⠀moment⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀loss⠀felt,⠀but⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀turn⠀into⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀theme.\n\nUse⠀recollection⠀selectively.⠀A⠀memory⠀may⠀return⠀because⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀calls⠀it:⠀a⠀tone⠀of⠀voice,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀task.⠀Let⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀next,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀moving.⠀At⠀the⠀end,⠀let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀rest⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀conversation.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀with⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀but⠀avoid⠀recapping⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀showed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀to⠀private⠀experience⠀aligned⠀with⠀the⠀chosen⠀point⠀of⠀view;⠀other⠀characters'⠀pasts⠀may⠀be⠀inferred⠀but⠀not⠀known.⠀This⠀combination⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀modern⠀setting⠀or⠀understated⠀emotion,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀require⠀the⠀emotion⠀to⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀its⠀choices.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀scene⠀selection⠀establish⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀that⠀show⠀what⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀do⠀for⠀each⠀other,⠀how⠀they⠀speak⠀when⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀is⠀listening,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀bond⠀makes⠀possible.⠀Use⠀the⠀established⠀premise,⠀not⠀a⠀default⠀set⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀If⠀there⠀is⠀affection,⠀show⠀its⠀particular⠀form;⠀if⠀there⠀is⠀rivalry⠀or⠀comfort,⠀keep⠀it⠀rooted⠀in⠀this⠀pair's⠀history.⠀Give⠀these⠀moments⠀enough⠀space⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀lost⠀before⠀loss⠀becomes⠀irreversible.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀out⠀of⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀shared⠀joke⠀can⠀return,⠀but⠀its⠀second⠀use⠀must⠀mean⠀something⠀different⠀in⠀the⠀relationship.⠀A⠀callback⠀should⠀signal⠀a⠀change—one⠀partner⠀now⠀hesitates,⠀the⠀old⠀phrase⠀is⠀said⠀with⠀effort,⠀or⠀the⠀familiar⠀comfort⠀has⠀become⠀an⠀accusation.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀be⠀staged⠀clearly:⠀Kishimoto-style⠀action⠀is⠀still⠀significant⠀even⠀in⠀an⠀intimate⠀setting.⠀A⠀task⠀done⠀together,⠀a⠀doorway⠀blocked,⠀a⠀hand⠀pulled⠀away,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀made⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀ordinary⠀domestic⠀work⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀turn.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀emotional⠀conflict⠀depend⠀on⠀everyone⠀becoming⠀inarticulate⠀or⠀cruel;⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀stronger⠀if⠀both⠀remain⠀intelligent⠀and⠀if⠀the⠀rejected⠀alternative⠀was⠀real.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀come⠀through⠀the⠀relationship's⠀own⠀terms.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀realize⠀the⠀change⠀when⠀the⠀private⠀language⠀no⠀longer⠀works,⠀or⠀when⠀a⠀memory⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀happy⠀moment⠀returns⠀with⠀new⠀meaning.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀aftermath⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀relationship⠀detail:⠀a⠀side⠀of⠀the⠀bed,⠀a⠀photo,⠀a⠀voice⠀message,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀plan.⠀The⠀ending⠀should⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀constant⠀pain.⠀Ordinary⠀care⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀warm⠀even⠀near⠀the⠀turn,⠀and⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀a⠀consequence⠀of⠀choices,⠀not⠀a⠀genre-driven⠀punishment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀retelling⠀of⠀deeds⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀opening⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀the⠀conflict;⠀let⠀compact⠀declarations⠀introduce⠀a⠀person's⠀established⠀quality⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀consequence.⠀When⠀an⠀action⠀is⠀shown,⠀make⠀its⠀staging⠀clear—who⠀moved⠀first,⠀what⠀was⠀at⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀moment—so⠀that⠀the⠀chronicle⠀does⠀not⠀flatten⠀conflict⠀into⠀summary.⠀Use⠀Kishimoto's⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀of⠀the⠀account:⠀rivals,⠀companions,⠀and⠀family⠀act⠀for⠀reasons⠀that⠀the⠀audience⠀sees⠀in⠀concrete⠀scenes,⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀judgment.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀phrases⠀and⠀names⠀to⠀organize⠀the⠀tragedy.⠀A⠀phrase⠀may⠀attach⠀to⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀a⠀task;⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀act⠀has⠀acquired⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀know⠀how⠀things⠀ended,⠀but⠀the⠀scenes⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀characters'⠀choices⠀as⠀they⠀were⠀made.⠀Include⠀the⠀alternative⠀so⠀that⠀listeners⠀understand⠀what⠀was⠀refused.⠀When⠀a⠀warning⠀appears,⠀let⠀it⠀arise⠀within⠀the⠀scene—a⠀person⠀speaks⠀against⠀the⠀course,⠀a⠀practical⠀difficulty⠀is⠀visible—rather⠀than⠀as⠀an⠀external⠀admonition.⠀Let⠀recognition⠀occur⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀pauses⠀to⠀state⠀how⠀an⠀earlier⠀act⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀after⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀teller's⠀later⠀knowledge⠀may⠀color⠀the⠀account,⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀characters'⠀real⠀deliberation.\n\nThe⠀aftermath⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀telling⠀itself.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀end⠀by⠀reciting⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀deed⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀remembers,⠀preserving⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀Keep⠀the⠀source⠀tradition⠀coherent:⠀do⠀not⠀mix⠀unrelated⠀epic⠀conventions⠀or⠀import⠀a⠀specific⠀pantheon⠀or⠀doom.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀task⠀resumed⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished;⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀tonal⠀weight⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀relation⠀of⠀the⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered,⠀not⠀from⠀declaring⠀every⠀defeat⠀heroic.⠀Avoid⠀making⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀like⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀performer;⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀speech⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀elevated⠀register⠀and⠀still⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀telling.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nGround⠀each⠀consequential⠀choice⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀obligations⠀of⠀the⠀selected⠀community:⠀family⠀care,⠀work,⠀housing,⠀money,⠀local⠀reputation,⠀or⠀an⠀institution⠀whose⠀rules⠀are⠀legible⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀living⠀under⠀them.⠀Make⠀the⠀setting⠀particular⠀and⠀practical.⠀A⠀room,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀meeting⠀hall⠀matters⠀because⠀of⠀who⠀can⠀enter⠀it,⠀what⠀work⠀happens⠀there,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀owe⠀one⠀another⠀in⠀that⠀space.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀observe⠀these⠀conditions⠀plainly⠀rather⠀than⠀treating⠀reserve,⠀snow,⠀or⠀isolation⠀as⠀automatic⠀atmosphere.\n\nStage⠀relationship-driven⠀scenes⠀with⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀physical⠀and⠀emotional⠀legibility.⠀When⠀two⠀people⠀meet,⠀make⠀their⠀history⠀visible⠀in⠀how⠀they⠀move,⠀what⠀they⠀avoid,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀task⠀brings⠀them⠀together.⠀A⠀remembered⠀wound⠀should⠀enter⠀the⠀present⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀trigger:⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture,⠀an⠀object⠀still⠀in⠀use,⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀in⠀a⠀changed⠀tone,⠀or⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀now⠀falls⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀The⠀memory⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀encounter⠀means⠀rather⠀than⠀simply⠀decorating⠀it.⠀An⠀earned⠀advance⠀can⠀occur⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀acts⠀on⠀knowledge⠀or⠀feeling⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀prepared⠀by⠀earlier⠀scenes,⠀but⠀the⠀advance⠀need⠀not⠀repair⠀the⠀underlying⠀loss.\n\nLet⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀remain⠀intelligible⠀through⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀itself.⠀Another⠀character⠀can⠀name⠀the⠀risk,⠀offer⠀help,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀reasonable⠀counterproposal⠀in⠀terms⠀the⠀community⠀would⠀actually⠀use:⠀a⠀neighbor⠀offers⠀to⠀take⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀colleague⠀explains⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀will⠀cost,⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀proposes⠀a⠀different⠀arrangement.⠀The⠀tragic⠀figure⠀may⠀refuse⠀for⠀a⠀supportable⠀reason:⠀loyalty,⠀pride,⠀fear⠀of⠀shame,⠀love,⠀or⠀a⠀mistaken⠀belief⠀about⠀what⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀saved.⠀Show⠀the⠀refusal⠀as⠀an⠀active⠀choice⠀with⠀practical⠀consequences,⠀not⠀as⠀stubbornness⠀the⠀reader⠀is⠀merely⠀told⠀to⠀expect.\n\nUse⠀the⠀social-realist⠀route⠀to⠀keep⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀in⠀composed⠀prose⠀while⠀distinguishing⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀knows.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀report⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀thought,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀bodily⠀awareness⠀without⠀entering⠀other⠀minds.⠀A⠀neighbor⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀result⠀of⠀a⠀choice⠀without⠀understanding⠀its⠀motive,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀understand⠀the⠀motive⠀without⠀the⠀neighbor⠀becoming⠀omniscient.⠀When⠀the⠀narration⠀moves⠀outward,⠀let⠀it⠀register⠀the⠀visible⠀aftermath⠀of⠀private⠀decisions:⠀a⠀changed⠀routine,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀differently.\n\nShow⠀recognition⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀understanding,⠀not⠀a⠀sudden⠀speech.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀realize⠀what⠀a⠀choice⠀has⠀cost⠀while⠀continuing⠀to⠀live⠀with⠀its⠀consequences.⠀Let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀an⠀empty⠀place⠀at⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀job⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀done⠀differently,⠀a⠀relationship⠀that⠀remains⠀civil⠀but⠀altered,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀outlasts⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀incurred⠀it.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀observe⠀these⠀conditions⠀plainly⠀without⠀insisting⠀that⠀every⠀scene⠀end⠀in⠀punishment.\n\nLet⠀the⠀story⠀move⠀through⠀ordinary⠀time.⠀Compress⠀uneventful⠀intervals,⠀but⠀preserve⠀the⠀changes⠀that⠀matter:⠀a⠀child⠀grows⠀old⠀enough⠀to⠀ask⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀house⠀changes⠀hands,⠀an⠀institution⠀revises⠀its⠀rules⠀too⠀late.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀accumulates⠀through⠀such⠀changes⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀melodramatic⠀reversal.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀or⠀installment⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀redemptive⠀turn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaqaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀in⠀concise⠀scene⠀blocks.⠀Use⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀then⠀present⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀events⠀in⠀readable⠀action⠀lines.⠀Keep⠀the⠀action⠀specific⠀enough⠀to⠀stage:⠀who⠀enters,⠀what⠀they⠀carry,⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀with⠀their⠀hands,⠀where⠀they⠀stand⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀another⠀person.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship.⠀A⠀pause,⠀a⠀turned⠀back,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀continued⠀too⠀long⠀can⠀show⠀feeling⠀without⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀explaining⠀it.\n\nGive⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀clear⠀cue⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀dialogue⠀fit⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation.⠀Characters⠀may⠀argue,⠀reassure,⠀warn,⠀or⠀refuse.⠀A⠀warning⠀should⠀be⠀intelligible⠀to⠀the⠀audience⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀alternative,⠀not⠀a⠀hollow⠀signal⠀that⠀the⠀fall⠀is⠀coming.⠀The⠀tragic⠀figure⠀can⠀reject⠀help⠀for⠀a⠀supportable⠀reason,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀reason⠀in⠀action:⠀loyalty⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀person,⠀pride⠀before⠀a⠀witness,⠀fear⠀of⠀losing⠀a⠀role,⠀or⠀a⠀mistaken⠀belief⠀about⠀what⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀saved.⠀Let⠀the⠀refusal⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀visible⠀choice—a⠀door⠀not⠀opened,⠀a⠀call⠀not⠀made,⠀a⠀task⠀continued⠀past⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀return—rather⠀than⠀only⠀as⠀a⠀spoken⠀line.\n\nUse⠀memories⠀as⠀present⠀visual⠀or⠀auditory⠀triggers.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀stop⠀at⠀an⠀object,⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀another⠀person⠀once⠀used,⠀or⠀perform⠀a⠀task⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀learned⠀from⠀someone⠀now⠀absent.⠀The⠀memory⠀changes⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀flashback.⠀If⠀a⠀flashback⠀is⠀used,⠀make⠀it⠀a⠀clear⠀scene⠀change⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀heading⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀serve⠀the⠀present⠀choice.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue⠀and⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀one⠀thing⠀while⠀saying⠀another,⠀but⠀give⠀the⠀difference⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason:⠀embarrassment,⠀caution,⠀love,⠀or⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀keep⠀working.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀voice-over.⠀Use⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀it⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.\n\nStage⠀recognition⠀through⠀visible⠀behavior⠀and⠀scene⠀contrast.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀once⠀held⠀a⠀different⠀meaning,⠀perform⠀a⠀familiar⠀action⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀result,⠀or⠀look⠀at⠀someone⠀without⠀speaking.⠀The⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀change⠀because⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene⠀established⠀the⠀baseline.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀heading⠀or⠀action⠀line⠀register⠀the⠀changed⠀condition:⠀the⠀same⠀room⠀now⠀empty,⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀now⠀done⠀alone,⠀the⠀same⠀gesture⠀now⠀producing⠀no⠀answer.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀final⠀explanatory⠀speech.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀in⠀ordinary⠀activity:⠀a⠀seat⠀left⠀empty,⠀a⠀job⠀done⠀alone,⠀a⠀door⠀closed⠀without⠀anger.\n\nLet⠀scenes⠀end⠀on⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀acknowledgment.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀to⠀a⠀later⠀time⠀or⠀another⠀place,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀cut⠀to⠀manufacture⠀a⠀false⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀advances⠀through⠀accumulated⠀consequences,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀reversal⠀in⠀every⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
