p,⠀uncertainty,⠀concealment,⠀or⠀habit.⠀It⠀may⠀also⠀align⠀completely⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀says.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀through⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀that⠀revisits⠀a⠀familiar⠀action⠀or⠀line⠀with⠀new⠀significance⠀earned⠀by⠀intervening⠀events.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀in⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀particulars:⠀a⠀routine⠀continuing⠀with⠀an⠀absence,⠀a⠀chair⠀left⠀empty,⠀a⠀relationship⠀persisting⠀in⠀a⠀diminished⠀form.⠀The⠀sequence⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀result⠀or⠀an⠀interruption⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀confession,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀completed⠀test.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqatax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Make⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀contests⠀playable⠀by⠀pairing⠀each⠀redefinition⠀with⠀stage⠀business:⠀one⠀person⠀redefines⠀duty⠀while⠀setting⠀a⠀table,⠀another⠀corrects⠀a⠀term⠀while⠀handing⠀over⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀third⠀revises⠀an⠀old⠀promise⠀during⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀lets⠀the⠀audience⠀see⠀the⠀cost.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀A⠀chair⠀moved,⠀a⠀letter⠀folded,⠀a⠀door⠀closed,⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀wording⠀does⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀gesture⠀into⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.\n\nGive⠀individual⠀speakers⠀different⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes.⠀One⠀may⠀correct⠀terminology⠀to⠀protect⠀an⠀institution,⠀another⠀may⠀revise⠀a⠀family⠀promise⠀to⠀claim⠀authority,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀state⠀a⠀cost⠀plainly⠀because⠀plainness⠀is⠀the⠀only⠀leverage⠀left.⠀Not⠀every⠀minor⠀character⠀is⠀a⠀hyperverbal⠀philosopher;⠀the⠀density⠀of⠀wordplay⠀follows⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure.⠀Before⠀the⠀destructive⠀choice,⠀have⠀a⠀character⠀state⠀the⠀risk⠀plainly,⠀propose⠀another⠀course,⠀or⠀name⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀lost.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀choose⠀the⠀incompatible⠀good⠀for⠀a⠀defended⠀reason:⠀loyalty⠀to⠀one⠀obligation⠀over⠀another,⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀revised⠀without⠀betraying⠀someone,⠀a⠀definition⠀of⠀duty⠀that⠀excludes⠀the⠀available⠀escape.⠀Write⠀the⠀reasoning⠀as⠀intelligible⠀and⠀serious⠀rather⠀than⠀foolish.\n\nUse⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀have⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose.⠀A⠀monologue⠀can⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀revise⠀an⠀old⠀account⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀others,⠀exposing⠀self-deception⠀or⠀genuine⠀conflict⠀through⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explaining.⠀An⠀aside⠀can⠀reveal⠀a⠀private⠀reaction⠀to⠀a⠀public⠀line,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀permissions,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation⠀instead⠀of⠀disguising⠀it⠀as⠀something⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.\n\nLet⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀objects⠀carry⠀tragic⠀consequence⠀through⠀observable⠀stage⠀facts.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀leaves⠀after⠀a⠀revised⠀promise⠀changes⠀the⠀stage's⠀meaning;⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀enters⠀after⠀a⠀loss⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀sees.⠀Objects⠀can⠀anchor⠀recognition:⠀a⠀familiar⠀item⠀handled⠀differently,⠀a⠀letter⠀returned,⠀a⠀chair⠀left⠀empty.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀in⠀the⠀stage's⠀particulars:⠀a⠀routine⠀continuing⠀with⠀an⠀absence,⠀a⠀relationship⠀persisting⠀in⠀a⠀diminished⠀form,⠀a⠀table⠀set⠀for⠀one⠀fewer⠀person.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀result⠀or⠀an⠀interruption⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀confession,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀completed⠀test.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means;⠀the⠀play's⠀final⠀moments⠀can⠀hold⠀that⠀changed⠀meaning⠀without⠀resolving⠀every⠀relationship.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqatay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nBraid⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀through⠀one⠀particular⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀self-correction⠀operate⠀as⠀interior⠀argument:⠀the⠀mind⠀defines⠀a⠀term,⠀objects⠀to⠀its⠀own⠀definition,⠀contradicts⠀a⠀remembered⠀line,⠀revises⠀a⠀promise,⠀and⠀exposes⠀itself⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explaining.⠀A⠀word⠀can⠀recur⠀with⠀changing⠀weight—duty,⠀love,⠀home,⠀enough—and⠀each⠀recurrence⠀revises⠀what⠀the⠀mind⠀thought⠀it⠀meant.⠀Show⠀the⠀revision⠀as⠀it⠀happens,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀a⠀revision⠀that⠀already⠀occurred.\n\nKeep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀events⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀in⠀a⠀sensory⠀detail—a⠀kettle's⠀whistle,⠀a⠀cold⠀windowsill,⠀a⠀familiar⠀voice⠀in⠀another⠀room—while⠀memory⠀and⠀association⠀move⠀around⠀it.⠀Syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀may⠀follow⠀those⠀associations,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀still⠀tell⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀imagined⠀or⠀feared.⠀When⠀a⠀memory⠀surfaces,⠀let⠀its⠀sensory⠀particularity⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀memory;⠀when⠀a⠀fear⠀surfaces,⠀let⠀its⠀conditional⠀or⠀hypothetical⠀shape⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀fantasy.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀linear⠀report.⠀Before⠀the⠀destructive⠀choice,⠀have⠀the⠀mind⠀recall⠀someone⠀stating⠀the⠀risk⠀plainly,⠀proposing⠀another⠀course,⠀or⠀naming⠀the⠀cost.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀still⠀commit⠀to⠀the⠀incompatible⠀good⠀for⠀a⠀defended⠀reason:⠀loyalty⠀to⠀one⠀obligation⠀over⠀another,⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀revised⠀without⠀betraying⠀someone,⠀a⠀definition⠀of⠀duty⠀that⠀excludes⠀the⠀available⠀escape.⠀Render⠀that⠀reasoning⠀as⠀it⠀forms,⠀with⠀its⠀hesitations⠀and⠀returns,⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀the⠀character⠀articulate⠀their⠀own⠀doom.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀mind⠀to⠀be⠀unreliable⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀way:⠀it⠀revises⠀an⠀old⠀account,⠀reorders⠀a⠀memory,⠀or⠀finds⠀a⠀new⠀word⠀for⠀what⠀was⠀sacrificed,⠀and⠀the⠀revision⠀itself⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.⠀Recognition⠀arrives⠀as⠀an⠀associative⠀connection—a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀heard⠀differently,⠀a⠀remembered⠀gesture⠀understood⠀too⠀late—rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀sudden⠀external⠀event.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀through⠀recurring⠀concern:⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀routine,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀and⠀each⠀return⠀carries⠀the⠀absence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀technique⠀within⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind,⠀authorize⠀human-owned⠀thoughts,⠀or⠀turn⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate.⠀Ordinary⠀reasoning⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀this⠀stylistic⠀mode;⠀the⠀associative⠀movement⠀must⠀structure⠀the⠀telling.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqataz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀to⠀carry⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀contests⠀through⠀digital⠀exchange.⠀When⠀a⠀participant⠀redefines⠀a⠀promise,⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀term,⠀contradicts⠀an⠀earlier⠀account,⠀or⠀revises⠀an⠀agreement,⠀show⠀the⠀wording⠀as⠀a⠀transmitted⠀message⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other.⠀Give⠀each⠀person⠀distinct⠀digital⠀habits:⠀one⠀writes⠀long,⠀self-correcting⠀paragraphs;⠀another⠀sends⠀short,⠀plain⠀statements;⠀a⠀third⠀edits⠀after⠀sending⠀and⠀leaves⠀the⠀correction⠀visible.⠀The⠀habit⠀should⠀reveal⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀sender's⠀stakes,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorate⠀the⠀transcript.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀A⠀delay⠀can⠀carry⠀hesitation⠀or⠀preoccupation;⠀an⠀edit⠀can⠀expose⠀a⠀revision;⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀boundary;⠀a⠀channel⠀change⠀can⠀signal⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀sender⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀transmit.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀The⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀appear⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀means.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀included⠀when⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀and⠀when⠀it⠀matters.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀as⠀ordinary⠀narrative⠀prose⠀in⠀that⠀separated⠀context,⠀not⠀as⠀transmitted⠀text⠀or⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀other⠀senders.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀emerge⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀transmit,⠀revise,⠀and⠀withhold.⠀Before⠀the⠀destructive⠀choice,⠀have⠀a⠀message⠀state⠀the⠀risk⠀plainly,⠀propose⠀another⠀course,⠀or⠀name⠀the⠀cost.⠀The⠀participant⠀may⠀still⠀choose⠀the⠀incompatible⠀good⠀for⠀a⠀defended⠀reason:⠀loyalty⠀to⠀one⠀obligation⠀over⠀another,⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀revised⠀without⠀betraying⠀someone,⠀a⠀definition⠀of⠀duty⠀that⠀excludes⠀the⠀available⠀escape.⠀A⠀revised⠀wording⠀can⠀expose⠀self-deception⠀or⠀genuine⠀conflict⠀without⠀making⠀everyone⠀articulate⠀their⠀own⠀doom.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.⠀A⠀later⠀message⠀can⠀revisit⠀an⠀earlier⠀phrase⠀with⠀new⠀significance⠀earned⠀by⠀intervening⠀events.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀in⠀the⠀digital⠀particulars:⠀a⠀channel⠀gone⠀quiet,⠀a⠀routine⠀message⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀arrives,⠀a⠀relationship⠀persisting⠀in⠀a⠀diminished⠀form.⠀The⠀transcript⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀result⠀or⠀an⠀interruption⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀confession,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀completed⠀test.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqatba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Stage⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀contests⠀through⠀attributed⠀dialogue:⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀redefines⠀a⠀duty,⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀term,⠀contradicts⠀an⠀earlier⠀account,⠀or⠀revises⠀a⠀promise,⠀let⠀the⠀wording⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other.⠀Give⠀individual⠀speakers⠀different⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes;⠀not⠀every⠀minor⠀character⠀is⠀a⠀hyperverbal⠀philosopher.⠀The⠀density⠀of⠀wordplay⠀follows⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure.\n\nLet⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀function⠀as⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicators.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀attract⠀attention,⠀but⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀an⠀account⠀or⠀a⠀revised⠀wording⠀must⠀do⠀the⠀consequential⠀work.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible:⠀a⠀new⠀location,⠀time,⠀or⠀group⠀of⠀speakers⠀marks⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake.⠀Use⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀as⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nUse⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀explains⠀another⠀person's⠀behavior.⠀The⠀next⠀exchange⠀may⠀support⠀that⠀explanation,⠀complicate⠀it,⠀or⠀reveal⠀that⠀the⠀speaker⠀was⠀concerned⠀with⠀something⠀else⠀entirely.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expression⠀always⠀reveals⠀what⠀they⠀feel⠀or⠀whether⠀they⠀lie.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀emerge⠀through⠀scenes⠀whose⠀exchanges⠀change⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake.⠀Before⠀the⠀destructive⠀choice,⠀have⠀a⠀character⠀state⠀the⠀risk⠀plainly,⠀propose⠀another⠀course,⠀or⠀name⠀the⠀cost.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀choose⠀the⠀incompatible⠀good⠀for⠀a⠀defended⠀reason:⠀loyalty⠀to⠀one⠀obligation⠀over⠀another,⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀revised⠀without⠀betraying⠀someone,⠀a⠀definition⠀of⠀duty⠀that⠀excludes⠀the⠀available⠀escape.⠀Write⠀the⠀reasoning⠀as⠀intelligible⠀and⠀serious⠀rather⠀than⠀foolish.⠀A⠀revisit⠀can⠀use⠀a⠀familiar⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀as⠀an⠀anchor,⠀with⠀its⠀new⠀significance⠀earned⠀by⠀a⠀later⠀fact⠀or⠀line.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀particulars:⠀a⠀familiar⠀scene⠀continuing⠀with⠀an⠀absence,⠀a⠀relationship⠀persisting⠀in⠀a⠀diminished⠀form,⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀includes⠀someone.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀activate⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands.⠀Preserve⠀whichever⠀authorship⠀contract⠀is⠀active.⠀A⠀discovery⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀new⠀conversation⠀rather⠀than⠀force⠀a⠀choice⠀screen,⠀and⠀a⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀may⠀remain⠀unsettled⠀after⠀the⠀factual⠀question⠀is⠀answered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqatbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Let⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀contests⠀operate⠀cumulatively.⠀A⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀revised⠀wording⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀installment⠀remains⠀available⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀A⠀promise⠀redefined⠀in⠀one⠀reply⠀is⠀revised⠀in⠀another;⠀a⠀term⠀corrected⠀in⠀one⠀scene⠀acquires⠀a⠀different⠀weight⠀after⠀intervening⠀events.\n\nRecover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps.⠀When⠀an⠀earlier⠀wording⠀becomes⠀significant,⠀recall⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular—the⠀exact⠀phrase,⠀the⠀speaker,⠀the⠀situation—rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀exchange⠀that⠀first⠀established⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀deepen⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀restart⠀the⠀same⠀argument.⠀The⠀recovered⠀wording⠀should⠀be⠀enough⠀for⠀a⠀reader⠀to⠀recognize⠀the⠀change⠀without⠀a⠀full⠀recap.\n\nUse⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀An⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀Serial⠀duration⠀should⠀give⠀selected⠀wordings⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning,⠀not⠀make⠀a⠀fair⠀understanding⠀perpetually⠀recede.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀accumulation⠀of⠀revised⠀accounts.⠀Before⠀the⠀destructive⠀choice,⠀have⠀a⠀character⠀state⠀the⠀risk⠀plainly,⠀propose⠀another⠀course,⠀or⠀name⠀the⠀cost.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀choose⠀the⠀incompatible⠀good⠀for⠀a⠀defended⠀reason:⠀loyalty⠀to⠀one⠀obligation⠀over⠀another,⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀revised⠀without⠀betraying⠀someone,⠀a⠀definition⠀of⠀duty⠀that⠀excludes⠀the⠀available⠀escape.⠀An⠀unreliable⠀account⠀may⠀expose⠀itself⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explaining⠀across⠀installments,⠀as⠀a⠀later⠀revision⠀reveals⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀wording⠀concealed.⠀Write⠀the⠀exposure⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀revision⠀of⠀a⠀specific⠀earlier⠀phrase,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀confession.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.⠀A⠀later⠀installment⠀can⠀revisit⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀or⠀scene⠀with⠀new⠀significance⠀earned⠀by⠀intervening⠀events.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀in⠀the⠀serial's⠀particulars:⠀a⠀routine⠀continuing⠀with⠀an⠀absence,⠀a⠀relationship⠀persisting⠀in⠀a⠀diminished⠀form,⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀that⠀now⠀carries⠀the⠀loss.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀as⠀ordinary⠀narrative⠀prose,⠀with⠀private⠀and⠀spoken⠀content⠀differing⠀only⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀immediate⠀emotional⠀exposure.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀enough⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀experience⠀that⠀strain⠀reshapes⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀what⠀they⠀say,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀postpone.⠀When⠀a⠀scene⠀turns⠀on⠀admitting,⠀needing,⠀withholding,⠀apologizing,⠀or⠀returning⠀to⠀someone,⠀make⠀the⠀difficulty⠀alter⠀the⠀exchange's⠀surface:⠀a⠀sentence⠀begun⠀and⠀abandoned,⠀a⠀question⠀answered⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀question,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀warmth⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀sharper⠀remark,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀the⠀character⠀fills⠀with⠀self-justification.⠀After⠀the⠀exchange,⠀show⠀the⠀strain⠀persisting⠀in⠀behavior:⠀the⠀character⠀avoids⠀a⠀room,⠀repeats⠀a⠀task,⠀seeks⠀out⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀conversation⠀only⠀to⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀point.\n\nRender⠀recognition⠀as⠀a⠀distributed⠀process.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀done⠀while⠀still⠀protecting⠀themselves⠀from⠀the⠀rest.⠀Let⠀them⠀reason⠀intelligently⠀about⠀their⠀situation⠀and⠀still⠀choose⠀badly,⠀because⠀the⠀choice⠀follows⠀from⠀a⠀commitment⠀they⠀cannot⠀abandon⠀or⠀a⠀belief⠀they⠀cannot⠀yet⠀surrender.⠀When⠀recognition⠀arrives,⠀make⠀it⠀change⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment:⠀a⠀promise⠀they⠀now⠀see⠀as⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀no⠀return,⠀an⠀apology⠀they⠀now⠀understand⠀came⠀too⠀late,⠀or⠀a⠀warning⠀they⠀dismissed⠀because⠀accepting⠀it⠀would⠀have⠀cost⠀them⠀someone⠀they⠀needed.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀holding⠀onto⠀the⠀protective⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀new⠀understanding⠀breaks⠀through,⠀so⠀the⠀recognition⠀arrives⠀in⠀stages⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀clean⠀revelation.\n\nKeep⠀warmth⠀available⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀safe.⠀Render⠀comfort⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀event:⠀a⠀partial⠀gesture,⠀an⠀awkward⠀attempt,⠀or⠀care⠀offered⠀by⠀someone⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀already⠀hurt.⠀Let⠀a⠀tender⠀moment⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀knowledge⠀that⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀repair⠀anything.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀difficult⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀collapse,⠀or⠀a⠀clean⠀emotional⠀resolution.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀loss:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀continue⠀to⠀function,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀register⠀what⠀they⠀carry,⠀what⠀they⠀avoid⠀saying,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀recover.⠀Shape⠀the⠀turbulence⠀through⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction,⠀using⠀the⠀particular⠀shape⠀of⠀this⠀character's⠀hurt⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragic⠀situation⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀interval⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks.⠀Each⠀reply⠀should⠀advance⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀what⠀characters⠀say,⠀do,⠀notice,⠀or⠀refuse.⠀Keep⠀the⠀tragic⠀stakes⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀choices⠀themselves:⠀a⠀character⠀insists⠀on⠀a⠀course⠀that⠀closes⠀off⠀alternatives,⠀or⠀another⠀character⠀offers⠀a⠀warning⠀that⠀is⠀intelligible⠀but⠀cannot⠀be⠀accepted⠀without⠀abandoning⠀something⠀the⠀first⠀character⠀values.⠀Let⠀the⠀consequences⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀exchange's⠀surface⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀pause⠀for⠀explanation.\n\nKeep⠀NPCs⠀and⠀the⠀ongoing⠀world⠀active.⠀They⠀may⠀cooperate,⠀resist,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀lives⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀moves⠀toward⠀a⠀destructive⠀or⠀costly⠀decision.⠀Their⠀behavior⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀their⠀established⠀motives⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀scene,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀need⠀to⠀manufacture⠀conflict.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀makes⠀a⠀consequential⠀choice,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀aftermath:⠀a⠀relationship⠀changes,⠀a⠀promise⠀becomes⠀impossible,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀recognizes⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀sacrificed.⠀Render⠀the⠀recognition⠀as⠀partial;⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀understand⠀the⠀loss⠀without⠀fully⠀accepting⠀responsibility⠀for⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀reply⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀happened.⠀The⠀next⠀moment⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀response,⠀a⠀practical⠀task,⠀a⠀silence,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀Let⠀the⠀tragedy⠀accumulate⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀concrete⠀details:⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀say⠀and⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀refuse⠀to⠀say,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀world⠀continues⠀to⠀demand⠀of⠀them⠀after⠀the⠀choice⠀is⠀made.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀classical⠀or⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route.⠀Organize⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀distinct⠀episodes,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀situation,⠀a⠀consequential⠀exchange⠀or⠀decision,⠀and⠀a⠀closing⠀moment⠀that⠀carries⠀a⠀specific⠀consequence⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀episode.⠀Let⠀the⠀episodes⠀accumulate:⠀a⠀warning⠀given⠀in⠀one⠀episode⠀becomes⠀intelligible⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀one,⠀a⠀commitment⠀made⠀early⠀narrows⠀the⠀choices⠀available⠀later,⠀and⠀a⠀character's⠀reputation⠀or⠀obligation⠀follows⠀them⠀across⠀the⠀sequence.\n\nWithin⠀each⠀episode,⠀keep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀concrete.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀and⠀say,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀supply⠀context⠀through⠀the⠀social⠀or⠀familial⠀obligations⠀that⠀constrain⠀them:⠀a⠀duty⠀owed⠀to⠀a⠀parent,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀to⠀a⠀friend,⠀a⠀reputation⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀maintained,⠀or⠀a⠀household⠀that⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀character's⠀choice.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀tragedy⠀in⠀advance.⠀Let⠀the⠀alternatives⠀remain⠀visible:⠀another⠀character⠀may⠀offer⠀a⠀way⠀out,⠀a⠀duty⠀may⠀conflict⠀with⠀a⠀desire,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀recognize⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀choice⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀refuse⠀it.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀that⠀the⠀fall⠀is⠀not⠀inevitable⠀because⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀foolish,⠀but⠀because⠀the⠀commitments⠀they⠀honor⠀cannot⠀be⠀reconciled.\n\nDistribute⠀recognition⠀and⠀aftermath⠀across⠀the⠀episodes.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀realize⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀choice⠀only⠀after⠀its⠀consequences⠀have⠀already⠀begun.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀should⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀a⠀broken⠀obligation,⠀a⠀lost⠀relationship,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀reputation.⠀Use⠀the⠀episode⠀boundary⠀to⠀mark⠀the⠀shift⠀in⠀understanding:⠀a⠀closing⠀moment⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀unaware⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀set⠀in⠀motion,⠀while⠀the⠀next⠀episode⠀opens⠀with⠀the⠀consequence⠀already⠀taking⠀shape.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀distinct⠀to⠀the⠀story's⠀actual⠀setting,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀episodic⠀structure⠀carry⠀the⠀reader⠀forward⠀through⠀the⠀accumulating⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀choices.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀in⠀hard-edged,⠀concrete⠀prose.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀to⠀move⠀the⠀scene⠀forward⠀without⠀sentimental⠀elaboration.⠀Let⠀material⠀wear⠀and⠀physical⠀stakes⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀loss:⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀kept⠀too⠀long,⠀a⠀tool⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀works,⠀a⠀body⠀that⠀shows⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀paid⠀in⠀labor⠀or⠀goods.⠀Show⠀the⠀consequences⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀handle,⠀repair,⠀abandon,⠀or⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to⠀replace.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀characters⠀intelligent⠀and⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention.⠀When⠀a⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀room,⠀let⠀the⠀thought⠀run⠀longer,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀concrete:⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀see,⠀what⠀they⠀owe,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀protect,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀they⠀are⠀giving⠀up.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀character⠀into⠀a⠀hardened⠀survivor⠀or⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀survival⠀horror⠀set⠀piece.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀choice⠀and⠀its⠀cost,⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀mere⠀presence⠀of⠀danger⠀or⠀decay.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀material⠀or⠀practical⠀detail⠀the⠀character⠀confronts:⠀an⠀empty⠀chair,⠀a⠀closed⠀door,⠀a⠀letter⠀they⠀cannot⠀answer,⠀a⠀task⠀they⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀perform,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀they⠀now⠀understand⠀they⠀cannot⠀repay.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀handling⠀or⠀facing⠀the⠀object⠀before⠀the⠀understanding⠀lands,⠀so⠀the⠀recognition⠀is⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀concrete⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀stated⠀as⠀a⠀summary.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀loss⠀without⠀explaining⠀it⠀away:⠀the⠀character⠀continues⠀to⠀work,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀registers⠀what⠀is⠀gone.⠀Use⠀changes⠀of⠀rhythm⠀deliberately:⠀a⠀short,⠀blunt⠀sentence⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀turning⠀point,⠀while⠀a⠀longer⠀passage⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀finally⠀sees⠀the⠀full⠀cost⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀done.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀tragic⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Choose⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter⠀written⠀before⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry⠀made⠀after⠀a⠀confrontation,⠀a⠀report⠀filed⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀did⠀not⠀understand⠀what⠀they⠀witnessed,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀behind,⠀or⠀a⠀record⠀revised⠀after⠀the⠀fact.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically.\n\nLet⠀each⠀document's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀concealment⠀follow⠀from⠀its⠀author's⠀situation.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀offer⠀a⠀warning⠀the⠀recipient⠀cannot⠀yet⠀accept.⠀A⠀journal⠀entry⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀decision⠀without⠀recognizing⠀its⠀full⠀cost.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀omit⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀would⠀have⠀changed⠀everything⠀because⠀the⠀writer⠀did⠀not⠀think⠀it⠀mattered.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀trace⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀across⠀the⠀gaps⠀between⠀documents:⠀what⠀one⠀writer⠀knows,⠀what⠀another⠀conceals,⠀what⠀a⠀later⠀revision⠀reveals,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unrecorded.⠀Use⠀the⠀gaps⠀themselves⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀reader⠀forward:⠀a⠀document⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀the⠀consequence⠀arrives,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀consequence⠀already⠀in⠀motion.\n\nUse⠀the⠀documents⠀to⠀distribute⠀recognition⠀and⠀aftermath.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀letter⠀only⠀after⠀reading⠀it⠀again⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀entry.⠀A⠀conflicting⠀account⠀may⠀show⠀how⠀two⠀people⠀understood⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀differently.⠀A⠀revision⠀may⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀tried⠀to⠀conceal⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀only⠀later⠀understood.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀should⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀through⠀the⠀documents'⠀material⠀existence:⠀a⠀final⠀letter⠀that⠀receives⠀no⠀answer,⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀ends⠀mid-sentence,⠀or⠀a⠀document⠀kept⠀long⠀after⠀its⠀purpose⠀has⠀passed.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀documents⠀carry⠀the⠀reader⠀forward;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀through⠀chosen⠀kindness,⠀familiar⠀preferences,⠀practical⠀care,⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures.⠀Spend⠀real⠀narrative⠀attention⠀on⠀the⠀moments⠀of⠀warmth:⠀a⠀meal⠀prepared⠀with⠀care,⠀a⠀remembered⠀preference⠀honored,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀to⠀make⠀someone's⠀day⠀easier,⠀a⠀quiet⠀interval⠀of⠀ease.⠀Render⠀the⠀care⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀event⠀with⠀concrete⠀details,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀affection.⠀Let⠀the⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀The⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀name⠀what⠀they⠀feel;⠀the⠀care⠀itself⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀meaning.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀or⠀remove⠀the⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀offer⠀care⠀while⠀still⠀holding⠀a⠀grudge,⠀keeping⠀a⠀secret,⠀or⠀refusing⠀to⠀discuss⠀the⠀choice⠀that⠀is⠀pulling⠀them⠀apart.⠀The⠀warmth⠀should⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀tragic⠀situation.⠀Instead,⠀it⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀loss⠀more⠀legible:⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake⠀because⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀shown⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀value⠀in⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀in⠀their⠀shared⠀routines.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀and⠀aftermath⠀unfold⠀within⠀this⠀treatment.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀realize⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀losing⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary,⠀comforting⠀moment:⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀small⠀preference⠀that⠀will⠀no⠀longer⠀matter.⠀Show⠀the⠀recognition⠀arriving⠀through⠀the⠀warmth⠀itself,⠀so⠀the⠀comfort⠀and⠀the⠀loss⠀coexist⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀loss⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀warmth⠀that⠀came⠀before.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀characters⠀still⠀caring⠀for⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀still⠀unable⠀to⠀keep⠀what⠀they⠀had.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀tragedy⠀with⠀a⠀domestic⠀vignette;⠀the⠀comfort⠀is⠀the⠀texture⠀through⠀which⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀felt,⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Use⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀the⠀character's⠀choices⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀obligations⠀that⠀constrain⠀the⠀character,⠀the⠀reputation⠀that⠀precedes⠀them,⠀or⠀the⠀public⠀expectations⠀that⠀make⠀a⠀private⠀choice⠀consequential.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language;⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀situation⠀without⠀becoming⠀uniformly⠀archaic⠀or⠀elaborate.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀fall⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀interaction⠀between⠀character⠀and⠀social⠀conditions.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternatives⠀that⠀are⠀intelligible⠀within⠀the⠀character's⠀world:⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀conflicts⠀with⠀a⠀desire,⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept⠀without⠀betraying⠀someone⠀else,⠀a⠀social⠀position⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀private⠀decision⠀public.⠀The⠀character⠀should⠀remain⠀intelligent⠀and⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention⠀even⠀when⠀their⠀choices⠀become⠀destructive.⠀Keep⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀commitments⠀and⠀reasoning⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀tragedy;⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀frames⠀the⠀choices⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀character's⠀agency⠀with⠀a⠀sociological⠀explanation.\n\nUse⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀public/private⠀contrast⠀to⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀relevant.⠀A⠀formal⠀occasion⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀private⠀loss⠀visible;⠀a⠀letter⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀consequence⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀speak⠀aloud;⠀a⠀public⠀judgment⠀may⠀change⠀what⠀a⠀private⠀recognition⠀means.⠀Let⠀recognition⠀change⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀loss:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀their⠀situation⠀differently⠀after⠀a⠀public⠀event,⠀a⠀delayed⠀message,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀private⠀clarity.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀should⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored,⠀with⠀the⠀narration⠀registering⠀the⠀loss⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀social⠀conditions⠀that⠀remain:⠀a⠀reputation⠀altered,⠀an⠀obligation⠀broken,⠀a⠀silence⠀where⠀a⠀relationship⠀once⠀stood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nGive⠀the⠀outer⠀story⠀a⠀teller,⠀an⠀audience,⠀and⠀a⠀present⠀occasion⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀telling⠀necessary:⠀someone⠀is⠀waiting,⠀deciding,⠀grieving,⠀or⠀asking⠀for⠀an⠀account⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀reason⠀to⠀shape.⠀Let⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀carry⠀a⠀warning,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀plea⠀whose⠀relevance⠀to⠀the⠀listener's⠀own⠀situation⠀becomes⠀clear⠀only⠀as⠀the⠀tale⠀moves⠀toward⠀its⠀irreversible⠀moment.\n\nMake⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀an⠀active⠀intervention⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀story.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀soften⠀a⠀failure,⠀linger⠀on⠀a⠀kindness,⠀or⠀omit⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀would⠀have⠀changed⠀the⠀listener's⠀judgment.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀question,⠀or⠀supply⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀their⠀own.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀distinct⠀and⠀intelligible:⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀says,⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀understands,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀from⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener's⠀interruptions⠀and⠀recollections⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀outer⠀tragedy,⠀not⠀merely⠀commentary⠀on⠀the⠀tale.\n\nLet⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀gesture⠀cross⠀from⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀into⠀the⠀outer⠀frame.⠀Its⠀recurrence⠀should⠀not⠀prove⠀the⠀tale⠀true⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀neat⠀parallel;⠀it⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀listener⠀recognize⠀that⠀the⠀same⠀pattern⠀is⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀life.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means,⠀not⠀what⠀happened.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀a⠀broken⠀trust,⠀a⠀missed⠀chance,⠀a⠀debt⠀no⠀one⠀can⠀repay.\n\nLet⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀become⠀consequential.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀understand⠀too⠀late,⠀reject⠀the⠀lesson,⠀or⠀accept⠀it⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀unable⠀to⠀change⠀the⠀outcome.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀realize⠀that⠀the⠀account⠀has⠀exposed⠀their⠀own⠀part⠀in⠀the⠀loss,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀listener's⠀response⠀has⠀made⠀the⠀outer⠀loss⠀irreversible.⠀End⠀the⠀frame⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀teller⠀and⠀listener,⠀leaving⠀the⠀consequence⠀felt⠀rather⠀than⠀explained.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀arc⠀of⠀recognition⠀and⠀consequence,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀moral⠀that⠀the⠀frame⠀must⠀enforce.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realism⠀route.⠀Place⠀the⠀characters⠀inside⠀concrete⠀institutions⠀and⠀relationships:⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀school,⠀a⠀civic⠀obligation,⠀a⠀family⠀expectation⠀that⠀has⠀shaped⠀what⠀they⠀believe⠀they⠀may⠀want.⠀Let⠀the⠀tragedy⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀accumulated⠀pressure⠀of⠀these⠀arrangements⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀choice,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀sudden⠀catastrophe⠀that⠀arrives⠀from⠀outside.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀alternatives⠀intelligible.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀might⠀have⠀done,⠀whom⠀they⠀might⠀have⠀trusted,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀a⠀smaller⠀compromise,⠀a⠀withheld⠀truth,⠀or⠀an⠀accepted⠀duty⠀begins⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀larger⠀loss⠀possible.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀character⠀foolish⠀or⠀the⠀warnings⠀invisible;⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀choosing⠀differently⠀real⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀final⠀choice⠀remains⠀consequential.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀being⠀described.⠀A⠀formal⠀or⠀measured⠀sentence⠀can⠀render⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀institution;⠀a⠀closer,⠀more⠀intimate⠀passage⠀can⠀render⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning⠀that⠀takes⠀place⠀inside⠀it.⠀Shift⠀deliberately⠀between⠀public⠀behavior⠀and⠀private⠀recognition,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀shows⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀say.⠀At⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀irreversible⠀choice,⠀let⠀the⠀sentence⠀rhythm⠀itself⠀change:⠀the⠀public⠀register⠀may⠀become⠀brittle⠀or⠀hollow,⠀while⠀the⠀private⠀recognition⠀surfaces⠀in⠀a⠀shorter,⠀more⠀direct⠀clause⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀speak⠀aloud.\n\nRecognition⠀should⠀change⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀sacrificed,⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀become,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀failed⠀to⠀see⠀in⠀someone⠀else.⠀Render⠀the⠀aftermath⠀through⠀the⠀institutions⠀and⠀relationships⠀already⠀established:⠀the⠀household⠀continues⠀without⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀held⠀it⠀together,⠀the⠀workplace⠀absorbs⠀the⠀absence,⠀the⠀civic⠀obligation⠀passes⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀the⠀family⠀expectation⠀remains⠀but⠀no⠀longer⠀fits.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀consequence⠀made⠀plain⠀in⠀that⠀social⠀world,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀moral⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀redemption.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀around⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀inherited⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life.⠀Give⠀the⠀central⠀character⠀a⠀loyalty,⠀duty,⠀or⠀identity⠀formed⠀under⠀an⠀older⠀order—a⠀family,⠀an⠀institution,⠀a⠀code,⠀a⠀debt—that⠀now⠀conflicts⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀relationship,⠀desire,⠀or⠀practical⠀need.⠀Let⠀both⠀commitments⠀be⠀real⠀and⠀intelligible,⠀so⠀that⠀choosing⠀one⠀means⠀losing⠀the⠀other.\n\nUse⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀conflict⠀concrete.⠀The⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀building,⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀apartment,⠀the⠀logistics⠀of⠀a⠀meeting,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀keeping⠀an⠀appearance:⠀these⠀details⠀should⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀inherited⠀order⠀presses⠀on⠀daily⠀life.⠀Let⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀mood⠀replace⠀the⠀actual⠀stakes.⠀Make⠀the⠀material⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀older⠀order,⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀garment,⠀or⠀a⠀route⠀becomes⠀the⠀physical⠀form⠀of⠀the⠀debt⠀or⠀loyalty⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀shed.\n\nAllow⠀social⠀masks⠀to⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company.⠀A⠀private⠀conversation⠀can⠀reveal⠀the⠀desire,⠀fear,⠀or⠀exhaustion⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀hides⠀in⠀public.⠀Morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀should⠀remain⠀complicated:⠀trust⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀manipulation,⠀care⠀with⠀self-interest,⠀honesty⠀with⠀a⠀strategic⠀omission.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀intimate⠀moment⠀a⠀betrayal⠀or⠀every⠀private⠀confession⠀a⠀trap.⠀Let⠀the⠀unmasking⠀scene⠀expose⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning⠀that⠀will⠀later⠀drive⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀weighing⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀say⠀it⠀plainly.\n\nLet⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling.⠀They⠀may⠀understand⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀sacrificing,⠀or⠀they⠀may⠀recognize⠀it⠀only⠀afterward.⠀Render⠀the⠀aftermath⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀bond,⠀place,⠀or⠀claim⠀already⠀established:⠀the⠀apartment⠀is⠀emptied⠀or⠀kept,⠀the⠀institution⠀continues⠀without⠀the⠀character's⠀loyalty,⠀the⠀relationship⠀survives⠀in⠀a⠀changed⠀and⠀diminished⠀form.⠀Keep⠀the⠀tragedy⠀personal⠀and⠀political⠀at⠀once,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀route.⠀Place⠀the⠀tragedy⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀household⠀and⠀community,⠀with⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀and⠀period⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story⠀kept⠀concrete.⠀Let⠀the⠀fall⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀obligations⠀of⠀family⠀life:⠀a⠀marriage⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀financial⠀duty,⠀a⠀caregiving⠀burden,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀to⠀an⠀elder,⠀a⠀sibling's⠀need⠀that⠀competes⠀with⠀a⠀spouse's.\n\nShow⠀the⠀household⠀economy.⠀Money,⠀work,⠀space,⠀food,⠀education,⠀migration,⠀and⠀the⠀labor⠀of⠀maintaining⠀relationships⠀should⠀be⠀present⠀as⠀real⠀pressures,⠀not⠀as⠀background⠀decoration.⠀A⠀character's⠀choice⠀should⠀be⠀shaped⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀family⠀can⠀afford,⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀expects,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀believes⠀they⠀owe.⠀Let⠀the⠀household⠀economy⠀enter⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀directly:⠀a⠀sum⠀of⠀money,⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀shared,⠀a⠀journey⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀afforded,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀repaid⠀should⠀become⠀the⠀concrete⠀form⠀of⠀the⠀choice⠀the⠀character⠀faces.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀code-switching⠀onto⠀the⠀scene;⠀use⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀and⠀characters⠀actually⠀contain.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀alternatives⠀intelligible.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀a⠀different⠀path⠀and⠀reject⠀it,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀see⠀it⠀until⠀too⠀late.⠀Their⠀reasoning⠀should⠀remain⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀becomes⠀destructive.⠀Let⠀love⠀and⠀duty⠀be⠀genuinely⠀incompatible,⠀so⠀that⠀honoring⠀one⠀means⠀failing⠀the⠀other.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀what⠀they⠀sacrificed,⠀whom⠀they⠀hurt,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀failed⠀to⠀say.\n\nLet⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀Render⠀the⠀changed⠀domestic⠀world⠀through⠀its⠀concrete⠀details:⠀the⠀household⠀continues⠀without⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀held⠀it⠀together,⠀the⠀shared⠀room⠀is⠀rearranged,⠀the⠀debt⠀is⠀paid⠀but⠀the⠀silence⠀remains,⠀or⠀the⠀relationship⠀survives⠀in⠀a⠀diminished⠀form.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀consequence⠀made⠀plain⠀in⠀the⠀domestic⠀world,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀reconciliation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaual::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀compose⠀a⠀personal⠀account⠀that⠀moves⠀between⠀remembered⠀events,⠀passing⠀observations,⠀and⠀later⠀understanding.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀diary,⠀a⠀memoir,⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀dated⠀entries,⠀or⠀a⠀reflective⠀record⠀assembled⠀after⠀the⠀loss.⠀Keep⠀the⠀distinction⠀clear⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀come⠀to⠀understand⠀since.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀reread⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀once⠀recorded.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀date,⠀a⠀description⠀of⠀weather,⠀a⠀note⠀about⠀someone's⠀mood:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀now⠀see⠀in⠀it⠀a⠀warning⠀they⠀missed⠀or⠀a⠀meaning⠀they⠀refused⠀to⠀accept.⠀Render⠀the⠀rereading⠀as⠀a⠀present⠀act:⠀the⠀narrator⠀holds⠀the⠀earlier⠀entry⠀against⠀the⠀later⠀loss⠀and⠀discovers⠀that⠀what⠀was⠀omitted,⠀or⠀what⠀was⠀recorded⠀too⠀lightly,⠀now⠀carries⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀failed⠀to⠀see.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀without⠀altering⠀what⠀happened.⠀The⠀earlier⠀entry⠀remains⠀as⠀it⠀was;⠀the⠀narrator's⠀understanding⠀of⠀it⠀changes.\n\nUse⠀seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀where⠀they⠀fit⠀the⠀actual⠀teller⠀and⠀setting.⠀A⠀seasonal⠀detail⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀passage⠀of⠀time⠀or⠀the⠀return⠀of⠀a⠀memory,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery.⠀Omission⠀can⠀be⠀meaningful:⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀did⠀not⠀record⠀may⠀become⠀as⠀important⠀as⠀what⠀they⠀wrote.⠀Let⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀voice.\n\nLet⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀continue⠀to⠀live⠀with⠀the⠀loss,⠀revisit⠀it,⠀or⠀find⠀that⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀writing⠀changes⠀their⠀relation⠀to⠀it⠀without⠀undoing⠀it.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀composition⠀itself⠀has⠀made⠀the⠀narrator's⠀present⠀understanding⠀plain:⠀the⠀final⠀entry⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀phrase,⠀record⠀a⠀seasonal⠀change,⠀or⠀name⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀say⠀only⠀in⠀writing.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀grief⠀or⠀explain⠀it⠀away⠀with⠀a⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀or⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Place⠀the⠀tragedy⠀inside⠀a⠀particular⠀city,⠀with⠀its⠀streets,⠀transit,⠀housing,⠀work,⠀and⠀social⠀rhythms⠀kept⠀concrete.⠀Let⠀the⠀city⠀exert⠀pressure⠀on⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀life:⠀distance,⠀cost,⠀visibility,⠀danger,⠀opportunity,⠀or⠀the⠀simple⠀difficulty⠀of⠀meeting⠀someone⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀time.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.\n\nTrack⠀the⠀character's⠀inward⠀experience⠀closely.⠀Show⠀how⠀desire,⠀fear,⠀pride,⠀or⠀mistaken⠀belief⠀shapes⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀decide.⠀The⠀social⠀conditions⠀should⠀be⠀real⠀and⠀legible,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀reach⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀particular⠀consciousness:⠀what⠀they⠀dread,⠀what⠀they⠀hope,⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to⠀admit.⠀Let⠀the⠀city's⠀pressure⠀enter⠀that⠀consciousness⠀directly:⠀a⠀bus⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀come,⠀a⠀rent⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀paid,⠀a⠀street⠀that⠀is⠀safe⠀or⠀unsafe⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀hour,⠀a⠀distance⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀meeting⠀impossible.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀remain⠀intelligent⠀and⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention⠀even⠀when⠀their⠀choices⠀become⠀destructive.\n\nMake⠀the⠀entanglement⠀between⠀social⠀pressure⠀and⠀private⠀desire⠀concrete.⠀A⠀relationship⠀may⠀be⠀impossible⠀because⠀of⠀money,⠀distance,⠀family⠀expectation,⠀or⠀political⠀circumstance;⠀a⠀duty⠀may⠀conflict⠀with⠀a⠀longing⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀tried⠀to⠀suppress.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternatives⠀the⠀character⠀considered⠀and⠀rejected,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀final⠀choice⠀is⠀intelligible⠀rather⠀than⠀arbitrary.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀what⠀they⠀sacrificed,⠀whom⠀they⠀failed,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀became.⠀Render⠀the⠀aftermath⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀city:⠀the⠀route⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀take,⠀the⠀apartment⠀they⠀keep⠀or⠀leave,⠀the⠀work⠀that⠀continues⠀without⠀the⠀person⠀they⠀lost,⠀or⠀the⠀street⠀where⠀they⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀walk⠀without⠀remembering.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀consequence⠀made⠀plain⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀life,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀supernatural⠀turn⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀enough⠀spatial⠀and⠀situational⠀information⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀one⠀room⠀to⠀another,⠀from⠀a⠀private⠀conversation⠀to⠀a⠀public⠀confrontation,⠀or⠀from⠀an⠀action⠀to⠀its⠀aftermath,⠀make⠀the⠀transition⠀concrete⠀and⠀brief.⠀Let⠀the⠀spatial⠀change⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀choice:⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀closes,⠀the⠀room⠀that⠀is⠀left,⠀the⠀route⠀that⠀is⠀taken⠀or⠀not⠀taken⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀irreversible⠀act⠀visible.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀Give⠀each⠀beat⠀room⠀to⠀land.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀quiet⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀comedy⠀or⠀a⠀quip⠀into⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀comic.⠀Let⠀the⠀reaction⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀understood,⠀refused⠀to⠀understand,⠀or⠀begun⠀to⠀fear.⠀The⠀accumulating⠀private⠀responses⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀choices⠀legible⠀to⠀the⠀reader.⠀At⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀recognition,⠀let⠀the⠀reaction⠀beat⠀slow⠀the⠀scene⠀just⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀see⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀understands.\n\nGive⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀they⠀appear,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀story⠀for⠀an⠀explanation⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀need.⠀Let⠀the⠀tragedy⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀choices⠀and⠀the⠀commitments⠀that⠀conflict.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternatives⠀they⠀considered⠀and⠀rejected,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀final⠀irreversible⠀act⠀is⠀intelligible⠀rather⠀than⠀sudden.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀what⠀they⠀sacrificed,⠀whom⠀they⠀failed,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀undo.⠀Render⠀the⠀aftermath⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀concrete⠀spatial⠀and⠀material⠀details:⠀the⠀room⠀that⠀is⠀now⠀empty,⠀the⠀object⠀left⠀behind,⠀the⠀route⠀that⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀taken,⠀or⠀the⠀silence⠀where⠀a⠀voice⠀used⠀to⠀be.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀consequence⠀is⠀felt,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀compulsory⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.⠀First⠀person,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀a⠀closing⠀twist⠀are⠀not⠀requirements⠀of⠀this⠀container.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀a⠀repeated⠀image⠀or⠀sound⠀pattern⠀first⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀moment⠀before⠀the⠀loss.⠀Choose⠀it⠀for⠀its⠀sensory⠀hold:⠀a⠀door's⠀hinge,⠀a⠀bowl's⠀rim,⠀a⠀coat's⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀once.⠀Return⠀to⠀it⠀after⠀a⠀decisive⠀act,⠀not⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀change⠀but⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀same⠀material⠀inside⠀the⠀new⠀rhythm.⠀A⠀longer⠀clause⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀alternative⠀seen⠀and⠀refused;⠀a⠀short⠀declarative⠀sentence⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀choice⠀itself.\n\nWork⠀with⠀syntax⠀rather⠀than⠀adjectives.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀recognizes⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀undone,⠀let⠀the⠀sentence⠀stretch⠀toward⠀the⠀thought⠀that⠀was⠀available⠀before,⠀then⠀break⠀into⠀a⠀plainer⠀sentence⠀that⠀admitted⠀it.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀a⠀plain⠀warning,⠀or⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀different⠀path⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀mocking⠀it.⠀Let⠀that⠀dialogue⠀and⠀plain⠀memory⠀provide⠀contrast⠀to⠀figurative⠀passages,⠀so⠀the⠀lyricism⠀stays⠀tied⠀to⠀actual⠀stakes.\n\nFollow⠀attention⠀to⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀fact⠀after⠀the⠀loss:⠀the⠀grain⠀of⠀a⠀table,⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀once.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀fact⠀into⠀a⠀symbol⠀the⠀narrator⠀decodes.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀order⠀create⠀the⠀recognition⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀image,⠀allowing⠀its⠀familiar⠀shape⠀to⠀now⠀hold⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀undone.⠀Warmth⠀may⠀survive⠀earlier⠀in⠀the⠀piece⠀so⠀its⠀later⠀absence⠀is⠀specific,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀stage⠀the⠀warmth⠀as⠀a⠀trap.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀with⠀the⠀final⠀rhythm⠀open⠀to⠀what⠀remains⠀rather⠀than⠀with⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀forced⠀completion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀hold⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀without⠀switching⠀into⠀an⠀elegy.⠀Move⠀from⠀a⠀detail⠀in⠀the⠀room—a⠀shifted⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀habit⠀that⠀stopped,⠀a⠀letter⠀never⠀answered—to⠀its⠀earlier⠀version,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀movement⠀expose⠀what⠀made⠀the⠀current⠀situation⠀irreversible⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀nostalgic.⠀The⠀reflection⠀should⠀register⠀the⠀specific⠀cost,⠀not⠀general⠀impermanence.\n\nAllow⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀to⠀remain⠀real.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀enjoy⠀a⠀meal⠀or⠀a⠀routine⠀while⠀aware⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀made⠀it⠀meaningful⠀is⠀gone⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀choice⠀cannot⠀be⠀taken⠀back.⠀Let⠀the⠀pleasure⠀sharpen⠀the⠀loss,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀warmth⠀false⠀or⠀make⠀it⠀a⠀trap.⠀The⠀coexistence⠀of⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available⠀is⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀recognition.\n\nWhen⠀recognition⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀the⠀loss's⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀simply⠀confirm⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀too⠀late⠀why⠀a⠀warning⠀was⠀given,⠀or⠀see⠀that⠀a⠀once-blamed⠀person⠀was⠀trying⠀to⠀help.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀recognition⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀dramatic⠀speech;⠀it⠀can⠀arrive⠀quietly⠀during⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀or⠀remain⠀partial.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀boundary,⠀with⠀the⠀mood⠀unresolved⠀if⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀taking⠀in⠀the⠀aftermath,⠀so⠀the⠀irreversibility⠀is⠀preserved⠀as⠀a⠀particular⠀cost⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀route:⠀the⠀tragic⠀account⠀sits⠀inside⠀a⠀situated⠀teller's⠀speech⠀at⠀an⠀evening⠀gathering,⠀a⠀remembered⠀family⠀story,⠀or⠀a⠀written⠀record⠀narrated⠀within⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀remain⠀present.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀hesitate,⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀practical⠀concern⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Those⠀interruptions⠀make⠀the⠀fall⠀more⠀terrible⠀because⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀implicated⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀related.\n\nMake⠀the⠀teller's⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀tragedy⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story's⠀information.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀survivor,⠀a⠀witness,⠀or⠀someone⠀who⠀once⠀refused⠀to⠀listen⠀to⠀the⠀warning⠀now⠀embedded⠀in⠀the⠀tale.⠀Do⠀not⠀reveal⠀everything⠀at⠀once.⠀Let⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀move⠀toward⠀a⠀loss⠀the⠀listeners⠀already⠀suspect,⠀then⠀delay⠀the⠀full⠀recognition⠀through⠀the⠀telling's⠀own⠀movement.⠀When⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀turns,⠀let⠀the⠀outer⠀listeners⠀react:⠀a⠀question⠀forces⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀a⠀choice,⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀suddenly⠀holds⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀loss.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀alternatives⠀intelligible⠀within⠀the⠀tale.⠀Characters⠀argue,⠀refuse⠀advice,⠀or⠀choose⠀among⠀love,⠀duty,⠀pride,⠀and⠀survival⠀without⠀losing⠀their⠀intelligence.⠀Use⠀a⠀recurring⠀formula⠀or⠀image—an⠀unfinished⠀meal,⠀a⠀gate⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open,⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀at⠀parting—to⠀bind⠀the⠀inner⠀and⠀outer⠀frames.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀telling⠀itself:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀stop⠀before⠀concluding,⠀a⠀listener⠀may⠀ask⠀what⠀happened⠀next,⠀or⠀the⠀room⠀may⠀fall⠀silent.⠀That⠀silence⠀preserves⠀the⠀aftermath⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nPick⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀details⠀that⠀are⠀already⠀inside⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀cracked⠀cup,⠀a⠀folded⠀letter,⠀a⠀chair⠀turned⠀toward⠀the⠀wall.⠀Let⠀them⠀appear⠀before⠀the⠀decisive⠀act⠀and⠀again⠀after⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀decode⠀the⠀detail⠀at⠀the⠀return.⠀The⠀repetition⠀itself⠀carries⠀recognition,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀infers⠀what⠀the⠀object⠀now⠀holds.\n\nKeep⠀alternatives⠀intelligible⠀through⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action.⠀A⠀character⠀says,⠀\"Don't⠀go,\"⠀puts⠀a⠀hand⠀flat⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀or⠀turns⠀a⠀key⠀in⠀a⠀lock.⠀Let⠀the⠀refusal⠀or⠀acceptance⠀remain⠀visible.⠀People⠀stay⠀intelligent;⠀their⠀choices⠀become⠀destructive⠀because⠀the⠀commitments⠀are⠀incompatible,⠀not⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀stupid.⠀Show⠀the⠀two⠀things⠀that⠀could⠀not⠀both⠀be⠀kept,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀moment⠀after⠀which⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀is⠀gone.\n\nIf⠀a⠀character⠀misunderstands,⠀give⠀the⠀small⠀remark⠀or⠀gesture⠀that⠀created⠀the⠀misunderstanding.⠀If⠀a⠀decision⠀is⠀irreversible,⠀show⠀the⠀door⠀closed,⠀the⠀word⠀spoken,⠀or⠀the⠀name⠀written.⠀Omit⠀explanation⠀without⠀omitting⠀causality.⠀Let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀be⠀quiet.⠀The⠀story⠀can⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action,⠀the⠀tragedy⠀already⠀complete⠀but⠀not⠀summarized.⠀If⠀an⠀essential⠀inward⠀thought⠀is⠀needed⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀causal⠀link⠀clear,⠀write⠀it⠀in⠀one⠀precise,⠀extended⠀sentence⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀rest⠀to⠀inference.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀fall⠀in⠀sustained⠀scenes⠀that⠀move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀thought.⠀Do⠀not⠀rush⠀toward⠀the⠀loss.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀reason⠀toward⠀a⠀destructive⠀choice⠀in⠀full⠀view,⠀so⠀the⠀mistaken⠀belief⠀or⠀incompatible⠀commitment⠀becomes⠀strong⠀enough⠀that⠀a⠀reasonable⠀person⠀could⠀hold⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀warning⠀arrive⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀lived⠀scene:⠀a⠀friend⠀argues,⠀a⠀letter⠀is⠀opened,⠀a⠀memory⠀rises⠀while⠀there⠀is⠀still⠀time⠀to⠀choose⠀differently.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀everyday⠀texture⠀to⠀continue⠀while⠀the⠀conditions⠀narrow.⠀Meals,⠀work,⠀and⠀small⠀courtesies⠀remain⠀present.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀scene⠀breaks⠀to⠀mark⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀begins⠀to⠀close⠀off⠀alternatives⠀without⠀your⠀announcing⠀it.⠀A⠀shift⠀from⠀dialogue⠀to⠀thought⠀can⠀linger⠀on⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀refusal.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration's⠀access⠀consistent:⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀but⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters,⠀and⠀that⠀gap⠀can⠀show⠀why⠀a⠀warning⠀is⠀not⠀heard⠀or⠀why⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀tenderness⠀is⠀misread.\n\nWhen⠀recognition⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀confirm⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀suddenly⠀understand⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀long⠀before,⠀or⠀see⠀that⠀a⠀choice⠀presented⠀as⠀devotion⠀was⠀actually⠀pride.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀recognition⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀dramatic⠀speech.⠀It⠀can⠀arrive⠀quietly⠀during⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task,⠀or⠀it⠀can⠀remain⠀partial.⠀End⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀boundary,⠀with⠀the⠀tragedy⠀complete⠀but⠀the⠀world⠀still⠀moving⠀around⠀the⠀empty⠀chair,⠀the⠀unsent⠀message,⠀or⠀the⠀changed⠀name⠀in⠀a⠀ledger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀exactly⠀match⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise.⠀If⠀the⠀bond⠀is⠀built⠀on⠀loyalty,⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀tests⠀that⠀loyalty;⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀built⠀on⠀discovery,⠀the⠀fall⠀comes⠀from⠀a⠀truth⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀know⠀about⠀each⠀other.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise.⠀The⠀loss⠀must⠀be⠀the⠀specific⠀consequence⠀of⠀this⠀bond,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀tragic⠀event.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀relationship's⠀private⠀language⠀through⠀scenes⠀before⠀the⠀fall.⠀A⠀nickname,⠀an⠀inside⠀joke,⠀a⠀gesture⠀only⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀uses,⠀a⠀place⠀they⠀return⠀to.⠀Show⠀these⠀moments⠀as⠀they⠀happen,⠀so⠀they⠀are⠀available⠀for⠀callbacks.⠀When⠀the⠀fall⠀comes,⠀return⠀to⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀frame:⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀with⠀knowledge⠀it⠀did⠀not⠀have⠀before,⠀the⠀same⠀gesture⠀now⠀refused⠀or⠀repeated⠀with⠀grief.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀the⠀change;⠀the⠀callback⠀carries⠀recognition⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀explaining⠀it.\n\nGive⠀affection⠀and⠀conflict⠀enough⠀room.⠀The⠀pair⠀can⠀be⠀tender⠀even⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀about⠀to⠀choose⠀incompatibly.⠀Let⠀one⠀try⠀to⠀warn⠀the⠀other,⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀domestic⠀routine⠀continue⠀while⠀the⠀problem⠀sits⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Both⠀characters⠀remain⠀intelligent;⠀they⠀may⠀understand⠀each⠀other⠀perfectly⠀and⠀still⠀choose⠀differently.⠀Whatever⠀loss⠀the⠀premise⠀makes⠀inevitable—a⠀death,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀broken⠀promise,⠀or⠀the⠀quiet⠀end⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀once⠀were—let⠀it⠀be⠀returned⠀to⠀through⠀the⠀pair's⠀private⠀language.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀recognition,⠀not⠀with⠀forced⠀comfort⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀reconciliation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀with⠀an⠀announcement⠀of⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀lost,⠀not⠀a⠀prediction⠀of⠀doom.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀say,⠀\"This⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀house⠀was⠀divided,\"⠀or⠀\"This⠀is⠀the⠀choice⠀that⠀was⠀spoken⠀of⠀after.\"⠀Let⠀the⠀announcement⠀create⠀expectation,⠀then⠀use⠀that⠀opening⠀phrase⠀or⠀declaration⠀as⠀a⠀recurring⠀material.⠀It⠀can⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀loss⠀occurs⠀and⠀again⠀when⠀the⠀community⠀remembers⠀it.\n\nTell⠀the⠀fall⠀through⠀deeds,⠀oaths,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀or⠀feuds⠀already⠀established⠀in⠀the⠀narrative.⠀Keep⠀the⠀particular⠀source⠀tradition⠀coherent,⠀using⠀only⠀its⠀actual⠀practices⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀another⠀epic's⠀conventions.⠀Use⠀recurrence⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀recognition:⠀the⠀same⠀welcome⠀formula⠀spoken⠀to⠀one⠀who⠀will⠀not⠀return,⠀the⠀same⠀gift⠀exchanged⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀a⠀break,⠀the⠀same⠀name⠀called⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀key.⠀The⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀return;⠀the⠀placement⠀does⠀the⠀work.⠀Public⠀reputation⠀can⠀differ⠀from⠀private⠀account.⠀A⠀character⠀remembered⠀as⠀steadfast⠀may⠀have⠀doubted;⠀a⠀character⠀blamed⠀for⠀the⠀break⠀may⠀have⠀struggled⠀against⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective,⠀so⠀focal⠀characters⠀can⠀think⠀and⠀feel⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀narration⠀contract.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀intelligibility⠀of⠀alternatives.⠀Characters⠀argue,⠀prophesy,⠀or⠀propose⠀another⠀course⠀with⠀genuine⠀force.⠀Their⠀intelligence⠀remains;⠀the⠀fall⠀comes⠀from⠀incompatible⠀commitments,⠀pride,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀established⠀fate,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀listen⠀that⠀makes⠀them⠀stupid.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority:⠀a⠀listener⠀in⠀the⠀hall⠀may⠀ask⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀survivor⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀detail.⠀End⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀completed⠀feud⠀or⠀funeral⠀but⠀after⠀the⠀loss⠀has⠀entered⠀the⠀community's⠀memory,⠀with⠀the⠀teller⠀pausing⠀because⠀the⠀next⠀words⠀are⠀known⠀but⠀not⠀yet⠀spoken.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀Scandinavian⠀social⠀setting—Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish—and⠀keep⠀its⠀institutional⠀texture⠀concrete.⠀Use⠀the⠀workplace,⠀housing⠀association,⠀school⠀board,⠀family⠀council,⠀union⠀branch,⠀or⠀municipal⠀office⠀as⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀is⠀made.⠀Show⠀the⠀protagonist⠀as⠀capable⠀and⠀embedded:⠀their⠀error⠀arises⠀because⠀two⠀legitimate⠀duties⠀cannot⠀both⠀be⠀honored,⠀not⠀because⠀they⠀suddenly⠀become⠀foolish.\n\nLet⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀remain⠀active⠀after⠀the⠀choice.⠀Colleagues⠀respond⠀with⠀practical⠀help,⠀formal⠀complaint,⠀or⠀careful⠀avoidance;⠀a⠀neighbor⠀continues⠀to⠀greet⠀the⠀family;⠀an⠀official⠀follows⠀procedure⠀without⠀malice.⠀Keep⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀private⠀moral⠀reasoning⠀present.⠀Before⠀the⠀decision,⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀weigh:⠀the⠀cost⠀to⠀a⠀child,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀years⠀earlier,⠀the⠀risk⠀of⠀appearing⠀disloyal,⠀the⠀financial⠀consequence⠀for⠀someone⠀else.⠀This⠀reasoning⠀may⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀self-deceiving,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀recognizable.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀automatically⠀see⠀the⠀full⠀private⠀picture.\n\nMake⠀the⠀national⠀route⠀shape⠀what⠀is⠀noticed⠀and⠀argued.⠀For⠀a⠀Norwegian⠀setting,⠀use⠀the⠀tone⠀of⠀municipal⠀consensus⠀and⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀dugnad;⠀for⠀a⠀Swedish⠀one,⠀foreground⠀bureaucratic⠀correctness⠀and⠀the⠀difficulty⠀of⠀naming⠀personal⠀disappointment;⠀for⠀a⠀Danish⠀one,⠀let⠀humor⠀and⠀direct⠀social⠀friction⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀loss.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀snow,⠀silence,⠀or⠀isolation⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀includes⠀them.⠀The⠀fall⠀becomes⠀legible⠀through⠀recurrence:⠀the⠀same⠀hallway,⠀the⠀same⠀document,⠀the⠀same⠀chair⠀at⠀a⠀meeting⠀carries⠀a⠀shifted⠀meaning.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀occur⠀in⠀ordinary⠀life—a⠀phone⠀call,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀colleague's⠀careful⠀question—where⠀the⠀protagonist⠀sees⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀act⠀cannot⠀be⠀undone⠀and⠀is⠀now⠀fully⠀understood.⠀End⠀in⠀the⠀aftermath⠀with⠀the⠀institution⠀still⠀functioning⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀loss⠀carried⠀inside⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqauaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀concise⠀scene⠀blocks:⠀a⠀real⠀location⠀heading⠀when⠀place⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀action⠀lines⠀that⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀camera⠀can⠀see,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names.⠀Use⠀cuts⠀to⠀advance⠀consequence,⠀not⠀to⠀skip⠀over⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀needs.⠀When⠀a⠀choice⠀is⠀made,⠀show⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀completed⠀visible⠀action:⠀signing⠀a⠀document,⠀handing⠀over⠀a⠀key,⠀leaving⠀a⠀room,⠀telling⠀a⠀truth⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀short⠀line.\n\nBefore⠀the⠀irreversible⠀decision,⠀plant⠀one⠀intelligible⠀alternative⠀in⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene.⠀Another⠀character⠀makes⠀the⠀opposing⠀case⠀in⠀plain⠀words,⠀or⠀the⠀protagonist⠀hesitates⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀physical⠀spot.⠀The⠀alternative⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀narrated;⠀its⠀presence⠀is⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀audience⠀to⠀feel⠀the⠀cost.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀prop⠀or⠀location⠀after⠀the⠀fall,⠀now⠀changed⠀or⠀unchanged,⠀so⠀the⠀consequence⠀becomes⠀visible.⠀A⠀child's⠀drawing⠀on⠀a⠀fridge,⠀a⠀coat⠀still⠀on⠀its⠀hook,⠀an⠀empty⠀seat⠀at⠀a⠀dinner⠀table⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀recognition⠀without⠀dialogue.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀interiority⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note,⠀separate⠀from⠀spoken⠀lines.⠀Use⠀it⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀cannot⠀say:⠀the⠀realization⠀that⠀a⠀relationship⠀has⠀ended,⠀the⠀memory⠀that⠀contradicts⠀a⠀present⠀excuse,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀promise.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀another⠀character⠀respond⠀to⠀that⠀private⠀note.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀character⠀to⠀understand⠀something,⠀have⠀them⠀demonstrate⠀it⠀through⠀action—a⠀delayed⠀reply,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀posture,⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀resumed⠀or⠀abandoned.\n\nAvoid⠀voice-over⠀except⠀when⠀the⠀existing⠀sequence⠀specifically⠀demands⠀it.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀be⠀staged:⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀car,⠀a⠀phone⠀call⠀made⠀or⠀not⠀made.⠀Let⠀the⠀final⠀scene⠀include⠀the⠀ordinary⠀continuance⠀of⠀life—someone⠀doing⠀dishes,⠀a⠀bus⠀pulling⠀away,⠀a⠀work⠀shift⠀starting—with⠀the⠀new⠀loss⠀present⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀there.⠀Tragedy⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀closing⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": true,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
