o⠀language,⠀authority,⠀and⠀tenderness;⠀some⠀show⠀care⠀through⠀practical⠀acts,⠀some⠀through⠀teasing,⠀some⠀through⠀quiet⠀presence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀remain⠀consequential⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀comfort⠀illuminate⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀lost.⠀A⠀warm⠀scene⠀can⠀happen⠀the⠀day⠀before⠀a⠀choice⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀taken⠀back,⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀care⠀in⠀that⠀scene⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀later⠀absence⠀legible:⠀the⠀familiar⠀preference⠀now⠀observed⠀by⠀someone⠀else,⠀the⠀small⠀ritual⠀continued⠀in⠀memory,⠀the⠀kindness⠀that⠀arrives⠀too⠀late⠀to⠀alter⠀anything⠀but⠀still⠀matters.⠀Warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀should⠀be⠀intelligible,⠀and⠀the⠀comfort⠀should⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀wise⠀or⠀safe.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means,⠀and⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀Do⠀not⠀erase⠀established⠀problems⠀or⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable;⠀keep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.\n\nBalance⠀ease⠀and⠀loss⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀ordinary⠀movement.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀dwell⠀on⠀the⠀small⠀pleasure⠀itself,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀practical⠀detail⠀interrupt⠀or⠀shadow⠀it:⠀a⠀clock,⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀done⠀before⠀the⠀choice.⠀The⠀style⠀should⠀explain⠀how⠀warmth⠀operates⠀within⠀the⠀tragedy,⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀genre⠀with⠀a⠀domestic⠀vignette.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Open⠀each⠀chapter⠀or⠀section⠀through⠀its⠀social⠀context:⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀a⠀building,⠀the⠀habit⠀of⠀a⠀household,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀community⠀explains⠀a⠀particular⠀office⠀or⠀duty.⠀Then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀without⠀losing⠀that⠀frame.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀be⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀archaic⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate.⠀Formal⠀architecture⠀is⠀the⠀style,⠀not⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀or⠀a⠀cast⠀of⠀uniformly⠀polished⠀speakers.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett-style⠀social⠀comedy⠀work⠀through⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀understanding.⠀Build⠀each⠀major⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀movement⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀framing⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀one:⠀a⠀ceremony⠀may⠀proceed⠀with⠀perfect⠀official⠀form⠀while⠀everyone⠀present⠀knows⠀what⠀the⠀forms⠀are⠀hiding,⠀and⠀then⠀a⠀private⠀conversation⠀may⠀translate⠀the⠀official⠀language⠀into⠀plain⠀terms.⠀A⠀correspondence⠀may⠀be⠀quoted⠀in⠀the⠀narration⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀an⠀institution⠀claims⠀and⠀what⠀its⠀members⠀actually⠀do.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀expose⠀something⠀particular⠀about⠀the⠀social⠀machinery,⠀not⠀merely⠀sound⠀clever.⠀Different⠀characters⠀should⠀retain⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority;⠀some⠀speak⠀the⠀official⠀dialect⠀fluently,⠀some⠀translate⠀it⠀into⠀plain⠀terms,⠀some⠀refuse⠀to⠀play⠀the⠀game⠀at⠀all.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀unfold⠀across⠀the⠀novel's⠀time⠀by⠀making⠀each⠀public⠀event⠀revise⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀choice.⠀Warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀should⠀be⠀intelligible⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀world:⠀a⠀friend's⠀counsel,⠀a⠀public⠀record,⠀a⠀family⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀similar⠀fall.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means,⠀and⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀frame⠀the⠀loss⠀through⠀the⠀community's⠀history⠀or⠀judgment,⠀but⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀erase⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀whose⠀choices⠀mattered.\n\nUse⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀to⠀organize⠀passages.⠀A⠀public⠀event⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀community's⠀official⠀version⠀of⠀a⠀choice;⠀a⠀private⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀Correspondence,⠀ceremony,⠀or⠀ritual⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀turning⠀point⠀when⠀relevant,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀them⠀into⠀every⠀chapter.⠀Keep⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀access⠀and⠀knowledge⠀separate:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀while⠀other⠀characters⠀remain⠀opaque.⠀The⠀formal⠀style⠀should⠀give⠀the⠀tragedy⠀room⠀to⠀breathe⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀specific⠀social⠀comedy⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀fall⠀legible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀an⠀oral⠀account⠀delivered⠀by⠀a⠀specific⠀storyteller⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀audience⠀for⠀a⠀specific⠀purpose.⠀Establish⠀the⠀frame⠀occasion⠀concretely⠀before⠀the⠀first⠀embedded⠀tale:⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀settle⠀an⠀argument,⠀explain⠀a⠀debt,⠀persuade⠀a⠀listener⠀to⠀act,⠀or⠀prevent⠀a⠀community⠀from⠀repeating⠀an⠀old⠀mistake.⠀Let⠀the⠀listeners'⠀interruptions,⠀questions,⠀and⠀silences⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀reveal.⠀The⠀storyteller⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀participant,⠀a⠀witness,⠀or⠀someone⠀reconstructing⠀another⠀person's⠀fall;⠀their⠀selection,⠀omission,⠀and⠀emphasis⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀tragedy.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀frame⠀a⠀neutral⠀container.⠀The⠀teller's⠀social⠀position⠀and⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀audience⠀should⠀determine⠀which⠀facts⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀plainly⠀and⠀which⠀must⠀be⠀approached⠀through⠀indirection,⠀a⠀joke,⠀or⠀a⠀story⠀about⠀someone⠀else.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀institutional⠀comedy⠀as⠀a⠀controlled⠀disclosure⠀strategy.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀describes⠀a⠀committee,⠀guild,⠀family,⠀or⠀office,⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀official⠀explanation⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀reality⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀person⠀and⠀a⠀specific⠀cost:⠀the⠀clerk⠀who⠀drafted⠀the⠀rule⠀has⠀never⠀met⠀the⠀person⠀it⠀will⠀ruin;⠀the⠀condolence⠀letter⠀follows⠀a⠀manual⠀that⠀forbids⠀the⠀one⠀true⠀sentence.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀mockery⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀actually⠀did,⠀not⠀merely⠀that⠀it⠀is⠀absurd.⠀Different⠀characters⠀should⠀keep⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority.⠀One⠀may⠀be⠀sharply⠀funny,⠀another⠀formal⠀and⠀earnest,⠀another⠀unable⠀to⠀recognize⠀that⠀a⠀joke⠀has⠀been⠀made.⠀The⠀humor⠀sharpens⠀the⠀critique⠀without⠀diminishing⠀the⠀loss,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀jokes⠀may⠀later⠀turn⠀out⠀to⠀have⠀been⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀delaying⠀an⠀admission.\n\nStructure⠀the⠀narrative⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀nested⠀or⠀resumed⠀accounts.⠀An⠀embedded⠀story⠀can⠀explain⠀a⠀decision,⠀delay⠀an⠀admission,⠀warn⠀the⠀listener,⠀or⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀outer⠀situation⠀is⠀understood.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀tells⠀another⠀story,⠀introduce⠀the⠀new⠀teller⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀question.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀concrete⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀gesture⠀across⠀levels⠀so⠀that⠀its⠀meaning⠀accumulates:⠀a⠀promise⠀repeated⠀in⠀two⠀contexts,⠀a⠀chair⠀that⠀appears⠀in⠀both⠀an⠀official⠀room⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀memory,⠀a⠀formula⠀of⠀respect⠀that⠀becomes⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀blame.⠀Each⠀recurrence⠀should⠀help⠀the⠀audience⠀recognize⠀the⠀tragedy's⠀pattern,⠀not⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀true.\n\nBring⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀recognition⠀through⠀the⠀listener's⠀participation.⠀Let⠀an⠀outer⠀audience⠀question⠀expose⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀been⠀avoiding:⠀a⠀listener⠀asks⠀about⠀a⠀time,⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀an⠀absence⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀skipped,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀must⠀either⠀answer⠀or⠀visibly⠀refuse.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀also⠀reach⠀a⠀moment⠀where⠀the⠀account⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀protect⠀someone⠀they⠀love.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀that⠀their⠀loyalty⠀was⠀used,⠀not⠀that⠀they⠀were⠀foolish;⠀that⠀their⠀pride⠀kept⠀them⠀from⠀a⠀warning⠀they⠀could⠀have⠀understood;⠀that⠀the⠀institution's⠀rules⠀were⠀written⠀to⠀protect⠀someone⠀else.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀fall⠀inevitable⠀from⠀the⠀first⠀scene;⠀let⠀alternatives⠀remain⠀intelligible⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀remain⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention⠀even⠀when⠀they⠀choose⠀badly.\n\nEnd⠀in⠀aftermath,⠀not⠀punishment.⠀After⠀recognition,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀frame:⠀the⠀audience⠀sits⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀heard,⠀the⠀storyteller⠀resumes⠀a⠀practical⠀obligation,⠀a⠀listener⠀asks⠀whether⠀anything⠀could⠀have⠀been⠀done.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored—the⠀dead⠀remain⠀dead,⠀the⠀broken⠀institution⠀remains⠀broken,⠀the⠀relationship⠀remains⠀changed.⠀The⠀audience's⠀changed⠀understanding⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀tragedy,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀undo⠀the⠀loss.⠀Keep⠀the⠀storytelling⠀voice⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀voices.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀report⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀said,⠀did,⠀or⠀later⠀learned,⠀but⠀when⠀the⠀narration⠀enters⠀a⠀character's⠀unspoken⠀thought,⠀write⠀that⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀storyteller's⠀later⠀interpretation⠀slipped⠀into⠀the⠀past.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism⠀route⠀from⠀German-language⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀Write⠀a⠀continuous,⠀patient⠀narrative⠀that⠀follows⠀a⠀character⠀whose⠀commitments—family,⠀work,⠀love,⠀honor,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀idea⠀of⠀duty—cannot⠀be⠀reconciled⠀with⠀the⠀social⠀conditions⠀around⠀them.⠀Establish⠀the⠀community⠀and⠀its⠀institutions⠀concretely:⠀who⠀owns⠀the⠀workshop,⠀what⠀the⠀union⠀or⠀guild⠀can⠀and⠀cannot⠀do,⠀what⠀the⠀landlord⠀will⠀tolerate,⠀what⠀the⠀office⠀records⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀ignores.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀explanatory⠀force;⠀different⠀characters⠀understand⠀its⠀rules⠀differently,⠀and⠀the⠀tragedy⠀lies⠀in⠀particular⠀people⠀making⠀particular⠀choices⠀within⠀those⠀constraints.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett's⠀institutional⠀comedy⠀operate⠀as⠀a⠀recurring⠀narrative⠀comparison⠀that⠀narrows⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀options.⠀Whenever⠀an⠀official⠀explanation⠀appears—a⠀regulation,⠀a⠀promotion⠀policy,⠀a⠀condolence⠀letter,⠀a⠀committee's⠀reason⠀for⠀delay—show⠀the⠀specific⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀official⠀wording⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀reality⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀it⠀affects.⠀The⠀policy⠀says⠀one⠀thing,⠀but⠀the⠀clerk⠀who⠀drafted⠀it⠀has⠀never⠀met⠀the⠀person⠀it⠀will⠀ruin;⠀the⠀firm's⠀dignity⠀manual⠀forbids⠀exactly⠀the⠀phrase⠀the⠀grieving⠀father⠀needs⠀to⠀say.⠀Each⠀gap⠀should⠀do⠀more⠀than⠀expose⠀absurdity:⠀it⠀should⠀remove⠀or⠀disguise⠀a⠀specific⠀alternative⠀the⠀protagonist⠀might⠀otherwise⠀have⠀taken.⠀The⠀comedy⠀makes⠀the⠀institution⠀visible,⠀not⠀merely⠀ridiculous.⠀Let⠀different⠀characters⠀relate⠀to⠀the⠀official⠀language⠀differently.⠀One⠀may⠀find⠀the⠀gap⠀absurd,⠀another⠀may⠀take⠀the⠀official⠀language⠀entirely⠀seriously,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀be⠀too⠀tired⠀to⠀notice.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀an⠀intelligible⠀fall.⠀Give⠀the⠀protagonist⠀choices⠀that⠀a⠀reasonable⠀person⠀could⠀make,⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀alternatives⠀they⠀consider⠀and⠀reject⠀for⠀specific⠀reasons.⠀Warnings⠀should⠀be⠀present⠀but⠀not⠀decisive:⠀a⠀neighbor⠀hints,⠀a⠀colleague⠀hesitates,⠀a⠀letter⠀arrives⠀too⠀late.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀remain⠀intelligent⠀and⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention⠀even⠀as⠀their⠀pride,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀mistaken⠀belief⠀narrows⠀their⠀options.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀not⠀moralize;⠀instead,⠀the⠀narrative⠀accumulates⠀the⠀costs⠀of⠀each⠀choice⠀until⠀the⠀loss⠀becomes⠀irreversible.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀come⠀too⠀late⠀for⠀action⠀but⠀still⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀for⠀the⠀survivor⠀or⠀the⠀community.\n\nUse⠀syntax⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀appropriate⠀to⠀patient⠀social⠀realism.⠀Longer⠀sentences⠀can⠀carry⠀gradual⠀developments;⠀shorter⠀sentences⠀can⠀mark⠀moments⠀of⠀immediate⠀consequence.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀town's⠀history⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀room's⠀argument⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀thread,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀calm⠀attention⠀to⠀material⠀conditions⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀judgment.⠀Avoid⠀melodramatic⠀exclamation.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀includes⠀documents—a⠀letter,⠀a⠀certificate,⠀an⠀official⠀notice—quote⠀them⠀plainly⠀and⠀let⠀their⠀bureaucratic⠀language⠀stand⠀in⠀direct⠀contrast⠀to⠀the⠀human⠀events⠀around⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀dialect⠀or⠀regional⠀idiom⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀already⠀includes⠀it;⠀when⠀characters⠀use⠀different⠀registers,⠀let⠀those⠀registers⠀reflect⠀their⠀actual⠀relationships⠀and⠀positions.\n\nEnd⠀in⠀aftermath.⠀After⠀the⠀irreversible⠀loss,⠀show⠀the⠀community⠀and⠀the⠀surviving⠀characters⠀continuing:⠀the⠀office⠀still⠀opens,⠀the⠀family⠀still⠀sits⠀down⠀to⠀eat,⠀the⠀narrator⠀still⠀knows⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀repaired.⠀Recognition⠀belongs⠀to⠀those⠀who⠀remain.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀lesson⠀the⠀protagonist⠀learns⠀in⠀time;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀pattern⠀that⠀becomes⠀clear⠀too⠀late⠀for⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀suffered⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nSet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀in⠀a⠀world⠀where⠀an⠀old⠀authority⠀still⠀operates⠀alongside⠀present⠀life:⠀a⠀family⠀legacy,⠀a⠀closed⠀institution,⠀a⠀building⠀whose⠀rules⠀outlast⠀their⠀original⠀purpose,⠀a⠀debt⠀owed⠀across⠀generations.⠀Use⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀to⠀make⠀that⠀collision⠀immediate⠀and⠀particular.⠀Describe⠀the⠀material⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure—the⠀worn⠀stair⠀rail,⠀the⠀photograph⠀no⠀one⠀has⠀removed,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀kept⠀too⠀long.⠀Each⠀atmospheric⠀detail⠀should⠀mark⠀what⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀permits⠀or⠀forbids⠀in⠀that⠀specific⠀room:⠀a⠀conversation⠀in⠀a⠀former⠀office⠀acquires⠀a⠀different⠀weight⠀than⠀the⠀same⠀conversation⠀in⠀a⠀cafe⠀because⠀the⠀office⠀still⠀carries⠀the⠀old⠀rules,⠀and⠀characters⠀notice⠀what⠀they⠀dare⠀to⠀say⠀there.\n\nBring⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀comedy⠀to⠀the⠀institution's⠀own⠀language.⠀When⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀explains⠀itself—through⠀a⠀family⠀memoir,⠀a⠀code⠀of⠀conduct,⠀a⠀plaque,⠀a⠀manager's⠀speech—compare⠀the⠀official⠀version⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀reality.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀authority⠀claims⠀and⠀what⠀its⠀heirs⠀actually⠀do:⠀the⠀founder's⠀portrait⠀watches⠀over⠀a⠀staff⠀who⠀have⠀never⠀read⠀the⠀founder's⠀letters;⠀the⠀rule⠀that⠀was⠀meant⠀to⠀protect⠀the⠀family⠀now⠀keeps⠀two⠀lovers⠀in⠀the⠀corridor.⠀Each⠀comic⠀gap⠀should⠀reveal⠀a⠀specific⠀cost⠀the⠀authority⠀continues⠀to⠀impose,⠀not⠀merely⠀that⠀the⠀institution⠀is⠀absurd.⠀Let⠀specific⠀characters⠀respond⠀differently⠀to⠀that⠀gap.⠀One⠀may⠀laugh⠀bitterly;⠀another⠀may⠀quote⠀the⠀old⠀language⠀with⠀complete⠀sincerity;⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀official⠀story⠀is⠀false⠀and⠀keep⠀quiet⠀for⠀practical⠀reasons.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀intimacy⠀and⠀inheritance.⠀The⠀protagonist's⠀fall⠀should⠀involve⠀a⠀morally⠀complicated⠀attachment:⠀loyalty⠀to⠀a⠀parent,⠀love⠀for⠀someone⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀has⠀marked,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀before⠀the⠀full⠀cost⠀was⠀known.⠀Show⠀the⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀mask⠀together.⠀In⠀trusted⠀company,⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀let⠀the⠀mask⠀fall⠀enough⠀to⠀say⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀fear;⠀in⠀public,⠀they⠀resume⠀the⠀formality⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀demands.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀both⠀performances,⠀and⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀them⠀should⠀matter.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀simply⠀evil;⠀it⠀may⠀have⠀once⠀served⠀a⠀genuine⠀purpose,⠀and⠀its⠀current⠀representatives⠀may⠀include⠀people⠀trying⠀to⠀act⠀honorably⠀within⠀impossible⠀constraints.⠀The⠀horror⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀structure⠀outlives⠀its⠀reasons⠀and⠀keeps⠀costing⠀people⠀even⠀after⠀everyone⠀inside⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀damage.\n\nLet⠀the⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀be⠀intelligible.⠀A⠀friend⠀may⠀name⠀the⠀risk;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀almost⠀choose⠀differently;⠀a⠀document⠀may⠀surface⠀too⠀late.⠀Recognition⠀comes⠀when⠀the⠀protagonist⠀understands⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀lost⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀own⠀choice⠀cost,⠀and⠀that⠀recognition⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀fall⠀without⠀undoing⠀it.⠀If⠀grief⠀turns⠀to⠀anger⠀at⠀the⠀institution,⠀let⠀that⠀anger⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀actually⠀did,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀general⠀mood.\n\nEnd⠀in⠀the⠀aftermath⠀of⠀the⠀specific⠀loss.⠀After⠀the⠀irreversible⠀event,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀material⠀details:⠀the⠀building⠀remains,⠀the⠀authority⠀continues,⠀someone⠀still⠀has⠀to⠀open⠀the⠀office⠀or⠀clear⠀the⠀room.⠀Show⠀the⠀survivors⠀carrying⠀the⠀memory⠀into⠀the⠀present.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampires,⠀blood⠀bonds,⠀factions,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀powers;⠀the⠀horror⠀and⠀the⠀tragedy⠀come⠀from⠀ordinary⠀people⠀caught⠀in⠀an⠀inherited⠀structure⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀let⠀them⠀go.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀route⠀from⠀Indian⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀Write⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀a⠀told⠀story⠀grounded⠀in⠀family⠀and⠀community⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀courtly⠀entertainment.⠀Settle⠀the⠀teller⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀cast:⠀an⠀elder⠀explaining⠀an⠀old⠀loss⠀to⠀a⠀younger⠀relative,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀saw⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀events,⠀a⠀friend⠀reconstructing⠀what⠀someone⠀they⠀loved⠀could⠀not⠀say.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀concrete⠀occasion—a⠀wedding,⠀a⠀property⠀dispute,⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀village,⠀a⠀night⠀before⠀a⠀departure—and⠀let⠀that⠀occasion⠀create⠀the⠀frame's⠀pressure.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀uncertain⠀about⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀what⠀happened,⠀and⠀the⠀listeners⠀may⠀hear⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀intend.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀frame⠀a⠀simple⠀moral⠀lesson.\n\nBring⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀comedy⠀to⠀the⠀institutions⠀within⠀that⠀community.⠀When⠀a⠀family,⠀caste⠀association,⠀cooperative,⠀landlord's⠀office,⠀or⠀government⠀bureau⠀explains⠀itself,⠀compare⠀its⠀official⠀story⠀with⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀do.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀form⠀that⠀was⠀filed⠀and⠀the⠀reason⠀it⠀was⠀filed;⠀the⠀promise⠀made⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀witnesses⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀understanding⠀that⠀contradicts⠀it;⠀the⠀honor⠀everyone⠀publicly⠀invokes⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀debt⠀everyone⠀quietly⠀knows.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀use⠀that⠀gap⠀strategically:⠀a⠀joke⠀about⠀an⠀official⠀phrase⠀may⠀delay⠀an⠀admission,⠀and⠀a⠀listener's⠀question⠀about⠀the⠀joke⠀may⠀force⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀say⠀what⠀the⠀phrase⠀actually⠀cost.⠀Different⠀characters⠀should⠀relate⠀to⠀the⠀official⠀language⠀differently.⠀One⠀may⠀recite⠀it⠀without⠀irony,⠀another⠀may⠀mock⠀it,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀use⠀it⠀strategically.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀institution⠀visible,⠀not⠀reduce⠀the⠀community⠀to⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀jokes.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀the⠀frame's⠀delayed⠀recognition.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀an⠀apparently⠀small⠀event—a⠀land⠀boundary,⠀a⠀marriage⠀negotiation,⠀an⠀examination⠀result—and⠀only⠀gradually⠀reveal⠀how⠀it⠀became⠀the⠀first⠀step⠀in⠀a⠀chain⠀no⠀one⠀intended.⠀Embedded⠀within⠀the⠀main⠀account,⠀let⠀characters⠀themselves⠀tell⠀shorter⠀stories⠀that⠀explain⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀warn⠀against⠀one.⠀Keep⠀the⠀levels⠀clear⠀by⠀introducing⠀each⠀teller⠀and⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀with⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀question.⠀Let⠀a⠀concrete⠀object⠀or⠀formula⠀recur⠀across⠀the⠀levels—a⠀boundary⠀stone,⠀a⠀wedding⠀gift,⠀a⠀phrase⠀of⠀respect—so⠀that⠀its⠀meaning⠀changes⠀as⠀the⠀account⠀proceeds.⠀Warnings⠀should⠀be⠀present⠀but⠀not⠀obligatory:⠀a⠀grandmother's⠀proverb,⠀a⠀friend's⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀letter⠀read⠀too⠀late.⠀The⠀fall⠀comes⠀from⠀particular⠀people⠀making⠀particular⠀choices⠀under⠀particular⠀social⠀conditions,⠀not⠀from⠀fate⠀alone.\n\nIf⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀includes⠀a⠀specific⠀language,⠀region,⠀or⠀community,⠀preserve⠀it⠀accurately.⠀Allow⠀characters⠀to⠀use⠀the⠀language⠀appropriate⠀to⠀their⠀relationships;⠀a⠀formal⠀register⠀for⠀the⠀landlord,⠀a⠀home⠀dialect⠀with⠀a⠀cousin,⠀standard⠀language⠀for⠀the⠀official⠀document.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English⠀or⠀code-switching⠀onto⠀a⠀scene⠀where⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀belong,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀caste,⠀religion,⠀or⠀family⠀structures⠀that⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀not⠀supplied.⠀The⠀oral⠀style⠀should⠀include⠀repetition,⠀formulaic⠀address,⠀and⠀direct⠀address⠀to⠀the⠀listener⠀where⠀those⠀fit⠀the⠀teller,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀string⠀of⠀proverbs⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀'Indian'⠀ornament.\n\nEnd⠀in⠀aftermath,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀neat⠀moral.⠀After⠀the⠀irreversible⠀loss,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀frame:⠀the⠀listeners⠀sit⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀heard,⠀someone⠀asks⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀the⠀teller⠀admits⠀what⠀they⠀still⠀do⠀not⠀understand.⠀Show⠀the⠀community⠀continuing—someone⠀still⠀has⠀to⠀cook,⠀the⠀land⠀case⠀still⠀has⠀a⠀hearing,⠀the⠀festival⠀still⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀arranged.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀not⠀that⠀everyone⠀learns⠀a⠀lesson;⠀it⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀loss⠀becomes⠀a⠀story⠀told⠀to⠀make⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀repaired.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀or⠀psychological⠀realism⠀route⠀from⠀Japanese⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀Write⠀a⠀continuous⠀narrative⠀that⠀follows⠀one⠀character's⠀fall⠀with⠀patient,⠀precise⠀attention⠀to⠀social⠀conditions⠀and⠀private⠀feeling.⠀Establish⠀the⠀concrete⠀setting—a⠀company,⠀a⠀school,⠀a⠀family,⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀a⠀clinic—and⠀let⠀its⠀rules⠀and⠀rhythms⠀shape⠀the⠀character's⠀choices.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀everything⠀at⠀once;⠀let⠀omission⠀and⠀seasonal⠀or⠀daily⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀passing⠀time.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀light,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀station,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀colleague's⠀greeting⠀alters⠀by⠀a⠀syllable.⠀Each⠀repeated⠀detail⠀should⠀mark⠀a⠀stage⠀in⠀the⠀fall:⠀the⠀same⠀station⠀platform⠀means⠀something⠀different⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀a⠀refusal,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀time⠀that⠀has⠀passed⠀without⠀a⠀narrator⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nBring⠀Pratchett's⠀institutional⠀comedy⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀language⠀and⠀actual⠀experience.⠀When⠀a⠀manager⠀gives⠀instructions,⠀a⠀school⠀policy⠀is⠀posted,⠀a⠀family⠀meeting⠀adopts⠀a⠀formal⠀resolution,⠀or⠀a⠀company⠀issues⠀a⠀statement⠀of⠀regret,⠀compare⠀the⠀words⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀people⠀involved⠀actually⠀feel⠀and⠀do.⠀Show⠀the⠀specific⠀absurdity:⠀the⠀apology⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀wrong⠀recipient,⠀the⠀staff⠀manual⠀that⠀forbids⠀the⠀one⠀act⠀of⠀kindness⠀everyone⠀performs,⠀the⠀thank-you⠀speech⠀that⠀transforms⠀a⠀private⠀hurt⠀into⠀a⠀performance⠀of⠀harmony.⠀Each⠀gap⠀should⠀narrow⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀options⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀way—the⠀manual⠀forbids⠀the⠀act⠀that⠀would⠀have⠀saved⠀a⠀relationship,⠀the⠀apology⠀closes⠀the⠀only⠀channel⠀through⠀which⠀a⠀warning⠀could⠀have⠀been⠀delivered.⠀Let⠀different⠀characters⠀relate⠀to⠀that⠀gap⠀differently.⠀One⠀may⠀bow⠀and⠀mean⠀it,⠀another⠀may⠀bow⠀and⠀silently⠀mock,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀avoid⠀the⠀meeting⠀to⠀avoid⠀lying.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀reveal⠀the⠀institution,⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀string⠀of⠀one-liners⠀from⠀every⠀character.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀an⠀intelligible⠀fall.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀should⠀face⠀a⠀choice⠀between⠀incompatible⠀commitments:⠀duty⠀to⠀work⠀and⠀duty⠀to⠀a⠀parent,⠀loyalty⠀to⠀a⠀friend⠀and⠀loyalty⠀to⠀the⠀group,⠀love⠀and⠀reputation,⠀honesty⠀and⠀the⠀survival⠀of⠀a⠀project.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternatives⠀they⠀consider⠀and⠀reject⠀for⠀specific,⠀human⠀reasons.⠀Warnings⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀colleague⠀who⠀hesitates,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀observes⠀too⠀much,⠀a⠀letter⠀or⠀email⠀that⠀remains⠀unopened.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀remain⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention:⠀intelligent,⠀capable,⠀and⠀capable⠀of⠀tenderness⠀even⠀as⠀their⠀pride⠀or⠀loyalty⠀becomes⠀destructive.⠀The⠀narrative⠀should⠀not⠀moralize;⠀it⠀should⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀exact⠀point⠀where⠀another⠀choice⠀was⠀possible⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀was⠀not⠀made.\n\nUse⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀appropriate⠀to⠀psychological⠀realism.⠀Sentences⠀can⠀be⠀plain⠀and⠀declarative;⠀feeling⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀small⠀gestures,⠀deliberate⠀understatement,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀direct⠀sentence.⠀Avoid⠀melodrama.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀enters⠀a⠀character's⠀thoughts,⠀make⠀those⠀thoughts⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀the⠀narrator's⠀retrospective⠀interpretation.⠀Private⠀and⠀spoken⠀content⠀may⠀differ—a⠀character⠀may⠀apologize⠀while⠀thinking⠀something⠀entirely⠀different—but⠀if⠀they⠀align,⠀write⠀them⠀as⠀aligned⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀thought-to-speech⠀ratio.\n\nEnd⠀in⠀aftermath.⠀After⠀the⠀irreversible⠀loss,⠀stay⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀or⠀the⠀survivors.⠀Show⠀the⠀routine⠀beginning⠀again:⠀the⠀train⠀still⠀comes,⠀the⠀office⠀still⠀opens,⠀the⠀family⠀still⠀eats⠀in⠀a⠀changed⠀silence.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀come⠀late,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀repair⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀fall⠀was⠀caused⠀by⠀people⠀who⠀were⠀trying,⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀way,⠀to⠀do⠀what⠀their⠀world⠀told⠀them⠀was⠀right.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀polyphonic⠀or⠀nonlinear⠀telling⠀route⠀from⠀Latin⠀American⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀Write⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀attributed⠀accounts⠀that⠀reconstruct⠀one⠀consequential⠀fall⠀from⠀different⠀social⠀positions.⠀Settle⠀the⠀compiler⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀cast:⠀a⠀chronicler,⠀a⠀surviving⠀relative,⠀a⠀researcher,⠀or⠀a⠀community⠀member⠀who⠀gathers⠀the⠀accounts.⠀The⠀compiler⠀may⠀introduce⠀each⠀account,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀compiler⠀resolve⠀every⠀contradiction.⠀Let⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀version⠀of⠀an⠀event⠀differ⠀from⠀a⠀relative's,⠀a⠀police⠀report⠀differ⠀from⠀a⠀friend's⠀memory,⠀a⠀newspaper⠀notice⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀a⠀child⠀saw.⠀Keep⠀each⠀account⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀voice⠀and⠀its⠀own⠀language,⠀if⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀includes⠀more⠀than⠀one.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀emerges⠀from⠀the⠀juxtaposition:⠀an⠀official⠀record⠀that⠀omits⠀the⠀reason,⠀a⠀testimony⠀that⠀changes⠀under⠀pressure,⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀reaches⠀someone⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀irreversible.\n\nBring⠀Pratchett's⠀institutional⠀comedy⠀to⠀the⠀records⠀and⠀offices⠀within⠀those⠀accounts.⠀When⠀a⠀government⠀document,⠀a⠀church⠀record,⠀a⠀company⠀notice,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀decision⠀explains⠀itself,⠀compare⠀its⠀official⠀wording⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀reality⠀the⠀other⠀accounts⠀reveal.⠀Show⠀the⠀gap:⠀the⠀death⠀certificate⠀that⠀lists⠀a⠀cause⠀no⠀one⠀believes,⠀the⠀land⠀title⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀wrong⠀owner,⠀the⠀committee⠀minute⠀that⠀thanks⠀everyone⠀for⠀their⠀cooperation⠀while⠀recording⠀a⠀decision⠀that⠀ruins⠀one⠀family.⠀Each⠀comic⠀gap⠀should⠀supply⠀a⠀concrete⠀fact⠀that⠀another⠀account⠀omits⠀or⠀contradicts—the⠀certificate's⠀date⠀conflicts⠀with⠀a⠀witness's⠀memory,⠀the⠀title's⠀boundary⠀conflicts⠀with⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀map.⠀Let⠀different⠀tellers⠀respond⠀differently⠀to⠀that⠀gap.⠀One⠀may⠀quote⠀the⠀document⠀with⠀bitter⠀accuracy,⠀another⠀may⠀laugh⠀at⠀its⠀absurdity,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀believe⠀it⠀because⠀no⠀one⠀has⠀told⠀them⠀the⠀truth.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀institution⠀visible,⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀witness⠀into⠀a⠀satirist.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀the⠀nonlinear⠀arrangement.⠀Begin⠀near⠀the⠀end⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀middle,⠀then⠀move⠀back⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀choice⠀became⠀possible.⠀Let⠀warnings⠀appear⠀in⠀one⠀account⠀and⠀be⠀ignored⠀in⠀another;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀warning⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀event,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀that⠀the⠀warning⠀existed⠀but⠀was⠀not⠀understood.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀the⠀only⠀focus;⠀the⠀community's⠀changing⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀event⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀tragedy.⠀Recognition⠀arrives⠀when⠀a⠀surviving⠀character⠀or⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means,⠀not⠀when⠀the⠀original⠀protagonist⠀is⠀vindicated.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀the⠀polyphony⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀cheap⠀ambiguity;⠀the⠀fall⠀should⠀remain⠀causally⠀legible,⠀and⠀the⠀evidence⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀injury⠀should⠀be⠀concrete.⠀Let⠀the⠀compiler's⠀arrangement⠀itself⠀do⠀the⠀causal⠀work:⠀a⠀later⠀account⠀may⠀explain⠀why⠀an⠀earlier⠀document⠀was⠀filed,⠀and⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀opening⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀first⠀teller⠀could⠀not⠀yet⠀say.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history.⠀If⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀is⠀a⠀specific⠀country,⠀region,⠀or⠀community,⠀use⠀its⠀actual⠀names,⠀institutions,⠀and⠀social⠀conflicts.⠀If⠀characters⠀speak⠀both⠀Spanish⠀and⠀an⠀Indigenous⠀language,⠀or⠀Portuguese⠀and⠀another⠀language,⠀represent⠀that⠀multilingualism⠀accurately⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀decoration.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀magical⠀realism⠀or⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them;⠀the⠀polyphonic⠀structure⠀is⠀itself⠀the⠀formal⠀marvel.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀believes⠀in⠀a⠀saint⠀or⠀a⠀curse,⠀that⠀belief⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀their⠀testimony,⠀not⠀a⠀narrative⠀fact⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀permits⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀in⠀aftermath.⠀After⠀the⠀irreversible⠀loss,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀of⠀the⠀telling:⠀the⠀compiler⠀or⠀a⠀surviving⠀account⠀records⠀what⠀remains.⠀Show⠀the⠀practical⠀continuation—a⠀family⠀still⠀disputes⠀the⠀land,⠀an⠀office⠀still⠀holds⠀the⠀file,⠀a⠀child⠀still⠀asks⠀the⠀same⠀unanswered⠀question.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀not⠀that⠀everyone⠀learns⠀a⠀lesson;⠀it⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀remembered⠀differently⠀by⠀everyone⠀who⠀was⠀there,⠀and⠀none⠀of⠀those⠀memories⠀can⠀restore⠀what⠀was⠀taken.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀in⠀fast,⠀visually⠀staged⠀scenes.⠀Open⠀each⠀scene⠀inside⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation:⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀changed.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀movement⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀with⠀brief,⠀concrete⠀descriptions—a⠀classroom,⠀an⠀office⠀desk,⠀a⠀train⠀platform,⠀a⠀family⠀kitchen.⠀Break⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀beat.⠀Do⠀not⠀begin⠀every⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀summary;⠀start⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀current⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀context⠀emerge⠀through⠀reaction⠀and⠀conversation.⠀If⠀a⠀name⠀or⠀mechanism⠀is⠀unfamiliar,⠀present⠀it⠀clearly⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀encounters⠀it:⠀who⠀it⠀is,⠀what⠀it⠀does,⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀matters⠀now.\n\nBring⠀Pratchett's⠀institutional⠀comedy⠀into⠀those⠀scenes⠀as⠀readable⠀exchanges⠀that⠀narrow⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀options.⠀When⠀a⠀school⠀rule,⠀company⠀policy,⠀family⠀obligation,⠀or⠀official⠀procedure⠀appears,⠀show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀it⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀do.⠀Put⠀that⠀gap⠀in⠀dialogue⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀external⠀observation:⠀a⠀teacher⠀explains⠀a⠀rule⠀while⠀a⠀student⠀points⠀out⠀the⠀exception;⠀a⠀manager⠀praises⠀a⠀policy⠀that⠀everyone⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀knows⠀is⠀ridiculous;⠀a⠀parent⠀recites⠀a⠀family⠀maxim⠀that⠀clearly⠀contradicts⠀the⠀situation.⠀Each⠀gap⠀should⠀remove⠀or⠀disguise⠀a⠀specific⠀alternative⠀the⠀protagonist⠀might⠀otherwise⠀have⠀taken—the⠀rule⠀forbids⠀the⠀one⠀act⠀that⠀would⠀have⠀helped,⠀the⠀policy⠀delays⠀the⠀one⠀message⠀that⠀could⠀have⠀arrived⠀in⠀time.⠀Let⠀different⠀characters⠀have⠀different⠀comedic⠀registers—one⠀may⠀be⠀sharp⠀and⠀fast,⠀another⠀may⠀not⠀understand⠀the⠀joke,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀use⠀official⠀language⠀without⠀irony.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀clarify⠀the⠀institution⠀and⠀its⠀pressure,⠀not⠀stop⠀the⠀plot⠀for⠀a⠀comedy⠀routine.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀tragedy⠀with⠀clear⠀beat⠀structure.⠀Each⠀scene⠀should⠀move⠀the⠀fall⠀forward⠀by⠀one⠀concrete⠀event⠀or⠀decision:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀refuses⠀a⠀warning,⠀chooses⠀loyalty⠀over⠀safety,⠀signs⠀a⠀document,⠀misses⠀a⠀departure,⠀sends⠀a⠀message⠀too⠀late.⠀Between⠀scenes,⠀let⠀time⠀pass;⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀gap⠀and⠀the⠀accumulating⠀consequence.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternatives⠀the⠀character⠀considers,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀understand⠀why⠀each⠀rejected⠀option⠀seemed⠀impossible.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀protagonist⠀foolish;⠀keep⠀them⠀intelligent⠀and⠀capable,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀fall⠀comes⠀from⠀their⠀commitments—love,⠀duty,⠀pride,⠀or⠀mistaken⠀belief—not⠀from⠀incompetence.\n\nInclude⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats.⠀After⠀a⠀major⠀event,⠀give⠀the⠀character⠀a⠀short⠀private⠀response:⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀what⠀they⠀realize,⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀to⠀do⠀next.⠀The⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀character.⠀Each⠀reaction⠀beat⠀should⠀register⠀the⠀narrowing⠀of⠀options⠀caused⠀by⠀the⠀preceding⠀institutional⠀gap⠀or⠀decision:⠀the⠀character⠀sees⠀that⠀the⠀rule⠀has⠀closed⠀the⠀door,⠀that⠀the⠀message⠀is⠀now⠀too⠀late,⠀that⠀the⠀loyalty⠀they⠀chose⠀has⠀cost⠀something⠀specific.⠀Not⠀every⠀beat⠀needs⠀a⠀cliffhanger;⠀some⠀scenes⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀quiet⠀recognition⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀practical⠀question.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀enter⠀the⠀character's⠀mind⠀for⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀two⠀where⠀it⠀matters,⠀especially⠀before⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀choice,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning⠀behind⠀the⠀public⠀action.\n\nEnd⠀in⠀tragedy's⠀aftermath.⠀The⠀final⠀beat⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀irreversible⠀loss⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀consequence,⠀not⠀a⠀tidy⠀resolution.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀stand⠀in⠀the⠀empty⠀room,⠀receive⠀the⠀confirmed⠀message,⠀or⠀listen⠀to⠀a⠀survivor⠀ask⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀answered.⠀The⠀recognition⠀may⠀come⠀late—after⠀the⠀chance⠀to⠀act⠀has⠀passed—and⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀undo⠀the⠀loss.⠀Keep⠀the⠀ending⠀short⠀and⠀concrete;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀happened,⠀not⠀a⠀lesson⠀delivered⠀by⠀the⠀narrator.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀the⠀fall⠀through⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀an⠀institution's⠀official⠀account⠀of⠀itself⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀life⠀that⠀account⠀cannot⠀hold.⠀Let⠀a⠀procedure,⠀a⠀posted⠀notice,⠀a⠀job⠀title,⠀or⠀a⠀form's⠀wording⠀appear⠀early⠀as⠀ordinary⠀comic⠀material:⠀something⠀everyone⠀knows⠀is⠀partly⠀true⠀and⠀partly⠀a⠀useful⠀fiction.⠀Return⠀to⠀that⠀same⠀official⠀language⠀later,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀lyric⠀movement⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀recognition.⠀The⠀phrase⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀quoted;⠀its⠀cadence⠀or⠀its⠀key⠀word⠀can⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀narration,⠀now⠀carrying⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀learned⠀to⠀call⠀by⠀a⠀plainer⠀name.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀images⠀as⠀instruments⠀of⠀changed⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀decoration.⠀An⠀object⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀action⠀may⠀first⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀moves⠀quickly,⠀with⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀daily⠀business.⠀When⠀the⠀image⠀returns,⠀slow⠀the⠀syntax⠀around⠀it.⠀Extend⠀the⠀sentence⠀through⠀subordinate⠀clauses⠀that⠀hold⠀the⠀present⠀perception⠀beside⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀become⠀irrecoverable.⠀Keep⠀the⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀general⠀meditation⠀detached⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀person⠀and⠀place.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comic⠀voice⠀remain⠀social⠀and⠀specific.⠀A⠀clerk⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀rule⠀with⠀complete⠀sincerity⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀notices⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀explanation⠀and⠀the⠀room's⠀actual⠀condition.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀expose⠀something⠀particular⠀about⠀how⠀this⠀organization⠀behaves:⠀the⠀way⠀paperwork⠀outlives⠀its⠀purpose,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀committee⠀protects⠀its⠀own⠀convenience,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀an⠀official⠀euphemism⠀makes⠀a⠀hard⠀fact⠀temporarily⠀manageable.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty.⠀Some⠀people⠀believe⠀the⠀official⠀account;⠀some⠀use⠀it⠀knowingly;⠀some⠀have⠀stopped⠀hearing⠀it.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀lies⠀in⠀which⠀of⠀these⠀positions⠀a⠀character⠀occupies⠀when⠀the⠀choice⠀arrives.\n\nWhen⠀recognition⠀comes,⠀let⠀it⠀alter⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀announcement.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀practical⠀task,⠀answer⠀the⠀same⠀question,⠀or⠀finish⠀the⠀sentence,⠀but⠀the⠀prose⠀around⠀the⠀action⠀has⠀changed⠀its⠀rhythm.⠀The⠀loss⠀becomes⠀meaningful⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀compare⠀the⠀earlier⠀cadence⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀one.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀room⠀still⠀arranged⠀for⠀work⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀resume,⠀a⠀form⠀still⠀waiting⠀to⠀be⠀signed,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀now⠀used⠀without⠀its⠀old⠀confidence.⠀Let⠀the⠀irreversibility⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀syntax⠀itself:⠀the⠀changed⠀image⠀carries⠀the⠀recognition,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀that⠀image⠀or⠀on⠀the⠀continuing⠀practical⠀life⠀around⠀it,⠀without⠀extracting⠀a⠀lesson⠀from⠀either.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
