            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-tragedy-07",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Tragedy · 07/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == tragedy}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Tragedy. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 7 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-tragedy; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPaqayap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀present⠀attention⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀remembered⠀particulars⠀from⠀the⠀institution's⠀practical⠀life:⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀ledger⠀was⠀ruled,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀door,⠀the⠀phrase⠀someone⠀used⠀when⠀a⠀meeting⠀was⠀about⠀to⠀end.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀nostalgic⠀ornaments.⠀Each⠀one⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀made⠀or⠀avoided⠀a⠀choice,⠀and⠀the⠀reflection⠀should⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀small⠀difference⠀that⠀has⠀since⠀become⠀unbridgeable.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Pratchett⠀social⠀attention⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀remembered⠀people⠀specific.⠀A⠀superior⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀ridiculous⠀in⠀one⠀respect⠀and⠀genuinely⠀capable⠀in⠀another.⠀A⠀colleague⠀may⠀have⠀defended⠀a⠀bad⠀rule⠀for⠀reasons⠀that⠀made⠀sense⠀within⠀the⠀office's⠀daily⠀pressures.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀remember⠀these⠀contradictions⠀without⠀resolving⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀verdict.⠀The⠀comic⠀correction⠀should⠀expose⠀something⠀particular⠀about⠀how⠀the⠀organization⠀actually⠀worked:⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀posted⠀policy⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀arrangement,⠀the⠀unspoken⠀agreement⠀that⠀kept⠀a⠀flawed⠀system⠀running,⠀or⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀someone⠀stopped⠀pretending⠀the⠀arrangement⠀was⠀temporary.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remain⠀available⠀in⠀memory.⠀A⠀remembered⠀lunch,⠀a⠀shared⠀joke,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀success⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀knowledge⠀that⠀the⠀conditions⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀possible⠀are⠀gone.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀recollection⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence.⠀The⠀melancholic⠀effect⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀accumulation⠀of⠀small⠀changes,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀repeated⠀moral.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀let⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀contain⠀one⠀detail⠀that⠀has⠀outlived⠀its⠀purpose⠀or⠀changed⠀its⠀meaning:⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀habit⠀of⠀speech,⠀a⠀view⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀window.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀legible⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀narrator⠀the⠀sole⠀judge⠀of⠀everyone⠀else.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀recognize⠀that⠀a⠀warning⠀was⠀intelligible⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀or⠀that⠀an⠀alternative⠀existed⠀but⠀required⠀a⠀cost⠀no⠀one⠀was⠀willing⠀to⠀name.⠀The⠀reflection⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀intelligence⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀involved,⠀including⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀earlier⠀self.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀past⠀into⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀obvious⠀errors.⠀The⠀loss⠀is⠀meaningful⠀because⠀the⠀choices⠀were⠀real⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀were⠀not⠀foolish,⠀not⠀because⠀hindsight⠀makes⠀the⠀outcome⠀seem⠀inevitable.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀attention⠀settle⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀object⠀or⠀habit,⠀allowing⠀the⠀distance⠀to⠀be⠀felt⠀through⠀that⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀all⠀means.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀concrete⠀regional⠀route.⠀Establish⠀a⠀teller⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀audience:⠀a⠀visitor,⠀a⠀younger⠀colleague,⠀a⠀family⠀member,⠀or⠀a⠀group⠀gathered⠀for⠀a⠀practical⠀reason.⠀The⠀teller's⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀institution's⠀fall⠀should⠀be⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀audience's⠀interruptions,⠀questions,⠀and⠀corrections.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀frame⠀become⠀a⠀neutral⠀container.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀know⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀already,⠀dispute⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀ask⠀why⠀someone⠀did⠀not⠀act⠀sooner,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀answers⠀should⠀revise⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀loss.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Pratchett⠀social⠀comedy⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀attention⠀to⠀official⠀language⠀and⠀practical⠀reality.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀quote⠀a⠀regulation,⠀a⠀posted⠀notice,⠀or⠀a⠀superior's⠀explanation,⠀then⠀supply⠀the⠀actual⠀arrangement⠀that⠀everyone⠀in⠀the⠀office⠀understood.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀be⠀particular⠀to⠀how⠀this⠀organization⠀behaved:⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀done,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀title⠀conferred⠀authority⠀without⠀competence,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀committee's⠀courtesy⠀concealed⠀its⠀refusal⠀to⠀decide.⠀Characters⠀retain⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀that⠀language.⠀Some⠀repeat⠀it⠀faithfully,⠀some⠀use⠀it⠀with⠀irony,⠀and⠀some⠀have⠀learned⠀to⠀translate⠀it⠀into⠀action.\n\nStructure⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀through⠀the⠀frame's⠀return.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀opening⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀the⠀institution⠀and⠀the⠀change⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀told.⠀As⠀the⠀account⠀proceeds,⠀let⠀the⠀audience's⠀interruptions⠀create⠀the⠀recognition:⠀a⠀question⠀may⠀force⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀state⠀plainly⠀what⠀the⠀official⠀language⠀had⠀softened,⠀or⠀a⠀listener's⠀memory⠀may⠀supply⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀teller⠀had⠀omitted.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀frame's⠀present.⠀The⠀teller⠀and⠀the⠀audience⠀sit⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀still⠀contains⠀some⠀trace⠀of⠀the⠀institution:⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀furniture,⠀a⠀document,⠀a⠀habit⠀of⠀speech,⠀a⠀view⠀through⠀a⠀window.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀moral.⠀The⠀telling⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored,⠀and⠀the⠀audience's⠀changed⠀attention⠀may⠀complete⠀the⠀recognition⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀still⠀forming⠀as⠀the⠀account⠀ends.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀story.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀atmosphere,⠀religious⠀symbolism,⠀or⠀an⠀honor⠀code.⠀The⠀framed⠀telling⠀is⠀a⠀formal⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀national⠀character.⠀The⠀teller's⠀access⠀remains⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀report⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀and⠀done,⠀but⠀cannot⠀narrate⠀another⠀person's⠀private⠀thought⠀unless⠀the⠀story's⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀institution's⠀official⠀account⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀life.⠀A⠀posted⠀notice,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀title,⠀a⠀key,⠀a⠀chair,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀comedy⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Place⠀the⠀detail⠀in⠀a⠀direct⠀clause⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀contradiction:⠀the⠀notice⠀says⠀one⠀thing,⠀the⠀room⠀shows⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀witty⠀comment.⠀The⠀selection⠀of⠀the⠀detail⠀is⠀the⠀correction.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀causal⠀movement⠀economical.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀makes⠀a⠀choice,⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀act⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀consequence.⠀Omit⠀the⠀general⠀reflection⠀unless⠀it⠀materially⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀choice.⠀A⠀warning⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue;⠀an⠀alternative⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀one⠀practical⠀action⠀someone⠀declines⠀to⠀take.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀infer⠀why⠀the⠀choice⠀matters⠀from⠀the⠀details⠀already⠀present,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀paragraph⠀explaining⠀its⠀significance.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀return⠀of⠀one⠀earlier⠀detail.⠀The⠀same⠀notice,⠀form,⠀or⠀phrase⠀appears⠀again,⠀but⠀the⠀surrounding⠀clauses⠀have⠀changed.⠀The⠀change⠀may⠀be⠀small:⠀the⠀notice⠀has⠀been⠀taken⠀down,⠀the⠀form⠀is⠀now⠀unsigned,⠀the⠀chair⠀is⠀empty,⠀the⠀phrase⠀is⠀said⠀by⠀a⠀different⠀person.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀direct⠀syntax⠀should⠀let⠀the⠀changed⠀detail⠀do⠀the⠀work.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀short⠀fragments,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀sentence's⠀movement⠀toward⠀the⠀concrete⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀toward⠀a⠀general⠀statement⠀about⠀loss.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀characters'⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority⠀without⠀explaining⠀them.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀quote⠀the⠀rule⠀exactly;⠀another⠀may⠀answer⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀correction;⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀say⠀nothing.⠀The⠀dialogue⠀should⠀remain⠀individual⠀and⠀economical.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀a⠀witty⠀commentator.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀lies⠀in⠀which⠀of⠀these⠀relationships⠀a⠀character⠀holds⠀when⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀arrives,⠀and⠀the⠀aftermath⠀may⠀be⠀shown⠀by⠀a⠀single⠀detail:⠀a⠀desk⠀cleared,⠀a⠀door⠀closed,⠀a⠀form⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀close⠀on⠀that⠀concrete⠀fact⠀or⠀on⠀the⠀continuing⠀practical⠀life⠀around⠀it,⠀without⠀extracting⠀a⠀lesson⠀from⠀either.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Let⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register⠀and⠀rhythm.⠀A⠀meeting⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀business⠀of⠀the⠀room:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀is⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀said⠀before.⠀Move⠀into⠀dialogue⠀when⠀the⠀characters'⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀official⠀language⠀become⠀audible.⠀One⠀speaker⠀may⠀use⠀the⠀institution's⠀terms⠀with⠀complete⠀confidence;⠀another⠀may⠀translate⠀them⠀into⠀practical⠀consequences;⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀remain⠀silent⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀registers⠀what⠀that⠀silence⠀costs.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Pratchett⠀social⠀attention⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀explanations⠀and⠀practical⠀reality⠀through⠀particular⠀behavior.⠀A⠀procedure⠀may⠀be⠀followed⠀exactly⠀while⠀everyone⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀knows⠀it⠀will⠀not⠀solve⠀the⠀problem.⠀A⠀superior⠀may⠀give⠀an⠀instruction⠀that⠀sounds⠀reasonable⠀in⠀the⠀official⠀vocabulary⠀and⠀impossible⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀circumstances.⠀Let⠀the⠀comedy⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀precision⠀of⠀the⠀observation,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator's⠀aside.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀move⠀into⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀inner⠀experience⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀person⠀weighs⠀the⠀official⠀account⠀against⠀what⠀they⠀know,⠀but⠀keep⠀other⠀characters'⠀private⠀thoughts⠀outside⠀the⠀authorized⠀access.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀by⠀letting⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀remain⠀intelligible⠀within⠀the⠀scene⠀flow.⠀A⠀colleague⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀likely⠀consequence⠀in⠀plain⠀terms.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀alternative⠀and⠀name⠀its⠀cost.⠀The⠀fall⠀becomes⠀meaningful⠀because⠀the⠀choice⠀is⠀made⠀in⠀full⠀view⠀of⠀these⠀possibilities,⠀not⠀because⠀everyone⠀is⠀foolish⠀or⠀blind.⠀When⠀recognition⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀occur⠀within⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀movement:⠀during⠀a⠀conversation,⠀while⠀performing⠀a⠀routine⠀task,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀pause⠀after⠀an⠀action.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀shift⠀from⠀perception⠀to⠀recollection⠀and⠀back,⠀but⠀the⠀shift⠀should⠀be⠀motivated⠀by⠀the⠀present⠀moment,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀structural⠀need⠀to⠀recap.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀aftermath⠀concrete⠀and⠀continuous⠀with⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀room⠀may⠀still⠀contain⠀the⠀materials⠀of⠀the⠀work⠀that⠀has⠀ended.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀continue⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀summary.⠀The⠀contemporary-novel⠀presentation⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀loss⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀details⠀and⠀the⠀characters'⠀remaining⠀choices,⠀so⠀the⠀irreversibility⠀is⠀felt⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀still⠀holds⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀closing⠀moral.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀output⠀contracts⠀throughout.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise.⠀Establish⠀its⠀particular⠀promise⠀through⠀scene⠀selection:⠀choose⠀moments⠀that⠀show⠀what⠀these⠀people⠀do⠀for⠀each⠀other,⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀only⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀what⠀repeated⠀action⠀or⠀phrase⠀has⠀become⠀their⠀private⠀language.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀involves⠀loyalty,⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀form⠀that⠀loyalty⠀takes⠀in⠀this⠀institution's⠀daily⠀life.⠀If⠀it⠀involves⠀rivalry⠀or⠀comfort,⠀show⠀the⠀specific⠀gestures⠀and⠀words⠀that⠀carry⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Pratchett⠀social⠀comedy⠀create⠀the⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀fall.⠀The⠀institution's⠀official⠀explanations⠀and⠀practical⠀realities⠀press⠀on⠀the⠀relationship⠀from⠀outside:⠀a⠀rule,⠀a⠀transfer,⠀a⠀duty,⠀a⠀budget,⠀a⠀public⠀expectation,⠀or⠀a⠀superior's⠀decision.⠀Show⠀how⠀the⠀couple⠀or⠀the⠀pair⠀negotiates⠀that⠀pressure⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀idiom.⠀One⠀may⠀translate⠀the⠀official⠀language⠀into⠀a⠀private⠀joke;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀joke⠀because⠀the⠀practical⠀consequence⠀is⠀too⠀serious.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀institution's⠀particular⠀absurdity,⠀not⠀mock⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀should⠀have⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs,⠀but⠀the⠀tragedy⠀requires⠀that⠀the⠀relationship's⠀promise⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept⠀under⠀the⠀new⠀conditions.\n\nUse⠀repeated⠀moments⠀and⠀callbacks⠀to⠀build⠀recognition.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀object⠀may⠀appear⠀early⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀relationship's⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Return⠀to⠀it⠀later⠀when⠀its⠀meaning⠀has⠀changed.⠀The⠀callback⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀by⠀showing⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost⠀or⠀what⠀has⠀become⠀impossible.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀callback⠀a⠀betrayal.⠀The⠀loss⠀may⠀be⠀that⠀the⠀private⠀language⠀now⠀sounds⠀like⠀the⠀institution's⠀language,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀gesture⠀of⠀comfort⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀performed⠀without⠀a⠀cost⠀the⠀characters⠀understand⠀too⠀well.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀established⠀premise.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀relationship's⠀changed⠀condition⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀grief.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀room,⠀still⠀using⠀a⠀fragment⠀of⠀their⠀private⠀language,⠀but⠀the⠀repeated⠀moment⠀no⠀longer⠀means⠀what⠀it⠀meant.⠀Let⠀the⠀irreversibility⠀be⠀felt⠀through⠀the⠀relationship's⠀own⠀terms.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀rupture.⠀The⠀ending⠀may⠀preserve⠀what⠀the⠀relationship's⠀promise⠀has⠀become⠀or⠀leave⠀that⠀changed⠀condition⠀still⠀forming,⠀without⠀resolving⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀moral⠀about⠀love⠀or⠀loss.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling⠀from⠀its⠀opening.⠀Use⠀a⠀deliberate⠀opening⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀institution,⠀the⠀person,⠀or⠀the⠀change⠀to⠀be⠀told,⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀compact⠀declaration⠀may⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀act:⠀who⠀kept⠀the⠀records,⠀who⠀spoke⠀plainly,⠀who⠀stayed⠀when⠀others⠀left.⠀Expand⠀from⠀that⠀declaration⠀into⠀the⠀practical⠀details⠀that⠀complicate⠀it.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀an⠀account⠀shaped⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀now⠀knows,⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀report.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀and⠀designations⠀drawn⠀from⠀the⠀institution's⠀actual⠀life.⠀A⠀title,⠀a⠀posted⠀rule,⠀a⠀job,⠀or⠀a⠀habitual⠀saying⠀can⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀The⠀Pratchett⠀comedy⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀designation⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀reality.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀record⠀that⠀someone⠀was⠀called⠀by⠀an⠀official⠀title,⠀then⠀show⠀what⠀that⠀title⠀actually⠀required.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀household⠀or⠀office⠀work⠀into⠀mock⠀combat.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀institution's⠀particular⠀absurdity:⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀procedure⠀outlived⠀its⠀purpose,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀committee⠀protected⠀its⠀own⠀convenience,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀an⠀official⠀phrase⠀made⠀a⠀hard⠀fact⠀temporarily⠀manageable.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀be⠀carried⠀by⠀the⠀relation⠀of⠀acts⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀A⠀warning⠀can⠀be⠀recorded⠀as⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration:⠀someone⠀said⠀what⠀would⠀happen,⠀and⠀it⠀happened.⠀An⠀alternative⠀can⠀be⠀remembered⠀as⠀the⠀road⠀not⠀taken.⠀The⠀recognition⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀later⠀knowledge,⠀but⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀must⠀remain⠀intelligent⠀and⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀their⠀choices.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀them⠀foolish⠀because⠀the⠀outcome⠀is⠀known.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀a⠀choice⠀seemed⠀reasonable⠀under⠀the⠀conditions⠀then⠀present,⠀and⠀still⠀record⠀its⠀consequence.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀can⠀report⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀and⠀done,⠀and⠀what⠀later⠀became⠀known,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀narrate⠀another⠀person's⠀private⠀thought⠀unless⠀the⠀story's⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle⠀when⠀a⠀participant⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀detail⠀or⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀should⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀a⠀room⠀still⠀arranged⠀for⠀work⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀resume,⠀a⠀phrase⠀now⠀used⠀without⠀its⠀old⠀confidence,⠀or⠀a⠀name⠀remembered⠀for⠀a⠀deed⠀whose⠀cost⠀the⠀chronicle⠀does⠀not⠀soften.⠀Let⠀the⠀account⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀leaving⠀the⠀loss⠀preserved⠀and⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀still⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered,⠀without⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀social-domestic⠀realism⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀inward⠀strand.⠀Use⠀a⠀limited⠀third-person⠀narrator⠀who⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀world⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀and⠀observes⠀it⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀position:⠀a⠀colleague,⠀neighbor,⠀family⠀member,⠀or⠀longtime⠀employee⠀who⠀knows⠀the⠀practical⠀arrangements⠀and⠀has⠀a⠀stake⠀in⠀them.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀protagonist⠀or⠀a⠀close⠀observer,⠀but⠀the⠀perspective⠀must⠀remain⠀fixed⠀enough⠀that⠀private⠀knowledge⠀belongs⠀to⠀one⠀mind⠀and⠀other⠀people's⠀motives⠀are⠀inferred⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀do,⠀say,⠀and⠀leave⠀undone.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀Scandinavian⠀context⠀and⠀keep⠀its⠀specific⠀institutional⠀and⠀domestic⠀texture.⠀Do⠀not⠀assemble⠀a⠀generic⠀Nordic⠀landscape.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish,⠀let⠀the⠀names⠀of⠀places,⠀organizations,⠀routines,⠀and⠀forms⠀of⠀address⠀carry⠀that⠀particularity⠀without⠀turning⠀them⠀into⠀local-color⠀decoration.⠀Weather⠀and⠀geography⠀enter⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀affect⠀work,⠀travel,⠀housing,⠀or⠀social⠀obligation:⠀a⠀ferry⠀schedule,⠀a⠀snow-clearing⠀duty,⠀a⠀long⠀commute,⠀a⠀seasonal⠀job.⠀Reserve,⠀darkness,⠀and⠀isolation⠀are⠀not⠀automatic⠀moods.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀arrangements⠀and⠀practical⠀life.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀institutional⠀or⠀communal⠀routine—a⠀workplace⠀procedure,⠀a⠀housing⠀association⠀meeting,⠀a⠀family⠀business,⠀a⠀care⠀schedule,⠀a⠀municipal⠀service—and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀how⠀the⠀rule⠀is⠀actually⠀carried⠀out.⠀Pratchett's⠀comic⠀correction⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀particular⠀mismatch:⠀the⠀form⠀everyone⠀signs⠀but⠀nobody⠀reads,⠀the⠀policy⠀announced⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀do⠀the⠀work,⠀the⠀neighbor⠀who⠀knows⠀the⠀boiler⠀better⠀than⠀the⠀manual.⠀Each⠀comic⠀observation⠀should⠀also⠀advance⠀the⠀reader's⠀understanding⠀of⠀who⠀has⠀authority,⠀who⠀is⠀competent,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀protect.\n\nGive⠀the⠀central⠀character⠀a⠀direct⠀aim⠀that⠀is⠀intelligible⠀and⠀socially⠀embedded:⠀keeping⠀a⠀job,⠀holding⠀a⠀family⠀arrangement⠀together,⠀honoring⠀a⠀promise,⠀maintaining⠀a⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀community,⠀avoiding⠀shame.⠀Let⠀the⠀destructive⠀pressure⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀that⠀aim⠀and⠀another⠀legitimate⠀commitment.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternative⠀clearly.⠀Another⠀person⠀proposes⠀a⠀workable⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀colleague⠀offers⠀help,⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀asks⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀opens⠀a⠀different⠀path.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀does⠀not⠀miss⠀the⠀alternative;⠀they⠀refuse⠀it⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀trace—loyalty,⠀pride,⠀fear⠀of⠀exposure,⠀a⠀fixed⠀belief⠀about⠀what⠀is⠀owed.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀refusal⠀foolish⠀or⠀melodramatic.\n\nUse⠀the⠀inward⠀strand⠀selectively.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀can⠀appear⠀when⠀it⠀explains⠀why⠀a⠀particular⠀choice⠀narrows,⠀but⠀the⠀story⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀continuous⠀monologue.⠀Let⠀private⠀thought⠀sit⠀beside⠀observable⠀social⠀detail:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀notices⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀of⠀a⠀message,⠀remembers⠀who⠀taught⠀them⠀the⠀task,⠀calculates⠀what⠀the⠀neighbors⠀will⠀say,⠀and⠀then⠀speaks⠀or⠀acts.⠀Other⠀characters'⠀interiority⠀is⠀not⠀available⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀it.\n\nStage⠀recognition⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀event,⠀not⠀a⠀private⠀epiphany⠀alone.⠀A⠀neighbor⠀says⠀plainly⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀has⠀been⠀avoiding.⠀A⠀child⠀asks⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀exposes⠀the⠀contradiction.⠀A⠀ledger,⠀roster,⠀or⠀message⠀history⠀makes⠀the⠀cost⠀visible.⠀The⠀recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀can⠀afterward⠀say⠀about⠀the⠀person:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀becomes⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀would⠀not⠀accept⠀help,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀let⠀the⠀arrangement⠀fail,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀chose⠀the⠀rule⠀over⠀the⠀person.⠀Let⠀the⠀loss⠀be⠀specific⠀and⠀irreversible—a⠀home,⠀a⠀position,⠀a⠀marriage,⠀a⠀family⠀connection,⠀a⠀public⠀trust—and⠀let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀show⠀the⠀community⠀absorbing⠀it⠀through⠀ordinary⠀continuities:⠀a⠀shift⠀change,⠀a⠀meal⠀prepared,⠀a⠀room⠀repurposed,⠀a⠀duty⠀reassigned.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀ending⠀concrete⠀and⠀unheroic.⠀The⠀community⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀mob⠀or⠀a⠀chorus⠀of⠀mourners.⠀Someone⠀makes⠀the⠀old⠀joke⠀to⠀a⠀newcomer⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀understand⠀it.⠀A⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀resumes⠀with⠀a⠀small,⠀permanent⠀alteration.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀record⠀the⠀loss⠀in⠀plain⠀language,⠀but⠀the⠀final⠀image⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀particular⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning:⠀a⠀name⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀chair⠀left⠀empty,⠀a⠀key⠀returned,⠀a⠀window⠀repaired⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀complete⠀not⠀because⠀fate⠀has⠀spoken⠀but⠀because⠀the⠀daily⠀workings⠀of⠀a⠀social⠀world⠀have⠀continued⠀past⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀protagonist⠀could⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nFormat⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀heading,⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀blocks.⠀Use⠀the⠀action⠀text⠀to⠀establish⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀and⠀audible:⠀who⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀how⠀the⠀space⠀is⠀organized,⠀what⠀object⠀or⠀sign⠀indicates⠀the⠀institution's⠀authority.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.⠀Use⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀comedy⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business.⠀A⠀character⠀corrects⠀a⠀colleague's⠀use⠀of⠀the⠀official⠀term⠀while⠀reaching⠀for⠀the⠀wrong⠀form.⠀A⠀supervisor⠀recites⠀a⠀procedure⠀while⠀a⠀subordinate⠀quietly⠀does⠀the⠀actual⠀repair.⠀Two⠀staff⠀members⠀share⠀a⠀complaint⠀about⠀a⠀third⠀without⠀agreeing⠀on⠀the⠀real⠀problem.⠀Each⠀comic⠀beat⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀particular⠀mismatch⠀between⠀official⠀explanation⠀and⠀practical⠀reality,⠀not⠀merely⠀sound⠀clever.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀set⠀of⠀recurring⠀locations.⠀Choose⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀places—an⠀office,⠀a⠀station,⠀a⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀public⠀hall,⠀a⠀workshop—and⠀return⠀to⠀them⠀so⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀changing⠀position⠀becomes⠀visible.⠀Early⠀scenes⠀show⠀the⠀protagonist⠀included:⠀someone⠀moves⠀a⠀chair⠀to⠀make⠀room,⠀a⠀routine⠀is⠀shared,⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀on⠀the⠀roster.⠀Later⠀scenes⠀reverse⠀those⠀details:⠀the⠀chair⠀is⠀not⠀moved,⠀the⠀routine⠀continues⠀without⠀asking,⠀the⠀name⠀is⠀gone.⠀Let⠀props⠀carry⠀the⠀change:⠀a⠀chair⠀that⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀his,⠀a⠀roster⠀without⠀his⠀name,⠀a⠀window⠀he⠀was⠀always⠀asked⠀to⠀close.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀prop⠀symbolic;⠀let⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀specific⠀objects⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀through⠀recurrence.\n\nShow⠀the⠀alternatives⠀clearly.⠀Another⠀person⠀proposes⠀a⠀different⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀friend⠀offers⠀practical⠀help,⠀a⠀note⠀pinned⠀to⠀the⠀wall⠀suggests⠀a⠀workaround.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀refuses⠀for⠀a⠀comprehensible⠀reason—duty,⠀reputation,⠀loyalty,⠀shame,⠀a⠀fixed⠀belief—not⠀because⠀the⠀speaker⠀is⠀ungenerous⠀or⠀the⠀alternative⠀is⠀obscure.⠀The⠀audience⠀should⠀see⠀the⠀path⠀narrowing⠀through⠀specific,⠀intelligible⠀choices.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀experience⠀accessible⠀in⠀a⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀note⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀it.⠀Place⠀the⠀note⠀between⠀scenes⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀relevant⠀line⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀block:⠀CHARACTER⠀(INTERIOR)⠀with⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀thought.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀this⠀material.⠀The⠀note⠀can⠀expose⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀know,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀formatted⠀as⠀a⠀voice-over⠀unless⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀explicitly⠀uses⠀one.\n\nStage⠀recognition⠀as⠀a⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀beat⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀place.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀short⠀line⠀delivered⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀been⠀watching⠀the⠀situation,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀wordless:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀looks⠀at⠀the⠀one⠀person⠀who⠀could⠀have⠀changed⠀things⠀and⠀finds⠀that⠀person⠀already⠀looking⠀away.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀courtroom⠀disclosure⠀or⠀a⠀fatal⠀accident.⠀The⠀recognition⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means,⠀not⠀merely⠀confirm⠀that⠀something⠀bad⠀has⠀happened.\n\nEnd⠀with⠀the⠀community⠀continuing⠀its⠀practical⠀life.⠀Someone⠀checks⠀the⠀roster,⠀the⠀chair⠀remains⠀empty,⠀a⠀colleague⠀says⠀the⠀old⠀joke⠀to⠀a⠀newcomer⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀the⠀context.⠀The⠀final⠀image⠀should⠀be⠀particular,⠀ordinary,⠀and⠀irrecoverable.⠀The⠀institution⠀remains⠀functioning,⠀but⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀absence⠀has⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀its⠀daily⠀arrangement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀play⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀speaker-led⠀scenes⠀with⠀practical⠀furniture⠀and⠀objects:⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀register,⠀a⠀clipboard,⠀a⠀coat⠀stand,⠀a⠀door.⠀Use⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀to⠀show⠀who⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀space⠀and⠀how⠀that⠀belonging⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀stage⠀directions⠀economical:⠀describe⠀movement,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀objects;⠀do⠀not⠀prescribe⠀emotion⠀or⠀camera⠀shots.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett's⠀comedy⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀practice⠀and⠀real⠀work.⠀One⠀character⠀cites⠀a⠀rule,⠀another⠀quietly⠀bypasses⠀it,⠀a⠀third⠀points⠀out⠀that⠀the⠀rule⠀does⠀not⠀cover⠀this⠀case,⠀and⠀the⠀work⠀still⠀gets⠀done.⠀Each⠀comic⠀beat⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀particular⠀institutional⠀mismatch⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀sound⠀clever.⠀Give⠀characters⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority:⠀some⠀speak⠀plainly,⠀some⠀misuse⠀procedure,⠀some⠀are⠀efficient⠀without⠀jokes.\n\nDo⠀not⠀use⠀long⠀monologues⠀to⠀explain⠀feelings.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀The⠀fall⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀changing⠀social⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀space:⠀who⠀makes⠀the⠀tea,⠀who⠀knows⠀where⠀the⠀key⠀is⠀kept,⠀who⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀sit,⠀who⠀is⠀addressed⠀by⠀name⠀and⠀who⠀by⠀title.⠀These⠀changes⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀action,⠀not⠀imposed⠀as⠀a⠀fixed⠀sequence.\n\nStage⠀the⠀alternatives⠀clearly.⠀A⠀younger⠀colleague⠀offers⠀a⠀solution.⠀A⠀friend⠀asks⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀protagonist⠀will⠀not⠀answer⠀honestly.⠀An⠀exit⠀becomes⠀a⠀rejection.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀refuses⠀for⠀a⠀comprehensible⠀reason—loyalty,⠀pride,⠀shame,⠀duty,⠀a⠀fixed⠀belief—not⠀because⠀the⠀alternative⠀is⠀obscure⠀or⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀are⠀foolish.\n\nStage⠀recognition⠀as⠀a⠀public⠀beat⠀the⠀theatre⠀audience⠀can⠀see.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀line,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀position,⠀or⠀a⠀simple⠀action:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀takes⠀his⠀coat,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀calls⠀him⠀back.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀sudden⠀reversal⠀or⠀a⠀confession⠀delivered⠀as⠀a⠀soliloquy.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀speak⠀a⠀longer⠀private⠀thought,⠀make⠀it⠀a⠀visibly⠀staged⠀aside⠀for⠀a⠀specific⠀dramatic⠀reason—the⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀protagonist⠀turn⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀group—but⠀do⠀not⠀rely⠀on⠀asides⠀for⠀every⠀private⠀moment.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀hidden⠀or⠀visible⠀interiority,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀outside⠀the⠀dialogue:⠀CHARACTER⠀(INTERIOR)⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀actual⠀thought.⠀Other⠀characters⠀cannot⠀hear⠀this.⠀Do⠀not⠀disguise⠀the⠀interiority⠀as⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀separately⠀authorizes⠀that⠀performed⠀speech.\n\nThe⠀play⠀must⠀remain⠀playable.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀can⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀death.⠀A⠀final⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀organization⠀continuing:⠀a⠀meeting⠀begins,⠀a⠀new⠀person⠀takes⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀seat,⠀someone⠀says⠀the⠀old⠀joke⠀to⠀the⠀newcomer,⠀and⠀the⠀light⠀changes.⠀The⠀loss⠀is⠀specific⠀and⠀social:⠀a⠀position,⠀a⠀friendship,⠀a⠀marriage,⠀a⠀family⠀arrangement.⠀The⠀audience⠀leaves⠀with⠀the⠀sense⠀that⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀absorbed⠀the⠀loss⠀and⠀moved⠀on,⠀but⠀something⠀in⠀its⠀daily⠀language⠀has⠀permanently⠀shifted.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀practical,⠀rule-conscious⠀mind.⠀Use⠀an⠀authorized⠀focal⠀stream⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀narrative⠀person,⠀moving⠀among⠀immediate⠀perception,⠀remembered⠀procedure,⠀bodily⠀discomfort,⠀inner⠀argument,⠀and⠀the⠀institutional⠀language⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀encounters.⠀The⠀associations⠀should⠀be⠀concrete:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀office,⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀supervisor,⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀of⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀childhood⠀incident⠀that⠀made⠀this⠀duty⠀feel⠀absolute,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀fits⠀properly.\n\nLet⠀the⠀institutional⠀comedy⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀commentary⠀on⠀the⠀world.⠀When⠀the⠀mind⠀corrects⠀an⠀official⠀explanation⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀truth,⠀make⠀the⠀correction⠀particular:⠀the⠀register⠀is⠀always⠀balanced⠀by⠀Marta,⠀never⠀by⠀the⠀procedure;⠀the⠀manager's⠀speech⠀omits⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀door⠀must⠀be⠀kicked⠀before⠀it⠀opens.⠀The⠀humor⠀is⠀not⠀free-floating⠀wit⠀but⠀the⠀character's⠀way⠀of⠀keeping⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀self⠀amid⠀rules⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀quite⠀work.⠀Other⠀people⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀memory⠀and⠀intermittent⠀response,⠀not⠀as⠀omniscient⠀portraits;⠀their⠀speech⠀may⠀be⠀quoted,⠀but⠀their⠀motives⠀remain⠀the⠀character's⠀interpretation.\n\nGive⠀the⠀tragedy⠀a⠀long,⠀winding⠀approach.⠀The⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀central⠀incompatible⠀demand—love⠀against⠀duty,⠀pride⠀against⠀acceptance,⠀the⠀wish⠀to⠀stay⠀against⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀leave—through⠀small⠀triggers:⠀a⠀colleague's⠀offhand⠀remark,⠀a⠀child's⠀question,⠀a⠀familiar⠀street⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀time⠀of⠀day.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀association⠀lead⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀insight.⠀Let⠀some⠀recollections⠀be⠀ordinary,⠀some⠀bodily,⠀some⠀bureaucratic.⠀The⠀alternatives⠀are⠀intelligible⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀rehearse⠀them:⠀another⠀possible⠀choice,⠀a⠀friend's⠀offered⠀help,⠀an⠀arrangement⠀that⠀would⠀work⠀practically.⠀The⠀stream⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀mind⠀deliberately⠀turning⠀away⠀from⠀those⠀alternatives⠀not⠀through⠀blindness,⠀but⠀through⠀a⠀linked⠀chain⠀of⠀loyalty,⠀shame,⠀fear,⠀or⠀fixed⠀belief⠀that⠀feels⠀internally⠀reasonable.\n\nThe⠀recognition⠀happens⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀stream's⠀movement.⠀The⠀mind⠀stops⠀rehearsing⠀the⠀alternative.⠀It⠀may⠀literally⠀say⠀the⠀sentence⠀it⠀has⠀avoided,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀a⠀third⠀time⠀and⠀find⠀a⠀different⠀meaning.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀external⠀orientation—a⠀door,⠀a⠀train,⠀a⠀clock,⠀a⠀remembered⠀person's⠀face—so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀distinguish⠀present⠀scene⠀from⠀memory⠀and⠀fantasy.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀hidden⠀or⠀visible⠀interiority,⠀this⠀stream⠀is⠀itself⠀the⠀interiority;⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀with⠀speech⠀addressed⠀to⠀another⠀person.\n\nThe⠀loss⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀and⠀irreversible:⠀a⠀home,⠀a⠀position,⠀a⠀marriage,⠀a⠀public⠀trust.⠀The⠀ending⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀violent.⠀It⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀the⠀mind⠀continuing⠀to⠀think⠀through⠀the⠀aftermath—the⠀bus⠀still⠀comes,⠀the⠀post⠀still⠀arrives,⠀someone⠀else⠀now⠀sits⠀at⠀the⠀desk—while⠀a⠀single⠀blocked⠀alternative⠀keeps⠀returning⠀only⠀as⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀character⠀will⠀not⠀complete.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀lyrical⠀to⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀abstraction;⠀keep⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀register⠀of⠀a⠀sharp,⠀socially⠀observant⠀person⠀making⠀sense⠀of⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀has⠀lost⠀a⠀fixed⠀point.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nConstruct⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀message⠀log⠀with⠀sender⠀names.⠀Distinguish⠀work⠀channels⠀from⠀friend⠀chats⠀and⠀family⠀threads⠀by⠀their⠀different⠀expectations:⠀one⠀group⠀uses⠀full⠀sentences,⠀a⠀manager's⠀punctuation,⠀and⠀formal⠀sign-offs;⠀the⠀friend⠀chat⠀is⠀fragments,⠀lowercase,⠀and⠀quick⠀jokes.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀be⠀consistent—one⠀sends⠀voice⠀notes,⠀one⠀edits⠀a⠀message⠀twice,⠀one⠀never⠀uses⠀punctuation,⠀one⠀replies⠀instantly⠀and⠀then⠀goes⠀silent.⠀Do⠀not⠀give⠀every⠀character⠀the⠀same⠀quip⠀or⠀banter⠀tone.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett's⠀institutional⠀comedy⠀emerge⠀in⠀the⠀mismatch⠀between⠀official⠀language⠀and⠀practical⠀reality⠀within⠀the⠀messages.⠀A⠀colleague⠀asks⠀for⠀the⠀procedure⠀while⠀another⠀privately⠀messages⠀the⠀workaround.⠀A⠀supervisor⠀sends⠀a⠀long⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀new⠀policy;⠀the⠀group⠀chat⠀follows⠀with⠀a⠀four-line⠀critique⠀that⠀ends⠀with⠀\"anyway⠀it⠀doesn't⠀matter.\"⠀The⠀humor⠀is⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀people's⠀digital⠀register,⠀not⠀generic⠀internet⠀wit.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀the⠀message⠀traffic⠀and⠀its⠀gaps.⠀Show⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀growing⠀difficulty⠀in⠀answering⠀a⠀particular⠀person.⠀Let⠀an⠀alternative⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀chat:⠀someone⠀offers⠀help,⠀proposes⠀a⠀different⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀asks⠀a⠀direct⠀question.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀can⠀respond⠀appropriately⠀in⠀the⠀work⠀channel⠀but⠀avoid⠀the⠀personal⠀message,⠀type⠀a⠀draft⠀and⠀not⠀send⠀it,⠀or⠀reply⠀with⠀the⠀kind⠀of⠀short,⠀polite⠀line⠀that⠀closes⠀a⠀conversation.⠀Mark⠀unsent⠀drafts⠀explicitly⠀as⠀UNSENT⠀DRAFT,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀treat⠀them⠀as⠀transmitted⠀text⠀or⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀full⠀private⠀thought.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀interiority,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀block⠀outside⠀the⠀messages:⠀CHARACTER⠀(INTERIOR)⠀with⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀That⠀interiority⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀formatted⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀another⠀character⠀receives.⠀The⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact;⠀it⠀may⠀reveal⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀character's⠀state,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.\n\nUse⠀timestamps⠀and⠀delays⠀meaningfully.⠀A⠀two-minute⠀delay⠀before⠀a⠀reply,⠀a⠀message⠀seen⠀but⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀group⠀notification⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀silence—each⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀read⠀receipts⠀or⠀other⠀interface⠀events⠀solely⠀for⠀subtext;⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀events⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀specific⠀story.\n\nStage⠀recognition⠀through⠀the⠀transcript's⠀own⠀material.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀can⠀serve⠀as⠀the⠀recognition⠀point:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀finally⠀types⠀the⠀truth,⠀but⠀the⠀message⠀arrives⠀after⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀left⠀the⠀group,⠀changed⠀a⠀situation,⠀or⠀made⠀a⠀different⠀decision.⠀Or⠀the⠀recognition⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀own⠀message⠀history:⠀scrolling⠀back⠀and⠀seeing⠀the⠀pattern⠀of⠀avoidance⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀undone.⠀The⠀recognition⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means,⠀not⠀merely⠀confirm⠀that⠀something⠀bad⠀has⠀happened.\n\nThe⠀aftermath⠀should⠀read⠀as⠀the⠀transcript⠀after⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀group⠀chat⠀continues⠀with⠀practical⠀arrangements.⠀Someone⠀asks⠀about⠀the⠀protagonist,⠀someone⠀shares⠀a⠀photo,⠀the⠀thread⠀falls⠀quiet.⠀One⠀contact⠀stops⠀responding⠀entirely.⠀The⠀final⠀exchange⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀brief,⠀ordinary⠀message⠀that⠀shows⠀the⠀relationship⠀now⠀operates⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀constraint—\"I'll⠀courier⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀files\"⠀or⠀\"Happy⠀to⠀take⠀over⠀the⠀desk\"—rather⠀than⠀an⠀emotional⠀confession.⠀Keep⠀the⠀transcript's⠀language⠀concrete⠀and⠀socially⠀habitual.⠀The⠀irreversible⠀loss⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀being⠀said⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀practical⠀messages⠀that⠀now⠀organize⠀the⠀space⠀the⠀protagonist⠀used⠀to⠀occupy.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqayba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀short⠀scenes.⠀Each⠀scene⠀opens⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀location⠀and⠀the⠀details⠀that⠀matter⠀for⠀that⠀moment:⠀a⠀desk⠀with⠀the⠀wrong⠀nameplate,⠀a⠀window⠀whose⠀latch⠀only⠀the⠀protagonist⠀can⠀manage,⠀a⠀staff⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀good⠀mugs⠀are⠀hidden⠀from⠀the⠀supervisor.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀concise;⠀the⠀visual⠀novel's⠀presentation⠀assumes⠀the⠀image⠀may⠀carry⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀moment,⠀so⠀do⠀not⠀list⠀every⠀visual⠀feature,⠀only⠀the⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀that⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀interprets.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀narration⠀from⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀viewpoint.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀report⠀what⠀the⠀protagonist⠀sees⠀and⠀can⠀include⠀inner⠀response—practical⠀reasoning,⠀remembered⠀rules,⠀immediate⠀feeling—without⠀making⠀it⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀visible⠀interiority,⠀this⠀focal⠀narration⠀is⠀the⠀interiority;⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀spoken⠀dialogue.⠀When⠀the⠀contract⠀requires⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀wrap⠀the⠀private⠀passage⠀in⠀the⠀appropriate⠀wrapper⠀at⠀the⠀source⠀level⠀while⠀keeping⠀the⠀visible⠀response⠀appropriately⠀constrained.\n\nLet⠀the⠀institutional⠀comedy⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀speech⠀and⠀the⠀scene's⠀background.⠀A⠀manager⠀says⠀the⠀new⠀system⠀is⠀working⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀notes⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀paper⠀ledger⠀is⠀still⠀open⠀under⠀the⠀counter.⠀A⠀colleague⠀gives⠀a⠀formal⠀apology⠀while⠀the⠀narrating⠀eye⠀sees⠀him⠀turning⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀favorite⠀chair⠀to⠀face⠀the⠀wall⠀later.⠀The⠀humor⠀is⠀particular,⠀not⠀universal.⠀Do⠀not⠀give⠀all⠀characters⠀the⠀same⠀wit;⠀some⠀speak⠀plainly,⠀some⠀misuse⠀procedure,⠀some⠀are⠀efficient⠀without⠀jokes.\n\nMake⠀the⠀tragedy⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀slow⠀change⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀locations.⠀Early⠀scenes⠀show⠀the⠀protagonist⠀included:⠀someone⠀moves⠀a⠀chair⠀to⠀make⠀room,⠀the⠀ritual⠀of⠀coffee⠀is⠀shared,⠀the⠀lock⠀is⠀known.⠀Later⠀scenes⠀reverse⠀those⠀details:⠀the⠀chair⠀is⠀not⠀moved,⠀the⠀coffee⠀is⠀made⠀without⠀asking,⠀the⠀lock⠀has⠀been⠀changed.⠀The⠀alternatives⠀are⠀visible⠀in⠀these⠀small⠀arrangements:⠀another⠀character⠀proposes⠀a⠀different⠀solution,⠀a⠀friend⠀offers⠀a⠀practical⠀compromise,⠀a⠀shared⠀joke⠀once⠀suggested⠀a⠀future⠀that⠀the⠀protagonist⠀cannot⠀accept.⠀The⠀choices⠀remain⠀comprehensible;⠀the⠀protagonist⠀is⠀not⠀foolish.\n\nThe⠀recognition⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀beat⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀sees⠀a⠀familiar⠀detail⠀and⠀understands⠀its⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀A⠀nameplate⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀name,⠀a⠀mug⠀left⠀unwashed⠀on⠀the⠀shelf,⠀the⠀window⠀latch⠀fixed⠀by⠀someone⠀else—one⠀detail⠀is⠀enough.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀dramatic⠀soliloquy.⠀The⠀loss⠀should⠀feel⠀concrete⠀and⠀unalterable:⠀a⠀job,⠀a⠀home,⠀a⠀marriage,⠀a⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀community.⠀The⠀final⠀scene⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀world⠀continuing⠀without⠀the⠀protagonist:⠀a⠀meeting⠀begins⠀without⠀him,⠀the⠀empty⠀chair⠀is⠀moved,⠀a⠀newcomer⠀takes⠀the⠀old⠀mug.⠀The⠀narration⠀stays⠀clean⠀and⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀perspective,⠀without⠀moral⠀summary⠀or⠀player-style⠀alternative⠀choices.⠀The⠀story⠀remains⠀a⠀linear⠀piece,⠀not⠀an⠀interactive⠀route.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqaybb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀self-aware⠀segment⠀of⠀a⠀longer⠀tragedy,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀scene.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀brief⠀concrete⠀reminder⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀underway:⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀current⠀task,⠀the⠀person⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀the⠀institutional⠀conflict⠀already⠀introduced.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀entire⠀backstory;⠀only⠀recover⠀the⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀needed⠀for⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀to⠀make⠀sense.⠀Let⠀the⠀selected⠀narrator⠀notice⠀how⠀people⠀actually⠀behave⠀under⠀pressure,⠀using⠀only⠀the⠀access⠀that⠀viewpoint⠀grants.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀comedy⠀as⠀the⠀regular⠀texture⠀of⠀institutional⠀life.⠀Each⠀installment⠀can⠀include⠀a⠀small,⠀specific⠀mismatch:⠀a⠀manager⠀announces⠀a⠀policy⠀while⠀a⠀subordinate⠀quietly⠀explains⠀why⠀it⠀will⠀not⠀work;⠀a⠀form⠀requires⠀a⠀signature⠀from⠀someone⠀who⠀left⠀last⠀year;⠀two⠀colleagues⠀share⠀a⠀joke⠀that⠀the⠀protagonist⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀join.⠀The⠀comedy⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀central⠀tone⠀but⠀a⠀recurring⠀presence⠀that⠀becomes⠀darker⠀as⠀the⠀situation⠀tightens.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty;⠀let⠀some⠀people⠀be⠀direct,⠀bored,⠀or⠀cautiously⠀kind.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragic⠀fall⠀across⠀installments⠀by⠀making⠀earlier⠀details⠀return.⠀A⠀favor⠀the⠀protagonist⠀did⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀segment⠀is⠀later⠀revealed⠀to⠀have⠀cost⠀a⠀friend's⠀trust.⠀A⠀joke⠀about⠀eviction⠀stops⠀being⠀funny⠀when⠀the⠀housing⠀situation⠀arises.⠀A⠀borrowed⠀umbrella⠀becomes⠀the⠀object⠀left⠀behind⠀after⠀the⠀final⠀break.⠀When⠀such⠀a⠀detail⠀returns,⠀state⠀the⠀connection⠀briefly:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀remembers⠀the⠀same⠀corridor,⠀the⠀same⠀line,⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀choice.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀dramatic⠀cliffhanger⠀at⠀every⠀break;⠀some⠀installments⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀quiet⠀recognition,⠀a⠀completed⠀errand,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀roster.\n\nLet⠀the⠀alternatives⠀remain⠀visible⠀over⠀time.⠀One⠀character⠀consistently⠀offers⠀a⠀different⠀solution;⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀own⠀earlier⠀reasoning⠀shows⠀that⠀another⠀path⠀existed;⠀a⠀friend's⠀message⠀repeats⠀a⠀request⠀that⠀the⠀protagonist⠀keeps⠀postponing.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀absence⠀of⠀alternatives⠀but⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀accumulated⠀inability⠀to⠀take⠀them.⠀The⠀serial⠀can⠀use⠀occasional⠀recontextualization—one⠀line⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀installment⠀quoted⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀implication—but⠀do⠀not⠀retract⠀established⠀world⠀facts.⠀A⠀repair⠀that⠀happened⠀cannot⠀be⠀omitted⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀falsely⠀portentous.\n\nThe⠀recognition⠀should⠀land⠀as⠀a⠀definite⠀installment⠀beat,⠀not⠀a⠀final⠀conclusion⠀ex⠀nihilo.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀finally⠀sees⠀the⠀pattern:⠀the⠀unsent⠀reply,⠀the⠀missed⠀shift,⠀the⠀rearranged⠀room.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀state⠀it⠀plainly⠀and⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀practical⠀world⠀continue.⠀Subsequent⠀installments⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀aftermath:⠀the⠀job⠀ends,⠀the⠀relationship⠀ends,⠀the⠀home⠀is⠀lost,⠀and⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀community⠀goes⠀on⠀with⠀its⠀daily⠀work.⠀A⠀final⠀installment⠀can⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀monstrous⠀twist;⠀the⠀tragedy⠀is⠀already⠀complete,⠀and⠀the⠀serial's⠀last⠀image⠀is⠀someone⠀else⠀taking⠀over⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀task,⠀another⠀person⠀making⠀the⠀same⠀old⠀institutional⠀joke,⠀both⠀showing⠀that⠀life⠀continues⠀in⠀a⠀world⠀permanently⠀rearranged⠀by⠀the⠀loss.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀emotional⠀damage⠀as⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀direct,⠀uncomfortable⠀negotiations.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀name⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀or⠀fear⠀in⠀plain⠀terms,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀that⠀naming:⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀practical⠀objection,⠀the⠀silence⠀that⠀follows,⠀the⠀small⠀adjustment⠀in⠀how⠀they⠀arrange⠀a⠀room⠀or⠀perform⠀a⠀task.⠀The⠀turbulence⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀mismatch⠀between⠀a⠀clear⠀statement⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀that⠀cannot⠀absorb⠀it.\n\nGive⠀each⠀character⠀a⠀specific⠀reason⠀for⠀their⠀exposure⠀or⠀withholding.⠀One⠀may⠀admit⠀need⠀because⠀honesty⠀feels⠀like⠀the⠀only⠀remaining⠀form⠀of⠀respect;⠀another⠀may⠀withhold⠀because⠀they⠀have⠀already⠀calculated⠀what⠀the⠀admission⠀would⠀cost.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀either⠀position⠀into⠀generic⠀suffering.⠀Let⠀their⠀reasoning⠀remain⠀nimble⠀and⠀particular,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀conclusion⠀is⠀destructive.\n\nUse⠀black⠀humor⠀sparingly⠀and⠀attach⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀voice.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀puncture⠀a⠀solemn⠀ritual,⠀an⠀official⠀euphemism,⠀or⠀their⠀own⠀self-pity⠀with⠀a⠀precise⠀observation.⠀The⠀joke⠀does⠀not⠀relieve⠀the⠀strain;⠀it⠀reveals⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀still⠀think⠀clearly⠀while⠀hurting.\n\nAfter⠀a⠀difficult⠀exchange,⠀show⠀the⠀strain⠀in⠀concrete⠀subsequent⠀behavior.⠀Someone⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀and⠀does⠀it⠀badly,⠀or⠀with⠀exaggerated⠀care.⠀Someone⠀answers⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀earlier⠀conversation⠀had⠀not⠀happened,⠀and⠀the⠀avoidance⠀itself⠀becomes⠀legible.⠀Comfort,⠀when⠀it⠀appears,⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀awkward,⠀or⠀offered⠀too⠀late.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀knowledge⠀that⠀something⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀lost.\n\nKeep⠀recognition⠀tied⠀to⠀consequence.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀exactly⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀and⠀still⠀do⠀it,⠀or⠀may⠀understand⠀only⠀afterward⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀choice⠀made⠀impossible.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀the⠀loss⠀without⠀requiring⠀every⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀collapse.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀the⠀irreversible⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀relationship,⠀not⠀a⠀uniform⠀mood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nPresent⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Let⠀each⠀speaker's⠀position⠀be⠀clear⠀enough⠀that⠀a⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀who⠀is⠀defending,⠀evading,⠀or⠀exposing⠀what.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀concrete:⠀where⠀people⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀with⠀their⠀hands,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀detail⠀of⠀the⠀setting⠀carries⠀the⠀strain.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀questioning⠀pressure⠀inside⠀the⠀exchange.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀the⠀question⠀that⠀the⠀situation⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀avoid,⠀or⠀point⠀out⠀the⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀everyone⠀is⠀pretending⠀to⠀respect.⠀The⠀observation⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀that⠀character's⠀voice⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀narrator's⠀general⠀cynicism.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀answer⠀with⠀equal⠀intelligence⠀and⠀still⠀choose⠀badly.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀operate⠀through⠀intelligible⠀alternatives.⠀Show⠀that⠀a⠀different⠀choice⠀was⠀possible,⠀or⠀that⠀someone⠀understood⠀the⠀risk⠀and⠀proceeded.⠀The⠀loss⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀complete⠀itself⠀in⠀one⠀reply.⠀A⠀commitment⠀may⠀be⠀broken,⠀a⠀departure⠀may⠀be⠀accepted,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀recognize⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀already⠀made⠀impossible.⠀Leave⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀open⠀without⠀demanding⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀participant⠀resolve⠀the⠀feeling.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀The⠀continuation⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀practical⠀task,⠀a⠀silence,⠀a⠀departure,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀subject⠀that⠀follows⠀naturally⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀said.⠀Keep⠀NPC⠀behavior⠀active⠀and⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀one⠀legible⠀step⠀in⠀a⠀consequential⠀arc,⠀not⠀a⠀completed⠀moral⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realist⠀route.⠀Ground⠀the⠀tragedy⠀in⠀the⠀practical⠀workings⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀community:⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀local⠀regulation,⠀or⠀an⠀official⠀procedure⠀that⠀people⠀must⠀navigate.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story⠀distinct;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀setting⠀or⠀cast.\n\nLet⠀the⠀fall⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀interaction⠀between⠀a⠀character's⠀clear⠀personal⠀motive⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀arrangement⠀that⠀constrains⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀rule⠀as⠀something⠀people⠀actually⠀operate:⠀who⠀enforces⠀it,⠀who⠀benefits⠀from⠀it,⠀who⠀quietly⠀works⠀around⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀happens⠀when⠀someone⠀refuses⠀to⠀perform⠀the⠀expected⠀accommodation.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀not⠀that⠀the⠀rule⠀exists,⠀but⠀that⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀cannot⠀live⠀inside⠀it⠀without⠀losing⠀something⠀irreplaceable.\n\nGive⠀the⠀satire⠀a⠀specific⠀voice.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀official⠀justification⠀with⠀perfect⠀clarity⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀that⠀contradicts⠀it,⠀or⠀may⠀explain⠀why⠀a⠀pointless⠀procedure⠀is⠀nonetheless⠀necessary.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀sneer⠀at⠀everyone.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀real⠀absurdity⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀characters'⠀intelligence⠀and⠀their⠀capacity⠀for⠀meaningful⠀loss.\n\nAllow⠀recognition⠀to⠀arrive⠀through⠀social⠀consequence.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀too⠀late⠀that⠀their⠀compliance⠀protected⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀that⠀their⠀refusal⠀cost⠀them⠀a⠀place⠀they⠀had⠀not⠀understood⠀they⠀needed.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀should⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀institution⠀into⠀a⠀uniform⠀villain.⠀Some⠀people⠀inside⠀the⠀system⠀may⠀help,⠀and⠀some⠀may⠀be⠀harmed⠀by⠀the⠀same⠀machinery⠀that⠀others⠀exploit.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀hard-edged,⠀concrete⠀prose.⠀Name⠀the⠀material⠀facts:⠀the⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀desk,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀road,⠀the⠀precise⠀way⠀a⠀body⠀moves⠀after⠀bad⠀news.⠀Use⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀that⠀move⠀from⠀action⠀to⠀consequence⠀without⠀pausing⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀feeling.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀world⠀carry⠀the⠀strain.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀direct⠀reasoning⠀inside⠀the⠀compression.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀through⠀a⠀problem⠀in⠀one⠀sharp⠀paragraph,⠀testing⠀a⠀rule⠀against⠀its⠀practical⠀result.⠀Do⠀not⠀shorten⠀that⠀thought⠀merely⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀prose⠀hard.⠀When⠀the⠀reasoning⠀matters,⠀let⠀it⠀run⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀person⠀working⠀toward⠀a⠀choice.⠀The⠀thought⠀should⠀be⠀as⠀concrete⠀as⠀the⠀setting:⠀specific⠀objections,⠀specific⠀costs,⠀specific⠀alternatives.\n\nGround⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀blunt⠀because⠀they⠀have⠀stopped⠀caring⠀about⠀appearances;⠀another⠀may⠀be⠀blunt⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀afraid⠀and⠀cannot⠀manage⠀softer⠀words.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀sound⠀the⠀same.⠀The⠀black⠀humor⠀should⠀be⠀quick⠀and⠀practical,⠀a⠀precise⠀jab⠀at⠀an⠀official⠀phrase⠀or⠀a⠀false⠀comfort,⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀says⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀operate⠀through⠀physical⠀stakes⠀and⠀irreversible⠀action.⠀A⠀choice⠀may⠀close⠀off⠀a⠀route,⠀damage⠀a⠀body,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀return⠀impossible.⠀Recognition⠀can⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀material⠀detail:⠀a⠀key⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀fits,⠀a⠀chair⠀left⠀empty,⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀must⠀now⠀be⠀done⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀the⠀loss⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀grief.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀report,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀behind,⠀an⠀official⠀record.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically.\n\nLet⠀each⠀document⠀carry⠀its⠀author's⠀particular⠀voice⠀and⠀reasoning.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀write⠀with⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀candor,⠀following⠀a⠀question⠀past⠀the⠀answer⠀that⠀would⠀make⠀the⠀situation⠀easier.⠀Another⠀may⠀write⠀an⠀official⠀account⠀that⠀is⠀perfectly⠀clear⠀and⠀quietly⠀false.⠀Another⠀may⠀write⠀to⠀someone⠀they⠀love⠀and⠀discover,⠀in⠀the⠀writing,⠀that⠀they⠀cannot⠀say⠀the⠀thing⠀they⠀meant⠀to⠀say.⠀What⠀each⠀document⠀knows⠀or⠀conceals⠀follows⠀from⠀who⠀is⠀writing,⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀when.\n\nUse⠀gaps⠀and⠀revisions⠀to⠀build⠀the⠀tragedy.⠀A⠀later⠀document⠀may⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀or⠀may⠀carefully⠀avoid⠀correcting⠀it.⠀A⠀missing⠀reply⠀may⠀matter⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀the⠀letter⠀that⠀was⠀sent.⠀A⠀material⠀trace,⠀such⠀as⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀or⠀a⠀crossed-out⠀line,⠀can⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀author⠀could⠀not⠀bring⠀themselves⠀to⠀send.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record;⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀assemble⠀the⠀loss⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀show⠀and⠀omit.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀across⠀entries.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀reread⠀an⠀old⠀letter⠀and⠀understand⠀what⠀it⠀actually⠀meant,⠀or⠀may⠀write⠀an⠀account⠀that⠀finally⠀admits⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀document⠀denied.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀the⠀loss⠀through⠀the⠀continued⠀existence⠀of⠀the⠀records:⠀a⠀final⠀note,⠀a⠀file⠀kept⠀open,⠀a⠀letter⠀returned⠀unread.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀written,⠀what⠀was⠀understood,⠀and⠀what⠀could⠀not⠀be⠀restored.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀real⠀attention⠀on⠀warmth⠀without⠀pretending⠀it⠀repairs⠀anything.⠀Show⠀a⠀chosen⠀kindness:⠀someone⠀remembers⠀how⠀another⠀person⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀saves⠀a⠀portion⠀of⠀food,⠀makes⠀a⠀bed,⠀or⠀sits⠀nearby⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀conversation.⠀Let⠀the⠀care⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀involved,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀gesture⠀of⠀comfort.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀candor⠀inside⠀the⠀warmth.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀offer⠀comfort⠀with⠀a⠀dry,⠀precise⠀remark⠀that⠀refuses⠀to⠀inflate⠀the⠀situation.⠀Another⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀kindness⠀and⠀still⠀say⠀plainly⠀that⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀what⠀happened.⠀The⠀black⠀humor,⠀when⠀it⠀appears,⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀voice⠀and⠀should⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀scene⠀sour.⠀It⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀staying⠀honest⠀while⠀remaining⠀close.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀Someone⠀may⠀care⠀deeply⠀and⠀still⠀not⠀say⠀so.⠀Someone⠀may⠀say⠀so⠀and⠀still⠀not⠀be⠀forgiven.⠀Disagreement⠀and⠀privacy⠀remain⠀intact.⠀The⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀remove⠀the⠀established⠀problem⠀from⠀the⠀world.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tragedy⠀visible⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀warmth⠀may⠀be⠀real⠀and⠀still⠀insufficient.⠀A⠀familiar⠀pleasure⠀may⠀be⠀enjoyed⠀in⠀the⠀shadow⠀of⠀an⠀irreversible⠀choice.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀can⠀include⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀recipe⠀should⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀tragedy⠀into⠀a⠀domestic⠀vignette;⠀it⠀should⠀show⠀how⠀people⠀continue⠀to⠀care⠀for⠀each⠀other⠀inside⠀a⠀situation⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀fixed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀a⠀scene⠀open⠀into⠀its⠀social⠀context:⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀a⠀place,⠀the⠀obligations⠀of⠀a⠀family,⠀the⠀public⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀decision.⠀Use⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀the⠀moment⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀inside⠀it.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀feel⠀composed,⠀not⠀merely⠀transcribed⠀from⠀speech.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀examine⠀why⠀a⠀rule⠀exists,⠀who⠀it⠀protects,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀to⠀obey⠀or⠀resist⠀it.⠀The⠀inquiry⠀should⠀remain⠀nimble⠀and⠀specific.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀formal⠀register⠀become⠀a⠀blanket⠀of⠀solemnity;⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀puncture⠀an⠀assumption⠀with⠀a⠀precise,⠀dry⠀observation⠀when⠀the⠀voice⠀permits⠀it.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀the⠀interaction⠀between⠀private⠀choice⠀and⠀social⠀condition.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀make⠀an⠀intelligible⠀decision⠀that⠀the⠀surrounding⠀world⠀cannot⠀accommodate,⠀or⠀may⠀comply⠀with⠀a⠀demand⠀that⠀destroys⠀something⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀they⠀needed.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternatives⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀fall⠀feels⠀consequential⠀rather⠀than⠀fated⠀by⠀vague⠀forces.⠀The⠀social⠀framing⠀should⠀explain⠀the⠀conditions,⠀not⠀excuse⠀the⠀choice.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀through⠀judgment⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀feeling.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀their⠀loss⠀in⠀private,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀also⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀loss⠀will⠀be⠀recorded,⠀remembered,⠀or⠀misunderstood⠀by⠀others.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀a⠀changed⠀reputation,⠀an⠀empty⠀role,⠀a⠀public⠀account⠀that⠀misses⠀the⠀truth.⠀Keep⠀the⠀ending⠀contingent⠀on⠀the⠀actual⠀story⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀fall⠀in⠀every⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nGive⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀specific⠀audience⠀and⠀occasion:⠀someone⠀is⠀speaking⠀because⠀a⠀decision⠀must⠀be⠀made,⠀a⠀debt⠀explained,⠀a⠀silence⠀broken,⠀or⠀a⠀listener⠀persuaded⠀to⠀act.⠀Establish⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀want⠀from⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀assume⠀about⠀the⠀events⠀before⠀the⠀tale⠀begins.\n\nLet⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀carry⠀a⠀lucid⠀argument.⠀The⠀teller⠀follows⠀a⠀question⠀past⠀the⠀answer⠀the⠀audience⠀expects,⠀showing⠀how⠀a⠀rule,⠀custom,⠀or⠀official⠀explanation⠀becomes⠀practically⠀absurd⠀when⠀applied⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀life.⠀The⠀tale's⠀humor⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀precise⠀exposure⠀of⠀contradiction,⠀not⠀from⠀mocking⠀the⠀people⠀caught⠀in⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀candor⠀owned:⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀admits,⠀omits,⠀or⠀treats⠀as⠀obvious⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀particular⠀voice⠀and⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀with⠀the⠀listeners.\n\nInside⠀the⠀embedded⠀story,⠀render⠀the⠀alternatives⠀that⠀were⠀intelligible⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀point⠀where⠀a⠀choice⠀became⠀irreversible.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀teller's⠀part⠀in⠀the⠀loss⠀early.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀narrate⠀the⠀tale⠀as⠀if⠀its⠀central⠀figure⠀were⠀separate,⠀then⠀allow⠀a⠀listener's⠀interruption,⠀objection,⠀or⠀practical⠀question⠀to⠀close⠀that⠀distance.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀revise⠀an⠀emphasis,⠀defend⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀the⠀question⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀reveals⠀the⠀figure⠀is⠀not⠀as⠀distant⠀as⠀the⠀audience⠀assumed.⠀The⠀recognition⠀is⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀part⠀in⠀the⠀loss⠀becoming⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀listeners⠀and⠀unavoidable⠀to⠀the⠀teller.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀connect⠀the⠀levels.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀question⠀from⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀reappears⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning,⠀so⠀that⠀when⠀the⠀audience⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀situation⠀they⠀understand⠀why⠀the⠀teller⠀chose⠀this⠀story⠀now.⠀After⠀the⠀recognition,⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀show⠀the⠀aftermath⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀frame,⠀where⠀the⠀listeners⠀must⠀decide⠀what⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀know.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀reconciliation,⠀but⠀the⠀loss⠀remains⠀fully⠀intelligible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modernist-satirical⠀construction⠀route.⠀The⠀narration⠀proceeds⠀through⠀composed,⠀socially⠀precise⠀observation:⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀can⠀describe⠀an⠀institution,⠀regulation,⠀or⠀official⠀arrangement⠀with⠀enough⠀exactness⠀that⠀its⠀contradictions⠀become⠀visible⠀without⠀editorial⠀shouting.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀be⠀controlled⠀and⠀analytical,⠀with⠀subordinate⠀clauses⠀that⠀trace⠀how⠀a⠀rule⠀is⠀justified,⠀applied,⠀and⠀then⠀bent⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀applying⠀it.\n\nFollow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀approved⠀answer.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀or⠀narrator⠀asks⠀why⠀a⠀procedure⠀exists,⠀what⠀a⠀category⠀means,⠀or⠀who⠀benefits⠀from⠀an⠀arrangement,⠀let⠀the⠀inquiry⠀continue⠀past⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀polite⠀explanation⠀stops.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀emerges⠀from⠀the⠀practical⠀consequences⠀of⠀the⠀rule,⠀not⠀from⠀exaggerated⠀caricature.⠀People⠀inside⠀the⠀system⠀may⠀be⠀competent,⠀well-meaning,⠀and⠀still⠀bound⠀by⠀a⠀logic⠀that⠀cannot⠀accommodate⠀the⠀particular⠀case⠀before⠀them.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀that⠀institutional⠀logic⠀and⠀an⠀irreversible⠀personal⠀choice.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternatives⠀that⠀were⠀available⠀and⠀why⠀each⠀one⠀carried⠀a⠀cost⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀not⠀accept.⠀Let⠀the⠀character's⠀intelligence⠀remain⠀visible⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀choice⠀becomes⠀destructive:⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀the⠀reasoning,⠀not⠀merely⠀pities⠀the⠀outcome.⠀The⠀satirical⠀edge⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀treatment⠀of⠀the⠀system,⠀while⠀the⠀character's⠀loss⠀remains⠀concrete⠀and⠀unironic.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀narrative⠀distance.⠀The⠀composed,⠀analytical⠀voice⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀it⠀previously⠀subordinated⠀to⠀the⠀system's⠀logic:⠀a⠀name⠀on⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀room⠀no⠀longer⠀occupied,⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀character⠀once⠀said.⠀The⠀subordinate⠀clauses⠀that⠀earlier⠀explained⠀the⠀arrangement⠀now⠀fail⠀to⠀contain⠀that⠀detail,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀sentence⠀grows⠀shorter⠀or⠀repeats⠀the⠀detail⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀The⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀understands⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀the⠀damage:⠀the⠀institution⠀continues,⠀the⠀rule⠀remains,⠀but⠀the⠀particular⠀life⠀has⠀been⠀changed⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀repaired.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀contradiction⠀with⠀a⠀moral⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀reform.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nMake⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀concrete⠀and⠀present.⠀It⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀a⠀building's⠀maintenance⠀schedule,⠀a⠀family's⠀claim⠀on⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀title⠀that⠀still⠀opens⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀an⠀inherited⠀debt⠀that⠀now⠀falls⠀due.⠀Describe⠀the⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀precisely:⠀the⠀worn⠀fixtures,⠀the⠀modern⠀equipment⠀installed⠀around⠀old⠀stone,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀space⠀is⠀divided⠀between⠀those⠀who⠀own⠀its⠀history⠀and⠀those⠀who⠀merely⠀use⠀it.⠀Atmosphere⠀changes⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced,⠀not⠀substitutes⠀for⠀the⠀encounter⠀itself.\n\nLet⠀a⠀character⠀treat⠀the⠀inherited⠀solemnity⠀as⠀a⠀question.⠀Use⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀direct⠀inquiry:⠀the⠀character⠀asks⠀what⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀actually⠀does,⠀who⠀benefits,⠀and⠀why⠀anyone⠀still⠀obeys⠀it.⠀The⠀irreverence⠀is⠀intelligent⠀and⠀specific,⠀exposing⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀ritual⠀without⠀denying⠀the⠀real⠀power⠀behind⠀it.⠀Black⠀humor⠀can⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀voice,⠀especially⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀sees⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀authority's⠀self-presentation⠀and⠀its⠀material⠀operations.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy.⠀The⠀character's⠀inquiry⠀brings⠀them⠀close⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀a⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement:⠀a⠀relative,⠀lover,⠀colleague,⠀or⠀patron⠀whose⠀loyalty,⠀desire,⠀or⠀fear⠀makes⠀the⠀conflict⠀personal.⠀Let⠀social⠀masks⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀private⠀conversation⠀reveals⠀what⠀the⠀public⠀performance⠀concealed.⠀The⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀arises⠀from⠀incompatible⠀commitments:⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀both⠀preserve⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀continue⠀the⠀inquiry,⠀or⠀cannot⠀both⠀protect⠀someone⠀and⠀expose⠀the⠀arrangement.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀material⠀trace⠀of⠀the⠀intimacy.⠀After⠀the⠀choice,⠀the⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀object,⠀room,⠀message,⠀or⠀gesture⠀that⠀belonged⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀sees⠀it⠀now⠀as⠀evidence⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀had⠀already⠀shaped⠀the⠀available⠀choices.⠀The⠀character⠀understands⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀or⠀failed⠀to⠀do.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀the⠀damage⠀in⠀the⠀material⠀world:⠀a⠀room⠀left⠀empty,⠀a⠀name⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀debt⠀still⠀owed.⠀The⠀ending⠀does⠀not⠀restore⠀the⠀old⠀order⠀or⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀clean⠀victory.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀remains,⠀but⠀now⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀what⠀it⠀costs.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀account⠀route.⠀The⠀narration⠀is⠀a⠀situated⠀speaker's⠀retrospective⠀account:⠀someone⠀is⠀telling⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀community,⠀institution,⠀or⠀family⠀arrangement⠀worked⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure.⠀The⠀speaker's⠀candor⠀is⠀owned⠀by⠀this⠀particular⠀voice⠀and⠀occasion.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speaker⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀approved⠀answer.⠀The⠀account⠀reconstructs⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀custom⠀by⠀showing⠀how⠀it⠀operated⠀in⠀daily⠀life:⠀who⠀enforced⠀it,⠀who⠀benefited,⠀who⠀found⠀a⠀workaround,⠀and⠀what⠀happened⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀asked⠀why.⠀The⠀inquiry⠀is⠀direct⠀and⠀nimble,⠀exposing⠀contradictions⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀community⠀into⠀a⠀cartoon.⠀People⠀may⠀defend⠀the⠀arrangement⠀intelligently,⠀and⠀the⠀speaker⠀may⠀understand⠀their⠀reasons⠀even⠀while⠀rejecting⠀them.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀the⠀retrospective⠀structure.⠀The⠀speaker⠀knows⠀the⠀outcome⠀from⠀the⠀beginning,⠀but⠀the⠀account⠀distinguishes⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀has⠀learned⠀since.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternatives⠀that⠀were⠀intelligible⠀then⠀and⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀a⠀choice⠀became⠀irreversible.⠀Do⠀not⠀retroactively⠀insert⠀later⠀knowledge⠀as⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀occur⠀when⠀the⠀speaker⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀and⠀separates⠀the⠀two⠀kinds⠀of⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀speaker⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀a⠀phrase,⠀promise,⠀or⠀warning⠀meant⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀then⠀state⠀what⠀it⠀has⠀come⠀to⠀mean⠀after⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀those⠀meanings⠀is⠀the⠀recognition.⠀Let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀organize⠀the⠀telling:⠀the⠀speaker⠀is⠀giving⠀this⠀account⠀because⠀the⠀loss⠀still⠀matters,⠀a⠀debt⠀remains,⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀unspoken,⠀a⠀place⠀has⠀changed,⠀or⠀a⠀younger⠀listener⠀needs⠀to⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀cost.⠀The⠀ending⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀The⠀speaker⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀angry,⠀puzzled,⠀or⠀quietly⠀precise⠀about⠀the⠀damage.⠀The⠀testimony⠀makes⠀the⠀loss⠀intelligible⠀without⠀requiring⠀reconciliation,⠀reform,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀The⠀narration⠀is⠀a⠀personal⠀record⠀assembled⠀from⠀observations,⠀questions,⠀remembered⠀exchanges,⠀and⠀brief⠀reflections.⠀Each⠀entry⠀or⠀passage⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀occasion:⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀walk,⠀a⠀document⠀read,⠀a⠀task⠀performed,⠀a⠀sleepless⠀interval.⠀Let⠀the⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀teller,⠀with⠀no⠀imposed⠀quietness⠀or⠀mandatory⠀seasonal⠀inventory.⠀Direct⠀feeling,⠀plain⠀argument,⠀and⠀open⠀exasperation⠀are⠀all⠀available⠀where⠀they⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀voice.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀approved⠀answer.⠀The⠀miscellany⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀rule,⠀custom,⠀or⠀official⠀explanation⠀from⠀different⠀angles:⠀how⠀it⠀was⠀announced,⠀how⠀it⠀was⠀justified,⠀how⠀it⠀worked⠀in⠀practice,⠀and⠀what⠀happened⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀tested⠀it.⠀The⠀inquiry⠀is⠀precise⠀and⠀irreverent,⠀exposing⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀entry⠀into⠀a⠀polemic.⠀Black⠀humor⠀can⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀rule's⠀language⠀and⠀its⠀effects.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀accumulation⠀and⠀omission.⠀The⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀is⠀not⠀announced⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀dramatic⠀scene.⠀Instead,⠀let⠀the⠀record⠀circle⠀it:⠀an⠀entry⠀notes⠀a⠀warning⠀the⠀narrator⠀did⠀not⠀take⠀seriously,⠀another⠀records⠀an⠀alternative⠀that⠀seemed⠀impossible,⠀another⠀quotes⠀a⠀conversation⠀whose⠀meaning⠀the⠀narrator⠀only⠀later⠀understands.⠀The⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀choice⠀taking⠀shape⠀across⠀the⠀entries⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀remains⠀partly⠀unaware⠀of⠀where⠀the⠀record⠀is⠀heading.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀occur⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀rereads⠀an⠀earlier⠀passage.⠀In⠀a⠀present⠀entry,⠀quote⠀or⠀recall⠀the⠀earlier⠀passage,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀state⠀what⠀it⠀meant⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀now.⠀The⠀changed⠀meaning⠀is⠀the⠀recognition.⠀Let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀govern⠀the⠀selection:⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀keeping⠀this⠀record⠀because⠀something⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀lost,⠀and⠀the⠀choice⠀of⠀what⠀to⠀include⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀that⠀loss.⠀The⠀ending⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀a⠀final⠀entry⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀now⠀absent.⠀The⠀record⠀need⠀not⠀achieve⠀closure⠀or⠀self-forgiveness.⠀Its⠀form⠀makes⠀the⠀loss⠀intelligible⠀by⠀showing⠀how⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀attention⠀and⠀reasoning⠀led⠀toward⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀and⠀testimony⠀route.⠀The⠀narration⠀is⠀a⠀situated⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀specific⠀community's⠀encounter⠀with⠀a⠀rule,⠀institution,⠀or⠀official⠀arrangement.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀as⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀participant,⠀a⠀witness,⠀or⠀someone⠀assembling⠀records⠀and⠀voices,⠀but⠀the⠀form⠀distinguishes⠀clearly⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀personally⠀saw⠀or⠀did⠀and⠀what⠀others⠀reported.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀approved⠀answer.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀shows⠀how⠀the⠀rule⠀was⠀announced,⠀justified,⠀applied,⠀and⠀evaded⠀in⠀daily⠀life.⠀Use⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀direct⠀inquiry⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity:⠀a⠀procedure⠀that⠀cannot⠀accommodate⠀an⠀actual⠀person,⠀a⠀category⠀that⠀splits⠀a⠀family,⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀becomes⠀a⠀debt.⠀Candor⠀and⠀black⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀voices,⠀including⠀the⠀narrator's,⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀community⠀into⠀a⠀uniform⠀chorus⠀or⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀victims.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀social⠀conditions⠀and⠀intelligible⠀alternatives.⠀Show⠀the⠀pressures⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀destructive⠀choice⠀seem⠀necessary:⠀a⠀deadline,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀loyalty,⠀a⠀threat,⠀a⠀hope⠀that⠀the⠀rule⠀would⠀bend.⠀Let⠀different⠀people⠀understand⠀the⠀situation⠀differently⠀and⠀act⠀on⠀different⠀interests.⠀The⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀arises⠀from⠀incompatible⠀commitments,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀why⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀not⠀choose⠀otherwise⠀without⠀betraying⠀something⠀essential.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀foolish⠀or⠀erase⠀warmth⠀before⠀the⠀loss.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀be⠀both⠀personal⠀and⠀collective.⠀The⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀loss⠀and⠀states⠀what⠀it⠀meant⠀for⠀that⠀person,⠀then⠀shows⠀its⠀communal⠀trace:⠀a⠀practice⠀abandoned,⠀a⠀trust⠀broken,⠀a⠀place⠀changed.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀two⠀scales⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀lesson.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀The⠀ending⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀reform,⠀revenge,⠀or⠀reconciliation.⠀The⠀chronicle's⠀purpose⠀is⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀loss⠀intelligible⠀to⠀a⠀reader⠀or⠀listener⠀who⠀was⠀not⠀there,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀absurdity⠀of⠀the⠀rule⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀choice⠀remain⠀concrete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀already⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place⠀and⠀facing⠀a⠀concrete⠀problem:⠀a⠀document⠀to⠀sign,⠀a⠀rule⠀to⠀obey,⠀a⠀question⠀someone⠀has⠀refused⠀to⠀answer.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀by⠀naming⠀the⠀location⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀movement⠀between⠀spaces.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀changed.\n\nLet⠀the⠀character⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀approved⠀answer.⠀The⠀dialogue⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀beats⠀carry⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀direct⠀inquiry:⠀the⠀character⠀asks⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀actually⠀does,⠀who⠀benefits,⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀official⠀explanation⠀falls⠀apart⠀in⠀practice.⠀The⠀irreverence⠀is⠀sharp⠀and⠀specific,⠀exposing⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀character⠀into⠀a⠀stand-up⠀comedian.⠀Black⠀humor⠀can⠀surface⠀in⠀a⠀private⠀reaction⠀beat,⠀but⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀particular⠀voice⠀and⠀situation.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀and⠀an⠀irreversible⠀choice.⠀Show⠀the⠀alternatives⠀clearly:⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀comply⠀and⠀betray⠀someone,⠀refuse⠀and⠀lose⠀something,⠀or⠀find⠀a⠀workaround⠀that⠀only⠀delays⠀the⠀cost.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀reasoning⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀response⠀beats,⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀dialogue.⠀The⠀choice⠀is⠀destructive⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀character⠀foolish:⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀why⠀this⠀person⠀could⠀not⠀choose⠀otherwise.⠀Keep⠀the⠀visual⠀staging⠀concrete⠀during⠀the⠀turning⠀point,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀place,⠀object,⠀or⠀action.\n\nUse⠀the⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀for⠀recognition⠀and⠀aftermath.⠀After⠀the⠀choice,⠀give⠀the⠀character⠀a⠀private⠀interval⠀in⠀which⠀they⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀visual⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀turning⠀point:⠀the⠀signed⠀document,⠀the⠀empty⠀chair,⠀the⠀closed⠀door.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀state⠀what⠀the⠀detail⠀meant⠀before⠀the⠀choice⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀now.⠀The⠀changed⠀meaning⠀is⠀the⠀recognition.⠀The⠀ending⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored:⠀a⠀room⠀now⠀empty,⠀a⠀name⠀crossed⠀off,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open⠀again.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀rescue.⠀The⠀fast-readable⠀prose⠀makes⠀the⠀tragedy⠀immediate⠀and⠀intelligible,⠀with⠀the⠀aftermath⠀as⠀concrete⠀as⠀the⠀opening⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀one⠀recurring⠀image⠀or⠀syntactic⠀pattern⠀as⠀the⠀lyric⠀spine⠀of⠀the⠀tragedy:⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀physical⠀object,⠀a⠀sound,⠀or⠀a⠀grammatical⠀turn⠀that⠀appears⠀before⠀the⠀decisive⠀choice⠀and⠀returns⠀after⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀The⠀first⠀occurrence⠀should⠀be⠀plain⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀scene;⠀later⠀occurrences⠀should⠀accumulate⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀accepted⠀or⠀refused.⠀Let⠀the⠀rhythm⠀itself⠀mark⠀the⠀shift—short⠀clauses⠀for⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀refusal,⠀a⠀longer⠀accumulating⠀sentence⠀for⠀the⠀step⠀that⠀closed⠀the⠀alternative.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀direct,⠀questioning⠀voice⠀interrupt⠀the⠀lyric⠀flow⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀a⠀rationalization⠀hardens.⠀Follow⠀the⠀question⠀past⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer:⠀why⠀the⠀rule⠀was⠀called⠀necessity,⠀who⠀first⠀named⠀the⠀duty⠀sacred,⠀what⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀the⠀solemn⠀phrase⠀concealed.⠀The⠀interruption⠀should⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀image⠀into⠀argument.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀recurring⠀image⠀after⠀the⠀question,⠀now⠀carrying⠀the⠀knowledge⠀the⠀question⠀exposed.\n\nKeep⠀comparisons⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfold⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀stand⠀against⠀the⠀shaped⠀passages⠀so⠀the⠀lyricism⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀permanent⠀solemnity.⠀The⠀fall⠀remains⠀intelligible:⠀particular⠀people⠀give⠀warnings,⠀a⠀real⠀alternative⠀remains⠀visible,⠀and⠀the⠀choosing⠀person⠀stays⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention.⠀Recognition⠀arrives⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀recurrence,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀thematic⠀summary.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀rhythm⠀finds⠀a⠀rest,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀consequence⠀is⠀still⠀unfolding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀a⠀present⠀detail⠀open⠀the⠀reflection:⠀something⠀small⠀and⠀specific⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion.⠀Move⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀detail⠀to⠀the⠀remembered⠀moment⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀transition.⠀In⠀the⠀remembered⠀scene,⠀show⠀the⠀alternative⠀that⠀was⠀still⠀available—a⠀word⠀not⠀yet⠀said,⠀a⠀door⠀not⠀yet⠀closed,⠀a⠀request⠀still⠀possible.⠀Do⠀not⠀editorialize⠀that⠀this⠀was⠀the⠀turning⠀point;⠀let⠀the⠀memory⠀itself⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀about⠀to⠀be⠀lost.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrator's⠀direct,⠀questioning⠀voice⠀to⠀examine⠀the⠀reasoning⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀loss⠀seem⠀acceptable⠀or⠀inevitable.⠀Follow⠀the⠀question⠀past⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer:⠀whose⠀convenience⠀the⠀rule⠀served,⠀what⠀the⠀promise⠀actually⠀protected,⠀how⠀a⠀small⠀compliance⠀became⠀a⠀principle.⠀The⠀question⠀should⠀puncture⠀a⠀solemn⠀assumption⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀reflection⠀into⠀cynicism.⠀Black⠀humor⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀particular⠀voice⠀and⠀may⠀surface⠀exactly⠀where⠀the⠀rationalization⠀was⠀most⠀respectable.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀detail⠀after⠀the⠀memory.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀has⠀changed:⠀the⠀object⠀is⠀worn,⠀the⠀gesture⠀is⠀gone,⠀the⠀phrase⠀no⠀longer⠀means⠀what⠀it⠀meant.⠀Recognition⠀arrives⠀in⠀that⠀return,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀moral⠀statement.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀reflection⠀holds⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀reflection⠀settles,⠀with⠀the⠀remembered⠀incident⠀still⠀unfinished⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀detail⠀still⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling:⠀a⠀present-day⠀teller⠀addressing⠀a⠀particular⠀audience,⠀with⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀containing⠀its⠀own⠀scenes⠀and⠀dialogue.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀light⠀but⠀functional—one⠀room,⠀one⠀request,⠀one⠀interruption—and⠀make⠀the⠀account⠀available⠀as⠀a⠀retelling⠀rather⠀than⠀omniscient⠀history.⠀The⠀frame⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀decorative.⠀Its⠀interruptions⠀carry⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀tragic⠀work.\n\nLet⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀follow⠀the⠀fall⠀through⠀social⠀or⠀domestic⠀realism.⠀Show⠀the⠀consequential⠀choice,⠀the⠀intelligible⠀alternative,⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀who⠀warned⠀or⠀stayed⠀silent.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀pause⠀to⠀explain⠀a⠀custom⠀or⠀consequence,⠀but⠀the⠀pause⠀should⠀do⠀more⠀than⠀inform.⠀When⠀a⠀listener⠀asks⠀why⠀the⠀custom⠀was⠀followed,⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀follow⠀the⠀question⠀past⠀its⠀approved⠀answer⠀in⠀the⠀manner⠀of⠀the⠀author⠀profile:⠀expose⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀the⠀rule,⠀whose⠀convenience⠀it⠀served,⠀what⠀the⠀solemn⠀phrase⠀concealed.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀listener⠀naive⠀or⠀every⠀telling⠀ironic.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀recognition⠀in⠀the⠀frame.⠀The⠀inner⠀tale's⠀participants⠀may⠀never⠀fully⠀see⠀what⠀they⠀lost,⠀but⠀the⠀teller⠀or⠀a⠀listener⠀can⠀see⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀telling—a⠀name⠀finally⠀supplied,⠀a⠀debt⠀understood⠀too⠀late,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀unanswered.⠀The⠀frame's⠀present⠀moment⠀preserves⠀the⠀aftermath:⠀the⠀loss⠀remains⠀real⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀still⠀being⠀told.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀can⠀pause,⠀with⠀the⠀recognition⠀opened⠀rather⠀than⠀moralized.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀one⠀exact⠀detail⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀tragedy:⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀fact⠀that⠀appears⠀before⠀the⠀decisive⠀choice⠀and⠀returns⠀after⠀it.⠀The⠀first⠀occurrence⠀should⠀be⠀plain⠀and⠀unremarked.⠀The⠀second⠀occurrence⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀without⠀explaining⠀it—the⠀chair⠀now⠀empty,⠀the⠀paper⠀folded⠀differently,⠀the⠀gate⠀closed⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀side.⠀Omit⠀the⠀intermediate⠀reasoning⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀from⠀the⠀two⠀occurrences.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀the⠀causality;⠀leave⠀enough⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀moments⠀for⠀the⠀choice⠀to⠀be⠀reconstructible.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀direct,⠀questioning⠀voice⠀surface⠀once,⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀precise⠀sentence⠀that⠀punctures⠀the⠀rationalization.⠀Target⠀the⠀exact⠀rule,⠀duty,⠀or⠀phrase⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀alternative⠀disappear:⠀whose⠀convenience⠀the⠀office⠀rule⠀served,⠀what⠀the⠀family⠀duty⠀actually⠀protected,⠀how⠀the⠀title⠀replaced⠀the⠀name.⠀The⠀question⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀commentary⠀on⠀the⠀loss.⠀After⠀it,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀detail⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀do⠀the⠀remaining⠀work.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀number⠀of⠀details⠀small⠀enough⠀that⠀each⠀one⠀carries⠀weight.⠀A⠀warning⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀one⠀earlier⠀line,⠀not⠀a⠀rehearsed⠀argument.⠀An⠀alternative⠀may⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀gesture.⠀Recognition⠀arrives⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀recurrence,⠀never⠀through⠀the⠀narrator⠀pronouncing⠀the⠀moral.⠀Black⠀humor⠀stays⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀speaker⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀mock⠀the⠀loss.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀available⠀information⠀ends,⠀without⠀a⠀thematic⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀continuous⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀with⠀natural⠀movement⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀perspective⠀character.⠀Let⠀the⠀tragic⠀fall⠀emerge⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀practical⠀decisions,⠀not⠀as⠀fate⠀announced⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀paragraph.⠀In⠀each⠀scene,⠀show⠀the⠀immediate⠀pressure:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀wants⠀to⠀preserve,⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀obligation⠀demands,⠀and⠀what⠀alternative⠀still⠀remains⠀visible.⠀People⠀remain⠀intelligent⠀even⠀when⠀their⠀choices⠀become⠀destructive.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrator's⠀direct,⠀questioning⠀voice⠀at⠀the⠀exact⠀moment⠀a⠀character⠀converts⠀pressure⠀into⠀inevitability.⠀Follow⠀the⠀question⠀past⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer:⠀why⠀the⠀rule⠀was⠀called⠀necessity,⠀whose⠀convenience⠀the⠀duty⠀served,⠀what⠀the⠀solemn⠀phrase⠀concealed.⠀The⠀question⠀should⠀puncture⠀the⠀rationalization⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀an⠀essay.⠀Black⠀humor⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀speaker⠀and⠀may⠀surface⠀where⠀the⠀rationalization⠀was⠀most⠀respectable.\n\nStage⠀recognition⠀through⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀or⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀that⠀rereads⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀reason⠀their⠀way⠀to⠀it,⠀another⠀person's⠀response⠀may⠀expose⠀it,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀may⠀now⠀read⠀differently.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀revelation⠀in⠀every⠀reply⠀or⠀inflate⠀minor⠀friction⠀into⠀doom.⠀The⠀loss⠀remains⠀real⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀prose⠀stays⠀lively.⠀End⠀mid-scene⠀where⠀the⠀available⠀information⠀ends,⠀at⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀speech⠀or⠀thought,⠀before⠀a⠀known⠀decision⠀has⠀produced⠀its⠀full⠀result.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀the⠀central⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀tragedy.⠀Start⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀make⠀it⠀legible⠀through⠀scene⠀selection,⠀private⠀language,⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments.⠀Establish⠀one⠀shared⠀idiom⠀early—a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀joke,⠀a⠀promise—that⠀belongs⠀only⠀to⠀these⠀two⠀people.⠀Give⠀the⠀relationship's⠀main⠀texture⠀enough⠀continuous⠀space:⠀affection,⠀rivalry,⠀comfort,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀care⠀should⠀occupy⠀scenes⠀without⠀being⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀plot⠀beat.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragic⠀fall⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀relationship's⠀own⠀terms.⠀At⠀the⠀decisive⠀moment,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀shared⠀idiom⠀and⠀show⠀it⠀failing⠀to⠀do⠀what⠀it⠀once⠀did:⠀the⠀joke⠀lands⠀wrong,⠀the⠀gesture⠀is⠀refused,⠀the⠀promise⠀no⠀longer⠀covers⠀the⠀present⠀obligation.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀failure.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀show⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀cannot⠀bring⠀themselves⠀to⠀say⠀and⠀what⠀public⠀obligation⠀overrides.⠀Keep⠀both⠀people⠀intelligent⠀and⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention;⠀the⠀fall⠀is⠀not⠀caused⠀by⠀stupidity⠀or⠀malice.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrator's⠀direct,⠀questioning⠀voice⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀external⠀rule⠀or⠀institutional⠀absurdity⠀that⠀overrides⠀the⠀private⠀bond.⠀Follow⠀the⠀question⠀past⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer:⠀whose⠀convenience⠀the⠀rule⠀served,⠀what⠀the⠀public⠀duty⠀actually⠀protected,⠀how⠀a⠀private⠀promise⠀became⠀inadmissible.⠀Candor⠀and⠀black⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀voices⠀and⠀should⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀private⠀loss⠀feel⠀cheap.⠀Recognition⠀arrives⠀through⠀a⠀later⠀callback⠀that⠀rereads⠀the⠀shared⠀idiom—a⠀changed⠀routine,⠀a⠀sudden⠀failure⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀private⠀language,⠀a⠀phrase⠀now⠀spoken⠀by⠀only⠀one⠀of⠀them.⠀End⠀within⠀an⠀intimate⠀moment,⠀unfinished⠀and⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀tragedy⠀as⠀an⠀oral⠀retelling⠀of⠀deeds,⠀with⠀deliberate⠀openings,⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀and⠀recurring⠀phrasing.⠀Introduce⠀a⠀person⠀by⠀the⠀act⠀still⠀most⠀remembered,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀Choose⠀one⠀recurring⠀designation⠀or⠀formula—a⠀name,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀place—that⠀appears⠀first⠀as⠀public⠀reputation⠀and⠀returns⠀after⠀the⠀fall⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀application.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀revise⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀deed⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀repeat⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀central⠀arc⠀be⠀a⠀public⠀consequential⠀fall.⠀Oaths,⠀kinship,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀or⠀feuds⠀can⠀organize⠀the⠀account⠀where⠀established.⠀Warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀appear⠀as⠀what⠀others⠀said⠀and⠀later⠀what⠀no⠀one⠀said.⠀Keep⠀the⠀source⠀tradition⠀coherent;⠀do⠀not⠀mix⠀every⠀epic⠀convention⠀or⠀impose⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon.⠀Aftermath⠀preserves⠀the⠀loss⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀retelling:⠀a⠀name⠀stopped⠀being⠀spoken,⠀a⠀place⠀changed⠀hands,⠀a⠀debt⠀was⠀remembered⠀too⠀late.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀direct⠀analytical⠀voice⠀to⠀break⠀into⠀the⠀chronicle⠀at⠀the⠀exact⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀tale's⠀authority⠀has⠀smoothed⠀over⠀a⠀practical⠀absurdity.⠀A⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀object⠀to⠀the⠀tale's⠀moral,⠀or⠀a⠀listener⠀can⠀ask⠀the⠀question⠀nobody⠀wants⠀to⠀answer.⠀Follow⠀the⠀question⠀past⠀its⠀approved⠀answer:⠀whose⠀convenience⠀the⠀duty⠀served,⠀what⠀the⠀custom⠀actually⠀protected,⠀how⠀the⠀solemn⠀formula⠀concealed⠀a⠀smaller⠀practical⠀choice.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀saga⠀into⠀satire.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀may⠀pause—a⠀deed⠀completed,⠀a⠀question⠀opened,⠀a⠀name⠀still⠀unreckoned.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀inside⠀a⠀single⠀Swedish⠀municipal⠀social-services⠀office,⠀keeping⠀its⠀procedures,⠀caseworker⠀roles,⠀appeal⠀routes,⠀and⠀meeting⠀rhythms⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀generically⠀Nordic.⠀The⠀setting⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀backdrop⠀of⠀snow⠀or⠀silence⠀but⠀the⠀actual⠀administrative⠀world:⠀a⠀waiting⠀room⠀with⠀numbered⠀tickets,⠀a⠀shared⠀desk⠀calendar,⠀a⠀locked⠀archive,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀glass-walled⠀office.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀render⠀these⠀spaces⠀with⠀the⠀plain⠀concreteness⠀of⠀social⠀realism,⠀so⠀the⠀institution's⠀order⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀its⠀furniture⠀and⠀routines⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀its⠀rules.\n\nThe⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀is⠀a⠀caseworker⠀pursuing⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer:⠀why⠀a⠀housing⠀exception⠀for⠀a⠀parent⠀with⠀worsening⠀dementia⠀was⠀refused,⠀what⠀the⠀eligibility⠀regulation⠀actually⠀covers,⠀and⠀who⠀decided⠀that⠀the⠀parent's⠀current⠀care⠀arrangement⠀counted⠀as⠀adequate.⠀The⠀inquiry⠀proceeds⠀with⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct,⠀nimble⠀argument.⠀The⠀character⠀reads⠀the⠀regulation's⠀exact⠀wording,⠀asks⠀a⠀colleague⠀which⠀paragraph⠀authorizes⠀the⠀refusal,⠀and⠀notices⠀when⠀an⠀official⠀answer⠀restates⠀the⠀rule⠀instead⠀of⠀applying⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀narrator⠀a⠀separate⠀cynic⠀translating⠀every⠀procedure⠀into⠀sarcasm;⠀the⠀irreverence⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀reasoning⠀and⠀occasional⠀deadpan⠀observation.\n\nThe⠀tragedy⠀arises⠀from⠀two⠀commitments⠀the⠀prose⠀keeps⠀equally⠀legible.⠀The⠀caseworker⠀believes⠀the⠀office's⠀rational⠀order⠀should⠀serve⠀the⠀people⠀it⠀assesses,⠀and⠀the⠀same⠀caseworker⠀needs⠀the⠀parent⠀moved⠀into⠀supported⠀housing⠀before⠀the⠀current⠀arrangement⠀collapses.⠀The⠀formal⠀reason⠀for⠀refusal⠀satisfies⠀the⠀public⠀record:⠀the⠀parent⠀does⠀not⠀yet⠀meet⠀the⠀assessed⠀threshold.⠀The⠀private⠀reason⠀makes⠀the⠀formal⠀reason⠀intolerable:⠀the⠀assessment⠀form's⠀categories⠀do⠀not⠀capture⠀the⠀parent's⠀nighttime⠀wandering⠀or⠀the⠀neighbor's⠀exhausted⠀phone⠀calls.⠀Show⠀both⠀sides⠀in⠀concrete⠀scenes,⠀so⠀the⠀eventual⠀violation⠀is⠀a⠀choice⠀made⠀for⠀an⠀intelligible⠀reason⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀confused⠀accident.\n\nLet⠀other⠀characters⠀disagree⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀institutional⠀positions.⠀A⠀supervisor⠀cites⠀precedent⠀and⠀audit⠀risk.⠀A⠀colleague⠀proposes⠀a⠀legal⠀workaround.⠀Another⠀caseworker⠀argues⠀that⠀bending⠀one⠀rule⠀will⠀make⠀the⠀next⠀refusal⠀harder⠀to⠀defend.⠀Make⠀these⠀reasons⠀strong⠀enough⠀that⠀a⠀reasonable⠀person⠀could⠀choose⠀differently.⠀When⠀the⠀protagonist⠀falsifies⠀the⠀parent's⠀care-needs⠀assessment⠀by⠀adding⠀a⠀fall⠀that⠀did⠀not⠀happen,⠀narrate⠀the⠀actual⠀reasoning⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀the⠀act:⠀the⠀pen⠀on⠀the⠀form,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀neighbor's⠀call,⠀the⠀justification⠀that⠀the⠀category⠀was⠀wrong⠀anyway.⠀Later⠀recognition⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀act⠀has⠀done⠀to⠀the⠀original⠀cause,⠀not⠀merely⠀that⠀the⠀protagonist⠀feels⠀guilty.\n\nThe⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀the⠀institution's⠀continuity.⠀The⠀office⠀reopens,⠀the⠀supervisor⠀schedules⠀a⠀follow-up,⠀the⠀falsified⠀assessment⠀sits⠀in⠀the⠀file.⠀The⠀loss⠀is⠀the⠀irreversibility⠀of⠀the⠀choice:⠀the⠀caseworker⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀claim⠀the⠀office's⠀order⠀as⠀an⠀honest⠀instrument,⠀even⠀while⠀the⠀parent's⠀move⠀proceeds.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀carry⠀the⠀bureaucratic⠀absurdity⠀through⠀specific⠀details—a⠀printed⠀code,⠀a⠀deadpan⠀sentence⠀in⠀a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀form⠀field⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀corrected—without⠀turning⠀the⠀story⠀into⠀an⠀essay⠀about⠀social⠀systems.⠀Keep⠀required⠀interiority⠀available⠀for⠀the⠀focal⠀reasoning⠀and⠀unspoken⠀feeling;⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀receive⠀that⠀access.⠀Describe⠀indoor⠀and⠀outdoor⠀settings⠀with⠀ordinary⠀seasonal⠀detail,⠀not⠀symbolic⠀snow⠀or⠀darkness,⠀unless⠀the⠀story's⠀specific⠀place⠀and⠀season⠀give⠀them⠀a⠀live⠀function.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀screenplay⠀format:⠀scene⠀headings⠀for⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Use⠀the⠀actual⠀setting⠀and⠀cast.⠀Where⠀an⠀institution⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀tragedy,⠀make⠀its⠀spaces,⠀procedures,⠀records,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀stageable.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀readable⠀rather⠀than⠀visually⠀prescriptive;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀shot⠀sizes,⠀lens⠀movements,⠀or⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nLet⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀shape⠀the⠀exchange⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀have⠀reason⠀to⠀question⠀an⠀accepted⠀answer.⠀A⠀precise⠀request⠀for⠀a⠀rule,⠀a⠀source,⠀or⠀an⠀explanation⠀can⠀test⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀an⠀official⠀justification⠀and⠀the⠀situation⠀it⠀governs.⠀Let⠀answers⠀hold⠀up⠀when⠀supported.⠀A⠀patient⠀clerk,⠀harsh⠀official,⠀loyal⠀colleague,⠀or⠀person⠀who⠀wants⠀the⠀matter⠀finished⠀must⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀cast⠀and⠀their⠀own⠀purposes;⠀the⠀recipe⠀assigns⠀no⠀profession,⠀family⠀relationship,⠀nationality,⠀or⠀shared⠀cynical⠀voice.\n\nMake⠀competing⠀commitments⠀legible⠀through⠀concrete⠀choices⠀and⠀available⠀alternatives.⠀If⠀the⠀ongoing⠀tragedy⠀reaches⠀an⠀irreversible⠀act,⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀action⠀in⠀a⠀scene:⠀what⠀was⠀signed,⠀withheld,⠀said,⠀done,⠀or⠀left⠀undone.⠀A⠀prop⠀or⠀record⠀may⠀return⠀later⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning⠀when⠀the⠀consequences⠀support⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀prescribe⠀falsification,⠀a⠀medical⠀or⠀family⠀crisis,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀adverse⠀decision⠀to⠀create⠀that⠀pattern.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀Hidden⠀or⠀Visible⠀nonspoken⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀its⠀causal⠀moment.⠀It⠀may⠀carry⠀reasoning,⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀or⠀an⠀unspoken⠀acknowledgment.⠀Coverage⠀and⠀length⠀follow⠀the⠀shared⠀contract⠀and⠀the⠀experience,⠀without⠀a⠀one-note⠀cap.⠀Voice-over⠀remains⠀a⠀performed⠀device⠀for⠀sequences⠀that⠀call⠀for⠀it.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀connect⠀an⠀action⠀with⠀its⠀later⠀consequence⠀without⠀skipping⠀the⠀exchange⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀choice⠀intelligible.⠀When⠀aftermath⠀arrives,⠀keep⠀the⠀loss⠀present⠀in⠀observable⠀particulars⠀and⠀ordinary⠀continuing⠀work.⠀A⠀recognition⠀may⠀be⠀quiet⠀or⠀incomplete;⠀the⠀reply⠀can⠀stop⠀at⠀its⠀current⠀boundary⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀an⠀ending⠀or⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀tragedy⠀for⠀the⠀stage,⠀using⠀the⠀supplied⠀place⠀and⠀people.⠀Choose⠀a⠀limited⠀set⠀of⠀useful⠀props⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀scene:⠀an⠀object⠀handled⠀during⠀a⠀dispute,⠀a⠀record⠀both⠀speakers⠀can⠀inspect,⠀a⠀chair⠀someone⠀needs,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀regulates⠀access.⠀Let⠀those⠀objects⠀make⠀commitments⠀tangible⠀without⠀importing⠀a⠀municipal⠀office,⠀a⠀family⠀care⠀problem,⠀or⠀a⠀predetermined⠀document.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear;⠀avoid⠀film-camera⠀instructions.\n\nLet⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀argumentative⠀method⠀animate⠀duologues⠀when⠀an⠀actual⠀speaker⠀follows⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀socially⠀comfortable⠀answer.⠀Keep⠀the⠀claim⠀precise:⠀what⠀a⠀rule⠀says,⠀how⠀a⠀decision⠀was⠀reached,⠀who⠀can⠀act,⠀what⠀a⠀promise⠀entails.⠀Other⠀characters⠀answer⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀knowledge⠀and⠀practical⠀purposes.⠀A⠀counterargument⠀may⠀be⠀sound,⠀evasive,⠀mistaken,⠀or⠀incomplete;⠀the⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀decide⠀its⠀truth⠀or⠀make⠀every⠀person⠀an⠀obstacle.\n\nWhen⠀commitments⠀become⠀incompatible,⠀make⠀the⠀available⠀alternatives⠀performable.⠀An⠀offered⠀route,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀delay,⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀to⠀proceed⠀should⠀be⠀expressed⠀through⠀what⠀these⠀characters⠀actually⠀do⠀and⠀say.⠀If⠀someone⠀makes⠀an⠀irreversible⠀choice,⠀stage⠀the⠀concrete⠀action⠀and⠀preserve⠀its⠀consequences.⠀A⠀familiar⠀prop⠀can⠀later⠀carry⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning,⠀but⠀no⠀character⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀falsify⠀a⠀record,⠀harm⠀a⠀relative,⠀or⠀reject⠀a⠀workable⠀alternative⠀to⠀satisfy⠀the⠀recipe.\n\nRender⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation.⠀It⠀may⠀hold⠀feeling⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀reasoning,⠀positioned⠀where⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀unfolding⠀action.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀remains⠀a⠀separately⠀chosen⠀dramatic⠀act⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀substitute⠀for⠀unspoken⠀experience.\n\nEntrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀pauses⠀should⠀follow⠀real⠀stage⠀business⠀and⠀character⠀purpose.⠀A⠀pause⠀may⠀hold⠀reading,⠀hesitation,⠀ease,⠀or⠀unresolved⠀attention.⠀When⠀the⠀tragedy⠀has⠀reached⠀aftermath,⠀let⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀continue⠀around⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀The⠀current⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀an⠀exchange⠀or⠀movement;⠀a⠀symbolic⠀exit,⠀final⠀confession,⠀or⠀fixed⠀tableau⠀is⠀optional.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqazay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀through⠀an⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀narrative⠀person.⠀Braid⠀immediate⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀private⠀words,⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀language⠀of⠀the⠀rules⠀or⠀commitments⠀this⠀person⠀actually⠀encounters.⠀Let⠀incompatible⠀concerns⠀coexist⠀in⠀the⠀associative⠀movement⠀instead⠀of⠀summarizing⠀them⠀as⠀a⠀debate.⠀The⠀profile⠀supplies⠀no⠀occupation,⠀country,⠀child,⠀medical⠀condition,⠀or⠀prescribed⠀family⠀dispute.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀irreverence⠀from⠀within.⠀A⠀thought⠀may⠀question⠀a⠀rule's⠀wording,⠀remember⠀who⠀explained⠀it,⠀test⠀whether⠀a⠀justification⠀covers⠀the⠀actual⠀situation,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀need⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀answer⠀matter.⠀The⠀question⠀can⠀uncover⠀a⠀contradiction,⠀confirm⠀a⠀rule's⠀purpose,⠀or⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀evidence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀mind's⠀own⠀habits⠀and⠀emotional⠀range;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀an⠀institutional⠀skeptic⠀on⠀every⠀subject.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀follow⠀association⠀where⠀it⠀helps.⠀A⠀long⠀sentence⠀can⠀hold⠀a⠀remembered⠀argument;⠀a⠀short⠀fragment⠀can⠀register⠀a⠀bodily⠀interruption⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀returning⠀to⠀attention.⠀Preserve⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀an⠀event⠀from⠀a⠀recollection,⠀fear,⠀or⠀imagined⠀alternative.⠀Other⠀people⠀enter⠀this⠀focal⠀stream⠀through⠀perceivable⠀conduct,⠀remembered⠀words,⠀or⠀attributed⠀reports.⠀If⠀another⠀fo