e⠀focal⠀character⠀notice⠀one⠀sharply⠀perceived⠀sensory⠀detail⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀near-admission:⠀a⠀hand⠀not⠀quite⠀touching⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down⠀too⠀carefully,⠀a⠀breath⠀held⠀a⠀moment⠀too⠀long.⠀The⠀detail⠀carries⠀the⠀emotional⠀pressure⠀without⠀naming⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀withheld⠀need⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀selects⠀to⠀notice⠀instead⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀say.\n\nLet⠀the⠀conversation⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀strain⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀almost⠀admits⠀something,⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀turn⠀to⠀the⠀chosen⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀full⠀confession;⠀the⠀omission⠀is⠀the⠀emotional⠀event.⠀A⠀partial⠀comfort⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀an⠀ordinary⠀gesture—a⠀coat⠀handed⠀over,⠀a⠀door⠀held⠀open—and⠀it⠀should⠀remain⠀awkward⠀or⠀incomplete,⠀sincere⠀without⠀repairing⠀the⠀larger⠀loss.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀chosen⠀detail⠀after⠀a⠀consequence⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀witnessed.⠀The⠀same⠀cup,⠀sleeve,⠀or⠀breath⠀should⠀now⠀mean⠀something⠀different⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀lost⠀or⠀refused.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀moment;⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀Keep⠀the⠀tragedy⠀legible:⠀the⠀character⠀should⠀have⠀an⠀intelligible⠀alternative,⠀even⠀if⠀they⠀cannot⠀take⠀it,⠀and⠀their⠀failure⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀genuine⠀choice⠀rather⠀than⠀confusion.⠀Write⠀the⠀interior⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀form,⠀showing⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀feels⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀say,⠀while⠀other⠀characters⠀remain⠀outside⠀that⠀knowledge.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀short,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀paragraphs.⠀In⠀each⠀beat,⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notice⠀one⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀image⠀that⠀marks⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀the⠀presence⠀of⠀an⠀alternative:⠀the⠀light⠀on⠀a⠀doorway⠀someone⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀leave,⠀a⠀cup⠀left⠀halfway⠀because⠀a⠀decision⠀interrupted⠀the⠀gesture,⠀a⠀sleeve⠀pulled⠀back⠀from⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀be⠀finished.⠀The⠀image⠀carries⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀without⠀added⠀explanation,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀the⠀tragic⠀pressure⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀selects⠀to⠀notice.\n\nAttribute⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably⠀and⠀keep⠀ongoing⠀NPC⠀behavior⠀active.⠀An⠀NPC⠀should⠀continue⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀life⠀even⠀while⠀tragedy⠀moves⠀through⠀the⠀scene;⠀their⠀calm⠀movement—folding⠀a⠀cloth,⠀setting⠀down⠀a⠀dish,⠀stepping⠀past⠀the⠀focal⠀character—can⠀deepen⠀the⠀loss⠀rather⠀than⠀pause⠀the⠀story.⠀The⠀tragic⠀arc⠀should⠀remain⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀choices⠀and⠀tensions⠀the⠀scene⠀makes⠀visible:⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept,⠀a⠀recognition⠀that⠀arrives⠀too⠀late,⠀an⠀alternative⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀see⠀but⠀refuse.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀reply⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀has⠀registered⠀a⠀consequence⠀without⠀completing⠀a⠀response⠀to⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀an⠀unfinished⠀gesture,⠀a⠀half-formed⠀thought,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀follows⠀a⠀difficult⠀line.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀decision;⠀the⠀continuation⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀occurred.⠀Render⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀form,⠀showing⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀feels⠀through⠀small⠀hesitations,⠀sensory⠀attention,⠀and⠀incomplete⠀sentences⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀full⠀explanation.⠀Keep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀voice⠀distinct,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀unresolved⠀hurt⠀remain⠀present⠀without⠀every⠀line⠀becoming⠀a⠀confession.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route:⠀a⠀closely⠀observed⠀household,⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀small⠀social⠀circle⠀where⠀ordinary⠀daily⠀life⠀carries⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀irreversible⠀commitments.⠀In⠀each⠀scene,⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notice⠀one⠀domestic⠀object⠀or⠀gesture⠀that⠀marks⠀the⠀conflict⠀between⠀a⠀private⠀need⠀and⠀a⠀social⠀obligation:⠀a⠀closed⠀door⠀that⠀separates⠀a⠀duty⠀from⠀a⠀desire,⠀a⠀bowl⠀left⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀will⠀not⠀return,⠀a⠀letter⠀folded⠀and⠀refolded⠀because⠀it⠀cannot⠀be⠀sent.⠀The⠀object⠀carries⠀the⠀tragic⠀pressure⠀without⠀melodramatic⠀explanation,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀obligation⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀selects⠀to⠀notice.\n\nLet⠀the⠀local⠀social⠀context⠀make⠀the⠀fall⠀intelligible.⠀Family⠀duty,⠀reputation,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀obligation⠀should⠀conflict⠀with⠀a⠀private⠀need,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀should⠀see⠀their⠀alternatives⠀even⠀as⠀they⠀choose⠀badly.⠀A⠀neighbor's⠀gesture⠀or⠀a⠀household⠀rule⠀can⠀reveal⠀the⠀social⠀pressure⠀behind⠀the⠀choice⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀community⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀backdrop.⠀Write⠀in⠀the⠀language⠀and⠀register⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀selected⠀period⠀and⠀community;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀snow⠀or⠀silence⠀as⠀automatic⠀Kawabata⠀markers.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀closely⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀perceptions,⠀with⠀inner⠀experience⠀rendered⠀through⠀brief⠀impressions⠀and⠀omissions⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀full⠀summary.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀chosen⠀object⠀after⠀the⠀choice⠀has⠀been⠀made.⠀The⠀same⠀door,⠀bowl,⠀or⠀letter⠀should⠀now⠀mean⠀something⠀different⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀what⠀the⠀obligation⠀has⠀cost.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀already⠀seen,⠀and⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀End⠀the⠀passage⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀short,⠀high-contrast⠀paragraphs⠀where⠀each⠀beat⠀advances⠀the⠀fall⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀physical⠀detail⠀that⠀marks⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀the⠀presence⠀of⠀an⠀alternative:⠀worn⠀shoes⠀at⠀a⠀door⠀the⠀character⠀will⠀not⠀cross,⠀a⠀cracked⠀basin⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀they⠀are⠀leaving,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bag⠀someone⠀will⠀never⠀carry.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀prose⠀into⠀a⠀monotone.⠀Let⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀choose⠀only⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀per⠀transition,⠀so⠀the⠀material⠀wear⠀stands⠀for⠀the⠀larger⠀loss⠀rather⠀than⠀piling⠀up.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀stakes⠀legible.⠀A⠀job,⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀household,⠀or⠀a⠀duty⠀may⠀be⠀at⠀risk,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀should⠀understand⠀what⠀they⠀will⠀lose⠀even⠀as⠀they⠀press⠀forward.⠀Ground⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀the⠀specific⠀speaker⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀every⠀character⠀hard-bitten.⠀When⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀actually⠀needs⠀to⠀work⠀through⠀the⠀consequence⠀of⠀a⠀choice,⠀interrupt⠀the⠀compressed⠀rhythm⠀with⠀a⠀longer⠀thought;⠀the⠀thought⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀weighing⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀about⠀to⠀lose,⠀not⠀merely⠀narrating⠀the⠀loss.\n\nRecognition⠀should⠀arrive⠀through⠀an⠀observed⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀physical⠀detail:⠀the⠀worn⠀shoes⠀now⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀door,⠀the⠀cracked⠀basin⠀now⠀dry,⠀the⠀bag⠀now⠀gone.⠀The⠀object's⠀new⠀meaning⠀must⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀a⠀consequence⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀witnessed.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀irreparable⠀outcome.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀material⠀trace⠀of⠀loss,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀documents—letters,⠀notes,⠀a⠀household⠀account,⠀a⠀report—each⠀written⠀by⠀a⠀clear⠀author⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose⠀at⠀a⠀specific⠀time.⠀In⠀each⠀document,⠀let⠀the⠀writer⠀record⠀one⠀sensory⠀detail⠀that⠀they⠀select⠀because⠀it⠀marks⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀a⠀loss:⠀the⠀weather⠀on⠀the⠀day⠀a⠀decision⠀was⠀made,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀gate⠀after⠀someone⠀left,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀key⠀no⠀longer⠀needed.⠀The⠀detail⠀becomes⠀the⠀trace⠀of⠀the⠀larger⠀event,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀omits⠀must⠀be⠀legible⠀from⠀their⠀situation.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀each⠀record.⠀Let⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀documents⠀carry⠀the⠀irreversible⠀change:⠀an⠀unanswered⠀letter,⠀a⠀revised⠀account,⠀a⠀note⠀written⠀but⠀never⠀sent.⠀The⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀writer⠀does⠀not⠀understand.⠀Keep⠀each⠀document's⠀knowledge⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀knew⠀at⠀that⠀time;⠀a⠀later⠀record⠀may⠀recognize⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀could⠀only⠀guess.\n\nMake⠀the⠀tragic⠀alternative⠀visible⠀within⠀the⠀document⠀form.⠀It⠀should⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀writer⠀considered,⠀feared,⠀or⠀omitted:⠀a⠀sentence⠀begun⠀and⠀crossed⠀out,⠀a⠀plan⠀mentioned⠀only⠀to⠀be⠀dismissed,⠀a⠀fear⠀stated⠀and⠀then⠀denied.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀understand⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀might⠀have⠀chosen⠀even⠀though⠀the⠀documents⠀only⠀record⠀the⠀aftermath.⠀Use⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation.⠀A⠀practical⠀list⠀can⠀advance⠀the⠀plot⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀a⠀confession.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀corrected⠀detail⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀letter⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀crossed⠀out⠀in⠀a⠀journal.⠀End⠀the⠀sequence⠀where⠀the⠀latest⠀document's⠀composition⠀falls,⠀without⠀an⠀external⠀frame⠀unless⠀the⠀narrative⠀already⠀provides⠀one.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragic⠀interval⠀through⠀concrete⠀acts⠀of⠀care⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures,⠀selected⠀with⠀Kawabata's⠀attention⠀to⠀what⠀is⠀transient.⠀Each⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀should⠀be⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀impending⠀loss:⠀a⠀blanket⠀folded⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀cannot⠀stay,⠀a⠀familiar⠀meal⠀prepared⠀on⠀a⠀day⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀marked,⠀a⠀favorite⠀cup⠀noticed⠀because⠀it⠀will⠀not⠀be⠀used⠀again.⠀The⠀details⠀should⠀be⠀warm⠀and⠀specific⠀without⠀being⠀sentimental,⠀and⠀the⠀affection⠀should⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀ordinary⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀repair.\n\nMove⠀the⠀scene⠀between⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀awareness⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀already⠀passing.⠀The⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀or⠀loss⠀remains⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀background—an⠀empty⠀chair,⠀a⠀packed⠀bag,⠀a⠀date⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀passed—and⠀the⠀kindness⠀cannot⠀undo⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀enjoy⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀while⠀also⠀feeling⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀coming⠀loss;⠀the⠀two⠀experiences⠀should⠀coexist⠀rather⠀than⠀cancel⠀each⠀other.⠀Characters⠀may⠀disagree⠀or⠀remain⠀private⠀without⠀the⠀comfort⠀becoming⠀a⠀false⠀resolution.\n\nDo⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀with⠀a⠀domestic⠀vignette.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀quiet⠀interval⠀where⠀the⠀warmth⠀is⠀real⠀but⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀still⠀coming.⠀Use⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀sensory⠀images⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀comfort⠀itself⠀feel⠀passing,⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀already⠀being⠀remembered.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀the⠀care⠀they⠀are⠀giving⠀or⠀receiving:⠀the⠀same⠀gesture⠀now⠀seen⠀as⠀a⠀farewell⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀routine⠀kindness.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀in⠀sustained,⠀deliberate⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀scene⠀with⠀formal⠀control⠀and⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀loss⠀in⠀social⠀context.⠀In⠀each⠀paragraph,⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀social⠀observation⠀or⠀judgment—history,⠀reputation,⠀shared⠀custom,⠀a⠀public⠀expectation—to⠀a⠀single⠀sensory⠀image⠀that⠀concentrates⠀the⠀emotional⠀cost:⠀a⠀hand⠀pausing⠀over⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀door⠀closing⠀on⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀be⠀entered⠀again,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀in⠀a⠀formal⠀register.⠀The⠀image⠀carries⠀the⠀emotional⠀current⠀while⠀the⠀surrounding⠀prose⠀remains⠀composed⠀rather⠀than⠀exhaustive,⠀and⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀suggests⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀through⠀intelligible⠀choices.⠀The⠀character⠀should⠀see⠀an⠀alternative—a⠀duty⠀refused,⠀a⠀confession⠀withheld,⠀a⠀practical⠀path⠀not⠀taken—and⠀the⠀social⠀frame⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀alternative⠀present⠀even⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀chosen.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀distinguish⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀understanding⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀permits⠀them⠀to⠀say⠀or⠀do.⠀Speech⠀may⠀be⠀deliberate⠀without⠀being⠀uniformly⠀elaborate;⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀should⠀feel⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀an⠀imported⠀aristocratic⠀template.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀chosen⠀sensory⠀image⠀after⠀the⠀choice⠀has⠀been⠀made.⠀The⠀same⠀hand,⠀door,⠀or⠀name⠀should⠀now⠀mean⠀something⠀different⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀lost⠀or⠀refused.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀already⠀seen,⠀and⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀rather⠀than⠀resolving⠀it⠀too⠀quickly.⠀Use⠀the⠀formal⠀style's⠀transitions⠀to⠀slow⠀or⠀compress⠀time⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀requires,⠀but⠀avoid⠀turning⠀every⠀moment⠀into⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀set⠀piece.⠀Render⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀form,⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀focal⠀character⠀where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits,⠀while⠀keeping⠀the⠀narration⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nPlace⠀the⠀telling⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀occasion,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀storyteller's⠀purpose⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀teller⠀has⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀listener,⠀and⠀the⠀outer⠀situation⠀gives⠀the⠀telling⠀something⠀at⠀stake:⠀to⠀console,⠀accuse,⠀preserve,⠀delay,⠀warn,⠀entertain,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀request.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀a⠀live⠀scene.⠀Track⠀who⠀is⠀addressed,⠀what⠀remembered⠀phrases⠀and⠀handled⠀objects⠀pass⠀between⠀teller⠀and⠀listener,⠀and⠀where⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupts,⠀doubts,⠀or⠀supplies⠀a⠀detail.⠀An⠀embedded⠀tale⠀should⠀do⠀work⠀in⠀the⠀frame:⠀it⠀may⠀secure⠀cooperation,⠀shift⠀blame,⠀postpone⠀a⠀decision,⠀offer⠀a⠀precedent,⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀history⠀the⠀listener⠀must⠀interpret.\n\nDrive⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀rather⠀than⠀general⠀misfortune.⠀Let⠀love⠀press⠀against⠀duty,⠀pride⠀against⠀survival,⠀a⠀promise⠀against⠀a⠀later⠀truth,⠀or⠀loyalty⠀against⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀speak.⠀Make⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀intelligible;⠀the⠀people⠀can⠀see⠀some⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀choosing⠀and⠀remain⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention⠀as⠀they⠀close⠀off⠀possibilities.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀every⠀scene⠀as⠀punishment,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀drain⠀warmth,⠀ordinary⠀competence,⠀or⠀pleasure⠀from⠀the⠀story⠀before⠀the⠀loss.⠀When⠀recognition⠀comes,⠀let⠀it⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀repeated,⠀omitted,⠀misread,⠀or⠀only⠀now⠀connects.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀and⠀what⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀restored.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀may⠀include⠀practical⠀help,⠀continued⠀attachment,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀continuance,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀irreparable⠀thing.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀sensory⠀attention⠀as⠀an⠀organizing⠀pressure.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀impressions—a⠀sound,⠀texture,⠀temperature,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀interval—and⠀let⠀their⠀relation⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀notice⠀what⠀is⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep:⠀a⠀quality⠀of⠀light⠀on⠀a⠀face,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀kept⠀object,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name.⠀Withhold⠀summary⠀emotion⠀where⠀the⠀detail⠀can⠀do⠀the⠀work,⠀but⠀keep⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀available⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀calls⠀for⠀it,⠀in⠀its⠀authorized⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀form.⠀Compression⠀must⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀emotionally⠀identical⠀or⠀replace⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀with⠀the⠀tale⠀alone.⠀Adapt⠀this⠀selectivity⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀world⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀snow,⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀Japanese⠀setting.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀share⠀recurring⠀material—a⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀gesture,⠀route,⠀or⠀time⠀of⠀day.⠀On⠀each⠀return,⠀the⠀repetition⠀should⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀teller's⠀emphasis,⠀the⠀listener's⠀understanding,⠀or⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀shifts.⠀Not⠀every⠀recurrence⠀needs⠀to⠀appear⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty;⠀some⠀can⠀fade⠀and⠀return⠀with⠀altered⠀weight.⠀A⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀should⠀be⠀meaningful⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀trick:⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀know,⠀could⠀not⠀say,⠀or⠀only⠀now⠀recognizes⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀loss.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀intelligible,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀listener's⠀response⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀means⠀without⠀undoing⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀happened.\n\nDraw⠀on⠀the⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀as⠀a⠀craft⠀source⠀for⠀nested⠀telling,⠀recurrence,⠀and⠀delayed⠀revelation,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀instruction⠀to⠀add⠀djinn,⠀palaces,⠀deserts,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀religion⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀includes⠀them.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀person,⠀role,⠀knowledge⠀limits,⠀and⠀world⠀facts;⠀a⠀participant⠀account⠀must⠀fit⠀who⠀owns⠀it,⠀and⠀a⠀composed⠀document⠀or⠀performed⠀aside⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀teller's⠀live⠀private⠀mind.⠀Where⠀the⠀scene⠀reaches⠀its⠀natural⠀boundary,⠀stop⠀there—during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀composition,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup—without⠀requiring⠀a⠀settled⠀outcome⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀tragedy⠀as⠀contemporary⠀intimate⠀prose⠀from⠀the⠀German-language⠀tradition:⠀narration⠀held⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention,⠀socially⠀situated⠀in⠀the⠀ordinary⠀texture⠀that⠀gives⠀a⠀choice⠀its⠀weight⠀—⠀work,⠀household,⠀small⠀institutions,⠀the⠀claims⠀other⠀people⠀have⠀on⠀the⠀character⠀—⠀without⠀bureaucratic⠀severity,⠀invented⠀national⠀speech,⠀or⠀the⠀mannerisms⠀of⠀translated⠀word⠀order.⠀This⠀closeness⠀works⠀in⠀whatever⠀person⠀and⠀narrator⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀already⠀establishes.⠀If⠀that⠀world⠀genuinely⠀holds⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀language,⠀let⠀the⠀difference⠀become⠀tragic⠀material:⠀a⠀thing⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀in⠀one⠀language⠀and⠀only⠀evaded⠀in⠀the⠀other.⠀If⠀it⠀does⠀not,⠀keep⠀the⠀intimacy⠀and⠀add⠀no⠀languages⠀the⠀world⠀lacks.\n\nLet⠀the⠀fall⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀irreversible⠀commitment:⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀refusal⠀that⠀closes⠀off⠀another⠀good⠀the⠀character⠀also⠀has⠀reasons⠀to⠀want.⠀Make⠀both⠀sides⠀intelligible⠀from⠀inside;⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀may⠀be⠀stated⠀plainly⠀by⠀others⠀and⠀still⠀go⠀unheeded.⠀Tragic⠀pressure⠀accumulates⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀commitment⠀costs,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀punishments.\n\nDiscipline⠀the⠀narration⠀with⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity.⠀Fix⠀early⠀on⠀three⠀or⠀four⠀recurring⠀physical⠀impressions⠀—⠀a⠀particular⠀gesture,⠀the⠀light⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀room⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀hour,⠀an⠀object⠀handled⠀often⠀or⠀conspicuously⠀never⠀touched.⠀Space⠀their⠀returns;⠀not⠀every⠀difficulty⠀needs⠀one.⠀When⠀an⠀impression⠀returns,⠀change⠀one⠀thing⠀about⠀it⠀—⠀the⠀hour,⠀the⠀hand,⠀who⠀else⠀is⠀present⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀altered⠀detail⠀shows⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost⠀or⠀refused⠀before⠀anyone⠀names⠀it.⠀Let⠀intervals⠀carry⠀cost:⠀pass⠀over⠀an⠀event⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀reconstruct⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀surfaces⠀just⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀it.⠀Keep⠀syntax⠀responsive⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀state⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀pattern:⠀under⠀pressure,⠀short⠀paratactic⠀units⠀that⠀name⠀objects⠀and⠀actions;⠀in⠀intervals,⠀longer⠀subordinate⠀clauses⠀that⠀gather⠀and⠀qualify⠀reflection.\n\nKeep⠀omission⠀on⠀the⠀social⠀surface,⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀narration's⠀permitted⠀access.⠀What⠀people⠀say⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀may⠀fall⠀short⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀—⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀ends⠀early,⠀an⠀endearment⠀used⠀instead⠀of⠀an⠀admission⠀—⠀while⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀still⠀carries⠀the⠀actual⠀confusion,⠀desire,⠀resentment,⠀calculation,⠀or⠀love.⠀A⠀private⠀interval⠀needs⠀no⠀task⠀or⠀decision⠀to⠀justify⠀its⠀place.\n\nRecognition⠀may⠀come⠀early⠀or⠀late,⠀suddenly⠀or⠀gradually,⠀spoken⠀or⠀held⠀inward;⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀without⠀reversing⠀it.⠀After⠀the⠀irreversible⠀event,⠀warmth,⠀intelligence,⠀and⠀mutual⠀care⠀stay⠀visible;⠀the⠀cast⠀does⠀not⠀turn⠀foolish,⠀and⠀tenderness⠀is⠀not⠀stripped⠀away⠀on⠀the⠀way⠀to⠀the⠀end.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀stops⠀—⠀mid-speech,⠀mid-motion,⠀or⠀mid-thought⠀is⠀permitted⠀—⠀and⠀preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀output⠀contracts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀toward⠀an⠀irreversible⠀commitment⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept⠀alongside⠀another.⠀Establish⠀the⠀competing⠀claims⠀early⠀through⠀concrete⠀obligations:⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀care,⠀a⠀post,⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀inherited⠀authority⠀whose⠀terms⠀are⠀still⠀being⠀enforced⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀Let⠀every⠀person⠀involved⠀remain⠀intelligent;⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀chosen⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀choice⠀still⠀feels⠀unavoidable.⠀The⠀fall⠀may⠀come⠀through⠀love,⠀duty,⠀pride,⠀mistaken⠀belief,⠀or⠀an⠀established⠀fate,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀pressure⠀among⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀punishment⠀imposed⠀from⠀outside.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀close⠀to⠀surfaces⠀and⠀intervals.⠀Choose⠀a⠀few⠀physical⠀impressions—weather⠀on⠀metal,⠀a⠀light⠀left⠀on⠀in⠀an⠀office,⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀hand,⠀a⠀smell⠀in⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀lift,⠀a⠀worn⠀threshold—and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀emotional⠀weight⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.⠀Omit⠀declarations⠀where⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀can⠀do⠀the⠀work.⠀Attend⠀to⠀what⠀is⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep:⠀a⠀trust,⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀a⠀version⠀of⠀someone,⠀a⠀shared⠀ritual,⠀a⠀body's⠀ease.⠀Compress⠀attention⠀around⠀the⠀moments⠀when⠀recognition⠀is⠀possible.⠀The⠀selectivity⠀should⠀fit⠀the⠀actual⠀place⠀and⠀people;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀snow,⠀silence,⠀a⠀Japanese⠀setting,⠀or⠀continuous⠀sadness.\n\nLet⠀old⠀authority⠀collide⠀with⠀present⠀life.⠀Show⠀inherited⠀power⠀as⠀an⠀ongoing⠀arrangement—who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀repairs⠀the⠀damage,⠀who⠀is⠀protected⠀by⠀an⠀old⠀name,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀modern⠀decay.⠀Keep⠀the⠀urban⠀material⠀world⠀specific:⠀rented⠀rooms,⠀transit,⠀cheap⠀food,⠀surveillance,⠀mold,⠀neon,⠀broken⠀pavement,⠀institutional⠀corridors,⠀the⠀private⠀cost⠀of⠀public⠀systems.⠀Let⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀unfold⠀through⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀social⠀masks⠀that⠀can⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company.⠀Atmosphere⠀should⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced,⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀rules⠀or⠀named⠀factions.⠀A⠀warm⠀room⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀place⠀of⠀real⠀tenderness⠀and⠀still⠀carry⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀an⠀unequal⠀world;⠀a⠀trusted⠀conversation⠀can⠀reveal⠀both⠀need⠀and⠀complicity.\n\nTragedy⠀turns⠀on⠀recognition.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀come⠀to⠀see⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀done⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀prevent,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀seeing⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.⠀Recognition⠀need⠀not⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀speech;⠀it⠀can⠀come⠀through⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀suddenly⠀connects,⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀fails,⠀or⠀a⠀truth⠀another⠀person⠀has⠀been⠀carrying.⠀Afterward,⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀Do⠀not⠀erase⠀all⠀warmth⠀before⠀the⠀end⠀or⠀make⠀every⠀scene⠀a⠀punishment.⠀Let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀hold⠀the⠀altered⠀relation,⠀the⠀practical⠀consequences,⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀absence.⠀Render⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀and⠀inference,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀performed⠀aside.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀perspective's⠀attention⠀stops,⠀even⠀if⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀composition,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀is⠀still⠀in⠀motion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀modern⠀Indian⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀with⠀lyric⠀inwardness.⠀Keep⠀the⠀story's⠀language,⠀region,⠀neighborhood,⠀work,⠀household⠀arrangements,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀where⠀the⠀material⠀supplies⠀them;⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀them⠀with⠀a⠀generic⠀family,⠀religious⠀marker,⠀caste⠀signature,⠀or⠀English/code-switching⠀that⠀the⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀already⠀contain.⠀Let⠀social⠀conditions⠀and⠀intimate⠀commitments⠀press⠀on⠀one⠀concrete⠀choice:⠀care⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀against⠀obligation⠀to⠀another,⠀a⠀debt⠀or⠀promise⠀against⠀love,⠀a⠀public⠀role⠀against⠀private⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀a⠀truth⠀that⠀would⠀protect⠀someone⠀against⠀a⠀truth⠀that⠀would⠀free⠀someone⠀else.⠀Make⠀warnings⠀and⠀alternatives⠀intelligible.⠀Characters⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀decision⠀and⠀still⠀make⠀it;⠀they⠀can⠀remain⠀intelligent,⠀warm,⠀and⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention⠀as⠀their⠀choices⠀turn⠀destructive.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀sensory⠀attention⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀story⠀near⠀concrete⠀objects⠀and⠀passing⠀moments.⠀Choose⠀a⠀few⠀physical⠀impressions—a⠀sound⠀from⠀another⠀room,⠀a⠀quality⠀of⠀light,⠀a⠀route⠀taken⠀daily,⠀a⠀garment,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀ledger,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀gesture—and⠀let⠀them⠀return⠀under⠀changed⠀pressure.⠀The⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀can⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀snow,⠀silence,⠀a⠀Japanese⠀setting,⠀or⠀uninterrupted⠀sadness.⠀Work⠀with⠀the⠀materials⠀the⠀story's⠀place⠀actually⠀provides;⠀if⠀language,⠀community,⠀or⠀period⠀are⠀supplied,⠀keep⠀them⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀ornamental.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀inside⠀ordinary⠀time⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀punishments.⠀Let⠀the⠀irreversible⠀choice⠀emerge⠀from⠀incompatible⠀commitments⠀and⠀accumulated⠀practical⠀consequence—small⠀accommodations,⠀avoided⠀conversations,⠀practical⠀decisions⠀that⠀each⠀seem⠀survivable.⠀Recognition⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀speech⠀or⠀a⠀verdict;⠀it⠀can⠀come⠀through⠀a⠀changed⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀withheld⠀fact⠀made⠀legible,⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀shared,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀detail⠀whose⠀meaning⠀has⠀shifted.⠀Recognition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.⠀In⠀the⠀aftermath,⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored—an⠀empty⠀place⠀at⠀a⠀routine,⠀a⠀responsibility⠀assumed,⠀a⠀habit⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀fits—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀erasing⠀all⠀warmth.\n\nEmotional⠀omission⠀should⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀erase⠀private⠀experience.⠀Render⠀focal⠀interiority⠀directly:⠀inner⠀speech,⠀sensory⠀memory,⠀hesitation,⠀physical⠀unease,⠀the⠀thought⠀that⠀goes⠀unsaid.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀keeps⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀place⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀established⠀interiority⠀form⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀dialogue,⠀an⠀unsent⠀letter,⠀or⠀a⠀performed⠀aside.⠀Keep⠀access⠀and⠀knowledge⠀separate:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀motive⠀that⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know.⠀Use⠀the⠀perspective⠀the⠀story⠀establishes;⠀do⠀not⠀switch⠀person⠀or⠀access⠀for⠀convenience.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Indian⠀literary⠀mode's⠀inwardness⠀work⠀as⠀a⠀counterpressure⠀to⠀compression.⠀Organize⠀attention⠀around⠀domestic⠀and⠀social⠀time—work,⠀obligation,⠀memory,⠀neighborhood,⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀expectation—while⠀allowing⠀lyric⠀reflection⠀to⠀open⠀from⠀a⠀physical⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀explanation.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀uses⠀an⠀oral,⠀testimonial,⠀or⠀epistolary⠀form,⠀let⠀that⠀form⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀element⠀inside⠀the⠀domestic-social⠀realism;⠀do⠀not⠀switch⠀to⠀a⠀generic⠀frame-tale⠀or⠀epic⠀register,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀document⠀substitute⠀for⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀experience.\n\nLet⠀the⠀response⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀actual⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀scene:⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀arrangement.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀business⠀or⠀pursuit⠀to⠀pause,⠀resume,⠀change⠀direction,⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀result⠀before⠀stopping.⠀Prose⠀length⠀does⠀not⠀determine⠀fictional⠀elapsed⠀time;⠀attention,⠀waiting,⠀and⠀events⠀keep⠀their⠀real⠀duration.⠀A⠀private⠀interval⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀an⠀external⠀task⠀or⠀practical⠀decision⠀to⠀justify⠀its⠀place.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀psychological⠀realism⠀with⠀a⠀reflective⠀register:⠀the⠀narration⠀selects⠀as⠀one⠀attending⠀consciousness⠀selects,⠀and⠀its⠀diction⠀and⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀narrator⠀your⠀story⠀already⠀has.⠀A⠀retrospective⠀first⠀person⠀may⠀let⠀later⠀knowledge⠀shade⠀which⠀details⠀are⠀recorded;⠀a⠀close⠀third⠀stays⠀strictly⠀within⠀the⠀focal⠀consciousness.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀diary⠀voice,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀relocate⠀anyone⠀to⠀a⠀Japanese⠀setting.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀fall⠀from⠀brief⠀surfaces⠀and⠀intervals.⠀In⠀a⠀scene,⠀choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀impressions⠀—⠀an⠀object⠀handled,⠀light⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀hour,⠀a⠀seasonal⠀turn⠀the⠀setting⠀actually⠀offers⠀—⠀and⠀give⠀them⠀full,⠀quiet⠀attention⠀while⠀the⠀larger⠀matter⠀passes⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀frame.⠀Let⠀intervals⠀between⠀scenes⠀carry⠀irreversible⠀weight.⠀A⠀choice⠀can⠀be⠀made⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀and⠀meet⠀the⠀reader⠀as⠀accomplished⠀fact⠀if⠀its⠀grounds⠀were⠀placed⠀earlier⠀in⠀concrete⠀detail:⠀an⠀alternative⠀declined⠀with⠀a⠀glance⠀elsewhere,⠀a⠀duty⠀named⠀in⠀passing,⠀a⠀warning⠀spoken⠀over⠀ordinary⠀business.⠀Intelligibility⠀comes⠀from⠀those⠀placements,⠀not⠀from⠀later⠀explanation,⠀so⠀a⠀character⠀remains⠀intelligent⠀and⠀worth⠀attention⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀choice⠀closes.\n\nWarmth⠀and⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remain⠀available⠀before⠀and⠀during⠀the⠀loss.⠀Transience⠀is⠀what⠀makes⠀a⠀valued⠀moment⠀matter,⠀and⠀the⠀arc⠀need⠀not⠀darken⠀every⠀exchange.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀move⠀on⠀small⠀practical⠀things⠀while⠀the⠀decisive⠀matter⠀goes⠀unspoken,⠀but⠀omission⠀is⠀a⠀method⠀of⠀narration,⠀not⠀a⠀law⠀of⠀conduct:⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀would⠀name⠀love⠀or⠀grief⠀plainly⠀should⠀name⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀actual⠀on⠀the⠀page⠀under⠀the⠀compression⠀—⠀sensation,⠀hesitation,⠀associative⠀memory,⠀the⠀thought⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀be⠀said⠀aloud⠀—⠀brief⠀and⠀concrete⠀rather⠀than⠀summarized⠀into⠀mood.⠀Let⠀recognition⠀arrive⠀through⠀recurrence:⠀after⠀the⠀truth⠀is⠀known,⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀detail⠀recorded⠀earlier⠀without⠀comment⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀changed⠀weight⠀do⠀the⠀recognizing.⠀In⠀the⠀aftermath,⠀hold⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀in⠀one⠀chosen⠀thing⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀commentary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWork⠀in⠀the⠀Latin⠀American⠀mode⠀of⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀realism:⠀stay⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀or⠀a⠀few⠀minds,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀concrete⠀social⠀world—work,⠀family,⠀distance,⠀money,⠀history,⠀the⠀obligations⠀that⠀bind⠀people—press⠀on⠀them⠀as⠀lived⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀panoramic⠀survey⠀or⠀explained⠀custom.⠀Use⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀period,⠀and⠀setting⠀already⠀established.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀marvelous⠀or⠀supernatural⠀fact⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀it.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀incompatible⠀commitments.⠀Give⠀the⠀central⠀character⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀genuine⠀loyalty,⠀need,⠀or⠀promise,⠀and⠀show⠀through⠀specific⠀scenes⠀why⠀each⠀matters⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀available⠀alternatives⠀are⠀intelligible.⠀Let⠀other⠀people⠀warn,⠀help,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀disappoint⠀without⠀becoming⠀fools⠀or⠀mere⠀instruments⠀of⠀punishment;⠀they⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀intelligence⠀and⠀worth.⠀The⠀fall⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀accumulated⠀pressure,⠀limited⠀knowledge,⠀love,⠀duty,⠀pride,⠀or⠀a⠀mistake⠀that⠀is⠀credible⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀character's⠀situation—not⠀from⠀enforced⠀stupidity⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀villain.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀scene⠀a⠀punishment⠀or⠀erase⠀warmth,⠀competence,⠀and⠀attachment⠀before⠀the⠀loss.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀in⠀the⠀close⠀psychological⠀frame.⠀Notice⠀a⠀few⠀physical⠀impressions—a⠀texture,⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀light,⠀an⠀object⠀handled⠀until⠀its⠀meaning⠀shifts—and⠀let⠀their⠀relation⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀attend⠀to⠀something⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep.⠀A⠀recurring⠀image⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀changed⠀weight,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀appear⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀snow,⠀silence,⠀a⠀Japanese⠀setting,⠀or⠀uninterrupted⠀sadness;⠀compression⠀must⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀one⠀emotional⠀register⠀or⠀replace⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀with⠀withheld⠀explanation.\n\nTreat⠀recognition⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.⠀It⠀may⠀come⠀quietly,⠀through⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail⠀that⠀now⠀fits⠀differently⠀or⠀a⠀fact⠀that⠀reorders⠀earlier⠀moments.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀later⠀realization⠀as⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀understand⠀something⠀that⠀cannot⠀restore⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀preserve⠀absence:⠀show⠀what⠀continues,⠀what⠀is⠀missing,⠀and⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀repaired.⠀Some⠀consequences⠀may⠀remain⠀unsettled.\n\nHonor⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀perspective.⠀Private⠀nonspoken⠀experience—uncertainty,⠀reasoning,⠀sensation,⠀the⠀thought⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀speech—belongs⠀in⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀actual⠀interiority,⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀A⠀letter,⠀diary,⠀monologue,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀does⠀not⠀substitute⠀for⠀that⠀live⠀private⠀experience.⠀Let⠀thought⠀and⠀speech⠀differ⠀only⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀ratio⠀between⠀them.\n\nAdvance⠀through⠀specific⠀scenes⠀and⠀intervals⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀required⠀sequence⠀of⠀warning,⠀fall,⠀and⠀resolution.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀composition,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup;⠀the⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀pause,⠀resume,⠀change⠀direction,⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀result⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀Prose⠀length⠀does⠀not⠀determine⠀elapsed⠀time;⠀honor⠀the⠀actual⠀duration⠀of⠀attention,⠀waiting,⠀and⠀events.⠀Leave⠀the⠀reader⠀with⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀passed⠀and⠀what⠀remains,⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀moral⠀or⠀false⠀restoration.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nStage⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀clean,⠀fast-readable⠀scenes.⠀Enter⠀each⠀scene⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀something⠀is⠀already⠀in⠀motion:⠀a⠀person⠀arriving,⠀a⠀hand⠀already⠀extended,⠀a⠀question⠀already⠀asked,⠀a⠀threshold⠀already⠀crossed.⠀Make⠀the⠀physical⠀situation⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀-⠀who⠀is⠀where,⠀what⠀object⠀or⠀obligation⠀sits⠀between⠀them,⠀which⠀exits⠀and⠀offers⠀remain⠀visible⠀-⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀beat⠀change⠀that⠀arrangement.⠀Keep⠀paragraphs⠀short⠀enough⠀that⠀action,⠀speech,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀do⠀not⠀blur⠀together,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀chop⠀every⠀moment⠀into⠀identical⠀fragments.\n\nHandle⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀sequence⠀of⠀consequential⠀choices⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀mood.⠀Let⠀each⠀commitment⠀narrow⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀kept:⠀the⠀warning⠀is⠀intelligible,⠀the⠀alternative⠀is⠀present,⠀and⠀the⠀destructive⠀choice⠀comes⠀from⠀someone⠀who⠀can⠀name⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀-⠀love,⠀duty,⠀pride,⠀fear,⠀or⠀a⠀fate⠀already⠀set⠀moving.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀cast⠀foolish⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀fall⠀inevitable,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀withdraw⠀all⠀warmth⠀before⠀the⠀end.⠀A⠀meal,⠀a⠀joke,⠀a⠀small⠀kindness⠀can⠀remain⠀inside⠀a⠀scene⠀while⠀the⠀larger⠀obligation⠀tightens.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀for⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀explain.⠀Choose⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀physical⠀impressions⠀from⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀materials⠀-⠀a⠀cup's⠀heat,⠀a⠀sleeve's⠀weight,⠀a⠀train⠀announcement,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀not⠀closed⠀-⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀return⠀at⠀the⠀turns.⠀The⠀chain⠀of⠀events⠀stays⠀fully⠀legible;⠀the⠀emotional⠀connections⠀among⠀the⠀selected⠀details⠀may⠀remain⠀unspoken.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀notice⠀something⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀noticing⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀turning⠀into⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀everything⠀means.\n\nAfter⠀dialogue,⠀give⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀a⠀reaction⠀beat⠀of⠀its⠀own.⠀Let⠀it⠀hold⠀the⠀small⠀perception⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀large⠀grief:⠀where⠀the⠀eye⠀stays⠀after⠀the⠀words⠀end,⠀the⠀object⠀set⠀down⠀and⠀not⠀picked⠀up,⠀a⠀sound⠀continuing⠀after⠀speech⠀stops.⠀Let⠀a⠀reaction⠀be⠀whatever⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀owner⠀-⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀briefly⠀funny⠀-⠀without⠀forcing⠀every⠀beat⠀toward⠀grief.⠀Render⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀when⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀allows⠀it⠀-⠀attention,⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀half-formed⠀recognition,⠀the⠀sentence⠀almost⠀said⠀-⠀without⠀forcing⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀name⠀the⠀feeling⠀or⠀interpret⠀the⠀whole⠀arc.⠀A⠀letter,⠀monologue,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀that⠀live⠀private⠀experience.⠀Other⠀characters⠀remain⠀unaware⠀of⠀this⠀private⠀experience⠀unless⠀the⠀established⠀access⠀permits⠀otherwise.\n\nWhen⠀recognition⠀comes,⠀route⠀it⠀through⠀recurrence.⠀A⠀detail⠀established⠀earlier⠀is⠀seen⠀again⠀and⠀now⠀holds⠀what⠀the⠀choice⠀meant,⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀noticing⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀explanation.⠀In⠀aftermath,⠀keep⠀the⠀physical⠀trace⠀of⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored⠀in⠀view⠀without⠀imposing⠀consolation⠀or⠀verdict.⠀Use⠀scene⠀breaks⠀for⠀passing⠀time⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀needs⠀them;⠀you⠀need⠀not⠀narrate⠀every⠀day⠀between.⠀Introduce⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀plainly⠀at⠀first⠀use,⠀keep⠀dialogue⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀cast,⠀and⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls⠀-⠀mid-motion,⠀mid-listening,⠀mid-thought⠀-⠀without⠀adding⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀forcing⠀a⠀final⠀curtain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nCompose⠀the⠀fall⠀through⠀the⠀gradual⠀accumulation⠀of⠀sensory⠀details⠀that⠀become⠀charged⠀with⠀what⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀kept.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀precise⠀images⠀per⠀scene—an⠀object,⠀a⠀quality⠀of⠀light,⠀a⠀repeated⠀sound—and⠀let⠀them⠀return⠀in⠀altered⠀form⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀choices⠀narrow.⠀Rhythm⠀should⠀shift⠀as⠀consequence⠀approaches:⠀longer,⠀associative⠀sentences⠀when⠀possibility⠀still⠀seems⠀open;⠀shorter,⠀more⠀separated⠀clauses⠀once⠀a⠀decision⠀has⠀been⠀made⠀or⠀a⠀loss⠀has⠀entered⠀the⠀body.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀turn.⠀Let⠀the⠀alteration⠀of⠀an⠀image⠀register⠀it:⠀the⠀cup⠀still⠀warm⠀where⠀a⠀hand⠀had⠀been,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open⠀without⠀intent,⠀a⠀familiar⠀corridor⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀too⠀long.\n\nLet⠀recognition⠀unfold⠀through⠀perception⠀rather⠀than⠀explanation.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀understands⠀something⠀irrevocable,⠀give⠀that⠀understanding⠀a⠀sensory⠀anchor⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀meaning.⠀A⠀comparison⠀should⠀be⠀used⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀see⠀or⠀admit:⠀the⠀beloved's⠀face⠀like⠀a⠀closed⠀window,⠀the⠀train's⠀departure⠀like⠀a⠀word⠀spoken⠀too⠀late,⠀the⠀unread⠀letter⠀like⠀a⠀live⠀coal⠀in⠀the⠀drawer.⠀Keep⠀every⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀memory.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀lyric⠀current⠀to⠀create⠀the⠀pressure⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀inevitable⠀feel⠀sudden⠀and⠀particular:⠀\"She⠀had⠀already⠀left,\"⠀\"The⠀house⠀was⠀sold,\"⠀\"He⠀did⠀not⠀turn⠀back.\"\n\nUse⠀omission⠀as⠀Kawabata⠀does,⠀but⠀tie⠀it⠀to⠀tragedy's⠀causal⠀chain.⠀Do⠀not⠀withhold⠀the⠀fact⠀of⠀the⠀choice;⠀withhold⠀the⠀emotional⠀explanation⠀until⠀the⠀consequence⠀has⠀made⠀it⠀unavoidable.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀observe⠀the⠀fine⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀knife,⠀the⠀gray⠀seam⠀of⠀a⠀departing⠀boat,⠀the⠀scent⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀packed⠀earth,⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀saying⠀what⠀those⠀details⠀mean.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀story⠀earns⠀its⠀tragedy:⠀continue⠀the⠀sensory⠀pattern⠀after⠀the⠀loss,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀absent⠀thing⠀remains⠀present⠀through⠀the⠀images⠀that⠀survive⠀it.⠀A⠀lyric⠀ending⠀may⠀hold⠀one⠀final⠀image—an⠀empty⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀lamp⠀burning⠀in⠀daylight,⠀a⠀mirror⠀turned⠀to⠀the⠀wall—that⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀but⠀completes⠀the⠀emotional⠀arc⠀through⠀form.⠀Keep⠀the⠀protagonist⠀sensible⠀and⠀capable⠀of⠀ordinary⠀affection;⠀the⠀failure⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀choice⠀and⠀its⠀conditions,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀monotone⠀of⠀grief.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀story⠀move⠀between⠀a⠀present⠀moment⠀and⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀the⠀two⠀held⠀together⠀by⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀changed⠀in⠀itself⠀but⠀has⠀changed⠀in⠀meaning.⠀Choose⠀that⠀detail⠀early⠀and⠀with⠀restraint:⠀a⠀particular⠀doorway,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀gate,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀curtain⠀hangs,⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀said⠀lightly.⠀Do⠀not⠀overmark⠀it.⠀The⠀first⠀appearance⠀should⠀be⠀unremarkable,⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀ordinary⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀day.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀when⠀a⠀choice⠀has⠀made⠀it⠀impossible⠀to⠀go⠀back,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀return⠀carry⠀the⠀whole⠀burden⠀of⠀recognition.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀directly,⠀but⠀only⠀in⠀response⠀to⠀something⠀actually⠀before⠀them—an⠀empty⠀chair,⠀a⠀familiar⠀scent,⠀a⠀bill⠀that⠀has⠀come⠀due⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀way.\n\nMemory⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀pool⠀to⠀dip⠀into⠀whenever⠀sadness⠀is⠀required.⠀It⠀should⠀be⠀called⠀up⠀by⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀task,⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀face⠀in⠀a⠀crowd,⠀the⠀particular⠀silence⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀after⠀someone⠀has⠀gone.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers,⠀keep⠀the⠀memory⠀partial⠀and⠀sensory.⠀Do⠀not⠀assemble⠀a⠀complete⠀retrospective;⠀let⠀one⠀image⠀stand⠀for⠀the⠀occasion.⠀\"The⠀light⠀fell⠀low⠀across⠀the⠀veranda\"⠀can⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀a⠀paragraph⠀if⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀has⠀given⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀consequence.⠀Let⠀the⠀remembered⠀moment⠀include⠀ordinary⠀pleasure.⠀A⠀tragedy⠀that⠀erases⠀all⠀warmth⠀is⠀only⠀a⠀report⠀of⠀damage.⠀The⠀lost⠀chance⠀to⠀say⠀something,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀hand⠀was⠀placed⠀on⠀a⠀shoulder,⠀the⠀unfinished⠀conversation⠀before⠀a⠀journey—these⠀become⠀tragic⠀because⠀they⠀were⠀once⠀available⠀and⠀are⠀no⠀longer.\n\nKeep⠀Kawabata's⠀economy⠀of⠀feeling.⠀Do⠀not⠀tell⠀the⠀reader⠀that⠀time⠀has⠀passed⠀or⠀that⠀things⠀can⠀never⠀be⠀the⠀same;⠀show⠀a⠀small,⠀irreversible⠀change:⠀the⠀clock⠀wound⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀no⠀longer⠀enters⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀garden⠀path⠀now⠀overgrown⠀past⠀the⠀second⠀step,⠀the⠀kettle⠀changed⠀on⠀the⠀stove.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀observe⠀these⠀things⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀practical,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reflection⠀rise⠀to⠀the⠀surface⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀physical⠀contact⠀with⠀the⠀changed⠀object⠀makes⠀it⠀unavoidable.⠀Use⠀plain⠀words⠀for⠀the⠀central⠀loss.⠀\"He⠀knew⠀she⠀would⠀not⠀come⠀back.\"⠀\"The⠀child⠀had⠀heard⠀the⠀news.\"⠀The⠀distance⠀between⠀such⠀a⠀sentence⠀and⠀the⠀surrounding⠀reflectiveness⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀method.⠀End⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀moment,⠀not⠀by⠀resolving⠀the⠀grief.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀walking,⠀still⠀waiting,⠀still⠀holding⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀opened.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀complete⠀in⠀the⠀altered⠀detail,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀summary⠀statement⠀about⠀the⠀irrevocable⠀nature⠀of⠀things.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀Persian-influenced⠀framed⠀tale:⠀a⠀storyteller,⠀often⠀older⠀or⠀removed⠀from⠀the⠀event⠀by⠀years,⠀speaks⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀has⠀asked⠀or⠀received⠀permission⠀to⠀hear⠀an⠀old⠀matter.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀economic.⠀The⠀teller⠀need⠀not⠀appear⠀constantly;⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀occasion⠀of⠀telling—a⠀courtyard⠀evening,⠀a⠀long⠀journey,⠀a⠀room⠀after⠀the⠀guests⠀have⠀gone—and⠀let⠀the⠀re-emergence⠀of⠀the⠀frame⠀function⠀as⠀a⠀breathing⠀pause,⠀not⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀explanation.⠀The⠀frame⠀should⠀hold⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀possession:⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀kept⠀and⠀is⠀now⠀placing⠀before⠀another⠀person.⠀The⠀listener's⠀interruptions⠀can⠀be⠀minimal,⠀a⠀single⠀question⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀word,⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀being⠀shaped⠀between⠀them.\n\nThe⠀inner⠀tale⠀should⠀follow⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity.⠀Choose⠀very⠀few⠀concrete⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀return⠀like⠀the⠀rhymes⠀in⠀a⠀long⠀ghazal:⠀not⠀with⠀identical⠀phrasing,⠀but⠀with⠀accumulating⠀difference.⠀The⠀scent⠀of⠀orange⠀blossom⠀behind⠀the⠀wall,⠀the⠀print⠀of⠀a⠀cup⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀brass⠀tray,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀door⠀was⠀latched⠀too⠀softly.⠀The⠀tragic⠀turn⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced⠀as⠀fate;⠀it⠀should⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀teller's⠀selected⠀images.⠀A⠀choice⠀once⠀made⠀becomes⠀visible⠀when⠀the⠀image⠀recurs⠀in⠀an⠀altered⠀state:⠀the⠀same⠀courtyard⠀now⠀empty,⠀the⠀same⠀lamp⠀brought⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀room,⠀the⠀same⠀song⠀heard⠀again⠀after⠀the⠀singer⠀has⠀gone.⠀Let⠀the⠀protagonist⠀be⠀intelligent⠀and⠀affectionate.⠀The⠀downfall⠀arises⠀from⠀social⠀obligation,⠀a⠀marriage,⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀divided⠀loyalty—not⠀from⠀universal⠀foolishness.\n\nDo⠀not⠀use⠀mysticism,⠀a⠀jinn,⠀a⠀blindness,⠀or⠀a⠀rigid⠀honor⠀code⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀region⠀is⠀invoked.⠀If⠀a⠀religious⠀or⠀cultural⠀detail⠀appears,⠀it⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀established⠀world⠀and⠀remain⠀a⠀concrete⠀part⠀of⠀social⠀life.⠀Keep⠀the⠀story's⠀language⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀frame's⠀language:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀compact,⠀parabolic⠀sentences,⠀while⠀the⠀tale⠀itself⠀stays⠀close⠀to⠀sensory⠀perception⠀and⠀private⠀thought.⠀The⠀frame's⠀final⠀turn⠀should⠀not⠀moralize.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀set⠀down⠀the⠀empty⠀glass,⠀look⠀at⠀the⠀listener,⠀or⠀say⠀one⠀plain⠀thing⠀that⠀returns⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀room.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀complete⠀when⠀the⠀told⠀images⠀have⠀become⠀charged⠀with⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored,⠀and⠀the⠀frame⠀acknowledges⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀passed⠀from⠀teller⠀to⠀listener⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀grief⠀into⠀a⠀general⠀claim⠀about⠀life.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀the⠀fall⠀from⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀meaning.⠀Show⠀the⠀thing⠀once,⠀plainly.⠀A⠀cup⠀on⠀a⠀table.⠀A⠀door⠀ajar.⠀A⠀cloth⠀folded⠀over⠀a⠀chair.⠀Do⠀not⠀decorate⠀these⠀objects.⠀Let⠀the⠀story⠀return⠀to⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀of⠀them⠀when⠀a⠀choice⠀has⠀altered⠀what⠀they⠀mean.⠀The⠀cup⠀can⠀be⠀full⠀and⠀then⠀empty⠀without⠀either⠀state⠀being⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀symbol.⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀becomes⠀a⠀causal⠀restraint:⠀the⠀reader⠀infers⠀from⠀the⠀detail's⠀changed⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀character,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀explanatory⠀sentence.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses,⠀primarily⠀subject-verb-object.⠀Vary⠀sentence⠀length⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀thought⠀requires⠀it.⠀A⠀long⠀sentence⠀may⠀be⠀precise,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀ramble.⠀If⠀inside⠀experience⠀is⠀included,⠀keep⠀it⠀essential.⠀One⠀sentence⠀of⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀enough:⠀\"He⠀knew⠀then⠀he⠀would⠀not⠀go⠀back.\"⠀\"She⠀wanted⠀to⠀say⠀it,⠀but⠀the⠀moment⠀had⠀gone.\"⠀Do⠀not⠀stack⠀repeated⠀fragments⠀to⠀produce⠀fake⠀brevity.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀turning⠀point⠀inferable:⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀the⠀declared⠀consequence,⠀but⠀never⠀before⠀the⠀character's⠀action⠀or⠀knowledge⠀that⠀sets⠀the⠀consequence⠀in⠀motion.\n\nDo⠀not⠀write⠀in⠀monotone.⠀Plain⠀sentences⠀can⠀still⠀register⠀warmth,⠀hesitation,⠀anger,⠀or⠀affection⠀through⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀moves⠀or⠀speaks.⠀Memory⠀is⠀permitted,⠀but⠀only⠀the⠀single⠀remembered⠀fact⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀present.⠀If⠀the⠀protagonist⠀remembers⠀a⠀promise,⠀show⠀the⠀promise⠀being⠀remembered⠀in⠀response⠀to⠀a⠀present⠀object,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀page⠀of⠀retrospection.⠀Keep⠀the⠀tragic⠀arc⠀intelligible:⠀the⠀alternatives⠀must⠀be⠀visible,⠀the⠀choice⠀must⠀be⠀made,⠀and⠀the⠀aftermath⠀must⠀preserve⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀In⠀the⠀final⠀movement,⠀let⠀the⠀detail⠀return⠀one⠀last⠀time,⠀now⠀transformed:⠀not⠀with⠀comment,⠀but⠀with⠀the⠀simplest⠀possible⠀statement⠀of⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action—a⠀hand⠀near⠀the⠀latch,⠀a⠀page⠀half-turned,⠀a⠀word⠀not⠀spoken—if⠀the⠀causal⠀facts⠀are⠀already⠀in⠀the⠀text.⠀Minimalism⠀does⠀not⠀delete⠀grief;⠀it⠀lets⠀the⠀retained⠀detail⠀bear⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀continuous⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀action,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀immediate⠀perception;⠀do⠀not⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀thesis⠀about⠀the⠀character⠀or⠀the⠀situation.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀establish⠀the⠀ordinary⠀before⠀the⠀fall.⠀Use⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀eye:⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sensory⠀details⠀per⠀scene⠀should⠀do⠀the⠀orienting⠀work.⠀A⠀window's⠀light,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀worn⠀doorknob,⠀a⠀specific⠀sound⠀from⠀another⠀room.⠀These⠀details⠀are⠀not⠀decoration.⠀Place⠀them⠀where⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀would⠀actually⠀rest,⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀return⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀situation⠀has⠀changed⠀them.⠀Avoid⠀poetic⠀inflation;⠀keep⠀the⠀surrounding⠀prose⠀in⠀the⠀contemporary⠀register⠀while⠀the⠀selected⠀image⠀carries⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight.\n\nMove⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀transitions.⠀If⠀the⠀protagonist⠀remembers⠀a⠀past⠀occasion,⠀let⠀that⠀memory⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀stimulus⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀material⠀consequence.⠀Interiority⠀is⠀ordinary⠀prose;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀wrapping⠀or⠀a⠀special⠀cue.⠀A⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀direct:⠀\"He⠀would⠀not⠀tell⠀her⠀now.\"⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀motive⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀visible⠀to⠀others.⠀No⠀mandatory⠀ratio⠀between⠀thought⠀and⠀speech;⠀some⠀scenes⠀will⠀be⠀almost⠀all⠀dialogue,⠀others⠀almost⠀all⠀interior⠀attention.⠀Keep⠀characters⠀individual.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀witty⠀in⠀every⠀reply,⠀nor⠀should⠀every⠀secondary⠀character⠀be⠀a⠀foil⠀to⠀the⠀central⠀grief.\n\nTragedy⠀is⠀the⠀organizing⠀pressure,⠀not⠀a⠀tone⠀that⠀colors⠀every⠀sentence.⠀Warnings⠀must⠀be⠀legible.⠀Let⠀someone⠀say⠀the⠀difficult⠀thing,⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀protagonist⠀notice⠀the⠀available⠀alternative⠀and⠀turn⠀away⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀that⠀is⠀credible⠀but⠀not⠀foolish.⠀The⠀choice⠀may⠀be⠀social,⠀domestic,⠀professional,⠀or⠀intimate.⠀Recognition⠀should⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀scene:⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀unsaid,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀paper⠀read⠀too⠀late,⠀a⠀person⠀seen⠀from⠀behind⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀twist⠀to⠀substitute⠀for⠀recognition.⠀The⠀recognition⠀must⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means—it⠀turns⠀a⠀mistake⠀into⠀an⠀irrevocable⠀act,⠀or⠀a⠀hope⠀into⠀a⠀memorial.⠀Aftermath⠀continues⠀in⠀present⠀scenes.⠀Show⠀the⠀small⠀practical⠀consequences:⠀the⠀room⠀rearranged,⠀the⠀task⠀left⠀undone,⠀the⠀call⠀not⠀made.⠀The⠀novel⠀prose⠀can⠀remain⠀flexible⠀all⠀the⠀way⠀to⠀the⠀end,⠀stopping⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀continued⠀exchange,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀a⠀private⠀system⠀of⠀repeated⠀physical⠀details⠀that⠀belong⠀only⠀to⠀these⠀two⠀people.⠀Choose⠀the⠀system⠀early⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀premise:⠀a⠀particular⠀way⠀of⠀knocking,⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀two⠀cups⠀after⠀they⠀have⠀eaten,⠀a⠀phrase⠀said⠀only⠀at⠀goodbyes,⠀the⠀side⠀of⠀the⠀bed⠀each⠀one⠀keeps,⠀a⠀song⠀played⠀only⠀on⠀certain⠀nights.⠀These⠀are⠀not⠀generic⠀romantic⠀ornaments.⠀Each⠀repetition⠀is⠀a⠀callback⠀that⠀should⠀reorient⠀the⠀relationship⠀slightly:⠀the⠀knock⠀becomes⠀shorter⠀after⠀an⠀argument;⠀the⠀cups⠀are⠀washed⠀from⠀opposite⠀sides⠀after⠀a⠀promise⠀has⠀been⠀broken;⠀the⠀goodbye⠀phrase⠀is⠀withheld.⠀Let⠀the⠀system⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff.⠀No⠀meta-commentary⠀from⠀the⠀narrator⠀about⠀how⠀meaningful⠀the⠀detail⠀is.\n\nKeep⠀Kawabata's⠀omission⠀of⠀explanation.⠀The⠀relationship's⠀state⠀may⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀one⠀altered⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀confession.⠀If⠀one⠀character⠀notices⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀stopped⠀doing⠀a⠀habitual⠀act,⠀that⠀absence⠀is⠀enough.⠀Private⠀matches⠀spoken⠀language.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀\"fine\"⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀shows⠀that⠀they⠀have⠀touched⠀the⠀window⠀latch⠀or⠀folded⠀a⠀sleeve⠀differently.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀mandatory⠀distrust⠀script;⠀this⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀betrayal⠀engine.⠀Affection⠀and⠀jealousy⠀can⠀share⠀space,⠀but⠀every⠀conflict⠀need⠀not⠀reveal⠀a⠀lie.⠀Let⠀the⠀couple⠀have⠀ordinary⠀competence⠀and⠀ordinary⠀affection.⠀When⠀the⠀tragic⠀choice⠀arrives,⠀it⠀should⠀grow⠀from⠀the⠀relationship's⠀actual⠀stakes:⠀an⠀obligation⠀in⠀conflict⠀with⠀the⠀bond,⠀a⠀silence⠀kept⠀too⠀long,⠀a⠀departure⠀that⠀could⠀not⠀be⠀refused,⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀one⠀believes⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀understood⠀differently.⠀Make⠀the⠀alternatives⠀legible⠀before⠀the⠀fall.\n\nDo⠀not⠀parade⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀AO3⠀tags.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀the⠀callbacks⠀it⠀makes⠀possible.⠀Scenes⠀may⠀include⠀comfort,⠀jealousy,⠀discovery,⠀or⠀rivalry⠀where⠀the⠀premise⠀supports⠀them,⠀but⠀not⠀all⠀in⠀every⠀reply.⠀The⠀relationship⠀promise⠀needs⠀enough⠀space:⠀a⠀conversation⠀may⠀extend⠀across⠀a⠀page⠀while⠀the⠀surrounding⠀prose⠀remains⠀scene-oriented⠀and⠀sensory.⠀Keep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀limited,⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀motives⠀remain⠀outside⠀unless⠀shown⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀actions⠀or⠀speech.⠀Do⠀not⠀provide⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀for⠀a⠀head⠀unrelated⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀it.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀private⠀interval:⠀the⠀narrator⠀waiting,⠀the⠀phone⠀not⠀called,⠀the⠀familiar⠀knock⠀not⠀answered.⠀The⠀tragedy⠀is⠀fulfilled⠀when⠀the⠀changed⠀callback⠀has⠀made⠀the⠀connection's⠀loss⠀present⠀without⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀relationship⠀advice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀one⠀that⠀people⠀have⠀told⠀and⠀will⠀tell⠀again,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀register⠀intimate.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀formula⠀of⠀retelling:⠀\"This⠀is⠀the⠀matter⠀of⠀the⠀two⠀cups⠀and⠀the⠀long⠀morning,\"⠀or⠀\"Now⠀shall⠀be⠀told⠀how⠀the⠀road⠀was⠀bought⠀and⠀never⠀used.\"⠀The⠀formula⠀should⠀name⠀the⠀story⠀by⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀things,⠀not⠀by⠀an⠀abstract⠀fate.⠀A⠀compact⠀declaration⠀can⠀introduce⠀a⠀person:⠀\"She⠀was⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀kept⠀the⠀gate⠀open⠀after⠀curfew.\"⠀Then⠀move⠀into⠀scenes⠀that⠀show⠀the⠀declaration's⠀limits.⠀The⠀saga⠀voice⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀narration,⠀but⠀the⠀characters⠀remain⠀particular;⠀not⠀every⠀speech⠀sounds⠀like⠀an⠀oath.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀as⠀Kawabata⠀uses⠀selective⠀images.⠀Choose⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀and⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀specific⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀account.⠀It⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀threshold⠀is⠀crossed,⠀the⠀same⠀errand⠀repeated,⠀or⠀the⠀same⠀warning⠀revisited.⠀Each⠀recurrence⠀carries⠀new⠀consequence.⠀When⠀the⠀phrase⠀is⠀fulfilled⠀in⠀an⠀altered⠀way,⠀the⠀tragedy⠀is⠀made⠀present⠀without⠀explanation.⠀For⠀example,⠀\"the⠀cups⠀stood⠀on⠀the⠀sill\"⠀may⠀recur⠀at⠀three⠀moments:⠀before⠀a⠀promise,⠀after⠀the⠀promise⠀was⠀kept⠀too⠀late,⠀and⠀after⠀the⠀house⠀was⠀emptied.⠀Do⠀not⠀label⠀these⠀moments.⠀The⠀relation⠀among⠀occurrences⠀does⠀the⠀work.\n\nAdapt⠀the⠀saga's⠀relation⠀of⠀deed⠀to⠀memory.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀move⠀forward⠀while⠀noting⠀what⠀later⠀generations⠀will⠀say⠀of⠀the⠀deed.⠀Keep⠀those⠀notes⠀modest⠀and⠀local:⠀\"Later⠀it⠀was⠀said⠀she⠀had⠀not⠀closed⠀the⠀ledger,\"⠀\"The⠀children⠀remembered⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀bell⠀before⠀they⠀remembered⠀its⠀name.\"⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀a⠀heroic⠀monument.⠀Feuds,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀or⠀broken⠀oaths⠀may⠀organize⠀the⠀story⠀if⠀the⠀actual⠀world⠀supplies⠀them,⠀but⠀household⠀and⠀community⠀scale⠀is⠀enough.⠀Jormungandr,⠀Valhalla,⠀berserker⠀imagery,⠀or⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon⠀are⠀not⠀defaults.⠀The⠀end⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀death⠀song⠀unless⠀tragedy's⠀aftermath⠀actually⠀reaches⠀public⠀mourning.⠀The⠀reteller⠀may⠀conclude⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀of⠀what⠀remains:⠀the⠀emptied⠀threshold,⠀the⠀unplanted⠀field,⠀the⠀name⠀now⠀spoken⠀only⠀in⠀the⠀kitchen.⠀Stop⠀when⠀the⠀act's⠀consequence⠀has⠀entered⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀community,⠀not⠀when⠀every⠀question⠀has⠀been⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route:⠀the⠀consequential⠀fall⠀develops⠀inside⠀the⠀specific⠀obligations⠀of⠀a⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀local⠀community⠀as⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story's⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀setting.⠀Make⠀the⠀obligations⠀concrete⠀and⠀institutional—a⠀lease,⠀a⠀care⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀union⠀rule,⠀a⠀municipal⠀form,⠀a⠀family⠀business—so⠀the⠀character's⠀choices⠀are⠀constrained⠀by⠀real⠀social⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀private⠀mood⠀alone.\n\nWithin⠀that⠀social⠀frame,⠀use⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀compression⠀as⠀the⠀method⠀of⠀emotional⠀disclosure.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀full⠀sequence⠀of⠀a⠀difficult⠀day.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀impressions⠀that⠀the⠀social⠀situation⠀has⠀made⠀significant,⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀spoken.⠀The⠀detail⠀should⠀be⠀ordinary⠀in⠀itself⠀but⠀changed⠀in⠀meaning⠀by⠀the⠀obligations⠀around⠀it:⠀the⠀chair⠀left⠀at⠀the⠀head⠀of⠀the⠀table⠀after⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀always⠀sat⠀there⠀has⠀moved⠀out,⠀the⠀work⠀schedule⠀pinned⠀to⠀the⠀kitchen⠀wall⠀after⠀the⠀shift⠀it⠀promised⠀no⠀longer⠀exists,⠀the⠀unopened⠀envelope⠀from⠀the⠀housing⠀office⠀placed⠀under⠀a⠀coffee⠀cup.⠀Select⠀the⠀detail⠀because⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀social⠀world,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀picturesque.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀explanation.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀later,⠀do⠀not⠀repeat⠀the⠀original⠀description⠀in⠀full;⠀show⠀the⠀slight⠀change⠀that⠀reveals⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀in⠀the⠀interval.⠀The⠀chair⠀has⠀been⠀moved⠀to⠀face⠀the⠀wall.⠀The⠀schedule⠀has⠀been⠀taken⠀down⠀and⠀the⠀pin⠀left⠀in⠀the⠀plaster.⠀The⠀envelope⠀has⠀been⠀opened⠀and⠀its⠀contents⠀set⠀aside⠀without⠀being⠀read.⠀The⠀reader⠀understands⠀the⠀loss⠀through⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀sightings,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀narrated⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀feelings.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀people⠀intelligent⠀and⠀capable⠀of⠀recognizing⠀what⠀their⠀choices⠀have⠀cost.⠀Recognition⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀private⠀thought,⠀a⠀spoken⠀sentence,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀action,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀social⠀circumstances⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀established.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀that⠀a⠀refusal⠀was⠀necessary⠀and⠀still⠀see⠀what⠀it⠀destroyed.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀recognition⠀a⠀single⠀dramatic⠀confession;⠀let⠀it⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀character⠀continues⠀to⠀perform⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀they⠀stop⠀performing⠀it.\n\nAftermath⠀preserves⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀restored.⠀The⠀household⠀does⠀not⠀return⠀to⠀its⠀earlier⠀shape.⠀A⠀new⠀arrangement⠀may⠀be⠀workable,⠀even⠀warm,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀marked⠀by⠀the⠀loss:⠀the⠀same⠀table⠀is⠀set⠀for⠀fewer⠀people,⠀the⠀same⠀route⠀to⠀work⠀is⠀walked⠀without⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀used⠀to⠀accompany⠀it,⠀the⠀same⠀holiday⠀is⠀observed⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀silence.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀ordinary⠀care⠀may⠀continue⠀in⠀minor⠀form⠀around⠀the⠀central⠀loss,⠀but⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀erase⠀it.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀social⠀and⠀restrained,⠀not⠀bleak;⠀the⠀tragedy⠀lies⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀particular⠀social⠀world⠀required⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀could⠀not⠀keep.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀consequential⠀decision⠀as⠀a⠀visible⠀sequence⠀of⠀small⠀physical⠀actions,⠀each⠀selected⠀for⠀what⠀it⠀omits.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀In⠀the⠀action⠀lines,⠀give⠀the⠀actor⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀movements⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀choice:⠀a⠀hand⠀pauses⠀over⠀a⠀coat⠀hook,⠀a⠀cup⠀is⠀held⠀too⠀long⠀before⠀being⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀letter⠀is⠀turned⠀over⠀without⠀being⠀opened.⠀Do⠀not⠀describe⠀the⠀character's⠀feelings⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀lines;⠀let⠀the⠀movement⠀and⠀its⠀duration⠀carry⠀them.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀reveal⠀the⠀practical⠀reasoning⠀and⠀the⠀incompatible⠀commitments.⠀The⠀characters⠀should⠀argue⠀about⠀the⠀concrete⠀matter⠀at⠀hand—a⠀lease,⠀a⠀practice⠀schedule,⠀a⠀promised⠀visit,⠀a⠀loan—while⠀the⠀deeper⠀loss⠀remains⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀say.⠀Make⠀the⠀alternatives⠀intelligible⠀in⠀the⠀spoken⠀exchange:⠀we⠀hear⠀the⠀option⠀that⠀might⠀save⠀them,⠀and⠀we⠀hear⠀the⠀reason⠀they⠀refuse⠀it.⠀The⠀refusal⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀refusal;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀character⠀stops⠀answering,⠀or⠀answers⠀about⠀something⠀else.\n\nUse⠀the⠀cut⠀as⠀Kawabata⠀uses⠀the⠀interval.⠀When⠀a⠀conversation⠀reaches⠀the⠀point⠀we⠀most⠀want⠀to⠀hear,⠀cut⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀aftermath⠀show⠀what⠀was⠀decided.⠀The⠀next⠀scene⠀should⠀contain⠀one⠀visible⠀detail⠀that⠀tells⠀us⠀the⠀outcome:⠀the⠀coat⠀is⠀gone⠀from⠀the⠀hook,⠀the⠀cup⠀has⠀been⠀washed⠀and⠀put⠀away,⠀the⠀letter⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀wastebasket.⠀Do⠀not⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀omitted⠀conversation⠀to⠀explain⠀it.⠀The⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀scene⠀before⠀the⠀cut⠀and⠀the⠀detail⠀after⠀it⠀carries⠀the⠀meaning.\n\nUse⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀we⠀understand.⠀A⠀door⠀closing⠀offscreen⠀can⠀tell⠀us⠀someone⠀has⠀left.⠀A⠀phone⠀ringing⠀unanswered⠀can⠀tell⠀us⠀a⠀call⠀is⠀being⠀refused.⠀The⠀sound⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀selected⠀sensory⠀impression,⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀every⠀private⠀thought.⠀When⠀required⠀interiority⠀must⠀be⠀present,⠀include⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀distinct⠀from⠀dialogue;⠀do⠀not⠀imply⠀that⠀other⠀characters⠀have⠀heard⠀it.\n\nRecognition⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀an⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀speech:⠀the⠀chair⠀is⠀straightened⠀for⠀no⠀one,⠀the⠀keys⠀are⠀laid⠀on⠀the⠀table⠀and⠀left⠀there,⠀the⠀photograph⠀is⠀turned⠀face⠀down.⠀After⠀the⠀consequential⠀moment,⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀continue⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀remains.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀the⠀loss⠀rather⠀than⠀repairing⠀it.⠀A⠀new⠀arrangement⠀may⠀appear,⠀but⠀the⠀visible⠀world⠀keeps⠀the⠀mark⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀lost—an⠀empty⠀hook,⠀a⠀place⠀not⠀set,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀ajar.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀restrained⠀and⠀visual,⠀not⠀bleak;⠀warmth⠀and⠀ordinary⠀care⠀may⠀continue⠀in⠀minor⠀form⠀around⠀the⠀central⠀loss.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nLet⠀the⠀physical⠀stage⠀carry⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀detail⠀through⠀objects⠀that⠀can⠀actually⠀be⠀handled⠀and⠀seen.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀objects⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀relationship⠀or⠀obligation—a⠀folded⠀coat,⠀a⠀glass⠀of⠀water,⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀keys,⠀a⠀photograph—and⠀let⠀them⠀recur.⠀The⠀first⠀time⠀an⠀object⠀appears,⠀it⠀is⠀ordinary.⠀The⠀second⠀time,⠀its⠀position⠀or⠀treatment⠀has⠀changed⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀shows⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀in⠀the⠀interval.⠀The⠀coat⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀on⠀the⠀hook.⠀The⠀glass⠀has⠀been⠀washed⠀and⠀put⠀away.⠀The⠀keys⠀have⠀been⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀table⠀instead⠀of⠀returned⠀to⠀the⠀pocket.⠀The⠀audience⠀reads⠀the⠀loss⠀through⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀sightings,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀narrated⠀explanation.\n\nLet⠀the⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀practical⠀reasoning⠀and⠀the⠀incompatible⠀commitments.⠀The⠀characters⠀should⠀argue⠀about⠀the⠀concrete⠀matter⠀at⠀hand—a⠀departure,⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀care⠀arrangement—while⠀the⠀deeper⠀loss⠀remains⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀say.⠀Make⠀the⠀alternatives⠀intelligible⠀in⠀the⠀spoken⠀exchange:⠀we⠀hear⠀the⠀option⠀that⠀might⠀save⠀them,⠀and⠀we⠀hear⠀the⠀reason⠀they⠀refuse⠀it.⠀The⠀refusal⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀character⠀stops⠀answering,⠀or⠀answers⠀about⠀something⠀else.\n\nUse⠀pauses,⠀exits,⠀and⠀blocking⠀as⠀the⠀play's⠀equivalent⠀of⠀Kawabata's⠀intervals.⠀When⠀a⠀line⠀is⠀withheld,⠀give⠀the⠀actor⠀the⠀preceding⠀physical⠀moment⠀to⠀make⠀that⠀withholding⠀visible:⠀a⠀hand⠀half⠀raised,⠀then⠀lowered.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀exits,⠀let⠀the⠀exit⠀be⠀too⠀long⠀or⠀too⠀short⠀for⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀established.⠀An⠀entrance⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀same⠀weight:⠀a⠀character⠀enters⠀with⠀a⠀box,⠀another⠀finds⠀a⠀chair⠀out⠀of⠀place,⠀someone⠀does⠀not⠀rise⠀when⠀expected.⠀The⠀relationship⠀between⠀speech⠀and⠀business⠀is⠀the⠀play.\n\nUse⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀dramatic⠀situation⠀requires⠀the⠀audience⠀to⠀know⠀something⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀must⠀not.⠀When⠀that⠀happens,⠀let⠀the⠀speech⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀physical⠀action—the⠀character⠀speaks⠀while⠀folding⠀the⠀coat,⠀or⠀while⠀looking⠀at⠀the⠀photograph—so⠀the⠀private⠀knowledge⠀remains⠀anchored⠀in⠀the⠀stage⠀world.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀monologue⠀to⠀replace⠀every⠀private⠀thought.⠀When⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀must⠀be⠀present,⠀include⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation;⠀the⠀stage⠀cast⠀does⠀not⠀hear⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀unfold⠀through⠀decisions:⠀the⠀refusal⠀to⠀leave,⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀throwing⠀away⠀an⠀address,⠀the⠀acceptance⠀of⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept.⠀After⠀the⠀consequential⠀moment,⠀let⠀the⠀play⠀continue⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀remains⠀on⠀stage—an⠀uncollected⠀coat,⠀a⠀light⠀left⠀burning,⠀two⠀chairs⠀whose⠀usual⠀occupants⠀no⠀longer⠀sit⠀together.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀preserves⠀the⠀loss⠀rather⠀than⠀repairing⠀it.⠀A⠀new⠀arrangement⠀may⠀appear,⠀but⠀the⠀stage⠀keeps⠀the⠀mark⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀lost.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀restrained⠀and⠀theatrical,⠀not⠀bleak;⠀warmth⠀and⠀ordinary⠀care⠀may⠀continue⠀in⠀minor⠀form⠀around⠀the⠀central⠀loss.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀flow⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀sensory⠀particulars⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀consequential⠀choice.⠀Choose⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀details⠀at⠀most—a⠀teacup⠀rim,⠀a⠀torn⠀hem,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀window⠀closing—and⠀let⠀them⠀recur⠀as⠀the⠀mind⠀moves⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀into⠀memory⠀or⠀anticipation.⠀The⠀first⠀occurrence⠀is⠀simply⠀perceived.⠀The⠀second⠀occurrence⠀arrives⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀years⠀ago,⠀or⠀to⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat.⠀The⠀third⠀occurrence⠀arrives⠀after⠀the⠀choice⠀has⠀been⠀made,⠀and⠀the⠀detail⠀now⠀carries⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀reader⠀understands⠀the⠀tragedy⠀through⠀the⠀changing⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀same⠀particular⠀and⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement⠀around⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀associative⠀movement⠀be⠀involuntary⠀rather⠀than⠀explanatory.⠀One⠀detail⠀leads⠀to⠀a⠀memory,⠀which⠀leads⠀to⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀which⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀connection⠀every⠀time.⠀The⠀relation⠀between⠀images⠀carries⠀the⠀feeling.⠀When⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀consequential⠀choice,⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀through⠀the⠀detail,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀happened:⠀a⠀phone⠀number⠀dialed⠀halfway,⠀a⠀chair⠀moved⠀after⠀someone⠀left,⠀an⠀apology⠀formed⠀in⠀the⠀head⠀but⠀never⠀spoken.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀protagonist⠀an⠀actual⠀mind⠀with⠀limits.⠀They⠀can⠀reason,⠀misunderstand,⠀refuse,⠀and⠀recognize.⠀Use⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀to⠀reflect⠀their⠀attention—short⠀fragments⠀when⠀a⠀thought⠀is⠀interrupted,⠀longer⠀sentences⠀when⠀memory⠀and⠀present⠀perception⠀run⠀together.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀feared⠀or⠀wished.⠀The⠀technique⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind⠀or⠀turn⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate.\n\nLet⠀the⠀recognition⠀be⠀incomplete.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀understand⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀choice⠀has⠀cost⠀without⠀understanding⠀all⠀of⠀it.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀is⠀the⠀continued⠀presence⠀of⠀the⠀loss⠀inside⠀the⠀flow:⠀the⠀detail⠀returns⠀again,⠀now⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀knowledge⠀that⠀nothing⠀can⠀be⠀restored.⠀The⠀mind⠀does⠀not⠀leave⠀the⠀consequential⠀choice⠀behind.⠀It⠀returns⠀not⠀as⠀exposition⠀but⠀as⠀felt⠀life.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀associative⠀and⠀restrained,⠀not⠀bleak;⠀warmth⠀and⠀ordinary⠀care⠀may⠀continue⠀in⠀minor⠀form⠀around⠀the⠀central⠀loss.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nLet⠀the⠀messages⠀themselves⠀be⠀spare⠀and⠀carefully⠀chosen,⠀as⠀if⠀each⠀line⠀were⠀a⠀physical⠀object⠀placed⠀in⠀a⠀room.⠀A⠀character's⠀actual⠀typing⠀habit⠀matters:⠀one⠀person⠀writes⠀in⠀full⠀sentences,⠀another⠀sends⠀fragments;⠀one⠀deletes⠀and⠀retypes,⠀another⠀never⠀uses⠀punctuation.⠀These⠀habits⠀reveal⠀character⠀without⠀commentary.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀character's⠀feelings⠀in⠀the⠀transcript;⠀let⠀the⠀choice⠀of⠀words,⠀the⠀length⠀of⠀the⠀message,⠀and⠀the⠀delay⠀before⠀sending⠀carry⠀them.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀means.⠀A⠀delay⠀before⠀answering⠀is⠀meaningful⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀we⠀know⠀about⠀the⠀characters.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀left⠀unopened⠀for⠀hours⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀equivalent⠀of⠀a⠀long⠀pause.⠀Show⠀that⠀a⠀message⠀was⠀edited,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀draft⠀exists⠀unsent,⠀only⠀when⠀that⠀fact⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀means.⠀When⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀appears,⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀clearly⠀labeled⠀block,⠀distinct⠀from⠀anything⠀transmitted.⠀Do⠀not⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀sent⠀message.⠀The⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀the⠀sent⠀message⠀carries⠀the⠀loss:⠀the⠀character⠀typed⠀the⠀apology,⠀then⠀sent⠀something⠀else.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tragedy⠀unfold⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀messages⠀allow.⠀A⠀practical⠀decision⠀made⠀by⠀text⠀cannot⠀be⠀taken⠀back.⠀A⠀misunderstanding⠀persists⠀because⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀too⠀frightened⠀to⠀speak.⠀A⠀refusal⠀is⠀delivered⠀so⠀calmly⠀that⠀it⠀breaks⠀a⠀relationship.⠀Let⠀the⠀alternatives⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself—the⠀question⠀asked,⠀the⠀offer⠀made,⠀the⠀chance⠀to⠀call—without⠀making⠀the⠀person⠀foolish⠀for⠀missing⠀them.⠀The⠀refusal⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀refusal;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀character⠀stops⠀answering,⠀or⠀answers⠀about⠀something⠀else.\n\nContext⠀outside⠀the⠀chat⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀and⠀brief.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀stream-of-consciousness;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀view⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀saw⠀or⠀did⠀between⠀messages.⠀Use⠀the⠀context⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀physical⠀world⠀that⠀the⠀messages⠀cannot⠀carry:⠀the⠀chair⠀moved⠀after⠀someone⠀left,⠀the⠀phone⠀set⠀face⠀down⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀unopened⠀envelope.⠀The⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀context⠀and⠀the⠀messages⠀carries⠀the⠀feeling⠀that⠀neither⠀can⠀express⠀alone.\n\nLet⠀the⠀recognition⠀be⠀incomplete.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀choice⠀has⠀cost⠀without⠀understanding⠀all⠀of⠀it.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀is⠀the⠀continued⠀presence⠀of⠀the⠀loss⠀inside⠀the⠀exchange:⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀asked⠀again,⠀the⠀same⠀answer⠀given⠀more⠀briefly,⠀the⠀timestamp⠀that⠀stands⠀where⠀another⠀answer⠀should⠀have⠀come.⠀The⠀final⠀exchange⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀dramatic⠀send-off.⠀It⠀can⠀simply⠀stop,⠀the⠀way⠀an⠀important⠀conversation⠀often⠀stops:⠀on⠀a⠀plain⠀okay,⠀a⠀missing⠀reply,⠀or⠀a⠀timestamp⠀that⠀marks⠀the⠀loss.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀digital⠀and⠀restrained,⠀not⠀bleak;⠀warmth⠀and⠀ordinary⠀care⠀may⠀continue⠀in⠀minor⠀form⠀around⠀the⠀central⠀loss.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀concise⠀placing⠀line⠀—⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where,⠀the⠀hour⠀or⠀the⠀light⠀—⠀then⠀let⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀chosen⠀details⠀hold⠀the⠀scene's⠀feeling.⠀Choose⠀what⠀is⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep:⠀an⠀object⠀in⠀use⠀for⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀last⠀time,⠀a⠀gesture⠀continued⠀out⠀of⠀habit,⠀a⠀keepsake⠀kept⠀where⠀it⠀cannot⠀be⠀seen.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀detail⠀and⠀feeling⠀stay⠀implied⠀rather⠀than⠀glossed.⠀An⠀expression⠀or⠀background⠀cue⠀—⠀a⠀look⠀away,⠀the⠀lamp's⠀hum⠀—⠀orients⠀the⠀moment;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀what⠀a⠀speaker⠀intends,⠀and⠀a⠀face⠀at⠀odds⠀with⠀words⠀is⠀settled⠀later⠀by⠀what⠀people⠀do⠀and⠀say.\n\nPut⠀the⠀irreversible⠀steps⠀into⠀clear,⠀attributed⠀dialogue⠀about⠀practical⠀things:⠀a⠀move,⠀a⠀treatment⠀schedule,⠀money,⠀a⠀promise⠀accepted⠀or⠀refused.⠀Keep⠀the⠀speech⠀plain⠀and⠀competent,⠀so⠀the⠀people⠀remain⠀intelligent⠀and⠀worthy⠀of⠀attention⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀choice⠀becomes⠀destructive.⠀Inside⠀the⠀same⠀scene,⠀keep⠀the⠀alternative⠀visible⠀and⠀available⠀—⠀the⠀unsent⠀message,⠀the⠀ticket⠀not⠀yet⠀bought,⠀the⠀request⠀not⠀yet⠀refused⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀destructive⠀step⠀is⠀a⠀choice⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀necessity.⠀After⠀an⠀exchange,⠀allow⠀a⠀beat⠀of⠀focal⠀narration:⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices⠀next,⠀the⠀interval⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀words⠀settle.⠀That⠀beat⠀may⠀simply⠀hold⠀attention⠀on⠀a⠀passing⠀thing;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀decision.\n\nLet⠀scenes⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀small⠀set⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀details.⠀When⠀recognition⠀comes,⠀stage⠀it⠀as⠀such⠀a⠀return⠀—⠀the⠀familiar⠀object⠀in⠀its⠀familiar⠀place⠀while⠀everything⠀around⠀it⠀has⠀changed⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀understand,⠀in⠀narration,⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀actually⠀is,⠀without⠀the⠀prose⠀explaining⠀the⠀connection.⠀Earlier⠀warnings⠀can⠀surface⠀here⠀as⠀things⠀half-known.⠀After⠀the⠀fall,⠀continue⠀in⠀scenes⠀of⠀remains:⠀the⠀desk⠀cleared,⠀the⠀number⠀deleted,⠀the⠀plant⠀still⠀watered,⠀presented⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀selective⠀plainness⠀as⠀before⠀and⠀without⠀sentimental⠀redressing.⠀Warmth⠀may⠀persist⠀between⠀losses⠀—⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀work⠀done⠀well,⠀a⠀joke⠀that⠀lands⠀—⠀because⠀the⠀tragedy⠀is⠀the⠀arc⠀of⠀the⠀fall,⠀not⠀a⠀punishment⠀distributed⠀across⠀scenes.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀through⠀a⠀break⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀place⠀and⠀hour.⠀Write⠀no⠀branching⠀menus,⠀choice⠀screens,⠀or⠀player⠀decisions;⠀any⠀choice⠀happens⠀inside⠀the⠀prose.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀attention⠀actually⠀ends⠀—⠀mid-errand,⠀after⠀a⠀reply,⠀in⠀the⠀interval⠀after⠀news,⠀while⠀someone⠀is⠀still⠀speaking⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀at⠀a⠀manufactured⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaqbabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Tragedy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nKeep⠀one⠀clear⠀line⠀alive⠀across⠀replies:⠀the⠀decision⠀already⠀taken,⠀the⠀obligation⠀approaching,⠀the⠀relationship⠀changing⠀in⠀one⠀direction.⠀Do⠀not⠀reopen⠀the⠀whole⠀history⠀at⠀the⠀top⠀of⠀an⠀installment.⠀When⠀a⠀returning⠀reader⠀needs⠀footing,⠀recover⠀a⠀single⠀salient⠀detail⠀—⠀the⠀half-packed⠀case,⠀the⠀chair⠀turned⠀to⠀the⠀window,⠀the⠀letter⠀still⠀unopened⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀one⠀detail⠀carry⠀both⠀the⠀re-entry⠀and⠀the⠀loss⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀tending.⠀A⠀short⠀clause⠀is⠀enough;⠀the⠀detail⠀works⠀because⠀it⠀was⠀chosen,⠀not⠀explained.\n\nLet⠀time⠀move⠀unevenly⠀across⠀installments.⠀Compress⠀uneventful⠀spans⠀to⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀two⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀space⠀to⠀small⠀physical⠀changes:⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀room,⠀the⠀voice⠀on⠀the⠀phone⠀a⠀little⠀more⠀tired,⠀the⠀plant⠀still⠀watered⠀by⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀stayed.⠀These⠀recurring⠀details⠀are⠀the⠀serial's⠀measure⠀of⠀the⠀fall⠀—⠀each⠀reply⠀advances⠀the⠀arc⠀by⠀an⠀earned⠀local⠀change⠀rather⠀than⠀restated⠀grief⠀—⠀while⠀waiting,⠀travel⠀and⠀attention⠀keep⠀their⠀real⠀duration⠀inside⠀a⠀scene.⠀Between⠀losses,⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continues:⠀meals,⠀work⠀done⠀competently,⠀small⠀kindnesses,⠀because⠀the⠀arc⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀scene⠀carries⠀the⠀tragedy.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀destructive⠀steps⠀in⠀ordinary⠀exchanges⠀—⠀work,⠀money,⠀care,⠀duty⠀—⠀where⠀the⠀alternatives⠀remain⠀intelligible⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀making⠀them⠀remain⠀intelligent;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀warning⠀clearly⠀and⠀still⠀choose⠀harm⠀for⠀love,⠀pride,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀mistaken⠀belief⠀they⠀can⠀defend.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀recognition⠀at⠀the⠀first⠀trouble.⠀Let⠀it⠀arrive⠀when⠀the⠀accumulated⠀changes⠀have⠀made⠀it⠀hard⠀to⠀avoid,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀add⠀to⠀it:⠀the⠀unopened⠀letter⠀reads⠀differently⠀once⠀its⠀writer⠀is⠀gone.⠀Afterward,⠀keep⠀consequences⠀practical⠀and⠀continuing⠀—⠀a⠀task⠀no⠀longer⠀possible,⠀a⠀right⠀forfeited,⠀a⠀room⠀in⠀use⠀by⠀someone⠀else⠀—⠀recoverable⠀in⠀later⠀installments⠀without⠀retelling.\n\nEnd⠀an⠀installment⠀where⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀the⠀reply⠀actually⠀stops:⠀a⠀quiet⠀result,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀task⠀half-finished,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀unanswered.⠀Occasional⠀hooks⠀are⠀welcome;⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀every⠀turn⠀is⠀not,⠀and⠀no⠀reply⠀owes⠀a⠀reversal⠀or⠀a⠀confession.⠀Keep⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀inside⠀the⠀serial⠀prose⠀itself⠀—⠀the⠀focal⠀attention,⠀the⠀uncertainty,⠀the⠀motive⠀behind⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀or⠀sends⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀deferring⠀it⠀to⠀summary⠀or⠀planning.⠀Invent⠀no⠀levels,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression⠀mechanics;⠀progress⠀here⠀is⠀knowledge,⠀relationship,⠀work,⠀or⠀what⠀remains⠀of⠀a⠀resource.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{// === END WRITING RECIPE LIBRARIES === }}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
