            "identifier": "v11-205-influence-chuck-palahniuk",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: Chuck Palahniuk",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN · multi-select influence] Chuck Palahniuk voice bias. Stacking more than two influences muddies all of them. Transgressive fiction: filter-word-free, visceral, socially savage prose. }}\n{{// @color #8E44AD }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + Chuck Palahniuk}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Style⠀Guidelines⠀—⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk\nUse⠀procedural⠀confession:⠀blunt⠀repetition,⠀consumer⠀debris,⠀body⠀process,⠀shame,⠀taboo,⠀and⠀social⠀rot.⠀Keep⠀sentences⠀hard,⠀rhythmic,⠀and⠀concrete.⠀Let⠀slogans,⠀rules,⠀lists,⠀and⠀repeated⠀fragments⠀become⠀pressure.⠀Beauty⠀appears⠀as⠀damage⠀named⠀without⠀ornament.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Distinct⠀Voice⠀—⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk\nGive⠀speakers⠀a⠀coping⠀mechanism.⠀One⠀person⠀recites⠀facts,⠀another⠀jokes⠀flatly,⠀another⠀turns⠀trauma⠀into⠀instructions.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀expose⠀denial⠀through⠀obsessive⠀detail,⠀branded⠀objects,⠀bodily⠀logistics,⠀and⠀casual⠀cruelty.⠀The⠀voice⠀knows⠀too⠀much⠀and⠀feels⠀too⠀little⠀until⠀it⠀cracks.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Imperfect⠀Speech⠀—⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk\nUse⠀loops,⠀resets,⠀and⠀mantra.⠀A⠀speaker⠀repeats⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀because⠀thought⠀has⠀stalled⠀around⠀a⠀wound.⠀Hard⠀pivots⠀with⠀\"Look,\"⠀\"No,\"⠀or⠀\"Here's⠀the⠀thing\"⠀should⠀reveal⠀deflection⠀and⠀pressure.⠀Contradiction⠀is⠀the⠀leak.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Body⠀in⠀Speech⠀—⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk\nLet⠀bodies⠀and⠀objects⠀argue.⠀Cleaning,⠀bleeding,⠀eating,⠀counting,⠀packaging,⠀sorting,⠀or⠀breaking⠀something⠀while⠀speaking⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀real⠀state⠀beneath⠀the⠀line.⠀Physical⠀detail⠀should⠀be⠀tactile,⠀ugly,⠀funny,⠀and⠀specific.\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}Chuck⠀Palahniuk{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
