            "identifier": "v11-211-influence-yasunari-kawabata",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: Yasunari Kawabata",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN · multi-select influence] Yasunari Kawabata voice bias. Stacking more than two influences muddies all of them. Aesthetic beauty, seasonal imagery, longing, minimalist Japanese prose. }}\n{{// @color #3498DB }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + Yasunari Kawabata}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Style⠀Guidelines⠀—⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata\nUse⠀ma,⠀yugen,⠀and⠀mono⠀no⠀aware:⠀brief⠀surface,⠀deep⠀silence,⠀beauty⠀already⠀passing.⠀Write⠀in⠀clean⠀fragments⠀and⠀sensory⠀images:⠀snow,⠀glass,⠀fabric,⠀light,⠀water,⠀skin,⠀distance.⠀Let⠀omission⠀create⠀the⠀emotional⠀field.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Distinct⠀Voice⠀—⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀sparse⠀and⠀socially⠀restrained.⠀A⠀character⠀says⠀the⠀practical⠀thing⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀carries⠀the⠀feeling.⠀Age,⠀rank,⠀desire,⠀and⠀shame⠀appear⠀through⠀address,⠀quiet⠀concession,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unsaid.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Imperfect⠀Speech⠀—⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata\nUse⠀pause⠀as⠀pressure.⠀A⠀sentence⠀ends⠀early⠀because⠀finishing⠀would⠀damage⠀the⠀moment.⠀Ellipses,⠀unanswered⠀questions,⠀and⠀slight⠀self-corrections⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀etiquette⠀holding⠀back⠀emotion.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Body⠀in⠀Speech⠀—⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata\nMake⠀tiny⠀movements⠀decisive:⠀a⠀sleeve⠀adjusted,⠀a⠀gaze⠀lowered,⠀a⠀cup⠀turned,⠀a⠀window⠀opened,⠀a⠀hand⠀withdrawn.⠀Physical⠀detail⠀should⠀be⠀exact,⠀quiet,⠀and⠀seasonal.⠀Stillness⠀is⠀active.\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}Yasunari⠀Kawabata{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
