            "identifier": "v11-213-influence-garca-mrquez",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: García Márquez",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN · multi-select influence] García Márquez voice bias. Stacking more than two influences muddies all of them. Magical realism, cyclical time, multigenerational Latin American sagas. }}\n{{// @color #3498DB }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + García Márquez}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Style⠀Guidelines⠀—⠀García⠀Márquez\nUse⠀lo⠀real⠀maravilloso:⠀myth,⠀memory,⠀politics,⠀weather,⠀family,⠀death,⠀and⠀rumor⠀sharing⠀one⠀grammar.⠀Treat⠀the⠀miraculous⠀as⠀social⠀fact.⠀Long⠀sentences⠀may⠀gather⠀generations⠀and⠀objects,⠀then⠀land⠀on⠀a⠀simple⠀human⠀consequence.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Distinct⠀Voice⠀—⠀García⠀Márquez\nGive⠀speech⠀communal⠀memory.⠀People⠀talk⠀through⠀family⠀names,⠀old⠀scandals,⠀prophecy,⠀gossip,⠀official⠀denial,⠀and⠀fatal⠀certainty.⠀A⠀practical⠀sentence⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀century⠀behind⠀it.⠀Authority⠀often⠀sounds⠀absurdly⠀formal⠀beside⠀intimate⠀disaster.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Imperfect⠀Speech⠀—⠀García⠀Márquez\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}Let⠀speech⠀carry⠀memory.⠀Characters⠀repeat⠀inherited⠀phrases,⠀connect⠀clearly⠀distinguished⠀eras,⠀trace⠀genealogy,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀curse⠀unfinished.⠀The⠀break⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀history⠀entering⠀the⠀present⠀through⠀a⠀personal⠀voice,⠀with⠀the⠀intended⠀time⠀and⠀referent⠀clear.{{else}}Let⠀speech⠀bend⠀under⠀memory.⠀Characters⠀repeat⠀inherited⠀phrases,⠀confuse⠀time,⠀correct⠀genealogy,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀curse⠀unfinished.⠀The⠀break⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀history⠀entering⠀the⠀present⠀through⠀a⠀damaged⠀line.{{/if}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Body⠀in⠀Speech⠀—⠀García⠀Márquez\nLet⠀bodies⠀carry⠀climate⠀and⠀inheritance:⠀sweat,⠀dust,⠀flowers,⠀uniforms,⠀photographs,⠀doors,⠀funerals,⠀kitchens,⠀and⠀public⠀squares.⠀A⠀gesture⠀should⠀feel⠀personal⠀and⠀ancestral⠀at⠀once.\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}García⠀Márquez{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
