            "identifier": "v11-215-influence-lu-xun",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: Lu Xun",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN · multi-select influence] Lu Xun voice bias. Stacking more than two influences muddies all of them. Sharp social criticism, lean prose, irony and moral urgency. }}\n{{// @color #3498DB }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + Lu Xun}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Style⠀Guidelines⠀—⠀Lu⠀Xun\nUse⠀scalpel⠀realism:⠀plain⠀narration,⠀social⠀diagnosis,⠀irony,⠀shame,⠀superstition,⠀cowardice,⠀and⠀civic⠀rot.⠀Keep⠀prose⠀clean⠀and⠀unsentimental.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀cruelty⠀expose⠀the⠀system⠀without⠀a⠀lecture.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Distinct⠀Voice⠀—⠀Lu⠀Xun\nGive⠀voices⠀social⠀position⠀and⠀moral⠀evasion.⠀Officials⠀use⠀hollow⠀terms,⠀neighbors⠀use⠀gossip⠀and⠀proverb,⠀intellectuals⠀hide⠀fear⠀behind⠀abstraction,⠀the⠀powerless⠀speak⠀in⠀practical⠀fragments.⠀Satire⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀exact⠀social⠀behavior.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Imperfect⠀Speech⠀—⠀Lu⠀Xun\nUse⠀evasive⠀correction,⠀unfinished⠀accusation,⠀nervous⠀proverb,⠀and⠀silence⠀around⠀blame.⠀Characters⠀stumble⠀when⠀the⠀truth⠀threatens⠀group⠀comfort⠀or⠀personal⠀safety.⠀The⠀broken⠀line⠀should⠀expose⠀complicity.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Body⠀in⠀Speech⠀—⠀Lu⠀Xun\nUse⠀public⠀behavior:⠀looking⠀away,⠀gathering⠀at⠀doors,⠀handling⠀bowls,⠀shuffling⠀papers,⠀laughing⠀in⠀groups,⠀lowering⠀voices.⠀Physical⠀beats⠀should⠀show⠀social⠀pressure,⠀cowardice,⠀hunger,⠀or⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀dissent.\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}Lu⠀Xun{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
