            "identifier": "v11-216-influence-wang-xiaobo",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: Wang Xiaobo",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN · multi-select influence] Wang Xiaobo voice bias. Stacking more than two influences muddies all of them. Satirical intellectual prose, absurdist humor, taboo-breaking. }}\n{{// @color #3498DB }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + Wang Xiaobo}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Style⠀Guidelines⠀—⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo\nUse⠀lucid⠀mischief:⠀rational⠀inquiry,⠀absurd⠀bureaucracy,⠀sexual⠀honesty,⠀black⠀humor,⠀and⠀freedom⠀of⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀prose⠀direct⠀and⠀nimble.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀puncture⠀solemnity⠀with⠀a⠀precise,⠀comic,⠀intellectually⠀dangerous⠀observation.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Distinct⠀Voice⠀—⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo\nGive⠀speakers⠀friction⠀between⠀private⠀intelligence⠀and⠀public⠀nonsense.⠀Officials⠀sound⠀procedural,⠀lovers⠀sound⠀candid,⠀cynics⠀sound⠀playful,⠀and⠀rebels⠀sound⠀almost⠀too⠀reasonable.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀question⠀rules⠀by⠀taking⠀them⠀literally.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Imperfect⠀Speech⠀—⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo\nUse⠀dry⠀correction,⠀sudden⠀aside,⠀and⠀failed⠀politeness.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀restart⠀because⠀the⠀official⠀sentence⠀is⠀absurd⠀or⠀the⠀honest⠀one⠀is⠀socially⠀risky.⠀Let⠀humor⠀expose⠀the⠀trap.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Body⠀in⠀Speech⠀—⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo\nUse⠀cramped⠀rooms,⠀forms,⠀bicycles,⠀queues,⠀beds,⠀classrooms,⠀offices,⠀and⠀streets⠀as⠀comic⠀pressure.⠀Physical⠀beats⠀should⠀reveal⠀surveillance,⠀desire,⠀boredom,⠀or⠀resistance⠀through⠀ordinary⠀logistics.\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}Wang⠀Xiaobo{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
