            "identifier": "v11-218-influence-cormac-mccarthy",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: Cormac McCarthy",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN · multi-select influence] Cormac McCarthy voice bias. Stacking more than two influences muddies all of them. McCarthy's stark, violent, Biblical prose. No quotation marks, sparse punctuation, poetic brutality. Perfect for dark westerns, post-apocalyptic. }}\n{{// @color #E67E22 }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + Cormac McCarthy}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Style⠀Guidelines⠀—⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy\nUse⠀biblical⠀parataxis⠀and⠀hard⠀landscape.⠀Concrete⠀nouns,⠀stark⠀verbs,⠀dust,⠀blood,⠀stone,⠀iron,⠀sky,⠀hunger,⠀and⠀silence⠀carry⠀the⠀weight.⠀Sentences⠀can⠀run⠀with⠀terrible⠀momentum⠀or⠀stop⠀like⠀a⠀struck⠀match.⠀Keep⠀judgment⠀inside⠀image⠀and⠀action.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Distinct⠀Voice⠀—⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy\nGive⠀speakers⠀sparse,⠀weathered⠀speech.⠀People⠀state⠀facts,⠀bargains,⠀warnings,⠀and⠀old⠀beliefs⠀with⠀minimal⠀explanation.⠀Formal⠀or⠀archaic⠀turns⠀can⠀appear⠀when⠀fate,⠀violence,⠀or⠀law⠀enters⠀the⠀room.⠀Eloquence⠀should⠀feel⠀earned⠀by⠀severity.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Imperfect⠀Speech⠀—⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy\nUse⠀omission,⠀hard⠀stops,⠀and⠀plain⠀refusal.⠀Characters⠀leave⠀motives⠀unsaid⠀because⠀survival,⠀pride,⠀or⠀doom⠀has⠀made⠀explanation⠀useless.⠀Repetition⠀works⠀as⠀ritual⠀or⠀threat.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Body⠀in⠀Speech⠀—⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy\nUse⠀labor,⠀travel,⠀hunger,⠀weapons,⠀horses,⠀fire,⠀wounds,⠀and⠀distance.⠀Physical⠀beats⠀should⠀show⠀endurance,⠀violence,⠀ritual,⠀or⠀judgment.⠀The⠀land⠀presses⠀on⠀every⠀body⠀in⠀the⠀scene.\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}Cormac⠀McCarthy{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
