            "identifier": "v11-219-influence-ernest-hemingway",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: Ernest Hemingway",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN · multi-select influence] Ernest Hemingway voice bias. Stacking more than two influences muddies all of them. Hemingway's sparse, direct prose. Short sentences, iceberg theory, masculine minimalism. }}\n{{// @color #E67E22 }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + Ernest Hemingway}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Style⠀Guidelines⠀—⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway\nUse⠀iceberg⠀prose:⠀short⠀sentences,⠀concrete⠀action,⠀visible⠀pressure,⠀and⠀emotion⠀held⠀below⠀the⠀waterline.⠀Name⠀objects,⠀weather,⠀work,⠀drink,⠀food,⠀weapons,⠀rooms,⠀and⠀movement⠀exactly.⠀Let⠀implication⠀carry⠀the⠀pain.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Distinct⠀Voice⠀—⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway\nGive⠀speakers⠀clean⠀surface⠀speech⠀with⠀buried⠀stakes.⠀People⠀say⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀rest⠀for⠀timing,⠀repetition,⠀and⠀silence.⠀Class,⠀profession,⠀nationality,⠀and⠀courage⠀should⠀shape⠀word⠀choice⠀without⠀decoration.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Imperfect⠀Speech⠀—⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway\nUse⠀clipped⠀answers,⠀repeated⠀practical⠀questions,⠀and⠀silence⠀after⠀the⠀important⠀line.⠀Characters⠀deflect⠀confession⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀work,⠀weather,⠀drink,⠀money,⠀or⠀travel.⠀The⠀evasion⠀is⠀the⠀feeling.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Body⠀in⠀Speech⠀—⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway\nMake⠀action⠀do⠀the⠀emotional⠀work:⠀pouring,⠀fishing,⠀packing,⠀cleaning⠀a⠀weapon,⠀lighting⠀a⠀cigarette,⠀touching⠀a⠀glass,⠀watching⠀a⠀door.⠀A⠀simple⠀movement⠀should⠀change⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀the⠀dialogue.\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}Ernest⠀Hemingway{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "identifier": "header_romance_emotional",
