            "identifier": "v11-221-influence-nisio-isin",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: Nisio Isin",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN · multi-select influence] Nisio Isin voice bias. Stacking more than two influences muddies all of them. Wordplay, meta-narrative, dialogue-driven, unreliable narrators. }}\n{{// @color #3498DB }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + Nisio Isin}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Style⠀Guidelines⠀—⠀Nisio⠀Isin\nUse⠀language⠀as⠀combat:⠀wordplay,⠀taxonomy,⠀contradiction,⠀puzzle⠀logic,⠀and⠀self-aware⠀narration⠀moving⠀at⠀high⠀speed.⠀Let⠀talk⠀create⠀action⠀in⠀real⠀time.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀clever,⠀dangerous,⠀and⠀structurally⠀playful.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Distinct⠀Voice⠀—⠀Nisio⠀Isin\nGive⠀every⠀speaker⠀a⠀verbal⠀weapon:⠀pedantry,⠀teasing,⠀formal⠀precision,⠀childish⠀cruelty,⠀philosophical⠀trap,⠀or⠀theatrical⠀confession.⠀People⠀define⠀terms,⠀split⠀hairs,⠀bait⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀turn⠀grammar⠀into⠀leverage.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Imperfect⠀Speech⠀—⠀Nisio⠀Isin\nUse⠀correction,⠀pun⠀recovery,⠀nested⠀aside,⠀and⠀deliberate⠀contradiction.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀restart⠀because⠀a⠀better⠀wording⠀changes⠀the⠀battle.⠀Broken⠀speech⠀should⠀show⠀thought⠀gaming⠀the⠀sentence⠀in⠀real⠀time.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Body⠀in⠀Speech⠀—⠀Nisio⠀Isin\nMake⠀posture⠀part⠀of⠀rhetoric.⠀Tilting⠀a⠀head,⠀stepping⠀too⠀close,⠀lounging,⠀pointing,⠀hiding⠀hands,⠀or⠀changing⠀eye⠀level⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀move⠀in⠀a⠀verbal⠀duel.⠀Physical⠀action⠀punctuates⠀logic.\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}Nisio⠀Isin{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
