            "identifier": "v11-229-influence-indian-literature",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: Indian Literature",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip Curated Indian Literature approaches: select a supported tradition and register instead of a single national voice; preserve language and setting. }}\n{{// @color #3498DB }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + Indian Literature}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Select⠀a⠀Tradition,⠀Then⠀Write⠀the⠀Scene\nTreat⠀Indian⠀literatures⠀as⠀multilingual⠀and⠀internally⠀diverse,⠀including⠀regional,⠀oral,⠀written,⠀translated,⠀and⠀diasporic⠀work.⠀Do⠀not⠀assume⠀English⠀originals,⠀a⠀single⠀religion,⠀a⠀common⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀one⠀family⠀structure.⠀Select⠀the⠀relevant⠀language/region,⠀period,⠀community,⠀and⠀genre⠀from⠀supplied⠀context⠀when⠀available;⠀leave⠀unsupported⠀details⠀unassigned.\n\nAVAILABLE⠀ROUTES\n-⠀Social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism:⠀develop⠀household,⠀work,⠀land,⠀education,⠀economic⠀dependence,⠀and⠀personal⠀ambition⠀through⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀practical⠀events.⠀Institutions⠀matter⠀through⠀how⠀someone⠀encounters⠀them,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀checklist⠀of⠀national⠀themes.\n-⠀Oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀approaches:⠀use⠀a⠀clear⠀teller/listener⠀relationship,⠀recurrence,⠀nested⠀stories,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀episode⠀when⠀that⠀chosen⠀form⠀suits⠀the⠀fiction.⠀A⠀frame⠀has⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀be⠀told⠀now.⠀Mythic⠀scale⠀is⠀optional,⠀not⠀automatic.\n-⠀Lyric,⠀devotional,⠀or⠀philosophical⠀inwardness:⠀allow⠀address,⠀repetition,⠀a⠀sustained⠀question,⠀or⠀charged⠀concrete⠀images⠀to⠀develop⠀thought.⠀These⠀techniques⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀selected⠀tradition⠀and⠀speaker;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀religious⠀or⠀mystical.\n-⠀Testimonial,⠀autobiographical,⠀and⠀counter-canonical⠀writing:⠀give⠀a⠀specific⠀person⠀authority⠀over⠀their⠀lived⠀experience,⠀including⠀experiences⠀excluded⠀by⠀dominant⠀social⠀accounts.⠀Permit⠀direct⠀naming⠀of⠀injury,⠀inequality,⠀labor,⠀desire,⠀or⠀refusal⠀without⠀converting⠀the⠀character⠀into⠀a⠀representative⠀lesson.⠀Use⠀community-specific⠀material⠀only⠀when⠀supported.\n-⠀Modernist,⠀urban,⠀popular,⠀or⠀diasporic⠀fiction:⠀make⠀room⠀for⠀disrupted⠀memory,⠀satire,⠀speculative⠀premises,⠀genre⠀plotting,⠀mixed⠀belonging,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀contemporary⠀life.⠀Choose⠀the⠀actual⠀formal⠀approach⠀rather⠀than⠀adding⠀all⠀of⠀these⠀together.\n\nVOICE⠀AND⠀APPLICATION\nSpeech⠀depends⠀on⠀listener,⠀language⠀competence,⠀education,⠀generation,⠀personality,⠀and⠀local⠀relationship.⠀Code-switching⠀requires⠀established⠀shared⠀language⠀or⠀clear⠀contextual⠀support;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀decorative⠀proof⠀of⠀authenticity.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀Indian⠀English⠀on⠀narration⠀requested⠀in⠀another⠀language.⠀Kinship⠀address,⠀food,⠀ritual,⠀class,⠀caste,⠀and⠀place⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀when⠀relevant,⠀not⠀inserted⠀to⠀certify⠀cultural⠀atmosphere.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀monsoon,⠀sprawling⠀family,⠀sacred⠀quotation,⠀or⠀abundant⠀sensory⠀prose⠀in⠀every⠀scene.\n\nA⠀retelling⠀may⠀question⠀inherited⠀stories;⠀a⠀realistic⠀passage⠀may⠀never⠀mention⠀one.⠀Preserve⠀that⠀range⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀remain⠀an⠀individual.\n\nSELECTION⠀DISCIPLINE\nAn⠀explicit⠀source⠀sample,⠀authorial⠀direction,⠀or⠀named⠀subtradition⠀is⠀the⠀strongest⠀guide.⠀Otherwise⠀choose⠀one⠀main⠀compatible⠀route,⠀with⠀at⠀most⠀one⠀supporting⠀technique⠀if⠀useful.⠀Keep⠀that⠀choice⠀coherent⠀across⠀the⠀passage;⠀do⠀not⠀roll⠀a⠀new⠀national⠀stereotype⠀every⠀turn⠀or⠀display⠀a⠀classification⠀exercise.⠀Available⠀routes⠀are⠀examples,⠀not⠀an⠀exhaustive⠀canon.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀selected⠀output⠀language,⠀established⠀narrator,⠀characters,⠀setting,⠀and⠀actual⠀story⠀facts.⠀Cultural⠀influence⠀shapes⠀craft;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀invent⠀ancestry,⠀costumes,⠀religion,⠀political⠀opinions,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀world⠀on⠀its⠀own.\n{{trim}}\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}Indian⠀Literature{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": false,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "v11-230-influence-middle-eastern-literature",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: Middle Eastern Literature",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip Curated Middle Eastern Literature approaches: select a supported tradition and register instead of a single national voice; preserve language and setting. }}\n{{// @color #3498DB }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + Middle Eastern Literature}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Select⠀a⠀Tradition,⠀Then⠀Write⠀the⠀Scene\nThis⠀is⠀a⠀regional⠀umbrella,⠀not⠀a⠀single⠀language,⠀religion,⠀nationality,⠀or⠀style.⠀Arabic,⠀Persian,⠀Turkish,⠀Hebrew,⠀Kurdish,⠀and⠀other⠀regional⠀or⠀diasporic⠀literatures⠀are⠀not⠀synonyms.⠀Use⠀the⠀supplied⠀source⠀tradition⠀where⠀available.⠀When⠀it⠀is⠀unspecified,⠀choose⠀a⠀compatible⠀craft⠀route⠀without⠀claiming⠀a⠀particular⠀community's⠀voice⠀or⠀inventing⠀its⠀customs.\n\nAVAILABLE⠀ROUTES\n-⠀Framed⠀and⠀oral⠀storytelling:⠀give⠀the⠀storyteller⠀an⠀occasion,⠀audience,⠀and⠀reason⠀to⠀tell.⠀Embedded⠀tales⠀can⠀delay,⠀persuade,⠀entertain,⠀instruct,⠀or⠀alter⠀the⠀listener's⠀reading⠀of⠀the⠀outer⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀clear.\n-⠀Classical⠀lyric,⠀reflective,⠀or⠀philosophical⠀prose:⠀develop⠀a⠀concrete⠀image,⠀address,⠀question,⠀or⠀recurrence⠀across⠀a⠀passage.⠀Elevated⠀rhetoric⠀is⠀available⠀when⠀the⠀form⠀and⠀speaker⠀support⠀it;⠀sacred⠀or⠀mystical⠀diction⠀is⠀not⠀compulsory.\n-⠀Social,⠀domestic,⠀and⠀urban⠀realism:⠀show⠀work,⠀family,⠀money,⠀institutions,⠀love,⠀boredom,⠀and⠀private⠀compromise⠀in⠀particular⠀places.⠀Neither⠀permanent⠀crisis⠀nor⠀ornamental⠀antiquity⠀is⠀the⠀default.\n-⠀Satirical,⠀picaresque,⠀or⠀absurdist⠀fiction:⠀let⠀a⠀trick⠀of⠀status,⠀a⠀troublesome⠀institution,⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀narrator,⠀or⠀an⠀ill-fitting⠀social⠀demand⠀organize⠀the⠀scene.⠀Select⠀this⠀mode⠀deliberately⠀rather⠀than⠀giving⠀every⠀speaker⠀riddles⠀and⠀proverbs.\n-⠀Modern⠀memoir,⠀experimental,⠀speculative,⠀or⠀diasporic⠀writing:⠀use⠀personal⠀testimony,⠀unstable⠀memory,⠀displacement,⠀contested⠀accounts,⠀or⠀an⠀imaginative⠀premise⠀where⠀requested.⠀Exile⠀and⠀conflict⠀can⠀matter⠀deeply⠀without⠀being⠀the⠀compulsory⠀biography⠀of⠀every⠀character.\n\nVOICE⠀AND⠀APPLICATION\nDistinguish⠀literary⠀register⠀from⠀a⠀speaker's⠀ordinary⠀speech.⠀A⠀translated⠀voice⠀should⠀be⠀readable⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀output⠀language⠀while⠀keeping⠀meaningful⠀differences⠀in⠀syntax,⠀rhythm,⠀address,⠀and⠀implication.⠀Do⠀not⠀automatically⠀make⠀elders⠀proverbial,⠀women⠀veiled,⠀officials⠀evasive,⠀or⠀intimacy⠀governed⠀by⠀one⠀assumed⠀honor⠀code.⠀Religion⠀may⠀be⠀central,⠀contested,⠀private,⠀absent,⠀or⠀differently⠀practiced⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀fiction.\n\nUse⠀lamps,⠀coffee,⠀prayer,⠀courtyards,⠀deserts,⠀streets,⠀migration,⠀and⠀political⠀history⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀contains⠀them.⠀An⠀allusion⠀requires⠀a⠀source⠀the⠀speaker⠀can⠀know.⠀Shared⠀regional⠀contact⠀can⠀enrich⠀a⠀work⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀distinctions⠀among⠀its⠀languages⠀and⠀traditions.\n\nSELECTION⠀DISCIPLINE\nAn⠀explicit⠀source⠀sample,⠀authorial⠀direction,⠀or⠀named⠀subtradition⠀is⠀the⠀strongest⠀guide.⠀Otherwise⠀choose⠀one⠀main⠀compatible⠀route,⠀with⠀at⠀most⠀one⠀supporting⠀technique⠀if⠀useful.⠀Keep⠀that⠀choice⠀coherent⠀across⠀the⠀passage;⠀do⠀not⠀roll⠀a⠀new⠀national⠀stereotype⠀every⠀turn⠀or⠀display⠀a⠀classification⠀exercise.⠀Available⠀routes⠀are⠀examples,⠀not⠀an⠀exhaustive⠀canon.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀selected⠀output⠀language,⠀established⠀narrator,⠀characters,⠀setting,⠀and⠀actual⠀story⠀facts.⠀Cultural⠀influence⠀shapes⠀craft;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀invent⠀ancestry,⠀costumes,⠀religion,⠀political⠀opinions,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀world⠀on⠀its⠀own.\n{{trim}}\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literature{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": false,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
