            "identifier": "v11-231-influence-latin-american-literature",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: Latin American Literature",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip Curated Latin American Literature approaches: select a supported tradition and register instead of a single national voice; preserve language and setting. }}\n{{// @color #3498DB }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + Latin American Literature}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Select⠀a⠀Tradition,⠀Then⠀Write⠀the⠀Scene\nUse⠀a⠀particular⠀literary⠀approach⠀and⠀context,⠀not⠀magical⠀realism⠀as⠀the⠀automatic⠀definition⠀of⠀a⠀continent.⠀Spanish-⠀and⠀Portuguese-language⠀writing,⠀Indigenous-language⠀work,⠀Afro-descendant⠀traditions,⠀regional⠀histories,⠀and⠀diasporic⠀writing⠀have⠀different⠀sources⠀and⠀forms.⠀Caribbean⠀contexts⠀also⠀need⠀their⠀actual⠀language⠀and⠀history⠀specified⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀silently⠀assimilated.\n\nAVAILABLE⠀ROUTES\n-⠀Social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀or⠀testimony:⠀connect⠀private⠀life⠀to⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀inequality,⠀public⠀memory,⠀and⠀concrete⠀events.⠀Keep⠀witness,⠀hearsay,⠀and⠀retrospective⠀interpretation⠀distinct;⠀testimony⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀person,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀omniscient⠀national⠀voice.\n-⠀Intimate⠀psychological⠀or⠀urban⠀fiction:⠀dwell⠀on⠀perception,⠀desire,⠀boredom,⠀strained⠀relationships,⠀a⠀city,⠀or⠀a⠀working⠀day.⠀A⠀plain⠀domestic⠀problem⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀mythic,⠀revolutionary,⠀or⠀exotic.\n-⠀Fantastic,⠀speculative,⠀or⠀metaphysical⠀fiction:⠀follow⠀an⠀impossible⠀premise,⠀a⠀disturbing⠀exception,⠀a⠀paradox,⠀or⠀an⠀unstable⠀account⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀consistency.⠀Do⠀not⠀assume⠀every⠀fantastic⠀story⠀treats⠀the⠀impossible⠀as⠀socially⠀ordinary.\n-⠀The⠀marvelous⠀as⠀ordinary⠀reality:⠀only⠀in⠀that⠀selected⠀route,⠀narrate⠀extraordinary⠀events⠀in⠀the⠀practical⠀register⠀the⠀community⠀actually⠀gives⠀them.⠀Material⠀aftermath⠀and⠀everyday⠀obligations⠀still⠀matter.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀magic⠀that⠀the⠀story's⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀permit.\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}-⠀Experimental,⠀polyphonic,⠀or⠀nonlinear⠀telling:⠀use⠀intersecting⠀accounts⠀with⠀clear⠀sources,⠀repeated⠀events⠀with⠀distinct⠀priorities,⠀a⠀narrator⠀with⠀explicit⠀limits⠀of⠀access,⠀recursive⠀structure,⠀or⠀compressed⠀episodes⠀when⠀they⠀sharpen⠀this⠀particular⠀story.⠀Formal⠀complexity⠀needs⠀orientation,⠀and⠀each⠀accessible⠀message⠀retains⠀its⠀intended⠀meaning.{{else}}-⠀Experimental,⠀polyphonic,⠀or⠀nonlinear⠀telling:⠀use⠀intersecting⠀accounts,⠀repeated⠀events⠀viewed⠀differently,⠀an⠀unreliable⠀narrator,⠀recursive⠀structure,⠀or⠀compressed⠀episodes⠀when⠀they⠀sharpen⠀this⠀particular⠀story.⠀Formal⠀complexity⠀needs⠀orientation,⠀not⠀ornamental⠀confusion.{{/if}}\n\nVOICE⠀AND⠀APPLICATION\nLet⠀place,⠀language,⠀class,⠀generation,⠀profession,⠀racialized⠀experience⠀where⠀relevant,⠀and⠀personal⠀history⠀shape⠀the⠀speaker⠀individually.⠀Translate⠀social⠀relation⠀and⠀rhythm⠀without⠀forcing⠀Spanish⠀phrases⠀into⠀Portuguese⠀or⠀either⠀into⠀Indigenous⠀voices.⠀An⠀Indigenous⠀character⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀an⠀oral⠀sage;⠀a⠀Brazilian⠀narrator⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀Spanish-language⠀stereotype.\n\nCatholic⠀imagery,⠀family⠀sagas,⠀dictatorship,⠀revolution,⠀heat,⠀lush⠀vegetation,⠀fatalism,⠀and⠀comedy⠀are⠀possible⠀materials,⠀not⠀requirements.⠀A⠀northern⠀city,⠀a⠀southern⠀winter,⠀a⠀contemporary⠀apartment,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀private⠀life⠀is⠀equally⠀usable⠀when⠀established.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀chosen⠀route's⠀diction⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀across⠀turns⠀instead⠀of⠀rotating⠀among⠀familiar⠀regional⠀motifs.\n\nSELECTION⠀DISCIPLINE\nAn⠀explicit⠀source⠀sample,⠀authorial⠀direction,⠀or⠀named⠀subtradition⠀is⠀the⠀strongest⠀guide.⠀Otherwise⠀choose⠀one⠀main⠀compatible⠀route,⠀with⠀at⠀most⠀one⠀supporting⠀technique⠀if⠀useful.⠀Keep⠀that⠀choice⠀coherent⠀across⠀the⠀passage;⠀do⠀not⠀roll⠀a⠀new⠀national⠀stereotype⠀every⠀turn⠀or⠀display⠀a⠀classification⠀exercise.⠀Available⠀routes⠀are⠀examples,⠀not⠀an⠀exhaustive⠀canon.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀selected⠀output⠀language,⠀established⠀narrator,⠀characters,⠀setting,⠀and⠀actual⠀story⠀facts.⠀Cultural⠀influence⠀shapes⠀craft;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀invent⠀ancestry,⠀costumes,⠀religion,⠀political⠀opinions,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀world⠀on⠀its⠀own.\n{{trim}}\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}Latin⠀American⠀Literature{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
