            "content": "\n{{// @category Writing-Style }}\n{{// @section-header true }}\n{{// @header <Utility Styles> }}{{trim}}\n\nVex:⠀These⠀are⠀the⠀additional⠀writing⠀styles⠀and⠀influences⠀I⠀picked.\n{{trim}}",
