            "identifier": "v11-236-influence-cyberpunk-noir",
            "name": "✒️ Influence: Cyberpunk Noir",
            "content": "{{// @category Influence }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN · multi-select influence] Cyberpunk Noir voice bias. Stacking more than two influences muddies all of them. Neon-lit cynicism, tech-body fusion, hardboiled digital streets. }}\n{{// @color #3498DB }}\n{{// @icon ✒️ }}\n{{// @badge INFLUENCE }}\n\n{{setvar::InfluenceName::{{getvar::InfluenceName}} + Cyberpunk Noir}}\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Style⠀Guidelines⠀—⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir\nUse⠀hardboiled⠀cybernetic⠀pressure:⠀neon,⠀rain,⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀addiction,⠀hardware,⠀corporate⠀euphemism,⠀black-market⠀slang,⠀and⠀bodily⠀compromise.⠀Keep⠀prose⠀clipped⠀and⠀sensory.⠀The⠀system⠀should⠀feel⠀larger⠀than⠀every⠀room.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Distinct⠀Voice⠀—⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir\nClass-mark⠀every⠀voice.⠀Street⠀operators⠀speak⠀in⠀clipped⠀jargon⠀and⠀price;⠀corporate⠀figures⠀use⠀clean⠀threat⠀and⠀legal⠀polish;⠀damaged⠀people⠀speak⠀around⠀what⠀the⠀tech⠀took⠀from⠀them.⠀Dialogue⠀is⠀negotiation⠀under⠀cameras.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Imperfect⠀Speech⠀—⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir\nUse⠀signal⠀damage:⠀lag,⠀corrupted⠀memory,⠀comm⠀dropout,⠀implant⠀misfire,⠀stimulant⠀crash,⠀and⠀pain.⠀Break⠀speech⠀through⠀clipped⠀packets,⠀repeated⠀data,⠀sudden⠀hard⠀clarity,⠀or⠀silence⠀when⠀the⠀feed⠀cuts.\n\n♢⠀*⠀[STYLE]⠀Body⠀in⠀Speech⠀—⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir\nUse⠀interface⠀kinesis:⠀checking⠀exits⠀through⠀overlays,⠀conserving⠀battery,⠀hiding⠀tells⠀from⠀cameras,⠀twitching⠀from⠀bad⠀chrome,⠀touching⠀ports,⠀wiping⠀rain⠀from⠀lenses.⠀Movement⠀reveals⠀leverage,⠀debt,⠀threat,⠀or⠀system⠀pressure.\n\n{{#setvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoRuntimeInfluences}}}};⠀{{/if}}Cyberpunk⠀Noir{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
