            "content": "{{// @category Utility }}\n{{// @tooltip [CLASSIC] Swipe-variety module, verbatim. }}\n{{// @color #B8860B }}\n{{// @icon 🛠️ }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::UtilityDirective_SwipeEnhancer::-⠀Swipe⠀Enhancer:⠀Add⠀one⠀genuinely⠀interesting⠀shift⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀risks⠀sameness:⠀a⠀fresh⠀story⠀beat,⠀altered⠀paragraph⠀rhythm,⠀sharper⠀diction,⠀a⠀new⠀conversational⠀angle,⠀an⠀environmental⠀complication,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀move⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀situation.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀random⠀noise.}}\n{{trim}}"
