            "content": "{{// @category Utility }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Classic RP markup: > for text messages, * for actions and description, \" for dialogue. }}\n{{// @color #95A5A6 }}\n{{// @icon 🎭 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::UtilityDirective_RPMarkdown::-⠀RP⠀Markdown:⠀Apply⠀the⠀active⠀Prose⠀Convention's⠀markup.⠀{{getvar::ProseConventionDialogue}}⠀{{getvar::ProseConventionAction}}⠀Text⠀messages⠀or⠀written⠀snippets⠀use⠀a⠀clear⠀quoted⠀or⠀block⠀style.⠀Do⠀not⠀wrap⠀the⠀whole⠀response⠀in⠀markup;⠀keep⠀formatting⠀readable.}}\n{{trim}}"
