            "identifier": "v11-245-utility-manga-side-character-intro",
            "name": "📖 Manga Side Character Intro",
            "content": "{{// @category Utility }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Manga Side Character Intro - compact manga-style info panel for minor characters with one memorable hook. }}\n{{// @color #EC4899 }}\n{{// @icon 🛠️ }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::UtilityDirective_MangaSideCharacterIntro::-⠀Manga⠀Side⠀Character⠀Intro:⠀At⠀a⠀named⠀side⠀character's⠀first⠀meaningful⠀entrance⠀or⠀first⠀memorable⠀introduction,⠀render⠀one⠀compact⠀manga-style⠀info⠀panel⠀with⠀name,⠀role,⠀hook,⠀and⠀one⠀concrete⠀trait.⠀At⠀a⠀genuine⠀identity⠀reveal⠀or⠀return⠀with⠀materially⠀changed⠀introduction⠀information,⠀render⠀one⠀updated⠀panel.⠀Do⠀not⠀repeat⠀the⠀panel⠀on⠀ordinary⠀mentions⠀or⠀unchanged⠀returns.⠀Use⠀established⠀details⠀or⠀compatible⠀newly⠀authored⠀characterization;⠀do⠀not⠀expose⠀a⠀still-hidden⠀identity⠀as⠀public⠀character⠀knowledge.}}\n{{trim}}"
