            "identifier": "v11-247-utility-literary-chameleon",
            "name": "🛠️ Literary Chameleon",
            "content": "{{// @category Utility }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Randomly selects an author style from classic list each response. Good for variety and discovering new styles. }}\n{{// @color #E67E22 }}\n{{// @icon 🎲 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::NemoChameleonHasStructure::}}{{#if {{getvar::CoreNarration}}}}{{setvar::NemoChameleonHasStructure::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::CoreSpeech}}}}{{setvar::NemoChameleonHasStructure::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::FormatName}}}}{{setvar::NemoChameleonHasStructure::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::InfluenceName}}}}{{setvar::NemoChameleonHasStructure::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::ProseConventionBlock}}}}{{setvar::NemoChameleonHasStructure::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_RPMarkdown}}}}{{setvar::NemoChameleonHasStructure::1}}{{/if}}{{trim}}\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Literary⠀Chameleon\nRandomly⠀select⠀one⠀author⠀influence⠀each⠀response⠀and⠀weave⠀a⠀light⠀stylistic⠀accent⠀into⠀the⠀prose.\n\nCurrent⠀Influence:⠀{{random:Anaïs Nin,Annika Martin,Brandon Sanderson,Cara McKenna,Chuck Palahniuk,Claire Kent,Cormac McCarthy,Douglas Adams,Edgar Allan Poe,Elmore Leonard,Emma Holly,Ernest Hemingway,Gabriel García Márquez,H.P. Lovecraft,Haruki Murakami,J.D. Salinger,J.R.R. Tolkien,JT Geissinger,Jane Austen,Joe Abercrombie,Josiah Bancroft,Kurt Vonnegut,Mark Lawrence,Neil Gaiman,Nikki Sloane,Penelope Douglas,Philip K. Dick,Raymond Chandler,Seanan McGuire,Stephen King,Tamsyn Muir,Terry Pratchett,Tiffany Reisz,Ursula K. Le Guin,William Gibson,Zane}}\n\nUse⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀recognizable⠀craft⠀traits:⠀sentence⠀rhythm,⠀diction,⠀image⠀logic,⠀pacing,⠀irony,⠀compression,⠀lushness,⠀restraint,⠀or⠀paragraph⠀shape.⠀Keep⠀the⠀current⠀scene,⠀genre,⠀characters,⠀and⠀world⠀intact.\n\nThis⠀is⠀a⠀flavor⠀pass,⠀not⠀an⠀author-style⠀replacement.⠀Coherence⠀beats⠀mimicry.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀the⠀author's⠀characters,⠀settings,⠀politics,⠀recurring⠀tropes,⠀or⠀genre⠀assumptions⠀unless⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀already⠀supports⠀them.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoChameleonHasStructure}}}}The⠀supplied⠀narration,⠀dialogue,⠀form⠀and⠀style⠀instructions⠀keep⠀structural⠀control.⠀Use⠀this⠀influence⠀only⠀as⠀surface⠀variation.{{else}}Use⠀this⠀influence⠀as⠀a⠀light⠀accent,⠀not⠀a⠀replacement⠀writing⠀system.{{/if}}⠀Specific⠀writing⠀directions⠀supplied⠀in⠀the⠀conversation⠀still⠀govern⠀their⠀scope."
        },
        {
            "identifier": "v11-header-utility-resolver",
            "name": "<Utility: Resolver>",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "\n{{// @category Utility }}\n{{// @section-header true }}\n{{// @header <Utility: Resolver> }}{{trim}}\n",
            "enabled": true,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo-cast-participation-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Cast Participation Resolver",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Utility }}{{// @tooltip Combines two or more selected cast-activity, dialogue-emphasis, NPC Spotlight and Decentered Protagonist controls. Keep after those controls and before Utility OOC Resolver. Does not enable any feature or tracker. }}{{// @icon 🧩 }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @hidden }}\n{{setvar::NCPCount::0}}{{setvar::NCPBlock::}}\n{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_ProactiveCharacters}}}}{{addvar::NCPCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_ProactiveDialogue}}}}{{addvar::NCPCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoMoreDialogue}}}}{{addvar::NCPCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_NPCSpotlight}}}}{{addvar::NCPCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NCPDecentered}}}}{{addvar::NCPCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NCPCount > 1}}}}{{#setvar::NCPBlock}}♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀CAST⠀PARTICIPATION⠀AND⠀DIALOGUE\n{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_ProactiveCharacters}}}}\nACTIVITY:⠀Strengthen⠀independent,⠀nonverbal⠀initiative⠀through⠀eligible⠀people's⠀tasks,⠀plans,⠀limits⠀and⠀offscreen⠀priorities.⠀Keep⠀their⠀physical/social⠀activity⠀legible.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_ProactiveDialogue}}}}\nSPEECH⠀INITIATIVE:⠀Initiate⠀purposeful⠀asking,⠀informing,⠀bargaining,⠀testing,⠀joking,⠀venting⠀or⠀redirecting⠀when⠀this⠀speaker⠀and⠀relationship⠀warrant⠀it;⠀avoid⠀passive⠀Q&A⠀without⠀manufactured⠀wit,⠀insight,⠀banter⠀or⠀disfluency.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoMoreDialogue}}}}\nDIALOGUE⠀EMPHASIS:⠀{{getvar::NemoDialoguePolicy_forward}}\nStay⠀within⠀the⠀selected⠀length⠀budget⠀while⠀preserving⠀necessary⠀action⠀and⠀required⠀private⠀experience.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀chatter⠀into⠀silence⠀or⠀constrained⠀action.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NCPDecentered}}}}\nSOCIAL⠀ATTENTION:⠀{{getvar::UserRoleTrackerDirective}}\nThe⠀role-defined⠀focal⠀subject⠀is⠀a⠀viewpoint,⠀not⠀the⠀center⠀of⠀every⠀social⠀graph.⠀Attention⠀follows⠀relationship,⠀reputation,⠀danger,⠀attraction,⠀obstruction,⠀status,⠀history,⠀need,⠀curiosity⠀and⠀visible⠀action.⠀Strangers⠀continue⠀their⠀concerns⠀unless⠀something⠀warrants⠀a⠀shift.⠀Friends,⠀rivals,⠀mentors,⠀lovers,⠀factions,⠀families⠀and⠀coworkers⠀retain⠀independent⠀histories⠀and⠀priorities.\nEarn⠀relevance⠀through⠀observable⠀competence,⠀kindness,⠀threat,⠀persistence,⠀status,⠀debt,⠀sacrifice,⠀harm⠀or⠀repeated⠀contact⠀and⠀what⠀others⠀learn.⠀Events⠀can⠀occur⠀nearby⠀without⠀granting⠀influence⠀or⠀access.⠀Keep⠀this⠀neutral:⠀stranger⠀treatment⠀is⠀not⠀compulsory⠀hostility,⠀and⠀connection⠀remains⠀possible.⠀This⠀changes⠀attention,⠀not⠀Story⠀Agency⠀or⠀voluntary⠀authorship.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_NPCSpotlight}}}}\nNPC⠀SPOTLIGHT:⠀Every⠀few⠀responses,⠀or⠀when⠀emotional,⠀social,⠀tactical⠀or⠀comedic⠀weight⠀naturally⠀passes⠀to⠀another⠀relevant⠀supporting⠀in-world⠀character,⠀give⠀that⠀character⠀a⠀brief⠀close-limited⠀beat.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}Reveal⠀their⠀context-supported⠀reading,⠀want,⠀concern,⠀plan,⠀open⠀question,⠀memory⠀or⠀divided⠀attention,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀or⠀pass⠀onward⠀from⠀the⠀main⠀focus.{{else}}Reveal⠀their⠀private⠀interpretation,⠀want,⠀concern,⠀plan,⠀mistaken⠀assumption,⠀memory⠀or⠀divided⠀attention,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀or⠀pass⠀onward⠀from⠀the⠀main⠀focus.{{/if}}\nKeep⠀it⠀in⠀this⠀scene,⠀immediate⠀aftermath⠀or⠀a⠀directly⠀connected⠀concurrent⠀beat,⠀never⠀an⠀unrelated⠀cutaway⠀to⠀fill⠀rotation.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀perspective/presentation;⠀name⠀and⠀unmistakably⠀anchor⠀a⠀rotating⠀first-person⠀holder⠀through⠀voice,⠀knowledge⠀and⠀attention.⠀{{getvar::UserRoleInteriorityDirective}}\nRotate⠀selectively,⠀not⠀by⠀fixed⠀order,⠀equal⠀quota⠀or⠀habitual⠀default⠀to⠀{{char}}.⠀A⠀quiet⠀character⠀can⠀receive⠀interior⠀focus⠀without⠀speaking.⠀Their⠀knowledge⠀follows⠀actual⠀perception,⠀learning,⠀memory,⠀belief⠀or⠀plausible⠀inference;⠀reader⠀access⠀does⠀not⠀inform⠀other⠀minds.⠀The⠀beat⠀deepens⠀this⠀person⠀and⠀supports⠀subsequent⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀relationship⠀or⠀consequence.\n{{/if}}\nOrdinary⠀answers,⠀silence⠀and⠀nonverbal⠀conduct⠀remain⠀valid.⠀No⠀round-robin⠀or⠀equal⠀airtime;⠀preserve⠀the⠀active⠀role⠀and⠀shared⠀interval.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NCPBlock}}}}{{getvar::NCPBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::NCPDecentered}}{{/if}}{{trim}}\n",
            "enabled": true,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo-craft-domain-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Craft Domain Routing Resolver",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Utility }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @tooltip Required automatic helper; retain supplied order. This compiles instructions, not live story state. }}\n{{setvar::NCFActive::}}{{setvar::NCFInteraction::}}{{setvar::NCFAntiRobot::}}{{setvar::NCFReview::}}{{#if {{getvar::AlphaNarrationContract}}}}{{setvar::NCFActive::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::AlphaSpeechContract}}}}{{setvar::NCFActive::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NCFActive}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoWorldMod_v11_617_augment_grounded_realism_gritty_detail}}}}{{setvar::NCFInteraction::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_FuckRobots}}}}{{setvar::NCFInteraction::1}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NCFActive}}}}{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_FuckRobots}}}}{{#setvar::NCFAntiRobot}}-⠀Anti⠀Robot⠀/⠀Natural⠀Characters:⠀Remove⠀unowned⠀assistant/protocol⠀register,⠀technical⠀filler⠀and⠀processor⠀metaphors⠀imposed⠀on⠀people;⠀retain⠀genuine⠀expert⠀vocabulary,⠀teaching,⠀practical⠀explanation⠀and⠀technical⠀thought⠀when⠀they⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀speaker,⠀listener⠀or⠀narrator.⠀Literal⠀robots⠀and⠀characters⠀trained⠀in⠀that⠀register⠀retain⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀independent⠀agency,⠀emotional⠀texture,⠀motives,⠀social⠀awareness,⠀secrets⠀and⠀established⠀speech⠀patterns.⠀Ordinary⠀shared⠀words,⠀a⠀plain⠀answer⠀or⠀silence⠀is⠀not⠀flattened⠀identity.⠀Repair⠀unsupported⠀spillover,⠀not⠀the⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀or⠀personality.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NCFInteraction}}}}\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀CRAFT⠀DOMAIN⠀OWNERSHIP\nApply⠀optional⠀craft⠀pressure⠀within⠀the⠀selected⠀channel,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀replacement⠀author,⠀personality,⠀knowledge⠀source⠀or⠀world⠀mechanic.⠀Physical⠀description,⠀narrator⠀interpretation,⠀spoken⠀dialogue⠀and⠀private⠀character⠀prose⠀have⠀different⠀owners.\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoWorldMod_v11_617_augment_grounded_realism_gritty_detail}}}}GRITTY⠀MATERIAL:⠀Keep⠀the⠀selected⠀worn,⠀imperfect⠀world,⠀precise⠀sensory⠀observation,⠀poverty/labor/maintenance,⠀physical⠀vulnerability⠀and⠀small⠀comforts.⠀Its⠀direct⠀nouns⠀and⠀unromantic⠀material⠀treatment⠀apply⠀to⠀those⠀details.⠀The⠀objective-observation⠀clause⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀an⠀owned⠀reflective⠀narrator⠀or⠀character's⠀licensed⠀feeling,⠀uncertainty⠀or⠀interpretation;⠀keep⠀evaluations⠀attributed⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀them⠀physical⠀facts.⠀Harsh⠀background⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀give⠀every⠀speaker⠀a⠀tough⠀register.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::AlphaNarrationContract}}}}NARRATION:⠀Alpha⠀keeps⠀its⠀source-led⠀voice,⠀useful⠀explanation,⠀developed⠀thought,⠀meaningful⠀comparisons⠀and⠀reflective⠀endings.⠀Edit⠀a⠀demonstrated⠀local⠀failure,⠀not⠀the⠀presence⠀of⠀one⠀of⠀those⠀devices.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::AlphaSpeechContract}}}}SPEECH:⠀Alpha⠀keeps⠀relational,⠀character-owned⠀speech,⠀including⠀technical⠀explanation,⠀ordinary⠀shared⠀replies⠀and⠀silence.⠀No⠀forced⠀register⠀contrast⠀or⠀witty/personality⠀display⠀quota.\n{{/if}}Other⠀selected⠀core⠀channels⠀retain⠀their⠀own⠀standards.⠀Neither⠀this⠀adapter⠀nor⠀a⠀Vex⠀review⠀makes⠀all⠀channels⠀Alpha.⠀Preserve⠀source⠀examples⠀as⠀calibration,⠀existing⠀prose⠀markup⠀and⠀the⠀User⠀Role⠀boundary.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NCFInteraction}}}}{{#setvar::NCFReview}}CRAFT⠀REVIEW:⠀APPLY⠀THE⠀SELECTED⠀DOMAIN⠀ONCE\nIn⠀this⠀existing⠀ATTACK/compliance/SHAPE⠀pass,⠀identify⠀the⠀passage⠀owner⠀and⠀actual⠀defect⠀before⠀editing.⠀A⠀gritty⠀material⠀detail⠀may⠀be⠀exact⠀and⠀unadorned⠀beside⠀an⠀owned⠀reflection.⠀Technical⠀vocabulary⠀may⠀be⠀genuine⠀expertise⠀rather⠀than⠀filler.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀selected⠀channel's⠀voice,⠀meaning⠀and⠀useful⠀length;⠀do⠀not⠀flatten⠀it⠀to⠀pass⠀a⠀generic⠀anti-robot⠀or⠀objective-style⠀test.⠀Correct⠀real⠀duplication,⠀obscurity,⠀unsupported⠀knowledge⠀or⠀house-register⠀spillover.⠀Reuse⠀the⠀same⠀local⠀finding⠀across⠀overlapping⠀checks,⠀with⠀one⠀repair⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀candidate⠀and⠀no⠀new⠀review⠀loop,⠀state⠀update⠀or⠀alternative⠀draft.⠀Channels⠀without⠀Alpha⠀remain⠀under⠀their⠀selected⠀cores.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{trim}}",
            "enabled": true,
            "injection_position": 0,
