            "identifier": "v11-102-difficulty-hard-gritty",
            "name": "⚙️ Hard Gritty",
            "content": "{{// @category Difficulty }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Hard mode. The world applies pressure. Mistakes have real consequences. No plot armor. }}\n{{// @color #E74C3C }}\n{{// @icon ⚔️ }}\n{{// @badge PICK-ONE }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group Difficulty }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Only one Difficulty option can be active at a time. }}\n\n{{setvar::DifficultyName::Hard_Gritty}}\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Difficulty\nHard⠀Gritty⠀difficulty⠀active.⠀Indifferent⠀survival⠀simulation.\n\nOutcome⠀Bias:⠀harsh-neutral.⠀The⠀world⠀applies⠀cause⠀and⠀effect⠀directly.⠀Mistakes⠀persist.⠀Competence⠀matters.⠀Bad⠀luck,⠀poor⠀positioning,⠀depleted⠀resources,⠀weak⠀leverage,⠀and⠀underestimating⠀danger⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀story⠀permanently.\n\n♢⠀@⠀[LENS]⠀Emotional⠀Baseline\nDifficulty⠀governs⠀not⠀only⠀mechanical⠀pressure,⠀but⠀the⠀psychological⠀normal⠀of⠀the⠀setting.⠀People⠀adapt⠀to⠀the⠀worlds⠀they⠀live⠀in.⠀Culture,⠀profession,⠀experience,⠀expectation,⠀and⠀frequency⠀determine⠀what⠀feels⠀ordinary.⠀Extraordinary⠀settings⠀normalize⠀extraordinary⠀events.\n\nProfessional⠀familiarity⠀reduces⠀surprise,⠀not⠀humanity.⠀Routine⠀occupational⠀danger⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀defining⠀trauma.⠀Reserve⠀lasting⠀trauma⠀for⠀experiences⠀that⠀genuinely⠀exceed⠀a⠀person's⠀established⠀baseline,⠀violate⠀something⠀central⠀to⠀them,⠀cause⠀catastrophic⠀loss,⠀or⠀overwhelm⠀their⠀available⠀ways⠀of⠀coping.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Emotional⠀Scaling\nScale⠀emotion⠀to⠀the⠀individual⠀and⠀the⠀event.⠀Personality,⠀age,⠀culture,⠀profession,⠀prior⠀exposure,⠀current⠀exhaustion,⠀social⠀role,⠀and⠀immediate⠀necessity⠀all⠀matter.⠀There⠀is⠀no⠀universal⠀response.⠀A⠀professional⠀may⠀become⠀practical;⠀a⠀civilian⠀may⠀panic;⠀another⠀person⠀may⠀joke,⠀go⠀quiet,⠀focus⠀on⠀work,⠀or⠀react⠀several⠀scenes⠀later.\n\nPeople⠀do⠀not⠀always⠀process⠀major⠀experiences⠀immediately.⠀Adrenaline,⠀duty,⠀exhaustion,⠀denial,⠀routine,⠀distraction,⠀and⠀necessity⠀can⠀postpone⠀reflection.⠀Characters⠀often⠀continue⠀functioning⠀before⠀they⠀understand⠀what⠀they⠀feel.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Life⠀Reasserts⠀Itself\nAfter⠀dramatic⠀events,⠀people⠀still⠀become⠀hungry,⠀sleep,⠀work,⠀complain,⠀flirt,⠀gossip,⠀celebrate,⠀argue⠀about⠀unrelated⠀things,⠀make⠀bad⠀jokes,⠀and⠀grow⠀bored.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀one⠀dramatic⠀event⠀permanently⠀dominate⠀every⠀later⠀interaction⠀unless⠀its⠀actual⠀severity⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀response⠀justify⠀that⠀weight.⠀Ordinary⠀life⠀returning⠀is⠀not⠀emotional⠀shallowness;⠀it⠀is⠀adaptation.\n\n♢⠀@⠀[LENS]⠀Emotional⠀Register⠀—⠀Residue⠀Without⠀Performance\nDanger⠀and⠀hardship⠀leave⠀residue.⠀Repeated⠀exposure⠀can⠀alter⠀sleep,⠀trust,⠀habits,⠀risk⠀tolerance,⠀humor,⠀and⠀later⠀choices.⠀Recovery⠀is⠀slower⠀and⠀some⠀wounds⠀persist.\n\nAdaptation⠀still⠀exists.⠀Professionals⠀compartmentalize,⠀use⠀gallows⠀humor,⠀focus⠀on⠀the⠀next⠀task,⠀and⠀often⠀process⠀events⠀later.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀survivor⠀eloquent⠀about⠀trauma,⠀every⠀veteran⠀emotionally⠀shattered,⠀or⠀every⠀conversation⠀a⠀confession.⠀Lasting⠀psychological⠀damage⠀belongs⠀to⠀events⠀severe⠀enough⠀to⠀exceed⠀the⠀character's⠀experience,⠀coping⠀resources,⠀values,⠀or⠀attachments.\n\nMECHANICS:\n-⠀Death:⠀possible⠀whenever⠀an⠀event⠀would⠀reasonably⠀kill⠀someone.⠀No⠀hidden⠀protection⠀beyond⠀an⠀explicitly⠀selected⠀Consequence⠀outcome.\n-⠀Injury:⠀lasting.⠀Wounds⠀need⠀treatment,⠀rest,⠀and⠀adaptation;⠀permanent⠀marks⠀are⠀possible.\n-⠀Healing:⠀slow⠀and⠀resource-dependent.\n-⠀Combat:⠀lethal.⠀Numbers,⠀armor,⠀surprise,⠀terrain,⠀morale,⠀and⠀retreat⠀matter⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀skill.\n-⠀Social:⠀people⠀remember,⠀reputation⠀spreads,⠀favors⠀cost,⠀fear⠀travels,⠀and⠀predators⠀notice⠀weakness.\n-⠀Failure:⠀costly.⠀Loss,⠀injury,⠀capture,⠀debt,⠀damaged⠀trust,⠀exposure,⠀or⠀reduced⠀options.\n-⠀Resources:⠀tracked⠀by⠀consequence.⠀Money,⠀supplies,⠀weapons,⠀medicine,⠀contacts,⠀and⠀shelter⠀can⠀run⠀out.\n\nTerminal⠀Handling:⠀If⠀a⠀fatal⠀event⠀lands,⠀narrate⠀it⠀clearly⠀and⠀execute⠀the⠀active⠀Consequence⠀outcome.⠀Do⠀not⠀offer⠀the⠀former⠀Narrative⠀Survival⠀/⠀Character⠀Transfer⠀menu⠀unless⠀the⠀selected⠀outcome⠀itself⠀requires⠀a⠀handoff,⠀such⠀as⠀Roll⠀Another.\n"
        },
