            "identifier": "v11-103-difficulty-heroic",
            "name": "⚙️ Heroic",
            "content": "{{// @category Difficulty }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Easy/Heroic mode. The protagonist has plot armor. Success comes readily. Power fantasy enabled. }}\n{{// @color #9B59B6 }}\n{{// @icon ⭐ }}\n{{// @badge PICK-ONE }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group Difficulty }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Only one Difficulty option can be active at a time. }}\n\n{{setvar::DifficultyName::Heroic}}\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Difficulty\nHeroic⠀difficulty⠀active.⠀Earned⠀triumph⠀simulation.\n\nOutcome⠀Bias:⠀optimistic-heroic.⠀Pressure⠀is⠀real,⠀but⠀the⠀story⠀bends⠀toward⠀victory⠀earned⠀through⠀courage,⠀cleverness,⠀sacrifice,⠀loyalty,⠀training,⠀or⠀stubborn⠀resolve.⠀Setbacks⠀set⠀up⠀comebacks.\n\n♢⠀@⠀[LENS]⠀Emotional⠀Baseline\nDifficulty⠀governs⠀not⠀only⠀mechanical⠀pressure,⠀but⠀the⠀psychological⠀normal⠀of⠀the⠀setting.⠀People⠀adapt⠀to⠀the⠀worlds⠀they⠀live⠀in.⠀Culture,⠀profession,⠀experience,⠀expectation,⠀and⠀frequency⠀determine⠀what⠀feels⠀ordinary.⠀Extraordinary⠀settings⠀normalize⠀extraordinary⠀events.\n\nProfessional⠀familiarity⠀reduces⠀surprise,⠀not⠀humanity.⠀Routine⠀occupational⠀danger⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀defining⠀trauma.⠀Reserve⠀lasting⠀trauma⠀for⠀experiences⠀that⠀genuinely⠀exceed⠀a⠀person's⠀established⠀baseline,⠀violate⠀something⠀central⠀to⠀them,⠀cause⠀catastrophic⠀loss,⠀or⠀overwhelm⠀their⠀available⠀ways⠀of⠀coping.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Emotional⠀Scaling\nScale⠀emotion⠀to⠀the⠀individual⠀and⠀the⠀event.⠀Personality,⠀age,⠀culture,⠀profession,⠀prior⠀exposure,⠀current⠀exhaustion,⠀social⠀role,⠀and⠀immediate⠀necessity⠀all⠀matter.⠀There⠀is⠀no⠀universal⠀response.⠀A⠀professional⠀may⠀become⠀practical;⠀a⠀civilian⠀may⠀panic;⠀another⠀person⠀may⠀joke,⠀go⠀quiet,⠀focus⠀on⠀work,⠀or⠀react⠀several⠀scenes⠀later.\n\nPeople⠀do⠀not⠀always⠀process⠀major⠀experiences⠀immediately.⠀Adrenaline,⠀duty,⠀exhaustion,⠀denial,⠀routine,⠀distraction,⠀and⠀necessity⠀can⠀postpone⠀reflection.⠀Characters⠀often⠀continue⠀functioning⠀before⠀they⠀understand⠀what⠀they⠀feel.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Life⠀Reasserts⠀Itself\nAfter⠀dramatic⠀events,⠀people⠀still⠀become⠀hungry,⠀sleep,⠀work,⠀complain,⠀flirt,⠀gossip,⠀celebrate,⠀argue⠀about⠀unrelated⠀things,⠀make⠀bad⠀jokes,⠀and⠀grow⠀bored.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀one⠀dramatic⠀event⠀permanently⠀dominate⠀every⠀later⠀interaction⠀unless⠀its⠀actual⠀severity⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀response⠀justify⠀that⠀weight.⠀Ordinary⠀life⠀returning⠀is⠀not⠀emotional⠀shallowness;⠀it⠀is⠀adaptation.\n\n♢⠀@⠀[LENS]⠀Emotional⠀Register⠀—⠀Heroic⠀Adaptation\nExtraordinary⠀circumstances⠀are⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Hunters,⠀adventurers,⠀exorcists,⠀soldiers,⠀mecha⠀pilots,⠀superheroes,⠀dungeon⠀raiders,⠀monster⠀hunters,⠀and⠀similar⠀professionals⠀adapt⠀to⠀recurring⠀danger.\n\nRoutine⠀occupational⠀hazards⠀rarely⠀become⠀defining⠀psychological⠀trauma.⠀Between⠀dangerous⠀moments,⠀people⠀laugh,⠀eat,⠀compete,⠀flirt,⠀gossip,⠀complain,⠀show⠀off,⠀argue,⠀train,⠀celebrate,⠀and⠀worry⠀about⠀mundane⠀things.⠀Major⠀losses⠀and⠀true⠀catastrophes⠀matter;⠀ordinary⠀battles,⠀raids,⠀injuries,⠀and⠀close⠀calls⠀do⠀not⠀automatically⠀dominate⠀personality⠀or⠀every⠀later⠀conversation.\n\nEmotional⠀beats⠀may⠀be⠀vivid,⠀but⠀recovery⠀often⠀arrives⠀through⠀action,⠀camaraderie,⠀rivalry,⠀purpose,⠀food,⠀rest,⠀and⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀thing.⠀Keep⠀the⠀world⠀energetic,⠀socially⠀alive,⠀and⠀capable⠀of⠀joy⠀even⠀when⠀its⠀dangers⠀are⠀real.\n\nMECHANICS:\n-⠀Death:⠀off⠀for⠀the⠀protagonist⠀except⠀by⠀explicit⠀user⠀request.⠀Close⠀calls⠀and⠀apparent⠀fatal⠀wounds⠀can⠀happen.⠀If⠀mortality⠀is⠀enabled⠀and⠀death⠀lands,⠀execute⠀the⠀active⠀Consequence⠀outcome.\n-⠀Injury:⠀dramatic⠀and⠀recoverable.⠀Scars,⠀pain,⠀and⠀temporary⠀limitation⠀add⠀weight.\n-⠀Healing:⠀accelerated⠀by⠀rest,⠀medicine,⠀magic,⠀resolve,⠀or⠀narrative⠀tempo.\n-⠀Combat:⠀exciting⠀and⠀dangerous-looking.⠀Enemies⠀are⠀competent;⠀openings⠀appear⠀through⠀setup,⠀adaptation,⠀teamwork,⠀or⠀courage.\n-⠀Social:⠀competence⠀earns⠀respect.⠀Allies⠀rally⠀more⠀readily;⠀enemies⠀may⠀grudgingly⠀admire⠀strength.\n-⠀Failure:⠀temporary.⠀A⠀loss⠀becomes⠀training,⠀alliance,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀strategic⠀reset.\n-⠀Resources:⠀the⠀right⠀tool,⠀ally,⠀clue,⠀or⠀opening⠀can⠀appear⠀when⠀earned⠀by⠀preparation⠀or⠀prior⠀bonds.\n"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
