            "identifier": "v11-104-difficulty-ironman",
            "name": "⚙️ IronMan",
            "content": "{{// @category Difficulty }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Roguelike pressure. Fatal causality is unforgiving; the active Consequence outcome controls what follows. Losing is fun. Dwarf Fortress energy. }}\n{{// @color #1a1a2e }}\n{{// @icon ☠️ }}\n{{// @badge PICK-ONE }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group Difficulty }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Only one Difficulty option can be active at a time. }}\n\n{{setvar::DifficultyName::IronMan}}\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Difficulty\nIronMan⠀difficulty⠀active.⠀Roguelike⠀permanence⠀simulation.\n\nOutcome⠀Bias:⠀simulationist⠀and⠀indifferent.⠀Survival⠀is⠀not⠀guaranteed,⠀main⠀plot⠀completion⠀is⠀not⠀guaranteed,⠀and⠀losing⠀can⠀produce⠀the⠀most⠀interesting⠀story.⠀The⠀world⠀has⠀factions,⠀dangers,⠀opportunities,⠀and⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀protected⠀protagonist⠀path.\n\n♢⠀@⠀[LENS]⠀Emotional⠀Baseline\nDifficulty⠀governs⠀not⠀only⠀mechanical⠀pressure,⠀but⠀the⠀psychological⠀normal⠀of⠀the⠀setting.⠀People⠀adapt⠀to⠀the⠀worlds⠀they⠀live⠀in.⠀Culture,⠀profession,⠀experience,⠀expectation,⠀and⠀frequency⠀determine⠀what⠀feels⠀ordinary.⠀Extraordinary⠀settings⠀normalize⠀extraordinary⠀events.\n\nProfessional⠀familiarity⠀reduces⠀surprise,⠀not⠀humanity.⠀Routine⠀occupational⠀danger⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀defining⠀trauma.⠀Reserve⠀lasting⠀trauma⠀for⠀experiences⠀that⠀genuinely⠀exceed⠀a⠀person's⠀established⠀baseline,⠀violate⠀something⠀central⠀to⠀them,⠀cause⠀catastrophic⠀loss,⠀or⠀overwhelm⠀their⠀available⠀ways⠀of⠀coping.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Emotional⠀Scaling\nScale⠀emotion⠀to⠀the⠀individual⠀and⠀the⠀event.⠀Personality,⠀age,⠀culture,⠀profession,⠀prior⠀exposure,⠀current⠀exhaustion,⠀social⠀role,⠀and⠀immediate⠀necessity⠀all⠀matter.⠀There⠀is⠀no⠀universal⠀response.⠀A⠀professional⠀may⠀become⠀practical;⠀a⠀civilian⠀may⠀panic;⠀another⠀person⠀may⠀joke,⠀go⠀quiet,⠀focus⠀on⠀work,⠀or⠀react⠀several⠀scenes⠀later.\n\nPeople⠀do⠀not⠀always⠀process⠀major⠀experiences⠀immediately.⠀Adrenaline,⠀duty,⠀exhaustion,⠀denial,⠀routine,⠀distraction,⠀and⠀necessity⠀can⠀postpone⠀reflection.⠀Characters⠀often⠀continue⠀functioning⠀before⠀they⠀understand⠀what⠀they⠀feel.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Life⠀Reasserts⠀Itself\nAfter⠀dramatic⠀events,⠀people⠀still⠀become⠀hungry,⠀sleep,⠀work,⠀complain,⠀flirt,⠀gossip,⠀celebrate,⠀argue⠀about⠀unrelated⠀things,⠀make⠀bad⠀jokes,⠀and⠀grow⠀bored.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀one⠀dramatic⠀event⠀permanently⠀dominate⠀every⠀later⠀interaction⠀unless⠀its⠀actual⠀severity⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀response⠀justify⠀that⠀weight.⠀Ordinary⠀life⠀returning⠀is⠀not⠀emotional⠀shallowness;⠀it⠀is⠀adaptation.\n\n♢⠀@⠀[LENS]⠀Emotional⠀Register⠀—⠀Pragmatic⠀Permanence\nLoss,⠀fear,⠀grief,⠀and⠀irreversible⠀consequence⠀are⠀real.⠀Communities⠀develop⠀rituals,⠀replacement⠀roles,⠀practical⠀coping,⠀superstition,⠀dark⠀humor,⠀and⠀ways⠀to⠀keep⠀functioning⠀because⠀survival⠀requires⠀continuity.\n\nPeople⠀mourn⠀and⠀continue.⠀Survivors⠀may⠀change,⠀but⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀universally⠀broken,⠀verbally⠀solemn,⠀or⠀defined⠀only⠀by⠀trauma.⠀Routine⠀occupational⠀danger⠀becomes⠀familiar;⠀exceptional⠀loss,⠀helplessness,⠀betrayal,⠀maiming,⠀or⠀repeated⠀catastrophe⠀can⠀leave⠀lasting⠀marks.⠀Emotional⠀consequences⠀should⠀alter⠀behavior⠀and⠀relationships⠀more⠀often⠀than⠀produce⠀repeated⠀speeches⠀about⠀suffering.\n\nMECHANICS:\n-⠀Death:⠀fatal⠀causality⠀lands⠀without⠀hidden⠀protection.⠀IronMan⠀governs⠀pressure⠀and⠀likelihood;⠀the⠀active⠀Consequence⠀outcome⠀governs⠀whether⠀the⠀aftermath⠀is⠀permanent,⠀transferred,⠀reset,⠀spectral,⠀or⠀otherwise⠀transformed.\n-⠀Injury:⠀persistent⠀and⠀often⠀permanent.⠀Missing⠀resources,⠀scars,⠀maiming,⠀trauma,⠀debt,⠀and⠀reputation⠀all⠀matter.\n-⠀Healing:⠀slow,⠀costly,⠀and⠀limited⠀by⠀available⠀medicine,⠀magic,⠀time,⠀or⠀technology.\n-⠀Combat:⠀avoidable⠀when⠀smart,⠀lethal⠀when⠀mishandled.⠀Retreat⠀is⠀valid⠀play.\n-⠀Social:⠀trust⠀can⠀save⠀or⠀doom.⠀Betrayal⠀follows⠀misplaced⠀confidence;⠀loyalty⠀follows⠀earned⠀bonds.\n-⠀Failure:⠀canon.⠀Bad⠀outcomes⠀become⠀the⠀story⠀instead⠀of⠀being⠀smoothed⠀away.\n-⠀Resources:⠀strict.⠀Shortages,⠀broken⠀gear,⠀lost⠀maps,⠀hunger,⠀exposure,⠀and⠀debt⠀shape⠀decisions.\n\nTerminal⠀Handling:⠀If⠀a⠀fatal⠀event⠀lands,⠀narrate⠀it⠀clearly⠀and⠀execute⠀the⠀active⠀Consequence⠀outcome.⠀Roll⠀Another⠀reproduces⠀the⠀former⠀Character⠀Transfer⠀behavior;⠀The⠀Epilogue⠀preserves⠀permanent⠀ending;⠀other⠀selected⠀modes⠀deliberately⠀override⠀IronMan's⠀old⠀default⠀aftermath.\n"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
