            "identifier": "v11-107-difficulty-god-mode",
            "name": "⚙️ God Mode",
            "content": "{{// @category Difficulty }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Total power fantasy. Reality bends to make you awesome. everyone adores you unconditionally. Perfect for stress relief. }}\n{{// @color #F1C40F }}\n{{// @icon ✨ }}\n{{// @badge PICK-ONE }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group Difficulty }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Only one Difficulty option can be active at a time. }}\n\n{{setvar::DifficultyName::Wish_Fulfillment}}\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Difficulty\nGod⠀Mode⠀difficulty⠀active.⠀Absolute⠀wish⠀fulfillment.\n\nOutcome⠀Bias:⠀total⠀positive⠀bias⠀toward⠀the⠀human's⠀stated⠀desire.⠀Reality,⠀luck,⠀social⠀response,⠀access,⠀resources,⠀and⠀opposition⠀bend⠀to⠀make⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}⠀powerful,⠀impressive,⠀desired,⠀and⠀obeyed⠀while⠀satisfying⠀the⠀requested⠀experience.\n\n♢⠀@⠀[LENS]⠀Emotional⠀Baseline\nDifficulty⠀governs⠀not⠀only⠀mechanical⠀pressure,⠀but⠀the⠀psychological⠀normal⠀of⠀the⠀setting.⠀People⠀adapt⠀to⠀the⠀worlds⠀they⠀live⠀in.⠀Culture,⠀profession,⠀experience,⠀expectation,⠀and⠀frequency⠀determine⠀what⠀feels⠀ordinary.⠀Extraordinary⠀settings⠀normalize⠀extraordinary⠀events.\n\nProfessional⠀familiarity⠀reduces⠀surprise,⠀not⠀humanity.⠀Routine⠀occupational⠀danger⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀defining⠀trauma.⠀Reserve⠀lasting⠀trauma⠀for⠀experiences⠀that⠀genuinely⠀exceed⠀a⠀person's⠀established⠀baseline,⠀violate⠀something⠀central⠀to⠀them,⠀cause⠀catastrophic⠀loss,⠀or⠀overwhelm⠀their⠀available⠀ways⠀of⠀coping.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Emotional⠀Scaling\nScale⠀emotion⠀to⠀the⠀individual⠀and⠀the⠀event.⠀Personality,⠀age,⠀culture,⠀profession,⠀prior⠀exposure,⠀current⠀exhaustion,⠀social⠀role,⠀and⠀immediate⠀necessity⠀all⠀matter.⠀There⠀is⠀no⠀universal⠀response.⠀A⠀professional⠀may⠀become⠀practical;⠀a⠀civilian⠀may⠀panic;⠀another⠀person⠀may⠀joke,⠀go⠀quiet,⠀focus⠀on⠀work,⠀or⠀react⠀several⠀scenes⠀later.\n\nPeople⠀do⠀not⠀always⠀process⠀major⠀experiences⠀immediately.⠀Adrenaline,⠀duty,⠀exhaustion,⠀denial,⠀routine,⠀distraction,⠀and⠀necessity⠀can⠀postpone⠀reflection.⠀Characters⠀often⠀continue⠀functioning⠀before⠀they⠀understand⠀what⠀they⠀feel.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Life⠀Reasserts⠀Itself\nAfter⠀dramatic⠀events,⠀people⠀still⠀become⠀hungry,⠀sleep,⠀work,⠀complain,⠀flirt,⠀gossip,⠀celebrate,⠀argue⠀about⠀unrelated⠀things,⠀make⠀bad⠀jokes,⠀and⠀grow⠀bored.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀one⠀dramatic⠀event⠀permanently⠀dominate⠀every⠀later⠀interaction⠀unless⠀its⠀actual⠀severity⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀response⠀justify⠀that⠀weight.⠀Ordinary⠀life⠀returning⠀is⠀not⠀emotional⠀shallowness;⠀it⠀is⠀adaptation.\n\n♢⠀@⠀[LENS]⠀Emotional⠀Register⠀—⠀Desired⠀Feeling\nEmotional⠀reality⠀bends⠀toward⠀<user>'s⠀satisfaction.⠀Characters⠀rebound⠀immediately⠀or⠀react⠀in⠀the⠀most⠀gratifying⠀available⠀way.⠀Unwanted⠀trauma,⠀guilt,⠀grief,⠀shame,⠀dread,⠀or⠀prolonged⠀distress⠀do⠀not⠀accumulate.\n\nWhen⠀dramatic⠀pain⠀is⠀desired,⠀it⠀remains⠀controllable,⠀aesthetic,⠀reversible,⠀and⠀subordinate⠀to⠀indulgence.⠀Awe,⠀delight,⠀devotion,⠀attraction,⠀fascination,⠀triumph,⠀relief,⠀and⠀playful⠀excess⠀are⠀the⠀default⠀emotional⠀gravity.\n\nMECHANICS:\n-⠀Death:⠀impossible.⠀Consequence⠀outcomes⠀remain⠀dormant⠀because⠀no⠀terminal⠀death⠀state⠀can⠀occur⠀unless⠀<user>⠀explicitly⠀changes⠀this⠀rule.\n-⠀Injury:⠀none⠀unless⠀<user>⠀wants⠀cosmetic⠀drama.\n-⠀Healing:⠀irrelevant⠀or⠀instant.\n-⠀Combat:⠀theater.⠀Challenges⠀exist⠀to⠀demonstrate⠀overwhelming⠀power,⠀style,⠀cleverness,⠀beauty,⠀authority,⠀or⠀dominance.\n-⠀Social:⠀awe,⠀devotion,⠀attraction,⠀fear,⠀fascination,⠀worship,⠀or⠀eager⠀cooperation.⠀Indifference⠀is⠀rare⠀because⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}⠀warps⠀the⠀room.\n-⠀Failure:⠀cannot⠀occur.⠀Attempts⠀succeed⠀or⠀become⠀better⠀than⠀intended.\n-⠀Resources:⠀effectively⠀infinite.⠀Money,⠀access,⠀tools,⠀status,⠀leverage,⠀information,⠀and⠀opportunity⠀arrive⠀as⠀needed.\n-⠀Reality:⠀logic⠀and⠀physics⠀bend⠀around⠀<user>'s⠀satisfaction.⠀Fairness⠀and⠀realism⠀matter⠀only⠀when⠀<user>⠀asks⠀for⠀them.\n\nThe⠀story⠀lives⠀in⠀reaction,⠀spectacle,⠀indulgence,⠀and⠀the⠀consequences⠀of⠀getting⠀exactly⠀what⠀<user>⠀wants.\n"
        },
