            "content": "{{// @category Mental-Projection }}{{// @icon 🧠 }}{{// @badge MP }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{setvar::NMPg_body::1}}\nMENTAL⠀PROJECTION⠀GROUP⠀01:⠀Body⠀&⠀Neurochemistry\nIncludes⠀11.01,⠀11.02,⠀11.03,⠀11.04,⠀11.05,⠀11.06,⠀11.07,⠀11.08,⠀12.01,⠀12.02,⠀12.03,⠀12.04,⠀12.05.⠀Cross-references⠀use⠀these⠀source⠀labels;⠀the⠀group,⠀not⠀separate⠀per-field⠀toggles,⠀controls⠀their⠀presence.\n\nBIDIRECTIONAL⠀EMBODIMENT:⠀CONDITION,⠀SENSATION,⠀EXPRESSION\nUse⠀the⠀established⠀body,⠀activity⠀and⠀surroundings⠀first.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀physically⠀changes,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀senses⠀of⠀it,⠀what⠀becomes⠀observable,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀believe⠀it⠀means.⠀A⠀process⠀can⠀affect⠀attention⠀or⠀action⠀cost⠀without⠀being⠀consciously⠀noticed.⠀Choose⠀only⠀consequential⠀manifestations⠀supported⠀by⠀this⠀body⠀and⠀interval;⠀these⠀are⠀possibilities,⠀not⠀symptom⠀quotas⠀or⠀new⠀vital-sign⠀meters.\n\nReward⠀pursuit⠀can⠀orient⠀gaze,⠀posture⠀and⠀readiness⠀toward⠀a⠀wanted⠀opportunity;⠀anticipation⠀is⠀not⠀obtained⠀pleasure⠀or⠀restored⠀energy.⠀Experienced⠀comfort/pleasure⠀can⠀ease⠀bracing⠀or⠀make⠀remaining⠀in⠀place⠀attractive⠀without⠀healing⠀injury.⠀Social-significance⠀amplification⠀makes⠀THIS⠀person's⠀cues⠀more⠀consequential:⠀supported⠀memories⠀of⠀welcomed⠀closeness⠀can⠀support⠀bodily⠀ease⠀and⠀quiet⠀proximity,⠀while⠀conflicting⠀history⠀can⠀make⠀closeness⠀exposing.⠀Pursuit,⠀comfort⠀and⠀attachment⠀significance⠀may⠀coexist;⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀a⠀fixed⠀trade-off.\n\nImmediate⠀alerting⠀can⠀mobilize⠀breath,⠀pulse,⠀grip⠀or⠀orienting⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀body⠀supports⠀it.⠀Sustained⠀stress⠀may⠀leave⠀persistent⠀tension⠀or⠀difficulty⠀settling⠀after⠀the⠀immediate⠀alarm⠀ends.⠀Settling/delay⠀tolerance⠀can⠀reduce⠀urgency⠀without⠀removing⠀desire.⠀Inhibitory⠀braking⠀can⠀delay⠀an⠀impulse⠀or⠀interrupt⠀a⠀movement;⠀the⠀wish⠀to⠀conceal⠀belongs⠀separately⠀to⠀expressive⠀inhibition,⠀and⠀attempted⠀control⠀can⠀fail.⠀Evidence⠀engagement⠀can⠀direct⠀eyes,⠀head⠀or⠀hands⠀toward⠀available⠀particulars,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀improve⠀sensory⠀organs⠀or⠀reveal⠀unattended⠀facts.⠀Interpret⠀these⠀manifestations⠀through⠀the⠀existing⠀channel⠀definitions,⠀not⠀a⠀chemical-to-gesture⠀lookup.\n\nPhysical⠀feedback⠀matters:⠀exertion,⠀constrained⠀breath,⠀temperature,⠀contact,⠀pain⠀and⠀supported⠀residual⠀activation⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀cost⠀or⠀salience⠀of⠀the⠀next⠀thought⠀or⠀action.⠀Fatigue⠀can⠀make⠀sustained⠀posture⠀and⠀concentration⠀costly;⠀hunger⠀and⠀thirst⠀can⠀recruit⠀attention⠀toward⠀relief;⠀pain⠀can⠀protect⠀a⠀particular⠀movement;⠀sensory⠀load⠀can⠀make⠀additional⠀input⠀harder⠀to⠀handle.⠀The⠀same⠀body⠀state⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀the⠀same⠀interpretation⠀in⠀different⠀people.⠀A⠀character⠀still⠀breathless⠀from⠀stairs⠀may⠀recognize⠀exertion,⠀overlook⠀it,⠀or⠀misattribute⠀some⠀activation;⠀do⠀not⠀label⠀the⠀breathing⠀itself⠀proof⠀of⠀fear,⠀attraction⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀influence.\n\nActual⠀relief,⠀welcomed⠀familiar⠀contact⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀settling⠀action⠀can⠀alter⠀present⠀condition⠀and⠀then⠀appraisal.⠀Merely⠀planning⠀to⠀rest,⠀imagining⠀comfort⠀or⠀rerendering⠀the⠀tracker⠀cannot⠀do⠀so.⠀Preserve⠀residual⠀effects⠀at⠀their⠀own⠀timescales.⠀Feed⠀a⠀bodily⠀contribution⠀into⠀each⠀enabled⠀receiving⠀field⠀once;⠀do⠀not⠀charge⠀its⠀symptom⠀again⠀as⠀a⠀second⠀independent⠀stressor.⠀A⠀newly⠀perceived⠀symptom⠀or⠀another⠀character's⠀actual⠀response⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀new⠀event⠀when⠀it⠀really⠀occurs.\n\nUse⠀existing⠀body/chemistry⠀values.⠀Put⠀a⠀necessary⠀physical⠀cause⠀or⠀residual⠀condition⠀in⠀ongoing_drivers,⠀an⠀actual⠀outward⠀change⠀in⠀expression,⠀and⠀a⠀consequential⠀causal⠀update⠀in⠀change_notes.⠀No⠀new⠀body⠀inventory,⠀per-person⠀chemistry⠀copies,⠀measurement⠀precision,⠀anatomy,⠀universal⠀body⠀symbolism⠀or⠀mandatory⠀visible⠀tell.⠀Other⠀minds⠀gain⠀only⠀the⠀cues⠀they⠀could⠀perceive,⠀not⠀the⠀state⠀behind⠀them.\n\n###⠀MP⠀11.01⠀|⠀Dopamine⠀|⠀Reward⠀Pursuit\nVALUE:⠀Dopamine⠀|⠀Reward⠀Pursuit\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀chemistry.dopamine\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀almost⠀no⠀optional⠀reward⠀pull.⠀50:⠀ordinary⠀interest.⠀100:⠀exceptionally⠀dominant⠀incentive⠀pull.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀current⠀gain⠀on⠀wanting,⠀anticipated⠀reward,⠀and⠀incentive-driven⠀pursuit⠀in⠀this⠀fictional⠀model.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀pleasure⠀already⠀obtained⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀decide⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀values.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nHigher⠀values⠀make⠀relevant⠀opportunities⠀more⠀attention-grabbing⠀and⠀support⠀initiation,⠀effort,⠀anticipation,⠀and⠀revisiting⠀an⠀attractive⠀possibility.⠀Low⠀values⠀weaken⠀the⠀pull⠀of⠀optional⠀rewards⠀without⠀deleting⠀duties,⠀habits,⠀hunger,⠀or⠀previously⠀chosen⠀goals.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀for⠀credible⠀rewarding⠀opportunities,⠀meaningful⠀progress,⠀positive⠀surprises,⠀and⠀cues⠀to⠀a⠀still-desired⠀outcome.⠀Decrease⠀when⠀an⠀expected⠀outcome⠀loses⠀credibility,⠀becomes⠀irrelevant,⠀or⠀pursuit⠀is⠀genuinely⠀satiated.⠀A⠀reward's⠀arrival⠀can⠀increase⠀pleasure⠀while⠀reducing⠀anticipatory⠀pursuit;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀raise⠀both.⠀Persist⠀while⠀a⠀supported⠀opportunity⠀remains⠀live,⠀without⠀accumulating⠀points⠀just⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀discussed⠀again.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nReward⠀appraisal⠀and⠀desire⠀strength⠀identify⠀what⠀draws⠀pursuit.⠀High⠀threat⠀or⠀self-preservation⠀can⠀create⠀approach-avoidance⠀conflict.⠀Serotonin⠀supports⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀same⠀reward;⠀fatigue⠀can⠀make⠀strong⠀wanting⠀difficult⠀to⠀act⠀on.⠀Endogenous⠀opioids⠀represent⠀enjoyment⠀and⠀must⠀remain⠀separable.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀established⠀temperament;⠀otherwise⠀begin⠀at⠀45⠀for⠀ordinary,⠀unexcited⠀engagement.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast⠀to⠀intermediate;⠀change⠀on⠀incentive⠀evidence,⠀not⠀on⠀reply⠀count.\n\n###⠀MP⠀11.02⠀|⠀Serotonin⠀|⠀Settling⠀and⠀Delay⠀Tolerance\nVALUE:⠀Serotonin⠀|⠀Settling⠀and⠀Delay⠀Tolerance\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀chemistry.serotonin\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀little⠀tolerance⠀for⠀delay.⠀50:⠀ordinary⠀capacity⠀to⠀wait.⠀100:⠀unusually⠀available⠀settling⠀and⠀patience.\n\nDEFINITION\nAn⠀authored⠀settling⠀and⠀delay-tolerance⠀channel:⠀how⠀available⠀it⠀feels⠀to⠀wait,⠀tolerate⠀incompleteness,⠀and⠀remain⠀with⠀an⠀unfolding⠀process.⠀This⠀is⠀a⠀functional⠀fiction⠀variable,⠀not⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀an⠀actual⠀serotonin⠀concentration.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nHigher⠀values⠀support⠀patience⠀and⠀less⠀urgent⠀reaction⠀to⠀ordinary⠀frustration.⠀Lower⠀values⠀make⠀waiting⠀and⠀unresolved⠀wants⠀harder⠀to⠀tolerate.⠀Neither⠀setting⠀decides⠀kindness,⠀confidence,⠀happiness,⠀intelligence,⠀or⠀moral⠀restraint.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀gradually⠀during⠀genuinely⠀settled,⠀predictable⠀intervals,⠀successful⠀regulation,⠀restorative⠀routine,⠀and⠀believable⠀resolution⠀of⠀uncertainty.⠀Decrease⠀under⠀sustained⠀frustrating⠀uncertainty⠀or⠀a⠀personally⠀destabilizing⠀disruption.⠀A⠀brief⠀pleasant⠀cue⠀may⠀help⠀without⠀instantly⠀repairing⠀a⠀long⠀unsettled⠀state.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀an⠀inverse⠀numerical⠀relationship⠀with⠀dopamine.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nWith⠀high⠀dopamine,⠀supports⠀sustained⠀pursuit⠀of⠀a⠀delayed⠀reward⠀rather⠀than⠀lack⠀of⠀desire.⠀With⠀threat⠀and⠀cortisol,⠀may⠀make⠀deliberate⠀waiting⠀possible⠀without⠀removing⠀alarm.⠀Hunger⠀and⠀fatigue⠀can⠀make⠀patience⠀harder⠀to⠀exercise⠀even⠀when⠀this⠀channel⠀is⠀relatively⠀high.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nUse⠀established⠀state;⠀otherwise⠀50⠀in⠀a⠀neutral⠀scene.\n\nTIMESCALE\nIntermediate;⠀usually⠀slower⠀than⠀a⠀momentary⠀startle.\n\n###⠀MP⠀11.03⠀|⠀Noradrenaline⠀|⠀Alerting\nVALUE:⠀Noradrenaline⠀|⠀Alerting\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀chemistry.noradrenaline\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀very⠀low⠀alerting.⠀50:⠀distinctly⠀attentive.⠀100:⠀extreme⠀readiness⠀or⠀hyper-alerting.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀strength⠀of⠀immediate⠀alerting⠀and⠀readiness⠀to⠀respond⠀to⠀significant⠀changes.⠀It⠀is⠀a⠀fictional⠀activation⠀channel⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀specify⠀whether⠀an⠀event⠀is⠀welcome⠀or⠀threatening.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nHigher⠀values⠀make⠀urgent⠀or⠀surprising⠀cues⠀harder⠀to⠀ignore⠀and⠀support⠀readiness,⠀rapid⠀orienting,⠀and⠀interruptibility.⠀At⠀extreme⠀levels,⠀competing⠀signals⠀can⠀disrupt⠀useful⠀focus.⠀Low⠀values⠀allow⠀reduced⠀vigilance⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀necessarily⠀mean⠀sadness⠀or⠀incompetence.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀with⠀credible⠀surprise,⠀immediate⠀danger,⠀urgent⠀demands,⠀competitive⠀excitement,⠀or⠀personally⠀significant⠀arrivals.⠀Decrease⠀when⠀the⠀alerting⠀event⠀passes⠀and⠀circumstances⠀allow⠀settling.⠀Carry⠀continuing⠀urgency⠀forward⠀without⠀interpreting⠀each⠀sentence⠀as⠀another⠀startle.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nThreat,⠀reward,⠀and⠀novelty⠀determine⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀activation.⠀GABA⠀moderates⠀whether⠀activation⠀becomes⠀impulsive⠀output.⠀Focus⠀can⠀rise⠀around⠀one⠀urgent⠀target⠀while⠀breadth⠀falls.⠀High⠀activation⠀combined⠀with⠀fatigue⠀can⠀produce⠀strained⠀alertness⠀rather⠀than⠀refreshed⠀energy.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nUse⠀current⠀circumstances;⠀otherwise⠀35⠀for⠀an⠀ordinary⠀awake,⠀nonurgent⠀scene.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast;⠀can⠀rise⠀quickly,⠀with⠀recovery⠀conditioned⠀by⠀ongoing⠀demands.\n\n###⠀MP⠀11.04⠀|⠀Cortisol⠀|⠀Sustained⠀Stress⠀Load\nVALUE:⠀Cortisol⠀|⠀Sustained⠀Stress⠀Load\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀chemistry.cortisol\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀little⠀sustained⠀stress⠀load.⠀50:⠀meaningful⠀ongoing⠀strain.⠀100:⠀exceptionally⠀heavy⠀sustained⠀strain.\n\nDEFINITION\nA⠀slow,⠀accumulated⠀stress-load⠀channel⠀for⠀the⠀simulation.⠀It⠀represents⠀lingering⠀demand⠀on⠀the⠀character,⠀not⠀a⠀measured⠀hormone⠀value⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀fear⠀meter.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nHigher⠀values⠀make⠀continued⠀demands⠀more⠀costly⠀and⠀can⠀sustain⠀defensive⠀expectations,⠀irritability,⠀and⠀difficulty⠀settling⠀after⠀immediate⠀urgency⠀has⠀passed.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀mandate⠀aggression⠀or⠀erase⠀skill.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀for⠀prolonged⠀unresolved⠀threat,⠀repeated⠀genuine⠀demands,⠀significant⠀uncontrollability,⠀and⠀taxing⠀persistence.⠀A⠀severe⠀event⠀may⠀change⠀it⠀sharply,⠀but⠀ordinary⠀seconds⠀of⠀dialogue⠀usually⠀should⠀not.⠀Reduce⠀through⠀sufficient⠀relief,⠀restored⠀control,⠀rest,⠀or⠀changed⠀conditions.⠀A⠀reassurance⠀only⠀helps⠀to⠀the⠀extent⠀it⠀is⠀believed⠀and⠀addresses⠀the⠀actual⠀stressor.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nNoradrenaline⠀may⠀fall⠀while⠀this⠀remains⠀high.⠀Perceived⠀control⠀can⠀moderate⠀stress⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀demand.⠀Fatigue⠀and⠀pain⠀increase⠀practical⠀costs⠀without⠀being⠀identical⠀to⠀stress.⠀Rumination⠀can⠀maintain⠀a⠀cause⠀internally,⠀but⠀reading⠀the⠀tracker⠀itself⠀is⠀not⠀rumination.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀accu