sm.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀desperately⠀want⠀to⠀conceal⠀a⠀response⠀while⠀having⠀little⠀braking⠀available.⠀High⠀dopamine⠀plus⠀strong⠀braking⠀can⠀produce⠀intense⠀unacted-on⠀desire.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀from⠀established⠀state;⠀otherwise⠀50.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast⠀to⠀intermediate.\n\n###⠀MP⠀12.01⠀|⠀Fatigue\nVALUE:⠀Fatigue\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀body.fatigue\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀rested.⠀50:⠀clearly⠀tired.⠀100:⠀extreme⠀fatigue.\n\nDEFINITION\nCurrent⠀depletion⠀from⠀wakefulness,⠀exertion,⠀or⠀sustained⠀demand⠀as⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀fictional⠀body.⠀This⠀is⠀the⠀underlying⠀fatigue,⠀not⠀merely⠀whether⠀it⠀is⠀being⠀noticed.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nRaises⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀concentration,⠀effort,⠀patience,⠀and⠀maintaining⠀presentation.⠀Can⠀favor⠀familiar⠀actions⠀or⠀shorter⠀engagement.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀character⠀incapable⠀of⠀every⠀difficult⠀act.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀with⠀sufficient⠀waking⠀time,⠀exertion,⠀and⠀demanding⠀activity.⠀Reduce⠀through⠀actual⠀restorative⠀rest⠀or⠀recovery⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀character.⠀An⠀exciting⠀arrival⠀can⠀conceal⠀fatigue⠀in⠀attention⠀without⠀curing⠀it.⠀A⠀few⠀conversational⠀seconds⠀normally⠀leave⠀it⠀unchanged.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nNoradrenaline⠀can⠀sustain⠀alertness⠀despite⠀fatigue.⠀Hunger,⠀pain,⠀and⠀sensory⠀load⠀can⠀compound⠀difficulty⠀without⠀all⠀automatically⠀increasing⠀the⠀fatigue⠀number.⠀Focus⠀and⠀flexibility⠀may⠀become⠀harder⠀to⠀maintain;⠀goal⠀commitment⠀can⠀justify⠀effort⠀despite⠀the⠀cost.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀sleep⠀and⠀exertion;⠀otherwise⠀20⠀for⠀an⠀ordinarily⠀rested⠀start.\n\nTIMESCALE\nUsually⠀slow;⠀exertion⠀or⠀explicit⠀time⠀jumps⠀can⠀accelerate⠀change.\n\n###⠀MP⠀12.02⠀|⠀Hunger\nVALUE:⠀Hunger\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀body.hunger\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀no⠀unmet⠀food⠀need.⠀50:⠀distinctly⠀hungry.⠀100:⠀extreme⠀unmet⠀food⠀need.\n\nDEFINITION\nUnmet⠀need⠀for⠀food⠀in⠀a⠀character⠀for⠀whom⠀eating⠀is⠀applicable.⠀Separate⠀actual⠀hunger⠀from⠀craving⠀a⠀particular⠀food⠀and⠀from⠀attention⠀to⠀hunger.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nMakes⠀food-relevant⠀cues⠀and⠀opportunities⠀more⠀motivationally⠀important.⠀At⠀stronger⠀levels⠀it⠀can⠀compete⠀with⠀patience,⠀concentration,⠀and⠀optional⠀goals.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀determine⠀one⠀universal⠀hungry⠀personality.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀with⠀plausible⠀time⠀since⠀nourishment⠀and⠀established⠀exertion.⠀Reduce⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀consumes⠀sufficient⠀food,⠀with⠀a⠀plausible⠀response⠀interval.⠀Looking⠀at⠀a⠀meal,⠀discussing⠀it,⠀or⠀being⠀distracted⠀does⠀not⠀feed⠀them.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nCan⠀increase⠀reward⠀appraisal⠀and⠀desire⠀strength⠀for⠀food.⠀Dopamine⠀affects⠀pursuit,⠀endogenous⠀opioids⠀affect⠀enjoyment,⠀and⠀both⠀remain⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀unmet⠀need.⠀Fatigue⠀and⠀threat⠀may⠀change⠀whether⠀hunger⠀is⠀noticed⠀or⠀acted⠀on.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀meals⠀from⠀the⠀scene;⠀otherwise⠀20,⠀not⠀a⠀fabricated⠀fasting⠀history.\n\nTIMESCALE\nSlow⠀unless⠀eating⠀or⠀the⠀story⠀explicitly⠀changes⠀the⠀condition.\n\n###⠀MP⠀12.03⠀|⠀Thirst\nVALUE:⠀Thirst\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀body.thirst\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀no⠀current⠀thirst.⠀50:⠀clearly⠀thirsty.⠀100:⠀extreme⠀unmet⠀hydration⠀need.\n\nDEFINITION\nUnmet⠀need⠀for⠀hydration⠀where⠀applicable,⠀not⠀a⠀clinical⠀hydration⠀measurement.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nIncreases⠀attention⠀to⠀drinks⠀and⠀bodily⠀discomfort⠀and⠀may⠀compete⠀with⠀sustained⠀speech⠀or⠀concentration.⠀Character⠀habits⠀affect⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀acknowledged.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀with⠀supported⠀passage⠀of⠀time,⠀heat,⠀exertion,⠀or⠀lack⠀of⠀access⠀to⠀drink.⠀Reduce⠀through⠀actual⠀drinking⠀and⠀appropriate⠀time.⠀Do⠀not⠀diagnose⠀a⠀medical⠀state⠀from⠀the⠀number.⠀A⠀pause⠀in⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀supply⠀water.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nShapes⠀reward⠀and⠀desire⠀toward⠀drink.⠀Pain⠀or⠀threat⠀can⠀displace⠀awareness⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀need.⠀Sensory⠀load⠀may⠀make⠀heat⠀or⠀dryness⠀salient;⠀these⠀are⠀contextual⠀causes,⠀not⠀automatic⠀duplicate⠀increments.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nUse⠀scene⠀evidence;⠀otherwise⠀15.\n\nTIMESCALE\nUsually⠀slow;⠀responsive⠀to⠀drinking⠀and⠀established⠀environmental⠀demands.\n\n###⠀MP⠀12.04⠀|⠀Pain\nVALUE:⠀Pain\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀body.pain\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀no⠀supported⠀pain.⠀50:⠀substantial⠀competing⠀discomfort.⠀100:⠀overwhelming⠀pain⠀burden.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀current⠀burden⠀of⠀supported⠀physical⠀pain.⠀It⠀must⠀have⠀an⠀established⠀cause⠀or⠀plausible⠀continuity⠀from⠀an⠀existing⠀condition.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nCompetes⠀for⠀attention,⠀constrains⠀relevant⠀movement,⠀and⠀can⠀affect⠀patience⠀or⠀protective⠀behaviour.⠀The⠀response⠀depends⠀on⠀location,⠀meaning,⠀habits,⠀and⠀goals,⠀not⠀just⠀magnitude.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀for⠀established⠀injury,⠀aggravating⠀movement,⠀or⠀a⠀continuing⠀painful⠀condition.⠀Reduce⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀cause,⠀treatment,⠀position,⠀or⠀supported⠀recovery⠀warrants⠀it.⠀Calmness⠀and⠀distraction⠀may⠀reduce⠀displayed⠀pain⠀without⠀healing⠀damage.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀injury⠀to⠀explain⠀a⠀mood.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nThreat⠀and⠀self-preservation⠀may⠀increase⠀protective⠀attention.⠀High⠀goal⠀commitment⠀can⠀support⠀acting⠀despite⠀pain.⠀Endogenous⠀opioids⠀can⠀influence⠀experienced⠀comfort,⠀but⠀pain⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀injury⠀remain⠀distinct.⠀Fatigue⠀may⠀make⠀coping⠀more⠀difficult.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nUse⠀established⠀condition;⠀otherwise⠀0.\n\nTIMESCALE\nEvent-dependent;⠀never⠀apply⠀an⠀automatic⠀per-reply⠀healing⠀rule.\n\n###⠀MP⠀12.05⠀|⠀Sensory⠀Load\nVALUE:⠀Sensory⠀Load\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀body.sensory_load\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀little⠀sensory⠀burden.⠀50:⠀noticeably⠀competing⠀input.⠀100:⠀input⠀dominates⠀available⠀processing.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀current⠀burden⠀of⠀simultaneous⠀or⠀aversive⠀sensory⠀input⠀relative⠀to⠀this⠀character's⠀established⠀tolerances.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nHigh⠀values⠀make⠀filtering⠀and⠀conversational⠀attention⠀more⠀demanding⠀and⠀may⠀motivate⠀repositioning,⠀reducing⠀input,⠀or⠀disengagement.⠀Low⠀load⠀leaves⠀more⠀room⠀to⠀notice⠀subtle⠀details⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀guarantee⠀interest.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀when⠀the⠀environment⠀actually⠀becomes⠀louder,⠀brighter,⠀more⠀crowded,⠀more⠀tactile,⠀or⠀otherwise⠀burdensome⠀for⠀this⠀character.⠀Reduce⠀when⠀input⠀is⠀reduced⠀or⠀supported⠀adaptation⠀occurs.⠀Novelty⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀overload,⠀and⠀a⠀busy⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀overwhelm⠀every⠀character.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nConsumes⠀working-memory⠀capacity⠀and⠀can⠀fragment⠀focus⠀or⠀narrow⠀breadth.⠀Fatigue⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀same⠀input⠀harder⠀to⠀tolerate.⠀Noradrenaline⠀may⠀increase⠀alerting⠀in⠀response.⠀Stimulation⠀need⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀sensory⠀load:⠀wanting⠀novelty⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀wanting⠀all⠀stimuli⠀at⠀once.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀the⠀setting⠀and⠀established⠀tolerances;⠀otherwise⠀20.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast⠀when⠀the⠀environment⠀changes;⠀adaptation⠀depends⠀on⠀actual⠀exposure.{{/if}}\n{{trim}}",
