            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Mental-Projection }}{{// @icon 🧠 }}{{// @badge MP }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{setvar::NMPg_appraisal::1}}\nMENTAL⠀PROJECTION⠀GROUP⠀02:⠀Needs⠀&⠀Appraisals\nIncludes⠀13.01,⠀13.02,⠀13.03,⠀13.04,⠀13.05,⠀13.06,⠀13.07,⠀14.01,⠀14.02,⠀14.03,⠀14.04,⠀14.05,⠀14.06,⠀14.07,⠀14.08.⠀Cross-references⠀use⠀these⠀source⠀labels;⠀the⠀group,⠀not⠀separate⠀per-field⠀toggles,⠀controls⠀their⠀presence.\n\n###⠀MP⠀13.01⠀|⠀Safety⠀Need\nVALUE:⠀Safety⠀Need\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀needs.safety\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀security⠀need⠀currently⠀satisfied.⠀50:⠀meaningful⠀unmet⠀security.⠀100:⠀urgent⠀unmet⠀security.\n\nDEFINITION\nUnmet⠀need⠀for⠀felt⠀security,⠀predictability,⠀and⠀protection.⠀It⠀can⠀remain⠀elevated⠀after⠀an⠀immediate⠀threat⠀has⠀ended;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀identical⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀threat⠀estimate.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nMakes⠀signs⠀of⠀shelter,⠀reliable⠀support,⠀boundaries,⠀exits,⠀and⠀reduced⠀uncertainty⠀more⠀valuable.⠀High⠀safety⠀need⠀can⠀motivate⠀seeking⠀help,⠀control,⠀withdrawal,⠀or⠀preparation⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀habits.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀when⠀security⠀is⠀undermined⠀or⠀unresolved⠀vulnerability⠀persists.⠀Reduce⠀through⠀believable⠀protection,⠀predictable⠀conditions,⠀effective⠀preparation,⠀or⠀trusted⠀support⠀that⠀addresses⠀the⠀vulnerability.⠀A⠀reassurance⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀believes⠀need⠀not⠀lower⠀it.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nThreat⠀identifies⠀a⠀possible⠀harm;⠀self-preservation⠀supplies⠀protective⠀motivational⠀priority;⠀this⠀value⠀records⠀what⠀is⠀lacking.⠀Belonging⠀and⠀autonomy⠀may⠀compete⠀with⠀safety.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀choose⠀risk⠀for⠀another⠀need⠀or⠀a⠀commitment⠀without⠀their⠀safety⠀need⠀disappearing.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀existing⠀insecurity;⠀otherwise⠀20⠀in⠀a⠀reasonably⠀secure⠀scene.\n\nTIMESCALE\nIntermediate;⠀can⠀rise⠀sharply,⠀often⠀resolves⠀more⠀slowly.\n\n###⠀MP⠀13.02⠀|⠀Belonging⠀Need\nVALUE:⠀Belonging⠀Need\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀needs.belonging\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀adequately⠀connected.⠀50:⠀meaningful⠀desire⠀for⠀connection.⠀100:⠀acutely⠀unmet⠀belonging.\n\nDEFINITION\nUnmet⠀need⠀for⠀connection,⠀inclusion,⠀or⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀having⠀a⠀place⠀with⠀relevant⠀people.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀affection⠀toward⠀everyone⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀a⠀preferred⠀relationship⠀type.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nMakes⠀acceptance,⠀exclusion,⠀contact,⠀reunion,⠀and⠀social⠀availability⠀more⠀consequential.⠀High⠀need⠀may⠀lead⠀to⠀seeking⠀company,⠀testing⠀a⠀bond,⠀hiding⠀vulnerability,⠀or⠀retreating⠀after⠀rejection,⠀depending⠀on⠀the⠀character.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀after⠀meaningful⠀isolation,⠀exclusion,⠀separation,⠀or⠀a⠀threatened⠀bond.⠀Reduce⠀through⠀connection⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀experiences⠀as⠀relevant⠀and⠀accepting.⠀Mere⠀proximity⠀to⠀strangers⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀compliment⠀need⠀not⠀satisfy⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀raise⠀it⠀for⠀every⠀moment⠀spent⠀alone.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nOxytocin⠀amplifies⠀socially⠀significant⠀cues.⠀Trust⠀and⠀comfort⠀determine⠀which⠀contact⠀is⠀welcome.⠀Autonomy⠀may⠀make⠀wanted⠀closeness⠀feel⠀constraining;⠀both⠀needs⠀can⠀stay⠀high.⠀Desire⠀strength⠀can⠀target⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀presence⠀without⠀rewriting⠀durable⠀affection.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀social⠀context⠀and⠀established⠀preferences;⠀otherwise⠀25.\n\nTIMESCALE\nIntermediate⠀to⠀slow⠀except⠀for⠀significant⠀social⠀events.\n\n###⠀MP⠀13.03⠀|⠀Autonomy⠀Need\nVALUE:⠀Autonomy⠀Need\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀needs.autonomy\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀choices⠀feel⠀sufficiently⠀self-authored.⠀50:⠀meaningful⠀constraint.⠀100:⠀urgently⠀frustrated⠀authorship.\n\nDEFINITION\nUnmet⠀need⠀to⠀experience⠀meaningful⠀choice⠀and⠀authorship⠀of⠀one's⠀actions.⠀It⠀is⠀different⠀from⠀always⠀getting⠀one's⠀preferred⠀outcome.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nRaises⠀the⠀importance⠀of⠀permission,⠀boundaries,⠀alternatives,⠀voluntary⠀agreement,⠀and⠀the⠀ability⠀to⠀refuse⠀or⠀revise.⠀It⠀can⠀produce⠀resistance⠀even⠀to⠀an⠀otherwise⠀attractive⠀offer⠀when⠀the⠀process⠀feels⠀coercive.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀with⠀unwanted⠀control,⠀forced⠀dependence,⠀manipulation,⠀or⠀repeated⠀dismissal⠀of⠀choices⠀as⠀perceived⠀by⠀the⠀character.⠀Reduce⠀through⠀credible⠀options⠀and⠀actual⠀respect⠀for⠀decisions.⠀Being⠀told⠀one⠀is⠀free⠀while⠀consequences⠀remove⠀every⠀real⠀option⠀need⠀not⠀satisfy⠀it.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nBelonging⠀can⠀pull⠀toward⠀accommodation⠀while⠀autonomy⠀pulls⠀toward⠀differentiation.⠀Perceived⠀control⠀concerns⠀ability⠀to⠀influence⠀an⠀issue;⠀autonomy⠀concerns⠀ownership⠀of⠀the⠀choice.⠀Affection⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀lower⠀autonomy⠀needs,⠀and⠀self-preservation⠀can⠀justify⠀a⠀temporary⠀compromise⠀without⠀satisfying⠀them.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nUse⠀character⠀and⠀circumstances;⠀otherwise⠀20.\n\nTIMESCALE\nEvent-sensitive;⠀persists⠀while⠀the⠀constraint⠀remains.\n\n###⠀MP⠀13.04⠀|⠀Competence⠀Need\nVALUE:⠀Competence⠀Need\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀needs.competence\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀effective⠀enough⠀for⠀present⠀purposes.⠀50:⠀significant⠀unmet⠀efficacy.⠀100:⠀competence⠀urgently⠀at⠀stake.\n\nDEFINITION\nUnmet⠀need⠀to⠀feel⠀capable,⠀effective,⠀or⠀improving⠀at⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀considers⠀relevant.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀objective⠀skill⠀or⠀intelligence.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nMakes⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀solving⠀a⠀problem,⠀demonstrating⠀ability,⠀and⠀avoiding⠀an⠀exposing⠀task⠀motivationally⠀relevant.⠀The⠀response⠀depends⠀on⠀whether⠀challenge⠀is⠀appraised⠀as⠀workable⠀or⠀humiliating.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀with⠀meaningful⠀failure,⠀helplessness,⠀inability⠀to⠀contribute,⠀or⠀being⠀denied⠀a⠀chance⠀to⠀use⠀one's⠀abilities.⠀Reduce⠀through⠀credible⠀mastery,⠀useful⠀contribution,⠀progress,⠀or⠀convincing⠀feedback.⠀Flattery⠀does⠀not⠀necessarily⠀substitute⠀for⠀evidence⠀of⠀competence.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nPerceived⠀control⠀affects⠀whether⠀a⠀challenge⠀invites⠀effort.⠀Goal⠀commitment⠀can⠀keep⠀effort⠀active⠀despite⠀failure.⠀Esteem⠀need⠀concerns⠀social⠀regard⠀and⠀can⠀diverge:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀feel⠀skilled⠀but⠀unappreciated,⠀or⠀praised⠀but⠀privately⠀incompetent.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nUse⠀scene⠀and⠀character;⠀otherwise⠀25.\n\nTIMESCALE\nIntermediate;⠀specific⠀success⠀can⠀shift⠀it⠀without⠀changing⠀underlying⠀skill.\n\n###⠀MP⠀13.05⠀|⠀Esteem⠀Need\nVALUE:⠀Esteem⠀Need\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀needs.est