        {
            "identifier": "nemo-mp-group-memory",
            "name": "🧠 MP 04 · Memory & Learning",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Mental-Projection }}{{// @icon 🧠 }}{{// @badge MP }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{setvar::NMPg_memory::1}}\nMENTAL⠀PROJECTION⠀GROUP⠀04:⠀Memory⠀&⠀Learning\nIncludes⠀18.01,⠀18.02,⠀18.03,⠀18.04,⠀18.05,⠀18.06,⠀24.00.⠀Cross-references⠀use⠀these⠀source⠀labels;⠀the⠀group,⠀not⠀separate⠀per-field⠀toggles,⠀controls⠀their⠀presence.\n\nMEMORY⠀AND⠀LEARNING⠀FROM⠀OBSERVED⠀OUTCOMES\n\nUse⠀the⠀six⠀separate⠀memory⠀VALUE⠀definitions⠀below.⠀Memory⠀age,⠀strength,⠀fidelity,⠀accessibility,⠀confidence⠀and⠀interference⠀are⠀not⠀interchangeable.⠀Retention⠀can⠀survive⠀without⠀current⠀access;⠀confident⠀recall⠀can⠀be⠀wrong.⠀Preserve⠀gist,⠀source,⠀cues,⠀detail⠀limits⠀and⠀last⠀actual⠀recall.⠀Merely⠀reading/reprinting⠀a⠀tracker⠀or⠀editing⠀a⠀draft⠀is⠀not⠀in-world⠀rehearsal.⠀Lost⠀detail⠀cannot⠀regenerate⠀without⠀new⠀evidence,⠀and⠀externally⠀refreshed⠀detail⠀must⠀be⠀labeled⠀as⠀such.\n\nMP⠀24.00:⠀Learned⠀patterns⠀are⠀qualitative⠀conditional⠀expectations,⠀not⠀new⠀skill/reinforcement⠀scores.⠀Create⠀one⠀only⠀for⠀a⠀consequential⠀lesson⠀or⠀revision⠀not⠀already⠀represented⠀adequately⠀in⠀memory,⠀relationships⠀or⠀behaviour⠀patterns.⠀Separate⠀evidence,⠀the⠀character's⠀interpretation,⠀a⠀relevant⠀plausible⠀alternative,⠀limited⠀adjustment⠀and⠀scope.⠀Learning⠀can⠀be⠀incomplete⠀or⠀mistaken.⠀A⠀delayed⠀response⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀refusal;⠀an⠀attempted⠀influence⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀it⠀worked;⠀one⠀helpful⠀act⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀that⠀all⠀other⠀care⠀is⠀unnecessary.⠀Values,⠀habits,⠀experience,⠀relationship⠀specificity⠀and⠀uncertain⠀sources⠀constrain⠀generalization.\n\nUse⠀learning_status⠀tentative,⠀reinforced,⠀revised⠀or⠀retired⠀as⠀descriptions,⠀not⠀multipliers.⠀Consolidate⠀a⠀supported⠀adjustment⠀into⠀its⠀existing⠀behaviour/bond⠀record⠀and⠀retain⠀necessary⠀evidence⠀in⠀memory,⠀with⠀only⠀one⠀authoritative⠀wording.⠀Contradictory⠀evidence⠀can⠀revise⠀or⠀retire⠀a⠀lesson.⠀Retaining⠀a⠀lesson⠀does⠀not⠀enact⠀it,⠀increase⠀commitment,⠀or⠀refresh⠀memory;⠀the⠀matching⠀situation⠀must⠀actually⠀arise.⠀Do⠀not⠀infer⠀missing⠀history⠀from⠀a⠀status⠀label.\n\n\nEXPERIENCE-BASED⠀ASSOCIATIONS\nRetain⠀what⠀an⠀encounter⠀did⠀to⠀THIS⠀character,⠀not⠀just⠀that⠀an⠀event⠀category⠀occurred.⠀A⠀consequential⠀experience⠀may⠀link⠀a⠀person,⠀activity⠀or⠀sensory⠀cue⠀to⠀anticipated⠀enjoyment,⠀experienced⠀comfort,⠀strain,⠀exposure⠀or⠀relief.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀perceived⠀event,⠀experienced⠀effect,⠀source⠀and⠀scope.⠀Attribute⠀the⠀effect⠀carefully:⠀amusement⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀game,⠀safety⠀from⠀the⠀setting,⠀or⠀relief⠀from⠀a⠀threat⠀ending⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀the⠀nearby⠀person.⠀The⠀character⠀can⠀misattribute⠀it;⠀keep⠀that⠀interpretation⠀fallible⠀rather⠀than⠀rewriting⠀the⠀event.\n\nDistinguish⠀an⠀immediate⠀response⠀from⠀a⠀learned⠀expectation.⠀A⠀meaningful⠀new⠀experience⠀or⠀changed⠀understanding⠀can⠀revise⠀the⠀expectation;⠀a⠀neutral⠀reply,⠀repeated⠀record⠀or⠀familiar⠀cue⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀repeatedly⠀strengthen⠀it.⠀A⠀genuinely⠀learned⠀cue⠀may⠀reactivate⠀an⠀established⠀response⠀without⠀conscious⠀episodic⠀recall.⠀This⠀requires⠀a⠀retained,⠀sourced⠀association⠀and⠀a⠀matching⠀cue,⠀not⠀access⠀to⠀every⠀inaccessible⠀memory.⠀Do⠀not⠀restore⠀lost⠀detail,⠀set⠀last_recall,⠀increase⠀fidelity⠀or⠀invent⠀a⠀formative⠀episode⠀just⠀because⠀an⠀association⠀affected⠀conduct.\n\nUse⠀existing⠀memories:⠀gist/source⠀for⠀the⠀experience,⠀cues⠀for⠀its⠀supported⠀triggers,⠀interpretation⠀for⠀the⠀learned⠀expectation⠀and⠀experienced⠀effect,⠀limits⠀for⠀uncertainty⠀and⠀counterexamples.⠀These⠀descriptions⠀are⠀not⠀automatically⠀current⠀thoughts.⠀When⠀an⠀active⠀Social⠀schema⠀already⠀owns⠀a⠀consolidated⠀learned_patterns⠀record,⠀keep⠀the⠀expectation⠀there⠀and⠀link⠀its⠀real⠀memory/event⠀evidence⠀instead⠀of⠀duplicating⠀it.⠀With⠀Social⠀off,⠀the⠀memory⠀interpretation⠀can⠀retain⠀the⠀compact⠀association⠀without⠀creating⠀social⠀collections.\n\nOn⠀a⠀later⠀cue,⠀interpret⠀the⠀retained⠀expectation⠀under⠀current⠀circumstances⠀and⠀update⠀only⠀active⠀receiving⠀owners.⠀A⠀remembered⠀enjoyable⠀evening⠀can⠀support⠀anticipation;⠀remembered⠀unpressured⠀closeness⠀can⠀make⠀quiet⠀company⠀attractive.⠀Both,⠀neither,⠀or⠀conflict⠀are⠀valid.⠀Current⠀chemistry⠀may⠀settle⠀while⠀the⠀learned⠀association⠀persists.⠀New⠀evidence⠀can⠀qualify,⠀revise⠀or⠀retire⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀a⠀supported⠀durable⠀expectation⠀after⠀episodic⠀detail⠀fades⠀without⠀inventing⠀that⠀detail;⠀disabled-owner⠀carryover⠀remains⠀inert.\n\n###⠀MP⠀18.01⠀|⠀Memory⠀Age\nVALUE:⠀Memory⠀Age\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀memories[].age_minutes\n\nSCALE:⠀Nonnegative⠀minutes,⠀or⠀null⠀when⠀unknown.⠀Age⠀measures⠀the⠀original⠀event,⠀not⠀number⠀of⠀replies.\n\nDEFINITION\nApproximate⠀fictional⠀time⠀since⠀the⠀original⠀encoding⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀memory.⠀This⠀is⠀not⠀time⠀since⠀the⠀file⠀or⠀tracker⠀was⠀last⠀loaded.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nProvides⠀elapsed-time⠀context⠀for⠀the⠀trace⠀and⠀detail⠀rules.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀alone⠀decide⠀whether⠀an⠀important⠀memory⠀is⠀accessible⠀or⠀whether⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀a⠀durable⠀fact.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nAdvance⠀by⠀actual⠀fictional⠀time⠀after⠀encoding.⠀A⠀newly⠀formed⠀memory⠀begins⠀near⠀0.⠀Retrieving⠀a⠀memory⠀does⠀not⠀reset⠀its⠀age;⠀note⠀genuine⠀rehearsal⠀qualitatively⠀in⠀last_recall.⠀If⠀the⠀original⠀event's⠀age⠀is⠀unknown,⠀preserve⠀null⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀timestamp.⠀An⠀explicit⠀later⠀time⠀anchor⠀may⠀resolve⠀it.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nTrace⠀strength⠀and⠀detail⠀fidelity⠀use⠀age⠀and⠀intervening⠀events,⠀while⠀accessibility⠀is⠀cue-sensitive⠀and⠀may⠀rise⠀for⠀an⠀old⠀memory.⠀Interference⠀depends⠀on⠀competing⠀experiences,⠀not⠀age⠀alone.⠀Long⠀age⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀delete⠀skills,⠀identity⠀knowledge,⠀promises,⠀or⠀relationships.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nNew⠀scene⠀memory:⠀0⠀at⠀encoding.⠀Older⠀known⠀event:⠀supported⠀approximate⠀age.⠀Unknown⠀age:⠀null.\n\nTIMESCALE\nMonotonic⠀with⠀fictional⠀time,⠀except⠀an⠀explicit⠀chronology⠀correction.\n\n###⠀MP⠀18.02⠀|⠀Memory⠀Trace⠀Strength\nVALUE:⠀Memory⠀Trace⠀Strength\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀memories[].trace_strength\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀gist⠀no⠀longer⠀reliably⠀retained⠀by⠀the⠀character.⠀50:⠀meaningful⠀but⠀fallible⠀retained⠀gist.⠀100:⠀exceptionally⠀durable⠀trace.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀durability⠀of⠀a⠀specific⠀encoded⠀memory's⠀gist⠀in⠀this⠀fictional⠀retrieval⠀model.⠀It⠀is⠀distinct⠀from⠀current⠀availability,⠀exact⠀detail,⠀and⠀confidence.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nStronger⠀traces⠀better⠀preserve⠀that⠀an⠀event⠀or⠀pattern⠀occurred⠀and⠀support⠀later⠀retrieval⠀when⠀relevant⠀cues⠀appear.⠀A⠀durable⠀gist⠀does⠀not⠀preserve⠀exact⠀words⠀or⠀guarantee⠀the⠀original⠀perception⠀was⠀accurate.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nSet⠀at⠀encoding⠀from⠀actual⠀attention,⠀relevance,⠀processing,⠀and⠀supported⠀emotional⠀significance.⠀Strengthen⠀through⠀genuine⠀retrieval⠀or⠀meaningful⠀reuse;⠀weaken⠀gradually⠀across⠀appropriate⠀fictional⠀intervals⠀and⠀competing⠀experience.⠀Ordinary⠀seconds⠀of⠀conversation⠀often⠀leave⠀it⠀unchanged.⠀Do⠀not⠀strengthen⠀a⠀trace⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀tracker⠀carries⠀it⠀forward.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nAcetylcholine⠀and⠀focus⠀influence⠀initial⠀processing;⠀intensity⠀may⠀make⠀an⠀event⠀significant⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀accurate.⠀Age⠀and⠀interference⠀shape⠀persistence.⠀Accessibility⠀may⠀be⠀low⠀for⠀a⠀strong⠀dormant⠀trace⠀or⠀high⠀for⠀a⠀recently⠀cued⠀weak⠀one.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nCreate⠀only⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀perceived,⠀learned,⠀or⠀establishedly⠀knows.⠀Choose⠀strength⠀from⠀its⠀actual⠀encoding⠀conditions;⠀do⠀not⠀assign⠀maximum⠀strength⠀to⠀every⠀scene⠀event.\n\nTIMESCALE\nSlow⠀between⠀genuine⠀encoding⠀or⠀rehearsal⠀events.\n\n###⠀MP⠀18.03⠀|⠀Memory⠀Detail⠀Fidelity\nVALUE:⠀Memory⠀Detail⠀Fidelity\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀memories[].detail_fidelity\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀essentially⠀no⠀reliable⠀specific⠀detail⠀beyond⠀any⠀surviving⠀gist.⠀50:⠀partial⠀detail.⠀100:⠀unusually⠀detailed⠀retained⠀encoding.\n\nDEFINITION\nHow⠀much⠀specific⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀original⠀encoding⠀remains⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀memory.⠀It⠀measures⠀retention⠀of⠀the⠀encoded⠀representation,⠀not⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀event⠀was⠀correctly⠀perceived.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nDetermines⠀whether⠀exact⠀wording,⠀sequence,⠀appearance,⠀timing,⠀or⠀only⠀the⠀gist⠀can⠀be⠀recalled.⠀Low⠀fidelity⠀should⠀permit⠀honest⠀uncertainty⠀or⠀incomplete⠀recall⠀rather⠀than⠀mandatory⠀fabricated⠀detail.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nInitialize⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀attended⠀and⠀encoded.⠀Reduce⠀with⠀appropriate⠀time,⠀interference,⠀or⠀known⠀incomplete⠀encoding.⠀Rehearsal⠀can⠀preserve⠀surviving⠀detail⠀but⠀cannot⠀regenerate⠀details⠀already⠀lost.⠀Increase⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀genuinely⠀re-encounters⠀relevant⠀evidence;⠀label⠀externally⠀refreshed⠀details⠀rather⠀than⠀pretending⠀they⠀were⠀always⠀remembered.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nTrace⠀strength⠀can⠀remain⠀high⠀while⠀detail⠀fades.⠀Confidence⠀may⠀remain⠀high⠀despite⠀low⠀fidelity,⠀but⠀confidence⠀does⠀not⠀restore⠀detail.⠀Accessibility⠀determines⠀whether⠀the⠀memory⠀is⠀retrieved,⠀not⠀how⠀exact⠀it⠀is.⠀Emotional⠀intensity⠀must⠀not⠀automatically⠀grant⠀photographic⠀memory.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nUse⠀encoding⠀quality⠀and⠀known⠀history.⠀Record⠀detail⠀limits⠀in⠀the⠀memory's⠀limits⠀field,⠀separate⠀from⠀its⠀gist⠀and⠀source.\n\nTIMESCALE\nSlow⠀decay;⠀evidence-dependent⠀recovery,⠀never⠀spontaneous⠀reconstruction.\n\n###⠀MP⠀18.04⠀|⠀Memory⠀Accessibility\nVALUE:⠀Memory⠀Accessibility\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀memories[].accessibility\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀not⠀presently⠀retrievable.⠀50:⠀retrievable⠀with⠀a⠀meaningful⠀cue⠀or⠀effort.⠀100:⠀immediately⠀present⠀to⠀mind.\n\nDEFINITION\nHow⠀readily⠀a⠀particular⠀memory⠀can⠀enter⠀awareness⠀now,⠀given⠀present⠀cues⠀and⠀attention.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀durability⠀of⠀the⠀memory⠀or⠀the⠀model's⠀ability⠀to⠀read⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀transcript.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nHigh⠀accessibility⠀makes⠀the⠀memory⠀a⠀plausible⠀spontaneous⠀influence.⠀Moderate⠀accessibility⠀may⠀require⠀a⠀relevant⠀prompt⠀or⠀deliberate⠀search.⠀Low⠀accessibility⠀normally⠀keeps⠀the⠀memory⠀out⠀of⠀active⠀thought,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀model⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀record.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀with⠀matching⠀sensory,⠀semantic,⠀relational,⠀or⠀goal⠀cues,⠀actual⠀recollection,⠀or⠀deliberate⠀retrieval.⠀Decrease⠀when⠀attention⠀moves⠀away,⠀cues⠀disappear,⠀or⠀competition⠀makes⠀retrieval⠀less⠀available.⠀Carrying⠀the⠀field⠀in⠀the⠀output⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀recall⠀event.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nTrace⠀strength⠀supports⠀retrieval⠀potential;⠀focus⠀and⠀the⠀working⠀set⠀determine⠀whether⠀it⠀is⠀used.⠀Interference⠀may⠀obstruct⠀access.⠀Rumination⠀can⠀keep⠀a⠀memory⠀readily⠀available⠀without⠀improving⠀truth⠀or⠀fidelity.⠀A⠀strong⠀appropriate⠀cue⠀can⠀revive⠀access⠀to⠀an⠀old⠀trace⠀without⠀restoring⠀its⠀missing⠀detail.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nSet⠀from⠀present⠀relevance,⠀not⠀merely⠀importance.⠀Dormant⠀memories⠀often⠀start⠀low;⠀a⠀memory⠀currently⠀being⠀discussed⠀can⠀start⠀high.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast;⠀this⠀is⠀the⠀main⠀live⠀retrieval⠀gate.\n\n###⠀MP⠀18.05⠀|⠀Memory⠀Confidence\nVALUE:⠀Memory⠀Confidence\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀memories[].confidence\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀highly⠀doubtful⠀of⠀recall.⠀50:⠀tentative⠀confidence.⠀100:⠀subjectively⠀certain,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀correct.\n\nDEFINITION\nHow⠀sure⠀the⠀character⠀feels⠀that⠀their⠀recollection⠀or⠀remembered⠀claim⠀is⠀dependable.⠀It⠀is⠀a⠀subjective⠀judgment,⠀independent⠀of⠀fidelity⠀and⠀source⠀truth.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nAffects⠀whether⠀remembered⠀material⠀is⠀stated⠀as⠀certain,⠀qualified,⠀checked,⠀or⠀withheld.⠀High⠀confidence⠀can⠀support⠀a⠀mistaken⠀interpretation⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀authorise⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀change⠀canon.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀with⠀credible⠀verification,⠀source⠀trust,⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀recognition⠀experience.⠀Decrease⠀with⠀contradiction,⠀acknowledged⠀gaps,⠀source⠀confusion,⠀or⠀correction.⠀Repetition⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀character⠀feel⠀more⠀sure⠀only⠀when⠀that⠀subjective⠀reinforcement⠀is⠀actually⠀supported;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀independent⠀confirmation.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nDetail⠀fidelity⠀constrains⠀specificity⠀even⠀when⠀confidence⠀is⠀high.⠀Relationship⠀trust⠀can⠀affect⠀confidence⠀in⠀testimony.⠀Appraisal⠀certainty⠀may⠀draw⠀on⠀a⠀retrieved⠀memory's⠀confidence⠀but⠀must⠀consider⠀other⠀evidence.⠀Self-awareness⠀affects⠀whether⠀uncertainty⠀is⠀noticed⠀and⠀admitted.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nUse⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀believes⠀about⠀the⠀source⠀and⠀recall.⠀Do⠀not⠀copy⠀trace⠀strength⠀or⠀fidelity⠀as⠀a⠀shortcut.\n\nTIMESCALE\nEvent-sensitive;⠀do⠀not⠀decay⠀it⠀automatically⠀just⠀because⠀age⠀increases.\n\n###⠀MP⠀18.06⠀|⠀Memory⠀Interference\nVALUE:⠀Memory⠀Interference\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀memories[].interference\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀little⠀competing⠀source⠀material.⠀50:⠀significant⠀source⠀or⠀detail⠀competition.⠀100:⠀severe⠀difficulty⠀separating⠀overlapping⠀material.\n\nDEFINITION\nCompetition⠀from⠀similar⠀events,⠀overlapping⠀sources,⠀or⠀other⠀encoded⠀material⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀particular⠀memory⠀harder⠀to⠀separate⠀or⠀retrieve.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀general⠀fatigue⠀or⠀elapsed⠀time⠀alone.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nCan⠀cause⠀retrieval⠀difficulty,⠀uncertainty⠀about⠀which⠀occasion⠀a⠀detail⠀belongs⠀to,⠀or⠀loss⠀of⠀specific⠀sequence.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀false⠀memory;⠀hesitation⠀and⠀source⠀checking⠀are⠀valid⠀outcomes.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀when⠀genuinely⠀competing⠀experiences⠀or⠀accounts⠀are⠀encountered⠀and⠀encoded.⠀Reduce⠀when⠀a⠀distinguishing⠀cue⠀or⠀reliable⠀evidence⠀separates⠀the⠀sources.⠀Do⠀not⠀raise⠀interference⠀because⠀multiple⠀memory⠀records⠀exist⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀same⠀memory⠀is⠀printed⠀again.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nAccessibility⠀can⠀fall⠀while⠀trace⠀strength⠀remains⠀intact.⠀Detail⠀fidelity⠀may⠀weaken⠀if⠀similar⠀specifics⠀become⠀hard⠀to⠀separate.⠀High⠀confidence⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀source⠀confusion,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀a⠀detailed⠀alternative⠀event⠀without⠀support.⠀Focus⠀and⠀evidence⠀engagement⠀affect⠀whether⠀distinguishing⠀features⠀are⠀encoded.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nUse⠀known⠀overlap;⠀otherwise⠀0-10⠀for⠀a⠀distinct⠀new⠀event.\n\nTIMESCALE\nChanges⠀on⠀competing⠀encoding⠀or⠀disambiguation,⠀not⠀every⠀clock⠀tick.{{/if}}\n{{trim}}",
