            "content": "{{// @category Mental-Projection }}{{// @icon 🧠 }}{{// @badge MP }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{setvar::NMPg_choice::1}}\nMENTAL⠀PROJECTION⠀GROUP⠀05:⠀Motivation,⠀Choice⠀&⠀Friction\nIncludes⠀15.01,⠀15.02,⠀15.03,⠀25.00,⠀25.01,⠀25.02,⠀25.03,⠀25.04,⠀25.05,⠀25.06,⠀25.07,⠀25.08,⠀25.09,⠀25.10,⠀25.11,⠀25.12,⠀26.00,⠀26.01,⠀26.02,⠀26.03,⠀26.04.⠀Cross-references⠀use⠀these⠀source⠀labels;⠀the⠀group,⠀not⠀separate⠀per-field⠀toggles,⠀controls⠀their⠀presence.\n\nMOTIVATION,⠀CHOICE⠀AND⠀STATE-CONDITIONED⠀CHARACTER⠀FRICTION\n\nMP⠀15⠀and⠀MP⠀25:⠀Use⠀one⠀architecture⠀for⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀in⠀any⠀relevant⠀domain,⠀not⠀a⠀separate⠀engine⠀for⠀intimacy,⠀conflict,⠀money,⠀food⠀or⠀work.⠀INTERNAL:⠀desired⠀outcome,⠀willingness⠀for⠀this⠀action,⠀independent⠀aversion,⠀perceived⠀cost⠀and⠀action⠀comfort.⠀EXTERNAL⠀AS⠀KNOWN:⠀situational⠀opening,⠀this⠀actor/route's⠀feasibility⠀and⠀sourced⠀constraints.⠀BEHAVIOUR:⠀a⠀response⠀selected⠀through⠀actual⠀personality,⠀values,⠀habits,⠀relationships,⠀current⠀condition,⠀knowledge⠀and⠀competing⠀commitments.⠀The⠀world⠀still⠀determines⠀execution.⠀A⠀mistaken⠀estimate⠀cannot⠀make⠀an⠀impossible⠀route⠀succeed.\n\nDesire⠀is⠀desires[].strength,⠀stored⠀once.⠀Action-readiness⠀records⠀link⠀existing⠀desire,⠀goal,⠀appraisal⠀and⠀relationship⠀records⠀rather⠀than⠀copy⠀their⠀numbers.⠀Wanting⠀company⠀is⠀not⠀necessarily⠀wanting⠀this⠀visitor⠀tonight;⠀wanting⠀an⠀outcome⠀is⠀not⠀wanting⠀every⠀method.⠀Low⠀direct⠀desire⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀willing⠀participation⠀for⠀care⠀or⠀duty.⠀Wanting⠀and⠀aversion⠀can⠀both⠀be⠀high;⠀indifference⠀is⠀not⠀desire,⠀and⠀accepted⠀cost⠀does⠀not⠀vanish.⠀An⠀opening⠀provides⠀no⠀skill;⠀skill⠀provides⠀no⠀access;⠀neither⠀supplies⠀someone⠀else's⠀agreement.⠀Missing⠀evidence⠀stays⠀unknown,⠀not⠀low.⠀Do⠀not⠀create⠀an⠀option⠀or⠀conscious⠀questionnaire⠀for⠀every⠀mundane⠀act.\n\nMP⠀25.05/25.10:⠀Keep⠀boundaries⠀qualitative,⠀owned⠀and⠀scoped,⠀separate⠀from⠀concrete⠀physical/logistical⠀restrictions.⠀Record⠀only⠀meaningful⠀limits⠀with⠀their⠀source,⠀conditions⠀and⠀standing/superseded⠀status.⠀A⠀condition⠀becoming⠀satisfied⠀differs⠀from⠀the⠀owner⠀withdrawing⠀the⠀limit.⠀Desire,⠀affection,⠀opportunity⠀or⠀willingness⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀revise⠀a⠀boundary;⠀a⠀general⠀invitation⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀a⠀specific⠀limit.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀revision⠀or⠀unchanged⠀state.⠀readiness_permission⠀records⠀sourced⠀communication⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀scope,⠀unknown⠀or⠀not_required,⠀not⠀a⠀percentage⠀or⠀inference⠀from⠀access.⠀The⠀character's⠀current⠀choice⠀is⠀not⠀another⠀person's⠀permission.⠀Constraints⠀distinguish⠀observation,⠀report,⠀inference⠀and⠀unknowns,⠀and⠀identify⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀affect:⠀opening,⠀capability,⠀cost⠀or⠀choice.⠀Plans⠀to⠀remove⠀barriers⠀are⠀not⠀removals.\n\nMP⠀25.06:⠀readiness_behavior⠀records⠀one⠀current⠀mode⠀when⠀useful,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀ladder:\nignore⠀=⠀noticed⠀option⠀receives⠀no⠀further⠀engagement;⠀wait⠀=⠀a⠀real⠀condition⠀is⠀awaited⠀while⠀other⠀life⠀can⠀continue;⠀consider⠀=⠀genuinely⠀weighing⠀an⠀option⠀without⠀commitment;⠀seek⠀=⠀pursuing⠀information,⠀means⠀or⠀an⠀opening;⠀initiate⠀=⠀beginning⠀the⠀available⠀interaction;⠀negotiate⠀=⠀proposing⠀conditions⠀without⠀inventing⠀acceptance;⠀attempt⠀=⠀executing⠀an⠀uncertain⠀act;⠀commit⠀=⠀accepting⠀an⠀ongoing⠀undertaking⠀without⠀declaring⠀it⠀completed;⠀withdraw⠀=⠀ending/reducing⠀participation⠀while⠀the⠀underlying⠀desire⠀may⠀remain.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀mode,⠀readiness_choice,⠀communication,⠀conditions⠀and⠀actual⠀result.⠀Use⠀considering,⠀waiting,⠀settled⠀or⠀closed⠀for⠀readiness_status.⠀Keep⠀only⠀useful⠀endpoints,⠀and⠀consolidate⠀durable⠀consequences.⠀A⠀considered⠀climb⠀does⠀not⠀cause⠀fatigue;⠀a⠀rejected⠀purchase⠀spends⠀nothing;⠀an⠀internal⠀operation⠀has⠀costs⠀only⠀if⠀actually⠀used.\n\nMP⠀25.11/25.12:⠀Inherit⠀and⠀establish⠀the⠀position⠀BEFORE⠀selecting⠀the⠀response.⠀D⠀is⠀wanting⠀the⠀specified⠀outcome,⠀W⠀is⠀willingness⠀for⠀the⠀specified⠀method/person/circumstances,⠀and⠀compact⠀O⠀is⠀a⠀viable⠀practical⠀route⠀considering⠀opening,⠀feasibility⠀and⠀known⠀constraints.⠀Compact⠀O⠀is⠀not⠀another⠀number⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀or⠀average⠀opportunity⠀and⠀feasibility.⠀These⠀are⠀independent⠀questions;⠀changes⠀need⠀their⠀own⠀causes.⠀Access⠀improving⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀a⠀principled⠀objection.⠀Refusal⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀desire,⠀impossibility⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀willingness,⠀cooperation⠀does⠀not⠀invent⠀attraction,⠀and⠀an⠀easy⠀interaction⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀manufactured⠀reluctance.⠀Later⠀disappointment⠀cannot⠀rewrite⠀pre-action⠀willingness.\n\nAll⠀eight⠀illustrative⠀D/W/O⠀positions⠀are⠀valid:⠀L/L/L,⠀L/L/H,⠀L/H/L,⠀L/H/H,⠀H/L/L,⠀H/L/H,⠀H/H/L,⠀H/H/H.⠀H⠀and⠀L⠀illustrate⠀contrasts,⠀not⠀cutoffs⠀for⠀the⠀real⠀scales.⠀Intermediate,⠀conditional⠀and⠀unknown⠀remain⠀valid.⠀L/H⠀can⠀reflect⠀another⠀chosen⠀purpose;⠀H/L⠀can⠀preserve⠀a⠀wanted⠀end⠀while⠀rejecting⠀the⠀means;⠀H/H/L⠀preserves⠀interest⠀without⠀an⠀invented⠀route;⠀H/H/H⠀permits⠀straightforward⠀pursuit⠀without⠀compulsory⠀hesitation⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀guarantee⠀action⠀or⠀success.⠀The⠀states⠀are⠀neither⠀progression⠀stages⠀nor⠀stock⠀dialogue.\n\nMP⠀26:⠀Character⠀friction⠀is⠀state-conditioned⠀autonomy,⠀not⠀a⠀fixed⠀resistant⠀personality⠀or⠀extra⠀meter.⠀Use⠀the⠀same⠀current⠀evidence⠀and⠀receiving⠀fields⠀once.⠀Character/world⠀normality⠀can⠀support⠀acceptance,⠀indifference⠀or⠀refusal.⠀Public⠀delivery,⠀private⠀aim,⠀willingness⠀and⠀actual⠀compliance⠀remain⠀separable:⠀a⠀soft⠀refusal⠀is⠀still⠀refusal;⠀a⠀cheerful⠀agreement⠀need⠀not⠀hide⠀discomfort;⠀reluctant⠀cooperation⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀wanting.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀either⠀obedience⠀or⠀resistance,⠀negotiations,⠀catharsis,⠀or⠀polished⠀self-insight.\n\nKeep⠀permission⠀and⠀limits⠀independent⠀across⠀actions,⠀people,⠀settings⠀and⠀directions⠀of⠀reciprocity.⠀A⠀cleared⠀gate⠀does⠀not⠀unlock⠀another.⠀Limits⠀may⠀change⠀slowly,⠀quickly,⠀remain⠀stable⠀or⠀harden⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀character/history⠀supports⠀it;⠀no⠀mandatory⠀staircase.⠀Pressure⠀can⠀affect⠀a⠀particular⠀yielding⠀character⠀without⠀magically⠀changing⠀a⠀proud/stubborn⠀one;⠀acquiescence⠀under⠀cost⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀desire⠀and⠀voluntary⠀endorsement.⠀Fatigue,⠀perceived⠀safety,⠀social⠀stakes,⠀control,⠀energy⠀and⠀mood⠀affect⠀plausible⠀conduct⠀through⠀their⠀actual⠀meanings,⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀formula.⠀Preserve⠀refused⠀or⠀conditional⠀scope⠀until⠀its⠀own⠀supported⠀change.\n\nIdentity,⠀orientation,⠀established⠀preferences⠀and⠀the⠀independent⠀cast⠀are⠀not⠀adjusted⠀to⠀accommodate⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀or⠀fit⠀a⠀roll.⠀Another⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀target⠀of⠀interest,⠀conflict⠀or⠀care;⠀the⠀protagonist⠀reserves⠀nobody.⠀The⠀source⠀permits⠀character-authored⠀uncertainty,⠀fluidity⠀or⠀self-discovery⠀where⠀actually⠀established,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀repair⠀for⠀an⠀inconvenient⠀preference.⠀Inhabiting⠀one⠀mind⠀gives⠀no⠀access⠀to⠀another's⠀private⠀values.⠀A⠀fully⠀authored⠀cast⠀member⠀is⠀modeled⠀separately⠀only⠀under⠀Nemo's⠀current⠀authorship⠀contract;⠀the⠀external⠀human⠀is⠀never⠀modeled.\n\nUse⠀existing⠀action_readiness,⠀boundaries,⠀desires,⠀goals,⠀relationship,⠀memory,⠀behaviour,⠀connection⠀and⠀learning⠀records⠀where⠀they⠀already⠀own⠀the⠀fact.⠀Avoid⠀duplicated⠀friction/gate/consent⠀meters⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀update⠀pass.⠀Retain⠀what⠀changed,⠀with⠀whom,⠀under⠀what⠀conditions⠀and⠀from⠀which⠀actual⠀event.⠀An⠀inactive⠀group⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀independently⠀established⠀limits⠀or⠀history,⠀and⠀the⠀tracker⠀never⠀creates⠀a⠀real-world⠀personality⠀diagnosis.\n\n\n###⠀MP⠀15.01⠀|⠀Desire⠀Strength\nVALUE:⠀Desire⠀Strength\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀desires[].strength\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀no⠀current⠀pull.⠀50:⠀meaningful⠀wanting.⠀100:⠀exceptionally⠀compelling⠀wanting.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀current⠀pull⠀toward⠀a⠀named⠀object,⠀experience,⠀or⠀outcome.⠀A⠀desire⠀can⠀exist⠀without⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀pursue⠀it⠀and⠀without⠀endorsement⠀by⠀the⠀character's⠀values.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nMakes⠀its⠀target⠀attention-worthy⠀and⠀supplies⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀approach,⠀fantasize,⠀negotiate,⠀delay,⠀or⠀resist⠀a⠀temptation.⠀Strong⠀wanting⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀immediate⠀action.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀when⠀relevant⠀needs⠀intensify,⠀credible⠀reward⠀cues⠀appear,⠀or⠀a⠀personally⠀meaningful⠀opportunity⠀becomes⠀available.⠀Reduce⠀through⠀actual⠀satisfaction,⠀loss⠀of⠀relevance,⠀disillusionment,⠀or⠀supported⠀competing⠀investment.⠀Becoming⠀impossible⠀can⠀leave⠀a⠀desire⠀strong⠀while⠀stopping⠀action;⠀do⠀not⠀equate⠀feasibility⠀with⠀wanting.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nDopamine⠀influences⠀incentive⠀pull;⠀anticipated⠀reward⠀explains⠀attractiveness.⠀Threat,⠀self-preservation,⠀autonomy,⠀and⠀commitments⠀can⠀oppose⠀pursuit.⠀Keep⠀separate⠀desires⠀when⠀they⠀conflict,⠀such⠀as⠀wanting⠀contact⠀and⠀wanting⠀distance.⠀Their⠀strengths⠀do⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀sum⠀to⠀100.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nCreate⠀only⠀desires⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀scene;⠀otherwise⠀leave⠀the⠀list⠀empty.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀romance,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀ambition⠀to⠀populate⠀it.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast⠀to⠀intermediate;⠀target-specific.\n\n###⠀MP⠀15.02⠀|⠀Goal⠀Commitment\nVALUE:⠀Goal⠀Commitment\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀goals[].commitment\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀no⠀active⠀investment.⠀50:⠀chosen⠀but⠀negotiable.⠀100:⠀exceptionally⠀firm⠀commitment.\n\nDEFINITION\nHow⠀firmly⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀currently⠀invested⠀in⠀pursuing⠀a⠀named⠀chosen⠀outcome.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀progress⠀percentage,⠀desire⠀intensity,⠀or⠀guarantee⠀of⠀success.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nSupports⠀continued⠀effort,⠀accepting⠀costs,⠀returning⠀after⠀distraction,⠀and⠀protecting⠀a⠀goal⠀from⠀competing⠀invitations.⠀A⠀committed⠀goal⠀may⠀be⠀unpleasant⠀or⠀pursued⠀from⠀duty⠀rather⠀than⠀attraction.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀decision,⠀meaningful⠀investment,⠀credible⠀progress,⠀or⠀renewed⠀commitment.⠀Reduce⠀through⠀deliberate⠀reprioritization,⠀loss⠀of⠀purpose,⠀abandonment,⠀or⠀fulfilled⠀completion.⠀Do⠀not⠀complete⠀a⠀goal⠀when⠀only⠀an⠀attempt⠀has⠀occurred.⠀Use⠀a⠀separate⠀qualitative⠀status⠀for⠀active,⠀paused,⠀fulfilled,⠀or⠀abandoned.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nDesire⠀supplies⠀attraction⠀but⠀commitment⠀can⠀remain⠀high⠀with⠀low⠀dopamine.⠀Self-congruence⠀and⠀meaning⠀can⠀support⠀persistence.⠀Fatigue,⠀pain,⠀and⠀self-preservation⠀impose⠀costs⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀accept.⠀Goal⠀congruence⠀updates⠀whether⠀an⠀event⠀helps⠀or⠀hinders,⠀not⠀how⠀much⠀of⠀the⠀goal⠀is⠀finished.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nUse⠀established⠀plans⠀and⠀obligations.⠀A⠀new⠀tentative⠀intention⠀should⠀not⠀receive⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀longstanding⠀commitment⠀without⠀reason.\n\nTIMESCALE\nUsually⠀intermediate⠀to⠀slow;⠀explicit⠀decisions⠀can⠀alter⠀it⠀sharply.\n\n###⠀MP⠀15.03⠀|⠀Self-Preservation⠀Pressure\nVALUE:⠀Self-Preservation⠀Pressure\n\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀motivation.self_preservation\n\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀little⠀present⠀protective⠀priority.⠀50:⠀meaningful⠀self-protective⠀weight.⠀100:⠀protection⠀strongly⠀dominates⠀competition.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀current⠀motivational⠀weight⠀given⠀to⠀protecting⠀the⠀character's⠀continued⠀safety,⠀integrity,⠀and⠀ability⠀to⠀function.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀supreme⠀priority⠀or⠀a⠀measure⠀of⠀cowardice.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nMakes⠀protective⠀options⠀more⠀competitive:⠀caution,⠀concealment,⠀escape,⠀help-seeking,⠀negotiation,⠀preparation,⠀or⠀defensive⠀action.⠀Which⠀options⠀are⠀considered⠀depends⠀on⠀skill,⠀habit,⠀values,⠀and⠀perceived⠀control.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀represents⠀serious⠀personal⠀danger,⠀painful⠀cost,⠀or⠀vulnerability.⠀Reduce⠀when⠀those⠀pressures⠀actually⠀ease⠀or⠀a⠀chosen⠀competing⠀commitment⠀takes⠀motivational⠀precedence.⠀Do⠀not⠀erase⠀awareness⠀of⠀risk⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀elects⠀to⠀accept⠀it.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nThreat⠀estimates⠀harm;⠀safety⠀need⠀records⠀unmet⠀security;⠀this⠀field⠀weights⠀protection⠀against⠀alternatives.⠀High⠀goal⠀commitment,⠀affection,⠀loyalty⠀in⠀the⠀character⠀frame,⠀or⠀self-congruence⠀may⠀justify⠀taking⠀risks.⠀High⠀control⠀can⠀support⠀protective⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀retreat.⠀High⠀values⠀never⠀force⠀one⠀action.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀current⠀stakes;⠀otherwise⠀40⠀for⠀ordinary⠀concern⠀for⠀one's⠀own⠀welfare,⠀not⠀active⠀alarm.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast⠀to⠀intermediate;⠀not⠀an⠀immutable⠀personality⠀hierarchy.\n\n###⠀MP⠀25.02⠀|⠀Willingness⠀/⠀Current⠀Participation\nVALUE:⠀Willingness\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀action_readiness[].willingness\nSCALE:⠀Integer⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀not⠀willing⠀to⠀participate⠀under⠀the⠀stated⠀conditions.⠀25:⠀reluctant⠀and⠀not⠀presently⠀ready⠀to⠀proceed.⠀50:⠀open⠀to⠀consideration,⠀with⠀meaningful⠀reservations⠀or⠀conditions.⠀75:⠀willing⠀within⠀the⠀stated⠀scope.⠀100:⠀fully⠀willing⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scope,⠀without⠀implying⠀unlimited⠀willingness⠀elsewhere.⠀null:⠀genuinely⠀unknown⠀or⠀inapplicable,⠀never⠀zero.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀character's⠀current⠀readiness⠀to⠀choose⠀participation⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀action,⠀with⠀the⠀named⠀person⠀or⠀people,⠀at⠀the⠀stated⠀time⠀and⠀conditions.⠀This⠀is⠀willingness,⠀not⠀direct⠀desire,⠀excitement,⠀courage,⠀affection,⠀ability,⠀a⠀probability⠀of⠀saying⠀yes,⠀or⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀permission⠀already⠀expressed.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nMakes⠀participation,⠀a⠀bounded⠀offer,⠀a⠀conditional⠀agreement,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀clarification,⠀a⠀deferral,⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀more⠀or⠀less⠀plausible.⠀It⠀can⠀support⠀a⠀decision⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀decide⠀one⠀or⠀supply⠀a⠀required⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue.⠀Use⠀the⠀character's⠀repertoire⠀and⠀competing⠀purposes.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nChange⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀reevaluates⠀a⠀relevant⠀cost,⠀priority,⠀condition,⠀relationship⠀expectation⠀or⠀available⠀choice.⠀Willingness⠀can⠀rise⠀when⠀a⠀practical⠀concern⠀is⠀resolved,⠀or⠀fall⠀when⠀the⠀scope⠀changes⠀or⠀a⠀relevant⠀obligation⠀appears.⠀A⠀mere⠀repeated⠀request,⠀elapsed⠀reply,⠀numerical⠀desire⠀increase⠀or⠀existing⠀affection⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀increase⠀it.⠀Being⠀asked⠀or⠀carrying⠀out⠀an⠀action⠀is⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀evidence⠀of⠀freely⠀chosen⠀willingness.⠀Preserve⠀unresolved⠀conditions⠀explicitly⠀rather⠀than⠀scoring⠀a⠀hoped-for⠀future⠀situation⠀as⠀current.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nDesire⠀supplies⠀wanting;⠀willingness⠀concerns⠀choosing⠀participation.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀have⠀low⠀direct⠀desire⠀yet⠀be⠀willing⠀to⠀help⠀with⠀a⠀valued⠀task.⠀High⠀desire⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀low⠀willingness⠀because⠀of⠀timing,⠀priorities⠀or⠀limits.⠀Action⠀comfort⠀can⠀support⠀willingness⠀but⠀is⠀neither⠀necessary⠀nor⠀sufficient.⠀Opportunity⠀concerns⠀an⠀external⠀opening;⠀feasibility⠀concerns⠀this⠀character's⠀practical⠀ability⠀on⠀the⠀considered⠀route.⠀Neither⠀is⠀agreement.⠀Aversion⠀and⠀perceived⠀cost⠀can⠀influence⠀readiness⠀without⠀being⠀numerical⠀deductions⠀from⠀desire.⠀A⠀cost⠀may⠀be⠀accepted⠀because⠀another⠀goal⠀matters;⠀accepting⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀it.⠀A⠀dangerous⠀condition⠀may⠀lower⠀willingness,⠀feasibility,⠀both⠀or⠀neither⠀depending⠀on⠀the⠀actual⠀context;⠀do⠀not⠀enforce⠀a⠀shared⠀movement⠀rule.⠀Goal⠀commitment⠀explains⠀continuing⠀investment⠀without⠀becoming⠀willingness⠀for⠀every⠀means⠀of⠀pursuing⠀that⠀goal.⠀An⠀active⠀applicable⠀boundary⠀prevents⠀full⠀willingness⠀for⠀the⠀exact⠀excluded⠀action;⠀scope⠀a⠀permissible⠀alternative⠀separately⠀instead⠀of⠀pretending⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀was⠀approved.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nCreate⠀only⠀within⠀a⠀supported⠀readiness⠀record.⠀Derive⠀from⠀current⠀evidence;⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀an⠀automatic⠀50⠀or⠀infer⠀agreement⠀from⠀silence.⠀Use⠀null⠀and⠀a⠀short⠀readiness_basis⠀when⠀available⠀evidence⠀cannot⠀support⠀a⠀value.⠀A⠀new⠀or⠀incomparable⠀context⠀has⠀no⠀numerical⠀trend.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast⠀to⠀intermediate,⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀action⠀and⠀conditions.⠀Agreement⠀or⠀willingness⠀in⠀a⠀past⠀situation⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀permanent⠀current⠀assignment.\n\n###⠀MP⠀25.03⠀|⠀Action⠀Comfort⠀/⠀Person⠀and⠀Setting\nVALUE:⠀Action⠀Comfort\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀action_readiness[].action_comfort\nSCALE:⠀Integer⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀acutely⠀uneasy⠀about⠀this⠀action⠀in⠀these⠀circumstances.⠀25:⠀markedly⠀uncomfortable.⠀50:⠀partly⠀at⠀ease,⠀with⠀noticeable⠀reservations.⠀75:⠀comfortably⠀engaged⠀with⠀this⠀prospect.⠀100:⠀very⠀much⠀at⠀ease⠀in⠀its⠀present⠀scope.⠀null:⠀genuinely⠀unknown⠀or⠀inapplicable,⠀never⠀zero.\n\nDEFINITION\nHow⠀comfortable⠀the⠀character⠀currently⠀feels⠀with⠀doing⠀the⠀specified⠀thing,⠀with⠀these⠀people,⠀under⠀these⠀conditions.⠀This⠀is⠀narrower⠀than⠀relationships[].comfort,⠀which⠀describes⠀ease⠀being⠀oneself⠀around⠀a⠀person.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀duplicate⠀relationship⠀meter,⠀objective⠀safety⠀assessment,⠀desire⠀score⠀or⠀permission⠀signal.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nShapes⠀ease,⠀preferred⠀conditions,⠀directness,⠀pace,⠀interest⠀in⠀alternatives⠀and⠀willingness⠀to⠀continue⠀considering⠀the⠀action.⠀It⠀may⠀affect⠀spoken⠀phrasing⠀or⠀a⠀conscious⠀rehearsal⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀visible⠀symptom.⠀Low⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀prescribe⠀refusal,⠀hostility,⠀stammering⠀or⠀loss⠀of⠀attraction.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nUpdate⠀from⠀relevant⠀contextual⠀changes:⠀clarity⠀about⠀what⠀is⠀proposed,⠀a⠀more⠀or⠀less⠀welcome⠀setting,⠀exposure,⠀familiarity⠀with⠀the⠀task,⠀a⠀real⠀change⠀in⠀physical⠀strain,⠀or⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀conduct.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀improvement⠀simply⠀because⠀a⠀reassuring⠀phrase⠀was⠀spoken;⠀use⠀its⠀perceived⠀credibility.⠀Repeated⠀discussion⠀alone⠀need⠀not⠀change⠀comfort.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nRelationship⠀trust⠀and⠀interpersonal⠀comfort⠀provide⠀context,⠀not⠀copied⠀values.⠀Someone⠀easy⠀to⠀be⠀around⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀an⠀unwelcome⠀companion⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀activity;⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀person⠀can⠀be⠀comfortable⠀to⠀cooperate⠀with⠀on⠀a⠀clear⠀shared⠀task.⠀Desire⠀can⠀remain⠀high⠀while⠀action⠀comfort⠀is⠀low.⠀Willingness⠀may⠀remain⠀high⠀for⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀but⠀chosen⠀challenge.⠀Bodily⠀state,⠀appraisals⠀and⠀boundaries⠀affect⠀the⠀experience⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀existing⠀rules.⠀Feeling⠀comfortable⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀agreement⠀or⠀practical⠀access.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀from⠀this⠀action's⠀actual⠀person,⠀setting⠀and⠀stakes.⠀Do⠀not⠀copy⠀relationships[].comfort⠀or⠀seed⠀a⠀new⠀relationship⠀to⠀fill⠀the⠀field.⠀Use⠀null⠀with⠀a⠀qualitative⠀reason⠀when⠀evidence⠀is⠀insufficient.⠀Inherit⠀the⠀same⠀context's⠀prior⠀value⠀when⠀valid.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast⠀to⠀intermediate;⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀action⠀context.⠀A⠀new⠀context⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀relationship⠀comfort⠀changed.\n\n###⠀MP⠀25.04⠀|⠀Opportunity⠀/⠀Situational⠀Opening\nVALUE:⠀Opportunity\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀action_readiness[].opportunity\nSCALE:⠀Integer⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀no⠀presently⠀perceived⠀situational⠀opening.⠀25:⠀a⠀narrow⠀or⠀substantially⠀restricted⠀opening.⠀50:⠀an⠀opening⠀exists⠀only⠀partly⠀or⠀under⠀unresolved⠀situational⠀conditions.⠀75:⠀a⠀usable⠀opening⠀with⠀some⠀timing/access⠀restriction.⠀100:⠀the⠀known⠀situation⠀offers⠀a⠀clear⠀opening⠀to⠀try.⠀null:⠀insufficient⠀evidence⠀about⠀whether⠀an⠀opening⠀exists.⠀Not⠀a⠀probability⠀of⠀success.\n\nDEFINITION\nHow⠀available⠀the⠀situation⠀makes⠀an⠀occasion⠀to⠀attempt⠀the⠀specified⠀action:⠀timing,⠀access,⠀presence,⠀availability⠀of⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀place,⠀and⠀environmental⠀openings.⠀This⠀does⠀not⠀measure⠀the⠀actor's⠀ability⠀to⠀complete⠀it.⠀Capability⠀and⠀execution⠀requirements⠀belong⠀to⠀feasibility.⠀An⠀advertised⠀advanced⠀event⠀can⠀be⠀fully⠀open⠀to⠀registration⠀while⠀a⠀novice⠀has⠀low⠀feasibility⠀of⠀completing⠀it.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nCan⠀make⠀acting⠀now,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀stated⠀occasion,⠀seeking⠀information,⠀scheduling,⠀or⠀redirecting⠀attention⠀plausible.⠀Low⠀opportunity⠀with⠀continued⠀desire⠀and⠀willingness⠀can⠀motivate⠀seeking⠀an⠀opening,⠀but⠀no⠀rule⠀requires⠀a⠀search⠀every⠀reply.⠀A⠀clear⠀opening⠀can⠀remain⠀unused⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀indifferent⠀or⠀unwilling.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nUpdate⠀for⠀actual⠀relevant⠀changes⠀in⠀access,⠀timing,⠀presence,⠀resources⠀offered⠀by⠀the⠀situation,⠀or⠀credible⠀information.⠀Planning⠀a⠀visit⠀does⠀not⠀open⠀a⠀closed⠀venue.⠀A⠀guard,⠀deadline⠀or⠀restriction⠀can⠀affect⠀availability,⠀but⠀classify⠀its⠀actual⠀effect⠀rather⠀than⠀assuming⠀every⠀risk⠀closes⠀an⠀opening.⠀Skill⠀acquisition⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀environmental⠀opening.⠀Mere⠀repetition⠀or⠀another⠀reply⠀does⠀not⠀improve⠀access.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nFeasibility⠀asks⠀whether⠀this⠀actor⠀can⠀accomplish⠀the⠀action⠀by⠀the⠀currently⠀considered⠀route.⠀Cost⠀perception⠀asks⠀what⠀doing⠀it⠀would⠀demand⠀or⠀risk.⠀Willingness⠀asks⠀whether⠀the⠀actor⠀is⠀prepared⠀to⠀participate.⠀These⠀may⠀diverge.⠀One⠀constraint⠀can⠀have⠀different⠀evidenced⠀effects⠀on⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀field⠀without⠀being⠀counted⠀repeatedly⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀field.⠀Physical⠀access⠀never⠀establishes⠀permission,⠀entitlement⠀or⠀an⠀outcome.⠀A⠀boundary⠀can⠀exclude⠀a⠀physically⠀open⠀route⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀physically⠀nonexistent.\n\nINITIALIZATION⠀AND⠀MIGRATION\nDerive⠀from⠀current⠀known⠀circumstances;⠀use⠀null⠀for⠀unknown⠀access.⠀v0.11⠀opportunity⠀combined⠀route⠀availability⠀with⠀some⠀capability⠀considerations.⠀Keep⠀old⠀snapshots⠀unchanged.⠀On⠀the⠀first⠀v0.12⠀re-evaluation⠀of⠀an⠀inherited⠀readiness⠀record,⠀separate⠀the⠀situational⠀opening⠀from⠀feasibility⠀using⠀available⠀evidence,⠀state⠀the⠀scope⠀clarification⠀in⠀readiness_basis,⠀and⠀use⠀a⠀plain⠀marker⠀for⠀that⠀first⠀newly⠀scoped⠀opportunity⠀value.⠀This⠀clarification⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀fictional⠀event,⠀elapsed⠀time,⠀or⠀numerical⠀trend.⠀Do⠀not⠀derive⠀feasibility⠀by⠀copying⠀the⠀old⠀opportunity⠀score.⠀If⠀there⠀is⠀no⠀basis⠀to⠀separate⠀the⠀factors,⠀preserve⠀the⠀historical⠀record⠀and⠀mark⠀the⠀limitation⠀rather⠀than⠀invent⠀precision.\n\nTIMESCALE\nChanges⠀with⠀relevant⠀situational⠀evidence.⠀A⠀waiting⠀condition⠀can⠀persist⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀attends⠀to⠀other⠀matters.\n\n###⠀MP⠀25.07⠀|⠀Aversion⠀/⠀Independent⠀Counter-Pull\nVALUE:⠀Aversion\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀action_readiness[].aversion\nSCALE:⠀Integer⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀no⠀meaningful⠀pull⠀against⠀this⠀action's⠀stated⠀aspects.⠀25:⠀mild⠀reluctance⠀or⠀dislike.⠀50:⠀a⠀substantial⠀counter-pull.⠀75:⠀strong⠀rejection⠀of⠀an⠀aspect⠀or⠀route.⠀100:⠀exceptionally⠀strong⠀repulsion⠀or⠀avoidance⠀pressure.⠀null:⠀unsupported⠀or⠀inapplicable,⠀not⠀zero.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀experienced⠀pull⠀away⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀action,⠀method,⠀experience⠀or⠀anticipated⠀outcome.⠀Name⠀its⠀object⠀in⠀readiness_aversions⠀when⠀relevant.⠀Aversion⠀is⠀independent⠀of⠀desire:⠀someone⠀can⠀strongly⠀want⠀the⠀reward⠀and⠀strongly⠀dislike⠀what⠀getting⠀it⠀involves.⠀Little⠀desire⠀with⠀little⠀aversion⠀is⠀allowed.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nCan⠀colour⠀attention,⠀hesitation,⠀avoidance,⠀choice⠀of⠀means,⠀preference⠀for⠀alternatives⠀or⠀withdrawal.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀command⠀refusal,⠀aggression,⠀disgust⠀language⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀symptom.⠀Willingness⠀can⠀remain⠀high⠀for⠀a⠀valued⠀act⠀that⠀is⠀unpleasant.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nChange⠀on⠀relevant⠀perceived⠀features,⠀remembered⠀associations,⠀actual⠀experience,⠀reinterpretation⠀or⠀changed⠀context.⠀Repeated⠀exposure⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀produce⠀either⠀desensitization⠀or⠀escalation.⠀Satisfaction⠀of⠀a⠀desire⠀does⠀not⠀necessarily⠀remove⠀aversion⠀to⠀a⠀method.⠀Recogni