them.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nCan⠀support⠀accepting⠀a⠀trade-off,⠀setting⠀conditions,⠀seeking⠀a⠀less⠀costly⠀alternative,⠀waiting⠀or⠀declining.⠀The⠀same⠀burden⠀can⠀be⠀acceptable⠀to⠀one⠀goal⠀and⠀unacceptable⠀to⠀another.⠀High⠀perceived⠀cost⠀neither⠀means⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀unable⠀nor⠀requires⠀unwillingness.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nChange⠀when⠀evidence,⠀route,⠀scope,⠀resource⠀availability,⠀stakes⠀or⠀priorities⠀relevant⠀to⠀perceived⠀sacrifice⠀change.⠀A⠀supported⠀reinterpretation⠀may⠀change⠀expected⠀cost⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀external⠀facts.⠀Actual⠀failure⠀can⠀inform⠀a⠀later⠀estimate,⠀but⠀imagining⠀failure⠀is⠀not⠀evidence⠀it⠀occurred.⠀Different⠀risks⠀or⠀obligations⠀need⠀not⠀reduce⠀to⠀one⠀moral⠀ranking.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nFeasibility⠀concerns⠀whether⠀the⠀actor⠀can⠀do⠀it,⠀opportunity⠀whether⠀an⠀opening⠀exists,⠀aversion⠀the⠀pull⠀against⠀it,⠀and⠀willingness⠀whether⠀they⠀are⠀prepared⠀to⠀participate.⠀Threat⠀appraisal⠀is⠀one⠀possible⠀input,⠀not⠀the⠀total⠀cost.⠀Fatigue⠀or⠀limited⠀time⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀effort⠀more⠀costly⠀without⠀themselves⠀being⠀newly⠀spent.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀the⠀same⠀risk⠀once⠀as⠀threat,⠀again⠀as⠀aversion⠀and⠀again⠀as⠀a⠀constraint⠀to⠀repeatedly⠀inflate⠀this⠀value.⠀A⠀decision⠀to⠀accept⠀a⠀cost⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀estimate.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nUse⠀known⠀conditions⠀and⠀this⠀character's⠀actual⠀priorities.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀in⠀readiness_costs/readiness_basis⠀and⠀use⠀null⠀when⠀unsupported.⠀No⠀fixed⠀default⠀or⠀trend⠀for⠀a⠀new⠀field.⠀Estimates⠀are⠀not⠀facts⠀about⠀how⠀the⠀world⠀will⠀respond.\n\nTIMESCALE\nProspective⠀and⠀action-scoped;⠀updates⠀on⠀relevant⠀evidence⠀or⠀reappraisal.⠀Apply⠀actual⠀consequences⠀only⠀after⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀event⠀occurs⠀under⠀existing⠀state⠀rules.\n\n###⠀MP⠀25.09⠀|⠀Feasibility⠀/⠀Actor,⠀Route⠀and⠀Means\nVALUE:⠀Feasibility\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀action_readiness[].feasibility\nSCALE:⠀Integer⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀the⠀stated⠀route⠀is⠀not⠀realistically⠀achievable⠀by⠀this⠀actor⠀under⠀known⠀conditions.⠀25:⠀major⠀execution⠀barriers.⠀50:⠀partly⠀achievable⠀or⠀materially⠀conditional.⠀75:⠀reasonably⠀achievable⠀with⠀known⠀means⠀and⠀a⠀manageable⠀limitation.⠀100:⠀no⠀known⠀material⠀execution⠀barrier⠀for⠀this⠀actor⠀and⠀route.⠀null:⠀insufficient⠀knowledge⠀to⠀assess.⠀Not⠀a⠀probability,⠀guarantee,⠀hidden⠀competence⠀score⠀or⠀forecast⠀of⠀another⠀person's⠀response.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀character-relative⠀estimate⠀of⠀whether⠀this⠀particular⠀actor⠀can⠀accomplish⠀the⠀stated⠀action⠀through⠀the⠀considered⠀route,⠀given⠀established⠀abilities,⠀resources,⠀means⠀and⠀constraints.⠀State⠀route/conditions⠀in⠀readiness_context⠀and⠀source/uncertainty⠀in⠀readiness_external_basis.⠀This⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀external/practical⠀layer⠀while⠀remaining⠀limited⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows;⠀private⠀optimism⠀cannot⠀overwrite⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀constraints.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nCan⠀support⠀trying,⠀preparing,⠀seeking⠀information⠀or⠀appropriate⠀help,⠀choosing⠀a⠀different⠀route,⠀waiting⠀or⠀withdrawing.⠀Ability⠀does⠀not⠀decide⠀willingness,⠀and⠀lack⠀of⠀ability⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀wanting.⠀An⠀overconfident⠀estimate⠀can⠀lead⠀to⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀secretly⠀granting⠀competence.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nUpdate⠀for⠀supported⠀information,⠀real⠀changes⠀in⠀means⠀or⠀physical⠀condition,⠀established⠀learning,⠀or⠀a⠀genuinely⠀different⠀considered⠀route.⠀Being⠀more⠀motivated⠀does⠀not⠀instantly⠀supply⠀skill.⠀A⠀risky⠀condition⠀may⠀reduce⠀attainability,⠀increase⠀cost,⠀both,⠀or⠀neither:⠀identify⠀the⠀actual⠀obstacle.⠀A⠀guard⠀standing⠀nearby⠀and⠀a⠀locked⠀barrier⠀are⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀restriction.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀routes,⠀instructions,⠀resources⠀or⠀successful⠀outcomes⠀merely⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀number⠀rise.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nOpportunity⠀is⠀the⠀situational⠀opening,⠀not⠀this⠀actor's⠀capacity.⠀Cost⠀is⠀an⠀expected⠀sacrifice,⠀not⠀ability.⠀Willingness⠀is⠀readiness,⠀not⠀skill.⠀needs.competence⠀measures⠀an⠀unmet⠀need⠀and⠀is⠀NOT⠀evidence⠀of⠀actual⠀ability;⠀draw⠀ability⠀from⠀the⠀card,⠀established⠀actions,⠀knowledge⠀and⠀means.⠀Existing⠀perceived⠀control⠀is⠀issue-level⠀appraisal,⠀not⠀a⠀duplicate⠀numerical⠀capability.⠀Keep⠀a⠀physical⠀limitation