            "content": "{{// @category Mental-Projection }}{{// @icon 🧠 }}{{// @badge MP }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{setvar::NMPg_workspace::1}}\nMENTAL⠀PROJECTION⠀GROUP⠀07:⠀Conscious⠀Workspace\nIncludes⠀20.00,⠀20.01,⠀20.02,⠀20.03.⠀Cross-references⠀use⠀these⠀source⠀labels;⠀the⠀group,⠀not⠀separate⠀per-field⠀toggles,⠀controls⠀their⠀presence.\n\nCONSCIOUS⠀WORKSPACE:⠀CHARACTER⠀EXPERIENCE,⠀NOT⠀MODEL⠀DELIBERATION\n\nMP⠀20.00⠀represents⠀consciously⠀present⠀contents⠀and⠀attempts⠀to⠀work⠀with⠀them.⠀Use⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀vocabulary,⠀knowledge,⠀habits,⠀imagery⠀and⠀mistakes.⠀Awareness⠀is⠀not⠀choice,⠀understanding,⠀control⠀or⠀successful⠀execution.⠀An⠀unbidden⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀vivid⠀and⠀hard⠀to⠀stop;⠀a⠀chosen⠀technique⠀can⠀fail;⠀low⠀self-awareness⠀does⠀not⠀prohibit⠀inner⠀speech.⠀Prominence,⠀steerability⠀and⠀deliberate⠀effort⠀remain⠀separate⠀values.\n\nUse⠀qualitative⠀process_kind⠀such⠀as⠀monologue,⠀deliberation,⠀imagery,⠀rehearsal,⠀retrieval,⠀attention_shift,⠀reappraisal,⠀self_talk,⠀suppression,⠀creative_association,⠀mental_calculation⠀or⠀monitoring.⠀These⠀are⠀examples,⠀not⠀compulsory⠀stages⠀or⠀additional⠀scores.⠀Inner⠀activity⠀can⠀be⠀nonverbal,⠀mundane,⠀selfish,⠀mistaken,⠀aimless⠀or⠀unresolved.⠀process_content⠀is⠀a⠀brief⠀fictional⠀experience,⠀never⠀the⠀model's⠀reasoning⠀log⠀or⠀numerical⠀derivation.\n\nA⠀relevant⠀record⠀preserves⠀process_kind,⠀spontaneous/chosen/habitual⠀origin,⠀content,⠀goal⠀or⠀null,⠀target,⠀actual⠀method⠀or⠀null,⠀result⠀so⠀far,⠀active/paused/interrupted/completed/abandoned⠀status,⠀real⠀resume⠀cue⠀or⠀null,⠀and⠀supported⠀input/output⠀lists.⠀Apply⠀the⠀three⠀VALUE⠀definitions⠀below.⠀New⠀active⠀records⠀require⠀conscious⠀presence,⠀not⠀an⠀inferred⠀unconscious⠀mechanism.⠀Usually⠀one⠀to⠀three⠀active⠀processes⠀are⠀enough,⠀not⠀a⠀quota.⠀Paused/completed⠀content⠀is⠀last-known,⠀not⠀ongoing⠀speech;⠀retain⠀it⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀useful.\n\nBefore⠀the⠀act⠀it⠀informs,⠀resolve⠀the⠀mental⠀operation⠀using⠀actual⠀knowledge,⠀established⠀methods,⠀usable⠀attention,⠀duration⠀and⠀effort.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀rehearse⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀reconsider⠀evidence,⠀not⠀assign⠀cortisol,⠀select⠀an⠀emotion⠀by⠀command,⠀summon⠀absent⠀memories⠀or⠀erase⠀a⠀bodily⠀need.⠀Imagined⠀reassurance⠀is⠀not⠀reassurance⠀received.⠀Result⠀may⠀be⠀unchanged,⠀partial,⠀wrong,⠀interrupted⠀or⠀not⠀attempted.⠀A⠀lengthy⠀task⠀cannot⠀finish⠀in⠀an⠀instant;⠀no⠀unsupported⠀completion⠀offscreen.⠀Route⠀supported⠀effects⠀once⠀through⠀their⠀receiving⠀definitions.⠀Reprinting⠀a⠀process⠀is⠀not⠀another⠀execution⠀and⠀an⠀internal⠀response⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀second⠀external⠀stressor.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀ongoing⠀task,⠀actual⠀result⠀and⠀real⠀restart⠀condition.⠀Existing⠀desires⠀and⠀goals⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀records;⠀a⠀technique⠀being⠀available⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀it⠀was⠀used.⠀Endpoint⠀records⠀summarize⠀the⠀accepted⠀interval,⠀while⠀any⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀placed⠀before⠀the⠀conduct⠀it⠀informed⠀under⠀Nemo's⠀interiority⠀contract.\n\n\n###⠀MP⠀20.01⠀|⠀Process⠀Prominence\nVALUE:⠀Process⠀Prominence\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀internal_processes[].process_prominence\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀not⠀presently⠀in⠀conscious⠀attention.⠀25:⠀faint⠀but⠀noticed.⠀50:⠀clearly⠀present⠀alongside⠀other⠀contents.⠀100:⠀dominating⠀the⠀current⠀conscious⠀workspace.\n\nDEFINITION\nHow⠀strongly⠀this⠀specific⠀process⠀occupies⠀conscious⠀experience⠀now.⠀This⠀is⠀the⠀prominence⠀of⠀a⠀noticed⠀thought⠀or⠀mental⠀action,⠀not⠀the⠀intensity⠀of⠀its⠀emotion,⠀confidence⠀in⠀its⠀truth,⠀or⠀insight⠀into⠀its⠀origin.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nInfluences⠀how⠀readily⠀the⠀content⠀enters⠀the⠀working⠀set,⠀interrupts⠀another⠀activity,⠀or⠀is⠀available⠀for⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀engage.⠀A⠀foreground⠀process⠀may⠀shape⠀phrasing⠀and⠀perception⠀without⠀being⠀spoken.⠀A⠀faint⠀thought⠀need⠀not⠀drive⠀behaviour.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀when⠀a⠀personally⠀relevant⠀cue⠀captures⠀attention,⠀the⠀character⠀deliberately⠀attends⠀to⠀the⠀process,⠀or⠀a⠀concern⠀remains⠀genuinely⠀hard⠀to⠀disengage⠀from.⠀Decrease⠀when⠀attention⠀really⠀shifts,⠀a⠀task⠀completes,⠀or⠀an⠀interruption⠀displaces⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀increase⠀simply⠀because⠀the⠀tracker⠀repeats⠀it.⠀At⠀zero,⠀the⠀process⠀is⠀not⠀currently⠀conscious;⠀mark⠀a⠀retained⠀record⠀paused,⠀interrupted,⠀completed,⠀or⠀abandoned⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀new⠀unobserved⠀thought⠀content.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nGlobal⠀focus⠀and⠀breadth⠀shape⠀the⠀workspace;⠀prominence⠀identifies⠀what⠀occupies⠀it.⠀Working-memory⠀load⠀limits⠀simultaneous⠀engagement.⠀Rumination⠀can⠀sustain⠀an⠀unwanted⠀process⠀at⠀high⠀prominence⠀while⠀steerability⠀is⠀low.⠀Self-awareness⠀concerns⠀interpretation⠀of⠀internal⠀causes⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀duplicate⠀of⠀this⠀value.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nCreate⠀no⠀score⠀without⠀a⠀supported⠀process⠀record.⠀Infer⠀from⠀the⠀scene;⠀for⠀a⠀newly⠀recognized,⠀clearly⠀present⠀process⠀without⠀finer⠀evidence,⠀use⠀50.⠀A⠀retained⠀noncurrent⠀process⠀may⠀have⠀zero⠀prominence⠀without⠀deleting⠀its⠀identity.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast;⠀changes⠀with⠀actual⠀shifts⠀of⠀conscious⠀attention,⠀not⠀message⠀count.\n\n###⠀MP⠀20.02⠀|⠀Process⠀Steerability\nVALUE:⠀Process⠀Steerability\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀internal_processes[].process_steerability\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀practically⠀unable⠀to⠀redirect⠀this⠀process⠀now.⠀25:⠀redirection⠀is⠀difficult⠀and⠀brief.⠀50:⠀partial⠀control⠀with⠀suitable⠀effort.⠀100:⠀readily⠀start,⠀redirect,⠀pause,⠀or⠀end⠀this⠀process⠀under⠀current⠀conditions.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀currently⠀available⠀ability⠀to⠀steer⠀this⠀particular⠀mental⠀activity.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀control⠀of⠀the⠀external⠀situation,⠀guaranteed⠀success⠀at⠀a⠀problem,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀will⠀choose⠀to⠀exercise⠀it.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nConstrains⠀attempts⠀to⠀shift⠀attention,⠀change⠀inner⠀wording,⠀alter⠀an⠀image,⠀abandon⠀a⠀loop,⠀or⠀sustain⠀a⠀chosen⠀mental⠀operation.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀redirect⠀their⠀response⠀to⠀a⠀worry⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀stop⠀the⠀worry⠀occurring.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀with⠀supported⠀disengagement,⠀usable⠀task⠀structure,⠀relevant⠀practice⠀already⠀established,⠀or⠀relief⠀of⠀competing⠀demands.⠀Decrease⠀with⠀overload,⠀intrusive⠀recurrence,⠀fatigue,⠀or⠀a⠀genuinely⠀overwhelming⠀cue.⠀Do⠀not⠀raise⠀it⠀merely⠀because⠀a⠀process⠀is⠀labelled⠀chosen,⠀or⠀lower⠀it⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀elects⠀to⠀continue⠀an⠀unpleasant⠀thought.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nProminence⠀can⠀be⠀high⠀at⠀any⠀steerability.⠀Deliberate⠀effort⠀can⠀work⠀within⠀current⠀limits⠀without⠀purchasing⠀certain⠀success.⠀Cognitive⠀flexibility,⠀working-memory⠀load,⠀and⠀established⠀techniques⠀inform⠀the⠀estimate.⠀Perceived⠀external⠀control⠀and⠀self-awareness⠀provide⠀context⠀but⠀remain⠀separate⠀values.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀overestimate⠀or⠀underestimate⠀their⠀ability⠀in⠀process_content.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀from⠀this⠀activity,⠀character,⠀and⠀current⠀situation.⠀When⠀genuinely⠀unspecified,⠀use⠀50⠀for⠀a⠀manageable⠀everyday⠀mental⠀action;⠀infer⠀differently⠀for⠀a⠀demonstrated⠀hard-to-stop⠀process.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast⠀to⠀intermediate;⠀supported⠀conditions⠀and⠀practice,⠀not⠀automatic⠀improvement⠀each⠀reply.\n\n###⠀MP⠀20.03⠀|⠀Process⠀Effort\nVALUE:⠀Process⠀Effort\nTRACKER⠀FIELD:⠀internal_processes[].process_effort\nSCALE:⠀0-100.⠀0:⠀no⠀deliberate⠀effort⠀is⠀being⠀spent⠀on⠀this⠀process⠀now.⠀25:⠀light⠀engagement.⠀50:⠀sustained,⠀noticeable⠀mental⠀work.⠀100:⠀near-maximal⠀deliberate⠀engagement⠀under⠀current⠀conditions.\n\nDEFINITION\nThe⠀deliberate⠀cognitive⠀work⠀actually⠀being⠀invested⠀in⠀this⠀particular⠀operation⠀during⠀the⠀current⠀lived⠀interval.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀available⠀energy,⠀a⠀success⠀probability,⠀distress⠀intensity,⠀or⠀the⠀mere⠀presence⠀of⠀thought.\n\nWHAT⠀IT⠀AFFECTS\nHelps⠀determine⠀how⠀much⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀limited⠀attention⠀is⠀engaged,⠀which⠀competing⠀activities⠀become⠀harder,⠀and⠀whether⠀continued⠀work⠀meaningfully⠀contributes⠀to⠀cognitive⠀load⠀or⠀eventual⠀fatigue.⠀It⠀can⠀support⠀persistence⠀without⠀guaranteeing⠀correctness⠀or⠀emotional⠀change.\n\nHOW⠀IT⠀CHANGES\nIncrease⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀starts,⠀intensifies,⠀or⠀struggles⠀to⠀sustain⠀a⠀chosen⠀mental⠀operation.⠀Decrease⠀when⠀it⠀becomes⠀easier,⠀is⠀interrupted,⠀is⠀paused,⠀or⠀is⠀completed.⠀A⠀planned⠀but⠀unattempted⠀exercise⠀has⠀no⠀execution⠀cost⠀yet.⠀Habitual⠀or⠀spontaneous⠀content⠀may⠀be⠀highly⠀prominent⠀with⠀little⠀deliberate⠀effort.\n\nINTERACTIONS\nSteerability⠀limits⠀what⠀effort⠀can⠀accomplish.⠀Working-memory⠀load⠀and⠀fatigue⠀reflect⠀supported⠀consequences,⠀considering⠀fictional⠀duration⠀and⠀overlapping⠀demands.⠀Several⠀process⠀scores⠀are⠀not⠀additive⠀percentages⠀of⠀a⠀fixed⠀resource⠀budget.⠀Do⠀not⠀charge⠀the⠀same⠀effort⠀once⠀per⠀causal⠀label⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀brief⠀thought⠀immediately⠀exhausting.⠀The⠀result⠀of⠀a⠀difficult⠀calculation⠀may⠀remain⠀wrong⠀despite⠀high⠀effort.\n\nINITIALIZATION\nInfer⠀actual⠀work⠀performed,⠀not⠀hoped-for⠀effort.⠀Use⠀zero⠀for⠀a⠀spontaneous⠀thought⠀with⠀no⠀deliberate⠀engagement;⠀use⠀25⠀for⠀a⠀lightly⠀applied⠀familiar⠀operation⠀when⠀no⠀more⠀specific⠀evidence⠀exists.\n\nTIMESCALE\nFast⠀for⠀engagement;⠀accumulated⠀fatigue⠀requires⠀appropriate⠀duration⠀and⠀context⠀under⠀its⠀existing⠀VALUE⠀prompt.{{/if}}\n{{trim}}",
