            "content": "{{// @category Mental-Projection }}{{// @tooltip Automatic compatibility boundary for selected psychological/violence pressure with Mental Projection. Difficulty sets baseline; selected augments set pressure; MP owns actual state updates. }}{{// @icon 🧠 }}{{// @badge AUTO }}{{// @hidden }}\n{{setvar::NMPPressureActive::0}}{{if {{getvar::NemoWorldMod_v11_613_augment_psychological_emotional_realism}}}}{{setvar::NMPPressureActive::1}}{{/if}}{{if {{getvar::NemoWorldMod_v11_610_augment_violence_realism}}}}{{setvar::NMPPressureActive::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPPressureActive}}}}\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀EMOTIONAL⠀PRESSURE⠀&⠀MENTAL⠀STATE⠀OWNERSHIP\n\nUse⠀one⠀causal⠀chain⠀for⠀emotional⠀pressure.⠀The⠀active⠀Difficulty⠀establishes⠀the⠀setting/character⠀baseline⠀for⠀what⠀is⠀ordinary,⠀surprising,⠀exhausting,⠀or⠀overwhelming;⠀current⠀selection:⠀{{getvar::DifficultyName}}.⠀The⠀selected⠀world⠀augments⠀sharpen⠀what⠀kinds⠀of⠀pressure⠀and⠀durable⠀consequences⠀this⠀fiction⠀emphasizes.⠀Mental⠀Projection,⠀when⠀enabled,⠀owns⠀the⠀actual⠀character-state⠀update⠀through⠀only⠀its⠀selected⠀VALUE⠀definitions⠀and⠀records.⠀Do⠀not⠀run⠀a⠀second⠀generic⠀psychology⠀engine⠀beside⠀it.\n\nBASELINE⠀→⠀EVENT⠀→⠀APPRAISAL/STATE⠀→⠀CONDUCT⠀→⠀ACCEPTED⠀ENDPOINT.\nApply⠀an⠀actual⠀cause⠀once⠀to⠀each⠀receiving⠀field⠀it⠀genuinely⠀affects.⠀The⠀same⠀injury,⠀killing,⠀loss,⠀threat,⠀memory,⠀recap,⠀tracker⠀display,⠀workbench⠀review,⠀or⠀repeated⠀description⠀is⠀not⠀another⠀event⠀merely⠀because⠀several⠀active⠀prompts⠀mention⠀it.⠀A⠀later⠀genuinely⠀new⠀consequence⠀can⠀update⠀state⠀again.\n\nDifficulty⠀calibrates⠀exposure;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀immunize⠀a⠀character⠀or⠀force⠀distress.⠀Training,⠀culture,⠀profession,⠀prior⠀exposure,⠀personality,⠀present⠀exhaustion,⠀relationships,⠀available⠀coping,⠀and⠀the⠀event's⠀meaning⠀determine⠀the⠀form⠀and⠀magnitude⠀of⠀response.⠀Keep⠀unchanged⠀values⠀unchanged⠀where⠀nothing⠀relevant⠀moved.⠀A⠀routine⠀danger⠀can⠀remain⠀routine⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀while⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀overwhelms⠀another⠀when⠀their⠀history⠀and⠀stakes⠀support⠀that⠀difference.\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoWorldMod_v11_613_augment_psychological_emotional_realism}}}}\nPSYCHOLOGICAL⠀EROSION⠀IS⠀ACTIVE.\nTreat⠀its⠀accumulated⠀strain,⠀damaged⠀trust,⠀flawed⠀coping,⠀worldview⠀shifts,⠀and⠀durable⠀deterioration⠀as⠀an⠀intentionally⠀harsh⠀world-pressure⠀lens.⠀Prolonged⠀or⠀repeated⠀meaningful⠀stress⠀may⠀accumulate⠀rather⠀than⠀resetting⠀between⠀scenes,⠀and⠀a⠀sufficiently⠀consequential⠀event⠀may⠀leave⠀durable⠀or⠀permanent⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀weaken⠀an⠀earned⠀deterioration⠀merely⠀to⠀restore⠀a⠀comfortable⠀baseline.\nIt⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀automatic⠀per-message⠀debit.⠀Do⠀not⠀lower⠀optimism,⠀trust,⠀regulation,⠀flexibility,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀other⠀MP⠀values⠀simply⠀because⠀another⠀turn⠀passed,⠀because⠀the⠀module⠀is⠀enabled,⠀or⠀because⠀old⠀distress⠀was⠀restated.⠀Select⠀the⠀actual⠀affected⠀MP⠀fields⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀definitions⠀and⠀scopes.⠀A⠀permanent⠀thematic⠀consequence⠀can⠀live⠀in⠀memory,⠀beliefs,⠀expectations,⠀relationships,⠀habits,⠀coping,⠀or⠀other⠀supported⠀state⠀without⠀requiring⠀every⠀numeric⠀field⠀to⠀worsen.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoWorldMod_v11_610_augment_violence_realism}}}}\nVIOLENCE⠀REALISM⠀IS⠀ACTIVE.\nKeep⠀physical⠀injury,⠀pain,⠀fatigue,⠀shock,⠀treatment⠀and⠀recovery⠀in⠀their⠀existing⠀physical⠀owners.⠀Violence⠀can⠀create⠀acute⠀or⠀lasting⠀psychological⠀consequence,⠀but⠀MP⠀determines⠀that⠀consequence⠀from⠀the⠀person's⠀exposure⠀and⠀interpretation⠀rather⠀than⠀copying⠀a⠀universal⠀symptom⠀list⠀into⠀every⠀mind.⠀Experience⠀may⠀change⠀severity,⠀timing,⠀awareness,⠀expression⠀or⠀coping⠀without⠀making⠀meaningful⠀violence⠀consequence-free.\nA⠀severe⠀killing,⠀injury,⠀helplessness,⠀witnessed⠀horror,⠀betrayal⠀under⠀violence,⠀or⠀other⠀threshold-crossing⠀event⠀can⠀justify⠀a⠀large⠀or⠀durable⠀change⠀when⠀the⠀relevant⠀MP⠀definition⠀permits⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀same⠀nightmare,⠀shaking,⠀withdrawal,⠀paranoia⠀or⠀trauma⠀label⠀for⠀every⠀participant⠀or⠀witness.\n{{/if}}\n\nPERSISTENCE⠀AND⠀RECOVERY\nOngoing⠀unresolved⠀pressure⠀can⠀sustain⠀an⠀existing⠀episode⠀or⠀keep⠀a⠀value⠀displaced⠀without⠀another⠀identical⠀causal⠀charge.⠀Additional⠀exposure,⠀worsening⠀conditions,⠀new⠀information,⠀sleep⠀loss,⠀social⠀fallout⠀or⠀another⠀real⠀event⠀may⠀add⠀pressure.⠀Relief,⠀safety,⠀rest,⠀support,⠀changed⠀appraisal,⠀successful⠀coping⠀or⠀elapsed⠀recovery⠀time⠀may⠀reduce⠀acute⠀activation⠀when⠀those⠀causes⠀actually⠀change.⠀Recovery⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀established⠀history,⠀durable⠀beliefs,⠀scars,⠀relationship⠀effects⠀or⠀a⠀selected⠀Erosion⠀consequence.\n\nTIME⠀AND⠀RETELLING\nAdvance⠀state⠀across⠀an⠀offscreen⠀interval⠀only⠀when⠀fictional⠀time⠀actually⠀passes⠀and⠀supported⠀conditions/events⠀during⠀that⠀interval⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀character.⠀Do⠀not⠀equate⠀message⠀count⠀with⠀exposure⠀or⠀recovery.⠀A⠀recap,⠀memory⠀retrieval,⠀flashback,⠀swipe⠀replacement,⠀planning⠀draft,⠀editorial⠀repair,⠀tracker⠀re-render⠀or⠀model-visible⠀repetition⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀re-inflict⠀the⠀event.⠀Remembering⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀new⠀present⠀cause⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀retrieves/appraises⠀it⠀now⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀memory/affect⠀rules⠀support⠀that⠀effect.\n\nENABLED-FIELD⠀DISCIPLINE\nOnly⠀enabled⠀MP⠀groups⠀actively⠀compute⠀new⠀values.⠀Preserve⠀valid⠀inactive⠀carryover⠀without⠀treating⠀it⠀as⠀current⠀processing,⠀and⠀never⠀initialize⠀a⠀disabled⠀field⠀just⠀to⠀satisfy⠀this⠀adapter.⠀Relationship⠀fields⠀remain⠀person/domain⠀scoped;⠀cognition,⠀affect,⠀needs,⠀neurochemistry,⠀memory⠀and⠀choice⠀remain⠀distinct⠀owners.⠀Difficulty⠀and⠀world⠀augments⠀supply⠀context/pressure,⠀not⠀replacement⠀numbers.⠀Commit⠀one⠀accepted⠀endpoint⠀from⠀the⠀accepted⠀scene;⠀discarded⠀candidates⠀and⠀review⠀passes⠀do⠀not⠀become⠀lived⠀experience.\n{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{trim}}",
