        {
            "identifier": "nemo-aura-state-access-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Aura · State Access Resolver",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Mental-Projection }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @tooltip Aura of Emotions compatibility: visible world cues remain observations, not full private-state access. Keep enabled. }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoWorldMod_v11_153_world_augments_aura_of_emotions}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀AURA⠀OF⠀EMOTIONS⠀×⠀MENTAL⠀STATE⠀ACCESS\nAura⠀manifestations⠀are⠀physical⠀world⠀evidence.⠀They⠀do⠀not⠀expose⠀the⠀complete⠀private⠀state⠀that⠀caused⠀them.\n\nSOURCE⠀OF⠀THE⠀CUE\nUse⠀already⠀established⠀current⠀emotion/state⠀and⠀the⠀Aura⠀world⠀rule.⠀Mental⠀Projection⠀owns⠀applicable⠀private⠀state⠀rather⠀than⠀Aura⠀independently⠀inventing⠀another⠀emotional⠀reading.{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_affect}}}}⠀MP⠀Affect/Emotion⠀records⠀may⠀support⠀the⠀broad⠀manifested⠀cue,⠀but⠀never⠀derive⠀an⠀aura⠀by⠀mechanically⠀translating⠀a⠀score,⠀copying⠀an⠀exact⠀intensity,⠀or⠀exposing⠀the⠀tracker.⠀Conflicting⠀simultaneous⠀emotions⠀can⠀yield⠀mixed,⠀ambiguous,⠀unstable,⠀or⠀selectively⠀dominant⠀manifestations⠀when⠀the⠀fiction⠀supports⠀it.{{/if}}\n\nWHAT⠀AN⠀OBSERVER⠀GETS\nAn⠀observer⠀receives⠀only⠀what⠀their⠀position,⠀senses,⠀attention,⠀training⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀manifestation⠀make⠀available:⠀broad⠀emotional⠀color,⠀suppression⠀strain,⠀or⠀a⠀concrete⠀physical⠀phenomenon⠀such⠀as⠀heat,⠀mist,⠀light,⠀scent,⠀static,⠀dimming,⠀or⠀pressure.⠀Distance,⠀obstruction,⠀distraction,⠀sensory⠀limits⠀and⠀established⠀suppression⠀skill⠀still⠀matter.⠀Out⠀of⠀range⠀means⠀no⠀observation.\n\nSeeing⠀an⠀aura⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀its⠀target,⠀cause,⠀memory,⠀motive,⠀exact⠀intensity,⠀private⠀wording,⠀future⠀choice,⠀diagnosis,⠀tracker⠀values,⠀or⠀narrator⠀knowledge.⠀Interpretation⠀remains⠀character-owned⠀and⠀fallible.⠀A⠀trained⠀reader⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀finer⠀supported⠀inference,⠀never⠀omniscience.⠀Feed⠀the⠀visible⠀cue⠀into⠀Knowledge⠀Map⠀/⠀Information⠀Asymmetry⠀as⠀observed⠀evidence⠀when⠀those⠀systems⠀are⠀active;⠀keep⠀interpretation⠀separate⠀from⠀observation.\n\nSUPPRESSION\nAura⠀suppression⠀is⠀the⠀world⠀mechanic's⠀trained⠀act.⠀Mental⠀Projection's⠀expressive⠀inhibition,⠀self-control,⠀fear⠀of⠀disclosure,⠀or⠀desire⠀for⠀privacy⠀may⠀motivate⠀an⠀attempt,⠀but⠀no⠀MP⠀number⠀automatically⠀grants⠀successful⠀suppression.⠀Use⠀established⠀skill,⠀effort,⠀conditions⠀and⠀the⠀world⠀rule.⠀If⠀suppression⠀works⠀imperfectly,⠀observers⠀perceive⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀residual⠀cue⠀or⠀strain;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀learn⠀what⠀was⠀hidden⠀merely⠀because⠀suppression⠀occurred.\n\nSTATE⠀UPDATE\nThe⠀aura⠀is⠀an⠀outward⠀consequence⠀of⠀current⠀state,⠀not⠀a⠀second⠀cause⠀that⠀re-applies⠀the⠀same⠀emotion⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀Reactions⠀by⠀other⠀people⠀can⠀become⠀genuinely⠀new⠀events⠀and⠀then⠀update⠀their⠀own⠀state⠀normally.⠀Do⠀not⠀feed⠀an⠀aura⠀back⠀into⠀the⠀emitting⠀character⠀as⠀a⠀duplicate⠀causal⠀charge⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀was⠀displayed.\n{{#if {{.NPCInteriorityMode == Hidden}}}}\nPRESENTATION\nHidden⠀Interiority⠀changes⠀what⠀private⠀prose⠀the⠀reader⠀sees;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀a⠀physically⠀manifested⠀aura⠀from⠀the⠀fiction.⠀Render⠀the⠀world-visible⠀phenomenon⠀outside⠀<nemo-interiority>⠀blocks⠀while⠀retaining⠀its⠀private⠀cause⠀in⠀the⠀normal⠀hidden/private⠀state⠀channel.⠀Never⠀expose⠀the⠀hidden⠀prose⠀or⠀full⠀MP⠀snapshot⠀through⠀the⠀aura.\n{{/if}}\nAUTHORSHIP\nThe⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract⠀still⠀controls⠀whose⠀private⠀state⠀Nemo⠀may⠀author.⠀For⠀a⠀protected⠀human-controlled⠀player,⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀unprovided⠀emotion,⠀motive,⠀thought⠀or⠀interpretation⠀merely⠀to⠀make⠀Aura⠀fire.⠀Use⠀an⠀aura⠀for⠀that⠀character⠀only⠀when⠀its⠀emotional⠀basis⠀or⠀resulting⠀manifestation⠀is⠀established⠀by⠀supplied⠀canon/current⠀input⠀or⠀otherwise⠀permitted⠀world-resolved⠀state.⠀Fully⠀authored⠀in-world⠀characters⠀resolve⠀normally⠀before⠀deriving⠀the⠀outward⠀cue.\n\nDeception/tells⠀remain⠀subordinate⠀to⠀stronger⠀world⠀rules.⠀If⠀another⠀active⠀premise⠀removes⠀deliberate⠀deception,⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀deceptive⠀act⠀merely⠀so⠀Aura⠀can⠀reveal⠀it.⠀Privacy,⠀refusal,⠀sincere⠀error⠀and⠀ordinary⠀uncertainty⠀remain⠀possible.\n{{else}}{{#if {{.NPCInteriorityMode == Hidden}}}}♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀AURA⠀OF⠀EMOTIONS⠀×⠀HIDDEN⠀INTERIORITY\nAura⠀manifestations⠀are⠀physical⠀world⠀evidence,⠀not⠀reader⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀complete⠀private⠀mind.⠀Observers⠀receive⠀only⠀the⠀manifested⠀cue⠀available⠀to⠀their⠀position,⠀senses,⠀attention⠀and⠀training.⠀Seeing⠀broad⠀emotional⠀color⠀never⠀grants⠀motive,⠀memory,⠀target,⠀exact⠀intensity,⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀narrator-only⠀knowledge.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}Interpretation⠀stays⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀visible⠀cue⠀and⠀leaves⠀inaccessible⠀details⠀unknown.{{else}}Interpretation⠀remains⠀fallible.{{/if}}\n\nHidden⠀Interiority⠀changes⠀what⠀private⠀prose⠀the⠀reader⠀sees;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀a⠀physically⠀manifested⠀aura⠀from⠀the⠀fiction.⠀Render⠀the⠀world-visible⠀phenomenon⠀outside⠀<nemo-interiority>⠀blocks.⠀Never⠀copy⠀hidden⠀prose⠀into⠀visible⠀aura⠀description⠀as⠀an⠀explanation.\n\nThe⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract⠀controls⠀whose⠀private⠀emotion⠀may⠀be⠀authored.⠀For⠀a⠀protected⠀human-controlled⠀player,⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀unprovided⠀emotion⠀merely⠀to⠀make⠀Aura⠀fire;⠀require⠀supplied/established⠀emotional⠀basis⠀or⠀an⠀otherwise⠀permitted⠀manifestation.⠀Fully⠀authored⠀in-world⠀characters⠀may⠀be⠀resolved⠀normally.⠀Suppression⠀follows⠀established⠀skill⠀and⠀conditions;⠀seeing⠀strain⠀does⠀not⠀reveal⠀what⠀was⠀hidden.\n\nAny⠀observer's⠀interpretation⠀is⠀an⠀inference⠀from⠀the⠀cue,⠀not⠀fact.⠀Deception/tells⠀remain⠀subordinate⠀to⠀stronger⠀world⠀premises;⠀privacy,⠀refusal,⠀sincere⠀error⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀remain⠀possible.\n{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{trim}}",
