        {
            "identifier": "nemo-return-by-death-reset-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Return By Death · Branch Ownership",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Consequence }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @tooltip Return By Death checkpoint/branch ownership across world state, Narrative Progression, and Mental Projection. Keep enabled after MP group selection and before MP preparation. }}\n{{setvar::NRBDActive::}}{{setvar::NRBDMPDirective::}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NRBDSelected}}}}{{setvar::NRBDActive::1}}\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀RETURN⠀BY⠀DEATH:⠀CHECKPOINT⠀BRANCH⠀OWNERSHIP\nA⠀canonical⠀Return⠀By⠀Death⠀reset⠀creates⠀a⠀new⠀accepted⠀continuation⠀from⠀the⠀established⠀checkpoint.⠀Do⠀not⠀inherit⠀the⠀latest⠀pre-death⠀world⠀snapshot⠀wholesale⠀simply⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀newest⠀text⠀in⠀history.\n\nTRIGGER⠀AND⠀CHECKPOINT\n-⠀Trigger⠀only⠀from⠀an⠀accepted⠀terminal⠀event⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀consequence⠀subject⠀under⠀the⠀selected⠀Return⠀By⠀Death⠀rule.⠀A⠀discarded⠀draft,⠀swipe,⠀planning⠀candidate,⠀review,⠀hypothetical,⠀recalled⠀death,⠀or⠀OOC⠀discussion⠀is⠀not⠀another⠀reset.\n-⠀Restore⠀the⠀last⠀checkpoint⠀that⠀was⠀established⠀before⠀the⠀terminal⠀event.⠀Never⠀move⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀retroactively⠀to⠀rescue⠀the⠀run.⠀If⠀no⠀checkpoint⠀exists,⠀use⠀the⠀beginning⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀source⠀rule⠀specifies.\n-⠀A⠀checkpoint⠀itself⠀advances⠀only⠀from⠀an⠀actually⠀established⠀new⠀reset⠀point⠀in⠀accepted⠀fiction.⠀Scene⠀transitions,⠀elapsed⠀turns,⠀travel,⠀victories,⠀or⠀dramatic⠀beats⠀are⠀not⠀automatic⠀checkpoints.⠀Compare⠀against⠀the⠀newest⠀accepted⠀checkpoint⠀record:⠀if⠀the⠀anchor⠀has⠀not⠀genuinely⠀changed,⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀same⠀checkpoint.\n-⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀consequence⠀subject⠀reaches⠀a⠀genuinely⠀new⠀accepted⠀checkpoint,⠀record⠀that⠀checkpoint⠀and⠀publish⠀one⠀`<checkpoint>⚰ Reset Point · SUBJECT · ANCHOR</checkpoint>`⠀marker⠀using⠀only⠀supported⠀identifying⠀details.⠀That⠀marker⠀is⠀emitted⠀once⠀for⠀that⠀checkpoint⠀and⠀is⠀never⠀evidence⠀that⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀exists⠀by⠀itself.⠀A⠀complete⠀candidate⠀may⠀preview⠀the⠀marker,⠀but⠀discarded⠀drafts/reviews/swipes⠀never⠀establish⠀it;⠀publication⠀keeps⠀exactly⠀one⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀checkpoint⠀survives⠀into⠀the⠀accepted⠀endpoint.⠀A⠀reset⠀to⠀an⠀existing⠀checkpoint⠀does⠀not⠀count⠀as⠀reaching⠀a⠀new⠀one.\n-⠀The⠀previous⠀loop⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀returning⠀subject's⠀lived⠀experience⠀where⠀that⠀subject⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀retain⠀it;⠀it⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀current⠀world⠀state.\n\nWORLD⠀BRANCH⠀RESTORE\nRestore⠀checkpoint⠀state⠀for⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀every⠀non-surviving⠀owner:⠀physical⠀positions,⠀bodies,⠀wounds,⠀deaths,⠀inventory/resources,⠀spent⠀or⠀gained⠀items,⠀doors/objects,⠀public⠀status,⠀institutions,⠀NPC⠀knowledge⠀and⠀memory,⠀NPC⠀relationship⠀state,⠀offscreen⠀threads,⠀pending⠀actions,⠀quest/world⠀state,⠀and⠀other⠀consequences⠀that⠀occurred⠀after⠀the⠀checkpoint.⠀A⠀post-checkpoint⠀event⠀is⠀not⠀still⠀true⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀remains⠀visible⠀in⠀chat⠀history.\nOther⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀remember⠀the⠀erased⠀interval⠀unless⠀a⠀separate⠀already-established⠀setting⠀rule⠀explicitly⠀lets⠀that⠀owner⠀survive⠀the⠀reset.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀narrator⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀tracker,⠀or⠀the⠀returning⠀subject's⠀memory⠀as⠀an⠀in-world⠀information⠀route⠀for⠀them.\n\nSURVIVING⠀EXPERIENCE⠀BELONGS⠀TO⠀ITS⠀OWNER\nThe⠀active⠀consequence⠀subject⠀alone⠀retains⠀the⠀post-checkpoint⠀experience⠀promised⠀by⠀Return⠀By⠀Death:⠀established⠀memories,⠀learned⠀facts,⠀practiced⠀understanding,⠀loop⠀awareness,⠀and⠀supported⠀subjective⠀changes⠀caused⠀by⠀those⠀experiences.⠀Separate⠀that⠀retained⠀private⠀experience⠀from⠀facts⠀about⠀the⠀restored⠀branch.\nThe⠀subject's⠀body⠀and⠀material⠀possessions⠀still⠀restore⠀to⠀checkpoint⠀state.⠀Do⠀not⠀carry⠀a⠀post-checkpoint⠀wound,⠀fatigue⠀debt,⠀spent⠀ammunition,⠀acquired⠀item,⠀public⠀reputation,⠀completed⠀quest,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀changed⠀feelings⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀subject⠀remembers⠀them.\nA⠀remembered⠀betrayal⠀may⠀change⠀the⠀returning⠀subject's⠀trust⠀or⠀expectation⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀returns⠀to⠀their⠀checkpoint⠀relationship⠀state.⠀A⠀remembered⠀death⠀may⠀create⠀strain⠀without⠀leaving⠀the⠀restored⠀body⠀dead⠀or⠀injured.⠀Keep⠀subjective⠀relationship⠀state,⠀factual⠀relationship⠀status,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀state⠀separate.\nFor⠀a⠀human-controlled⠀consequence⠀subject,⠀retain⠀only⠀memory,⠀knowledge,⠀feeling,⠀interpretation,⠀or⠀intention⠀actually⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀human⠀or⠀already⠀established⠀in⠀accepted⠀fiction.⠀Return⠀By⠀Death⠀never⠀licenses⠀invented⠀private⠀player⠀experience.\n\nNARRATIVE⠀STAGE⠀AND⠀THREADS\nNarrative⠀Progression,⠀offscreen⠀threads,⠀cutaway⠀state,⠀and⠀other⠀world-facing⠀continuity⠀restore⠀to⠀the⠀checkpoint⠀branch.⠀Post-checkpoint⠀held-turn⠀counts,⠀completed⠀transitions,⠀cutaway⠀consequences,⠀and⠀pending⠀world⠀work⠀do⠀not⠀leak⠀back⠀as⠀current⠀state.⠀The⠀reset⠀itself⠀is⠀a⠀real⠀new⠀event⠀after⠀restoration⠀and⠀may⠀justify⠀a⠀fresh⠀classification⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀restored⠀conditions;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀advance⠀an⠀arc⠀just⠀because⠀the⠀prior⠀loop⠀reached⠀a⠀later⠀stage.\nWorld⠀elapsed⠀time⠀restores⠀with⠀the⠀checkpoint.⠀If⠀Dreamscape⠀supplied⠀a⠀distinct⠀experienced⠀duration,⠀the⠀returning⠀subject⠀may⠀remember⠀that⠀experience,⠀but⠀restored⠀material⠀clocks,⠀bodies,⠀resources,⠀and⠀outside⠀threads⠀use⠀the⠀checkpoint's⠀world-time⠀state.\n\nONE⠀RESET,⠀ONE⠀CAUSAL⠀UPDATE\nApply⠀the⠀reset⠀once.⠀Re-reading⠀the⠀old⠀loop,⠀rendering⠀trackers,⠀continuing⠀the⠀same⠀reply,⠀or⠀revising⠀a⠀candidate⠀does⠀not⠀perform⠀another⠀reset⠀or⠀reapply⠀its⠀strain.⠀Repeated⠀deaths⠀can⠀accumulate⠀only⠀when⠀separate⠀accepted⠀terminal⠀events⠀actually⠀occur.\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{#setvar::NRBDMPDirective}}RETURN⠀BY⠀DEATH:⠀MP⠀INHERITANCE⠀OVERRIDE\nWhen⠀an⠀accepted⠀Return⠀By⠀Death⠀reset⠀occurs,⠀step⠀1⠀inheritance⠀must⠀branch⠀at⠀the⠀checkpoint⠀instead⠀of⠀taking⠀the⠀newest⠀pre-death⠀MP⠀snapshot⠀as⠀the⠀current⠀state⠀for⠀everyone.\n\n-⠀NON-SUBJECTS:⠀restore⠀their⠀checkpoint⠀mental/relationship/knowledge⠀state.⠀Post-checkpoint⠀memories,⠀appraisals,⠀trust⠀changes,⠀goals,⠀learned⠀patterns,⠀and⠀other⠀private⠀changes⠀are⠀no⠀longer⠀current⠀for⠀them⠀unless⠀an⠀independent⠀established⠀memory-survival⠀rule⠀applies.\n-⠀RETURNING⠀SUBJECT:⠀restore⠀checkpoint⠀body/material⠀conditions,⠀then⠀merge⠀only⠀the⠀subject-owned⠀surviving⠀experience⠀promised⠀by⠀Return⠀By⠀Death.⠀Do⠀not⠀merge⠀the⠀whole⠀pre-death⠀snapshot.\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_body}}}}-⠀BODY⠀&⠀CHEMISTRY:⠀restore⠀checkpoint⠀physical⠀state⠀and⠀body-dependent⠀values.⠀Do⠀not⠀copy⠀the⠀dead/injured/fatigued⠀body's⠀transient⠀chemistry⠀forward⠀as⠀though⠀the⠀body⠀did⠀not⠀reset.⠀Retained⠀memory⠀of⠀death⠀may⠀create⠀a⠀new⠀supported⠀stress/appraisal⠀effect⠀once⠀after⠀restoration;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀new⠀present⠀cause,⠀not⠀preserved⠀bodily⠀damage.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_memory}}}}-⠀MEMORY:⠀the⠀returning⠀subject⠀may⠀retain⠀accepted⠀post-checkpoint⠀episodic/semantic⠀learning⠀and⠀loop⠀knowledge⠀with⠀their⠀actual⠀source⠀and⠀fidelity.⠀Other⠀owners'⠀memory⠀records⠀restore⠀to⠀checkpoint.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀remembered⠀outcomes⠀into⠀current-world⠀facts.⠀For⠀each⠀retained⠀subject⠀memory,⠀age_minutes⠀follows⠀elapsed⠀fictional⠀time⠀since⠀encoding⠀along⠀that⠀subject's⠀surviving⠀personal⠀chronology.⠀Preserve⠀its⠀already⠀accumulated⠀age⠀across⠀an⠀instantaneous⠀reset,⠀including⠀elapsed⠀time⠀in⠀erased⠀loops⠀and⠀any⠀separately⠀established⠀experienced⠀Dreamscape⠀duration;⠀do⠀not⠀subtract⠀the⠀world-clock⠀rewind,⠀rebase⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀checkpoint⠀timestamp,⠀or⠀restart⠀it⠀on⠀recall⠀or⠀reprint.⠀Advance⠀that⠀retained⠀age⠀once⠀for⠀actual⠀further⠀elapsed⠀fictional⠀time⠀in⠀the⠀new⠀branch.⠀Restored⠀non-subject⠀memories⠀recover⠀their⠀checkpoint⠀ages.⠀Unknown⠀ages⠀stay⠀null⠀until⠀supported⠀time⠀evidence⠀resolves⠀them.⠀These⠀memory⠀ages⠀do⠀not⠀advance⠀the⠀restored⠀world⠀clock⠀or⠀physical⠀bodies.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_social}}}}-⠀RELATIONSHIPS:⠀the⠀returning⠀subject's⠀own⠀trust,⠀affection,⠀comfort,⠀learned⠀patterns,⠀or⠀expectations⠀may⠀retain⠀supported⠀changes⠀from⠀remembered⠀experience.⠀The⠀counterpart's⠀state⠀and⠀factual⠀relationship/public⠀status⠀restore⠀to⠀checkpoint.⠀Never⠀mirror⠀one⠀owner's⠀surviving⠀relationship⠀values⠀into⠀the⠀other⠀owner.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_choice}}}}-⠀MOTIVATION/CHOICE:⠀erased-branch⠀goals,⠀strategies,⠀boundaries,⠀and⠀readiness⠀are⠀not⠀automatically⠀still⠀active.⠀Preserve⠀only⠀returning-subject⠀learning⠀or⠀presently⠀supported⠀intent;⠀for⠀a⠀protected⠀human-controlled⠀subject,⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀that⠀intent.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_affect}}}}-⠀AFFECT/COGNITION:⠀derive⠀the⠀post-reset⠀present⠀state⠀from⠀the⠀restored⠀situation⠀plus⠀retained⠀experience.⠀Do⠀not⠀simply⠀copy⠀the⠀final⠀pre-death⠀valence,⠀arousal,⠀dominance,⠀focus,⠀rumination,⠀or⠀emotion⠀episodes.⠀Lingering⠀strain⠀must⠀have⠀a⠀retained⠀cause.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_resolution}}}}-⠀RESOLUTION⠀RECORDS:⠀results⠀from⠀the⠀erased⠀branch⠀are⠀historical⠀loop⠀experience,⠀not⠀still-resolved⠀current⠀attempts.⠀Retire/currently⠀reclassify⠀them⠀as⠀appropriate⠀and⠀require⠀a⠀new⠀real⠀attempt/result⠀when⠀the⠀restored⠀branch⠀reaches⠀uncertainty⠀again;⠀never⠀recycle⠀an⠀old⠀roll⠀as⠀the⠀new⠀branch's⠀outcome.{{/if}}\n\nCommit⠀one⠀complete⠀post-reset⠀snapshot⠀per⠀eligible⠀owner.⠀Preserve⠀each⠀character_key,⠀assign⠀one⠀new⠀accepted⠀timeline⠀for⠀this⠀actual⠀reset,⠀and⠀use⠀it⠀in⠀every⠀new⠀full⠀snapshot⠀and⠀adjacent⠀capsule.⠀The⠀checkpoint⠀and⠀erased-branch⠀snapshots⠀keep⠀their⠀original⠀timeline⠀labels⠀as⠀source⠀provenance;⠀continue⠀the⠀new⠀key⠀on⠀later⠀replies⠀rather⠀than⠀treating⠀the⠀same⠀reset⠀as⠀another⠀branch.⠀Resolve⠀missing/ambiguous⠀legacy⠀identity⠀under⠀the⠀shared⠀MP⠀state⠀contract⠀without⠀guessing⠀another⠀owner's⠀values.⠀The⠀returning⠀subject⠀can⠀remember⠀the⠀erased⠀branch⠀while⠀standing⠀in⠀a⠀restored⠀world;⠀other⠀owners⠀cannot⠀infer⠀that⠀branch⠀from⠀the⠀tracker.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}{{trim}}",
