            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Mental-Projection }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @tooltip Required automatic helper; retain supplied order. This compiles instructions, not live story state. }}\n{{setvar::NARMPDirective::}}{{#if {{.NARCount == 1}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{#setvar::NARMPDirective}}ARCHETYPE⠀/⠀MP⠀HANDOFF\nUse⠀any⠀supported⠀{{getvar::NARName}}⠀classification⠀only⠀as⠀sourced⠀characterization.⠀MP's⠀active⠀definitions⠀own⠀current⠀conditions,⠀numeric⠀scales,⠀evidence,⠀updates⠀and⠀accepted⠀endpoint.⠀Do⠀not⠀seed⠀or⠀reset⠀a⠀score⠀from⠀a⠀type,⠀apply⠀a⠀60/40⠀numerical⠀blend,⠀manufacture⠀a⠀diagnostic⠀result,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀temporary⠀state⠀reclassify⠀identity.⠀Use⠀the⠀selected⠀engine's⠀embedded⠀taxonomy⠀and⠀supported⠀classifications.⠀Insufficient⠀character⠀evidence⠀for⠀one⠀axis⠀leaves⠀that⠀axis⠀uncertain,⠀not⠀the⠀entire⠀classification⠀or⠀MP⠀state⠀empty.\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_affect}}}}Affect/cognition⠀remain⠀current⠀responses⠀to⠀actual⠀appraisal,⠀attention⠀and⠀causes,⠀not⠀a⠀type⠀checklist.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_social}}}}Social⠀records⠀keep⠀their⠀named⠀target/domain/context;⠀a⠀perceived⠀classification⠀never⠀replaces⠀the⠀counterpart's⠀actual⠀relationship⠀state.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_choice}}}}Choices⠀retain⠀distinct⠀wants,⠀willingness,⠀limits⠀and⠀opportunity;⠀a⠀type⠀supplies⠀no⠀selected⠀action⠀or⠀permission.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_memory}}}}Memory⠀keeps⠀its⠀own⠀sources,⠀fidelity⠀and⠀access;⠀a⠀label⠀grants⠀no⠀history⠀or⠀erased-branch⠀knowledge.\n{{/if}}Reuse⠀permitted⠀qualitative⠀continuity⠀notes;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀classification⠀score,⠀section⠀or⠀duplicate⠀snapshot.⠀Disabled⠀groups⠀remain⠀inactive⠀carryover.⠀Protected⠀player⠀and⠀external-human⠀exclusions⠀remain⠀unchanged.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{trim}}",
            "enabled": true,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo-mp-prepare",
            "name": "🧩 MP · State contract & planning bridge",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Mental-Projection }}{{// @icon 🧠 }}{{// @badge AUTO }}{{// @hidden }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{#setvar::NMPPlan}}MENTAL⠀PROJECTION:⠀STATE⠀TRANSITION⠀WITHIN⠀THE⠀SELECTED⠀HOST\nUse⠀this⠀step⠀for⠀the⠀active⠀component⠀groups⠀before⠀deciding⠀character⠀conduct.⠀It⠀is⠀the⠀same⠀scene-state⠀evaluation⠀used⠀by⠀Character⠀Turn⠀Simulation,⠀not⠀a⠀second⠀simulation⠀or⠀an⠀additional⠀planning⠀host.\n1.⠀INHERIT⠀each⠀eligible⠀character's⠀latest⠀complete⠀applicable⠀raw⠀snapshot⠀by⠀character_key⠀and⠀timeline.⠀Apply⠀the⠀identity⠀contract's⠀legacy⠀mapping⠀or⠀authorized⠀branch/checkpoint⠀source⠀first⠀when⠀necessary;⠀recover⠀individual⠀missing⠀fields⠀only⠀from⠀that⠀owner's⠀valid⠀evidence⠀without⠀resetting⠀other⠀state.⠀Respect⠀the⠀active⠀user⠀role⠀and⠀separate⠀knowledge⠀owners.\n2.⠀PERCEIVE⠀new⠀receivable⠀events,⠀attention,⠀actual⠀elapsed⠀time⠀and⠀ongoing⠀causes.⠀Update⠀relevant⠀body,⠀chemistry⠀and⠀needs⠀once;⠀form⠀issue-specific⠀appraisals⠀and⠀allow⠀one⠀bounded⠀feedback⠀reassessment.⠀Repetition⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀new⠀cause.\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_body}}}}Use⠀the⠀actual⠀physical⠀condition,⠀sensed⠀effect⠀and⠀possible⠀misinterpretation⠀as⠀inputs⠀before⠀conduct;⠀select⠀supported⠀manifestations⠀without⠀charging⠀symptoms⠀twice.{{/if}}\n3.⠀RETRIEVE⠀from⠀supported⠀cues,⠀trace,⠀accessibility,⠀fidelity⠀and⠀interference.⠀A⠀record⠀is⠀not⠀in-world⠀rehearsal,⠀a⠀confident⠀belief⠀is⠀not⠀fact,⠀and⠀absent⠀detail⠀is⠀not⠀reconstructed⠀knowledge.\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_memory}}}}Distinguish⠀explicit⠀recall⠀from⠀a⠀sourced,⠀cued⠀association;⠀carry⠀its⠀experienced⠀effect⠀and⠀scope⠀without⠀replaying⠀the⠀event⠀or⠀inventing⠀detail.{{/if}}\n4.⠀INTEGRATE⠀motives,⠀appraisals,⠀affect,⠀relationships,⠀habits⠀and⠀competing⠀commitments.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_choice}}}}Choice/Friction⠀is⠀selected:⠀keep⠀desire,⠀willingness,⠀aversion,⠀cost,⠀comfort,⠀opening,⠀feasibility,⠀scoped⠀limits⠀and⠀permission⠀separate.⠀Establish⠀state⠀before⠀selecting⠀ignore/wait/consider/seek/initiate/negotiate/attempt/commit/withdraw;⠀never⠀backfill⠀numbers⠀to⠀force⠀the⠀chosen⠀ending.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_social}}}}Let⠀person-specific⠀experienced⠀effects⠀and⠀learned⠀expectations⠀influence⠀the⠀bond;⠀never⠀backfill⠀chemistry⠀or⠀memories⠀from⠀a⠀relationship⠀label.{{/if}}\n5.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_workspace}}}}CONSCIOUS⠀WORKSPACE:⠀Apply⠀the⠀selected⠀group⠀to⠀actual⠀internal⠀activity.⠀{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_social}}}}SOCIAL⠀ROUTING:⠀Apply⠀the⠀selected⠀group⠀to⠀actual⠀interactions.⠀{{/if}}Resolve⠀only⠀actual⠀mental/social⠀attempts,⠀with⠀fallibility,⠀real⠀time,⠀independent⠀participants⠀and⠀meaningful⠀waiting⠀conditions.⠀Awareness,⠀intention,⠀method⠀and⠀result⠀differ.⠀If⠀an⠀eligible⠀uncertainty⠀is⠀resolved,⠀use⠀the⠀single⠀selected⠀resolution⠀protocol⠀and⠀accepted⠀result⠀once;⠀do⠀not⠀create⠀a⠀second⠀roll⠀or⠀success⠀pass.⠀{{getvar::NemoResolutionMPDirective}}\n6.⠀EMBODY⠀through⠀the⠀selected⠀narrator/POV⠀and⠀each⠀character's⠀own⠀speech⠀and⠀private⠀experience.⠀Advance⠀only⠀actual⠀events⠀in⠀causal⠀order.⠀Use⠀the⠀existing⠀consistency⠀check⠀to⠀repair⠀inconsistency;⠀editing⠀is⠀not⠀another⠀lived⠀event⠀or⠀state⠀update.\n7.⠀COMMIT⠀complete⠀endpoint⠀snapshots,⠀stable⠀IDs⠀and⠀useful⠀retained⠀records⠀to⠀the⠀selected⠀tracker⠀host⠀after⠀accepted⠀fiction.⠀Keep⠀live⠀causes⠀distinct⠀from⠀retrospective⠀appraisal.⠀Derive⠀any⠀enabled⠀read-only⠀map⠀afterward.⠀No⠀duplicate⠀standalone⠀tracker⠀when⠀Scratchpad⠀hosts⠀it,⠀and⠀no⠀model⠀reasoning⠀transcript⠀in⠀state.{{/setvar}}\n{{// Shared MP compatibility boundaries: emit once regardless of planning host. }}\n{{getvar::NRBDMPDirective}}{{#if {{getvar::NARMPDirective}}}}\n{{getvar::NARMPDirective}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::NDTMPDirective}}\nMENTAL⠀PROJECTION:⠀NAMED⠀RECORDS⠀AND⠀RETENTION\n\nUse⠀stable,⠀short⠀text⠀IDs⠀for⠀issues,⠀desires,⠀goals,⠀relationships,⠀memories,⠀and⠀emotional⠀episodes.⠀IDs⠀are⠀labels,⠀not⠀behavioural⠀values⠀or⠀numerical⠀counters.⠀Keep⠀the⠀same⠀ID⠀while⠀referring⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀thing.⠀Context,⠀target,⠀source,⠀domain,⠀gist,⠀and⠀status⠀are⠀qualitative⠀descriptors,⠀not⠀extra⠀hidden⠀numeric⠀scores.\n\nAppraisals⠀attach⠀an⠀interpretation⠀and⠀its⠀values⠀to⠀a⠀named⠀issue,⠀event,⠀or⠀prospect.⠀Include⠀the⠀stake⠀or⠀goal⠀that⠀makes⠀it⠀matter⠀and⠀distinguish⠀the⠀event⠀as⠀perceived⠀from⠀the⠀interpretation.⠀Keep⠀incompatible⠀issue-level⠀appraisals⠀separate⠀where⠀they⠀matter.⠀A⠀global⠀mood⠀must⠀not⠀overwrite⠀target-specific⠀beliefs.\n\nDesires⠀name⠀wanted⠀outcomes;⠀goals⠀name⠀chosen⠀outcomes⠀with⠀a⠀qualitative⠀status.⠀Relationships⠀identify⠀a⠀person,⠀domain,⠀and⠀context.⠀The⠀four⠀relationship⠀values⠀may⠀diverge.⠀A⠀relationship⠀record⠀is⠀the⠀tracked⠀character's⠀representation⠀of⠀that⠀person,⠀never⠀the⠀person's⠀own⠀mental⠀state.\n\nEmotion⠀episodes⠀name⠀a⠀label⠀or⠀mixture⠀in⠀ordinary⠀language,⠀target,⠀issue_id,⠀action⠀tendencies,⠀and⠀unresolved⠀meaning.⠀An⠀emotion⠀may⠀persist⠀while⠀attention⠀temporarily⠀moves⠀elsewhere.⠀Mark⠀genuinely⠀resolved⠀episodes⠀inactive⠀or⠀summarize⠀their⠀lasting⠀consequence⠀in⠀a⠀relevant⠀belief⠀or⠀memory;⠀do⠀not⠀retain⠀every⠀past⠀emotion⠀as⠀permanently⠀active.\n\nMemory⠀records⠀keep⠀an⠀encoded⠀gist,⠀source,⠀cues,⠀detail⠀limits,⠀an⠀interpretation⠀if⠀needed,⠀and⠀their⠀six⠀separately⠀defined⠀values.⠀Store⠀the⠀source⠀as⠀witnessed,⠀heard-from,⠀inferred,⠀or⠀established-personal-knowledge,⠀with⠀the⠀relevant⠀context.⠀Do⠀not⠀collapse⠀an⠀inference⠀into⠀a⠀witnessed⠀event.⠀status⠀is⠀active⠀or⠀dormant⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀change⠀numeric⠀accessibility.⠀last_recall⠀is⠀a⠀brief⠀qualitative⠀anchor⠀for⠀genuine⠀recollection,⠀not⠀a⠀mechanical⠀refresh⠀timestamp.\n\nCreate⠀memory⠀records⠀for⠀consequential⠀experiences,⠀learned⠀facts,⠀promises,⠀unresolved⠀threads,⠀and⠀details⠀likely⠀to⠀affect⠀future⠀perception.⠀Do⠀not⠀create⠀one⠀for⠀every⠀sentence.⠀Keep⠀a⠀small⠀working⠀selection⠀active;⠀retain⠀consequential⠀dormant⠀records⠀with⠀compact⠀wording⠀and⠀their⠀values.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀a⠀promise,⠀identity⠀fact,⠀or⠀relationship⠀history⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀currently⠀attended.⠀Stable⠀learned⠀facts⠀can⠀be⠀condensed⠀into⠀known_facts⠀while⠀preserving⠀source⠀and⠀relevant⠀uncertainty.⠀Such⠀condensation⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀forgetting.\n\nDo⠀not⠀serialize⠀an⠀ever-growing⠀reasoning⠀log.⠀Keep⠀only⠀a⠀short⠀recent_events⠀ledger⠀sufficient⠀to⠀identify⠀newly⠀processed⠀events⠀and⠀distinguish⠀them⠀from⠀retellings,⠀plus⠀ongoing_drivers⠀for⠀continuing⠀causes.⠀Older⠀causes⠀remain⠀represented⠀in⠀the⠀affected⠀durable⠀records.⠀carryover⠀records⠀what⠀remains⠀unresolved,⠀not⠀a⠀command⠀to⠀escalate⠀it.\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_body}}}}EMBODIED⠀CONTINUITY\nRetain⠀only⠀consequential⠀physical⠀causes/residual⠀effects⠀in⠀existing⠀ongoing_drivers⠀and⠀change_notes;⠀expression⠀holds⠀actual⠀outward⠀conduct,⠀while⠀self_account⠀is⠀only⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀current⠀account.⠀Unnoticed⠀influence⠀is⠀not⠀conscious⠀process_content.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀symptom⠀fields,⠀numbers⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀state⠀host.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_memory}}}}ASSOCIATION⠀EVIDENCE⠀AND⠀STORAGE\nKeep⠀the⠀experience⠀and⠀its⠀effect⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀memory's⠀gist/source/interpretation,⠀its⠀cue⠀in⠀cues⠀and⠀its⠀limitation⠀in⠀limits.⠀An⠀implicit⠀expectation⠀is⠀retained⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀a⠀present⠀monologue;⠀activating⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀refresh⠀last_recall,⠀fidelity⠀or⠀trace⠀strength.\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_social}}}}Use⠀an⠀existing⠀learned_patterns⠀record⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀consolidated⠀person/context⠀expectation⠀needs⠀its⠀own⠀continuity:⠀learning_scope⠀names⠀the⠀person/context;⠀learning_evidence⠀references⠀real⠀memories/events;⠀learning_reading⠀states⠀the⠀fallible⠀association⠀and⠀experienced⠀effect;⠀learning_adjustment⠀states⠀the⠀conditional⠀expectation;⠀learning_limit/alternative⠀qualify⠀it.⠀Reference⠀it⠀from⠀existing⠀bond_source/bond_context⠀instead⠀of⠀copying⠀the⠀account⠀or⠀its⠀numbers.⠀A⠀compatible⠀existing⠀record⠀keeps⠀its⠀ID;⠀no⠀record⠀quota.\n{{else}}With⠀Social⠀off,⠀retain⠀the⠀concise⠀association⠀in⠀the⠀existing⠀memory⠀interpretation/cues/limits.⠀Do⠀not⠀create⠀learned_patterns,⠀relationship⠀fields⠀or⠀social⠀numbers⠀for⠀this⠀integration.\n{{/if}}{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_social}}}}With⠀Memory⠀off,⠀use⠀supported⠀card/history⠀in⠀existing⠀bond_source/bond_context⠀or⠀an⠀already⠀active⠀Social⠀record.⠀Do⠀not⠀seed⠀memory⠀fields⠀or⠀activate⠀disabled⠀stored⠀memories.⠀Unknown⠀formative⠀events⠀remain⠀unknown.\n{{/if}}{{/if}}\n\nThese⠀are⠀prompt-only⠀retention⠀rules.⠀If⠀old⠀evidence⠀or⠀a⠀tracker⠀is⠀absent⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀context,⠀do⠀not⠀claim⠀to⠀recover⠀it⠀from⠀a⠀database.⠀Preserve⠀available⠀state,⠀mark⠀the⠀limitation⠀in⠀continuity_note,⠀and⠀continue⠀from⠀supported⠀information.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀exact⠀forgotten⠀numbers⠀or⠀missing⠀history.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀turn⠀is⠀regenerated⠀or⠀swiped⠀and⠀the⠀discarded⠀response⠀is⠀absent⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀active⠀history,⠀start⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀prior⠀snapshot.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀unseen⠀alternatives⠀as⠀lived⠀events.⠀If⠀a⠀discarded⠀alternative⠀is⠀still⠀supplied⠀without⠀a⠀usable⠀branch⠀indication,⠀do⠀not⠀claim⠀automatic⠀branch⠀detection.⠀Follow⠀explicit⠀current⠀history⠀and⠀director⠀corrections.\n\nOn⠀a⠀continuation,⠀advance⠀only⠀through⠀newly⠀generated⠀events.⠀If⠀a⠀prior⠀partial⠀response⠀has⠀no⠀complete⠀tracker,⠀inherit⠀the⠀last⠀complete⠀snapshot⠀and⠀account⠀for⠀the⠀already-written⠀partial⠀narrative⠀once.⠀If⠀a⠀complete⠀response⠀is⠀continued,⠀the⠀latest⠀complete⠀tracker⠀is⠀its⠀endpoint.⠀If⠀technical⠀continuation⠀appends⠀multiple⠀snapshots⠀inside⠀one⠀message,⠀the⠀last⠀complete⠀one⠀is⠀authoritative;⠀never⠀pretend⠀to⠀edit⠀text⠀already⠀emitted.\n\nFor⠀purely⠀OOC⠀discussion,⠀do⠀not⠀advance⠀fictional⠀time⠀or⠀create⠀fictional⠀experiences.⠀Preserve⠀existing⠀state⠀if⠀a⠀tracker⠀is⠀appended.⠀With⠀no⠀active⠀fictional⠀scene,⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀one⠀just⠀to⠀fill⠀a⠀tracker.⠀For⠀impersonation⠀or⠀an⠀authored-user⠀role,⠀follow⠀Nemo's⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract;⠀never⠀substitute⠀another⠀character's⠀state⠀or⠀infer⠀the⠀real⠀human's⠀mind.\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_workspace}}}}INTERNAL⠀PROCESS⠀RETENTION\nUse⠀stable⠀internal_processes⠀IDs⠀for⠀relevant⠀conscious⠀contents⠀and⠀mental⠀actions.⠀Carry⠀an⠀interrupted⠀task⠀only⠀while⠀a⠀real⠀pending⠀goal⠀or⠀resume⠀cue⠀makes⠀it